values
  ('817634404537133686', 'Luther: The Fallen Sun', 2023, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jamie Payne, Andrew Rothschild, Tom Stern', 'Neil Cross', 'Idris Elba, Cynthia Erivo, Andy Serkis, Dermot Crowley, Thomas Coombes, Hattie Morahan, Lauryn Ajufo, Vincent Regan', 'R', 'A gruesome serial killer is terrorizing London while brilliant but disgraced detective John Luther sits behind bars. Haunted by his failure to capture the cyber psychopath who now taunts him, Luther decides to break out of prison to finish the job by any means necessary.', 'A gruesome serial killer is terrorizing London while brilliant but disgraced detective John Luther sits behind bars. Haunted by his failure to capture the cyber psychopath who now taunts him, Luther decides to break out of prison to finish the job by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsW7M4b4gawgFKCzcXHL2MSeswj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722149'),
  ('1119747201840270197', 'Luv', 1967, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Clive Donner, David Salven, Steve Siporin', 'Elliott Baker', 'Jack Lemmon, Peter Falk, Elaine May, Nina Wayne, Eddie Mayehoff, Paul Hartman, Severn Darden, Alan DeWitt', null, 'Depressed by the direction his life is taking, Harry decides to take his own life by jumping off the Manhattan Bridge. At the last minute he''s stopped by old friend Milt Manville, a successful stock broker. Milt, however, is facing his own problem: he has fallen out of love with his argumentative wife, Ellen. In a misguided effort to solve both of their problems, he introduces Ellen to Harry, hoping the two will fall in love.', 'Depressed by the direction his life is taking, Harry decides to take his own life by jumping off the Manhattan Bridge. At the last minute he''s stopped by old friend Milt Manville, a successful stock broker. Milt, however, is facing his own problem: he has fallen out of love with his argumentative wife, Ellen. In a misguided effort to solve both of their problems, he introduces Ellen to Harry, hoping the two will fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mi2nlGMW5uTBKE49FCUaRUeH5HQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163376'),
  ('406729243289963834', 'Luv Ka The End', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bumpy, Adil Afsar', 'Roye Segal, Shenaz Treasury', 'Shraddha Kapoor, Taha Shah Badussha, Errol Marks, Meherzan Mazda, Pushtii Shakti, Sreejita De, Rahul Pardasany, Riya Bamniyal', null, 'Rhea is the typical girl next door who is in love with Luv Nanda, a rich and famous boy in college. As they plan to take their relationship to the next level, Rhea realises that Luv is not as nice as she thought. So, she decides to get even and bring Luv down! All in the span of one night. Buckle up for one crazy night as the girls discover the meaning of love, life, friendship and more.', 'Rhea is the typical girl next door who is in love with Luv Nanda, a rich and famous boy in college. As they plan to take their relationship to the next level, Rhea realises that Luv is not as nice as she thought. So, she decides to get even and bring Luv down! All in the span of one night. Buckle up for one crazy night as the girls discover the meaning of love, life, friendship and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJ1jSKqc4iXIHsWVFzpgxV6Y0Sy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63683'),
  ('801408164257030890', 'Luv Shuv Tey Chicken Khurana', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Mitesh Mirchandani, Sameer Sharma', null, 'Kunal Kapoor, Huma Qureshi, Mukesh Chhabra, Vipin Sharma, Rajesh Sharma, Rahul Bagga, Sophie Karl, John Duggan', null, 'On-the-run from the London mafia, Omi returns to his ancestral village – a place he’d flown from with his grandad’s money and grander ‘London Dreams’. Will Omi be able to hide his failures while chasing love, and the lost recipe of the infamous dish, ‘Chicken Khurana’?', 'On-the-run from the London mafia, Omi returns to his ancestral village – a place he’d flown from with his grandad’s money and grander ‘London Dreams’. Will Omi be able to hide his failures while chasing love, and the lost recipe of the infamous dish, ‘Chicken Khurana’?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGUwqtdCUJ36pTwqg2tiYzvKI4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138370'),
  ('582462265727888603', 'Lux Æterna', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gaspar Noé, Benoît Debie, Claire Corbetta-Doll', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Béatrice Dalle, Abbey Lee, Karl Glusman, Clara 3000, Claude-Emmanuelle Gajan-Maull, Félix Maritaud, Mica Argañaraz', 'NR', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg agrees to play a witch condemned to be burned at the stake in the first film directed by Béatrice Dalle. But the chaotic production, technical problems, and psychotic breakdowns gradually plunge the shoot into a chaos of pure light.', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg agrees to play a witch condemned to be burned at the stake in the first film directed by Béatrice Dalle. But the chaotic production, technical problems, and psychotic breakdowns gradually plunge the shoot into a chaos of pure light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oStzv8gUrAAevtIiv0icGcvAbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599377'),
  ('39042361212728047', 'Luxembourg, Luxembourg', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antonio Lukich, Oleksandra Nikitina, Serhii Stepanskyi', 'Antonio Lukich', 'Amil Nasirov, Ramil Nasirov, Nataliia Hnitii, Liudmyla Sachenko, Viktor Drapikovskyi, Doris Maidanjuk, Karina Cherchevych, Kseniia Mishyna', null, 'Kolya and Vasylii learn that their father, who left them when they were children, is dying in Luxembourg, far away from them. One of them wants to go and find his father, while the other one does everything he can to prevent the first from leaving the country. As a result, they both go to Luxembourg in search of their dad: Kolya considers him a hero, while Vasylii thinks he is a scoundrel.', 'Kolya and Vasylii learn that their father, who left them when they were children, is dying in Luxembourg, far away from them. One of them wants to go and find his father, while the other one does everything he can to prevent the first from leaving the country. As a result, they both go to Luxembourg in search of their dad: Kolya considers him a hero, while Vasylii thinks he is a scoundrel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GGORXI4WRusI7XWje8c4lBm9WS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005141'),
  ('59353694533961625', 'Luxo Jr.', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy', 'John Lasseter', 'John Lasseter', null, 'G', 'A baby lamp finds a ball to play with and it''s all fun and games until the ball bursts. Just when the elder Luxo thinks his kid will settle down for a bit, Luxo Jr. finds a ball ten times bigger.', 'A baby lamp finds a ball to play with and it''s all fun and games until the ball bursts. Just when the elder Luxo thinks his kid will settle down for a bit, Luxo Jr. finds a ball ten times bigger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/as8xF0wOawngZ1G3qg5gs0VQea3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13925'),
  ('325551559344526649', 'Luz', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Semih Korhan Güner, Tilman Singer, Paul Faltz', 'Tilman Singer', 'Luana Velis, Jan Bluthardt, Julia Riedler, Nadja Stübiger, Johannes Benecke, Lilli Lorenz', null, 'Luz, a young cabdriver, drags herself into the brightly lit entrance of a run-down police station. A demonic entity follows her, determined to finally be close to the woman it loves.', 'Luz, a young cabdriver, drags herself into the brightly lit entrance of a run-down police station. A demonic entity follows her, determined to finally be close to the woman it loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xLen4n8FYYjW2HhBG2rtvFMUZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498062'),
  ('89280863937093553', 'Luzifer', 2021, 'Drama, Horror', 'Peter Brunner, Peter Flinckenberg', 'Peter Brunner', 'Franz Rogowski, Susanne Jensen, Monika Hinterhuber, Theo Blaickner, Erwin Geisler, Clemens Göbl, Markus Eibl', null, 'Johannes, an innocent, Kaspar Hauser-like man with the heart of a child, lives secluded in an alpine hut together with his eagle and his devout mother. Daily life in this isolated world is governed by prayer and ritual. But suddenly, modern objects and disruptive noises intrude between nature and worship. A tourist development threatens to poison their paradise and awaken the devil.', 'Johannes, an innocent, Kaspar Hauser-like man with the heart of a child, lives secluded in an alpine hut together with his eagle and his devout mother. Daily life in this isolated world is governed by prayer and ritual. But suddenly, modern objects and disruptive noises intrude between nature and worship. A tourist development threatens to poison their paradise and awaken the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9znMhBKbYc2lg7QaCk48Mk23wm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846786'),
  ('113736226987988731', 'Luzzu', 2021, 'Drama', 'Alex Camilleri, Léo Lefèvre', 'Alex Camilleri', 'Jesmark Scicluna, Michela Farrugia, David Scicluna, Frida Cauchi, Uday K Maclean, Timur Ali, Marta Vella, Marlene Schranz', null, 'Jesmark, a struggling fisherman on the island of Malta, is forced to turn his back on generations of tradition and risk everything by entering the world of black market fishing to provide for his girlfriend and newborn baby.', 'Jesmark, a struggling fisherman on the island of Malta, is forced to turn his back on generations of tradition and risk everything by entering the world of black market fishing to provide for his girlfriend and newborn baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFz8Mna6oc8YAmK4jwZRAC79Mzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776544'),
  ('1133360965136920959', 'LX 2048', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Guy Moshe', 'Guy Moshe', 'James D''Arcy, Gina McKee, Delroy Lindo, Juliet Aubrey, Anna Brewster, Jay Hayden, Linc Hand, Gabrielle Cassi', null, 'In the near future, the sun has become so toxic people can no longer leave their houses in daytime, and normal life is conducted mostly inside the virtual realm. Against this dystopian backdrop, a dying man seeks to ensure the future well-being of his family, while coping with what it means to be human in this new reality.', 'In the near future, the sun has become so toxic people can no longer leave their houses in daytime, and normal life is conducted mostly inside the virtual realm. Against this dystopian backdrop, a dying man seeks to ensure the future well-being of his family, while coping with what it means to be human in this new reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5VqBL0TtNmV1kxwoQ2L2dWPLiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739010'),
  ('350503589654785365', 'Lydia', 1941, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julien Duvivier, Lee Garmes, Horace Hough', 'Ben Hecht, Samuel Hoffenstein, André de Toth', 'Merle Oberon, Edna May Oliver, Alan Marshal, Joseph Cotten, Hans Járay, George Reeves, John Halliday, Sara Allgood', 'NR', 'Lydia MacMillan, a wealthy woman who has never married, invites several men her own age to her home to reminisce about the times when they were young and courted her. In memory, each romance seemed splendid and destined for happiness, but in each case, Lydia realizes, the truth was less romantic, and ill-starred.', 'Lydia MacMillan, a wealthy woman who has never married, invites several men her own age to her home to reminisce about the times when they were young and courted her. In memory, each romance seemed splendid and destined for happiness, but in each case, Lydia realizes, the truth was less romantic, and ill-starred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rw3hm5i79uhJEggBTs5S0ZKo7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56151'),
  ('98642609118823232', 'Lying and Stealing', 2019, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Jody Spilkoman, Matt Aselton, Corey Walter', 'Adam Nagata, Matt Aselton', 'Theo James, Emily Ratajkowski, Fred Melamed, Aris Alvarado, Fernanda Andrade, Tim Bader, Joe Bucaro III, Rod Chaouqi', 'R', 'Hoping to leave his criminal lifestyle behind him, a successful art thief teams up with a sexy con woman to pull off the ultimate heist and set himself free.', 'Hoping to leave his criminal lifestyle behind him, a successful art thief teams up with a sexy con woman to pull off the ultimate heist and set himself free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YrVrPfMEqtFsLmN4HdzERjbveo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509874'),
  ('911846246204654301', 'Lying Eyes', 1996, 'Thriller, Romance, TV Movie', 'Alan Caso, Marina Sargenti', 'Paul B. Margolis', 'Cassidy Rae, Vincent Irizarry, Allison Smith, Jamie Rose, Ashlee Levitch, Sherry Hursey, Nancy Carlin, Richard Conti', null, 'A high-school senior becomes a target for murder when her clandestine affair with an older lawyer gets out of control.', 'A high-school senior becomes a target for murder when her clandestine affair with an older lawyer gets out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65wcOk3mAtTLtGKSox7zTLloojf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299718'),
  ('654571002954026730', 'Lying to Be Perfect', 2010, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Gary Harvey, Robert S. Weber, Robert Lee', 'Nancey Silvers', 'Poppy Montgomery, Adam Kaufman, Michelle Harrison, Chelah Horsdal, Audrey Wasilewski, Julia Benson, Gabrielle Rose, Mark Brandon', null, 'Nola Devlin is an unassuming, frumpy magazine editor who is overlooked and teased by her coworkers. Though, when she is behind the glow and anonymity of her computer screen, she becomes the famous advice columnist Belinda Apple. Nola’s friends, tired of being overworked and overweight, band together to create the Cinderella Pact, vowing to lose pounds by following the advice of Belinda Apple. When her secret identity is threatened, Nola is forced to take her own alter ego’s advice. But, as the group of friends drops dress sizes, their real issues are exposed, and better-than-expected life changes begin to blossom.', 'Nola Devlin is an unassuming, frumpy magazine editor who is overlooked and teased by her coworkers. Though, when she is behind the glow and anonymity of her computer screen, she becomes the famous advice columnist Belinda Apple. Nola’s friends, tired of being overworked and overweight, band together to create the Cinderella Pact, vowing to lose pounds by following the advice of Belinda Apple. When her secret identity is threatened, Nola is forced to take her own alter ego’s advice. But, as the group of friends drops dress sizes, their real issues are exposed, and better-than-expected life changes begin to blossom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bS8rba4By9UqGQ5EtiO7VWhBM7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70076'),
  ('890339028862584651', 'Lyle, Lyle, Crocodile', 2022, 'Comedy, Family, Music', 'Will Speck, Josh Gordon, Riley Flanagan', 'William Davies', 'Shawn Mendes, Winslow Fegley, Javier Bardem, Constance Wu, Scoot McNairy, Brett Gelman, Ego Nwodim, Lyric Hurd', 'PG', 'When the Primm family moves to New York City, their young son Josh struggles to adapt to his new school and new friends. All of that changes when he discovers Lyle — a singing crocodile who loves baths, caviar and great music — living in the attic of his new home. But when Lyle’s existence is threatened by evil neighbor Mr. Grumps, the Primms must band together to show the world that family can come from the most unexpected places.', 'When the Primm family moves to New York City, their young son Josh struggles to adapt to his new school and new friends. All of that changes when he discovers Lyle — a singing crocodile who loves baths, caviar and great music — living in the attic of his new home. But when Lyle’s existence is threatened by evil neighbor Mr. Grumps, the Primms must band together to show the world that family can come from the most unexpected places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dN6XnCEP3AO7N4XFOFyZ8V8kZF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:830784'),
  ('1071150506135103440', 'Lymelife', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Derick Martini, Frank Godwin', 'Derick Martini, Steven Martini', 'Rory Culkin, Jill Hennessy, Emma Roberts, Alec Baldwin, Kieran Culkin, Timothy Hutton, Cynthia Nixon, Logan Huffman', 'R', 'A coming of age dramedy where infidelity, real estate, and Lyme disease have two families falling apart on Long Island in the early eighties. Scott, 15, is at the point in his life when he finds out that the most important people around him, his father, his mother, and his brother, are not exactly who he thought they were. They are flawed and they are human.', 'A coming of age dramedy where infidelity, real estate, and Lyme disease have two families falling apart on Long Island in the early eighties. Scott, 15, is at the point in his life when he finds out that the most important people around him, his father, his mother, and his brother, are not exactly who he thought they were. They are flawed and they are human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLo39N9UuiRJlL3cRytkM7BzZK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22152'),
  ('569388369112393646', 'Lynch/Oz', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre O. Philippe, Robert Muratore', 'Alexandre O. Philippe', 'Amy Nicholson, Rodney Ascher, John Waters, Karyn Kusama, Justin Benson, Aaron Moorhead, David Lowery, David Lynch', null, 'Victor Fleming’s 1939 film The Wizard of Oz is one of David Lynch’s most enduring obsessions. This documentary goes over the rainbow to explore this Technicolor through-line in Lynch’s work.', 'Victor Fleming’s 1939 film The Wizard of Oz is one of David Lynch’s most enduring obsessions. This documentary goes over the rainbow to explore this Technicolor through-line in Lynch’s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utMuIiigJPVQZXvpkyGL1mPw9Ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965400'),
  ('927296738691239216', 'Lynx', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Geslin, Laurent Geslin', 'Laurent Geslin', 'Laurent Geslin', null, 'In the heart of the Jura mountains, a call resounds through the forest. The silhouette of a Eurasian lynx creeps through the trees. A male is looking for its mate. Suddenly a call answers back. It is the beginning of the story of a lynx’s family we will follow over the seasons. While it is rare to come across this private feline, it is exceptional to discover its daily life in the wild.', 'In the heart of the Jura mountains, a call resounds through the forest. The silhouette of a Eurasian lynx creeps through the trees. A male is looking for its mate. Suddenly a call answers back. It is the beginning of the story of a lynx’s family we will follow over the seasons. While it is rare to come across this private feline, it is exceptional to discover its daily life in the wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdZIMVAbx7ZqrjPj77xNxludY6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846983'),
  ('878413072905581763', 'Lyon, place Bellecour', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Pedestrian and various vehicles traffic on Place Bellecour, in Lyon.', 'Pedestrian and various vehicles traffic on Place Bellecour, in Lyon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR3PVrofFbZpN3GZWv4edKgCkM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231113'),
  ('898264718792071833', 'Lyon, travaux au canal de Jonage: Machine à damer', 1897, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière, Auguste Lumière', null, null, null, 'A group of workers, aided by a steam-roller, are leveling the ground during the construction of the Jonage canal, a diversion of the Rhône river, which was built in order to supply the hydroelectric plant of Cusset.', 'A group of workers, aided by a steam-roller, are leveling the ground during the construction of the Jonage canal, a diversion of the Rhône river, which was built in order to supply the hydroelectric plant of Cusset.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMi0HEvej42HfyRgFdWIlzTkIfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190587'),
