  ('729644192699479266', 'M. Kumaran S/O Mahalakshmi', 2004, 'Romance', 'Mohan Raja, Balasubramaniem', 'Mohan Raja', 'Ravi Mohan, Asin Thottumkal, Nadhiya, Prakash Raj, Vivek, Nandha Saravanan, Ragasiya, Aishwarya Bhaskar', null, 'Kumaran''s life is all about his mother Mahalakshmi, who is separated from her husband Eshwar. Kumaran is passionate about kickboxing and he shares a very special relationship with his mother. In between, Kumaran falls in love with Malabar. But his life is destroyed after his mother''s death. On the deathbed she tells her son to meet his father, a kick boxing champion, who lives in Malaysia. Kumaran goes to Malaysia to meet him and he comes...', 'Kumaran''s life is all about his mother Mahalakshmi, who is separated from her husband Eshwar. Kumaran is passionate about kickboxing and he shares a very special relationship with his mother. In between, Kumaran falls in love with Malabar. But his life is destroyed after his mother''s death. On the deathbed she tells her son to meet his father, a kick boxing champion, who lives in Malaysia. Kumaran goes to Malaysia to meet him and he comes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArVe9XK7XyGtG8lP6o0n7TUP0FC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63816'),
  ('117623236451078252', 'M.D. Geist', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Action, Animation', 'Hayato Ikeda, Koichi Ohata, Hirotoshi Sano', 'Riku Sanjou', 'Norio Wakamoto, Akio Nojima, Fumi Hirano, Takeshi Watabe, Banjo Ginga, Hideyuki Hori, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Naoki Tatsuta', null, 'Geist (the main character) is MD-02, a Most Dangerous Soldier, genetically engineered to function as a killing machine, but every one of the MDS units went homicidally insane. As a result Geist was placed in suspended animation in a stasis pod orbiting the planet Jerra until it crashed several years later, awakening him and bringing him into another war on the planet.', 'Geist (the main character) is MD-02, a Most Dangerous Soldier, genetically engineered to function as a killing machine, but every one of the MDS units went homicidally insane. As a result Geist was placed in suspended animation in a stasis pod orbiting the planet Jerra until it crashed several years later, awakening him and bringing him into another war on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2wij5i2SUq958cFnKGsDEyCs4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71444'),
  ('484806963335589286', 'M.D. Geist II: Death Force', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action', 'Koichi Ohata, Hisao Shirai, Chuichi Iguchi', 'Riku Sanjou', 'Takumi Yamazaki, Kazuhiro Nakata, Rica Fukami, Rokuro Naya, Shinpachi Tsuji, Koji Ishii, Masato Hirano, Takaya Hashi', null, 'Less than a year after Geist activated the Death Force, which decimated most of Jerra''s population, he has kept himself busy by dismantling the Death Force machines one by one. Most of the remaining human population have fled to a remote haven run by a warlord named Krauser. Krauser is another MDS unit, MD-01, who has a technology that hides his mobile fortress from the Death Force.', 'Less than a year after Geist activated the Death Force, which decimated most of Jerra''s population, he has kept himself busy by dismantling the Death Force machines one by one. Most of the remaining human population have fled to a remote haven run by a warlord named Krauser. Krauser is another MDS unit, MD-01, who has a technology that hides his mobile fortress from the Death Force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w78m7imvxfn5oJCEOhbfFYW5hLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71449'),
  ('28683638193158041', 'M.F.A.', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Natalia Leite, Aaron Kovalchik', 'Leah McKendrick', 'Clifton Collins Jr., Francesca Eastwood, Leah McKendrick, Peter Vack, David Sullivan, David Huynh, Marlon Young, Jess Nurse', null, 'After the accidental death of her rapist, an art student becomes an unlikely vigilante, set out to avenge college girls whose rapists were not charged.', 'After the accidental death of her rapist, an art student becomes an unlikely vigilante, set out to avenge college girls whose rapists were not charged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntXFNanjY22rsyXS94FiSYHJFKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438435'),
  ('333907790602835349', 'M.O.M. Mothers of Monsters', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Tucia Lyman, Lili Peper', 'Tucia Lyman', 'Melinda Page Hamilton, Bailey Edwards, Ed Asner, Julian De La Celle, Janet Ulrich Brooks, Sevan Aliksanian, Cynthia Bell, Lili Peper', 'R', 'A distraught mother suspects her teenage son is a psychopath who may shoot up his high school, but when he outsmarts the mental healthcare system she is forced to take matters into her own hands.', 'A distraught mother suspects her teenage son is a psychopath who may shoot up his high school, but when he outsmarts the mental healthcare system she is forced to take matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDyrXDB3POXKN49g5XvSoXSFijc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675253'),
  ('314884585842627671', 'M.S. Dhoni: The Untold Story', 2016, 'Drama', 'Neeraj Pandey, Santosh Thundiyil, Raghav Jairath', 'Nandu Kamte, Dilip Jha, Neeraj Pandey', 'Sushant Singh Rajput, Anupam Kher, Disha Patani, Kiara Advani, Rajesh Sharma, Kumud Mishra, Neetha Mohindra, Bhumika Chawla', null, 'Based on the life story of Mahendra Singh Dhoni, and his journey to being the world cup winning captain of the Indian cricket team.', 'Based on the life story of Mahendra Singh Dhoni, and his journey to being the world cup winning captain of the Indian cricket team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUpMckVHaB55YJ3SMK0arwxKmCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388333'),
  ('309137001931260882', 'M*A*S*H', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Robert Altman, Harold E. Stine, Ray Taylor Jr.', 'Ring Lardner, Jr.', 'Donald Sutherland, Elliott Gould, Tom Skerritt, Sally Kellerman, Robert Duvall, Roger Bowen, René Auberjonois, David Arkin', 'R', 'One of the world''s most acclaimed comedies, M*A*S*H focuses on three Korean War Army surgeons brilliantly brought to life by Donald Sutherland, Tom Skerritt and Elliott Gould. Though highly skilled and deeply dedicated, they adopt a hilarious, lunatic lifestyle as an antidote to the tragedies of their Mobile Army Surgical Hospital, and in the process infuriate Army bureaucrats. Robert Duvall, Gary Burghoff and Sally Kellerman co-star as a sanctimonious Major, an other-worldly Corporal, and a self-righteous yet lusty nurse.', 'One of the world''s most acclaimed comedies, M*A*S*H focuses on three Korean War Army surgeons brilliantly brought to life by Donald Sutherland, Tom Skerritt and Elliott Gould. Though highly skilled and deeply dedicated, they adopt a hilarious, lunatic lifestyle as an antidote to the tragedies of their Mobile Army Surgical Hospital, and in the process infuriate Army bureaucrats. Robert Duvall, Gary Burghoff and Sally Kellerman co-star as a sanctimonious Major, an other-worldly Corporal, and a self-righteous yet lusty nurse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/on8Q9LhtHYNhmITjUMpgOUkIG8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651'),
  ('807373497257288141', 'M/Other', 1999, 'Drama', 'Nobuhiro Suwa, Masami Inomoto', 'Tomokazu Miura, Makiko Watanabe, Nobuhiro Suwa', 'Tomokazu Miura, Makiko Watanabe, Ryudai Takahashi, Hiroo Fuseya', null, 'Tetsuro is living with his young girlfriend Aki in a pleasant house in Tokyo. They both spend a lot of time at their jobs. However their routine is upset when Tetsuro brings his 8-year-old son Shun to live with them, while his ex-wife recovers from a car accident.', 'Tetsuro is living with his young girlfriend Aki in a pleasant house in Tokyo. They both spend a lot of time at their jobs. However their routine is upset when Tetsuro brings his 8-year-old son Shun to live with them, while his ex-wife recovers from a car accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csUwV0MZGPkrALhxokWDy9AD9hs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49939'),
  ('2906304827370703', 'M3GAN', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Lyn Moncrief, Andrew McGeorge, Simon Raby', 'Akela Cooper', 'Allison Williams, Violet McGraw, Amie Donald, Jenna Davis, Ronny Chieng, Brian Jordan Alvarez, Jen Van Epps, Stephane Garneau-Monten', 'PG-13', 'A brilliant toy company roboticist uses artificial intelligence to develop M3GAN, a life-like doll programmed to emotionally bond with her newly orphaned niece. But when the doll''s programming works too well, she becomes overprotective of her new friend with terrifying results.', 'A brilliant toy company roboticist uses artificial intelligence to develop M3GAN, a life-like doll programmed to emotionally bond with her newly orphaned niece. But when the doll''s programming works too well, she becomes overprotective of her new friend with terrifying results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9nBoowhjiiYc4FBNtQkPY7c11H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536554'),
  ('821591702067044295', 'M3GAN 2.0', 2025, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Gerard Johnstone, Toby Oliver, Rafly Ambadar', 'Gerard Johnstone', 'Allison Williams, Amie Donald, Violet McGraw, Jenna Davis, Brian Jordan Alvarez, Jen Van Epps, Aristotle Athari, Ivanna Sakhno', 'PG-13', 'After the underlying tech for M3GAN is stolen and misused by a powerful defense contractor to create a military-grade weapon known as Amelia, M3GAN''s creator Gemma realizes that the only option is to resurrect M3GAN and give her a few upgrades, making her faster, stronger, and more lethal.', 'After the underlying tech for M3GAN is stolen and misused by a powerful defense contractor to create a military-grade weapon known as Amelia, M3GAN''s creator Gemma realizes that the only option is to resurrect M3GAN and give her a few upgrades, making her faster, stronger, and more lethal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oekamLQrwlJjRNmfaBE4llIvkir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071585'),
  ('261923364438259433', 'M8 - When Death Rescues Life', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Cristiano Conceição, Fernanda Polastri, Jeferson De', 'Jeferson De, Paulo Lins, Felipe Sholl', 'Juan Paiva, Raphael Logam, Mariana Nunes, Giulia Gayoso, Bruno Peixoto, Fabio Beltrão, Zezé Motta, Aílton Graça', null, 'When Maurício becomes a student at a top medical school, he becomes obsessed with a mystery linked to the dead bodies used for dissection.', 'When Maurício becomes a student at a top medical school, he becomes obsessed with a mystery linked to the dead bodies used for dissection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCyAqeRPvKj8nJm1Eux5logss7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651906'),
  ('883366704115914986', 'Ma', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joe Landry, Cleta Elaine Ellington, Patrick Longman', 'Scotty Landes', 'Octavia Spencer, Juliette Lewis, Diana Silvers, McKaley Miller, Corey Fogelmanis, Luke Evans, Gianni Paolo, Dante Brown', 'R', 'Sue Ann is a loner who keeps to herself in her quiet Ohio town. One day, she is asked by Maggie, a new teenager in town, to buy some booze for her and her friends, and Sue Ann sees the chance to make some unsuspecting, if younger, friends of her own.', 'Sue Ann is a loner who keeps to herself in her quiet Ohio town. One day, she is asked by Maggie, a new teenager in town, to buy some booze for her and her friends, and Sue Ann sees the chance to make some unsuspecting, if younger, friends of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6n7ASmQ1wY2cxTubFFGlcvPpyk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502416'),
  ('685172377177138933', 'MA 2412 - Die Staatsdiener', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Harald Sicheritz', 'Alfred Dorfer, Harald Sicheritz, Roland Düringer', 'Alfred Dorfer, Roland Düringer, Monica Weinzettl, Wolfgang Böck, Karl Ferdinand Kratzl, Barbara Stöckl, Peter Fröhlich, Reinhard Nowak', null, 'The film deals with questions that have long tormented us: Who was the first civil servant? How has the civil service developed over the course of history? What did Mr. Weber, Engineer Breitfuß, Ms. Knackal, and Mr. Claus do before MA 2412 existed? How did they meet? Why was MA 2412 actually founded? What if the EU decides to introduce a Europe-wide Christmas department? And what is the point of it all?', 'The film deals with questions that have long tormented us: Who was the first civil servant? How has the civil service developed over the course of history? What did Mr. Weber, Engineer Breitfuß, Ms. Knackal, and Mr. Claus do before MA 2412 existed? How did they meet? Why was MA 2412 actually founded? What if the EU decides to introduce a Europe-wide Christmas department? And what is the point of it all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtO059k7Q0ctmifcPxIbaYANTZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63933'),
  ('645116945098484941', 'Ma and Pa Kettle', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont, Maury Gertsman', 'Betty MacDonald, Al Lewis', 'Marjorie Main, Percy Kilbride, Richard Long, Meg Randall, Patricia Alphin, Esther Dale, Barry Kelley, Harry Antrim', null, 'The Kettles and their fifteen children are about to be evicted from their rundown rustic home when Pa wins the grand prize by coming up with a new tobacco slogan. Birdie Hicks is jealous of the family''s new wealth, which includes a completely automated modern home, and accuses Pa of stealing the slogan. Reporter Kim Parker proves Birdie wrong and marries Tom Kettle.', 'The Kettles and their fifteen children are about to be evicted from their rundown rustic home when Pa wins the grand prize by coming up with a new tobacco slogan. Birdie Hicks is jealous of the family''s new wealth, which includes a completely automated modern home, and accuses Pa of stealing the slogan. Reporter Kim Parker proves Birdie wrong and marries Tom Kettle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fk1nTY7CUT0Q0YLZdHVUdcaiDLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64620'),
  ('109203751190746212', 'Ma and Pa Kettle Back on the Farm', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Edward Sedgwick, Charles Van Enger', 'Jack Henley', 'Marjorie Main, Percy Kilbride, Richard Long, Meg Randall, Ray Collins, Barbara Brown, Emory Parnell, Peter Leeds', 'G', 'The Kettles leave their ultra-modern home and return to the country looking for uranium. Ma and Tom''s mother-in-law, Mrs. Parker, fight over whether their grandchild will be raised "hygiencially."', 'The Kettles leave their ultra-modern home and return to the country looking for uranium. Ma and Tom''s mother-in-law, Mrs. Parker, fight over whether their grandchild will be raised "hygiencially."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7JDBpFbN5tFjKvIIZLwMWiRTyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51412'),
