  ('657072870477950689', 'Maara', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sharanya Subramaniam, Dhilip Kumar, Ramnath Rigvedhi', null, 'R. Madhavan, Shraddha Srinath, Sshivada Nair, Mouli, Alexander Babu, Minon John, Abhirami, M. S. Bhaskar', null, 'When Paaru sees a fairy tale she heard from from a stranger as a child painted across the walls of a costal town, she goes in search of the man who painted it - Maara.', 'When Paaru sees a fairy tale she heard from from a stranger as a child painted across the walls of a costal town, she goes in search of the man who painted it - Maara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRseVdrHk4dhmwrYwbtDtxJYwA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751858'),
  ('563037460937377955', 'Maareesan', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Sudheesh Shankar, Kalaiselvan Sivaji', 'Krishna Moorthy', 'Vadivelu, Fahadh Faasil, Kovai Sarala, Sithara, Renuka, Vivek Prasanna, P.L. Thenappan, Saravana Subbiah', 'PG-13', 'A petty thief embarks on a road trip with an elderly man suffering from memory loss under deceptive pretenses. As they journey across Tamil Nadu, the promise of an easy con unravels into a quietly shifting connection, with both men hiding secrets of their own.', 'A petty thief embarks on a road trip with an elderly man suffering from memory loss under deceptive pretenses. As they journey across Tamil Nadu, the promise of an easy con unravels into a quietly shifting connection, with both men hiding secrets of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7JGfFgMnNuyF2Q4FSu7Kgip3mK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022074'),
  ('415190367512223159', 'Maari', 2015, 'Action', 'Balaji Mohan, Om Prakash', 'Balaji Mohan', 'Dhanush, Kajal Aggarwal, Vijay Yesudas, Robo Shankar, Kaali Venkat, Anirudh Ravichander, Balaji Mohan, Mime Gopi', null, 'A feared local rowdy, known for his dominance in the streets and pigeon racing, finds himself at odds with a newly appointed police officer. As tensions rise, hidden motives and betrayals unfold, shaking the balance of power in the neighborhood.', 'A feared local rowdy, known for his dominance in the streets and pigeon racing, finds himself at odds with a newly appointed police officer. As tensions rise, hidden motives and betrayals unfold, shaking the balance of power in the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlZIYvuEl6mIEbtJYM4NM7RXSjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311166'),
  ('466671958908899378', 'Maarnami', 2026, null, 'Rishith Shetty, Vardhraj Kamath', 'Rishith Shetty, Sudhi Aryan', 'Sonu Gowda, Chaithra J Achar, Prakash Thuminad, Swaraj Shetty, Mathad Ritvvikk', null, 'Chetu''s life, a poignant dance between tradition and tragedy, as Hulivesha becomes his solace and legacy, amidst turmoil and loss, his story fades into mystery.', 'Chetu''s life, a poignant dance between tradition and tragedy, as Hulivesha becomes his solace and legacy, amidst turmoil and loss, his story fades into mystery.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNTJjMmZmMTUtYjJlZS00ZDFjLTllODYtY2FkODI0MjBjNWQ4XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:maarnami'),
  ('38645770604540474', 'Maaveeran', 2023, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Vidhu Ayanna, Madonne Ashwin, Chandhru Anbazhagan', 'Madonne Ashwin', 'Sivakarthikeyan, Aditi Shankar, Saritha, Mysskin, Sunil Varma, Yogi Babu, Monisha Blessy, Dhileban', null, 'After a head injury, cowardly newspaper cartoonist Sathya hears a voice in his mind, foretells events and puts him in precarious situations and forces him to take on a corrupt politician.', 'After a head injury, cowardly newspaper cartoonist Sathya hears a voice in his mind, foretells events and puts him in precarious situations and forces him to take on a corrupt politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl3AeCuuFDsjhN4rKKFQ9O8mzrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987895'),
  ('294757746145805118', 'maboroshi', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Mari Okada, Tadashi Hiramatsu, Yuriko Ishii', 'Mari Okada', 'Junya Enoki, Reina Ueda, Misaki Kuno, Koji Seto, Kento Hayashi, Taku Yashiro, Tasuku Hatanaka, Daiki Kobayashi', 'PG-13', 'A factory explosion plunges a small town into a timeless freeze, leaving teenage Masamune and his pals to grapple with a quickly collapsing reality.', 'A factory explosion plunges a small town into a timeless freeze, leaving teenage Masamune and his pals to grapple with a quickly collapsing reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kzoPEasqFZGPGHj1imsLtTM20k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845387'),
