  ('381546890911674359', 'Mac', 1992, 'Drama', 'John Turturro, Steve Apicella, Ron Fortunato', 'Brandon Cole, John Turturro', 'John Turturro, Michael Badalucco, Carl Capotorto, Katherine Borowitz, Ellen Barkin, John Amos, Nicholas Turturro, Steven Randazzo', 'R', 'Niccolo "Mac" Vitelli is the eldest of three brothers in 1950s Queens. Mac is a construction builder, a trade he learned from his late father, and helps put his brothers on the job. When they can no longer take working for Polowski, who does shoddy work and is abusive to his staff, Mac and his brothers set up their own company. Together, Vitelli Brothers Construction builds houses with pride and care. But Mac turns out to be an overbearing workaholic, with obsessive concern about the quality of their work and incredible attention to detail. His intensity and driven ambition precludes a happy family life and begins to drive his brothers away.', 'Niccolo "Mac" Vitelli is the eldest of three brothers in 1950s Queens. Mac is a construction builder, a trade he learned from his late father, and helps put his brothers on the job. When they can no longer take working for Polowski, who does shoddy work and is abusive to his staff, Mac and his brothers set up their own company. Together, Vitelli Brothers Construction builds houses with pride and care. But Mac turns out to be an overbearing workaholic, with obsessive concern about the quality of their work and incredible attention to detail. His intensity and driven ambition precludes a happy family life and begins to drive his brothers away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP01g3yL2NBZlwJJTNrRdJAMSYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111883'),
  ('385087254308738470', 'Mac & Devin Go to High School', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Dylan C. Brown, Chandra M. Alexander, Kanesha Caldwell', 'Jamieson Stern, Herschel Faber, Jarrett Golding', 'Snoop Dogg, Wiz Khalifa, Mike Epps, Teairra Mari, Andy Milonakis, Samantha Cope, Teni Panosian, Luenell', 'R', 'A comedy that follows two high school students -- one overachiever struggling to write his valedictorian speech, the other a senior now going on his 15th year of school.', 'A comedy that follows two high school students -- one overachiever struggling to write his valedictorian speech, the other a senior now going on his 15th year of school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3G4ft7cAWsnXjFPC5D5ruvGaOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104859'),
  ('653135098335540728', 'Mac and Me', 1988, 'Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Stewart Raffill, Nick McLean, Caro Jones', 'Stewart Raffill, Steve Feke', 'Christine Ebersole, Jonathan Ward, Tina Caspary, Lauren Stanley, Jade Calegory, Vinnie Torrente, Martin West, Ivan J. Rado', 'PG', 'A Mysterious Alien Creature (MAC) escaping from nefarious NASA agents, is befriended by a young boy in a wheelchair. Together, they try to find MAC''s family from whom he has been separated.', 'A Mysterious Alien Creature (MAC) escaping from nefarious NASA agents, is befriended by a young boy in a wheelchair. Together, they try to find MAC''s family from whom he has been separated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZsIgK2W9K6e1ebNro3WT7u5yGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20196'),
  ('424751020948469051', 'Macabre', 1958, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'William Castle, Carl E. Guthrie', 'Robb White', 'William Prince, Jacqueline Scott, Jim Backus, Jonathan Kidd, Ellen Corby, Philip Tonge, Susan Morrow, Christine White', null, 'After his wife and her blind sister have died under his care, a doctor''s young daughter is kidnapped and reported as buried alive, leaving him with mere hours to find and rescue her.', 'After his wife and her blind sister have died under his care, a doctor''s young daughter is kidnapped and reported as buried alive, leaving him with mere hours to find and rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9APm7cJaJaaFXNNuUKSNjLaIQcr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29393'),
  ('860027235808711761', 'Macabre', 1980, 'Horror', 'Lamberto Bava, Franco Delli Colli, Rossana Rocchi', 'Antonio Avati, Pupi Avati, Lamberto Bava', 'Bernice Stegers, Stanko Molnar, Veronica Zinny, Roberto Posse, Ferdinando Orlandi, Fernando Pannullo, Elisa Kadigia Bove', 'R', 'A middle-aged woman, traumatized from the death of her adulterous lover, moves into a room at a New Orleans boarding house where the blind landlord becomes suspicious to her activities of continuing her affair with her dead lover.', 'A middle-aged woman, traumatized from the death of her adulterous lover, moves into a room at a New Orleans boarding house where the blind landlord becomes suspicious to her activities of continuing her affair with her dead lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yI3zSIWZaxcZNvJ8yAdYlTD6ujH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67737'),
  ('19592280096186250', 'Macabre', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kimo Stamboel, Timo Tjahjanto, Roni Arnold', 'Kimo Stamboel, Timo Tjahjanto', 'Shareefa Daanish, Julie Estelle, Ario Bayu, Arifin Putra, Imelda Therinne, Sigi Wimala, Mike Lucock, Daniel Mananta', null, 'Six friends are captured and tortured by a murderous family after giving a ride home to a desperate stranger.', 'Six friends are captured and tortured by a murderous family after giving a ride home to a desperate stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzirDRNA3JH7TjjhEMRz5QN8rAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39067'),
  ('417523671454060102', 'Macabre', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Marcos Prado, Guilherme Camurati, Cecília Carvalhal', 'Rita Glória Curvo, Lucas Paraizo', 'Renato Góes, Amanda Grimaldi, Guilherme Ferraz, Diego Francisco, Eduardo Tomaz, Juliana Schalch, Flávio Bauraqui, Paulo Reis', null, 'In the 1990s, two brothers were accused of murdering eight women, one man and one child in the Serra dos Órgãos region. In the eyes of the suspects, Sergeant Téo realizes that the trial of the press, police and local society is fundamentally racist, and begins to have doubts about the conviction of one of them. Based on a true story, the film is a work of fiction about the famous case of the "Necrophil Brothers."', 'In the 1990s, two brothers were accused of murdering eight women, one man and one child in the Serra dos Órgãos region. In the eyes of the suspects, Sergeant Téo realizes that the trial of the press, police and local society is fundamentally racist, and begins to have doubts about the conviction of one of them. Based on a true story, the film is a work of fiction about the famous case of the "Necrophil Brothers."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lofgyVTwqt2sq2ZHTlN7etbTN3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637890'),
  ('288174248648223781', 'Macabre Serenade', 1968, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Juan Ibáñez, Jack Hill, José Luis González de León', 'Jack Hill, Octavio Ocampo, José Méndez', 'Boris Karloff, Julissa, Andrés García, José Ángel Espinosa ''Ferrusquilla'', Beatriz Baz, Quintín Bulnes, Manuel Alvarado, Arturo Fernández', null, 'Relatives of a recently deceased man meet at his eerie castle for a reading of the will. They encounter a sinister piano player who turns out to be a toy maker, and his toys are imbued with murderous intentions.', 'Relatives of a recently deceased man meet at his eerie castle for a reading of the will. They encounter a sinister piano player who turns out to be a toy maker, and his toys are imbued with murderous intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMWexzHHl924pDGGVB1f0KuLG6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80655'),
  ('307489954876570746', 'Macadam Stories', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Samuel Benchetrit, Pierre Aïm', 'Gábor Rassov', 'Isabelle Huppert, Gustave Kervern, Tassadit Mandi, Jules Benchetrit, Michael Pitt, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Mickaël Graehling, Larouci Didi', null, 'Improbable encounters bring tenderness, laughter and compassion to a world of urban alienation.', 'Improbable encounters bring tenderness, laughter and compassion to a world of urban alienation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZAC0ziklqOoL9MC0dfuy4JxbMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336199'),
  ('502129854195085545', 'Macao', 1952, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Nicholas Ray, Harry J. Wild, Josef von Sternberg', 'George Bricker, Edward Chodorov, Norman Katkov', 'Robert Mitchum, Jane Russell, William Bendix, Thomas Gomez, Gloria Grahame, Brad Dexter, Edward Ashley, Philip Ahn', 'NR', 'Nick Cochran, an American in exile in Macao, has a chance to restore his name by helping capture an international crime lord. Undercover, can he mislead the bad guys and still woo the attractive singer/petty crook, Julie Benson?', 'Nick Cochran, an American in exile in Macao, has a chance to restore his name by helping capture an international crime lord. Undercover, can he mislead the bad guys and still woo the attractive singer/petty crook, Julie Benson?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXoIIwdaaDuCthlTGMimjCjfPRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26282'),
  ('562931717066070016', 'Macario', 1960, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Gabriel Figueroa, Ignacio Villareal', 'Emilio Carballido, Roberto Gavaldón', 'Ignacio López Tarso, Pina Pellicer, Enrique Lucero, Mario Alberto Rodríguez, José Gálvez, Eduardo Fajardo, Consuelo Frank, José Dupeyrón', null, 'Poor, hungry peasant Macario longs for just one good meal on the Day of the Dead. After his wife cooks a turkey for him, he meets three apparitions, the Devil, God, and Death. Each asks him to share his turkey, but he refuses all except Death. In return, Death gives him a bottle of water which will heal any illness. Soon, Macario is more wealthy than the village doctor, which draws the attention of the feared Inquisition.', 'Poor, hungry peasant Macario longs for just one good meal on the Day of the Dead. After his wife cooks a turkey for him, he meets three apparitions, the Devil, God, and Death. Each asks him to share his turkey, but he refuses all except Death. In return, Death gives him a bottle of water which will heal any illness. Soon, Macario is more wealthy than the village doctor, which draws the attention of the feared Inquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKRzGm3BiuOv3MuolazFOEgB8EX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122019'),
  ('847531307213358496', 'Macaroni', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ettore Scola, Paola Scola, Alessandro Colizzi', 'Graziano Diana', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Jack Lemmon, Daria Nicolodi, Bruno Esposito, Maria Luisa Santella, Orsetta Gregoretti, Isa Danieli, Patrizia Sacchi', 'PG', 'A businessman from the United States returns to Italy for the first time in four decades only to discover that an old girlfriend of his, along with her brother, have involved him in a massive hoax.', 'A businessman from the United States returns to Italy for the first time in four decades only to discover that an old girlfriend of his, along with her brother, have involved him in a massive hoax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akkzoO8tcN3o5y1jMitmYhEla81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60202'),
  ('1132756430721522424', 'MacArthur', 1977, 'Drama, History, War', 'Joseph Sargent, Scott Maitland, Don Zepfel', 'Hal Barwood, Matthew Robbins', 'Gregory Peck, Ivan Bonar, Ward Costello, Nicolas Coster, Marj Dusay, Ed Flanders, Warde Donovan, Branscombe Richmond', 'PG', 'The film portrays MacArthur''s life from 1942, before the Battle of Bataan, to 1952, when he was removed from his Korean War command by President Truman for insubordination, and is recounted in flashback as he visits West Point.', 'The film portrays MacArthur''s life from 1942, before the Battle of Bataan, to 1952, when he was removed from his Korean War command by President Truman for insubordination, and is recounted in flashback as he visits West Point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkgakUhHugeMRAtxSiM47nwXufa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31037'),
  ('630777255074552268', 'Macbeth', 1948, 'Drama', 'Orson Welles, John L. Russell', 'Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles, Jeanette Nolan, Dan O''Herlihy, Roddy McDowall, Edgar Barrier, Alan Napier, Erskine Sanford, John Dierkes', 'NR', 'Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth commits a treasonous act and takes the throne for himself.', 'Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth commits a treasonous act and takes the throne for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DbzuePqGcUY7olAKzGly7kCEmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27883'),
  ('863433655255882474', 'Macbeth', 1971, 'War, Drama', 'Roman Polanski, Jack Stephens, Hercules Bellville', 'Roman Polanski, Kenneth Tynan', 'Jon Finch, Francesca Annis, Martin Shaw, John Stride, Nicholas Selby, Terence Bayler, Stephan Chase, Paul Shelley', 'R', 'Scotland, 11th century. Driven by the twisted prophecy of three witches and the ruthless ambition of his wife, warlord Macbeth, bold and brave, but also weak and hesitant, betrays his good king and his brothers in arms and sinks into the bloody mud of a path with no return, sown with crime and suspicion.', 'Scotland, 11th century. Driven by the twisted prophecy of three witches and the ruthless ambition of his wife, warlord Macbeth, bold and brave, but also weak and hesitant, betrays his good king and his brothers in arms and sinks into the bloody mud of a path with no return, sown with crime and suspicion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35wNrDYuZjVCLurOmTZ5j490iuR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11316'),
  ('319719844803544488', 'Macbeth', 1979, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Philip Casson, Trevor Nunn', null, 'Judi Dench, Ian McKellen, John Bown, Susan Dury, Judith Harte, Greg Hicks, David Howey, Griffith Jones', null, 'Macbeth is a 1978 videotaped version of Trevor Nunn''s Royal Shakespeare Company production of the play by William Shakespeare. Produced by Thames Television, it features Ian McKellen as Macbeth and Judi Dench as Lady Macbeth. The TV version was directed by Philip Casson. The original stage production was performed at The Other Place, the RSC''s small studio theatre in Stratford-upon-Avon. It had been performed in the round before small audiences, with a bare stage and simple costuming. The recording preserves this style: the actors perform on a circular set and with a mostly black background changes of setting are indicated only by lighting changes.', 'Macbeth is a 1978 videotaped version of Trevor Nunn''s Royal Shakespeare Company production of the play by William Shakespeare. Produced by Thames Television, it features Ian McKellen as Macbeth and Judi Dench as Lady Macbeth. The TV version was directed by Philip Casson. The original stage production was performed at The Other Place, the RSC''s small studio theatre in Stratford-upon-Avon. It had been performed in the round before small audiences, with a bare stage and simple costuming. The recording preserves this style: the actors perform on a circular set and with a mostly black background changes of setting are indicated only by lighting changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doZO7mPl5Yx3fKKogpziw2gZguk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41149'),
  ('946751925455794915', 'Macbeth', 1982, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Béla Tarr, Ferenc Pap, Buda Gulyás', 'Béla Tarr', 'György Cserhalmi, Erzsébet Kútvölgyi, Ferenc Bencze, Imre Csuja, János Derzsi, István Dégi, Pál Hetényi, Tamás Jordán', null, 'Consistent of only two long shots, three witches predict that Macbeth will ascend to the throne of Scotland. To fulfill this prophecy, Lady Macbeth convinces her husband to murder King Duncan, who has come to spend the night at their home. This crime plunges the new ruler into a macabre spiral that will lead him to sink into guilt and madness.', 'Consistent of only two long shots, three witches predict that Macbeth will ascend to the throne of Scotland. To fulfill this prophecy, Lady Macbeth convinces her husband to murder King Duncan, who has come to spend the night at their home. This crime plunges the new ruler into a macabre spiral that will lead him to sink into guilt and madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYiy2WTHcevtUBCqmXjLlDiQaR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115427'),
  ('476283447540736473', 'Macbeth', 1983, 'Drama', 'Jack Gold', null, 'Nicol Williamson, Jane Lapotaire, Ian Hogg, Mark Dignam, Tony Doyle, Brenda Bruce, Eileen Way, Anne Dyson', null, 'Macbeth and his wife murder Duncan in order to gain his crown, but the bloodbath doesn''t stop there, and things supernatural combine to bring the Macbeths down.', 'Macbeth and his wife murder Duncan in order to gain his crown, but the bloodbath doesn''t stop there, and things supernatural combine to bring the Macbeths down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3BVJgAnHW7VaZtpdWqcDpGyGgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119844'),
  ('1128819519956421305', 'Macbeth', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Geoffrey Wright, Bruce Phillips, Will Gibson', 'Victoria Hill, Geoffrey Wright', 'Sam Worthington, Victoria Hill, Lachy Hulme, Kate Bell, Steve Bastoni, Bob Franklin, Matt Doran, Nash Edgerton', null, 'Macbeth, loyal to his crime boss, Duncan, is told by witches that he will one day take over. Driven by their prophecy, he and his wife plot to kill Duncan, and takes the leadership of the gang for himself. Maintaining his power will require more murder and violence, finally driving his surviving enemies to unite and destroy him. A sexy, high octane retelling of this classic story.', 'Macbeth, loyal to his crime boss, Duncan, is told by witches that he will one day take over. Driven by their prophecy, he and his wife plot to kill Duncan, and takes the leadership of the gang for himself. Maintaining his power will require more murder and violence, finally driving his surviving enemies to unite and destroy him. A sexy, high octane retelling of this classic story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2M3BkwwITCR88NQuHQmcFjd7lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13775'),
  ('444954530957729501', 'Macbeth', 2015, 'Drama, War', 'Justin Kurzel, Adam Arkapaw, Nick Dent', 'Todd Louiso, Jacob Koskoff, Michael Lesslie', 'Michael Fassbender, Marion Cotillard, Paddy Considine, Sean Harris, Jack Reynor, Elizabeth Debicki, David Thewlis, David Hayman', 'R', 'Feature film adaptation of Shakespeare''s Scottish play about General Macbeth whose ambitious wife urges him to use wicked means in order to gain power of the throne over the sitting king, Duncan.', 'Feature film adaptation of Shakespeare''s Scottish play about General Macbeth whose ambitious wife urges him to use wicked means in order to gain power of the throne over the sitting king, Duncan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5NEpil29Uns1wEYF8k99qVgj1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225728'),
  ('830857865932379679', 'MacGruber', 2010, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jorma Taccone, Brandon Trost, Joel Jeffrey Nishimine', 'Will Forte, John Solomon, Jorma Taccone', 'Will Forte, Kristen Wiig, Ryan Phillippe, Powers Boothe, Maya Rudolph, Chris Irvine, Mark Henry, Glenn Jacobs', 'R', 'Ex-special operative MacGruber is called back into action to take down his archenemy, Dieter Von Cunth, who''s in possession of a nuclear warhead and bent on destroying Washington, DC.', 'Ex-special operative MacGruber is called back into action to take down his archenemy, Dieter Von Cunth, who''s in possession of a nuclear warhead and bent on destroying Washington, DC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eZEk793evkaIOjBwNO2cFS6h5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37931'),
  ('543034357605353501', 'MacGyver: Lost Treasure of Atlantis', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Michael Vejar, Adam Somner', 'John Sheppard', 'Richard Dean Anderson, Brian Blessed, Sophie Ward, Christian Burgess, Oliver Ford Davies, Tim Woodward, Kevork Malikyan', null, 'Hunting artifacts attributed to Zenon (an ancient scientist from Atlantis), MacGyver and his old professor end up searching for the lost city.', 'Hunting artifacts attributed to Zenon (an ancient scientist from Atlantis), MacGyver and his old professor end up searching for the lost city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcmocdC6Rp0w6C8M4i1yvewmgNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81895'),
  ('898021563643902948', 'MacGyver: Trail to Doomsday', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Charles Correll, David Geddes, Adam Somner', 'John Considine', 'Richard Dean Anderson, Beatie Edney, Peter Egan, Alun Armstrong, Bob Sherman, Lena Headey', null, 'A close friend of MacGyver is murdered. In searching for a reason for this assassination MacGyver discovers a secret nuclear weapons plant right in the center of Britain.', 'A close friend of MacGyver is murdered. In searching for a reason for this assassination MacGyver discovers a secret nuclear weapons plant right in the center of Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1fwL6i2PObYIeOW6iMhimLpIa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13632'),
  ('71366263462923146', 'Machete', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Robert Rodriguez, Jimmy Lindsey, Ethan Maniquis', 'Robert Rodriguez, Álvaro Rodríguez', 'Danny Trejo, Michelle Rodriguez, Jessica Alba, Robert De Niro, Steven Seagal, Cheech Marin, Lindsay Lohan, Electra Avellan', 'R', 'After being set-up and betrayed by the man who hired him to assassinate a Texas Senator, an ex-Federale launches a brutal rampage of revenge against his former boss.', 'After being set-up and betrayed by the man who hired him to assassinate a Texas Senator, an ex-Federale launches a brutal rampage of revenge against his former boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcPSm1rGEFdiEc7DaKz0t5kb66b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23631'),
  ('974567439356229824', 'Machete Kills', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez', 'Kyle Ward', 'Danny Trejo, Mel Gibson, Demián Bichir, Amber Heard, Michelle Rodriguez, Sofía Vergara, Charlie Sheen, Lady Gaga', 'R', 'Ex-Federale agent Machete is recruited by the President of the United States for a mission which would be impossible for any mortal man – he must take down a madman revolutionary and an eccentric billionaire arms dealer who has hatched a plan to spread war and anarchy across the planet.', 'Ex-Federale agent Machete is recruited by the President of the United States for a mission which would be impossible for any mortal man – he must take down a madman revolutionary and an eccentric billionaire arms dealer who has hatched a plan to spread war and anarchy across the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i4UgSZmAJXt6Euy5azvknmzsm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106747'),
  ('1114645347879614658', 'Machete Maidens Unleashed!', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Mark Hartley, Karl von Moller', 'Mark Hartley', 'Roger Corman, Colleen Camp, John Landis, Sid Haig, R. Lee Ermey, Joe Dante, Brian Trenchard-Smith, Marlene Clark', 'NR', 'In the final decades of the 20th century, the Philippines was a country where low-budget exploitation-film producers were free to make nearly any kind of movie they wanted, any way they pleased. It was a country with extremely lax labor regulations and a very permissive attitude towards cultural expression. As a result, it became a hotbed for the production of cheapie movies. Their history and the genre itself are detailed in this breezy, nostalgic documentary.', 'In the final decades of the 20th century, the Philippines was a country where low-budget exploitation-film producers were free to make nearly any kind of movie they wanted, any way they pleased. It was a country with extremely lax labor regulations and a very permissive attitude towards cultural expression. As a result, it became a hotbed for the production of cheapie movies. Their history and the genre itself are detailed in this breezy, nostalgic documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GbANwz67TyuOQc5GFY4hBaqTQ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70115'),
  ('1062976919817907665', 'Machine', 2017, 'Action, Romance, Comedy', 'Safdar Abbas, Mohammed S. Burmawala, Sudhir Trivedi', null, 'Mustafa Burmawala, Kiara Advani, Rishabh Arora, Shabbir Burmawala, Carla Dennis, Supriya Karnik, Mridanjli Rawal, Ronit Roy', null, 'Machine depicts the story of racing enthusiasts , who meet each other under mysterious circumstances. As their bond becomes stronger, they eventually fall in love. However, new things begin to unfold, which change their lives forever', 'Machine depicts the story of racing enthusiasts , who meet each other under mysterious circumstances. As their bond becomes stronger, they eventually fall in love. However, new things begin to unfold, which change their lives forever', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vx1v3WaM2atLBbqJfmm3fVIFokP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449510'),
  ('105477241644952523', 'Machine Gun Kelly''s Life In Pink', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Sam Cahill, Sam Cahill', 'mgk', 'mgk, Casie Baker, Brandon ''Slim'' Allen, Travis Barker, Megan Fox, Conor McGregor, J.P. ''Rook'' Cappelletty, Stephen ''Baze'' Basil', 'R', 'An in-depth look at the dramatic highs and lows of an artist chasing music''s top spot while tackling noise from the outside world, stardom, fatherhood and more. From creating his platinum-selling, Billboard No. 1 album “Tickets to My Downfall,” to his most recent No. 1 studio album, “Mainstream Sellout,” this is an all-access pass, that goes beyond the headlines, into the chaotic world of Machine Gun Kelly.', 'An in-depth look at the dramatic highs and lows of an artist chasing music''s top spot while tackling noise from the outside world, stardom, fatherhood and more. From creating his platinum-selling, Billboard No. 1 album “Tickets to My Downfall,” to his most recent No. 1 studio album, “Mainstream Sellout,” this is an all-access pass, that goes beyond the headlines, into the chaotic world of Machine Gun Kelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiJxvswZSc3dc3DfAUw2YvC254u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988460'),
  ('594209913823438715', 'Machine Gun McCain', 1969, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Erico Menczer, Fabrizio Gianni', 'Mino Roli, Giuliano Montaldo', 'John Cassavetes, Britt Ekland, Peter Falk, Gabriele Ferzetti, Pierluigi Aprà, Luigi Pistilli, Margherita Guzzinati, Claudio Biava', 'PG', 'After serving 12 years behind bars for armed robbery, tough guy Hank McCain finds himself the pawn of a ruthless mob runt''s rebellion against a high level don. When McCain discovers that he''s been betrayed and abandoned by his new employer, he retaliates with a high stakes Las Vegas casino heist that erupts into all-out war on the streets of Los Angeles, San Francisco and New York. Neither blood, nor lust, nor wedding vows can come between McCain and his money ... or his machine gun.', 'After serving 12 years behind bars for armed robbery, tough guy Hank McCain finds himself the pawn of a ruthless mob runt''s rebellion against a high level don. When McCain discovers that he''s been betrayed and abandoned by his new employer, he retaliates with a high stakes Las Vegas casino heist that erupts into all-out war on the streets of Los Angeles, San Francisco and New York. Neither blood, nor lust, nor wedding vows can come between McCain and his money ... or his machine gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlCoQTTfVVuzpEbNe2H0ovjnsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45138'),
  ('617954832907433572', 'Machine Gun Preacher', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Roberto Schaefer, Marc Forster', 'Jason Keller', 'Gerard Butler, Michelle Monaghan, Kathy Baker, Richard Goteri, Peter Carey, Barbara Coven, Michael Shannon, Ryann Campos', 'R', 'The true story of Sam Childers, a former drug-dealing biker who finds God and became a crusader for hundreds of Sudanese children who''ve been kidnapped and pressed into duty as soldiers.', 'The true story of Sam Childers, a former drug-dealing biker who finds God and became a crusader for hundreds of Sudanese children who''ve been kidnapped and pressed into duty as soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/534yDalJ8rybnSn8VZ9XPWU3egc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45610'),
  ('1116668720392372136', 'Machine-Gun Kelly', 1958, 'Crime, Action', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby', 'R. Wright Campbell', 'Charles Bronson, Susan Cabot, Morey Amsterdam, Richard Devon, Jack Lambert, Frank De Kova, Connie Gilchrist, Wally Campo', 'NR', 'George Kelly is angry at the world and scared to death of dying. A career bank robber, Kelly gets his confidence from his Thompson SMG and his girl Flo. After a botched robbery, Flo, Kelly and his gang try their hand at a more lucrative job: kidnapping.', 'George Kelly is angry at the world and scared to death of dying. A career bank robber, Kelly gets his confidence from his Thompson SMG and his girl Flo. After a botched robbery, Flo, Kelly and his gang try their hand at a more lucrative job: kidnapping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1jB8vxLGiJJjgGhbrqUuIgXTGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43119'),
  ('117944403077768095', 'Machines', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Rodrigo Trejo Villanueva, Rahul Jain', null, null, null, 'This portrayal of the rhythm of life and work in a gigantic textile factory in Gujarat, India, moves through the corridors and bowels of the enormously disorienting structure—taking the viewer on a journey of dehumanizing physical labor and intense hardship.', 'This portrayal of the rhythm of life and work in a gigantic textile factory in Gujarat, India, moves through the corridors and bowels of the enormously disorienting structure—taking the viewer on a journey of dehumanizing physical labor and intense hardship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gITpHa3GOEYGsZuya1hFJN4CKkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433086'),
  ('706903910268311636', 'Macho', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Serrano', 'Sabina Berman', 'Miguel Rodarte, Cecilia Suárez, Aislinn Derbez, Ana de la Reguera, Renato López, Valeria Vera, Mario Iván Martínez, Manolo Cardona', null, 'A fashion designer pretends to be gay in order to be closer to female models.', 'A fashion designer pretends to be gay in order to be closer to female models.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSDckOHRDHAzSddFREdxQS1Yy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387585'),
  ('960117473576039609', 'Macho calado', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Lourdes Álvarez', null, 'Carlos Bonavides, Esmeralda Cervantes, Juan José Mendoza, Vania Daniela, Zaida Mafud, Pablo Cheng, Patricia Lupercio, Oswaldo Rada', 'R', 'A family is about to receive their nephew, a fashion designer, but everything gets complicated when a milkman chased by his lover''s husband arrives and pretends to be him. He will soon have everyone''s affection and the confusion will be greater.', 'A family is about to receive their nephew, a fashion designer, but everything gets complicated when a milkman chased by his lover''s husband arrives and pretends to be him. He will soon have everyone''s affection and the confusion will be greater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3v7unm9mBk9PlONtU0FX8vAGsR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573724'),
  ('993929810546355754', 'Macho Callahan', 1971, 'Western', 'Bernard L. Kowalski, Robert "Buzz" Henry, Jesús Marín', null, 'David Janssen, Jean Seberg, Lee J. Cobb, James Booth, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., David Carradine, Bo Hopkins, Anne Revere', 'NR', 'A man tricked into enlisting in the Confederate army is later thrown into a hellish stockade on desertion charges. He eventually breaks out of the prison camp, reunites with his old partner and sets out to kill the man who was responsible for his being in the camp in the first place. However, after accidentally killing a Confederate officer, he finds himself pursued by a gang of vicious bounty hunters intent on collecting the reward put up by the dead officer''s widow.', 'A man tricked into enlisting in the Confederate army is later thrown into a hellish stockade on desertion charges. He eventually breaks out of the prison camp, reunites with his old partner and sets out to kill the man who was responsible for his being in the camp in the first place. However, after accidentally killing a Confederate officer, he finds himself pursued by a gang of vicious bounty hunters intent on collecting the reward put up by the dead officer''s widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tKkw9azwzPXNPD2M5K1hBfuHVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111375'),
  ('289762788434244614', 'Macho Dancer', 1989, 'Drama', 'Lino Brocka, Joe Tutanes', 'Ricardo Lee, Amado Lacuesta', 'Allan Paule, Daniel Fernando, Jaclyn Jose, William Lorenzo, Princess Punzalan, Timothy Diwa, Johnny Vicar, Lucita Soriano', null, 'Pol moves to Manila for better opportunities after his American lover leaves. However, he gets drawn into the gritty world of gay prostitution and sexual slavery.', 'Pol moves to Manila for better opportunities after his American lover leaves. However, he gets drawn into the gritty world of gay prostitution and sexual slavery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HP9zbx6l7E1SWuPtjmFb6w4oDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170924'),
  ('851868503943775013', 'Macho Man', 1985, 'Action', 'Alexander Titus Benda, Adi Gürtner', 'Alexander Titus Benda', 'René Weller, Peter Althof, Bea Fiedler, Jacqueline Elber, Michael Messing, Horst Schreiner, Tony Dawson Harrison, Günther Althof', null, 'The world-champion in boxing Dany Wagner saves Sandra right before some criminals could give her a shot of heroin to get her addicted. After that he stops a bank robbery with his friend Andreas. They plan to fight the underworld of Nuernberg together.', 'The world-champion in boxing Dany Wagner saves Sandra right before some criminals could give her a shot of heroin to get her addicted. After that he stops a bank robbery with his friend Andreas. They plan to fight the underworld of Nuernberg together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTaT3vKUVvsSBnLKLAJw3v9zKEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73879'),
  ('805257575769147914', 'Macho Man', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Christof Wahl, Christof Wahl', 'Roger Schmelzer, Moritz Netenjakob', 'Christian Ulmen, Aylin Tezel, Dar Salim, Axel Stein, Inez Bjørg David, Samuel Finzi, Vladimir Burlakov, Nora Tschirner', null, 'A German man fells in love with a Turkish woman and changes his lifestyle for her family.', 'A German man fells in love with a Turkish woman and changes his lifestyle for her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f54R3NiPhrsuKIE6SjwCS8iNUNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358760'),
  ('1150423920766026880', 'Macho Man', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Amorim, Dante Belluti, Carol Minêm', 'Carolina Castro, Célio Porto', 'Luís Lobianco, Thiago Rodrigues, Marcelo Flores, Thati Lopes, Marcelo Souza, Saulo Rodrigues, Victor Lamoglia, Pedroca Monteiro', null, 'Carlão is a prejudiced man who works in a car dealership with Cadinho, Zeca and Antunes. In conversations between them, Carlão always boasts of being the greatest soccer and mechanics savvy, all amidst macho and homophobic jokes. When Evaristo is the target of such verbal assaults, he pursues him and locks him in a magic locker. From there comes Carlinhos, a homosexual alter ego that takes over Carlão''s body when night comes.', 'Carlão is a prejudiced man who works in a car dealership with Cadinho, Zeca and Antunes. In conversations between them, Carlão always boasts of being the greatest soccer and mechanics savvy, all amidst macho and homophobic jokes. When Evaristo is the target of such verbal assaults, he pursues him and locks him in a magic locker. From there comes Carlinhos, a homosexual alter ego that takes over Carlão''s body when night comes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMbz46SYfEgDdFUIoAnkm43ft5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515919'),
  ('797109655210149230', 'Macho Que Ladra No Muerde', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Damián Acosta Esparza, Víctor Manuel Castro, Raúl Domínguez', null, 'Alfonso Zayas, Rebeca Silva, Maribel Guardia, Alberto Rojas, Eduardo de la Peña, Pedro Weber ''Chatanuga'', Polo Ortín, Víctor Manuel Castro', null, 'An old man punishes his son for not having children, so he tells him his inheritance will go to someone else if he doesn''t have a child in a year.', 'An old man punishes his son for not having children, so he tells him his inheritance will go to someone else if he doesn''t have a child in a year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fIWCXp4doP1LBaHYf7ONlRoj4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546190'),
  ('867458874818902529', 'Machorka-Muff', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Erich Kuby, Renate Langsdorff, Johannes Eckardt, Rolf Thiede, Heiner Braun, Gino Cardella, Julius Wikidal, Guenther Strupp', null, 'A satirical attack on West Germany''s re-armament and revival of militaristic tradition in the Adenauer era.', 'A satirical attack on West Germany''s re-armament and revival of militaristic tradition in the Adenauer era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqXUdtI354pYy1drs28iD6ksay5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208197'),
  ('1081034605886679044', 'Machuca', 2004, 'Drama', 'Andrés Wood, M.I. Littin-Menz, María José Droguett', 'Andrés Wood, Eliseo Altunaga, Mamoun Hassan', 'Matías Quer, Ariel Mateluna, Aline Küppenheim, Ernesto Malbrán, Federico Luppi, Manuela Martelli, Tamara Acosta, Francisco Reyes', null, 'Santiago, capital of Chile during the Marxist government of elected, highly controversial president Salvador Allende. Father McEnroe supports his leftist views by introducing a program at the prestigious "collegio" (Catholic prep school) St. Patrick to allow free admission of some proletarian kids. One of them is Pedro Machuca, slum-raised son of the cleaning lady in Gonzalo Infante''s liberal-bourgeois home. Yet the new classmates become buddies, paradoxically protesting together as Gonzalo gets adopted by Pedro''s slum family and gang. But the adults spoil that too, not in the least when general Pinochet''s coup ousts Allende, and supporters such as McEnroe.', 'Santiago, capital of Chile during the Marxist government of elected, highly controversial president Salvador Allende. Father McEnroe supports his leftist views by introducing a program at the prestigious "collegio" (Catholic prep school) St. Patrick to allow free admission of some proletarian kids. One of them is Pedro Machuca, slum-raised son of the cleaning lady in Gonzalo Infante''s liberal-bourgeois home. Yet the new classmates become buddies, paradoxically protesting together as Gonzalo gets adopted by Pedro''s slum family and gang. But the adults spoil that too, not in the least when general Pinochet''s coup ousts Allende, and supporters such as McEnroe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP3ceWIvq7DZm8VLYWuFKzbDK43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12086'),
  ('1150042329921821354', 'Maciste', 1915, 'Adventure, Comedy, Thriller, Action', 'Luigi Romano Borgnetto, Vincenzo Denizot', 'Giovanni Pastrone', 'Bartolomeo Pagano, Clementina Gay, Amelia Chellini, Didaco Chellini, Leone Papa', null, 'A young girl, pursued by a band of conspirators, hides in a movie theatre where she watches the film Cabiria. She determines to seek the aid of that film''s strongman, Maciste. When she locates him, he helps her overcome her enemies, but not without many thrilling and dangerous adventures.', 'A young girl, pursued by a band of conspirators, hides in a movie theatre where she watches the film Cabiria. She determines to seek the aid of that film''s strongman, Maciste. When she locates him, he helps her overcome her enemies, but not without many thrilling and dangerous adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY1oip8WZ5HHZ5L6DAJ5AwbAtnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191141'),
  ('316179165168765265', 'Maciste in Hell', 1925, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama, Adventure', 'Massimo Terzano, Ubaldo Arata, Guido Brignone', 'Riccardo Artuffo', 'Bartolomeo Pagano, Elena Sangro, Lucia Zanussi, Franz Sala, Umberto Guarracino, Mario Saio, Pauline Polaire, Domenico Serra', null, 'The devil takes Maciste down to hell in an attempt to corrupt and ruin his morality.', 'The devil takes Maciste down to hell in an attempt to corrupt and ruin his morality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciU1RIIkbP1PKDj4flQ3IN8v2Lc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113623'),
  ('845152572434866411', 'Maciste In King Solomon''s Mines', 1964, 'Action, Adventure', 'Piero Regnoli, Mario Capriotti', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Reg Park, Wandisa Guida, Eleonora Bianchi, Nino Persello, Bruno Scipioni, Loris Loddi, Bruno Piergentili, Elio Jotta', null, 'Maciste is captured and forced to work as a slave in an African mine.', 'Maciste is captured and forced to work as a slave in an African mine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfrQ1h8Eur1bfILMkKZgd8SQ4JQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63495'),
  ('150732246530112992', 'Mack & Rita', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama', 'Katie Aselton, Sean McElwee, Jessamyn Land', 'Paul Welsh, Madeline Walter', 'Elizabeth Lail, Diane Keaton, Taylour Paige, Dustin Milligan, Simon Rex, Loretta Devine, Amy Hill, Lois Smith', 'PG-13', 'A 30-year-old spends a wild weekend in Palm Springs and wakes up to find she has magically transformed into her 70-year-old self.', 'A 30-year-old spends a wild weekend in Palm Springs and wakes up to find she has magically transformed into her 70-year-old self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhJDDzGZitrGpW3ELmFhdCEFx9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808087'),
  ('1073261946806828836', 'Mack the Knife - Brecht''s Threepenny Film', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Joachim Lang, David Slama', 'Joachim Lang', 'Lars Eidinger, Tobias Moretti, Hannah Herzsprung, Joachim Król, Claudia Michelsen, Christian Redl, Robert Stadlober, Britta Hammelstein', null, 'Following the phenomenal success of “The Threepenny Opera”, the film industry wants to win over the celebrated author. But Bertolt Brecht is not prepared to play by their rules. His concept of the “Threepenny Film” is radical, uncompromising, political, and incisive.', 'Following the phenomenal success of “The Threepenny Opera”, the film industry wants to win over the celebrated author. But Bertolt Brecht is not prepared to play by their rules. His concept of the “Threepenny Film” is radical, uncompromising, political, and incisive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whU0gR218cjVaytn8kfjEm2Ae2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456618'),
  ('583604958959518086', 'Macken - Roy''s & Roger''s Bilservice', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Claes Eriksson, Dan Myhrman', 'Claes Eriksson', 'Anders Eriksson, Jan Rippe, Kerstin Granlund, Per Fritzell, Peter Rangmar, Knut Agnred, Claes Eriksson, Sven Melander', null, 'Roy and Roger decide to close their gasstation for the summer, to try to find where, what and how their lost father is. Roger also falls in love and much more.', 'Roy and Roger decide to close their gasstation for the summer, to try to find where, what and how their lost father is. Roger also falls in love and much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LuXbMcfmc6ZL0l9bpncnm9L9nc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53703'),
  ('747752703614034018', 'Mackenna''s Gold', 1969, 'Adventure, Action, Western', 'J. Lee Thompson, Joseph MacDonald', 'Carl Foreman', 'Gregory Peck, Omar Sharif, Camilla Sparv, Julie Newmar, Telly Savalas, Keenan Wynn, Ted Cassidy, Lee J. Cobb', null, 'A bandit kidnaps a Marshal who has seen a map showing a gold vein on Indian lands, but other groups are looking for it too, while the Apache try to keep the secret location undisturbed.', 'A bandit kidnaps a Marshal who has seen a map showing a gold vein on Indian lands, but other groups are looking for it too, while the Apache try to keep the secret location undisturbed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uChjCbOKpoREb3yZrG1p8L3GyC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18118'),
  ('446446936271209034', 'Maclovia', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Fernández, James L. Fields, Carlos L. Cabello', 'Emilio Fernández', 'María Félix, Pedro Armendáriz, Carlos López Moctezuma, Columba Domínguez, Arturo Soto Rangel, Miguel Inclán, Eduardo Arozamena, José Morcillo', null, 'On a small Mexican island dwells a group of Indians who live in the traditional manner and who disdain outsiders. The beautiful Maclovia and the poverty-stricken Jose Maria are in love, but her father refuses to allow their marriage, or even any communication between them, due to Jose Maria''s lack of means.', 'On a small Mexican island dwells a group of Indians who live in the traditional manner and who disdain outsiders. The beautiful Maclovia and the poverty-stricken Jose Maria are in love, but her father refuses to allow their marriage, or even any communication between them, due to Jose Maria''s lack of means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aL0U8M6qCGcDORIvWNdDpaIriQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183529'),
  ('797785033349245948', 'Macon County Line', 1974, 'Drama, Action', 'Richard Compton, Daniel Lacambre', 'Richard Compton, Max Baer Jr.', 'Alan Vint, Cheryl Waters, Geoffrey Lewis, Max Baer Jr., Joan Blackman, Jesse Vint, Sam Gilman, Timothy Scott', 'R', 'A vengeful Southern sheriff is out for blood after his wife is brutally killed by a pair of drifters. Low-budget film set in Georgia in 1953 and at the time of release, purported to be based on a true story.', 'A vengeful Southern sheriff is out for blood after his wife is brutally killed by a pair of drifters. Low-budget film set in Georgia in 1953 and at the time of release, purported to be based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWAyaQWfGkk0OWkXjdZFtQvAYwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42450'),
  ('382215973043164294', 'Macondo', 2014, 'Drama', 'Klemens Hufnagl, Sudabeh Mortezai', 'Sudabeh Mortezai', 'Ramasan Minkailov, Aslan Elbiev, Kheda Gazieva, Rosa Minkailova', null, 'A drama centered on an 11-year-old Chechnyan refugee living in Vienna whose life is thrown into disarray when a friend of his deceased father materializes.', 'A drama centered on an 11-year-old Chechnyan refugee living in Vienna whose life is thrown into disarray when a friend of his deceased father materializes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17V6pBcIGMNlH18mE9j5CkYRW2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256021'),
  ('868257988918625915', 'Macross 7: The Galaxy Is Calling Me!', 1995, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Music', 'Masami Shimoda, Tetsuro Amino, Yasunori Honda', 'Shoji Kawamori', 'Tomo Sakurai, Satomi Korogi, Nobutoshi Canna, Michiko Neya, Takehito Koyasu, Masashi Sugawara, Yoshiki Fukuyama, Yo Inoue', null, 'Basara, on one of his frequent trips across the galaxy to spread the message of his music, folds in on an icy planet. The natives are hostile, and take him prisoner until he begins to sing for them and a little boy named Pedro recognizes his voice. They release Basara, and almost as soon as they don, a strange wailing voice comes from the nearby mountains. Basara and Pedro head out in Basara''s valkyrie to investigate the noise. Little do they know, an ambush is waiting for them.', 'Basara, on one of his frequent trips across the galaxy to spread the message of his music, folds in on an icy planet. The natives are hostile, and take him prisoner until he begins to sing for them and a little boy named Pedro recognizes his voice. They release Basara, and almost as soon as they don, a strange wailing voice comes from the nearby mountains. Basara and Pedro head out in Basara''s valkyrie to investigate the noise. Little do they know, an ambush is waiting for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnBOoTbsKctL2COK0XZXQxkQpuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45932'),
  ('405402698305329505', 'Macross Delta: Passionate Walküre', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Drama, Science Fiction, War, Romance, Music', 'Yoshihiro Nagata, Yoshimasa Hiraike, Shintaro Itoga', 'Shoji Kawamori, Toshizo Nemoto', 'Minori Suzuki, Yuma Uchida, Asami Seto, Ami Koshimizu, Kiyono Yasuno, Nozomi Nishida, Nao Toyama, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'Macross Delta is set in the year 2067, eight years after the events of Macross Frontier. The story focuses on Walküre, a team of talented idols and the Delta Squadron, a team of experienced Valkyrie pilots as they battle against the Var Syndrome, a mysterious phenomena that is consuming the galaxy, alongside the mysterious Aerial Knights Valkyrie fighter team of the Kingdom of Wind. This film recompiles scenes from the television anime with new scenes to tell a different story.', 'Macross Delta is set in the year 2067, eight years after the events of Macross Frontier. The story focuses on Walküre, a team of talented idols and the Delta Squadron, a team of experienced Valkyrie pilots as they battle against the Var Syndrome, a mysterious phenomena that is consuming the galaxy, alongside the mysterious Aerial Knights Valkyrie fighter team of the Kingdom of Wind. This film recompiles scenes from the television anime with new scenes to tell a different story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsrn9gRgRGoVuYb5kYFgnprx3Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496349'),
  ('142054965041108816', 'Macross Frontier: The False Songstress', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shoji Kawamori, Yasuhito Kikuchi, Masafumi Mima', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino, Shoji Kawamori', 'Jun Fukuyama, Aya Endo, Megumi Nakajima, Yuichi Nakamura, Aya Hirano, Kikuko Inoue, Megumi Toyoguchi, Hiroshi Kamiya', null, 'Half retelling of the original Frontier series, half new story. Conspiracies arise within the Frontier government when Sheryl Nome arrives to the colonial fleet for her concert and is soon marked as a spy for Galaxy while childhood friends, Alto Saotome and Ranka Lee both try to achieve their dreams as the battle between Frontier and the Vajra draws closer.', 'Half retelling of the original Frontier series, half new story. Conspiracies arise within the Frontier government when Sheryl Nome arrives to the colonial fleet for her concert and is soon marked as a spy for Galaxy while childhood friends, Alto Saotome and Ranka Lee both try to achieve their dreams as the battle between Frontier and the Vajra draws closer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAa3xDHeeM2cYqlnBeCS1OqyP2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48625'),
  ('315886561165122804', 'Macross Frontier: The Wings of Farewell', 2011, 'Action, Animation, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Shoji Kawamori, Kenji Shinohara, Masashi Abe', 'Shoji Kawamori, Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Aya Endo, Megumi Nakajima, Yuichi Nakamura, Aya Hirano, Katsuyuki Konishi, Sanae Kobayashi, Kikuko Inoue, Megumi Toyoguchi', null, 'Picking up from where the previous movie left off, Ranka''s star career flourishes while Sheryl''s health rapidly deteriorates after collapsing during a live performance. At the same time, separate factions are maneuvering behind the scenes seeking to control the Vajra horde by utilizing the singing abilities of the two songstresses. As the entire Macross Frontier fleet begins to wage its final war on the Vajra, Alto finally makes a choice between Ranka and Sheryl.', 'Picking up from where the previous movie left off, Ranka''s star career flourishes while Sheryl''s health rapidly deteriorates after collapsing during a live performance. At the same time, separate factions are maneuvering behind the scenes seeking to control the Vajra horde by utilizing the singing abilities of the two songstresses. As the entire Macross Frontier fleet begins to wage its final war on the Vajra, Alto finally makes a choice between Ranka and Sheryl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QulQQbVoy7MxMqsv9mvbaP6Cnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60964'),
  ('693570686357879953', 'Macross Plus: The Movie', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shoji Kawamori, Shinichiro Watanabe, Yuji Moriyama', 'Keiko Nobumoto', 'Takumi Yamazaki, Unsho Ishizuka, Rica Fukami, Mako Hyodo, Kenji Utsumi, Megumi Hayashibara, Banjo Ginga, Koichi Kitamura', null, 'Three decades after the great war between the humans and the Zentradi, the U.N. government is developing new technologies to use in their transforming fighter aircraft by running tests on the colony planet Eden. Military test pilots and former childhood friends, loose cannon Isamu Alva Dyson and the Zentradi mixed race Guld Goa Bowman, are selected to each pilot a new aircraft (Shinsei Industries'' YF-19 & General Galaxy''s YF-21) for Project Super Nova, to choose the newest successor to the VF-11 Thunderbolt variable fighter which is currently still in use by the U.N. Spacy military forces. Their own personal grudges end up disrupting the tests, and begin to wreak havoc on the program.', 'Three decades after the great war between the humans and the Zentradi, the U.N. government is developing new technologies to use in their transforming fighter aircraft by running tests on the colony planet Eden. Military test pilots and former childhood friends, loose cannon Isamu Alva Dyson and the Zentradi mixed race Guld Goa Bowman, are selected to each pilot a new aircraft (Shinsei Industries'' YF-19 & General Galaxy''s YF-21) for Project Super Nova, to choose the newest successor to the VF-11 Thunderbolt variable fighter which is currently still in use by the U.N. Spacy military forces. Their own personal grudges end up disrupting the tests, and begin to wreak havoc on the program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwx4ogFB0ST3jAHAuda9xFF2tnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18837'),
  ('165436891394361664', 'Macross: Do You Remember Love?', 1984, 'Animation, Science Fiction, War, Action', 'Noboru Ishiguro, Shoji Kawamori, Kazunori Hashimoto', 'Sukehiro Tomita', 'Mari Iijima, Arihiro Hase, Mika Doi, Akira Kamiya, Michio Hazama, Osamu Ichikawa, Eiji Kanie, Ryusuke Ohbayashi', null, 'It is A.D. 2009 and the human race is caught in a war between giant humanoids, male Zentrans and female Meltrans. Returning from the edge of our solar system after making a space fold, the SDF-1 Macross makes the long journey back to Earth with survivors of South Ataria Island.', 'It is A.D. 2009 and the human race is caught in a war between giant humanoids, male Zentrans and female Meltrans. Returning from the edge of our solar system after making a space fold, the SDF-1 Macross makes the long journey back to Earth with survivors of South Ataria Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxGCI4H0ANXD8YoXnt3ZmjTjNIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14132'),
  ('353373409798084641', 'Macumba Sexual', 1983, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Jesús Franco, Juan Soler', 'Jesús Franco', 'Ajita Wilson, Lina Romay, Antonio Mayans, Lorna Green, José Ferro, Jesús Franco', null, 'Princess Obongo, the Goddess of Unspeakable Lust, uses dark powers to ensnare a hapless couple of yuppies, so that she can imbue them with evil and conquer the world.', 'Princess Obongo, the Goddess of Unspeakable Lust, uses dark powers to ensnare a hapless couple of yuppies, so that she can imbue them with evil and conquer the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VJqIya7qS6dQUs7QTNcVcsGhN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81486'),
  ('595566308717221151', 'Macunaima', 1969, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Carlos Alberto Prates Correia', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Grande Otelo, Paulo José, Jardel Filho, Milton Gonçalves, Dina Sfat, Rodolfo Arena, Joana Fomm, Maria do Rosário', null, 'Born a fully grown black man in a village in the Brazilian jungle, Macunaíma later magically transforms into a white man before making an adventure-filled trip to the city of São Paulo. Once there, he becomes something of a dandy, falling in love with Ci, a revolutionary who dies in an accidental bombing. After robbing a ruthless industrialist, Macunaima returns to his village where he finds his newly acquired knowledge and possessions of little use.', 'Born a fully grown black man in a village in the Brazilian jungle, Macunaíma later magically transforms into a white man before making an adventure-filled trip to the city of São Paulo. Once there, he becomes something of a dandy, falling in love with Ci, a revolutionary who dies in an accidental bombing. After robbing a ruthless industrialist, Macunaima returns to his village where he finds his newly acquired knowledge and possessions of little use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oWUjptjy3Z9FlrghGeHe3rAvQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68173'),
