  ('133434209894425724', 'Mad about Her', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'André Carvalheira, Marcus Ligocki Júnior', 'Angélica Lopes, Marcus Ligocki Júnior, Kirsten Carthew', 'Mariana Ximenes, Bruno Garcia, Sérgio Guizé, Guida Vianna, Miá Mello, Luis Carlos Miele, Augusto Madeira, Cláudio Mendes', null, 'A woman leaves her career in dancing to dedicate her life to her husband, a famous politician. Fifteen years after, she leaves her luxurious life to resume what she left behind years ago.', 'A woman leaves her career in dancing to dedicate her life to her husband, a famous politician. Fifteen years after, she leaves her luxurious life to resume what she left behind years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr3vWfsiNo5BBW0Tv33cetMTq50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381725'),
