  ('114197148798526797', 'Mad About Men', 1954, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward, James H. Ware', 'Peter Blackmore', 'Glynis Johns, Donald Sinden, Anne Crawford, Margaret Rutherford, Dora Bryan, Nicholas Phipps, Peter Martyn, Noel Purcell', null, 'Flirtatious mermaid Miranda swaps places with a schoolteacher who has gone on holiday. All is well until she falls in love with a human.', 'Flirtatious mermaid Miranda swaps places with a schoolteacher who has gone on holiday. All is well until she falls in love with a human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHFg7bP4N2kihqvB2fkv8nOEW6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112049'),
  ('1141145446490882234', 'Mad as a Mars Hare', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Marvin the Martian is monitoring through his telescope a rocket launch on Earth. The rocket heads straight for him and lands on Mars. The only occupant is Bugs Bunny, lured into Cape Canaveral by a carrot and sent to Mars as an expendable "astro-rabbit". Bugs is to claim Mars in the name of the Earth, but Marvin won''t allow an Earth creature to contaminate his atmosphere. He trains a time-projector gun on Bugs and reverts the bunny to a Neanderthal Rabbit, who crushes Marvin with one hand.', 'Marvin the Martian is monitoring through his telescope a rocket launch on Earth. The rocket heads straight for him and lands on Mars. The only occupant is Bugs Bunny, lured into Cape Canaveral by a carrot and sent to Mars as an expendable "astro-rabbit". Bugs is to claim Mars in the name of the Earth, but Marvin won''t allow an Earth creature to contaminate his atmosphere. He trains a time-projector gun on Bugs and reverts the bunny to a Neanderthal Rabbit, who crushes Marvin with one hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOKCttrBPas1RAUS7ihY86Em5ho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101515'),
  ('785206172149861505', 'Mad at the Moon', 1992, 'Horror, Romance, Western', 'Rohn Schmidt, Martin Donovan', 'Martin Donovan, Richard Pelusi', 'Mary Stuart Masterson, Hart Bochner, Stephen Blake, Fionnula Flanagan, Cec Verrell, Daphne Zuniga, Melissa Moore, Reed Hollister', null, 'A young woman on the frontier marries a meek farmer who has an annoying habit of going through a rather drastic change every full moon.', 'A young woman on the frontier marries a meek farmer who has an annoying habit of going through a rather drastic change every full moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDwgbHw48sst8Ix5BOfXXjvIlWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151062'),
  ('578366931571825057', 'MAD CATS', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Reiki Tsuno, Shintaro Teramoto', 'Reiki Tsuno', 'Sho Mineo, Yuya Matsuura, Ayane, Michael Aaron Stone, So Yamanaka, Hikari Aiko, Nozomi Hanayagi', null, 'Taka, a shiftless young man, sets off on a quest to find his brother Mune. Teaming up with a quirky new friend and an edgy, mysterious young girl along the way, Taka finds himself taking on a pack of vicious monster cats determined to execute unscrupulous pet shop owners.', 'Taka, a shiftless young man, sets off on a quest to find his brother Mune. Teaming up with a quirky new friend and an edgy, mysterious young girl along the way, Taka finds himself taking on a pack of vicious monster cats determined to execute unscrupulous pet shop owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oS4BfZX3vHgW3K6HJ9sK07J5eBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1065277'),
  ('1097058037007244263', 'Mad City', 1997, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Costa-Gavras, Patrick Blossier, Dennis Maguire', 'Tom Matthews', 'John Travolta, Dustin Hoffman, Mia Kirshner, Alan Alda, Robert Prosky, Blythe Danner, William Atherton, Ted Levine', 'PG-13', 'A misguided museum guard who loses his job and then tries to get it back at gunpoint is thrown into the fierce world of ratings-driven TV gone mad.', 'A misguided museum guard who loses his job and then tries to get it back at gunpoint is thrown into the fierce world of ratings-driven TV gone mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXb9KGqxyrAHNygRRI1HW1BhcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9770'),
  ('357241953170542401', 'Mad Cows', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Sara Sugarman, Pierre Aïm', 'Sara Sugarman, Sasha Hails', 'Anna Friel, Joanna Lumley, Anna Massey, Phyllida Law, Greg Wise, Elizabeth Berrington, Omid Djalili, John Standing', null, 'When her TV star husband Alex decides to divorce her so that he can start a career in politics, newly single mother Maddy goes shoplifting and ends up in jail. Losing custody of her infant child, Maddy hatches a scheme to break out of prison with the assistance of her friend Gillian, who''s avoiding the law herself for credit card fraud. Now Maddy has to find the couple who have adopted her son and avoid falling in love with selfish Alex all over again.', 'When her TV star husband Alex decides to divorce her so that he can start a career in politics, newly single mother Maddy goes shoplifting and ends up in jail. Losing custody of her infant child, Maddy hatches a scheme to break out of prison with the assistance of her friend Gillian, who''s avoiding the law herself for credit card fraud. Now Maddy has to find the couple who have adopted her son and avoid falling in love with selfish Alex all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aISSeQty0ijSRC5DvwZ3sOgNIxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38833'),
  ('472335861503948266', 'Mad Detective', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Au Kin-Yee, Wai Ka-Fai', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Andy On Chi-Kit, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Karen Lee Choi-Ling, Joseph Lee Kwok-Lun, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Lam Suet', null, 'Bun, a schizophrenic, former police inspector comes out of retirement to help a rookie detective solve a complex murder case involving a missing colleague and a suspected policeman suffering from a multiple personality disorder.', 'Bun, a schizophrenic, former police inspector comes out of retirement to help a rookie detective solve a complex murder case involving a missing colleague and a suspected policeman suffering from a multiple personality disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hS1Q06GRHTPyHIIWgeT8VF1xF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14016'),
  ('689963011465620383', 'Mad Doctor of Blood Island', 1969, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Eddie Romero, Gerardo de Leon, Justo Paulino', 'Reuben Canoy', 'John Ashley, Angelique Pettyjohn, Ronald Remy, Ronaldo Valdez, Alicia Alonzo, Tita Muñoz, Tony Edmunds, Alfonso Carvajal', 'NR', 'A man who loves to travel, travels to an island where a mad doctor is creating zombies.', 'A man who loves to travel, travels to an island where a mad doctor is creating zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ihk3cUdumUlpsKNJGiRFu2HHGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81477'),
  ('430921829043278172', 'Mad Dog', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Vincenzo Alfieri, Davide Manca', 'Giorgio Glaviano, Vincenzo Alfieri, Fabrizio Bettelli', 'Edoardo Pesce, Massimo Popolizio, Chiara Bassermann, Roberta Caronia, Luka Zunic, Nicola Rignanese, Marcello Prayer, Alessandro Federico', null, 'Two young people go missing after a rave party in the woods. Meda and Rio, a man defeated by life and an uncompromising captain, are the two cops leading the investigation. It’s an old nightmare coming back to haunt the people from the small village near the forest but, this time, the monster has chosen the wrong person.', 'Two young people go missing after a rave party in the woods. Meda and Rio, a man defeated by life and an uncompromising captain, are the two cops leading the investigation. It’s an old nightmare coming back to haunt the people from the small village near the forest but, this time, the monster has chosen the wrong person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n8tfMbFi7owmbwmXkDAY1CqVTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807024'),
  ('477577033005514847', 'Mad Dog and Glory', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance, Drama', 'John McNaughton, Robby Müller', 'Richard Price', 'Robert De Niro, Uma Thurman, Bill Murray, David Caruso, Mike Starr, Tom Towles, Kathy Baker, Derek Anunciation', 'R', 'Wayne Dobie is a shy cop whose low-key demeanor has earned him the affectionate nickname "Mad Dog." After Mad Dog saves the life of Frank Milo, a crime boss and aspiring stand-up comedian, he''s offered the company of an attractive young waitress named Glory for a week. At first both are uneasy about the arrangement, but they eventually fall in love. However, the situation becomes complicated when Milo demands Glory back.', 'Wayne Dobie is a shy cop whose low-key demeanor has earned him the affectionate nickname "Mad Dog." After Mad Dog saves the life of Frank Milo, a crime boss and aspiring stand-up comedian, he''s offered the company of an attractive young waitress named Glory for a week. At first both are uneasy about the arrangement, but they eventually fall in love. However, the situation becomes complicated when Milo demands Glory back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmgmTe9uQ5mtudN6e4IVEGvSqg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10433'),
  ('861953268184004407', 'Mad Dog Coll', 1961, 'Crime, Drama', 'Burt Balaban, Gayne Rescher', 'Leo Lieberman, Edward Schreiber', 'John Davis Chandler, Kay Doubleday, Brooke Hayward, Neil Burstyn, Jerry Orbach, Vincent Gardenia, Telly Savalas, Glenn Cannon', null, 'Killer Vincent "Mad Dog" Coll moves in on gangster Dutch Schultz in 1920s New York.', 'Killer Vincent "Mad Dog" Coll moves in on gangster Dutch Schultz in 1920s New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQjMkGtoekvsgQNWGiisDF3VY5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3556'),
  ('28090866072554660', 'Mad Dog Killer', 1977, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Enzo Milioni, Sergio Grieco, Vittorio Bernini', null, 'Helmut Berger, Marisa Mell, Richard Harrison, Marina Giordana, Luigi Bonos, Vittorio Duse, Claudio Gora, Alberto Squillante', null, 'Sadistic no-count killer Nanni Vitali and three other equally brutish hoodlums escape from prison. The foul foursome embark on a savage rape, murder, and robbery spree. Vitali even abducts and defiles frightened hapless lass Giuliana Caroli. Meanwhile, rugged police inspector Giulio Santini is determined to bag the despicable Vitali.', 'Sadistic no-count killer Nanni Vitali and three other equally brutish hoodlums escape from prison. The foul foursome embark on a savage rape, murder, and robbery spree. Vitali even abducts and defiles frightened hapless lass Giuliana Caroli. Meanwhile, rugged police inspector Giulio Santini is determined to bag the despicable Vitali.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6a6EXqoeSpynTNjfue8BQZN0Qj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3541'),
  ('1008945181048888517', 'Mad Dog Morgan', 1976, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Western', 'Philippe Mora, Mike Molloy', 'Philippe Mora', 'Dennis Hopper, Jack Thompson, David Gulpilil, Bill Hunter, Frank Thring, Michael Pate, Wallas Eaton, John Hargreaves', 'R', 'The true story of Irish outlaw Daniel Morgan, who is wanted, dead or alive, in Australia during the 1850s.', 'The true story of Irish outlaw Daniel Morgan, who is wanted, dead or alive, in Australia during the 1850s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9Lh2B0WfGVdAD55MYUlHGdlnDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60269'),
  ('627450413156475332', 'Mad Dog Time', 1996, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Larry Bishop, Frank Byers', 'Larry Bishop', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Ellen Barkin, Jeff Goldblum, Gabriel Byrne, Diane Lane, Burt Reynolds, Larry Bishop, Joey Bishop', 'R', 'With his boss in the madhouse, a mobster is temporary boss of the criminal empire just as vicious rivals threaten the control of the empire.', 'With his boss in the madhouse, a mobster is temporary boss of the criminal empire just as vicious rivals threaten the control of the empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5WQce58yyNCdKFLFWmxfmL6gtA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66034'),
  ('847044877369892202', 'Mad Enough to Kill', 1975, 'Thriller', 'Yves Boisset, Jean Boffety', 'Yves Boisset', 'Marlène Jobert, Tomas Milian, Thomas Waintrop, Michel Peyrelon, Michael Lonsdale, Victor Lanoux, Antoine Saint-John, Jean Bouise', null, 'Julie Ballenger has spent five years in a psychiatric clinic. Leaving the clinic apparently cured, she is hired by a wealthy industrialist, Mostri, to work as a governess to his young nephew, Thomas. The boy is heir to a huge fortune after the recent death of his wealthy parents who died in mysterious circumstances. During a visit to a park, Julie and Thomas are kidnapped at gun-point and driven away to deserted quarry. The two hostages manage to escape, but are closely pursued by an armed killer...', 'Julie Ballenger has spent five years in a psychiatric clinic. Leaving the clinic apparently cured, she is hired by a wealthy industrialist, Mostri, to work as a governess to his young nephew, Thomas. The boy is heir to a huge fortune after the recent death of his wealthy parents who died in mysterious circumstances. During a visit to a park, Julie and Thomas are kidnapped at gun-point and driven away to deserted quarry. The two hostages manage to escape, but are closely pursued by an armed killer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDATUAwSGBiIaS2t64p2RmBGrgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134171'),
