  ('901209178684672010', 'Mad Fate', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Cheang Pou-Soi, Cheng Siu-Keung, Wylie Chan Wai-Yi', 'Angus Chan Siu-Hei', 'Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Yeung Lok-Man, Berg Ng Ting-Yip, Ng Wing-Sze, Peter Chan Charm-Man, Bonnie Wong Man-Wai, Koo Tin-Lung, Birdy Wong', null, 'A fortune teller fails to help a prostitute who is facing a deadly calamity. When he meets a young boss of a tea restaurant, he predicts that his bloodthirsty tendencies will lead him to a prison sentence for murder.', 'A fortune teller fails to help a prostitute who is facing a deadly calamity. When he meets a young boss of a tea restaurant, he predicts that his bloodthirsty tendencies will lead him to a prison sentence for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5cAg97yLaqDwzLhOQ6S2TfsmyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:969050'),
  ('1019681219132738112', 'Mad Foxes', 1981, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Paul Grau, Hans-Toni Aschwanden', 'Paul Grau, Hans R. Walthard, Jaime Jesús Balcázar', 'José Gras, Laura Premika, Andrea Albani, Eric Falk, Helmi Sigg, Peter John Saunders, Brian Billings, Paul Grau', null, 'A man seeks revenge after a biker gang murders his loved ones.', 'A man seeks revenge after a biker gang murders his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hrzPQoXFiFzA9aDdU0VXBeymfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81463'),
  ('712074012131311932', 'Mad God', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Phil Tippett, Chris Morley', 'Phil Tippett', 'Alex Cox, Niketa Roman, Satish Ratakonda, Arne Hain, Jake Freytag, David Lauer, Hans Brekke, Tom Gibbons', 'NR', 'A figure known as "The Assassin" descends from the heavens into a nightmarish pit full of monsters, titans, and cruelty.', 'A figure known as "The Assassin" descends from the heavens into a nightmarish pit full of monsters, titans, and cruelty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/105stT9GkiENXiYqvWYKoAuHKQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846867'),
  ('817644059346095495', 'Mad Heidi', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Stephan Schoenholtz, Thomas Hacikoglu, Thomas Kaufmann', 'Johannes Hartmann, Sandro Klopfstein, Gregory D. Widmer', 'Alice Lucy, David Schofield, Kel Matsena, Max Rüdlinger, Casper Van Dien, Almar G. Sato, Pascal Ulli, Katja Kolm', null, 'In a dystopian Switzerland that has fallen under the fascist rule of an evil cheese tyrant, Swiss mountain girl Heidi transforms herself into a kick-ass female fighting force who sets out to liberate the country from a cheese-fueled machinery of hate.', 'In a dystopian Switzerland that has fallen under the fascist rule of an evil cheese tyrant, Swiss mountain girl Heidi transforms herself into a kick-ass female fighting force who sets out to liberate the country from a cheese-fueled machinery of hate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVooOemwuIuOYsBKgHolI9zC81X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566805'),
  ('307646730842640500', 'Mad Hot Ballroom', 2005, 'Documentary, Family', 'Marilyn Agrelo, Claudia Raschke', 'Amy Sewell', 'Heather Berman, Emma Therese Biegacki, Eva Carrozza, Evangelina Carrozzo, Paul Daggett, Graciela Daniele, Pierre Dulaine, Leslie Freu', 'PG', 'Eleven-year-old New York City public school kids journey into the world of ballroom dancing and reveal pieces of themselves and their world along the way. Told from their candid, sometimes humorous perspectives, these kids are transformed, from reluctant participants to determined competitors, from typical urban kids to "ladies and gentlemen," on their way to try to compete in the final citywide competition.', 'Eleven-year-old New York City public school kids journey into the world of ballroom dancing and reveal pieces of themselves and their world along the way. Told from their candid, sometimes humorous perspectives, these kids are transformed, from reluctant participants to determined competitors, from typical urban kids to "ladies and gentlemen," on their way to try to compete in the final citywide competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wDU19PTEdR30QdnLFw93scXto7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14358'),
  ('185248641869857894', 'Mad Love', 1935, 'Horror, Romance', 'Karl Freund, Gregg Toland, Chester A. Lyons', 'P.J. Wolfson, John L. Balderston', 'Peter Lorre, Frances Drake, Colin Clive, Ted Healy, Isabel Jewell, Sara Haden, Edward Brophy, Henry Kolker', null, 'An insane surgeon''s obsession with an actress leads him to replace her wounded pianist husband''s hands with those of a knife-throwing murderer.', 'An insane surgeon''s obsession with an actress leads him to replace her wounded pianist husband''s hands with those of a knife-throwing murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDD8pKd6jSrFLV3RvE0eDGGGxR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28261'),
  ('342892110679901958', 'Mad Love', 1985, 'Drama, Crime, Romance, Comedy', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Jean-François Robin, Emmanuel Gust', 'Etienne Roda-Gil, Andrzej Żuławski', 'Sophie Marceau, Tchéky Karyo, Francis Huster, Christiane Jean, Jean-Marc Bory, Michel Albertini, Saïd Amadis, Roland Dubillard', null, 'After a successful bank robbery, Micky hopes to take back his girlfriend Marie who has been taken from him. On the way to Paris he meets Leon, a neurotic dreamer whom he considers an idiot. Leon can hardly understand what Micky is up to but he follows him everywhere and soon falls in love with Marie.', 'After a successful bank robbery, Micky hopes to take back his girlfriend Marie who has been taken from him. On the way to Paris he meets Leon, a neurotic dreamer whom he considers an idiot. Leon can hardly understand what Micky is up to but he follows him everywhere and soon falls in love with Marie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fW0bg6cUuxjLd8TIefjJUwVxUNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98927'),
  ('1116427988071153472', 'Mad Love', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Antonia Bird, Fred Tammes, Vebe Borge', 'Paula Milne', 'Chris O''Donnell, Drew Barrymore, Matthew Lillard, Richard Chaim, Robert Nadir, Joan Allen, Jude Ciccolella, Amy Sakasitz', 'PG-13', 'Matt falls for Casey, the new girl in school. She''s fun-loving and eccentric, but there''s a darkness to her whimsy that Matt can''t begin to comprehend. When Casey attempts to commit suicide, her parents place her in a mental institution. Matt springs her out, and together the young lovers head on a road trip. They believe their love can "cure" Casey''s problems. Matt starts to wonder, though, if are they inspired or misguided.', 'Matt falls for Casey, the new girl in school. She''s fun-loving and eccentric, but there''s a darkness to her whimsy that Matt can''t begin to comprehend. When Casey attempts to commit suicide, her parents place her in a mental institution. Matt springs her out, and together the young lovers head on a road trip. They believe their love can "cure" Casey''s problems. Matt starts to wonder, though, if are they inspired or misguided.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glhctWoYw1jg8z0FUSwFD4UTNi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47608'),
  ('847197044258938474', 'Mad Love', 2001, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Vicente Aranda, Paco Femenía', 'Manuel Tamayo y Baus', 'Pilar López de Ayala, Daniele Liotti, Rosana Pastor, Giuliano Gemma, Roberto Álvarez, Manuela Arcuri, Susi Sánchez, Chema de Miguel', null, 'The tragic fate of Juana I of Castille, Queen of Spain, madly in love to an unfaithful husband, Felipe el Hermoso, Archduke of Austria.', 'The tragic fate of Juana I of Castille, Queen of Spain, madly in love to an unfaithful husband, Felipe el Hermoso, Archduke of Austria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgPW2uIIzkIKEIvrU7WKprJgVsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26165'),
  ('1013158660027325929', 'Mad Love', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Philippe Ramos', 'Philippe Ramos', 'Melvil Poupaud, Dominique Blanc, Diane Rouxel, Lise Lamétrie, Jean-François Stévenin, Jacques Bonnaffé, Jean-Paul Bodet, Virginie Petit', null, '1959. Guilty of a double-murder, a man is beheaded. At the bottom of the basket that just welcomed it, the head of the dead man tells his story: everything was going so well! Admired priest, great lover - his earthly paradise seemed to have no end. Inspired by a scandal surrounding the Priest of Uruffe in the 1950s.', '1959. Guilty of a double-murder, a man is beheaded. At the bottom of the basket that just welcomed it, the head of the dead man tells his story: everything was going so well! Admired priest, great lover - his earthly paradise seemed to have no end. Inspired by a scandal surrounding the Priest of Uruffe in the 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hm32Cz2lyZeUKCmj24s5iVFXIbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353301'),
  ('48249991682985527', 'Mad Max', 1979, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'George Miller, David Eggby, Ian Goddard', 'George Miller, James McCausland', 'Mel Gibson, Joanne Samuel, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Steve Bisley, Tim Burns, Roger Ward, Vincent Gil, Lulu Pinkus', 'R', 'In the ravaged near-future, a savage motorcycle gang rules the road. Terrorizing innocent civilians while tearing up the streets, the ruthless gang laughs in the face of a police force hell-bent on stopping them.', 'In the ravaged near-future, a savage motorcycle gang rules the road. Terrorizing innocent civilians while tearing up the streets, the ruthless gang laughs in the face of a police force hell-bent on stopping them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LrI4GiCSrChgkdskVZiwv643Kg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9659'),
  ('893916903318659619', 'Mad Max 2', 1981, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'George Miller, Dean Semler, Mark Thomas', 'Terry Hayes, George Miller, Brian Hannant', 'Mel Gibson, Bruce Spence, Michael Preston, Max Phipps, Vernon Wells, Kjell Nilsson, Emil Minty, Virginia Hey', 'R', 'Max Rockatansky returns as the heroic loner who drives the dusty roads of a postapocalyptic Australian Outback in an unending search for gasoline. Arrayed against him and the other scraggly defendants of a fuel-depot encampment are the bizarre warriors commanded by the charismatic Lord Humungus, a violent leader whose scruples are as barren as the surrounding landscape.', 'Max Rockatansky returns as the heroic loner who drives the dusty roads of a postapocalyptic Australian Outback in an unending search for gasoline. Arrayed against him and the other scraggly defendants of a fuel-depot encampment are the bizarre warriors commanded by the charismatic Lord Humungus, a violent leader whose scruples are as barren as the surrounding landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1KVEhkGDpWRzQ0VqIhZqDDuOim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8810'),
  ('528484062003400638', 'Mad Max Beyond Thunderdome', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Dean Semler, George Miller, George Ogilvie', 'Terry Hayes, George Miller', 'Mel Gibson, Tina Turner, Helen Buday, Bruce Spence, Angelo Rossitto, Adam Cockburn, Frank Thring, Paul Larsson', 'PG-13', 'Mad Max becomes a pawn in a decadent oasis of a technological society, and when exiled, becomes the deliverer of a colony of children.', 'Mad Max becomes a pawn in a decadent oasis of a technological society, and when exiled, becomes the deliverer of a colony of children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJlxcEVVUHnrUeEkQ0077VeHQpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9355'),
  ('797012415151987501', 'Mad Max: Fury Road', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'George Miller, Wendy Croad, Lee-Roy Titus', 'George Miller, Nico Lathouris, Brendan McCarthy', 'Tom Hardy, Charlize Theron, Nicholas Hoult, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Josh Helman, Nathan Jones, Zoë Kravitz, Rosie Huntington-Whiteley', 'R', 'An apocalyptic story set in the furthest reaches of our planet, in a stark desert landscape where humanity is broken, and most everyone is crazed fighting for the necessities of life. Within this world exist two rebels on the run who just might be able to restore order.', 'An apocalyptic story set in the furthest reaches of our planet, in a stark desert landscape where humanity is broken, and most everyone is crazed fighting for the necessities of life. Within this world exist two rebels on the run who just might be able to restore order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hA2ple9q4qnwxp3hKVNhroipsir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76341'),
  ('384455974598170886', 'Mad Mom', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Virginie Saint-Martin, Frédéric Quiring', 'Frédéric Quiring', 'Audrey Lamy, Florent Peyre, Charlie Langendries, Max Boublil, Michèle Moretti, JoeyStarr, Igor van Dessel, Damien Marchal', null, 'Everything goes for the best in Fanny''s life without stories ... until she discovers that her beloved son, Arthur, nine, is the scapegoat of three boys at his school. Fanny will not leave her son alone in front of these little executioners: she will give these dirty kids the change of their room. Thunderstorms and playground traps, now it will be "an eye for an eye and a tooth for a tooth!"', 'Everything goes for the best in Fanny''s life without stories ... until she discovers that her beloved son, Arthur, nine, is the scapegoat of three boys at his school. Fanny will not leave her son alone in front of these little executioners: she will give these dirty kids the change of their room. Thunderstorms and playground traps, now it will be "an eye for an eye and a tooth for a tooth!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5s4xhgZm2teeMDrq6LusNFCfGIJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510465'),
  ('1015183323824214012', 'Mad Mom', 2019, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Daniel Villeneuve, Jean-François Rivard, Brigitte Goulet', 'James Taylor Phillips', 'Romy Rosemont, Kari Matchett, Victoria Diamond, Matthew Raudsepp, Salvatore Antonio, Adam Reid, Jenny Brizard, Jay Chevery', null, 'Amber Vickers is ecstatic that she will finally be making the walk down the aisle with her prince charming Luke. After multiple failed relationships, she was beginning to think that something was wrong; but her soon-to-be mother-in-law and best friend, Jill, believes that Amber is the picture-perfect daughter she never had. Everything is coming up roses until Sharon Vickers, Amber''s mother, arrives for a visit. Gaudy, straight-laced and opinionated, Sharon is the complete opposite of Jill. What was supposed to be a benign first meeting of the in-law''s quickly turns into a competition, as Sharon and Jill have widely differing views on life, love and marriage. As the weekend visit is coming to an end, Sharon takes matters into her own hands, rendering Jill incapable of escaping her house, and proving to her once and for all that no one comes between Sharon and her daughter.', 'Amber Vickers is ecstatic that she will finally be making the walk down the aisle with her prince charming Luke. After multiple failed relationships, she was beginning to think that something was wrong; but her soon-to-be mother-in-law and best friend, Jill, believes that Amber is the picture-perfect daughter she never had. Everything is coming up roses until Sharon Vickers, Amber''s mother, arrives for a visit. Gaudy, straight-laced and opinionated, Sharon is the complete opposite of Jill. What was supposed to be a benign first meeting of the in-law''s quickly turns into a competition, as Sharon and Jill have widely differing views on life, love and marriage. As the weekend visit is coming to an end, Sharon takes matters into her own hands, rendering Jill incapable of escaping her house, and proving to her once and for all that no one comes between Sharon and her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zP0lSE2IUZFQ53e2olCaVGklzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584643'),
  ('28535519271106848', 'Mad Money', 2008, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Callie Khouri, John Bailey, Scott August', 'John Mister, Neil McKay, Terry Winsor', 'Diane Keaton, Queen Latifah, Katie Holmes, Ted Danson, Adam Rothenberg, Roger Cross, Stephen Root, J.C. MacKenzie', 'PG-13', 'Three female employees of the Federal Reserve plot to steal money that is about to be destroyed.', 'Three female employees of the Federal Reserve plot to steal money that is about to be destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6b6rQ1ZFEkM4tSt84yPtdAioCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12085'),
  ('1122688671084920308', 'Mad Monkey Kung Fu', 1979, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Huang Pa-Ching, Lee Tai-Hang', 'Ni Kuang', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Hsiao Ho, Lo Lieh, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Lam Fai-Wong, Lam Hak-Ming, San Sin, Wong Ching-Ho', 'R', 'A disgraced former Kung Fu expert makes a living as a merchant with the help of a hot headed friend. When the men are harassed by gangsters, the merchant decided to teach his friend monkey boxing so they can defend their business.', 'A disgraced former Kung Fu expert makes a living as a merchant with the help of a hot headed friend. When the men are harassed by gangsters, the merchant decided to teach his friend monkey boxing so they can defend their business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rKpD7PRrArgcEgPj1kXHCROrbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46736'),
  ('1075948569848744369', 'Mad Monster Party?', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Jules Bass, Kizo Nagashima', 'Harvey Kurtzman, Len Korobkin, Forrest J. Ackerman', 'Boris Karloff, Allen Swift, Gale Garnett, Phyllis Diller, Ethel Ennis', 'NR', 'When Dr Frankenstein decides to retire from the monster-making business, he calls an international roster of monsters to a creepy convention to elect his successor. Everyone is there including Dracula, The Werewolf, The Creature, Dr Jekyll & Mr Hyde and many more. But Frankenstein''s title is not all that is at stake. The famous doctor has also discovered the secret of total destruction that must not fall into the wrong hands!', 'When Dr Frankenstein decides to retire from the monster-making business, he calls an international roster of monsters to a creepy convention to elect his successor. Everyone is there including Dracula, The Werewolf, The Creature, Dr Jekyll & Mr Hyde and many more. But Frankenstein''s title is not all that is at stake. The famous doctor has also discovered the secret of total destruction that must not fall into the wrong hands!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DsTP8PSrOPxlO1926sFZF6VPd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17278'),
  ('1051179050637027959', 'Mad World', 2016, 'Drama', 'Wong Chun, Zhang Ying, Lau Sai-Wing', 'Florence Chan, Wong Chun', 'Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Charmaine Fong, Ivan Chan, Ng Siu-Hin, Bryant Mak, Shui Jie', null, 'An absentee father and his bipolar son are forced to live together as they struggle with a recent family tragedy. The tension and anxiety boil as they live and try to cope in a tiny apartment. As time passes, they realize their shared pain is not their only source of grief, as they find the outside world is a cruel and unjust place.', 'An absentee father and his bipolar son are forced to live together as they struggle with a recent family tragedy. The tension and anxiety boil as they live and try to cope in a tiny apartment. As time passes, they realize their shared pain is not their only source of grief, as they find the outside world is a cruel and unjust place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ethXmiGJ13aoWk4a4JkvmmGD78C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413838'),
  ('1002717691237645813', 'Madaari', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Nishikant Kamat, Bhav Dhulia, Himanshu Joshi', 'Ritesh Shah', 'Irrfan Khan, Jimmy Shergill, Tushar Dalvi, Vishesh Bansal, Kedar Bagaria, Sadhil Kapoor, Nitesh Pandey, Akash Dabas', null, 'A common man kidnaps the son of the Home Minister of India to get answers about the loss of his own son, caused by the illegal acts committed by corrupt government officials.', 'A common man kidnaps the son of the Home Minister of India to get answers about the loss of his own son, caused by the illegal acts committed by corrupt government officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrZhF166gPDzdArYMSh3mPvFjYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397365'),
  ('214097381484823783', 'Madadayo', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Akira Kurosawa, Takao Saitō, Shoji Ueda', 'Ishirō Honda, Akira Kurosawa', 'Tatsuo Matsumura, Kyōko Kagawa, Hisashi Igawa, George Tokoro, Masayuki Yui, Akira Terao, Takeshi Kusaka, Asei Kobayashi', null, 'In postwar Tokyo, beloved writer-professor Hyakken Uchida retires and is buoyed through hardship by the fierce devotion of his former students, who honor him each year with a raucous “Not yet!” birthday toast. Told in warm, gently comic vignettes, Kurosawa’s farewell celebrates aging, friendship, and the sustaining ritual of teacher and pupils refusing to say goodbye.', 'In postwar Tokyo, beloved writer-professor Hyakken Uchida retires and is buoyed through hardship by the fierce devotion of his former students, who honor him each year with a raucous “Not yet!” birthday toast. Told in warm, gently comic vignettes, Kurosawa’s farewell celebrates aging, friendship, and the sustaining ritual of teacher and pupils refusing to say goodbye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6uufygMy6kUwuNgIjtmSIomqzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13889'),
  ('268141851722548370', 'Madagascar', 2005, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Eric Darnell, Tom McGrath, Corban Gossett', 'Billy Frolick, Mark Burton, Tom McGrath', 'Ben Stiller, Chris Rock, David Schwimmer, Jada Pinkett Smith, Sacha Baron Cohen, Cedric the Entertainer, Andy Richter, Tom McGrath', 'PG', 'Four animal friends get a taste of the wild life when they break out of captivity at the Central Park Zoo and wash ashore on the island of Madagascar.', 'Four animal friends get a taste of the wild life when they break out of captivity at the Central Park Zoo and wash ashore on the island of Madagascar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMpJY5CJKUufG9OTw0In4eAFqPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953'),
  ('999631604022178259', 'Madagascar 3: Europe''s Most Wanted', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Eric Darnell, Conrad Vernon, Tom McGrath', 'Eric Darnell, Noah Baumbach', 'Ben Stiller, Chris Rock, David Schwimmer, Jada Pinkett Smith, Frances McDormand, Sacha Baron Cohen, Andy Richter, Cedric the Entertainer', 'PG', 'Animal pals Alex, Marty, Melman, and Gloria are still trying to make it back to New York''s Central Park Zoo. They are forced to take a detour to Europe to find the penguins and chimps who broke the bank at a Monte Carlo casino. When French animal-control officer Capitaine Chantel DuBois picks up their scent, Alex and company are forced to hide out in a traveling circus.', 'Animal pals Alex, Marty, Melman, and Gloria are still trying to make it back to New York''s Central Park Zoo. They are forced to take a detour to Europe to find the penguins and chimps who broke the bank at a Monte Carlo casino. When French animal-control officer Capitaine Chantel DuBois picks up their scent, Alex and company are forced to hide out in a traveling circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekraj4ksvIKeuvQVEevEJkuybZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80321'),
  ('870383180132758870', 'Madagascar, a Journey Diary', 2010, 'Animation', 'Bastien Dubois', 'Bastien Dubois', null, null, 'Filmed like the travel journey of a Western traveler in search of Madagascar''s customs. The pages turn, the drawings come to life, and the luxuriant landscapes of Madagascar appear one after another.', 'Filmed like the travel journey of a Western traveler in search of Madagascar''s customs. The pages turn, the drawings come to life, and the luxuriant landscapes of Madagascar appear one after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXGkHvYAb7ZJjHRJlk0x8EBvggh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150298'),
  ('749255936629315052', 'Madagascar: A Little Wild - Holiday Goose Chase', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chad Van De Keere', 'Laura Zak', 'Shaylin Becton, Tucker Chandler, Jasmine Gatewood, Luke Lowe, Amir O''Neil, Eric Petersen, Mark Whitten', 'G', 'Melman the Giraffe meets Hank, a goose who has been separated from his family and along with his friends, they embark on a wild goose chase around the city to reunite Hank with his merry flock.', 'Melman the Giraffe meets Hank, a goose who has been separated from his family and along with his friends, they embark on a wild goose chase around the city to reunite Hank with his merry flock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6TUQegjmCafQMswFW0SgCM3JeK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:904039'),
  ('216944216632776807', 'Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Eric Darnell, Tom McGrath, Asha Kiran Mateti', 'Eric Darnell, Tom McGrath, Etan Cohen', 'Ben Stiller, Chris Rock, David Schwimmer, Jada Pinkett Smith, Sacha Baron Cohen, Cedric the Entertainer, Andy Richter, Bernie Mac', 'PG', 'Alex, Marty, and other zoo animals find a way to escape from Madagascar when the penguins reassemble a wrecked airplane. The precariously repaired craft stays airborne just long enough to make it to the African continent. There the New Yorkers encounter members of their own species for the first time. Africa proves to be a wild place, but Alex and company wonder if it is better than their Central Park home.', 'Alex, Marty, and other zoo animals find a way to escape from Madagascar when the penguins reassemble a wrecked airplane. The precariously repaired craft stays airborne just long enough to make it to the African continent. There the New Yorkers encounter members of their own species for the first time. Africa proves to be a wild place, but Alex and company wonder if it is better than their Central Park home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agRbLOHgN46TQO4YdKR462iR7To.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10527'),
  ('995070446206398808', 'Madalena', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Walter Lassally, Dinos Dimopoulos, Yiorgos Stamboulopoulos', 'Giorgos Roussos', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Pantelis Zervos, Thodoros Moridis, Yorgos Damasiotis, Despo Diamantidou, Smaro Stefanidou, Kaiti Lambropoulou', null, 'Madalena is a tough seventeen-year-old who is forced to take on her father''s ferry business after he dies. She has her many brothers and sisters to support, and there is no one else to do the job. So she rallies her defenses and sets out to give her rival in the ferry business a run for his money. But at the same time, the rival''s handsome son is starting to look better and better. Madalena refuses to acknowledge her feelings for him -- though how long she can sustain that denial is the question.', 'Madalena is a tough seventeen-year-old who is forced to take on her father''s ferry business after he dies. She has her many brothers and sisters to support, and there is no one else to do the job. So she rallies her defenses and sets out to give her rival in the ferry business a run for his money. But at the same time, the rival''s handsome son is starting to look better and better. Madalena refuses to acknowledge her feelings for him -- though how long she can sustain that denial is the question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cByEaFxf0Pr8j4BXIY47Zs4epMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198890'),
  ('303412068522078800', 'Madalena', 2021, 'Drama, Horror', 'Madiano Marcheti, Tiago Rios, Guilherme Tostes', 'Helena Vieira, Tiago Coelho, Thiago Gallego', 'Natália Mazarim, Rafael de Bona, Pâmella Yulle, Chloe Milan, Maria Leite, Nadja Mitidiero, Edilton Ramos, Antonio Salvador', null, 'The body of a trans woman lies lifeless in a soy plantation and three lives react to her missing and presumed death.', 'The body of a trans woman lies lifeless in a soy plantation and three lives react to her missing and presumed death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cggzjvHqCxt3kEbEe1qISShjSnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778655'),
  ('614222135739072741', 'Madam Chief Minister', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jayesh Nair, Subhash Kapoor, Parvez Shaikh', 'Subhash Kapoor', 'Richa Chadha, Saurabh Shukla, Manav Kaul, Akshay Oberoi, Shubhrajyoti Barat, Nikhil Vijay', null, 'A political-drama where a young woman from a small village rises to power into the world of politics by breaking barriers of caste and patriarchy and overcomes the obstacles placed by her opponents to become the chief minister and work for the upliftment of backward classes.', 'A political-drama where a young woman from a small village rises to power into the world of politics by breaking barriers of caste and patriarchy and overcomes the obstacles placed by her opponents to become the chief minister and work for the upliftment of backward classes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jk8KZ4SqFR9Uz48m1KAEzc41vlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782848'),
  ('984123982075912665', 'Madam City Hunter', 1993, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Johnnie Kong, Kwan Chi-Kan', null, 'Cynthia Khan, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Tommy Wong, Woo Fung, Buffalo Tang Tai-Wo, Hau Woon-Ling', null, 'A young lady and her father are threatened by a gang named the Five Fingers. Private eye Charlie comes to the rescue.', 'A young lady and her father are threatened by a gang named the Five Fingers. Private eye Charlie comes to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDZrojeLR8Pl9sVxuUTctWRLLP5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45401'),
  ('762705292527346553', 'Madam Dilâ', 1977, 'Drama, Western', 'Orhan Aksoy', 'Safa Önal', 'Türkan Şoray, Kadir İnanır, Erol Taş, Kadir Savun, Hüseyin Peyda, Tarık Şimşek, Ahmet Üstel, Nubar Terziyan', null, 'Madam Dila is the grieving widow of a recently deceased Ağa (feudal landowner) who is hell-bent on wreaking revenge on Rıza, the man who murdered her husband. She sends her men to kill him and then ironically, saves his life because she doesn’t know it’s him.', 'Madam Dila is the grieving widow of a recently deceased Ağa (feudal landowner) who is hell-bent on wreaking revenge on Rıza, the man who murdered her husband. She sends her men to kill him and then ironically, saves his life because she doesn’t know it’s him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZQuRJGVKYLiehYJ1R8SW6n9lL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319369'),
  ('752232180417564057', 'Madam Satan', 1930, 'Romance, Music, Comedy', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Harold Rosson, Mitchell Leisen', 'Gladys Unger, Jeanie Macpherson, Elsie Janis', 'Kay Johnson, Reginald Denny, Lillian Roth, Roland Young, Elsa Peterson, Jack King, Eddie Prinz, Boyd Irwin', 'NR', 'A socialite masquerades as a notorious femme fatale to win back her straying husband during a costume party aboard a doomed dirigible.', 'A socialite masquerades as a notorious femme fatale to win back her straying husband during a costume party aboard a doomed dirigible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMRAu0p3cT1p06TCbPDsjcLgs4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83817'),
  ('482336215409337838', 'Madam Scandal: Let Me Die for 10 Seconds', 1982, 'Drama', 'Yoshihiro Kawasaki, Shōgorō Nishimura, Yoshihiro Yamazaki', 'Susumu Saji', 'Midori Satsuki, Hōsei Komatsu, Yuki Kazamatsuri, Shinsho Nakamaru, Ken Nishida, Teal Roberts', null, 'In the exotic location of Los Angeles, California a business woman enjoys all the men in her life whether it’s her older husband, a younger relative or a former fiancé.', 'In the exotic location of Los Angeles, California a business woman enjoys all the men in her life whether it’s her older husband, a younger relative or a former fiancé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jzR2UPLOwVcnfpqIl1mLw5cNpt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400510'),
  ('155061477885198063', 'Madame', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama, History, Romance', 'Christian-Jaque, Roberto Gerardi, Raymond Villette', 'Christian-Jaque, Ennio De Concini, José Luis Dibildos', 'Sophia Loren, Robert Hossein, Renaud Mary, Léa Gray, Gianrico Tedeschi, Marina Berti, Enrique Ávila, Carlo Giuffrè', null, 'Catherine Hubscher, who washes the shirts of young Napoleon and other soldiers fighting the Revolution, falls in love with Sergeant Lefebvre. Circumstances bring Lefebvre a noble title and even more -- Napoleon decides to make him the local ruler over a large territorial fiefdom. But trouble brews when Madame Sans-Gene, now elevated to the nobility along with her man -- cannot keep her frank observations under control.', 'Catherine Hubscher, who washes the shirts of young Napoleon and other soldiers fighting the Revolution, falls in love with Sergeant Lefebvre. Circumstances bring Lefebvre a noble title and even more -- Napoleon decides to make him the local ruler over a large territorial fiefdom. But trouble brews when Madame Sans-Gene, now elevated to the nobility along with her man -- cannot keep her frank observations under control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoFjFlqcXIp6wdD9q2OgH7jnGvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198570'),
  ('274608103454038194', 'Madame', 1988, 'Drama', 'Halit Refiğ, Seçkin Yasar', 'Nezihe Araz, Halit Refiğ', 'Yıldız Kenter, Eşref Kolçak, Fatoş Sezer, Cem Özer, Ani İpekkaya, Orhan Çağman, Baki Tamer, Bedia Ener', null, 'An elderly piano teacher recently diagnosed with terminal cancer lives in fear of death. But her real fear is who will take care of her cat, her only friend, after her death. As she tries to find someone to take care of her cat, the generational clash of the times and the drastically changing urban identity of Istanbul confront her with an unpleasant prospect.', 'An elderly piano teacher recently diagnosed with terminal cancer lives in fear of death. But her real fear is who will take care of her cat, her only friend, after her death. As she tries to find someone to take care of her cat, the generational clash of the times and the drastically changing urban identity of Istanbul confront her with an unpleasant prospect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tK1HRGaClADULCeHHEiMiEUb1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239296'),
  ('815405932199057595', 'Madame', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Amanda Sthers, Régis Blondeau', 'Amanda Sthers, Matthew Robbins', 'Toni Collette, Harvey Keitel, Rossy de Palma, Michael Smiley, Tom Hughes, Violaine Gillibert, Sue Cann, Ariane Séguillon', null, 'Anne and Bob, a well-to-do American couple, have just moved to a beautiful manor house in romantic Paris. To impress their sophisticated friends, they decide to host a lavish dinner party, but must disguise their maid as a noblewoman to even out the number of guests. When the maid runs off with a wealthy guest, Anne must chase her around Paris to thwart the joyous and unexpected love affair.', 'Anne and Bob, a well-to-do American couple, have just moved to a beautiful manor house in romantic Paris. To impress their sophisticated friends, they decide to host a lavish dinner party, but must disguise their maid as a noblewoman to even out the number of guests. When the maid runs off with a wealthy guest, Anne must chase her around Paris to thwart the joyous and unexpected love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTOfZevdHCrmjxj4oVUK6qKrAdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446131'),
  ('705807376073541695', 'Madame', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Marcus Winterbauer, Stéphane Riethauser, Luc Riethauser', 'Stéphane Riethauser', 'Stéphane Riethauser, Caroline Della Beffa', null, 'The intimate journey of Caroline, a flamboyant grandmother, and Stéphane, her filmmaker grandson, exploring the development and transmission of gender identity.', 'The intimate journey of Caroline, a flamboyant grandmother, and Stéphane, her filmmaker grandson, exploring the development and transmission of gender identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reIw8Uw6ozXeNHFMhimyH6NJc5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594152'),
  ('790516809505419784', 'Madame and Her Niece', 1969, 'Drama', 'Eberhard Schröder, Klaus Werner', 'Werner P. Zibaso', 'Ruth-Maria Kubitschek, Edwige Fenech, Fred Williams, Rainer Penkert, Karl Walter Diess, Ini Assmann, Valerie Antelmann, Robert Naegele', null, 'Michelle De Winter lives the good life, wining and dining with only the richest men who are fortunate to cross her path. Her daughter Yvette, whom Michelle insists on introducing as her ''niece'', is a fashion model. She is saving herself for the right man, despite the fact that she is part of the free love generation and lives with a group of promiscuous creative types. While Michelle is searching for a new millionaire playboy, Yvette falls for the handsome Peter Von Hallstein. She asks the fatherly Dr. Fink to help her come up with a scheme to get Peter to propose to he', 'Michelle De Winter lives the good life, wining and dining with only the richest men who are fortunate to cross her path. Her daughter Yvette, whom Michelle insists on introducing as her ''niece'', is a fashion model. She is saving herself for the right man, despite the fact that she is part of the free love generation and lives with a group of promiscuous creative types. While Michelle is searching for a new millionaire playboy, Yvette falls for the handsome Peter Von Hallstein. She asks the fatherly Dr. Fink to help her come up with a scheme to get Peter to propose to he', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4hyhY7qJG58mP9bokJUc9ItIBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5625'),
  ('472770448304048835', 'Madame Bovary', 1934, 'Drama', 'Jean Renoir, Jean Bachelet', 'Jean Renoir', 'Valentine Tessier, Pierre Renoir, Alice Tissot, Héléna Manson, Max Dearly, Pierre Larquey, Robert Le Vigan, Daniel Lecourtois', null, 'In 19th-century France, doctor''s wife Emma Bovary seeks to escape her dull provincial life through various extramarital affairs and extravagant spending, leading to tragic consequences.', 'In 19th-century France, doctor''s wife Emma Bovary seeks to escape her dull provincial life through various extramarital affairs and extravagant spending, leading to tragic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrRpmDh3PMHYPdaisyePGV6VQkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43123'),
