  ('191739610308925668', 'Made for Each Other', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William M. Miller, Daryl Goldberg', 'Eric Lord', 'Christopher Masterson, Bijou Phillips, Lauren German, Danny Masterson, George Segal, Patrick Warburton, Samm Levine, Leslie Hendrix', null, 'After three months in a sexless marriage, a man cheats on his wife and tries to justify his actions by tricking her into infidelity.', 'After three months in a sexless marriage, a man cheats on his wife and tries to justify his actions by tricking her into infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeQsbpuwISDhiWB4uwoqryGrPSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29029'),
  ('807123776383597613', 'Made in Abyss: Dawn of the Deep Soul', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Satoshi Mori, Ken Takahashi, Tsunetaka Ema', 'Hideyuki Kurata', 'Miyu Tomita, Mariya Ise, Shiori Izawa, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Inori Minase, Sayaka Ohara, Tetsu Inada, Eri Kitamura', 'R', 'A continuation of the epic adventure of plucky Riko and Reg who are joined by their new friend Nanachi. Together they descend into the Abyss'' treacherous fifth layer, the Sea of Corpses, and encounter the mysterious Bondrewd, a legendary White Whistle whose shadow looms over Nanachi''s troubled past. Bondrewd is ingratiatingly hospitable, but the brave adventurers know things are not always as they seem in the enigmatic Abyss.', 'A continuation of the epic adventure of plucky Riko and Reg who are joined by their new friend Nanachi. Together they descend into the Abyss'' treacherous fifth layer, the Sea of Corpses, and encounter the mysterious Bondrewd, a legendary White Whistle whose shadow looms over Nanachi''s troubled past. Bondrewd is ingratiatingly hospitable, but the brave adventurers know things are not always as they seem in the enigmatic Abyss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4riqNEEd5rnkbNytf02wkF4W8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573730'),
  ('382948190095613162', 'Made in America', 1993, 'Comedy', 'L. Dean Jones Jr., Patrick J. Palmer, Newt Arnold', 'Holly Goldberg Sloan', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Ted Danson, Will Smith, Nia Long, Paul Rodríguez, Jennifer Tilly, Peggy Rea, Clyde Kusatsu', 'PG-13', 'A young black woman discovers that her father was a sperm donor, and if that wasn''t bad enough, he''s white.', 'A young black woman discovers that her father was a sperm donor, and if that wasn''t bad enough, he''s white.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NLhOZN4AcTSvEPMI3HCjTVSfvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12121'),
  ('246220561102205475', 'Made in Argentina', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Juan José Jusid, Víctor Dínenzon', 'Nelly Fernández Tiscornia, Juan José Jusid', 'Luis Brandoni, Marta Bianchi, Leonor Manso, Patricio Contreras, Hugo Arana, Alberto Busaid, Mario Luciani, Gabriela Flores', null, 'Osvaldo and Mabel, an Argentine couple exiled for political reasons in the United States, travel to their country of origin after ten years to reconnect with their family and friends, including Mabel''s brother and his wife. Mabel offers her brother the possibility of working in New York in order to improve their economic situation, but his wife is opposed to that idea.', 'Osvaldo and Mabel, an Argentine couple exiled for political reasons in the United States, travel to their country of origin after ten years to reconnect with their family and friends, including Mabel''s brother and his wife. Mabel offers her brother the possibility of working in New York in order to improve their economic situation, but his wife is opposed to that idea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxrCm7VrxyXEHhhA4SzTMZTkAN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73036'),
  ('775071408257731999', 'Made in Britain', 1983, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Alan Clarke, Chris Menges', 'David Leland', 'Tim Roth, Terry Richards, Bill Stewart, Eric Richard, Geoffrey Hutchings, Sean Chapman, John Bleasdale, Noel Diacomo', null, 'After being sent to a detention centre, a teenage skinhead clashes with the social workers who want to conform him to the status quo.', 'After being sent to a detention centre, a teenage skinhead clashes with the social workers who want to conform him to the status quo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ygBME2MULEQVxqFZzBfje7Jnhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31858'),
  ('706274867068736785', 'Made in China', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julien Abraham', 'Frédéric Chau, Kamel Guemra, Julien Abraham', 'Frédéric Chau, Medi Sadoun, Julie de Bona, Steve Tran, Mylène Jampanoï, Clémentine Célarié, Li Heling, Bing Yin', null, 'François, a young thirty-year-old Asian, has not been back in his family for 10 years after a violent dispute with his father Meng. Since then, he has always tried to avoid questions about his origins, until he lies to believe that he has been adopted. But when he learns that he is going to be a father, he realizes that he will have to reconnect with his past and his origins. Pushed by his companion Sophie, he decides to reconnect with his family and returns to his XIIIth native district to announce the good news, accompanied by his best friend Bruno. François is welcomed with open arms by his family, with the exception of his father and his younger brother. The return to his community is not going to be so simple .', 'François, a young thirty-year-old Asian, has not been back in his family for 10 years after a violent dispute with his father Meng. Since then, he has always tried to avoid questions about his origins, until he lies to believe that he has been adopted. But when he learns that he is going to be a father, he realizes that he will have to reconnect with his past and his origins. Pushed by his companion Sophie, he decides to reconnect with his family and returns to his XIIIth native district to announce the good news, accompanied by his best friend Bruno. François is welcomed with open arms by his family, with the exception of his father and his younger brother. The return to his community is not going to be so simple .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K0AjnnoVrOOFZ0ZRCBeBVRE31p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602971'),
  ('9532107356929628', 'Made in Dagenham', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'John de Borman, Nigel Cole', 'William Ivory', 'Sally Hawkins, Bob Hoskins, Miranda Richardson, Geraldine James, Rosamund Pike, Andrea Riseborough, Daniel Mays, Jaime Winstone', 'R', 'A dramatization of the 1968 strike at the Ford Dagenham car plant, where female workers walked out in protest against sexual discrimination.', 'A dramatization of the 1968 strike at the Ford Dagenham car plant, where female workers walked out in protest against sexual discrimination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcQGPxuk0fclp9UrFevI2lhDi1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46138'),
