  ('1108837273218506318', 'Made in France', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Éric Besnard, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Malik Zidi, Dimitri Storoge, François Civil, Nassim Lyes, Ahmed Dramé, Franck Gastambide, Judith Davis, Nailia Harzoune', null, 'Sam, a freelance journalist, decides to investigate the growing phenomenon of disaffected youth joining extremist groups. He infiltrates a group of four young people who have been tasked with the creation of a jihadist cell and whose mission is to destabilise the city centre of Paris.', 'Sam, a freelance journalist, decides to investigate the growing phenomenon of disaffected youth joining extremist groups. He infiltrates a group of four young people who have been tasked with the creation of a jihadist cell and whose mission is to destabilise the city centre of Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RYbOorWc0soHNjKjELA5cL32JK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358881'),
