  ('599727428402603464', 'Made in Hong Kong', 1997, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fruit Chan, Lam Wah-Chuen, O Sing-Pui', 'Fruit Chan', 'Sam Lee, Neiky Yim Hui-Chi, Wenders Li Tung-Chuen, Carol Lam, Chan Sang, Woo Wai-Chung, Chan Tat Yee, Amy Tam Ka-Chuen', null, 'Hong Kong 1997, where young people dream of love and death, suicide and murder. Moon is a cynical young debt collector, smitten by Ping, a young woman dying of kidney disease. A suicide note from a student they don''t know ends up intertwining their fates.', 'Hong Kong 1997, where young people dream of love and death, suicide and murder. Moon is a cynical young debt collector, smitten by Ping, a young woman dying of kidney disease. A suicide note from a student they don''t know ends up intertwining their fates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWuB0NcEyZu2oz1ppdIwNGUpZJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26005'),
  ('303908504096278718', 'Made in Italy', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Ennio Guarnieri, Nanni Loy, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Ruggero Maccari, Nanni Loy, Ettore Scola', 'Lando Buzzanca, Aldo Giuffrè, Walter Chiari, Lea Massari, Milena Vukotić, Aldo Fabrizi, Nino Castelnuovo, Mario Pisu', null, 'A group of Italians take a flight to Sweden: among them there are the tourists, and the immigrants.', 'A group of Italians take a flight to Sweden: among them there are the tourists, and the immigrants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rPzTLNIJ9SQI3cMkwzShcWd0B9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65478'),
