  ('129856296353221198', 'Made in Italy', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Toby Spanton, Alice Caronna, Amber Tordoff-Gibson', 'James D''Arcy', 'Liam Neeson, Micheál Richardson, Valeria Bilello, Lindsay Duncan, Marco Quaglia, Gian Marco Tavani, Helena Antonio, Yolanda Kettle', 'R', 'A bohemian artist travels from London to Italy with his estranged son to sell the house they inherited from his late wife.', 'A bohemian artist travels from London to Italy with his estranged son to sell the house they inherited from his late wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKjD3DTZjRI3Ipkf7Oz5zAILnwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659991'),
  ('1059809949770233346', 'Made in Korea', 2026, 'Drama', 'Ra. Karthik, Prasanna S. Kumar', 'Ra. Karthik', 'Priyanka Arul Mohan, Rishikanth, Park Hye-jin, Baek Si-hun, Jang Jae-hyeon, Kim So-ri, Jo Ha-ram, Kim Rok', 'PG-13', 'A woman from a small town in Tamil Nadu moves to South Korea — a place she always dreamed of — but struggles to find her footing in a foreign land.', 'A woman from a small town in Tamil Nadu moves to South Korea — a place she always dreamed of — but struggles to find her footing in a foreign land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foEObhyAMM3dxYeBEr242EdQDB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1561687'),
  ('25054931440253468', 'Made in Mexico', 2012, 'History, Music, Documentary', 'Duncan Bridgeman, Gregory W. Allen, Lorenzo Hagerman', null, 'Héctor Aguilar Camín, Rubén Albarrán, Amandititia, Sergio Arau, Venado Azul, Blue Demon, José Guadalupe Esparza, Laura Esquivel', 'R', 'From Diego Luna and Alejandro Fernandez, to Carla Morrison and Chavela Vargas, Duncan Bridgeman weaves a cinematic tapestry composed of original songs and insights from the most iconic artists and performers of contemporary Mexico. With striking visuals, the movie captures the rich diversity of Mexican geography, art, music, and culture. It is a rare look at the country''s real identity, and an unparalleled celebration of what it truly means to be "Hecho en Mexico."', 'From Diego Luna and Alejandro Fernandez, to Carla Morrison and Chavela Vargas, Duncan Bridgeman weaves a cinematic tapestry composed of original songs and insights from the most iconic artists and performers of contemporary Mexico. With striking visuals, the movie captures the rich diversity of Mexican geography, art, music, and culture. It is a rare look at the country''s real identity, and an unparalleled celebration of what it truly means to be "Hecho en Mexico."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Saeem00BkCz2T8UwbUk6bhMMma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139325'),
  ('1137718901190431877', 'Made in Milan', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Martin Scorsese, Néstor Almendros', 'Jay Cocks', 'Giorgio Armani, Martin Scorsese', null, 'As he prepares for a show, fashion designer Giorgio Armani discusses his principles of fashion, his family history and the city of Milan.', 'As he prepares for a show, fashion designer Giorgio Armani discusses his principles of fashion, his family history and the city of Milan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44Xm8r819NnodzmFK5c2H7o6rRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301814'),
  ('732659356018794104', 'Made in Paris', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Bonitzer', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Marina de Van', 'Édouard Baer, Géraldine Pailhas, Marina de Van, Charles Berling, Hippolyte Girardot, Philippe Caroit', null, 'Diane lives with publisher Hermann but everything is spoiled when Worms, Hermann’s loyal author and friend, reveals in his new book the affair he once had with Diane, in a highly subjective manner. She soon discovers the contents of the work, which Hermann tries to hide from her, and takes on a lawyer to defend her privacy. But this is only the beginning of a mess that simply gets worse and worse, leading to an unexpected, brutal ending.', 'Diane lives with publisher Hermann but everything is spoiled when Worms, Hermann’s loyal author and friend, reveals in his new book the affair he once had with Diane, in a highly subjective manner. She soon discovers the contents of the work, which Hermann tries to hide from her, and takes on a lawyer to defend her privacy. But this is only the beginning of a mess that simply gets worse and worse, leading to an unexpected, brutal ending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvarq69Cw4BxXvL7WeGYNcbWQ7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64838'),
  ('55668548867928072', 'Made in U.S.A', 1967, 'Crime, Mystery, Comedy', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Claude Bakka, Philippe Pouzenc', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Anna Karina, László Szabó, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Marianne Faithfull, Yves Afonso, Claude Bakka, Daniel Bart, Jean-Pierre Biesse', 'NR', 'Paula Nelson goes to Atlantic City to meet her lover, Richard Politzer, but finds him dead and decides to investigate his death. In her hotel room, she meets Typhus, whom she ends up knocking out. His corpse is later found in the apartment of David Goodis, a writer. Paula is arrested and interrogated. From then on, she encounters many gangsters.', 'Paula Nelson goes to Atlantic City to meet her lover, Richard Politzer, but finds him dead and decides to investigate his death. In her hotel room, she meets Typhus, whom she ends up knocking out. His corpse is later found in the apartment of David Goodis, a writer. Paula is arrested and interrogated. From then on, she encounters many gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4SDhdZlKA03flhd4ssO3Opm8Xa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29369'),
  ('401615010034362638', 'Made in U.S.A.', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Adventure', 'Ken Friedman, Phillip Christon, Bill Corcoran', 'Zbigniew Kempinski', 'Adrian Pasdar, Chris Penn, Lori Singer, Judith Baldwin, Jacqueline Murphy, Marji Martin, Tiny Wells, Frank Beddor', 'R', 'Two men from Pennsylvania give up hope in their small run down coal mining town, and head off in search of the beaches of California. The two steal cars as they travel across the USA and are joined by a wild young woman.', 'Two men from Pennsylvania give up hope in their small run down coal mining town, and head off in search of the beaches of California. The two steal cars as they travel across the USA and are joined by a wild young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEfzGJXf9k8uiq82fYK7322N0Wi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162700'),
  ('360865123917147532', 'Made Men', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Louis Morneau, George Mooradian', 'Robert Franke, Alfred Gough, Miles Millar', 'Jim Belushi, Michael Beach, Timothy Dalton, Steve Railsback, Carlton Wilborn, Vanessa Angel, Jamie Harris, David O''Donnell', 'R', 'A man and a woman are on the run from gangsters whom he has stolen $12.5 million. When the gangsters show up, he takes them supposedly to where the money is hidden but instead leads them into a trap at a backwoods crystal-meth factory. The gangsters and the drug dealers start a shoot-out for unknown reasons and both go gunning for Belushi. Meanwhile an unscrupulous cop is secretly having an affair with the girl friend and planning to make off with the money.', 'A man and a woman are on the run from gangsters whom he has stolen $12.5 million. When the gangsters show up, he takes them supposedly to where the money is hidden but instead leads them into a trap at a backwoods crystal-meth factory. The gangsters and the drug dealers start a shoot-out for unknown reasons and both go gunning for Belushi. Meanwhile an unscrupulous cop is secretly having an affair with the girl friend and planning to make off with the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGCv1t8McPOFnHdUgDIiFv9c5GW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33671'),
  ('695469278030547077', 'Made of Honor', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Weiland, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Adam Sztykiel, Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont', 'Patrick Dempsey, Michelle Monaghan, Kevin McKidd, Kadeem Hardison, Chris Messina, Richmond Arquette, Busy Philipps, Whitney Cummings', 'PG-13', 'Tom and Hannah have been platonic friends for 10 years. He''s a serial dater, while she wants marriage but hasn''t found Mr. Right. Just as Tom is starting to think that he is relationship material after all, Hannah gets engaged. When she asks Tom to be her ''maid'' of honor, he reluctantly agrees just so he can attempt to stop the wedding and woo her.', 'Tom and Hannah have been platonic friends for 10 years. He''s a serial dater, while she wants marriage but hasn''t found Mr. Right. Just as Tom is starting to think that he is relationship material after all, Hannah gets engaged. When she asks Tom to be her ''maid'' of honor, he reluctantly agrees just so he can attempt to stop the wedding and woo her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDg8D0jNqmz7RbCBgblWvmPswHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10761'),
  ('991652058374392438', 'Made You Look: A True Story About Fake Art', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Barry Avrich', null, 'Ann Freedman, M.H. Miller, Perry Amsellem, Patricia Cohen, Luke Nikas, Eleanore De Sole, Blake Gopnik, Jack Flam', null, 'A woman walks into a New York gallery with a cache of unknown masterworks. Thus begins a story of art world greed, willfulness and a high-stakes con.', 'A woman walks into a New York gallery with a cache of unknown masterworks. Thus begins a story of art world greed, willfulness and a high-stakes con.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ANquD7ZQTU4yZVLG478BbzRMAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693906'),
  ('167737045336520263', 'Madea Goes to Jail', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Alexander Gruszynski, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Derek Luke, Keshia Knight Pulliam, Ion Overman, Sofía Vergara, Vanessa Ferlito, Viola Davis, David Mann', 'PG-13', 'After a high-speed car chase, Madea winds up behind bars because her quick temper gets the best of her. Meanwhile, Assistant District Attorney Josh Hardaway lands a case that''s too personal to handle: that of a young prostitute and former drug addict named Candace, also a childhood friend. When Candace winds up in jail, Madea takes the young woman under her protective wing.', 'After a high-speed car chase, Madea winds up behind bars because her quick temper gets the best of her. Meanwhile, Assistant District Attorney Josh Hardaway lands a case that''s too personal to handle: that of a young prostitute and former drug addict named Candace, also a childhood friend. When Candace winds up in jail, Madea takes the young woman under her protective wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiXNNmSFXsfUdKDkylBF2LfX0DR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15670'),
  ('340005940391789898', 'Madea''s Big Happy Family', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Loretta Devine, Shad Moss, Cassi Davis, Shannon Kane, Lauren London, Rodney Perry, Teyana Taylor', 'PG-13', 'When Shirley, Madea''s niece, receives distressing news about her health, the only thing she wants is her family gathered around her. However, Shirley''s three adult children are too preoccupied with their own troubled lives to pay attention to their mother. It is up to Madea, with the help of rowdy Aunt Bam, to bring the clan together and help Shirley deal with her crisis.', 'When Shirley, Madea''s niece, receives distressing news about her health, the only thing she wants is her family gathered around her. However, Shirley''s three adult children are too preoccupied with their own troubled lives to pay attention to their mother. It is up to Madea, with the help of rowdy Aunt Bam, to bring the clan together and help Shirley deal with her crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qWcpqRfUEFrbKdDvB7tg7h1oXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51017'),
  ('1113181972156124079', 'Madea''s Destination Wedding', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Justyn Moro', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Xavier Smalls, Diamond White, Cassi Davis, Tamela Mann, David Mann, Jermaine Harris, Taja V. Simpson', 'PG-13', 'Madea packs her best floral dresses and a whole lot of chaos when the Simmons family heads to the Bahamas for her grandniece''s whirlwind wedding.', 'Madea packs her best floral dresses and a whole lot of chaos when the Simmons family heads to the Bahamas for her grandniece''s whirlwind wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwMwRucnAROgWo9WLLmIqzHmmzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1246310'),
  ('588491266572685337', 'Madea''s Family Reunion', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tyler Perry, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Rochelle Aytes, Lisa Arrindell, Lynn Whitfield, Blair Underwood, Boris Kodjoe, Keke Palmer, Cicely Tyson', 'PG-13', 'Southern matriarch Madea has a lot on her plate. Her nieces, Vanessa and Lisa, have relationship troubles - Vanessa moves into Madea''s house with her 2 young children and Lisa is engaged to a controlling man that her mother set her up with. In addition, Madea has just been court-ordered to become the guardian of Nikki, a rebellious runaway teenager. Madea must keep the peace and her family together while simultaneously planning her clan''s reunion.', 'Southern matriarch Madea has a lot on her plate. Her nieces, Vanessa and Lisa, have relationship troubles - Vanessa moves into Madea''s house with her 2 young children and Lisa is engaged to a controlling man that her mother set her up with. In addition, Madea has just been court-ordered to become the guardian of Nikki, a rebellious runaway teenager. Madea must keep the peace and her family together while simultaneously planning her clan''s reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAzrDS5bJJSSdPAUxuctCoomXUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16781'),
  ('580768152188072893', 'Madea''s Witness Protection', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Alexander Gruszynski, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Eugene Levy, Denise Richards, Romeo, Doris Roberts, Tom Arnold, John Amos, Devan Leos', 'PG-13', 'For years, mild-mannered Wall Street banker George Needleman has meandered through life oblivious to his family''s dysfunction and his company''s malfeasance, but he''s forced to wake up when he learns that he''s been framed in a mob-backed Ponzi scheme. Placed under federal protection, George and his family are shipped down South to Madea''s house, where the no-nonsense matriarch whips them all into shape using her special brand of tough love.', 'For years, mild-mannered Wall Street banker George Needleman has meandered through life oblivious to his family''s dysfunction and his company''s malfeasance, but he''s forced to wake up when he learns that he''s been framed in a mob-backed Ponzi scheme. Placed under federal protection, George and his family are shipped down South to Madea''s house, where the no-nonsense matriarch whips them all into shape using her special brand of tough love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4P6d7kVDB60Ydmk9WAhrPCWrARI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103370'),
  ('320962701957775163', 'Madeinusa', 2006, 'Drama', 'Claudia Llosa, Raúl Pérez Ureta', 'Claudia Llosa', 'Magaly Solier, Carlos J. de la Torre, Yiliana Chong, Juan Ubaldo Huaman, Melvin Quijada, Vicento Llauca Trejo', null, 'Madeinusa is a girl who lives in an isolated village in the mountains of Peru. This strange place is characterized by its religious fervor, and seemingly odd custom: from Good Friday at three o’clock in the afternoon to Easter Sunday, the whole village can do whatever it feels like.', 'Madeinusa is a girl who lives in an isolated village in the mountains of Peru. This strange place is characterized by its religious fervor, and seemingly odd custom: from Good Friday at three o’clock in the afternoon to Easter Sunday, the whole village can do whatever it feels like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f187ptaaH4E0SVTIyJ9yoZYj6V4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46820'),
  ('1043631729859788283', 'Madeleine', 1950, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'David Lean, Guy Green, George Pollock', 'Stanley Haynes, Nicholas Phipps', 'Ann Todd, Norman Wooland, Ivan Desny, Leslie Banks, Elizabeth Sellars, André Morell, Barbara Everest, Susan Stranks', 'NR', 'Madeleine''s middle-class family cannot understand why she puts off marrying a respectable young man, as they know nothing about her long-term affair with a Frenchman.', 'Madeleine''s middle-class family cannot understand why she puts off marrying a respectable young man, as they know nothing about her long-term affair with a Frenchman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQsThlhGuWUn8h3vpdbK3Kr4qGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46995'),
  ('621761677367900415', 'Madeleine', 2003, 'Romance, Drama', 'Park Kwang-chun, Kim Yeong-cheol', 'Joon-Seok Sol, Kim Eun-jeong, Park Kwang-chun', 'Zo In-sung, Shin Min-a, Park Jung-ah, Kim Soo-ro, Ham Eun-jung, Ha Jung-woo, Kang Dong-gyun', null, 'The story follows the lives of two girls living together and their separate love lives as they struggle to find and maintain their new relationships. The movie mainly focuses on pretty girl Lee Hee-Jin. Hee-Jin is a hair stylist working at a salon when she meets an old classmate from junior high school. Kang Ji-Suk meets up with Hee-Jin when he arrives at her salon for a hair cut. The pair ends up deciding to try dating for a month to see how things go. All goes well in the beginning until Ji-Suks first love shows up. Sung-Hae invites Ji-Suk over to a reunion party with their old junior high school friends. Hee-Jin ends up tagging along. But she feels excluded and uncomfortable while Ji-Suk and Sung-Hae are hitting it off.', 'The story follows the lives of two girls living together and their separate love lives as they struggle to find and maintain their new relationships. The movie mainly focuses on pretty girl Lee Hee-Jin. Hee-Jin is a hair stylist working at a salon when she meets an old classmate from junior high school. Kang Ji-Suk meets up with Hee-Jin when he arrives at her salon for a hair cut. The pair ends up deciding to try dating for a month to see how things go. All goes well in the beginning until Ji-Suks first love shows up. Sung-Hae invites Ji-Suk over to a reunion party with their old junior high school friends. Hee-Jin ends up tagging along. But she feels excluded and uncomfortable while Ji-Suk and Sung-Hae are hitting it off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lP9apJwM6KYddTSkhCaTJq6kz5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109683'),
  ('368160908686867500', 'Madeleine Collins', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gordon Spooner, Antoine Barraud', 'Antoine Barraud, Héléna Klotz', 'Virginie Efira, Quim Gutiérrez, Bruno Salomone, Loïse Benguerel, François Rostain, Jacqueline Bisset, Thomas Gioria, Valérie Donzelli', null, 'Judith leads a double life between Switzerland and France. On the one hand Abdel, with whom she is raising a little girl, on the other Melvil with whom she has two older boys. Little by little, this fragile balance, made up of lies, secrets and back and forth, cracks dangerously. Trapped, Judith chooses to head forward, at the risk of losing everything.', 'Judith leads a double life between Switzerland and France. On the one hand Abdel, with whom she is raising a little girl, on the other Melvil with whom she has two older boys. Little by little, this fragile balance, made up of lies, secrets and back and forth, cracks dangerously. Trapped, Judith chooses to head forward, at the risk of losing everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHBlnHHV3x3GWMkWbgWxT0eLIyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659988'),
  ('634758894077588282', 'Madeline', 1952, 'Animation, Family', 'Robert Cannon', null, 'Gladys Holland', null, 'This short from the UPA studio was nominated for the 1952 Oscars. Based on the Madeline series of children''s books.', 'This short from the UPA studio was nominated for the 1952 Oscars. Based on the Madeline series of children''s books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2yFPAeFjlLswdgAKSjhoxzjJsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242994'),
  ('954883376200909234', 'Madeline', 1998, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Daisy von Scherler Mayer, Pierre Aïm, Anne Ventura', 'Mark Levin, Jennifer Flackett', 'Hatty Jones, Frances McDormand, Nigel Hawthorne, Ben Daniels, Arturo Venegas, Stéphane Audran, Katia Caballero, Chantal Neuwirth', 'PG', 'Horrified at the prospect of her beloved school being sold, a young French girl named Madeline uses her wit and craftiness to attempt to save it, making an unlikely new friend in the process.', 'Horrified at the prospect of her beloved school being sold, a young French girl named Madeline uses her wit and craftiness to attempt to save it, making an unlikely new friend in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAGRLwJC0jv7QlfJR6y32xRZqcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35680'),
  ('1059411154243179495', 'Madeline: Lost in Paris', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Stan Phillips, Marija Miletic Dail', 'Jacqueline Feather, David Seidler', 'Lauren Bacall, Jason Alexander, Andrea Libman, Christopher Plummer, Stevie Vallance, Alex Hood, Britt Irvin, Veronika Sztopa', null, 'When Madeline''s long lost uncle Horst arrives to take her to a Viennese finishing school, Miss Clavel, the eleven little girls and Pepito realize that something is not right.', 'When Madeline''s long lost uncle Horst arrives to take her to a Viennese finishing school, Miss Clavel, the eleven little girls and Pepito realize that something is not right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yvMSO44uzng2wFAeWM7h1IDArh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216983'),
  ('208587294069003425', 'Madeline''s Madeline', 2018, 'Drama', 'Josephine Decker, Ashley Connor, Nick Grau', 'Josephine Decker, Donna di Novelli', 'Helena Howard, Molly Parker, Miranda July, Okwui Okpokwasili, Sunita Mani, Eva Steinmetz, Felipe Bonilla, Lolo Haha', 'NR', 'Madeline has become an integral part of a prestigious physical theater troupe. When the workshop''s ambitious director pushes the teenager to weave her rich interior world and troubled history with her mother into their collective art, the lines between performance and reality begin to blur. The resulting battle between imagination and appropriation rips out of the rehearsal space and through all three women''s lives.', 'Madeline has become an integral part of a prestigious physical theater troupe. When the workshop''s ambitious director pushes the teenager to weave her rich interior world and troubled history with her mother into their collective art, the lines between performance and reality begin to blur. The resulting battle between imagination and appropriation rips out of the rehearsal space and through all three women''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PcvYO5SHmPUFzdXpI2kzj3JtXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468735'),
  ('49648404632932850', 'Madelines', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Ken Whiting, Jason Richard Miller', 'Brea Grant, Jason Richard Miller', 'Brea Grant, Parry Shen, Richard Riehle', null, 'Working in their garage, indie entrepreneurs Madeline and Owen discover the secret of time travel. There''s only one hitch: a bug in the code creates a new copy of Madeline at the same time every day.', 'Working in their garage, indie entrepreneurs Madeline and Owen discover the secret of time travel. There''s only one hitch: a bug in the code creates a new copy of Madeline at the same time every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNVLNTA2232OjOWkm79YYxtO2oW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911348'),
  ('387280278852569190', 'Mademoiselle', 1966, 'Drama', 'David Watkin, Tony Richardson, Christian de Chalonge', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Jeanne Moreau, Ettore Manni, Keith Skinner, Umberto Orsini, Georges Aubert, Jane Beretta, Paul Barge, Pierre Collet', null, 'A sexually repressed school teacher releases her pent up passions in a series of shocking crimes.', 'A sexually repressed school teacher releases her pent up passions in a series of shocking crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfTFh0ltQK7lkIpYXZmcjBUrDia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36457'),
  ('1150576477058201328', 'Mademoiselle', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Lioret, Bertrand Chatry', 'Christian Sinniger, Philippe Lioret, Emmanuel Courcol', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Jacques Gamblin, Isabelle Candelier, Zinedine Soualem, Jacques Boudet, Gilbert Frémont, Patrick Mercado, Philippe Beglia', null, 'Claire is a young woman who leads a somewhat formatted life. Pierre is an improviser, but not an actor. Brief encounter, brief romance, doomed or not, who can say? When things like that happen, you act on the spur of the moment.', 'Claire is a young woman who leads a somewhat formatted life. Pierre is an improviser, but not an actor. Brief encounter, brief romance, doomed or not, who can say? When things like that happen, you act on the spur of the moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuKqpN1QWwAxxgY3eIKl4lhPosK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78210'),
  ('452683513568389202', 'Mademoiselle Chambon', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Stéphane Brizé, Antoine Héberlé', 'Florence Vignon, Stéphane Brizé', 'Vincent Lindon, Sandrine Kiberlain, Aure Atika, Jean-Marc Thibault, Bruno Lochet, Abdellah Moundy, Michelle Goddet, Anne Houdy', null, 'Véronique Chambon (Sandrine Kiberlain), a single schoolteacher and Jean (Vincent Lindon), discover an unexpected bond that causes them to question the direction of their lives. They move in different social circles but their relationship develops and their lives begin gradually to unravel.', 'Véronique Chambon (Sandrine Kiberlain), a single schoolteacher and Jean (Vincent Lindon), discover an unexpected bond that causes them to question the direction of their lives. They move in different social circles but their relationship develops and their lives begin gradually to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tYs9sjWm33lTO0zUtPmCXPDQmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34013'),
  ('806491092621203767', 'Mademoiselle de Maupin', 1966, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Mauro Bolognini, Ruggero Deodato, Massimo Castellani', 'Luigi Magni', 'Catherine Spaak, Robert Hossein, Tomas Milian, Mikaela Wood, Ángel Álvarez, Ottavia Piccolo, Manuel Zarzo, Lojze Drenovec', null, 'Mademoiselle de Maupin escapes from her uncle''s castle, invaded by Hungarian troops, under the guise of a clergyman named Theodore. An army recruiter forces Theodore to enlist in the King''s army, and not even the religious robe is an insurance against it. Theodore is assigned to be aide-de-camp to Alcibiade, a man as virile in combat, as he seems troubled for the figure of his aid. D''Albert, an aristocrat, will expose Theodore''s true sex, and after a number of confusing, comedy situations, Alcibiade will appease his troubled feelings.', 'Mademoiselle de Maupin escapes from her uncle''s castle, invaded by Hungarian troops, under the guise of a clergyman named Theodore. An army recruiter forces Theodore to enlist in the King''s army, and not even the religious robe is an insurance against it. Theodore is assigned to be aide-de-camp to Alcibiade, a man as virile in combat, as he seems troubled for the figure of his aid. D''Albert, an aristocrat, will expose Theodore''s true sex, and after a number of confusing, comedy situations, Alcibiade will appease his troubled feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VUw0cPq72mxWCOjCIPot6oaUJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198311'),
  ('655886938429136435', 'Mademoiselle Paradis', 2017, 'History, Drama', 'Christine A. Maier, Barbara Albert', 'Kathrin Resetarits', 'Maria Dragus, Devid Striesow, Lukas Miko, Katja Kolm, Maresi Riegner, Johanna Orsini-Rosenberg, Stefanie Reinsperger, Christoph Luser', null, '18th century Vienna. Maria Theresia von Paradis, a gifted piano player and close friend of Mozart''s, lost her eye-sight as a child. Desperate to cure their talented daughter, the Paradis entrust Maria to Dr. Mesmer, a forward-thinking-physician who gives her the care and attention that she requires. With the doctor''s innovative techniques of magnetism, Maria slowly recovers her sight. But this miracle comes at a price as the woman progressively starts to lose her gift for music.', '18th century Vienna. Maria Theresia von Paradis, a gifted piano player and close friend of Mozart''s, lost her eye-sight as a child. Desperate to cure their talented daughter, the Paradis entrust Maria to Dr. Mesmer, a forward-thinking-physician who gives her the care and attention that she requires. With the doctor''s innovative techniques of magnetism, Maria slowly recovers her sight. But this miracle comes at a price as the woman progressively starts to lose her gift for music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2S5pQCxzf2JsqvCCZaKPlwbMHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424585'),
  ('975611024882062539', 'Madgaon Express', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kunal Khemu, Sarvesh Shingre, Adil Afsar', 'Kunal Khemu', 'Divyendu Sharma, Pratik Gandhi, Avinash Tiwary, Nora Fatehi, Chhaya Kadam, Upendra Limaye, Remo D''Souza, Raviraj Kande', null, 'Three childhood friends embark on a trip to Goa that goes completely off-track when they wake up in their hotel room to find a cache of cocaine belonging to a don.', 'Three childhood friends embark on a trip to Goa that goes completely off-track when they wake up in their hotel room to find a cache of cocaine belonging to a don.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS1s8FKLWFR6cn1rlVUyqURb5os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201015'),
  ('125729565832795738', 'Madham', 2026, 'Drama', 'Vamsee Krishna Malla', 'Vamsee Krishna Malla, Ramesh Babu Koya', 'Methagu Aranganathan, Harsha Gangavarapu, Anuroop Katari, Hema Pop, Miryala Ravi', null, 'A marginalized family in rural India faces brutal persecution after false accusations. As they endure police violence and social hostility, their fight for justice becomes a testament to resistance against systemic oppression.', 'A marginalized family in rural India faces brutal persecution after false accusations. As they endure police violence and social hostility, their fight for justice becomes a testament to resistance against systemic oppression.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:madham-2026'),
  ('72484263639439305', 'Madharaasi', 2025, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'A. R. Murugadoss, Sudeep Elamon, Abhay Anand', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Sivakarthikeyan, Rukmini Vasanth, Vidyut Jammwal, Biju Menon, Vikranth, Shabeer Kallarakkal, Thalaivasal Vijay, Siddhartha Shankar', 'NR', 'A man with a psychological disorder overcomes trauma and confronts his nemesis in a fast-paced action film with romance and unique elements, exploring themes of resilience and redemption.', 'A man with a psychological disorder overcomes trauma and confronts his nemesis in a fast-paced action film with romance and unique elements, exploring themes of resilience and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dw3Dllz1gV7186m7clqNDnI9R28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297181'),
  ('1113687521413991170', 'Madhouse', 1974, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jim Clark, John Siddall, Allan James', 'Greg Morrison, Ken Levison', 'Vincent Price, Peter Cushing, Robert Quarry, Adrienne Corri, Linda Hayden, Natasha Pyne, Michael Parkinson, Barry Dennen', 'PG', 'A horror movie star returns to his famous role after spending years in a mental institution, but the character seems to be committing murders independent of his will.', 'A horror movie star returns to his famous role after spending years in a mental institution, but the character seems to be committing murders independent of his will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGvbgGotNIr24wyMrrfgYcSuH1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28715'),
  ('885383053437239222', 'Madhouse', 1981, 'Horror', 'Ovidio G. Assonitis, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Peter Shepherd, Ovidio G. Assonitis, Stephen Blakely', 'Patricia Mickey, Allison Biggers, Michael MacRae, Dennis Robertson, Morgan Hart, Edith Ivey, Jerry Fujikawa, Doug Dillingham', 'R', 'A woman is pursued by her murderous, psychopathic twin sister in the days leading up to their birthday.', 'A woman is pursued by her murderous, psychopathic twin sister in the days leading up to their birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ebCs7FLor0um97T41UULuXd5EM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54133'),
  ('968198232954358630', 'Madhouse', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Butler, Victoria Dragnea, Virgil Nicolaescu', 'William Butler', 'Joshua Leonard, Jordan Ladd, Natasha Lyonne, Lance Henriksen, Dendrie Taylor, Leslie Jordan, Patrika Darbo, Christian Leffler', 'R', 'A young psychiatric intern unearths secrets about the mental health facility in which he works.', 'A young psychiatric intern unearths secrets about the mental health facility in which he works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug2DwSZ5WCgMUJcWfEPn7wIHtpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17209'),
  ('471493855047544138', 'MadHouse', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Tom Ropelewski, Dennis C. Lewiston', 'Tom Ropelewski', 'John Larroquette, Kirstie Alley, John Diehl, Alison La Placa, Jessica Lundy, Bradley Gregg, Dennis Miller, Robert Ginty', 'PG-13', 'The luxurious villa of Mark and Jessie Bannister, a yuppie couple, is overrun by loads of uninvited guests who turn the house up side down.', 'The luxurious villa of Mark and Jessie Bannister, a yuppie couple, is overrun by loads of uninvited guests who turn the house up side down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8BBcinqXq50PeKObT2lvLdTkYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51036'),
  ('633868014490234010', 'Madhumati', 1958, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Bimal Roy, Dilip Gupta', 'Ritwik Ghatak', 'Dilip Kumar, Vyjayanthimala, Johnny Walker, Pran Sikand, Jayant, Ramayan Tiwari, Tarun Bose, Baij Sharma', null, 'Two men take shelter in a derelict mansion situated in the countryside during a storm. One of the men suddenly becomes aware that he once visited this mansion in a past life; he recounts a story about when he was Anand, a painter, who fell in love with a tribal girl named Madhumati.', 'Two men take shelter in a derelict mansion situated in the countryside during a storm. One of the men suddenly becomes aware that he once visited this mansion in a past life; he recounts a story about when he was Anand, a painter, who fell in love with a tribal girl named Madhumati.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrrQ69whukrcuuFi7Oo7PjBaJ2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168069'),
  ('561276033416022072', 'Madicken of June Hill', 1980, 'Comedy, Family', 'Göran Graffman, Jörgen Persson', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Jonna Liljendahl, Liv Alsterlund, Monica Nordquist, Björn Granath, Lis Nilheim, Birgitta Andersson, Allan Edwall, Yvonne Lombard', null, 'A second movie based on Astrid Lindgren''s novel "Madicken och Junibackens pims", which is about two sisters and their adventures in 1910s Sweden.', 'A second movie based on Astrid Lindgren''s novel "Madicken och Junibackens pims", which is about two sisters and their adventures in 1910s Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klRD7VUMwER6Ba9ZYBFDYP7jNv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8445'),
  ('151655697578513462', 'Madigan', 1968, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Don Siegel, Russell Metty, Joseph C. Cavalier', 'Howard Rodman, Abraham Polonsky', 'Richard Widmark, Henry Fonda, Inger Stevens, Harry Guardino, James Whitmore, Susan Clark, Michael Dunn, Steve Ihnat', 'NR', 'NYPD detectives Bonaro and Madigan lose their guns to fugitive Barney Benesch. As compensation, they are given a weekend to bring Benesch to justice. While they follow various leads, Police Commissioner Russell goes about his duties, including attending functions, meeting with aggrieved relatives, and counseling the spouses of fallen officers.', 'NYPD detectives Bonaro and Madigan lose their guns to fugitive Barney Benesch. As compensation, they are given a weekend to bring Benesch to justice. While they follow various leads, Police Commissioner Russell goes about his duties, including attending functions, meeting with aggrieved relatives, and counseling the spouses of fallen officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hj4AgOat5aQUVQfKOi2KNdmnCNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4931'),
  ('462952738521792720', 'Madison', 2005, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'William Bindley, James Glennon', 'William Bindley, Scott Bindley', 'Jim Caviezel, Jake Lloyd, Mary McCormack, Bruce Dern, Paul Dooley, Brent Briscoe, Mark Fauser, Matt Letscher', null, 'In 1971, air-conditioner repairman and boat enthusiast Jim McCormick entertains his desire to ''go down'' as a legend in the record books when the Gold Cup hydroplane boat race improbably comes to his small town of Madison, Indiana. Immediately, Jim seizes his opportunity to enter the contest. With a motley crew of fellow mechanics and friends at his side, Jim fixes up his old boat and brings hope to the blighted industrial city. Written by Sujit R. Varma', 'In 1971, air-conditioner repairman and boat enthusiast Jim McCormick entertains his desire to ''go down'' as a legend in the record books when the Gold Cup hydroplane boat race improbably comes to his small town of Madison, Indiana. Immediately, Jim seizes his opportunity to enter the contest. With a motley crew of fellow mechanics and friends at his side, Jim fixes up his old boat and brings hope to the blighted industrial city. Written by Sujit R. Varma', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlZUHqnwcOv5yPXW7BmguKedNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38717'),
  ('153517628798997106', 'Madison County', 2011, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Eric England, David Starks, Jordan Mears', 'Eric England', 'Colley Bailey, Matt Mercer, Ace Marrero, Joanna Motomura, Natalie Scheetz, Nick Principe, Adrienne Harrell, Dayton Knoll', null, 'A group of college kids travel to a small, mountain town called Madison County to interview the author of a tell-all book on the accounts of several grisly murders that happened there. But when the kids get to Madison County, the author is no where to be found and the towns people act like they haven''t seen him in years. They also say that the killer never existed and the murders never happened. However, when the kids start digging around to get their own answers, they find out that the stories maybe more real than the townspeople are letting on!', 'A group of college kids travel to a small, mountain town called Madison County to interview the author of a tell-all book on the accounts of several grisly murders that happened there. But when the kids get to Madison County, the author is no where to be found and the towns people act like they haven''t seen him in years. They also say that the killer never existed and the murders never happened. However, when the kids start digging around to get their own answers, they find out that the stories maybe more real than the townspeople are letting on!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zCC4BBXyxb9rsSfv1edBgfWXsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77785'),
  ('503926514373112086', 'Madly in Life', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jorge Piquer Rodríguez, Raphaël Balboni, Ann Sirot', 'Ann Sirot, Raphaël Balboni', 'Jo Deseure, Jean Le Peltier, Lucie Debay, Gilles Remiche, Estelle Marion, Vincent Lecuyer, Joëlle Franco, Annette Gatta', null, 'Alex and Noémie would like to have a child. But their plans are turned upside down when Alex''s mother, Suzanne, has contracted "semantic dementia", a fatal neurodegenerative disease that affects her behavior.', 'Alex and Noémie would like to have a child. But their plans are turned upside down when Alex''s mother, Suzanne, has contracted "semantic dementia", a fatal neurodegenerative disease that affects her behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avT4Dxca2meLYcD2ZjQl7sEUS1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747681'),
  ('768400182305216563', 'Madly in Love', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Danilo Desideri, Pipolo', 'Pipolo, Castellano', 'Adriano Celentano, Ornella Muti, Adolfo Celi, Milla Sannoner, Enzo Garinei, Corrado Olmi, Franco Diogene, Dino Cassio', null, 'Cristina is a rich, spoiled princess visiting Rome with her royal parents. The mission of their visit is to marry her off to a super-wealthy corporate type and thereby start to turn around the losses their small kingdom is experiencing in its casino business. These less-than-noble intentions get derailed when Barnaba, a zany bus driver enters their lives and falls madly in love with the gorgeous Cristina. He is nuts enough to succeed in this romantic chase after royalty, as love seems to fuel his determination to rid Cristina of her elitism and to make her see his own irrepressible attractions.', 'Cristina is a rich, spoiled princess visiting Rome with her royal parents. The mission of their visit is to marry her off to a super-wealthy corporate type and thereby start to turn around the losses their small kingdom is experiencing in its casino business. These less-than-noble intentions get derailed when Barnaba, a zany bus driver enters their lives and falls madly in love with the gorgeous Cristina. He is nuts enough to succeed in this romantic chase after royalty, as love seems to fuel his determination to rid Cristina of her elitism and to make her see his own irrepressible attractions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Mo9IKxv7XOMJrdVpWY0iZqPMhe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11441'),
  ('781074825912477254', 'Madly Madagascar', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'David Soren', 'David Soren', 'Ben Stiller, Chris Rock, David Schwimmer, Jada Pinkett Smith, Cedric the Entertainer, Andy Richter, Taraji P. Henson, Danny Jacobs', 'G', 'Your favorite Madagascar pals are back in an all-new adventure! Alex''s favorite holiday, Valentine''s Day, brings hilarious surprises and excitement for the entire gang. Melman plans a big surprise for Gloria, Marty tries to impress a new friend and everyone wants to get their hands on King Julien''s love potion. You''ll fall in LOVE with Madly Madagascar!', 'Your favorite Madagascar pals are back in an all-new adventure! Alex''s favorite holiday, Valentine''s Day, brings hilarious surprises and excitement for the entire gang. Melman plans a big surprise for Gloria, Marty tries to impress a new friend and everyone wants to get their hands on King Julien''s love potion. You''ll fall in LOVE with Madly Madagascar!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gajMxAW4lZg13x5XXUTB56RrcC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161143'),
  ('391227399817512416', 'Madman', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joe Giannone, James Lemmo, Mark Slater', 'Joe Giannone', 'Gaylen Ross, Tony Nunziata, Harriet Bass, Seth Jones, Jan Claire, Alexander Murphy Jr., Jimmy Steele, Carl Fredericks', 'R', 'Madman Marz, an old folklore legend who murdered his family before escaping into the woods, is inadvertently summoned to a campsite to finish the spree he started decades ago.', 'Madman Marz, an old folklore legend who murdered his family before escaping into the woods, is inadvertently summoned to a campsite to finish the spree he started decades ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pZxY7b22LicdcvWNMCyX8VseVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47957'),
  ('477074984801036173', 'Madman at War', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Giorgio Di Battista, Gianfrancesco Lazotti', 'Agenore Incrocci, Dino Risi, Furio Scarpelli', 'Coluche, Beppe Grillo, Bernard Blier, Fabio Testi, Claudio Bisio, Gianni Franco, Franco Diogene, Sandro Ghiani', null, 'A young psychiatrist struggles to remove an erratic captain from command at an Italian base in the Lybian desert during World War II.', 'A young psychiatrist struggles to remove an erratic captain from command at an Italian base in the Lybian desert during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqs05xHVqD9Wt50IUziHlj92SBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72279'),
  ('83513147415433470', 'Madness', 1980, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Enrico Lucidi, Fernando Di Leo', 'Fernando Di Leo', 'Joe Dallesandro, Patrizia Behn, Gianni Macchia, Lorraine De Selle, Omero Capanna', null, 'An escaped convicted murderer invades the cottage of a man, his wife and the wife''s sister, whereupon he proceeds to torment this already dysfunctional trio with rape and violence.', 'An escaped convicted murderer invades the cottage of a man, his wife and the wife''s sister, whereupon he proceeds to torment this already dysfunctional trio with rape and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gV0J0Fqw2mYMtQbzb0ruxv9MAeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28322'),
  ('1046305451993800723', 'Mado', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Sautet, Jean Boffety', 'Claude Néron, Claude Sautet', 'Michel Piccoli, Ottavia Piccolo, Romy Schneider, Jacques Dutronc, Julien Guiomar, Charles Denner, Claude Dauphin, Michel Aumont', null, 'A middle-aged businessman faces bankruptcy after his partner''s suicide and a rival''s unscrupulous offer to buy his company. Determined to avoid the trap, he finds an unexpected solution through a prostitute.', 'A middle-aged businessman faces bankruptcy after his partner''s suicide and a rival''s unscrupulous offer to buy his company. Determined to avoid the trap, he finds an unexpected solution through a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J7DbJx6h7cxGcshkJOKag4eq8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3424'),
  ('16433172541129852', 'Madonna and Child', 1980, 'Drama', 'Terence Davies, Kees Ryninks', 'Terence Davies', 'Terry O''Sullivan, Sheila Raynor, Paul Barber, John Meynell, Brian Ward, Dave Cooper, Mark Walton, Mal Jefferson', null, 'A middle-aged British man struggles to reconcile his homosexuality and his Catholic upbringing.', 'A middle-aged British man struggles to reconcile his homosexuality and his Catholic upbringing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQDgqGzh0NlhgwpsHMGgdCGJS86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48146'),
  ('21848011683607324', 'Madonna of the Seven Moons', 1945, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Arthur Crabtree', 'Roland Pertwee', 'Phyllis Calvert, Stewart Granger, Patricia Roc, Peter Glenville, John Stuart, Reginald Tate, Peter Murray-Hill, Dulcie Gray', 'NR', 'In the early part of this century, Maddelena a teenage Italian girl, is attacked whilst walking in the woods. The attack leaves her mentally scarred and our story flashes forward to the 1940s where Maddelena is still troubled. She disappears one day and her daughter vows to find her.', 'In the early part of this century, Maddelena a teenage Italian girl, is attacked whilst walking in the woods. The attack leaves her mentally scarred and our story flashes forward to the 1940s where Maddelena is still troubled. She disappears one day and her daughter vows to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQK3b2roOSsFIegKkI62iwadikJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81678'),
  ('855714315247910194', 'Madonna: Blond Ambition World Tour Live', 1990, 'Music', 'David Mallet, Mark Aldo Miceli', null, 'Madonna, Donna DeLory, Niki Haris, Luis Camacho, Oliver Crumes, Salim Gauwloos, Jose Guitierez, Kevin Alexander Stea', 'PG-13', 'Blond Ambition World Tour Live contains the final tour date recorded in Nice, France. The release had previously been shown and produced by American network HBO as a television special. In 1992, the LaserDisc release won the Best Music Video-Long Form category at the 34th Grammy Awards. The tour reached North America, Europe and Asia. It was a highly controversial tour, mainly for its juxtaposition of Catholic iconography and sexuality. Rolling Stone called it an "elaborately choreographed, sexually provocative extravaganza" and proclaimed it "the best tour of 1990."', 'Blond Ambition World Tour Live contains the final tour date recorded in Nice, France. The release had previously been shown and produced by American network HBO as a television special. In 1992, the LaserDisc release won the Best Music Video-Long Form category at the 34th Grammy Awards. The tour reached North America, Europe and Asia. It was a highly controversial tour, mainly for its juxtaposition of Catholic iconography and sexuality. Rolling Stone called it an "elaborately choreographed, sexually provocative extravaganza" and proclaimed it "the best tour of 1990."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlJOG0KqEw7hgRcWa7koK35dkRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40495'),
  ('518736958468068708', 'Madonna: Ciao, Italia! - Live from Italy', 1988, 'Music', 'Egbert van Hees, Jeffrey Hornaday, Mitchell Sinoway', null, 'Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Jai Winding, Jonathan Moffett, David Williams, James Harrah, Kerry Hatch, Luis Conte', null, 'In "Ciao, Italia! Live from Italy" Madonna visits the land of her noble heritage for this high-energy concert video filmed in 1987. It contained footage from a previous TV special of the Who''s That Girl World Tour, Madonna in Concerto, broadcast in Europe in 1987, filmed at the Stadio Comunale in Turin, Italy. The video release also contained footage from shows recorded in Florence, Italy and Tokyo, Japan. The tour supported her 1986 third studio album True Blue, as well as the 1987 soundtrack Who''s That Girl.', 'In "Ciao, Italia! Live from Italy" Madonna visits the land of her noble heritage for this high-energy concert video filmed in 1987. It contained footage from a previous TV special of the Who''s That Girl World Tour, Madonna in Concerto, broadcast in Europe in 1987, filmed at the Stadio Comunale in Turin, Italy. The video release also contained footage from shows recorded in Florence, Italy and Tokyo, Japan. The tour supported her 1986 third studio album True Blue, as well as the 1987 soundtrack Who''s That Girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1X3IKEwSNUrkUPTDdjXlqkHlzPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58629'),
  ('173348639864205081', 'Madonna: Madame X', 2021, 'Music', 'Nuno Xico, Sasha Kasiuha, Ricardo Gomes', 'Madonna', 'Madonna, Maluma, Gaspar Varela, Monte Pittman, Ahlamalik Williams, Marvin Gofin, Stella Mwale, Estere Mwale', null, 'Filmed in Lisbon, Portugal, the film captures the pop icon’s rare and rapturous tour performance, hailed by sold out theatrical audiences worldwide. The unprecedented intimate streaming experience will take viewers on a journey as compelling and audacious as Madonna’s fearless persona, Madame X, a secret agent traveling around the world, changing identities, fighting for freedom and bringing light to dark places.', 'Filmed in Lisbon, Portugal, the film captures the pop icon’s rare and rapturous tour performance, hailed by sold out theatrical audiences worldwide. The unprecedented intimate streaming experience will take viewers on a journey as compelling and audacious as Madonna’s fearless persona, Madame X, a secret agent traveling around the world, changing identities, fighting for freedom and bringing light to dark places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxwpJ6LsYesKJjVA2HRnZeo8OsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787864'),
  ('788150544672598700', 'Madonna: The Confessions Tour', 2006, 'Music', 'Jonas Åkerlund', null, 'Madonna, Stuart Price, Steve Sidelnyk, Monte Pittman, Marcus Brown, Donna DeLory, Nicki Richards, Isaac Sinwani', null, 'Filmed in its entirety at London''s Wembley Arena during her worldwide sold-out 25-city Confessions Tour (2006''s top-grossing tour world-wide), this concert film features songs from throughout the queen''s career but largely focuses on Confessions On A Dance Floor.', 'Filmed in its entirety at London''s Wembley Arena during her worldwide sold-out 25-city Confessions Tour (2006''s top-grossing tour world-wide), this concert film features songs from throughout the queen''s career but largely focuses on Confessions On A Dance Floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfvAKvFiAUGUgVAQI06ABCLNJtN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18527'),
  ('857848239050492040', 'Madonna: The Girlie Show - Live Down Under', 1993, 'Music', 'Mark Aldo Miceli, Toby Phillips', null, 'Madonna, Jai Winding, Michael Bearden, Mike McKnight, Paul Pesco, Omar Hakim, Luis Conte, Victor Bailey', 'R', 'Filmed at Sydney Cricket Ground on November 19, 1993, Live from Down Under showcases Madonna’s brilliant fourth concert tour, The Girlie Show.', 'Filmed at Sydney Cricket Ground on November 19, 1993, Live from Down Under showcases Madonna’s brilliant fourth concert tour, The Girlie Show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLsy6ggcklcurxUIYJxBjuNBqZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40496'),
  ('727282767405529656', 'Madonna: Truth or Dare', 1991, 'Music, Documentary', 'Robert Leacock, Christophe Lanzenberg, Alek Keshishian', null, 'Madonna, Donna DeLory, Niki Haris, Warren Beatty, Sandra Bernhard, Jean-Paul Gaultier, Luis Camacho, Jose Xtravaganza', 'R', 'From the rains of Japan, through threats of arrest for ''public indecency'' in Canada, and a birthday tribute to her father in Detroit, this documentary follows Madonna on her 1990 ''Blond Ambition'' concert tour. Filmed in black and white, with the concert pieces in glittering MTV color, it is an intimate look at the work of the icon, from a prayer circle before each performance to bed games with the dance troupe afterwards.', 'From the rains of Japan, through threats of arrest for ''public indecency'' in Canada, and a birthday tribute to her father in Detroit, this documentary follows Madonna on her 1990 ''Blond Ambition'' concert tour. Filmed in black and white, with the concert pieces in glittering MTV color, it is an intimate look at the work of the icon, from a prayer circle before each performance to bed games with the dance troupe afterwards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJHCqwDgS9MEhdChIkGn7QAUoyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10174'),
