  ('509161118410317316', 'Maestro', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Léa Fazer, Lucas Leconte', 'Jocelyn Quivrin, Léa Fazer', 'Pio Marmaï, Michael Lonsdale, Déborah François, Alice Belaïdi, Nicolas Bridet, Dominique Reymond, Micha Lescot, Scali Delpeyrat', null, 'Henry, a young actor, finds himself involved in a film by cinema superstar, Cédric Rovere. Charmed by his benevolence, feelings hitherto unknown are aroused, while Rovere, intrigued by Henry''s dream, lives this shoot as an unexpected gift.', 'Henry, a young actor, finds himself involved in a film by cinema superstar, Cédric Rovere. Charmed by his benevolence, feelings hitherto unknown are aroused, while Rovere, intrigued by Henry''s dream, lives this shoot as an unexpected gift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxMV3gVXXw9J2g3u4BRLKxF2AOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279550'),
  ('255590287644923381', 'Maestro', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Matthew Libatique, Michele Ziegler, Xanthus Valan', 'Bradley Cooper, Josh Singer', 'Carey Mulligan, Bradley Cooper, Matt Bomer, Vincenzo Amato, Greg Hildreth, Michael Urie, Brian Klugman, Nick Blaemire', 'R', 'A towering and fearless love story chronicling the lifelong relationship between Leonard Bernstein and Felicia Montealegre Cohn Bernstein. A love letter to life and art, Maestro at its core is an emotionally epic portrayal of family and love.', 'A towering and fearless love story chronicling the lifelong relationship between Leonard Bernstein and Felicia Montealegre Cohn Bernstein. A love letter to life and art, Maestro at its core is an emotionally epic portrayal of family and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxj7rMco6RNYsVcNwuGAIlfWu64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523607'),
  ('229202113306010787', 'Maestro(s)', 2022, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Sonia Leval, Bruno Chiche, Denis Rouden', 'Yaël Langmann, Cécilia Rouaud, Bruno Chiche', 'Yvan Attal, Pascale Arbillot, Miou-Miou, Pierre Arditi, Caroline Anglade, Thomas Lemoine, Anaëlle Othenin-Girard, Clément Giren', null, 'The Dunars are conductors from father to son. François'' long and brilliant international career come to an end, whereas Denis has just won an umpteenth classical music award. When François is chosen to be the head of the Scala, his ultimate dream, he can''t believe it. Happy at first for his father, Denis quickly become disillusioned when he discovers that he was, in fact, chosen to go to Milan.', 'The Dunars are conductors from father to son. François'' long and brilliant international career come to an end, whereas Denis has just won an umpteenth classical music award. When François is chosen to be the head of the Scala, his ultimate dream, he can''t believe it. Happy at first for his father, Denis quickly become disillusioned when he discovers that he was, in fact, chosen to go to Milan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXpdVFtxDVXKWLCtxrwHVTU2Frs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960275'),
  ('693054349757170804', 'Mafalda: The Movie', 1982, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Carlos Márquez', 'Alberto Cabado, Joaquin Lavado', 'Susana Klein, Cecilia Gispert, Nelly Hering, Oscar Silva, Cecilia Gispert, Paqui Balaguer', null, 'Mafalda is an exceptional child, since her curiosity, world view and existential consciousness are broader than those of almost all human beings.', 'Mafalda is an exceptional child, since her curiosity, world view and existential consciousness are broader than those of almost all human beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI8vSACXbcHCE7q3AMNbExqXsEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53074'),
  ('1026060289916518029', 'Mafia & Red Tomatoes', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Giulio Manfredonia, Marcello Montarsi', 'Giulio Manfredonia, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Stefano Accorsi, Sergio Rubini, Iaia Forte, Maria Rosaria Russo, Nicola Rignanese, Bebo Storti, Debora Caprioglio', null, 'In Puglia, a cooperative wants to farm the land confiscated from a Mafioso, as it is legally entitled to do. But things are moving slowly. So the members of the cooperative turn to Filippo, who belongs to an anti-mafia organisation with its headquarters in the north. Filippo arrives in Puglia and realises that everyone, starting with the carabinieri, is taking huge liberties with the law.', 'In Puglia, a cooperative wants to farm the land confiscated from a Mafioso, as it is legally entitled to do. But things are moving slowly. So the members of the cooperative turn to Filippo, who belongs to an anti-mafia organisation with its headquarters in the north. Filippo arrives in Puglia and realises that everyone, starting with the carabinieri, is taking huge liberties with the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWmpMZEtmDVokJBc1qiQYXFM7eb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293516'),
  ('843197113357871966', 'Máfia de Pelúcia', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Martín Escriche', 'Martín Escriche, Fernando Colaço, Lautaro Núñez de Arco, Gabriel Penna', 'Rodrigo Caetano, Alexandre Paz, Alejandro Hernandez', null, 'Máfia de Pelúcia (2026) released on March 12, 2026 starring Rodrigo Caetano, Alejandro Hernandez, Alexandre Paz and directed by Martín Escriche. Get notified when Máfia de Pelúcia is available to stream!', 'Máfia de Pelúcia (2026) released on March 12, 2026 starring Rodrigo Caetano, Alejandro Hernandez, Alexandre Paz and directed by Martín Escriche. Get notified when Máfia de Pelúcia is available to stream!', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:mafia-de-pelucia-2026'),
  ('837132195898391937', 'Mafia Inc.', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Podz, Steve Cosens, Nathalie Boutrie', 'Sylvain Guy', 'Sergio Castellitto, Marc-André Grondin, Gilbert Sicotte, Mylène Mackay, Donny Falsetti, Tony Nardi, Cristina Rosato, Michael Ricci', null, 'The Gamache, tailors from father to son, have been dressing the Mafia family Paternò for three generation. Vincent "Vince" Gamache works on behalf of Frank the godfather with his eldest son Giaco. Vince, reckless and rash, seeks to earn his stripes by impressing the godfather. Without the Paternò knowing, he stages a big operation and is promoted. Fuming with jealousy, Giaco discovers that Vince committed a monstrous act during his stroke. The Gamache disown Vince and war begins.', 'The Gamache, tailors from father to son, have been dressing the Mafia family Paternò for three generation. Vincent "Vince" Gamache works on behalf of Frank the godfather with his eldest son Giaco. Vince, reckless and rash, seeks to earn his stripes by impressing the godfather. Without the Paternò knowing, he stages a big operation and is promoted. Fuming with jealousy, Giaco discovers that Vince committed a monstrous act during his stroke. The Gamache disown Vince and war begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pR13xCDg2faAfhuU2UwFImqQmBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622469'),
  ('911238021835083616', 'Mafia Is Not What It Used to Be', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Giuliano La Franca, Ugo Polizzi, Franco Maresco', 'Claudia Uzzo, Francesco Guttuso, Franco Maresco', 'Franco Maresco, Letizia Battaglia, Ciccio Mira, Matteo Mannino, Cristian Miscel, Franco Zecchin, Attilio Bolzoni, Davide Chianello', null, 'Palermo, Sicily, Italy, 2017. Twenty-five years after the murders of anti-mafia judges Giovanni Falcone, on May 23, 1992, and Paolo Borsellino, on July 19, 1992; and on the occasion of the tributes held in memory of both heroes, skeptical photographer Letizia Battaglia, chronicler of their titanic combat, criticizes the opportunism of shady characters who, like businessman Ciccio Mira, profit from the commemoration of both tragedies.', 'Palermo, Sicily, Italy, 2017. Twenty-five years after the murders of anti-mafia judges Giovanni Falcone, on May 23, 1992, and Paolo Borsellino, on July 19, 1992; and on the occasion of the tributes held in memory of both heroes, skeptical photographer Letizia Battaglia, chronicler of their titanic combat, criticizes the opportunism of shady characters who, like businessman Ciccio Mira, profit from the commemoration of both tragedies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MTBUSLpQFXuV0udVOTXE0aQeGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618215'),
  ('696643844383760451', 'Mafia Junction', 1973, 'Action', 'Jack Hildyard, Massimo Dallamano', 'Massimo Dallamano, Ross MacKenzie', 'Ivan Rassimov, Stephanie Beacham, Patricia Hayes, Ettore Manni, Luciano Catenacci, Verna Harvey, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Cec Linder', 'R', 'Cliff works as a narcotics investigator for the police and infiltrate a mafia gang. Soon it turns out that Cliff has bigger plans than just to bust bad guys.', 'Cliff works as a narcotics investigator for the police and infiltrate a mafia gang. Soon it turns out that Cliff has bigger plans than just to bust bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3yurnJHi28ajDc39hWdx7tmR2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104334'),
  ('864604365874440462', 'Mafia Mamma', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Patrick Murguia, Alessandro Cardilli', 'Debbie Jhoon, J. Michael Feldman', 'Toni Collette, Monica Bellucci, Sophia Nomvete, Alessandro Bressanello, Eduardo Scarpetta, Tommy Rodger, Giulio Maria Corso, Francesco Mastroianni', 'R', 'A suburban American woman inherits her grandfather’s Mafia empire and, guided by the Firm’s trusted consigliere, defies everyone’s expectations, including her own, as the new head of the family business.', 'A suburban American woman inherits her grandfather’s Mafia empire and, guided by the Firm’s trusted consigliere, defies everyone’s expectations, including her own, as the new head of the family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqFZqZFWWEDRCTtbTJqvrIitEKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809787'),
  ('490120858192103377', 'Mafia Millionaires', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alessandro Piva, Renaud Personnaz, Dino Giarrusso', 'Alessandro Piva', 'Francesco Scianna, Valentina Lodovini, Carmine Recano, Francesco Di Leva, Salvatore Striano, Gianfranco Gallo, Vincenzo Pirozzi, Ivan Castiglione', null, 'The rise and fall of a Neapolitan criminal clan through the story of a boss and his family, divided between the aspiration for a bourgeois life and the deep impulses of oppression. Thirty years of history of one of the most beautiful and discussed cities in the world, the dream of a boy who is overwhelmed by the desire for power as an end in itself, to become the nightmare of a man and those who live next to him.', 'The rise and fall of a Neapolitan criminal clan through the story of a boss and his family, divided between the aspiration for a bourgeois life and the deep impulses of oppression. Thirty years of history of one of the most beautiful and discussed cities in the world, the dream of a boy who is overwhelmed by the desire for power as an end in itself, to become the nightmare of a man and those who live next to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FhzqtJOT22i0igmkxwhERQSuz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298457'),
  ('428519334220965538', 'Mafia Wars', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Scott Windhauser', 'Scott Windhauser', 'Tom Welling, Cam Gigandet, Cher Cosenza, Chris Mullinax, Alessia Alciati, Davide Cincis, Al Linea, Sidhartha Mallya', 'R', 'An ex-con gets released early from prison only to be forced into an undercover unit of six men and on his first day the other five are all killed. Now he must face the men who he was tasked to spy on.', 'An ex-con gets released early from prison only to be forced into an undercover unit of six men and on his first day the other five are all killed. Now he must face the men who he was tasked to spy on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usQlA0Xya4HbHjkg6F5k5fqQO7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273487'),
  ('82405060611652417', 'Mafia: Survival Game', 2016, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Sarik Andreasyan, Alexey Smolyar, Anton Zenkovich', 'Andrey Gavrilov', 'Viktor Verzhbitskiy, Venyamin Smekhov, Vyacheslav Razbegaev, Olga Tumaykina, Andrey Chadov, Yuriy Chursin, Violetta Getmanskaya, Artem Suchkov', null, 'A twist on the classic game of Mafia. 12 competitors take part in a game of life and death where the innocent must take out the Mafia in order to win the cash prize. Those that are voted out must face their biggest fears in a computer simulation.', 'A twist on the classic game of Mafia. 12 competitors take part in a game of life and death where the innocent must take out the Mafia in order to win the cash prize. Those that are voted out must face their biggest fears in a computer simulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fApl3x5biYZ9dE16wXCPlArj7R9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375108'),
  ('785453477516801516', 'Mafioso', 1962, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Alberto Lattuada, Aldo D''Angelo, Vana Caruso', 'Furio Scarpelli, Rafael Azcona, Marco Ferreri', 'Alberto Sordi, Norma Bengell, Carmelo Oliviero, Gabriella Conti, Ugo Attanasio, Cinzia Bruno, Katiusca Piretti, Lilly Bistrattin', 'NR', 'When a good-natured factory supervisor living in Milan with his Northern wife returns to his native Sicily, a decades'' old oath forces him to fulfill a nightmarish obligation.', 'When a good-natured factory supervisor living in Milan with his Northern wife returns to his native Sicily, a decades'' old oath forces him to fulfill a nightmarish obligation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36abgVBo67TI2rPEIWqMRh3oQ1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34866'),
  ('99397995934918185', 'Mag Mag', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror, Drama', 'Yuriyan Retriever, Hideki Shima, Shinya Masuda', 'Eisuke Naito', 'Sara Minami, Aoi Yamada, Oshirō Maeda, Akari Takaishi, Takumi Saitoh', null, 'After her beloved is killed by the Mag Mag ghost, the protagonist, Sanae, vows revenge, but soon discovers the true identity of the person she truly owes her revenge to.', 'After her beloved is killed by the Mag Mag ghost, the protagonist, Sanae, vows revenge, but soon discovers the true identity of the person she truly owes her revenge to.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4XqjJ4iobn199K9Ox1rUREjV8lN.jpg', 'plex:movie:mag-mag-2026'),
  ('194898805852622051', 'Magadheera', 2009, 'Action', 'S. S. Rajamouli', 'Vijayendra Prasad, S. S. Rajamouli', 'Ram Charan, Kajal Aggarwal, Dev Gill, Srihari, Sunil Varma, Surya Bhagawan Das, Chatrapathi Sekhar, Sarath Babu', 'PG', 'A street-bike racer chances upon a woman and is struck by visions of a past life where they were both star-crossed lovers in a war-ridden kingdom 400 years ago, while the reincarnation of his romantic rival emerges with murderous intent.', 'A street-bike racer chances upon a woman and is struck by visions of a past life where they were both star-crossed lovers in a war-ridden kingdom 400 years ago, while the reincarnation of his romantic rival emerges with murderous intent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xK7MEV56GF291VG0U5XnVJuvNv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23790'),
  ('562537437180252316', 'Magallanes', 2015, 'Drama', 'Salvador del Solar, Pamela Livia Delgado, Diego Jiménez', 'Salvador del Solar', 'Damián Alcázar, Magaly Solier, Federico Luppi, Christian Meier, Bruno Odar, Tatiana Astengo, Nicolás Galindo, Tatiana Espinoza', null, 'Magallanes sees his humdrum life turn upside down the day Celina, a women he met in the violent years when he was a soldier with the Peruvian Army, jumps into his taxi in a Lima street. This unexpected re-encounter after 25 years with the dark past that unites them prompts Magallanes to embark on a daring plan to help Celina get money and find his own redemption.', 'Magallanes sees his humdrum life turn upside down the day Celina, a women he met in the violent years when he was a soldier with the Peruvian Army, jumps into his taxi in a Lima street. This unexpected re-encounter after 25 years with the dark past that unites them prompts Magallanes to embark on a daring plan to help Celina get money and find his own redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVzC42W7RLWJIOXxRJPgYDTovKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306838'),
  ('113425904767360178', 'Magari resto', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Mario Parruccini, Mario Parruccini', 'Alfonso Santaniello, Patrizio Trecca, Mario Parruccini', 'Enrico Lo Verso, Valentina Corti, Pietro De Silva, Veronica Maya, Noemi Giangrande, Emiliano De Martino, Rosaria De Cicco, Giovanni del Monte', null, 'In the splendid setting of the Cilento, Francesca is preparing for her wedding but feels that something in her life is not quite right. Surrounded by her longtime friends, with wedding preparations in full swing, she begins to ask herself important questions and to look for answers where she has always built her most solid certitudes, as ever finding help from her counsellor, Don Fabio. She will end up stumbling on a truth that will completely subvert the tidiness of her life, questioning her tenets, only to realize she is ready to find herself.', 'In the splendid setting of the Cilento, Francesca is preparing for her wedding but feels that something in her life is not quite right. Surrounded by her longtime friends, with wedding preparations in full swing, she begins to ask herself important questions and to look for answers where she has always built her most solid certitudes, as ever finding help from her counsellor, Don Fabio. She will end up stumbling on a truth that will completely subvert the tidiness of her life, questioning her tenets, only to realize she is ready to find herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2BItOH2Dex6ExypexKTn6JjPpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738256'),
  ('295166752484066444', 'Magazine Dreams', 2025, 'Drama', 'Matthias Schubert, Adam Arkapaw, Christopher S. Bryson', 'Elijah Bynum', 'Jonathan Majors, Haley Bennett, Taylour Paige, Harrison Page, Harriet Sansom Harris, Mike O''Hearn, Bradley Stryker, Craig Cackowski', 'R', 'Aspiring bodybuilder Killian Maddox struggles to find human connection in an exploration of celebrity and violence. Nothing deters him from his fiercely protected dream of superstardom, not even the doctors who warn him of the permanent damage he causes to himself with his quest.', 'Aspiring bodybuilder Killian Maddox struggles to find human connection in an exploration of celebrity and violence. Nothing deters him from his fiercely protected dream of superstardom, not even the doctors who warn him of the permanent damage he causes to himself with his quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSidx9NHKuQIPEQ4yI9b9zkTeh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784524'),
  ('195872106385319503', 'Magdana''s Donkey', 1955, 'Drama', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Rezo Chkheidze', 'Karlo Gogodze', 'Dudukhana Tserodze, Liana Moistsrapishvili, Mikho Borashvili, Nani Chikvinidze, Akaki Kvantaliani, Karlo Sakandelidze, Akaki Vasadze, Aleqsandre Omiadze', null, 'This chamber drama is set in Georgia on the turn of the 19th and 20th centuries. A simple peasant family makes its living by selling yogurt which the Magdany widow takes every morning to the town market. Once, in their mother’s absence, the children – six-year-old Mikho and three-year-old Kato – found an abandoned donkey on a road leading to their village. The foundling was fed, tended, and the moment the donkey opened its big, tender eyes, it was named “Lurdja”, which means “blue-eyed”. Surrounded by love and care, the donkey became a big help in the poor household. But this idyll was not to last long…', 'This chamber drama is set in Georgia on the turn of the 19th and 20th centuries. A simple peasant family makes its living by selling yogurt which the Magdany widow takes every morning to the town market. Once, in their mother’s absence, the children – six-year-old Mikho and three-year-old Kato – found an abandoned donkey on a road leading to their village. The foundling was fed, tended, and the moment the donkey opened its big, tender eyes, it was named “Lurdja”, which means “blue-eyed”. Surrounded by love and care, the donkey became a big help in the poor household. But this idyll was not to last long…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prWrhOYDcCEcA2rU0GAjSXOTQGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148933'),
  ('266409458587182344', 'Magellan', 2017, 'Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Rob York, Elliot York', 'Rob York, Scott Baird', 'Brandon Ray Olive, K. Danor Gerald, D.L. Walker, Matthew Mercer, Nicola Posener, Whitney Palmer, Jim Horning, Demetrius Daniels', null, 'After NASA picks up a trio of mysterious signals from within our own solar system, astronaut Roger Nelson is dispatched on a multi-year solo mission aboard the Magellan spacecraft to investigate the sources.', 'After NASA picks up a trio of mysterious signals from within our own solar system, astronaut Roger Nelson is dispatched on a multi-year solo mission aboard the Magellan spacecraft to investigate the sources.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtdhkxH8JVwauuGBxkt4YLA0wJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406240'),
  ('658730201105106794', 'Magellan', 2025, 'History, Adventure, Drama', 'Lav Diaz, Artur Tort, Lav Diaz', 'Lav Diaz', 'Gael García Bernal, Amado Arjay Babon, Ronnie Lazaro, Ângela Ramos, Dario Yazbek Bernal, Tomás Alves, Bong Cabrera, Hazel Orencio', 'NR', 'At the dawn of the modern era, Portuguese explorer Ferdinand Magellan leads an expedition under the Spanish crown in search of the first westward route to the Spice Islands. He embarks on a perilous journey across the uncharted Pacific, where his fleet faces starvation, mutiny, and the psychological toll of endless seas. Upon reaching the shores of Cebu, Magellan is pulled into a fatal conflict with the natives by his drive to spread Catholicism, culminating in his tragic doom.', 'At the dawn of the modern era, Portuguese explorer Ferdinand Magellan leads an expedition under the Spanish crown in search of the first westward route to the Spice Islands. He embarks on a perilous journey across the uncharted Pacific, where his fleet faces starvation, mutiny, and the psychological toll of endless seas. Upon reaching the shores of Cebu, Magellan is pulled into a fatal conflict with the natives by his drive to spread Catholicism, culminating in his tragic doom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmFeUueU7BWLVnHrYI1FD7VnxtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975335'),
  ('828355504705604343', 'Magellan: At the Gates of Death, Part I: The Red Gate I, 0', 1976, null, 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'An experimental short film from the Gates of Death series by Hollis Frampton.', 'An experimental short film from the Gates of Death series by Hollis Frampton.', null, 'tmdb:movie:166712'),
  ('476395604360367522', 'Maggie', 2015, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Henry Hobson, Lukas Ettlin, Julie Ziah', 'John Scott', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Abigail Breslin, Joely Richardson, Douglas M. Griffin, J.D. Evermore, Rachel Whitman Groves, Jodie Moore, Bryce Romero', 'PG-13', 'There''s a deadly zombie epidemic threatening humanity, but Wade, a small-town farmer and family man, refuses to accept defeat even when his daughter Maggie becomes infected. As Maggie''s condition worsens and the authorities seek to eradicate those with the virus, Wade is pushed to the limits in an effort to protect her. Joely Richardson co-stars in this post-apocalyptic thriller.', 'There''s a deadly zombie epidemic threatening humanity, but Wade, a small-town farmer and family man, refuses to accept defeat even when his daughter Maggie becomes infected. As Maggie''s condition worsens and the authorities seek to eradicate those with the virus, Wade is pushed to the limits in an effort to protect her. Joely Richardson co-stars in this post-apocalyptic thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twa9gXjocLM629sJrQYVtmF306R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287424'),
  ('666545132841859418', 'Maggie', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oh Sung-taek, Yi Ok-seop, Lee Jae-woo', 'Yi Ok-seop, Koo Kyo-hwan', 'Lee Joo-young, Koo Kyo-hwan, Moon So-ri, Chun Woo-hee, Park Kyung-hye, Park Jong-hwan, Kwon Hae-hyo, Kim Kkob-bi', null, 'A couple''s hospital tryst is caught on X-Ray. Thinking she and her boyfriend are the ones in the compromising radiograph, nurse Yoon-young goes in the next day to resign only to find that everyone has called in sick except the head doctor.', 'A couple''s hospital tryst is caught on X-Ray. Thinking she and her boyfriend are the ones in the compromising radiograph, nurse Yoon-young goes in the next day to resign only to find that everyone has called in sick except the head doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6p2C6HlFY8cKZQDTvVu2ppQnocV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546768'),
  ('416949693936818972', 'Maggie Moore(s)', 2023, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'W. Mott Hupfel III, R. Eric Braun, Ian Simon', 'Paul Bernbaum', 'Jon Hamm, Tina Fey, Micah Stock, Nick Mohammed, Happy Anderson, Louisa Krause, Mary Holland, Derek Basco', 'R', 'Bizarre back-to-back murders in an otherwise quiet Arizona desert town has rattled local Police Chief Jordan Sanders. The two dead women have no connection to each other – except they’re both named Maggie Moore. While unravelling a web of small-town lies and mysteries, the investigation gets even more complicated when Sanders begins a romantic relationship with one of the murdered women''s neighbor, Rita.', 'Bizarre back-to-back murders in an otherwise quiet Arizona desert town has rattled local Police Chief Jordan Sanders. The two dead women have no connection to each other – except they’re both named Maggie Moore. While unravelling a web of small-town lies and mysteries, the investigation gets even more complicated when Sanders begins a romantic relationship with one of the murdered women''s neighbor, Rita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IY1n6UQnjNImEToEDTW924EUAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800089'),
  ('414502845251874427', 'Maggie Simpson in "Playdate with Destiny"', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'David Silverman, Eric Koenig', 'Tom Gammill, Matt Groening, Max Pross', 'Chris Edgerly', 'G', 'When Maggie Simpson is rescued by a cute young baby from playground peril, it''s girl meets boy, girl loses boy, guess what happens next?', 'When Maggie Simpson is rescued by a cute young baby from playground peril, it''s girl meets boy, girl loses boy, guess what happens next?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6fgOq7wPKujibXGWYlcIBgkcwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673595'),
  ('711603556294535067', 'Maggie Simpson in "Rogue Not Quite One"', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'David Silverman', 'Al Jean, Ryan Koh, Loni Steele Sosthand', 'Hank Azaria, Chris Edgerly, Dawnn Lewis', 'PG', 'On their way to daycare, Homer loses track of Maggie who hops in Grogu''s hovering pram for a hyperspace-hopping adventure across the galaxy. Facing a squadron of Imperial TIE fighters, Maggie brings the battle to Springfield in this epic short celebrating all things Star Wars.', 'On their way to daycare, Homer loses track of Maggie who hops in Grogu''s hovering pram for a hyperspace-hopping adventure across the galaxy. Facing a squadron of Imperial TIE fighters, Maggie brings the battle to Springfield in this epic short celebrating all things Star Wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmTOhwzcSbEGG3xKRfQwwS2BTXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121116'),
  ('989770830850121633', 'Maggie Simpson in "The Force Awakens from Its Nap"', 2021, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'David Silverman', 'Joel H. Cohen, Al Jean, Michael Price', null, 'PG', 'In a daycare far, far away… but still in Springfield, Maggie is on an epic quest for her stolen pacifier. Her adventure brings her face-to-face with young Padawans, Sith Lords, familiar droids, Rebel scum, and an ultimate battle against the dark side, in this original short celebrating the Star Wars galaxy.', 'In a daycare far, far away… but still in Springfield, Maggie is on an epic quest for her stolen pacifier. Her adventure brings her face-to-face with young Padawans, Sith Lords, familiar droids, Rebel scum, and an ultimate battle against the dark side, in this original short celebrating the Star Wars galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ou1cuRaV22FbDq8oEZeyR6C6P6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:825597'),
  ('1034112542093767720', 'Maggie Simpson in "The Longest Daycare"', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'David Silverman, Oscar Cervantes, Matthew Schofield', 'James L. Brooks, Matt Groening, Al Jean', null, 'PG', 'Maggie must navigate an eventful first day in daycare. At the Ayn Rand School for Tots, Maggie is diagnosed with average intelligence. Barred from the gifted children, she longs to escape from her glue-guzzling classmates. But when a lonely caterpillar befriends her, she makes it her mission to save it from a ruthless butterfly smashing toddler.', 'Maggie must navigate an eventful first day in daycare. At the Ayn Rand School for Tots, Maggie is diagnosed with average intelligence. Barred from the gifted children, she longs to escape from her glue-guzzling classmates. But when a lonely caterpillar befriends her, she makes it her mission to save it from a ruthless butterfly smashing toddler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6db4Dzg3GmlQxbUrJCDhcbMvMxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116440'),
  ('1127579548486542084', 'Maggie''s Plan', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Rebecca Miller, Sam Levy, Jessica Hong', 'Rebecca Miller', 'Greta Gerwig, Ethan Hawke, Julianne Moore, Bill Hader, Maya Rudolph, Travis Fimmel, Mina Sundwall, Jackson Frazer', 'R', 'Maggie''s plan to have a baby on her own with a sperm donor is derailed when she falls in love with John, an older married professor, destroying his volatile marriage to the brilliant and impossible Georgette. But three years later, married to John with one daughter, Maggie is out of love and in a quandary: what do you do when you suspect your man and his ex-wife are actually perfect for each other?', 'Maggie''s plan to have a baby on her own with a sperm donor is derailed when she falls in love with John, an older married professor, destroying his volatile marriage to the brilliant and impossible Georgette. But three years later, married to John with one daughter, Maggie is out of love and in a quandary: what do you do when you suspect your man and his ex-wife are actually perfect for each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irz7aLl87kGnwzdHoYs4iObLdFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312669'),
  ('44749332551115239', 'Magi', 2016, 'Horror', 'Hasan Karacadağ', 'Hasan Karacadağ', 'Michael Madsen, Stephen Baldwin, Brianne Davis, Lucie Pohl, Dragan Mićanović, Kenan Ece, Eminé Meyrem, Can Girgin', null, 'Olivia, A New York-based journalist travels to Turkey when she receives news that her sister Marla is pregnant. Marla recently ended a relationship but decides to keep the baby and that''s when sinister things begin to occur.', 'Olivia, A New York-based journalist travels to Turkey when she receives news that her sister Marla is pregnant. Marla recently ended a relationship but decides to keep the baby and that''s when sinister things begin to occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8qVPfvww6DPafD0QdC2pfNSSmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395955'),
  ('1134297999067684414', 'Magic', 1978, 'Drama, Horror', 'Richard Attenborough, Victor J. Kemper, Mike Haley', 'William Goldman', 'Anthony Hopkins, Ann-Margret, Burgess Meredith, Ed Lauter, E.J. André, Jerry Houser, David Ogden Stiers, Lillian Randolph', 'R', 'A ventriloquist is at the mercy of his vicious dummy while he tries to renew a romance with his high school sweetheart.', 'A ventriloquist is at the mercy of his vicious dummy while he tries to renew a romance with his high school sweetheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edxr6rPbpLh1V6dTiMIiyHNKRi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34193'),
  ('1043352106708139055', 'Magic', 2026, null, 'Ravindra Vijaya Karmarkar, Kedar Phadke', 'Ravindra Vijaya Karmarkar, Abhishek Deshmukh, Yogesh Vinayak Joshi', 'Jui Bhagwat, Nitin Bhajan, Pradeep Doiphode, Jitendra Joshi, Siddhirupa Karmakar', null, 'Magic is a dark psychological thriller about guilt that refuses to stay silent. One mistake. Endless consequences. A magical loop that won''t break.', 'Magic is a dark psychological thriller about guilt that refuses to stay silent. One mistake. Endless consequences. A magical loop that won''t break.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:magic-2026'),
  ('290062512120108231', 'Magic Arch', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Vasily Rovensky, Natalya Nilova', 'Alec Sokolow', 'Stephen Thomas Ochsner, Daniil Medvedev, Liza Klimova, Bruce Grant, David Grout, Jacqueline Efremova, Daniel Barnes, Timothy Sell', null, 'A young dolphin with an active imagination saves Fish Town from evil Moray Eels and reunites with his father after discovering a magic arch that makes wishes come true.', 'A young dolphin with an active imagination saves Fish Town from evil Moray Eels and reunites with his father after discovering a magic arch that makes wishes come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnDhw5nudk4RfiV1Fxn3QXV3HuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663451'),
  ('698949399467814779', 'Magic Beyond Words: The J.K. Rowling Story', 2011, 'Drama', 'Paul A. Kaufman, Mathias Herndl', 'Tony Caballero, Jeffrey Berman', 'Poppy Montgomery, Emily Holmes, Antonio Cupo, Janet Kidder, Madison Desjarlais, Andy Maton, Aislyn Watson, Marie West', 'PG-13', 'A look at J.K. Rowling from her humble beginnings as an imaginative young girl and awkward teenager, to the loss of her mother and the genesis of the Harry Potter book series.', 'A look at J.K. Rowling from her humble beginnings as an imaginative young girl and awkward teenager, to the loss of her mother and the genesis of the Harry Potter book series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8luhZ3kQ2XfCwdgGqSjuTzf8HB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80530'),
  ('349753735281902128', 'Magic Boy', 1959, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Akira Daikuhara, Taiji Yabushita', 'Michihei Muramatsu', 'Katsuo Nakamura, Hiroko Sakuramachi, Teruo Miyazaki, Tomoko Matsushima, Kenji Susukida, Harue Akagi, Yoshio Yoshida, Shunji Sakai', 'G', 'Magically gifted boy Sasuke lives in peace, deep in the forest with his animal pals and Oyu, his elder sister. After their forest sanctuary is violated by a demon witch who devours one of Sasuke''s animal companions, he vows vengeance. Leaving the forest, he sets out to master his magical gifts, making a pilgrimage to the home of the wizard Hakuunsai. While Sasuke learns the ways of magic, the demon witch terrorizes the countryside, and Sasuke works to complete his training in time.', 'Magically gifted boy Sasuke lives in peace, deep in the forest with his animal pals and Oyu, his elder sister. After their forest sanctuary is violated by a demon witch who devours one of Sasuke''s animal companions, he vows vengeance. Leaving the forest, he sets out to master his magical gifts, making a pilgrimage to the home of the wizard Hakuunsai. While Sasuke learns the ways of magic, the demon witch terrorizes the countryside, and Sasuke works to complete his training in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukrOk3p9JkJikPKgye3FHjD88GH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63486'),
  ('17909314158973390', 'Magic Camp', 2020, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mark Waters, Marci Liroff, Theo van de Sande', 'Max Winkler, Matt Spicer, Micah Fitzerman-Blue', 'Adam Devine, Jeffrey Tambor, Gillian Jacobs, Nathaniel Logan McIntyre, Cole Sand, Isabella Crovetti, Josie Totah, Izabella Alvarez', 'PG', 'Andy, at the urging of his former mentor and Magic Camp owner Roy Preston, returns to the camp of his youth hoping to reignite his career. Instead, he finds inspiration in his ragtag bunch of rookie magicians.', 'Andy, at the urging of his former mentor and Magic Camp owner Roy Preston, returns to the camp of his youth hoping to reignite his career. Instead, he finds inspiration in his ragtag bunch of rookie magicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awcPLFFYjufRXd2oAAP6ZIXF9vM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454433'),
  ('1108420130202150175', 'Magic Candies', 2025, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Daisuke Nishio', 'Ichiro Takano', 'Haruto Shima, Hiroshi Iwasaki, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Ikkei Watanabe, Sakiko Uran', null, 'The other kids never ask Dong-Dong to play, but he’s fine just playing marbles on his own. Until one day, he buys a bag of colorful candies and begins to discover new voices and perspectives.', 'The other kids never ask Dong-Dong to play, but he’s fine just playing marbles on his own. Until one day, he buys a bag of colorful candies and begins to discover new voices and perspectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kaWCY3pUNG7lHmjL6GM8FtATrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249728'),
  ('784158708302271268', 'Magic Carpet Ride', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Uğur İçbak', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Tolga Çevik, Demet Akbağ, Altan Erkekli, Özgü Namal, Erdal Tosun, Tuncer Salman, Öner Erkan', null, 'A struggling, suicidal young comedian meets a car thief who is willing to teach him a few things about his profession.', 'A struggling, suicidal young comedian meets a car thief who is willing to teach him a few things about his profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hydImnaVkVv6PinLMzozFiPP1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30634'),
  ('84788958023895242', 'Magic Cop', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Stephen Tung Wai, Raymond Lam Fai-Tai', 'Sam Chi-Leung, Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Lam Ching-Ying, Wilson Lam Chun-Yin, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Wong Mei-Wah, Wu Ma, Michiko Nishiwaki, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Frankie Chan Chi-Leung', null, 'A Taoist former cop is called to Hong Kong to assist in the investigation of of a series of strange murders. Aided by two local officers, he runs afoul of an evil sorceress.', 'A Taoist former cop is called to Hong Kong to assist in the investigation of of a series of strange murders. Aided by two local officers, he runs afoul of an evil sorceress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvRCQkDUmNzaTxUiVqeBiyWLGgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67346'),
  ('1124088753234297445', 'Magic Crystal', 1986, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Wong Jing', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Cynthia Rothrock, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Bin Bin, Wong Jing, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Sharla Cheung, Phillip Ko Fai', null, 'Archaeologist Shum finds an antique jade with supernatural power in Greece. The stone is wanted both by KGB''s agent Karoff and the Interpol. Shum asks his friend Nike for help. However, Shum is finally caught by KGB but the jade is slipped into the hands of a boy called Pan.', 'Archaeologist Shum finds an antique jade with supernatural power in Greece. The stone is wanted both by KGB''s agent Karoff and the Interpol. Shum asks his friend Nike for help. However, Shum is finally caught by KGB but the jade is slipped into the hands of a boy called Pan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ro5WQWyreQ3mVFV7lAD5p15LYE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142300'),
  ('770086011586662815', 'Magic Farm', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Amalia Ulman, Marilu Varsky, Adam Centko', 'Amalia Ulman', 'Chloë Sevigny, Alex Wolff, Amalia Ulman, Joe Apollonio, Guillermo Jacubowicz , Camila del Campo, Mateo Vaquer Ruiz de los Llanos, Valeria Lois', null, 'A misguided American documentary crew working for an edgy media company travels to rural Argentina to profile a local musician, but their ineptitude leads them into the wrong small town. As they collaborate with locals to attempt to fabricate a viral trend, unexpected connections blossom, while a pervasive crisis looms unacknowledged in the background.', 'A misguided American documentary crew working for an edgy media company travels to rural Argentina to profile a local musician, but their ineptitude leads them into the wrong small town. As they collaborate with locals to attempt to fabricate a viral trend, unexpected connections blossom, while a pervasive crisis looms unacknowledged in the background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XGkkT6KAx5ZYNPGNEF6U34sUf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309962'),
  ('859050046080179878', 'Magic Gift of the Snowman', 1995, 'Animation, Family', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga', 'Lawrence H. Hartstein', 'Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk, Lillian Carlson, Bailee Reid, Ian James Corlett, Michael Donovan', null, 'Everybody knows that Christmas is the time when miracles happen. And this exciting new tale is about a cool snowman who brings a very special gift to a little girl and her family. This heartwarming original feature is a beautiful reminder that a positive attitude can help us soar on wings of imagination and keep us hopeful and happy–no matter how old we are!', 'Everybody knows that Christmas is the time when miracles happen. And this exciting new tale is about a cool snowman who brings a very special gift to a little girl and her family. This heartwarming original feature is a beautiful reminder that a positive attitude can help us soar on wings of imagination and keep us hopeful and happy–no matter how old we are!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXrwWbGMq3qjTmnKZrddAza2Gyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64816'),
  ('1132578071057710462', 'Magic in Mistletoe', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paula Elle, Robert Gardiner, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Skyy Blair', 'Lyndie Greenwood, Paul Campbell, Mila Jones, Oliver Rice, Robyn Bradley, Jacqueline Samuda, Raugi Yu', 'G', 'Successful yet recluse author Harrington returns to his hometown for an annual Christmas festival, where he must face his publicist there for damage control.', 'Successful yet recluse author Harrington returns to his hometown for an annual Christmas festival, where he must face his publicist there for damage control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEZby0qqE7vYyZFU5hgyBf3fIm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180743'),
  ('1019413093280993350', 'Magic in the Moonlight', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gil Kenny, Jeanne Bizard, Delphine Bertrand', 'Woody Allen', 'Colin Firth, Emma Stone, Hamish Linklater, Marcia Gay Harden, Jacki Weaver, Erica Leerhsen, Eileen Atkins, Simon McBurney', 'PG-13', 'Set in the 1920s French Riviera, a master magician is commissioned to try and expose a psychic as a fraud.', 'Set in the 1920s French Riviera, a master magician is commissioned to try and expose a psychic as a fraud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNYZUVDj4ORSPHWinmqJbXyuG6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229297'),
  ('721982891756932978', 'Magic in the Water', 1995, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Rick Stevenson, Thomas Burstyn', 'Rick Stevenson, Icel Dobell Massey', 'Mark Harmon, Joshua Jackson, Harley Jane Kozak, Sarah Wayne, Willie Nark-Orn, Frank Salsedo, Morris Panych, Ben Cardinal', 'PG', 'Radio psychologist Jack Black takes his children Joshua and Ashley on a ''vacation'' to a lake in British Columbia. While he grinds away at work the children discover that the famous local lake monster "Orky" may not be just a gimmick to attract tourists after all. In fact, Orky may enable them to get closer to their workaholic dad, and help stop local polluters who are dumping toxic waste.', 'Radio psychologist Jack Black takes his children Joshua and Ashley on a ''vacation'' to a lake in British Columbia. While he grinds away at work the children discover that the famous local lake monster "Orky" may not be just a gimmick to attract tourists after all. In fact, Orky may enable them to get closer to their workaholic dad, and help stop local polluters who are dumping toxic waste.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54BiiZRiIUFDNboO8RZ81AKqk3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24962'),
  ('707618796517613144', 'Magic Island', 1995, 'Family, Adventure', 'Sam Irvin, James Lawrence Spencer, Pavel Cantú', 'Brent V. Friedman, Neil Ruttenberg', 'Zachery Ty Bryan, Andrew Divoff, Edward Kerr, Schae Harrison, Jessie-Ann Friend, Lee Armstrong, French Stewart, Oscar Dillon', 'PG', 'Jack Carlisle is a disillusioned 13-year old boy. His mother is always away at work since his father left. He decides to run away, as his mom won''t miss him. As he is ready to leave, his nanny, convinces him to read this ''magic book''. The book is about a pirate adventure on Magic Island. As Jack reads the book, he is sucked into the world and goes on numerous adventures with Prince Morgan, while fleeing the evil Blackbeard the Pirate. He is even saved by Lily, a beautiful mermaid, whom he falls in love with.', 'Jack Carlisle is a disillusioned 13-year old boy. His mother is always away at work since his father left. He decides to run away, as his mom won''t miss him. As he is ready to leave, his nanny, convinces him to read this ''magic book''. The book is about a pirate adventure on Magic Island. As Jack reads the book, he is sucked into the world and goes on numerous adventures with Prince Morgan, while fleeing the evil Blackbeard the Pirate. He is even saved by Lily, a beautiful mermaid, whom he falls in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lseC8bWZQkLcIYjIpwoL9vpCLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72302'),
  ('536338340517298074', 'Magic Kid', 1993, 'Action, Family, Comedy', 'Joseph Merhi, Ken Blakey', 'Stephen Smoke', 'Ted Jan Roberts, Stephen Furst, Shonda Whipple, Joseph Campanella, Billy Hufsey, Christopher Mitchum, Lauren Tewes, Don Wilson', 'PG', 'Karate action and laughs never cease when a brother and sister go to California to visit their uncle. They soon discover that he''s an alcoholic on the run from the Mob who want him to pay up or else...', 'Karate action and laughs never cease when a brother and sister go to California to visit their uncle. They soon discover that he''s an alcoholic on the run from the Mob who want him to pay up or else...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5Hcj7ZUs2jHIxNMsvBIx9QXXmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215405'),
  ('1011131224434465900', 'Magic Kid II', 1994, 'Family, Action, Comedy', 'Stephen Furst, Ken Blakey', 'Nick Stone, Stephen Furst', 'Stephen Furst, Ted Jan Roberts, Dana Barron, Donald Gibb, William Daniels, Howie Mandel, David Morse, Allyce Beasley', 'PG', 'Kevin Ryan is Hollywood''s leading teen heartthrob. He''s the star of "Ninja Boy," a hot Martial Arts TV series. The trouble starts when Kevin decides he wants to leave the hit show, so that he can go to high school and lead a normal teenager''s life. However, he is the Studio''s biggest money maker and the unscrupulous executives are NOT going to let him leave. Their sinister plans involve a desirable young starlet, a muscle-bound mountain man, and an army of inept thugs trying to kill Kevin''s loveable, but mixed-up manager, Uncle Bob.', 'Kevin Ryan is Hollywood''s leading teen heartthrob. He''s the star of "Ninja Boy," a hot Martial Arts TV series. The trouble starts when Kevin decides he wants to leave the hit show, so that he can go to high school and lead a normal teenager''s life. However, he is the Studio''s biggest money maker and the unscrupulous executives are NOT going to let him leave. Their sinister plans involve a desirable young starlet, a muscle-bound mountain man, and an army of inept thugs trying to kill Kevin''s loveable, but mixed-up manager, Uncle Bob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpxXrPzZXenA43hM2dSRdsI6p6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150154'),
  ('545454875292971616', 'Magic Magic', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Sebastián Silva, Glenn Kaplan, Christopher Doyle', 'Sebastián Silva', 'Michael Cera, Juno Temple, Emily Browning, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Agustín Silva, Luis Dubó, Roxana Naranjo, Lorenza Aillpan', 'R', 'In remote Chile, a vacationing young woman begins to mentally unravel; meanwhile, her friends ignore her claim until it''s too late.', 'In remote Chile, a vacationing young woman begins to mentally unravel; meanwhile, her friends ignore her claim until it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgbECqu8xLVzmHT9p3SuB4HtSpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139519'),
  ('1098835469105240998', 'Magic Mike', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Gregory Jacobs', 'Reid Carolin', 'Channing Tatum, Matthew McConaughey, Alex Pettyfer, Cody H. Carolin, Olivia Munn, Joe Manganiello, Matt Bomer, James Martin Kelly', 'R', 'Mike, an experienced stripper, takes a younger performer called The Kid under his wing and schools him in the arts of partying, picking up women, and making easy money.', 'Mike, an experienced stripper, takes a younger performer called The Kid under his wing and schools him in the arts of partying, picking up women, and making easy money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfRv1INLSSumjvxAqEGOP6b0Aw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77930'),
  ('19496348693880340', 'Magic Mike XXL', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gregory Jacobs, Steven Soderbergh, Dee Blackburn', 'Reid Carolin', 'Channing Tatum, Matt Bomer, Joe Manganiello, Kevin Nash, Adam Rodriguez, Jada Pinkett Smith, Gabriel Iglesias, Amber Heard', 'R', 'Three years after Mike bowed out of the stripper life at the top of his game, he and the remaining Kings of Tampa hit the road to Myrtle Beach to put on one last blow-out performance.', 'Three years after Mike bowed out of the stripper life at the top of his game, he and the remaining Kings of Tampa hit the road to Myrtle Beach to put on one last blow-out performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkuCNd3wOmf4sDlZ89HEt8jmsqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264999'),
  ('397140138051299929', 'Magic Mike''s Last Dance', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Steven Soderbergh, Sam Stokes, Steven Soderbergh', 'Reid Carolin', 'Channing Tatum, Salma Hayek Pinault, Ayub Khan-Din, Jemelia George, Juliette Motamed, Ethan Lawrence, Alan Cox, Caitlin Gerard', 'R', 'Mike Lane takes to the stage again after a lengthy hiatus, following a business deal that went bust, leaving him broke and taking bartender gigs in Florida. For what he hopes will be one last hurrah, Mike heads to London with a wealthy socialite who lures him with an offer he can’t refuse… and an agenda all her own. With everything on the line, once Mike discovers what she truly has in mind, will he—and the roster of hot new dancers he’ll have to whip into shape—be able to pull it off?', 'Mike Lane takes to the stage again after a lengthy hiatus, following a business deal that went bust, leaving him broke and taking bartender gigs in Florida. For what he hopes will be one last hurrah, Mike heads to London with a wealthy socialite who lures him with an offer he can’t refuse… and an agenda all her own. With everything on the line, once Mike discovers what she truly has in mind, will he—and the roster of hot new dancers he’ll have to whip into shape—be able to pull it off?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a9pyJZRhUWUSBT8BQqWihtqbI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:906221'),
  ('575867101740867678', 'Magic Mirror', 2006, 'Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Renato Berta', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Leonor Silveira, Ricardo Trêpa, Luis Miguel Cintra, Leonor Baldaque, Glória de Matos, Isabel Ruth, Adelaide Teixeira, Diogo Dória', null, 'Luciano, fresh out of jail, was taken by his brother, Flórido, to serve in the home of wealthy Alfreda. He was surprised when she told him that her greatest desire was to see the Virgin Mary. Now comes this rich land owner with her sublime pretensions. Isn''t it enough for her to have an Aston Martin and a Jaguar in the garage and ten different dresses per season? It was all professor Heschel''s fault. Or someone else''s. Anyway, to go beyond the promise is heresy. Alfreda said that she wouldn''t rest until she saw the Virgin and made her some questions. Filipe Quinta, the Forger, says he has a solution. Meanwhile, Bahia, her husband, listens do music.', 'Luciano, fresh out of jail, was taken by his brother, Flórido, to serve in the home of wealthy Alfreda. He was surprised when she told him that her greatest desire was to see the Virgin Mary. Now comes this rich land owner with her sublime pretensions. Isn''t it enough for her to have an Aston Martin and a Jaguar in the garage and ten different dresses per season? It was all professor Heschel''s fault. Or someone else''s. Anyway, to go beyond the promise is heresy. Alfreda said that she wouldn''t rest until she saw the Virgin and made her some questions. Filipe Quinta, the Forger, says he has a solution. Meanwhile, Bahia, her husband, listens do music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VmasX7vjy5a2X1tan2P2JWWXWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129937'),
  ('1026343005086491387', 'Magic Mountains', 2020, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Urszula Antoniak, Lennert Hillege', 'Urszula Antoniak', 'Hannah Hoekstra, Marcin Dorociński, Thomas Ryckewaert, Maria Maj', null, 'Hannah travels through the Polish mountains with her ex-boyfriend Lex. During their journey the young woman finds out that Lex has prepared the perfect crime, with Hannah as his victim.', 'Hannah travels through the Polish mountains with her ex-boyfriend Lex. During their journey the young woman finds out that Lex has prepared the perfect crime, with Hannah as his victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1of3Y4SV0FFnyDm8uqCmDZORKLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655358'),
  ('254284161082332225', 'Magic Mushrooms', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nadirshah, Sujith Vaassudev', 'Akash Dev, B K Harinarayanan, Santhosh Varma', 'Fazal A. Backer, Vazhoor Jose, Athira Diljith, Yellowtooths Varun, B. K. Harinarayanan', null, 'Mysterious mushrooms trigger odd events in Kanjikkuzhi village. Friends investigating their origin discover a web of folklore and scientific mysteries that challenge the boundary between natural and supernatural.', 'Mysterious mushrooms trigger odd events in Kanjikkuzhi village. Friends investigating their origin discover a web of folklore and scientific mysteries that challenge the boundary between natural and supernatural.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpKszcXMCZxAut8lkRanpVEJfZLc.jpg', 'plex:movie:magic-mushrooms-2026-1'),
  ('497487899428229336', 'Magic Silver', 2009, 'Fantasy', 'Roar Uthaug, Tormod Ringnes, Katarina Launing', 'Thomas Moldestad, Gudny Ingeborg Hagen', 'Ane Viola Semb, Johan Tinus Lindgren, Simen Bakken, Nikoline Ursin Erichsen, Sigve Bøe, Finn Schau, Jan Gunnar Røise, Kyrre Hellum', null, 'Princess Bluerose is a small gnome living deep in the Norwegian mountains. A small community of gnomes is responsible for making the transition between daylight and night. This is the magic hour, created by the magic silver, of which only these gnomes possess. When the silver is stolen, the world is transformed into eternal night. Bluerose sets out on a remarkable journey to retrieve the silver and save the world from eternal darkness.', 'Princess Bluerose is a small gnome living deep in the Norwegian mountains. A small community of gnomes is responsible for making the transition between daylight and night. This is the magic hour, created by the magic silver, of which only these gnomes possess. When the silver is stolen, the world is transformed into eternal night. Bluerose sets out on a remarkable journey to retrieve the silver and save the world from eternal darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fR3bCbQ212ao4wj58kDirteatBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46489'),
  ('860371703039359763', 'Magic Touch', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Lamberto Caimi, Massimo Carocci', 'Steno, Renato Pozzetto, Enrico Vanzina', 'Renato Pozzetto, Eleonora Giorgi, Sylva Koscina, Maurizio Micheli, Stefano Mingardo, Felice Andreasi, Giovanni Frezza, Eleonora Grippo', null, 'Andrea, a forty-year old engineer, suddenly becomes unemployed while his wife France gets a promotion. He is very down hearted and since he does not want to be a burden to his family he takes the place of the house maid.', 'Andrea, a forty-year old engineer, suddenly becomes unemployed while his wife France gets a promotion. He is very down hearted and since he does not want to be a burden to his family he takes the place of the house maid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHMepKCN3Y1vGmAzSAATaPit5sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73075'),
  ('844616280926512343', 'Magic Town', 1947, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, Joseph F. Biroc, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Robert Riskin', 'James Stewart, Jane Wyman, Kent Smith, Ned Sparks, Wallace Ford, Regis Toomey, Ann Doran, Donald Meek', 'NR', 'Rip Smith''s opinion-poll business is a failure...until he discovers that the small town of Grandview is statistically identical to the entire country. He and his assistants go there to run polls cheaply and easily, in total secrecy (it would be fatal to let the townsfolk get self-conscious). And of course, civic crusader Mary Peterman must be kept from changing things too much. But romantic involvement with Mary complicates life for Rip; then suddenly everything changes.', 'Rip Smith''s opinion-poll business is a failure...until he discovers that the small town of Grandview is statistically identical to the entire country. He and his assistants go there to run polls cheaply and easily, in total secrecy (it would be fatal to let the townsfolk get self-conscious). And of course, civic crusader Mary Peterman must be kept from changing things too much. But romantic involvement with Mary complicates life for Rip; then suddenly everything changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plCn5h9s98MgqEpvqyuw7ZtZ1JX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90966'),
  ('586578882890743740', 'Magic Tree House', 2012, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Nishikiori, Yoshiaki Yanagida, Keisuke Nakamura', 'Ichiro Okouchi', 'Mana Ashida, Keiko Kitagawa, Fumiko Orikasa, Noriko Shitaya, Koichi Yamadera, Katsuhisa Houki, Nana Mizuki, Shozo Iizuka', null, 'Jack and Annie are young siblings who find a magic tree house on their way home after chasing a weasel. By using the books available on the tree house, they are able to travel through time and location. The two end up with the difficult task of collecting four medallions, each one hidden in a different place and epoch, in order to help a magician named Morgan.', 'Jack and Annie are young siblings who find a magic tree house on their way home after chasing a weasel. By using the books available on the tree house, they are able to travel through time and location. The two end up with the difficult task of collecting four medallions, each one hidden in a different place and epoch, in order to help a magician named Morgan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewq3RVqwkJVWAcmskbrTO1hFg9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126710'),
  ('534035284097140605', 'Magical Christmas Ornaments', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Don McBrearty, Jonathan Yapp', 'Rickie Castaneda', 'Jessica Lowndes, Brendan Penny, Tim Matheson, Farah Merani, Stephen Huszar, Judah Katz, Lindsay Leese, Anthony Ulc', 'G', 'When Marie begins receiving ornaments from her mother, a new coincidental blessing comes with each one, causing Marie to feel more excited for the holidays than she has in years. Marie’s once-lost Christmas spirit gets another boost when she meets her handsome neighbor Nate and feels a spark with him while celebrating the season.', 'When Marie begins receiving ornaments from her mother, a new coincidental blessing comes with each one, causing Marie to feel more excited for the holidays than she has in years. Marie’s once-lost Christmas spirit gets another boost when she meets her handsome neighbor Nate and feels a spark with him while celebrating the season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmxjY8lRviPwsTC09AUjINphumi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483554'),
  ('706191485016683172', 'Magical Girl', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carlos Vermut, Santiago Racaj, Cayetana Pascual', 'Carlos Vermut', 'Bárbara Lennie, José Sacristán, Luis Bermejo, Lucía Pollán, Israel Elejalde, Elisabet Gelabert, Marisol Membrillo, Miquel Insúa', null, 'The father of a terminally ill girl is determined to grant his daughter''s last wish, a ridiculously expensive collectors'' costume from a Japanese TV series. The request will drive him into a journey within his city''s dark underbelly.', 'The father of a terminally ill girl is determined to grant his daughter''s last wish, a ridiculously expensive collectors'' costume from a Japanese TV series. The request will drive him into a journey within his city''s dark underbelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrTIsngoDR5ekQJBtpSfJtnnxu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282983'),
  ('870109781095398271', 'Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha: The Movie 2nd A''s', 2012, 'Drama, Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Keizo Kusakawa, Tadashi Kitaoka, Jin Aketagawa', 'Masaki Tsuzuki', 'Nana Mizuki, Yukari Tamura, Kana Ueda, Kaori Shimizu, Asami Sanada, Ryoka Yuzuki, Kazuya Ichijo, Natsuko Kuwatani', null, 'Six months after the events of Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha: The Movie 1st, Fate has returned to Uminari City with Lindy as her legal guardian and is living the life of a normal elementary schoolgirl along with Nanoha and her friends. The reunion between the two new-found friends is cut short, however, when they are assaulted by four ancient magic users who identify themselves as the Wolkenritter. As the motives behind the actions of the Wolkenritter become clear, Nanoha and Fate find themselves in a race against time to stop the reactivation of a highly dangerous artifact known as the Book of Darkness.', 'Six months after the events of Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha: The Movie 1st, Fate has returned to Uminari City with Lindy as her legal guardian and is living the life of a normal elementary schoolgirl along with Nanoha and her friends. The reunion between the two new-found friends is cut short, however, when they are assaulted by four ancient magic users who identify themselves as the Wolkenritter. As the motives behind the actions of the Wolkenritter become clear, Nanoha and Fate find themselves in a race against time to stop the reactivation of a highly dangerous artifact known as the Book of Darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quAsWHbyfWTo2jCn9yR7Z8TjqfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181522'),
  ('540229128043092506', 'Magical Maestro', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler, Carlos Ramírez, Mary Kaye, Norman Kaye, Frank Ross, Paul Frees', 'NR', 'After he is rejected by the Great Poochini as an opening act, Mysto the Magician gets his revenge by conducting his next operatic performance.', 'After he is rejected by the Great Poochini as an opening act, Mysto the Magician gets his revenge by conducting his next operatic performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gXmD4QOkNAXxI9M8scea52tx3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86735'),
  ('984114017615558996', 'Magical Mystery or: The Return of Karl Schmidt', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Dennis Eichhof, Jakob Grunert, Christoph Holsten', 'Sven Regener', 'Charly Hübner, Annika Meier, Detlev Buck, Marc Hosemann, Bastian Reiber, Jacob Matschenz, Jan-Peter Kampwirth, Sarah Viktoria Frick', null, 'Under the auspicious name "Magical Mystery" the Berlin techno label BummBumm Records wants to go on a rave tour. Karl Schmidt aka Charly himself was once an aspiring artist on the scene, until he retired after a nervous breakdown five years ago. Since then he lives in a supervised withdrawal WG in Hamburg. Now, as a driver and custodian for the party-loving DJs and their producers, he becomes part of "Magical Mystery", trying to lead a self-determined life after years of patronizing and well-intentioned advice.', 'Under the auspicious name "Magical Mystery" the Berlin techno label BummBumm Records wants to go on a rave tour. Karl Schmidt aka Charly himself was once an aspiring artist on the scene, until he retired after a nervous breakdown five years ago. Since then he lives in a supervised withdrawal WG in Hamburg. Now, as a driver and custodian for the party-loving DJs and their producers, he becomes part of "Magical Mystery", trying to lead a self-determined life after years of patronizing and well-intentioned advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYMi6MOH0uDu7ZGNZDlVCWLoJYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426562'),
  ('404648586293749347', 'Magical Mystery Tour', 1967, 'Music, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Ringo Starr, George Harrison, Ringo Starr', 'Paul McCartney, Ringo Starr, John Lennon', 'John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr, Vivian Stanshall, Neil Innes, Roger Ruskin Spear, ''Legs'' Larry Smith', 'NR', 'While on a coach tour, The Beatles and a few dozen friends experience strange happenings caused by magicians.', 'While on a coach tour, The Beatles and a few dozen friends experience strange happenings caused by magicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJSqSXCeK407l7t4zTXaYSJH0gL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34038'),
  ('483590069470574583', 'Magical Nights', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Elisabetta Boni, Elisa Becchere, Paolo Virzì', 'Paolo Virzì, Francesca Archibugi, Francesco Piccolo', 'Mauro Lamantia, Giovanni Toscano, Irene Vetere, Roberto Herlitzka, Marina Rocco, Paolo Sassanelli, Annalisa Arena, Eugenio Nicola Marinelli', null, 'Rome, 1990. The night Italy''s national football team is eliminated from the World Cup by Argentina on penalty kicks, a well-known film producer is found dead in the Tiber river. The main suspects for the murder are three young aspiring screenwriters, who–promptly taken to the police–start to tell their version of the story.', 'Rome, 1990. The night Italy''s national football team is eliminated from the World Cup by Argentina on penalty kicks, a well-known film producer is found dead in the Tiber river. The main suspects for the murder are three young aspiring screenwriters, who–promptly taken to the police–start to tell their version of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPfXIAQM8YacKLl9qrxGFLc9ROl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552088'),
  ('973665013245914074', 'Magical Sisters Yoyo & Nene', 2013, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Takuro Takahashi, Yuka Shibata, Takuro Takahashi', 'Kazuharu Sato, Takumi Miyajima, Takayuki Hirao', 'Sumire Morohoshi, Ai Kakuma, Shoko Nakagawa, Takehito Koyasu, Rio Sasaki, Kyoko Hikami, Takako Honda, Miyuki Sawashiro', null, 'It is a story about a pair of sisters who work as "noroiya" (cursers) using magic in a fantasy world. One day a big tree suddenly appears in a forest, and tall buildings that look like they are from our world can be seen entangled in it. The two sisters go there to investigate and get ported to our world. They then encounter two children who are startled by the sisters'' sudden appearance and rush back home but at home they see their parents turned into monsters...', 'It is a story about a pair of sisters who work as "noroiya" (cursers) using magic in a fantasy world. One day a big tree suddenly appears in a forest, and tall buildings that look like they are from our world can be seen entangled in it. The two sisters go there to investigate and get ported to our world. They then encounter two children who are startled by the sisters'' sudden appearance and rush back home but at home they see their parents turned into monsters...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9w24MqPE0Sp6aQVl3djMCpi1CjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239530'),
  ('242988564472361955', 'Magical Witches', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Raúl Pérez Cubero, Andrés Vich', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Andrés Pajares, Antonio Ozores, Ángel de Andrés, Azucena Hernández, Paloma Hurtado, Adrián Ortega, Trini Alonso, Adriana Ozores', null, 'In the year 1595, in a Spanish village lives the miller Diego, irresistible to the local girls. Meanwhile, a friar arrives in the village on his way to Santiago de Compostela, and is mistaken for a man sent by the Inquisition.', 'In the year 1595, in a Spanish village lives the miller Diego, irresistible to the local girls. Meanwhile, a friar arrives in the village on his way to Santiago de Compostela, and is mistaken for a man sent by the Inquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NN6Ye3qnQ8mHyTMnlqJjzfqXE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77327'),
  ('813694973027526237', 'Magician Mickey', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash, Walt Disney', 'NR', 'Donald continually heckles Mickey''s magic act, but Mickey bests him at every turn. Donald shoots off a magic pistol that causes all the stage props to fall down on them at the finish of the act.', 'Donald continually heckles Mickey''s magic act, but Mickey bests him at every turn. Donald shoots off a magic pistol that causes all the stage props to fall down on them at the finish of the act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vyLRQWWDOxwTsEZTQL8FhF1ogT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66997'),
  ('22729410747877505', 'Magicians', 1982, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Konstantin Bromberg, Konstantin Apryatin, Iosif Goldman', 'Boris Strugatskiy, Arkadiy Strugatskiy', 'Aleksandr Abdulov, Aleksandra Yakovleva-Aasmyae, Valentin Gaft, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Valeriy Zolotukhin, Roman Filippov, Emmanuil Vitorgan, Mikhail Svetin', null, 'In a small Russian town, there is a Research Institute for magic. One of the witches, Alyona Sanina, is going to marry a guy named Ivan Puhov (not a magician). A jealous Apollon Sataneev tells her boss Kira Shemahandskaya that Sanina is going to marry not Ivan Puhov, but Ivan Kivrin, whom Shemahandskaya is going to marry herself. Enraged, Shemahandskaya, who is a powerful witch, orders Sanina to forget about her Ivan and marry Sataneev instead. And this will be final unless Alyona kisses Puhov before midnight on New Year. Alyona''s friends call Puhov to the rescue.', 'In a small Russian town, there is a Research Institute for magic. One of the witches, Alyona Sanina, is going to marry a guy named Ivan Puhov (not a magician). A jealous Apollon Sataneev tells her boss Kira Shemahandskaya that Sanina is going to marry not Ivan Puhov, but Ivan Kivrin, whom Shemahandskaya is going to marry herself. Enraged, Shemahandskaya, who is a powerful witch, orders Sanina to forget about her Ivan and marry Sataneev instead. And this will be final unless Alyona kisses Puhov before midnight on New Year. Alyona''s friends call Puhov to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wC5WNWYKxosp9jcKPZvk9Q8HiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41977'),
  ('502748864589787839', 'Magicians', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Andrew O''Connor, James Welland', 'Jesse Armstrong, Sam Bain', 'Robert Webb, David Mitchell, Sarah Hadland, Paul Mark Elliott, Karen Seacombe, Phil Nice, Jessica Hynes, Darren Boyd', 'PG-13', 'A pair of rivaling stage magicians are forced to confront their falling out over a guillotine mishap when they compete in a magic competition.', 'A pair of rivaling stage magicians are forced to confront their falling out over a guillotine mishap when they compete in a magic competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNdA5ebwyaE9gwUUiTrdvQ3Ll6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10078'),
  ('229244391566705234', 'Magister Negi Magi: Anime Final', 2011, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Ken''ichi Ishikura, Akiyuki Shinbo', 'Deko Akao', 'Madoka Kimura, Natsuko Kuwatani, Ayana Sasagawa, Rina Sato, Mari Kanou', null, 'The story is centred around Negi Springfield, a ten-year-old wizard from Wales, who dreams of becoming a Magister Magi like his missing father, a special wizard who uses his powers to help normal people, using covers such as working for NGOs. Initially appointed as an English teacher at Mahora Academy in Japan he becomes a teacher to a middle school class of 31 older girls. However, the peaceful school life is quickly disturbed as people from his father''s past appear and Negi has to form contracts with various students to overcome the new dangers. Finally he embarks on a journey to the Magic World together with his partners to find his long-lost father. This film is the climax to their adventures depicted in the Shiroki Tsubasa Ala Alba and Mou Hitotsu no Sekai OVAs.', 'The story is centred around Negi Springfield, a ten-year-old wizard from Wales, who dreams of becoming a Magister Magi like his missing father, a special wizard who uses his powers to help normal people, using covers such as working for NGOs. Initially appointed as an English teacher at Mahora Academy in Japan he becomes a teacher to a middle school class of 31 older girls. However, the peaceful school life is quickly disturbed as people from his father''s past appear and Negi has to form contracts with various students to overcome the new dangers. Finally he embarks on a journey to the Magic World together with his partners to find his long-lost father. This film is the climax to their adventures depicted in the Shiroki Tsubasa Ala Alba and Mou Hitotsu no Sekai OVAs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGOiP1EKSf7d1czyJEwsurLz1NI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102070'),
  ('6467004325828723', 'Magma', 2025, 'Drama', 'Basile Jullien, Jordan Fleury, Jacques Girault', 'Cyprien Vial, Nicolas Pleskof', 'Marina Foïs, Théo Christine, Mathieu Demy, Mikaël Blameble, Genny Dagnet, Dimitry Zandronis, Djanyss Adelo, Daren Delannay Marinette', null, 'Katia Reiter directs the Guadeloupe Volcano Observatory. A passionate volcanologist, she’s waved goodbye to the idea of one day fulfilling her professional dream of managing a major eruption. But she hadn’t appreciated the unpredictable nature of the Soufrière... or of young volcanologist Aimé Lubin.', 'Katia Reiter directs the Guadeloupe Volcano Observatory. A passionate volcanologist, she’s waved goodbye to the idea of one day fulfilling her professional dream of managing a major eruption. But she hadn’t appreciated the unpredictable nature of the Soufrière... or of young volcanologist Aimé Lubin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BJrYmfBaxycV61DWbyb3T6fs8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149463'),
  ('147497563077196109', 'Magma: Volcanic Disaster', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ian Gilmore, Lorenzo Senatore, Todor Chapkanov', null, 'Xander Berkeley, Amy Jo Johnson, Reiko Aylesworth, David O''Donnell, George R. Sheffey, Michael Durrell, Vlado Mihailov, Rushi Vidinliev', 'PG-13', 'When a volcano expert becomes convinced that a cataclysmic natural disaster is about to unfold, a volcanologist Professor John Shepherd and his graduate students believes that recent unexplainable volcanic activity as all of the volcanoes in the world are going to erupt and kill every living thing on the planet! They try to convince the government that their theory is true not a joke while also trying to figure out how to stop it before time runs out!', 'When a volcano expert becomes convinced that a cataclysmic natural disaster is about to unfold, a volcanologist Professor John Shepherd and his graduate students believes that recent unexplainable volcanic activity as all of the volcanoes in the world are going to erupt and kill every living thing on the planet! They try to convince the government that their theory is true not a joke while also trying to figure out how to stop it before time runs out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5PeIUdO32mqKlfR8VTpCTR7juK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68446'),
  ('110888450920321616', 'Magnet of Doom', 1963, 'Crime, Drama, Adventure', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Henri Decaë, Yves Boisset', 'Jean-Pierre Melville', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Charles Vanel, Michèle Mercier, Stefania Sandrelli, Malvina Silberberg, Barbara Sommers, E.F. Medard, Todd Martin', null, 'Young boxer Michel Maudet is sacked by his manager after a series of match defeats and is forced to look for a new job. He is engaged as secretary to a millionaire named Ferchaux who is in a hurry to flee the country when he discovers he has been implicated in a high-profile fraud.', 'Young boxer Michel Maudet is sacked by his manager after a series of match defeats and is forced to look for a new job. He is engaged as secretary to a millionaire named Ferchaux who is in a hurry to flee the country when he discovers he has been implicated in a high-profile fraud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wjAEZWBcdjrwePqJ34RLPpAq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69729'),
  ('992690314986091847', 'Magnetic Beats', 2021, 'Drama', 'Vincent Maël Cardona, Brice Pancot, Marion Dehaene', 'Vincent Maël Cardona, Chloé Larouchi, Maël Le Garrec', 'Thimotée Robart, Marie Colomb, Joseph Olivennes, Fabrice Adde, Louise Anselme, Younès Boucif, Maxence Tual, Judith Zins', null, 'Brittany, France, 1980s. A group of friends, fed up with the boring country life and eager for excitement, create a radio station.', 'Brittany, France, 1980s. A group of friends, fed up with the boring country life and eager for excitement, create a radio station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSdGJz5m9Tst39Zq0Wdxb91Lmom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820709'),
  ('1115675299183648855', 'Magnetic Fields', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yorgos Goussis, Dimitris Manousiakis', 'Elena Topalidou, Antonis Tsiotsiopoulos, Yorgos Goussis', 'Elena Topalidou, Antonis Tsiotsiopoulos, Nikos Spanidis, Dimitris Smaelis, Dimitris Bouzos, Froso Tzanetatou', null, 'Having met by chance on the way to an island, a woman and a man decide to wander around together in search of a good place to bury a metallic box.', 'Having met by chance on the way to an island, a woman and a man decide to wander around together in search of a good place to bury a metallic box.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCd3nyuYv0hAviKJi6nuI7vFkaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891024'),
  ('778985056604086477', 'Magnetic Harvest', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marine Levéel', 'Marine Levéel', 'Gilles Vandeweerd, Victor Fradet, Xavier Clion, Jonathan Turnbull, Thomas Landbo, Bernadette Chapron, Domitille Chambon, Jean-Louis Lamouroux', null, 'Mickaël, a pig farmer in rural France, finds his search for an amorous connection interrupted by the sudden return of the charming and youthful Paul.', 'Mickaël, a pig farmer in rural France, finds his search for an amorous connection interrupted by the sudden return of the charming and youthful Paul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWK7iFVspRm1GVtBlR0WMu0Mqdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577176'),
  ('595719691075489130', 'Magnificat', 1993, 'Drama, History', 'Pupi Avati, Cesare Bastelli', 'Pupi Avati', 'Luigi Diberti, Arnaldo Ninchi, Massimo Bellinzoni, Dalia Zagni, Lorella Morlotti, Massimo Sarchielli, Brizio Montinaro, Marcello Cesena', null, 'During the Middle Ages, a traveling executioner hires an apprentice to learn the finer points of torture and execution, and a young girl is given by her parents to a Catholic convent.', 'During the Middle Ages, a traveling executioner hires an apprentice to learn the finer points of torture and execution, and a young girl is given by her parents to a Catholic convent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pI2g5q6U3uYEvMsZJYPeV8chYDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60191'),
  ('358761549554963178', 'Magnificat', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Virginie Sauveur, Noémie Gillot, Amaury Serieye', 'Virginie Sauveur, Nicolas Silhol', 'Karin Viard, François Berléand, Maxime Bergeron, Patrick Catalifo, Nicolas Cazalé, Anaïde Rozam, Patrick d''Assumçao, Benoît Allemane', null, 'When an elderly priest died, the people in charge of his diocese discovered that it was a woman. Without anyone suspecting it, she had been practicing her vocation for years. Dismayed, the bishop decided to launch an investigation and asked the chancellor of the diocese to find out how, why and with what complicity such a deception was possible.', 'When an elderly priest died, the people in charge of his diocese discovered that it was a woman. Without anyone suspecting it, she had been practicing her vocation for years. Dismayed, the bishop decided to launch an investigation and asked the chancellor of the diocese to find out how, why and with what complicity such a deception was possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSJ4yESLn6Cf6rNfXEhqiAWNNko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960134'),
  ('1119033396876364789', 'Magnificent Bodyguards', 1978, 'Action', 'Lo Wei, Chen Jung-Shu', 'Lung Ku', 'Jackie Chan, James Tien Chun, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Wang Ping, Liu Ming, Wong Gwan, Lee Man-Tai, Chui Yuen', 'R', 'Chan is asked by a young, wealthy lady to take her sick brother to a particular doctor in order to be cured. To reach this doctor, Chan and a handful of travelling companions must pass through bandit-infested wild country. They meet and kung-fu-fight several gangs of thugs along the way.', 'Chan is asked by a young, wealthy lady to take her sick brother to a particular doctor in order to be cured. To reach this doctor, Chan and a handful of travelling companions must pass through bandit-infested wild country. They meet and kung-fu-fight several gangs of thugs along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEyZjZyPQEnHW38fFO2HtRCkG40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18735'),
  ('467519868617181368', 'Magnificent Doll', 1946, 'Drama, History', 'Frank Borzage, Joseph A. Valentine, Charles Felstead', 'Irving Stone', 'Ginger Rogers, David Niven, Burgess Meredith, Peggy Wood, Stephen McNally, Robert Barrat, Grandon Rhodes, Frances E. Williams', 'NR', 'While packing her belongings in preparation of evacuating the White House because of the impending British invasion of Washington D.C., Dolly Payne Madison thinks back on her childhood, her first marriage, and later romances with two very different politicians, Aaron Burr and his good friend James Madison. She plays each against the other, not only for romantic reasons, but also to influence the shaping of the young country. By manipulating Burr''s affections, she helps Thomas Jefferson win the presidency, and eventually she becomes First Lady of the land herself.', 'While packing her belongings in preparation of evacuating the White House because of the impending British invasion of Washington D.C., Dolly Payne Madison thinks back on her childhood, her first marriage, and later romances with two very different politicians, Aaron Burr and his good friend James Madison. She plays each against the other, not only for romantic reasons, but also to influence the shaping of the young country. By manipulating Burr''s affections, she helps Thomas Jefferson win the presidency, and eventually she becomes First Lady of the land herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvBBh0yx0MZy8S42HGyUEiQ00dY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217250'),
  ('764998422930505772', 'Magnificent Obsession', 1935, 'Drama, Romance', 'John M. Stahl, John J. Mescall', 'Sarah Y. Mason, Victor Heerman, George O''Neil', 'Irene Dunne, Robert Taylor, Charles Butterworth, Betty Furness, Sara Haden, Ralph Morgan, Henry Armetta, Gilbert Emery', 'NR', 'A playboy tries to redeem himself after his careless behavior causes a great man''s death.', 'A playboy tries to redeem himself after his careless behavior causes a great man''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcBLLMeKUjW1igNGwQ71njzB0Iz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47920'),
  ('382618819082039547', 'Magnificent Obsession', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Douglas Sirk, Russell Metty, William Holland', 'Robert Blees', 'Jane Wyman, Rock Hudson, Barbara Rush, Agnes Moorehead, Otto Kruger, Gregg Palmer, Paul Cavanagh, Sara Shane', 'NR', 'Reckless playboy Bob Merrick crashes his speedboat, requiring emergency attention from the town’s only resuscitator while a local hero, Dr. Phillips, dies waiting for the life-saving device. Merrick then tries to right his wrongs with the doctor’s widow, Helen, falling in love with her in the process.', 'Reckless playboy Bob Merrick crashes his speedboat, requiring emergency attention from the town’s only resuscitator while a local hero, Dr. Phillips, dies waiting for the life-saving device. Merrick then tries to right his wrongs with the doctor’s widow, Helen, falling in love with her in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/511Z4X0NdOfbjgycDHuedsm8zfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13457'),
  ('765393072791715218', 'Magnificent Times', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Oskar Roehler, Carl-Friedrich Koschnick', 'Jan Berger', 'Oliver Masucci, Katja Riemann, Samuel Finzi, Lize Feryn, Alexander Beyer, Margarita Broich, Katy Karrenbauer, Andrea Sawatzki', null, 'A plastic surgeon publishes an ad searching for a slave. Even if he meant it in an ironic way and is really looking for a housemaid, a lot of SM-subs are showing up in front of his house the next day...', 'A plastic surgeon publishes an ad searching for a slave. Even if he meant it in an ironic way and is really looking for a housemaid, a lot of SM-subs are showing up in front of his house the next day...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6kQIGCzd4XhmEOudRbWBUSQOkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510265'),
  ('583584170326875365', 'Magnificent Warriors', 1987, 'Action, Drama', 'David Chung, Ma Chun-Wah, Yun-Cheng Lo', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Michelle Yeoh, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Derek Yee, Lowell Lo Koon-Ting, Lau Chin-Dai, Chang Yi, Tetsuya Matsui, Hwang Jang-Lee', null, 'A daredevil airplane pilot and spy, who fights against the occupying Japanese forces in China, must rescue the ruler of the city of Kaal from the hands of a ruthless Japanese general and his advancing army.', 'A daredevil airplane pilot and spy, who fights against the occupying Japanese forces in China, must rescue the ruler of the city of Kaal from the hands of a ruthless Japanese general and his advancing army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oCT6fZknLmI8ET8wggMHshvWm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43637'),
  ('4785462991085349', 'Magnolia', 1999, 'Drama', 'Paul Thomas Anderson, Robert Elswit, Adam Druxman', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Tom Cruise, Philip Baker Hall, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Julianne Moore, William H. Macy, John C. Reilly, Melora Walters, Jeremy Blackman', 'R', 'On one random day in the San Fernando Valley, a dying father, a young wife, a male caretaker, a famous lost son, a police officer in love, a boy genius, an ex-boy genius, a game show host and an estranged daughter will each become part of a dazzling multiplicity of plots, but one story.', 'On one random day in the San Fernando Valley, a dying father, a young wife, a male caretaker, a famous lost son, a police officer in love, a boy genius, an ex-boy genius, a game show host and an estranged daughter will each become part of a dazzling multiplicity of plots, but one story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpfC325Jk6S38VTe5dDWjWtoyxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334'),
  ('35085400851797170', 'Magnum Cop', 1978, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Stelvio Massi, Riccardo Pallottini, Danilo Massi', 'Franz Antel, Gino Capone, Stelvio Massi', 'Maurizio Merli, Joan Collins, Franco Ressel, Werner Pochath, Annarita Grapputo, Alexander Trojan, Gastone Moschin, Andrea Scotti', null, 'A low-rent private investigator and former cop is sent to Austria on a job, and while there sees a number of seemingly unrelated coincidences that lead him into a strange web of corruption and decadence.', 'A low-rent private investigator and former cop is sent to Austria on a job, and while there sees a number of seemingly unrelated coincidences that lead him into a strange web of corruption and decadence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eA1EHiKslsU9xD1m2mNCFzOt3ov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90019'),
  ('418563213236704258', 'Magnum Force', 1973, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Ted Post, Frank Stanley', 'Michael Cimino, John Milius', 'Clint Eastwood, Hal Holbrook, Mitchell Ryan, David Soul, Felton Perry, Robert Urich, Kip Niven, Tim Matheson', 'R', '"Dirty" Harry Callahan is a San Francisco Police Inspector on the trail of a group of rogue cops who have taken justice into their own hands. When shady characters are murdered one after another in grisly fashion, only Dirty Harry can stop them.', '"Dirty" Harry Callahan is a San Francisco Police Inspector on the trail of a group of rogue cops who have taken justice into their own hands. When shady characters are murdered one after another in grisly fashion, only Dirty Harry can stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uX1uzn09seCftG3rTGLPyFXxV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10648'),
  ('735275034173989229', 'Magnum Opus', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Kirsten Lepore', 'Kirsten Lepore', 'Vin Diesel, Bradley Cooper, Fred Tatasciore', 'G', 'Groot sets out to paint a family portrait of himself and the Guardians, only to discover just how messy the artistic process can be.', 'Groot sets out to paint a family portrait of himself and the Guardians, only to discover just how messy the artistic process can be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8p8JsKokKbuNCn9yBirAg1oEwGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010823'),
  ('1054255386876575489', 'Magnus', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Benjamin Ree, Magnus Flåto, Benjamin Ree', 'Benjamin Ree, Linn-Jeanethe Kyed', 'Magnus Carlsen, Viswanathan Anand, Henrik Carlsen, Espen Agdestein, Ellen Carlsen, Jon-Ludvig Hammer', null, 'From a young age Magnus Carlsen had aspirations of becoming a champion chess player. While many players seek out an intensely rigid environment to hone their skills, Magnus’ brilliance shines brightest when surrounded by his loving and supportive family. Through an extensive amount of archival footage and home movies, director Benjamin Ree reveals this young man’s unusual and rapid trajectory to the pinnacle of the chess world. This film allows the audience to not only peek inside this isolated community but also witness the maturation of a modern genius.', 'From a young age Magnus Carlsen had aspirations of becoming a champion chess player. While many players seek out an intensely rigid environment to hone their skills, Magnus’ brilliance shines brightest when surrounded by his loving and supportive family. Through an extensive amount of archival footage and home movies, director Benjamin Ree reveals this young man’s unusual and rapid trajectory to the pinnacle of the chess world. This film allows the audience to not only peek inside this isolated community but also witness the maturation of a modern genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iREs3gCWywQHILPpc2cDBw6CRiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390409'),
  ('133942697010113625', 'Mägo de Oz - Diabulus In Opera', 2017, 'Music', null, null, 'Txus di Fellatio, Javier Domínguez "Zeta", Carlos Prieto ''Mohamed'', Juan Carlos Marín ''Carlitos'', Frank, Patricia Tapia, Fernando Mainer, Javi Diez', null, 'Diabulus in Opera is the fifth live album and fourth live DVD by the band Mägo de Oz, the concert was recorded on May 6, 2017 at the Arena Ciudad de México in collaboration with the Mexico Symphony Orchestra under the direction of the director of orchestra José Luis López Antón, originally the direction of the orchestra would be in charge of the soprano Pilar Jurado.', 'Diabulus in Opera is the fifth live album and fourth live DVD by the band Mägo de Oz, the concert was recorded on May 6, 2017 at the Arena Ciudad de México in collaboration with the Mexico Symphony Orchestra under the direction of the director of orchestra José Luis López Antón, originally the direction of the orchestra would be in charge of the soprano Pilar Jurado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RYLdAuPbSUvrm0jd2ESv0jGuF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568083'),
  ('62432661311729255', 'Magoo''s Puddle Jumper', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Pete Burness', null, 'Jim Backus, Daws Butler', null, 'At a used car lot, Mr. Magoo is intent on buying a car for his nephew Waldo. He is slick talked into buying an old clunker thanks to a shifty salesman but he drives it off anyway. Unfortunately, the myopic Magoo drives off a pier and under the ocean where he mistakes the various aquatic surroundings such as fish, sunken boats, and seals for other cars, dilapidated mansions, and a horn happy driver respectively.', 'At a used car lot, Mr. Magoo is intent on buying a car for his nephew Waldo. He is slick talked into buying an old clunker thanks to a shifty salesman but he drives it off anyway. Unfortunately, the myopic Magoo drives off a pier and under the ocean where he mistakes the various aquatic surroundings such as fish, sunken boats, and seals for other cars, dilapidated mansions, and a horn happy driver respectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A2afR28PYdWeKn2myfvghEfU6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243043'),
  ('345880556918211725', 'Magpie', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Sam Yates, Laura Bellingham, Amy Kate Dolan', 'Tom Bateman', 'Daisy Ridley, Shazad Latif, Matilda Lutz, Hiba Ahmed, Alistair Petrie, Pippa Bennett-Warner, Cherrelle Skeete, Jenny Galloway', 'R', 'A couple''s lives are thrown into disarray when their daughter is cast opposite a controversial major star.', 'A couple''s lives are thrown into disarray when their daughter is cast opposite a controversial major star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6mB5j1IiM00Pl2u71hQXRcHV70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974292'),
  ('969314662940424647', 'Magritte or the Object Lesson', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Luc de Heusch, Jacques Delcorde, Frédéric Geilfus', 'Jean Raine, Jacques Delcorde, Luc de Heusch', 'Serge Sauvion, René Magritte, Marcel Lecomte, Louis Scutenaire, Camille Goemans, Irène Hamoir', null, 'The surrealist painter René Magritte questions the objective reality and emphasizes the arbitrariness of the relationship between an object, its image and its name: the evocation of mystery consists of images of familiar things gathered or transformed in such a way that they no longer conform to our ideas, whether naive or wise.', 'The surrealist painter René Magritte questions the objective reality and emphasizes the arbitrariness of the relationship between an object, its image and its name: the evocation of mystery consists of images of familiar things gathered or transformed in such a way that they no longer conform to our ideas, whether naive or wise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdZWoRJFUHmWCuvq46mYxbCtPHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410076'),
  ('414505204431314570', 'Mahaan', 2022, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Karthik Subbaraj, Shreyaas Krishna', 'Karthik Subbaraj', 'Vikram, Dhruv Vikram, Bobby Simha, Simran, Sananth, Muthukumar, Ramachandran Durairaj, Subathra Robert', null, 'A man''s family leaves him when he strays from the path of ideological living in his search for personal freedom. However, as he realizes his ambitions, he also misses the presence of his son in his life. Having fulfilled his dream of becoming a billionaire, does life give him a second chance to be a father?', 'A man''s family leaves him when he strays from the path of ideological living in his search for personal freedom. However, as he realizes his ambitions, he also misses the presence of his son in his life. Having fulfilled his dream of becoming a billionaire, does life give him a second chance to be a father?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHcwUUy3gRVUEUepYOd7xkesiNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804337'),
