  ('447840023927838234', 'Mahrous the Minister''s Attaché', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Nader Galal, Ramy Imam', 'Youssef Maaty', 'Adel Emam, Kamal Al-Shenawy, Wafaa Amer, Hassan Mostafa, Osama Abbas, Manal Afifi, Sami Sarhan, Saeed Saleh', null, 'Mahrous, a simple man, is acquainted with the minister as they both hail from the same village. When Mahrous gets appointed at the minister''s office, he only causes trouble. However, as the two get involved in extra-marital relationships, they form a strange bond and become square in many endeavors.', 'Mahrous, a simple man, is acquainted with the minister as they both hail from the same village. When Mahrous gets appointed at the minister''s office, he only causes trouble. However, as the two get involved in extra-marital relationships, they form a strange bond and become square in many endeavors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vohNcYRn8vZc3Fv2lXUTESacYT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87266'),
  ('342321157419594881', 'Mai Mai Miracle', 2009, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama', 'Sunao Katabuchi, Shigehito Tsuji, Yukihiro Masumoto', 'Sunao Katabuchi', 'Mayuko Fukuda, Nako Mizusawa, Ei Morisako, Manami Honjo, Tamaki Matsumoto, Kazato Tomizawa, Miyo Wakita, Eiji Takemoto', null, 'Inspired by her grandfather''s stories, young Shinko embarks on wild flights of fancy about the history of the little town she lives in. But dreams can''t fend off the realities of growing up.', 'Inspired by her grandfather''s stories, young Shinko embarks on wild flights of fancy about the history of the little town she lives in. But dreams can''t fend off the realities of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9E1muIHzVoml9wwuVc6KJmO7MSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64809'),
  ('794833380746007337', 'Mai-chan''s Daily Life', 2014, 'Horror', 'Sade Satô, Matsuyama, Hiro', 'Sade Satô', 'An Koshi, Miyako Akane, Shôgo Maruyama, Soaco Roman', 'R', 'Miyako starts a live-in maid job and quickly discovers that housecleaning is the least of her duties, as her employers use the maids in their twisted fantasies. Her co-worker Mai-chan, who can miraculously recover from any injury, becomes the focus of horrific, indulgent violence that Miyako is soon drawn into.', 'Miyako starts a live-in maid job and quickly discovers that housecleaning is the least of her duties, as her employers use the maids in their twisted fantasies. Her co-worker Mai-chan, who can miraculously recover from any injury, becomes the focus of horrific, indulgent violence that Miyako is soon drawn into.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5wObiqXx9bMmjy4XeoRmafno58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372962'),
  ('989839256017559697', 'Maid in Manhattan', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Wayne Wang, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Glen Trotiner', 'Kevin Wade', 'Jennifer Lopez, Ralph Fiennes, Natasha Richardson, Stanley Tucci, Tyler Posey, Marissa Matrone, Frances Conroy, Chris Eigeman', 'PG-13', 'Marisa Ventura is a struggling single mom who works at a posh Manhattan hotel and dreams of a better life for her and her young son. One fateful day, hotel guest and senatorial candidate Christopher Marshall meets Marisa and mistakes her for a wealthy socialite. After an enchanting evening together, the two fall madly in love. But when Marisa''s true identity is revealed, issues of class and social status threaten to separate them. Can two people from very different worlds overcome their differences and live happily ever after?', 'Marisa Ventura is a struggling single mom who works at a posh Manhattan hotel and dreams of a better life for her and her young son. One fateful day, hotel guest and senatorial candidate Christopher Marshall meets Marisa and mistakes her for a wealthy socialite. After an enchanting evening together, the two fall madly in love. But when Marisa''s true identity is revealed, issues of class and social status threaten to separate them. Can two people from very different worlds overcome their differences and live happily ever after?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qweTKkAwvGPt2Wd76TFoh2c9yt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7303'),
  ('245057889961426225', 'Maid in Sweden', 1971, 'Drama', 'Dan Wolman', 'George T. Norris, Ronnie Friedland', 'Christina Lindberg, Monica Ekman, Krister Ekman, Leif Naeslund, Per-Axel Arosenius, Ittla Frodi, Tina Hedström, Henrik Meyer', 'R', 'Schoolgirl Inga goes to visit her sister in Stockholm and is shocked to find her living with her boyfriend, Casten.', 'Schoolgirl Inga goes to visit her sister in Stockholm and is shocked to find her living with her boyfriend, Casten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI9hLOxGfx5bPgygQrdMMDR6NLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47570'),
  ('380332291629633626', 'Maid to Order', 1987, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Amy Holden Jones, Shelly Johnson', 'Amy Holden Jones, Perry Howze, Randy Howze', 'Ally Sheedy, Beverly D''Angelo, Michael Ontkean, Valerie Perrine, Dick Shawn, Tom Skerritt, Merry Clayton, Begonya Plaza', 'PG', 'Spoiled Jessie Montgomery, whose wild behavior and spending excesses cause her well-meaning but exasperated millionaire father Charles to wish he never had her, is visited by fairy godmother Stella. In an effort to save Jessie, Stella casts a spell which causes Charles to no longer have a daughter. Jessie, now penniless and without a friend, must take a maid''s job to earn a living, and hopefully to learn her lesson.', 'Spoiled Jessie Montgomery, whose wild behavior and spending excesses cause her well-meaning but exasperated millionaire father Charles to wish he never had her, is visited by fairy godmother Stella. In an effort to save Jessie, Stella casts a spell which causes Charles to no longer have a daughter. Jessie, now penniless and without a friend, must take a maid''s job to earn a living, and hopefully to learn her lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5XNXwjRieKMixWL7rGgtLANf75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2608'),
  ('933028390283905566', 'MAID-DROID', 2008, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Katsuji Oyamada', 'Chisato Ōgawara', 'Akiho Yoshizawa, Anri Suzuki, Masayoshi Nogami, Hiroshi Fujita, Hiroyuki Kaneko, Yōko Satomi, Mari Yamaguchi, Abo', null, 'The main plotline concerns retired Mr Ueno, who since a child has been cared for by his late parents’ robot maid ‘Maria’ – a lifelike humanoid in a maid’s outfit! Over the years, Ueno has developed an unconsummated love for Maria, but although she has not ‘aged’ as such, she is now classed as an obsolete model and Ueno is finding it difficult replacing her fading battery… The secondary plotline involves Detective Yuri Akagi, who is investigating a series of rapes, which she believes may be being committed by a rogue droid.', 'The main plotline concerns retired Mr Ueno, who since a child has been cared for by his late parents’ robot maid ‘Maria’ – a lifelike humanoid in a maid’s outfit! Over the years, Ueno has developed an unconsummated love for Maria, but although she has not ‘aged’ as such, she is now classed as an obsolete model and Ueno is finding it difficult replacing her fading battery… The secondary plotline involves Detective Yuri Akagi, who is investigating a series of rapes, which she believes may be being committed by a rogue droid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qCpVYZwF0tPYX3BgLzIT6NqNzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86350'),
  ('665309469593547779', 'Maidaan', 2024, 'Drama', 'Amit Sharma, Aishwarya Agrawal, Priyanka Gaherwar', 'Saiwyn Quadras', 'Ajay Devgn, Priyamani, Gajraj Rao, Baharul Islam, Rudranil Ghosh, Ishtiyak Khan, Rishabh Joshi, Devansh Tapuriah', null, 'Inspired by the Indian national football team coach and manager Syed Abdul Rahim, who is regarded as the architect of Indian football, encapsulating the golden era from 1952 to 1962.', 'Inspired by the Indian national football team coach and manager Syed Abdul Rahim, who is regarded as the architect of Indian football, encapsulating the golden era from 1952 to 1962.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKbAVKQf6choCfasNWuYoSTOPBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668340'),
  ('249011959706111075', 'Maide''nin Altın Günü', 2017, 'Family, Comedy', 'Caner Özyurtlu', null, 'Ezgi Mola, Mesut Can Tomay, Hilmi Özçelik, Gülhan Tekin, Demet Gül, Nalan Olcayalp, Selma Arıkan, Aysun Tekeli', null, 'When a meticulous homemaker hosts a lavish get-together, her family heirloom gets stolen. She teams with her out-of-towner nephew to find the thief.', 'When a meticulous homemaker hosts a lavish get-together, her family heirloom gets stolen. She teams with her out-of-towner nephew to find the thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH6dH2E59kzoyLl0QLtXw38ZJLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477314'),
  ('663266769103101711', 'Maiden''s Cheek', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Lakis Antonakos, Marios Stavropoulos', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Orestis Makris, Hristos Tsaganeas, Giorgos Gavriilidis, Thodoros Moridis, Marika Krevata', null, 'Young teacher Floras arrives to teach a class at a girls’ high school in Athens. His students, daughters of rich Athenian families, are very spoilt making his and the other teachers work difficult. When he starts implementing discipline in his class, the girls use every means to get rid of him. But the most undisciplined, Lisa Papastavrou, falls in love with him.', 'Young teacher Floras arrives to teach a class at a girls’ high school in Athens. His students, daughters of rich Athenian families, are very spoilt making his and the other teachers work difficult. When he starts implementing discipline in his class, the girls use every means to get rid of him. But the most undisciplined, Lisa Papastavrou, falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGEZAYoSKlLG7ekJ7ZqgGmIjFeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297560'),
  ('1084858066146079784', 'Maidentrip', 2014, 'Adventure, Documentary', 'Jillian Schlesinger, Hillary Spera', null, 'Laura Dekker', null, '14-year-old Laura Dekker sets out on a two-year voyage in pursuit of her dream to become the youngest person ever to sail around the world alone.', '14-year-old Laura Dekker sets out on a two-year voyage in pursuit of her dream to become the youngest person ever to sail around the world alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8avFTtVCGcX9Akca7BdUAqyG60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169760'),
  ('211163317812956398', 'Maids', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fernando Meirelles, Nando Olival, Lauro Escorel', 'Cecília Homem de Mello, Nando Olival, Renata Melo', 'Graziella Moretto, Lena Roque, Olivia Araújo, Luis Miranda, Robson Nunes, Tiago Moraes, Cláudia Missura, Renata Melo', null, 'Five maids in São Paulo are observed in this episodic, impressionistic film. The women interact with each other, ride busses, work, and have longings: Rai for a husband, Créo for her lost daughter, Roxane for a career in modeling. Quitéria is naive, a gull for thieves. Cida has a husband and also a lover. While each woman gets what she wishes for (more or less), it doesn''t always make things better.', 'Five maids in São Paulo are observed in this episodic, impressionistic film. The women interact with each other, ride busses, work, and have longings: Rai for a husband, Créo for her lost daughter, Roxane for a career in modeling. Quitéria is naive, a gull for thieves. Cida has a husband and also a lover. While each woman gets what she wishes for (more or less), it doesn''t always make things better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szCMtfKNxvq9qkj0C9aIpI94TIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8444'),
  ('1120209249356321278', 'Maidstone', 1971, 'Drama', 'D. A. Pennebaker, Norman Mailer', 'Norman Mailer', 'Norman Mailer, Rip Torn, Paul Austin, Joy Bang, Ann Barry, Beverly Bentley, Eddie Bonette, Steve Borton', null, 'Over a booze-fueled, increasingly hectic five-day shoot in East Hampton, Norman Mailer and his cast and crew spontaneously unloaded onto film the lurid and loony chronicle of U.S. presidential candidate and filmmaker Norman T. Kingsley debating and attacking his hangers-on and enemies. This gonzo narrative, “an inkblot test of Mailer’s own subconscious” (Time), becomes something like a documentary on its own making when costar Rip Torn breaks the fourth wall in one of cinema’s most alarming on-screen outbursts.', 'Over a booze-fueled, increasingly hectic five-day shoot in East Hampton, Norman Mailer and his cast and crew spontaneously unloaded onto film the lurid and loony chronicle of U.S. presidential candidate and filmmaker Norman T. Kingsley debating and attacking his hangers-on and enemies. This gonzo narrative, “an inkblot test of Mailer’s own subconscious” (Time), becomes something like a documentary on its own making when costar Rip Torn breaks the fourth wall in one of cinema’s most alarming on-screen outbursts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iurUIRRHh1Va8MDA3a5uZ1BOCGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117424'),
  ('613050059713233383', 'Maigret', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Yves Angelo, Patrice Leconte', 'Patrice Leconte, Jérôme Tonnerre', 'Gérard Depardieu, Anne Loiret, Aurore Clément, Mélanie Bernier, Jade Labeste, Clara Antoons, Pierre Moure, Bertrand Poncet', null, 'In Paris, a young girl is found dead in a Parisian square, wearing an evening dress. Commissioner Maigret will try to identify her and then understand what happened to the victim.', 'In Paris, a young girl is found dead in a Parisian square, wearing an evening dress. Commissioner Maigret will try to identify her and then understand what happened to the victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWmJyzqXVSLzsq4XKXr4lIDlLBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752564'),
  ('154921542736429679', 'Maigret and the Dead Lover', 2026, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Justinien Schricke, Pierre Milon', 'Pascal Bonitzer', 'Denis Podalydès, Olivier Rabourdin, Micha Lescot, Laurent Poitrenaux, Irène Jacob, Manuel Guillot, Anne Alvaro, Julia Faure', null, 'Commissioner Maigret rushes to the Quai d’Orsay with Lieutenant Janvier. There, they find Mademoiselle Larrieu in a state of shock. That very morning, she discovered the bullet-riddled body of Mr. Berthier-Lagès, a renowned former ambassador whom she had served as a housekeeper for 46 years. While searching the victim''s apartment, Maigret and Janvier uncover hundreds of letters. The diplomat had maintained a fifty-year-long love correspondence with a certain Princess of Vuynes, whose husband - by a strange coincidence - had died just a few days earlier. As he confronts the various members of the two families and the suspicious silence of Mademoiselle Larrieu, Maigret finds himself faced with surprise after surprise, watching his certainties crumble - until the solution to the mystery finally hits him in the face at the very last moment...', 'Commissioner Maigret rushes to the Quai d’Orsay with Lieutenant Janvier. There, they find Mademoiselle Larrieu in a state of shock. That very morning, she discovered the bullet-riddled body of Mr. Berthier-Lagès, a renowned former ambassador whom she had served as a housekeeper for 46 years. While searching the victim''s apartment, Maigret and Janvier uncover hundreds of letters. The diplomat had maintained a fifty-year-long love correspondence with a certain Princess of Vuynes, whose husband - by a strange coincidence - had died just a few days earlier. As he confronts the various members of the two families and the suspicious silence of Mademoiselle Larrieu, Maigret finds himself faced with surprise after surprise, watching his certainties crumble - until the solution to the mystery finally hits him in the face at the very last moment...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siGwXsTqwSBC9VcbDM4tdhb1qLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1398486'),
  ('739471710846534169', 'Maigret and the St. Fiacre Case', 1959, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jean Delannoy, Louis Page, Joseph Drimal', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean Gabin, Michel Auclair, Valentine Tessier, Jacques Morel, Michel Vitold, Paul Frankeur, Robert Hirsch, Gabrielle Fontan', null, 'Police Commissioner Jules Maigret returns to the small village where he spent his childhood at the request of the Countess of Saint-Fiacre, who has received a disturbing anonymous letter.', 'Police Commissioner Jules Maigret returns to the small village where he spent his childhood at the request of the Countess of Saint-Fiacre, who has received a disturbing anonymous letter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUj0bDjdYUzRXntxN27g4tMs0Mc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434966'),
  ('1128662101956174731', 'Maigret at the Pigalle', 1966, 'Crime', 'Mario Landi, Giuseppe Ruzzolini', null, 'Gino Cervi, Lila Kedrova, Raymond Pellegrin, Alfred Adam, Christian Barbier, Riccardo Garrone, Claudio Biava, Enzo Cerusico', null, 'Maigret is about to leave for the holidays but a colleague asks him for help in investigating the mysterious murder of a stripper and a noblewoman, both of which took place in Pigalle.', 'Maigret is about to leave for the holidays but a colleague asks him for help in investigating the mysterious murder of a stripper and a noblewoman, both of which took place in Pigalle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbAjSk6ZqVWm72rOoFZejqPA3j8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263776'),
  ('548968420688678160', 'Maigret Sees Red', 1963, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Gilles Grangier, Georges Charlot, Louis Page', null, 'Jean Gabin, Françoise Fabian, Michel Constantin, Paul Frankeur, Guy Decomble, Paulette Dubost, Laurence Badie, Marcel Bozzuffi', null, 'Gangsters from the United States try to kill a key government witness whose testimony could help land an influential mobster in jail. It''s up to detective Maigret to deal with the FBI and a series of underworld figures to save the life of the witness...', 'Gangsters from the United States try to kill a key government witness whose testimony could help land an influential mobster in jail. It''s up to detective Maigret to deal with the FBI and a series of underworld figures to save the life of the witness...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cniyXfO8lOmAwBsdxuTesd1htU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76647'),
  ('829232398394236807', 'Maigret Sets a Trap', 1958, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jean Delannoy, Alain Kaminker, Joseph Drimal', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean Gabin, Annie Girardot, Olivier Hussenot, Jeanne Boitel, Lucienne Bogaert, Jean Debucourt, Paulette Dubost, Lino Ventura', 'NR', 'Four women were murdered, each was knifed and, though they had their clothes torn, they weren''t molested. As the famed police inspector Jules Maigret pieces the clues together, he comes to realize that for the elusive man that he suspects to be unmasked, he has to set him a trap.', 'Four women were murdered, each was knifed and, though they had their clothes torn, they weren''t molested. As the famed police inspector Jules Maigret pieces the clues together, he comes to realize that for the elusive man that he suspects to be unmasked, he has to set him a trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71pYPAf00xoaQ5cmH7lSbWbSOwl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37454'),
  ('690859083111442933', 'Maikäfer flieg', 2016, 'Drama', 'Mirjam Unger, Eva Testor', 'Sandra Bohle, Christine Nöstlinger, Mirjam Unger', 'Ursula Strauss, Lissy Pernthaler, Zita Gaier, Krista Stadler, Konstantin Khabenskiy, Hilde Dalik, Peter Schorn, Gerald Votava', null, 'A movie based on the book by Christine Nöstlinger “Maikäfer, flieg! Mein Vater, das Kriegsende, Cohn und ich”', 'A movie based on the book by Christine Nöstlinger “Maikäfer, flieg! Mein Vater, das Kriegsende, Cohn und ich”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unjwBtvi1wUIbdksXpiE7IabsiC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390415'),
