  ('295149981846914417', 'Main Aurr Mrs Khanna', 2009, 'Drama', 'Prem Soni, Ali Shah, Deepesh Sharma', 'Prem Soni', 'Salman Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Sohail Khan, Bappi Lahiri, Deepika Padukone, Preity Zinta, Dino Morea', null, 'Three people, each having different aspirations from life, are caught in a tangle of emotions and don’t know the way out. There’s a husband and wife with love eroding from their life. And there’s a single, happy-go-lucky dude who falls in love with the wife.', 'Three people, each having different aspirations from life, are caught in a tangle of emotions and don’t know the way out. There’s a husband and wife with love eroding from their life. And there’s a single, happy-go-lucky dude who falls in love with the wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsx9kbzMIDRP8qSrrWZO89MllZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24604'),
  ('168910958830427097', 'Main Hoon Na', 2004, 'Drama', 'Farah Khan, Sahiba Shaikh, V. Manikandan', 'Abbas Tyrewala, Rajesh Saathi, Farah Khan', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Sushmita Sen, Suniel Shetty, Zayed Khan, Amrita Rao, Boman Irani, Satish Shah, Kirron Kher', 'PG', 'An army major goes undercover as a college student. His mission is both professional and personal: to protect his general''s daughter from a radical militant, and to find his estranged half-brother.', 'An army major goes undercover as a college student. His mission is both professional and personal: to protect his general''s daughter from a radical militant, and to find his estranged half-brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiZ8BgmAsxKUEyO6ux8z6GHiE6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14134'),
