  ('932182147393813399', 'Main Ladega', 2024, 'Drama', 'Gaurav Rana', 'Akash Pratap Singh', 'Akash Pratap Singh, Ashwath Bhatt, Gandharv Dewan', null, 'A young boy escapes his troubled home, finding solace I in boxing at an army hostel, where he channels his pain into strength to protect his family.', 'A young boy escapes his troubled home, finding solace I in boxing at an army hostel, where he channels his pain into strength to protect his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHKCsn5FteTI4UyHPvFE64ua6BT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277236'),
  ('914257191452875158', 'Main Line to Terror', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Kazutami Hara', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Yoshio Shirasaka', 'Masaomi Kondo, Jirō Tamiya, Keiko Takahashi, Meiko Kaji, Hisashi Igawa, Asao Koike, Fumio Watanabe, Meika Seri', null, 'Akiyama is an intern, disgusted with the noise pollution caused by the bullet trains and the heart attacks that noise has been causing in older hospital patients, plots to disrupt and, in ten days, destroy a unit of the operation. He warns the Japan National Railway, that, if nothing is done to reduce the noise, he will derail a bullet train. Takigawa is the police detective sent to stop him.', 'Akiyama is an intern, disgusted with the noise pollution caused by the bullet trains and the heart attacks that noise has been causing in older hospital patients, plots to disrupt and, in ten days, destroy a unit of the operation. He warns the Japan National Railway, that, if nothing is done to reduce the noise, he will derail a bullet train. Takigawa is the police detective sent to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xH2fXEaQaGS4H78zbIpYA2TEqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457581'),
