  ('1009559199781652832', 'Main Man', 2018, 'Drama', 'Florian Forsch, Dino Osmanoviç', 'Florian Forsch', 'Adrian Grünewald, Frederik Schmid, Thomas Bartholomäus, Yuri Völsch, Jarl Lando Beger', null, 'For Kevin, a shy teenager, being bullied is part of everyday life. But one day an older guy, Benny, comes to his aid. Impressed by Benny''s self-as-sured appearance, Kevin seeks his company from then on, and increasingly idolizes him. But Benny''s intention is not to protect the younger boy, quite the contrary.', 'For Kevin, a shy teenager, being bullied is part of everyday life. But one day an older guy, Benny, comes to his aid. Impressed by Benny''s self-as-sured appearance, Kevin seeks his company from then on, and increasingly idolizes him. But Benny''s intention is not to protect the younger boy, quite the contrary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOaZgy1S2UL3RW21FvzORjM33K0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635420'),
  ('727002584658399109', 'Main Prem Ki Diwani Hoon', 2003, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sooraj Barjatya', null, 'Hrithik Roshan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Abhishek Bachchan, Himani Shivpuri, Johny Lever, Pankaj Kapur, Raju Srivastava, Reema Lagoo', null, 'Main Prem Ki Diwani Hoon is the story of Sanjana (Kareena Kapoor), a girl of today''s generation full of life and vibrant ecstasy. She lives life on her own terms and gets very upset when her mother Susheela (Himani Shivpuri), arranges for her to see a boy leading to a marriage prospect.', 'Main Prem Ki Diwani Hoon is the story of Sanjana (Kareena Kapoor), a girl of today''s generation full of life and vibrant ecstasy. She lives life on her own terms and gets very upset when her mother Susheela (Himani Shivpuri), arranges for her to see a boy leading to a marriage prospect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ubxLXZbSXi3MWk8nZRBDEoqfB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165402'),
  ('19380512286484445', 'Main Street', 1956, 'Drama', 'Juan Antonio Bardem, Michel Kelber, Marcelo Arroita-Jáuregui', 'Juan Antonio Bardem', 'Betsy Blair, José Suárez, Yves Massard, Luis Peña, Dora Doll, Alfonso Godá, Manuel Alexandre, José Calvo', null, 'A small town in Spain, October 1955. Isabel, a 35-year-old dreamer who feels like a failure because she is not married yet, becomes the new target of a group of soulless pranksters.', 'A small town in Spain, October 1955. Isabel, a 35-year-old dreamer who feels like a failure because she is not married yet, becomes the new target of a group of soulless pranksters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngp7v632ATVqJGmnN3xttfAO2n8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104607'),
  ('631695482724584928', 'Main Street', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Doyle', 'Horton Foote', 'Colin Firth, Ellen Burstyn, Patricia Clarkson, Orlando Bloom, Amber Tamblyn, Andrew McCarthy, Margo Martindale, Victoria Clark', 'PG', 'From the once thriving tobacco warehouses, to the current run-down and closed shops of Five Points, a diverse group of residents and their respective life changes when outsider Gus Leroy brings something new and potentially dangerous into their quiet town.', 'From the once thriving tobacco warehouses, to the current run-down and closed shops of Five Points, a diverse group of residents and their respective life changes when outsider Gus Leroy brings something new and potentially dangerous into their quiet town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrLwh5HWfTAkhpp6zmUrZs6JFcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54469'),
