  ('1064116804517500086', 'Main Zaroor Aaunga', 2019, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Chandrakant Singh', null, 'Arbaaz Khan, Govind Namdeo, Hemant Pandey, Aindrita Ray, Vikas Verma, Vineet Sharma', null, 'A successful businessman, Yash Malhotra falls in love and marries a beautiful model named Lisa. Their marital bliss is disrupted by the entry of a fashion photographer named Peter who connects with Lisa and this betrayal leads to a series of dangerous consequences.', 'A successful businessman, Yash Malhotra falls in love and marries a beautiful model named Lisa. Their marital bliss is disrupted by the entry of a fashion photographer named Peter who connects with Lisa and this betrayal leads to a series of dangerous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tq9mZ3aUQmHcMNi4xxvNTRMRLjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706915'),
  ('213890833130538912', 'Main, Meri Patni Aur Woh', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Chandan Arora', 'Pankaj Saraswat', 'Rajpal Yadav, Rituparna Sengupta, Kay Kay Menon, Vinod Nagpal, Varun Badola, Naseeruddin Shah, Vinod Nagpal', null, 'A short, nondescript man, Mithilesh Shukla marries a tall and beautiful woman. Now jealousy and Mithilesh''s own insecurities threaten to wreck his happy home.', 'A short, nondescript man, Mithilesh Shukla marries a tall and beautiful woman. Now jealousy and Mithilesh''s own insecurities threaten to wreck his happy home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hedAEBVB4TzodNZeixNP9xrqZ5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39218'),
  ('711535459336913558', 'Maine Dil Tujhko Diya', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Sohail Khan, Aamir Lal', 'Ranjeet Gupta', 'Sohail Khan, Sameera Reddy, Sanjay Dutt, Kabir Bedi, Dalip Tahil, Amrita Prakash, Rajpal Yadav, Sarfaraz Khan', null, 'Ayesha is the elder daughter of rich business tycoon Mr. Verma, an overprotective father who''s kept his two daughters away from modern influences. Ayesha goes to college and comes in contact with Ajay, the leader of a group called Aryans, responsible for handling the security at the college. Ajay''s soft-spoken nature and humble, down-to-earth attitude soon make Ayesha his most ardent admirer.', 'Ayesha is the elder daughter of rich business tycoon Mr. Verma, an overprotective father who''s kept his two daughters away from modern influences. Ayesha goes to college and comes in contact with Ajay, the leader of a group called Aryans, responsible for handling the security at the college. Ajay''s soft-spoken nature and humble, down-to-earth attitude soon make Ayesha his most ardent admirer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Rpm0wlAcV0JRns9TDCldAD2EQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277751'),
  ('993344901693698370', 'Maine Gandhi Ko Nahin Mara', 2005, 'Drama', 'Jahnu Barua', null, 'Anupam Kher, Urmila Matondkar, Parvin Dabas, Rajit Kapoor', null, 'Once known for his intellectual prowess, a retired professor (Anupam Kher) begins experiencing memory gaps and periods of forgetfulness. But while he tries to laugh it off, it soon becomes clear that the symptoms are a sign of a more serious illness, prompting his grown daughter (Urmila Matondkar) to move in as his caretaker. Meanwhile, as his mind regresses, he recalls a traumatic childhood memory involving the death of Mahatma Gandhi.', 'Once known for his intellectual prowess, a retired professor (Anupam Kher) begins experiencing memory gaps and periods of forgetfulness. But while he tries to laugh it off, it soon becomes clear that the symptoms are a sign of a more serious illness, prompting his grown daughter (Urmila Matondkar) to move in as his caretaker. Meanwhile, as his mind regresses, he recalls a traumatic childhood memory involving the death of Mahatma Gandhi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmxjQG998GVEcalvH8f2xIchbtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84096'),
  ('1047794642579793382', 'Maine Man', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Raymond St. Pierre', 'Raymond St. Pierre', 'Raymond St. Pierre, Curtain, Wall, Ceiling', 'G', 'A loop of a guy in Maine hanging out in his room.', 'A loop of a guy in Maine hanging out in his room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzMMSHv3LGOF4kiHDNBunBA7rg5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1399552'),
  ('628422280125127811', 'Maine Pyaar Kyun Kiya?', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Dhawan, Sabbir Khan, Vikas Sivaraman', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Salman Khan, Sushmita Sen, Katrina Kaif, Sohail Khan, Arshad Warsi, Isha Koppikar, Rajpal Yadav, Beena Kak', 'PG', 'Dr Samir is an absolute charmer when it comes to women, but he poses as a married man to keep them at bay. Love becomes a three-ring-circus for him after he ends up tangled in his web of lies with his girlfriend Sonia and pretend wife Naina.', 'Dr Samir is an absolute charmer when it comes to women, but he poses as a married man to keep them at bay. Love becomes a three-ring-circus for him after he ends up tangled in his web of lies with his girlfriend Sonia and pretend wife Naina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uV0P65zblJdjxeazaC4WC9UE6Ig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39217'),
  ('136835587653436810', 'Maine Pyar Kiya', 1989, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Sooraj Barjatya, Arvind Laad, Ravi Sanyal', 'Sooraj Barjatya', 'Salman Khan, Bhagyashree, Alok Nath, Rajeev Verma, Reema Lagoo, Ajit Vachani, Harish Patel, Deep Dhillon', null, 'After Suman''s father leaves her in the care of another family while he travels abroad, she falls in love with Prem. However, in order to for them to marry, Prem has to prove to Suman''s father that he is not the same as his own dad.', 'After Suman''s father leaves her in the care of another family while he travels abroad, she falls in love with Prem. However, in order to for them to marry, Prem has to prove to Suman''s father that he is not the same as his own dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqZ9CEbXVLrEVAZFpT2F7PAE7dV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27624'),
  ('22590319927591273', 'Maine-Ocean Express', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Rozier, Acácio de Almeida', 'Lydia Feld, Jacques Rozier', 'Luis Rego, Yves Afonso, Lydia Feld, Bernard Ménez, Rosa-Maria Gomes, Abdel Kedadouche, Bernard Dumaine, Pedro Armendáriz Jr.', null, '"Maine-Ocean" is the name of a train that rides from Paris to Saint-Nazaire (near the ocean). In that train, Dejanira, a Brazilian, has a brush with the two ticket inspectors. Mimi, another traveler and also a lawyer, helps her. The four of them will meet together later and live a few shifted adventures with a strange-speaking sailor (Mimi''s client).', '"Maine-Ocean" is the name of a train that rides from Paris to Saint-Nazaire (near the ocean). In that train, Dejanira, a Brazilian, has a brush with the two ticket inspectors. Mimi, another traveler and also a lawyer, helps her. The four of them will meet together later and live a few shifted adventures with a strange-speaking sailor (Mimi''s client).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rozC3lvWxHld3ux5OxrSXwtJP6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63663'),
  ('13116002084739946', 'Mainstream', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ricky R. Weaver, Richard Graves, Randin Brown', 'Tom Stuart, Gia Coppola', 'Andrew Garfield, Maya Hawke, Nat Wolff, Jason Schwartzman, Johnny Knoxville, Alexa Demie, Casey Frey, Kalena Yiaueki', 'R', 'A young woman thinks she’s found a path to internet stardom when she starts making YouTube videos with a charismatic stranger – until the dark side of viral celebrity threatens to ruin them both.', 'A young woman thinks she’s found a path to internet stardom when she starts making YouTube videos with a charismatic stranger – until the dark side of viral celebrity threatens to ruin them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vTf02WXyldeKN4kfwZRwwI4XbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557950'),
  ('283537322109535461', 'Maintenance Required', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Lacey Uhlemeyer, Paul Morris, Hamish Doyne-Ditmas', 'Lacey Uhlemeyer, Erin Falconer, Roo Berry', 'Madelaine Petsch, Jacob Scipio, Katy O''Brian, Madison Bailey, Matteo Lane, Jim Gaffigan, Naomi J. Ogawa, Inanna Sarkis', 'PG-13', 'Charlie, the fiercely independent owner of an all-female mechanic shop, is forced to reevaluate her future when a flashy corporate competitor moves in across the street. Seeking comfort, she turns to an anonymous online confidant - unaware she''s confiding in Beau, the very rival threatening her business. As sparks fly both online and off, the truth threatens to blow everything apart.', 'Charlie, the fiercely independent owner of an all-female mechanic shop, is forced to reevaluate her future when a flashy corporate competitor moves in across the street. Seeking comfort, she turns to an anonymous online confidant - unaware she''s confiding in Beau, the very rival threatening her business. As sparks fly both online and off, the truth threatens to blow everything apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM7Q1y0pmHPWZCPmGkAWGKdgu6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1352755'),
  ('554511995069421366', 'Mais qui a re-tué Pamela Rose ?', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Régis Blondeau', 'Julien Rappeneau', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Audrey Fleurot, Laurent Lafitte, Omar Sy, Guy Lecluyse, Jean-Claude Tran, Laurence Arné', null, 'French filmmaker Eric Lartigau directs the anarchic buddy comedy Bullit and Riper, originally released as Mais qui a tue Pamela Rose? French comedic television stars Kad Merad and Olivier Barroux are both the protagonists and the screenwriters. As a parody of Hollywood cop films, the story is set somewhere in the American Midwest as fabricated by the French. After losing his regular partner, FBI agent Richard Bullit (Merad) gets assigned to the book-learned cop Riper (Barroux) to investigate the death of a stripper. American movie stereotypes abound, such as shock jock Phil Canon (Gérard Darmon) and sheriff Steve Marley (Jean-Paul Rouve).', 'French filmmaker Eric Lartigau directs the anarchic buddy comedy Bullit and Riper, originally released as Mais qui a tue Pamela Rose? French comedic television stars Kad Merad and Olivier Barroux are both the protagonists and the screenwriters. As a parody of Hollywood cop films, the story is set somewhere in the American Midwest as fabricated by the French. After losing his regular partner, FBI agent Richard Bullit (Merad) gets assigned to the book-learned cop Riper (Barroux) to investigate the death of a stripper. American movie stereotypes abound, such as shock jock Phil Canon (Gérard Darmon) and sheriff Steve Marley (Jean-Paul Rouve).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/556VNOb4FKYoPqqFtMun6mNaDwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139374'),
  ('868471712165719586', 'Mais qui a tué Pamela Rose ?', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Eric Lartigau, Régis Blondeau', 'Kad Merad, Julien Rappeneau, Olivier Baroux', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Gérard Darmon, Jean-Paul Rouve, Bénédicte Loyen, Lionel Abelanski, Julie Bataille, Manuel Le Lièvre', null, 'FBI Agents Bullit and Riper investigate the murder of a young dancer called Pamela Rose, found dead in her motel room in Bornsville, a small american town. Despite their differences, they must team up: the local police is hostile and they can only count on themselves to solve the crime. They meet Ginger, Pamela''s best friend, and discover soon enough she knows more than she says.', 'FBI Agents Bullit and Riper investigate the murder of a young dancer called Pamela Rose, found dead in her motel room in Bornsville, a small american town. Despite their differences, they must team up: the local police is hostile and they can only count on themselves to solve the crime. They meet Ginger, Pamela''s best friend, and discover soon enough she knows more than she says.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m1hLUtU5xwPWUNOX7FVOyS0ekb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20106'),
  ('1002606735138738982', 'Maîtresse', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Barbet Schroeder, Néstor Almendros, Jean-François Stévenin', 'Barbet Schroeder, Paul Voujargol', 'Gérard Depardieu, Bulle Ogier, André Rouyer, Nathalie Keryan, Roland Bertin, Tony Taffin, Holger Löwenadler, Anny Bartanovski', null, 'After breaking into a house he believes is empty, thief Olivier is caught by the owner, Ariane, who turns out to be a dominatrix. Improbably falling for her, Olivier returns periodically, and an impulsive romance blossoms despite Ariane''s profession. Soon Olivier becomes more familiar with her work, even joining in on occasion. However, when he discovers that Ariane has a son, he attempts to "fix" her, hoping to give her a better life.', 'After breaking into a house he believes is empty, thief Olivier is caught by the owner, Ariane, who turns out to be a dominatrix. Improbably falling for her, Olivier returns periodically, and an impulsive romance blossoms despite Ariane''s profession. Soon Olivier becomes more familiar with her work, even joining in on occasion. However, when he discovers that Ariane has a son, he attempts to "fix" her, hoping to give her a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4F9aPUvaWgU1ifvuHlaQgN6Ohnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46978'),
  ('617026115980430489', 'Maixabel', 2021, 'Drama', 'Icíar Bollaín, Guillermo Escribano, Javier Agirre Erauso', 'Isa Campo, Icíar Bollaín', 'Blanca Portillo, Luis Tosar, Urko Olazábal, María Cerezuela, Tamara Canosa, María Jesús Hoyos, Arantxa Aranguren, Bruno Sevilla', null, 'In the year 2000, Maixabel Lasa’s husband, Juan Maria Jauregi, was killed by ETA. Eleven years later, she receives an incredible request: one of the men who killed Juan wants to meet with her in the Nanclares de la Oca prison in Araba (Spain), where he is serving his sentence after breaking ties with the terrorist group. Despite her reservations and her immense pain, Maixabel Lasa agrees to meet face to face with those who ended the life of the person who had been her companion since she was 16 years old. ‘Everyone deserves a second chance’, she said, when asked why she was willing to confront the man who killed her husband.', 'In the year 2000, Maixabel Lasa’s husband, Juan Maria Jauregi, was killed by ETA. Eleven years later, she receives an incredible request: one of the men who killed Juan wants to meet with her in the Nanclares de la Oca prison in Araba (Spain), where he is serving his sentence after breaking ties with the terrorist group. Despite her reservations and her immense pain, Maixabel Lasa agrees to meet face to face with those who ended the life of the person who had been her companion since she was 16 years old. ‘Everyone deserves a second chance’, she said, when asked why she was willing to confront the man who killed her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lOcGma9G2yak5qB6ITwg3j0PDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814312'),
  ('206307874745662271', 'Maja Ma', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Anand Tiwari, Debojeet Ray', 'Sumit Batheja', 'Madhuri Dixit, Ritwik Bhowmik, Barkha Singh, Gajraj Rao, Srishti Shrivastava, Rajit Kapoor, Sheeba Chaddha, Simone Singh', null, 'A rumour about an unassuming housewife threatens to disrupt her middle-class family''s life on the eve of her son''s engagement.', 'A rumour about an unassuming housewife threatens to disrupt her middle-class family''s life on the eve of her son''s engagement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfzBw0g0zKjyCpcTCEQEfq3gy0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:969797'),
  ('807584672591786868', 'Major', 2022, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Vamsi Patchipulusu, Sashi Kiran Tikka', 'Adivi Sesh', 'Adivi Sesh, Saiee Manjrekar, Sobhita Dhulipala, Murali Sharma, Prakash Raj, Revathi, Vinay Nallakadi, Anish Kuruvilla', 'R', 'This biopic follows the life of Indian Army officer Major Sandeep Unnikrishnan, from his childhood to his heroic actions during the 2008 Mumbai attacks.', 'This biopic follows the life of Indian Army officer Major Sandeep Unnikrishnan, from his childhood to his heroic actions during the 2008 Mumbai attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJOfJuyQVZPwNQ8g21Qv0lojQhC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605153'),
  ('72390390801182400', 'Major Barbara', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Pascal, Muir Mathieson, David Lean', 'George Bernard Shaw', 'Wendy Hiller, Rex Harrison, Robert Morley, Robert Newton, Sybil Thorndike, Emlyn Williams, Marie Lohr, Penelope Dudley-Ward', 'NR', 'Idealistic young Barbara is the daughter of rich weapons manufacturer Andrew Undershaft. She rebels against her estranged father by joining the Salvation Army. Wooed by professor-turned-preacher Adolphus Cusins, Barbara eventually grows disillusioned with her causes and begins to see things from her father''s perspective.', 'Idealistic young Barbara is the daughter of rich weapons manufacturer Andrew Undershaft. She rebels against her estranged father by joining the Salvation Army. Wooed by professor-turned-preacher Adolphus Cusins, Barbara eventually grows disillusioned with her causes and begins to see things from her father''s perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGn2yUY23pDkjw1OcfXfwYvkApA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38770'),
  ('290862759260627902', 'Major Dundee', 1965, 'Western, War', 'Sam Leavitt, Sam Peckinpah, John Veitch', 'Sam Peckinpah, Harry Julian Fink, Oscar Saul', 'Charlton Heston, Richard Harris, Jim Hutton, James Coburn, Michael Anderson Jr., Senta Berger, Mario Adorf, Brock Peters', 'PG-13', 'During the last winter of the Civil War, cavalry officer Amos Dundee leads a contentious troop of Army regulars, Confederate prisoners and scouts on an expedition into Mexico to destroy a band of Apaches who have been raiding U.S. bases in Texas.', 'During the last winter of the Civil War, cavalry officer Amos Dundee leads a contentious troop of Army regulars, Confederate prisoners and scouts on an expedition into Mexico to destroy a band of Apaches who have been raiding U.S. bases in Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afdhdupMyfn3tDoL3XosgQF82gX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29715'),
  ('469231832371287104', 'Major Grom', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Vladimir Besedin, Aleksandra Rozhdestvenskaya, Arseny Kan', 'Artem Gabrelyanov, Vladimir Besedin', 'Aleksandr Gorbatov, Ivan Fominov, Anton Kuznetsov, Danila Yakushev, Oysel More Despaygne, Alina Bunk, Anatoliy Koshcheev, Evgeniya Shcherbakova', null, 'Igor Grom, a skilled detective from St. Petersburg, happened to be at the scene of a bank robbery and decides to stop them.', 'Igor Grom, a skilled detective from St. Petersburg, happened to be at the scene of a bank robbery and decides to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gLABGKMMaUbodrH3adB9afwWj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438597'),
  ('22043558839853552', 'Major Grom: Plague Doctor', 2021, 'Action, Adventure', 'Asya Gusakova, Oleg Trofim, Maxim Zhukov', 'Artem Gabrelyanov, Vladimir Besedin, Valentina Tronova', 'Tikhon Zhiznevsky, Lyubov Aksyonova, Aleksey Maklakov, Aleksandr Seteykin, Sergey Goroshko, Dmitry Chebotarev, Mikhail Evlanov, Oleg Chugunov', 'PG-13', 'In present day St. Petersburg, police major Igor Grom, an honest and skilled cop with unconventional methods, pursues a vigilante murderer in the mask of a plague doctor.', 'In present day St. Petersburg, police major Igor Grom, an honest and skilled cop with unconventional methods, pursues a vigilante murderer in the mask of a plague doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PsiX8or0QHg3LKLbh4VyF0bLj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529106'),
  ('32379716046678461', 'Major Grom: The Game', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Oleg Trofim, Maxim Zhukov, Aleksandra Kozlova', 'Artem Gabrelyanov, Nikolay Shishkin, Ekaterina Krasner', 'Tikhon Zhiznevsky, Lyubov Aksyonova, Aleksandr Seteykin, Aleksey Maklakov, Oleg Chugunov, Sergey Goroshko, Olga Sutulova, Matvey Lykov', null, 'Police Major Igor Grom is known throughout St. Petersburg for his punchy character and uncompromising attitude towards criminals of all stripes. Incredible strength, analytical mindset and integrity — all this makes Major Thunder a real superhero. His life is perfect: during the day he catches criminals with his partner Dima Dubin, and spends the evenings in the company of journalist Yulia Pchelkina. The complete idyll is interrupted by the appearance in the city of a mysterious villain calling himself a Ghost. He offers Thunder to play a dangerous game, the stake in which is the lives of ordinary people.', 'Police Major Igor Grom is known throughout St. Petersburg for his punchy character and uncompromising attitude towards criminals of all stripes. Incredible strength, analytical mindset and integrity — all this makes Major Thunder a real superhero. His life is perfect: during the day he catches criminals with his partner Dima Dubin, and spends the evenings in the company of journalist Yulia Pchelkina. The complete idyll is interrupted by the appearance in the city of a mysterious villain calling himself a Ghost. He offers Thunder to play a dangerous game, the stake in which is the lives of ordinary people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ssOkbkJ1SiF401jYhLej30NhOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1080252'),
  ('469351103180773259', 'Major League', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Reynaldo Villalobos, David S. Ward, Christine Larson', 'David S. Ward', 'Tom Berenger, Charlie Sheen, Corbin Bernsen, Margaret Whitton, James Gammon, Rene Russo, Wesley Snipes, Charles Cyphers', 'R', 'When Rachel Phelps inherits the Cleveland Indians from her deceased husband, she''s determined to move the team to a warmer climate—but only a losing season will make that possible, which should be easy given the misfits she''s hired. Rachel is sure her dream will come true, but she underestimates their will to succeed.', 'When Rachel Phelps inherits the Cleveland Indians from her deceased husband, she''s determined to move the team to a warmer climate—but only a losing season will make that possible, which should be easy given the misfits she''s hired. Rachel is sure her dream will come true, but she underestimates their will to succeed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypUedY9zX4nGGf1lQv1UGc8PhPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9942'),
  ('854503938205851507', 'Major League II', 1994, 'Comedy', 'David S. Ward, Victor Hammer, Louis Race', 'R.J. Stewart', 'Charlie Sheen, Tom Berenger, Corbin Bernsen, Dennis Haysbert, James Gammon, Omar Epps, Eric Bruskotter, Takaaki Ishibashi', 'PG', 'After losing in the ALCS the year before, the Cleveland Indians are determined to make it into the World Series this time! However, they first have to contend with Rachel Phelps again when she buys back the team.', 'After losing in the ALCS the year before, the Cleveland Indians are determined to make it into the World Series this time! However, they first have to contend with Rachel Phelps again when she buys back the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QAb0gZusyMsZ1W5ce85plVciDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11067'),
  ('242292084844463510', 'Major League: Back to the Minors', 1998, 'Comedy', 'John Warren, Tim Suhrstedt, Christine Larson', 'John Warren', 'Scott Bakula, Corbin Bernsen, Dennis Haysbert, Takaaki Ishibashi, Jensen Daggett, Eric Bruskotter, Walton Goggins, Ted McGinley', 'PG-13', 'At the behest of Roger Dorn -- the Minnesota Twins'' silver-tongued new owner -- washed-up minor league hurler Gus Cantrell steps up to the plate to take over as skipper of the club''s hapless farm team. But little does he know that Dorn has an ulterior motive to generate publicity with a grudge match between the big leaguers and their ragtag Triple A affiliate.', 'At the behest of Roger Dorn -- the Minnesota Twins'' silver-tongued new owner -- washed-up minor league hurler Gus Cantrell steps up to the plate to take over as skipper of the club''s hapless farm team. But little does he know that Dorn has an ulterior motive to generate publicity with a grudge match between the big leaguers and their ragtag Triple A affiliate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bV0Dpx5zAy2TbOzOFSCEBSGcakJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9771'),
  ('391915802575577942', 'Major Payne', 1995, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Nick Castle, Richard Bowen, James Griffin', 'Dean Lorey, Gary Rosen, Damon Wayans', 'Damon Wayans, Karyn Parsons, William Hickey, Michael Ironside, Albert Hall, Steven Martini, Chris Owen, Andrew Leeds', 'PG-13', 'Major Benson Winifred Payne is being discharged from the Marines. Payne is a killin'' machine, but the wars of the world are no longer fought on the battlefield. A career Marine, he has no idea what to do as a civilian, so his commander finds him a job - commanding officer of a local school''s JROTC program, a bunch of ragtag losers with no hope.', 'Major Benson Winifred Payne is being discharged from the Marines. Payne is a killin'' machine, but the wars of the world are no longer fought on the battlefield. A career Marine, he has no idea what to do as a civilian, so his commander finds him a job - commanding officer of a local school''s JROTC program, a bunch of ragtag losers with no hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWHx5eq7PELkF3If7LrrhuBskRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11008'),
  ('46776889025968727', 'Major Saab', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Tinnu Anand', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Ajay Devgn, Sonali Bendre, Nafisa Ali, Mohan Joshi, Shahbaz Khan, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat', null, 'Virendra is a spoiled young man newly enrolled in the Indian army. Major Jasbir Singh Rana, a tough disciplinarian, is in charge of transforming him into a brave soldier and a noble man.', 'Virendra is a spoiled young man newly enrolled in the Indian army. Major Jasbir Singh Rana, a tough disciplinarian, is in charge of transforming him into a brave soldier and a noble man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mS6zYGLA8ObDDRtP5HuI91QWc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84321'),
  ('705927653308298527', 'Major: The Ball of Friendship', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Drama', 'Kouji Aoki, Takao Kato, Katsuaki Kamata', 'Michihiro Tsuchiya', 'Motoko Kumai, Showtaro Morikubo, Fuyuka Ono, Junko Noda, Rie Kugimiya, Takehito Koyasu, Yuuko Sasamoto, Shunsuke Sakuya', null, 'Goro briefly returns to Japan after a triumphant campaign in the US. He is heading towards Fukuoka where he played baseball when he was a fifth grader. Having just moved into a new town, this is where Goro faced a critical point in his life.', 'Goro briefly returns to Japan after a triumphant campaign in the US. He is heading towards Fukuoka where he played baseball when he was a fifth grader. Having just moved into a new town, this is where Goro faced a critical point in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3dXbHyRns01wXE9YpJ3mnvA4Mu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77940'),
  ('605235560477430157', 'Majorettes in Space', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Stoeber, Thierry d''Orlan de Polignac, Benoît Rizzotti', 'David Fourier', 'Elise Laurent, Jean-Marc Delacruz, Olivier Laville, Clea Delacruz, Aurelien Bianco, Philippe Bianco', null, 'Dimitri, a Soviet cosmonaut of Soyouz 27 likes majorettes. Catherine and Laurent like making love. Jean-Paul II loves airports. Vincent loves boys.', 'Dimitri, a Soviet cosmonaut of Soyouz 27 likes majorettes. Catherine and Laurent like making love. Jean-Paul II loves airports. Vincent loves boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzLmo7amQOnpJnn8V6woYczX3vL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49118'),
  ('502621698229207048', 'Majority', 2010, 'Drama', 'Seren Yüce, Ahmet Yılmaz, Barış Yıkılmaz', 'Seren Yüce', 'Bartu Küçükçağlayan, Settar Tanrıöğen, Nihal Koldaş, Esme Madra, Cem Zeynel Kılıç, İlhan Hacıfazlıoğlu, Mehmet Ünal, Guzide Balcı', null, 'A middle class young man rebels against his father’s brutish authority and seeks a rough romance with a woman of ethnic minority. Yuce’s moral tale draws from the example of today’s Turkish youth and the timeless shadow of fathers over sons.', 'A middle class young man rebels against his father’s brutish authority and seeks a rough romance with a woman of ethnic minority. Yuce’s moral tale draws from the example of today’s Turkish youth and the timeless shadow of fathers over sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ82V5nm0xRrcnsm1hWdzUE3sBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54424'),
  ('1050449700544827769', 'Makala', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Emmanuel Gras, Emmanuel Gras', 'Emmanuel Gras', 'Kabwita Kasongo, Lydie Kasongo', null, 'Kabwita, a young man living with his wife and daughters in Kolwezi, a town in the southwest of the Democratic Republic of Congo, dreams of buying land to build a house. To do so, he produces charcoal (makala), extracted from the ashes of a mighty hardwood tree. Carrying the sacks of charcoal on the back of his bicycle, he embarks on a dangerous journey to sell them on the market.', 'Kabwita, a young man living with his wife and daughters in Kolwezi, a town in the southwest of the Democratic Republic of Congo, dreams of buying land to build a house. To do so, he produces charcoal (makala), extracted from the ashes of a mighty hardwood tree. Carrying the sacks of charcoal on the back of his bicycle, he embarks on a dangerous journey to sell them on the market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9fjuXC9WmF2L1vg85P1eKmOcrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453358'),
  ('4384456175984190', 'Makdee', 2002, 'Family, Horror, Fantasy', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Hemant Chaturvedi, Abhishek Chaubey', 'Vishal Bhardwaj', 'Shweta Basu Prasad, Shabana Azmi, Makrand Deshpande, Daya Shankar Pandey, Alap Mazgaonkar, Mohini Mathur, Shammi Narang', null, 'One half of an identical set of twins, the mischievous Chunni is known in her hometown for the pranks she plays, notably on her father, the schoolteacher and the village butcher. To get out of trouble, Chunni often impersonates her sister Munni and makes others look a fool.', 'One half of an identical set of twins, the mischievous Chunni is known in her hometown for the pranks she plays, notably on her father, the schoolteacher and the village butcher. To get out of trouble, Chunni often impersonates her sister Munni and makes others look a fool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HuLZToYLNaeDDwZCbWV3UP12gF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134841'),
  ('934261285917339462', 'Make a Bow and Kiss', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Takeshi Furusawa, Takahiro Takasugi', 'Yacco Kaga', 'Elaiza Ikeda, Masaki Nakao, Takashi Matsuo, Katsuhiro Suzuki, Takahisa Maeyama, Minori Hagiwara, Kousei Yuki, Keito Kanamori', null, 'Mikami Yota is smitten with the archery of his older schoolmate Kishimoto, a high school senior who heads the archery club. Mikami clumsily conveys his ardent feelings to An, and she tries to respond to his affections. Their feelings are mutual but somehow things don''t go smoothly between them, and then other guys appear on the scene to complicate things.', 'Mikami Yota is smitten with the archery of his older schoolmate Kishimoto, a high school senior who heads the archery club. Mikami clumsily conveys his ardent feelings to An, and she tries to respond to his affections. Their feelings are mutual but somehow things don''t go smoothly between them, and then other guys appear on the scene to complicate things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ1O1DBRxqlDEmEhRNp9KjQdOqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526306'),
