  ('558698190096274208', 'Make Me Shudder', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Poj Arnon, Arnon Chunprasert, Thanadol Nuansut', 'Poj Arnon', 'Kunatip Pinpradub, Kittipat Samantrakulchai, Bhuripat Vejvongsatechavat, Withawat Thaokhamlue, Ritthichai Tasarika, Worrachai Sirikongsuwan, Supakit Amornthitipong, Brian Richard Garton', null, 'A group of student want to challenge themselves by entering the most haunted building of their school, which is forbidden.', 'A group of student want to challenge themselves by entering the most haunted building of their school, which is forbidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQ8QSPznHiswqucQqW7mOyKwXEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251735'),
  ('243674261867759272', 'Make Me Shudder 2: Shudder Me Mae Nak', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Poj Arnon, Arnon Chunprasert, Thanadol Nuansut', 'Poj Arnon', 'Wanida Termthanaporn, Pongpitch Preechaborisuthikul, Kunatip Pinpradub, Kittipat Samantrakulchai, Bhuripat Vejvongsatechavat, Ritthichai Tasarika, Worrachai Sirikongsuwan, Brian Richard Garton', null, 'When a group of young children decided to pay homage to the grandmother''s court, but then unexpected things happened when everyone fell into the loop at the same time as Mae Nak Phra Khanong.', 'When a group of young children decided to pay homage to the grandmother''s court, but then unexpected things happened when everyone fell into the loop at the same time as Mae Nak Phra Khanong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEfKrtcm0PB0Kiz4YFosQnRCgGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316745'),
  ('1093135728579507349', 'Make Mine Mink', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Robert Asher, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Michael Pertwee, Peter Coke, Peter Blackmore', 'Terry-Thomas, Athene Seyler, Hattie Jacques, Billie Whitelaw, Elspeth Duxbury, Jack Hedley, Raymond Huntley, Freddie Frinton', 'NR', 'In a mansion block in Knightsbridge, a gang of middle-aged biddies decide to brighten up "the dullness of the tea time of life" by staging a series of robberies on furriers, then donating the proceeds to charitable concerns. Terry Thomas as a retired army officer leads the gang, which includes Athene Seyler and Hattie Jacques, on a series of capers that nearly go awry when their maid, Billie Whitelaw, an ex-con and also a resident of the block, falls for a police officer.', 'In a mansion block in Knightsbridge, a gang of middle-aged biddies decide to brighten up "the dullness of the tea time of life" by staging a series of robberies on furriers, then donating the proceeds to charitable concerns. Terry Thomas as a retired army officer leads the gang, which includes Athene Seyler and Hattie Jacques, on a series of capers that nearly go awry when their maid, Billie Whitelaw, an ex-con and also a resident of the block, falls for a police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLClqmwoW0XCP3hHcpVy8bFIDS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44023'),
  ('394150057944377113', 'Make Mine Music', 1946, 'Animation, Music, Family', 'Clyde Geronimi, Robert Cormack, Joshua Meador', null, 'Nelson Eddy, Dinah Shore, Benny Goodman, Jerry Colonna, Andy Russell, Sterling Holloway, Tatiana Riabouchinska, David Lichine', 'G', 'In the tradition of Fantasia, Make Mine Music is a glorious collection of musically charged animated shorts featuring such fun-filled favorites as "Peter and the Wolf", narrated by the beloved voice behind Winnie the Pooh. In addition you''ll enjoy such classic cartoon hits as "Casey at the Bat," "The Whale Who Wanted to Sing at the Met" and "Johnnie Fedora and Alice Bluebonnet."', 'In the tradition of Fantasia, Make Mine Music is a glorious collection of musically charged animated shorts featuring such fun-filled favorites as "Peter and the Wolf", narrated by the beloved voice behind Winnie the Pooh. In addition you''ll enjoy such classic cartoon hits as "Casey at the Bat," "The Whale Who Wanted to Sing at the Met" and "Johnnie Fedora and Alice Bluebonnet."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Mu98243emXAKy8iZfymUJDgTpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20343'),
  ('931615339653250898', 'Make the Yuletide Gay', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Rob Williams', 'Rob Williams', 'Keith Jordan, Wyatt Fenner, Hallee Hirsh, Kelly Keaton, Derek Long, Alison Arngrim, Adamo Ruggiero, Ian Buchanan', null, 'The holidays get overly festive as Olaf "Gunn" Gunnunderson, an out-and-proud gay college student, crawls back into the closet to survive the holidays with his parents. But when his boyfriend, Nathan, shows up at their doorstep unannounced, Gunn must put on a charade to keep the relationship a secret. With pressure mounting from all sides, will Gunn come out before the truth does?', 'The holidays get overly festive as Olaf "Gunn" Gunnunderson, an out-and-proud gay college student, crawls back into the closet to survive the holidays with his parents. But when his boyfriend, Nathan, shows up at their doorstep unannounced, Gunn must put on a charade to keep the relationship a secret. With pressure mounting from all sides, will Gunn come out before the truth does?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziljiSKOvpYxuBbVsf5UDfh3uCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26032'),
  ('765326135898202574', 'Make Up', 2011, 'Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Lien Yi-chi, Randy Che', null, 'Nikki Hsieh, Matt Wu, Sonia Sui, Ray Chang, Michael Chang, Zooey Tseng, Pu Hsueh-liang, Kate Yeung', null, 'Being a mortuary cosmetologist, Min-Hsiu is used to seeing dead bodies until she accidentally spots a female corpse – her high school teacher Miss Chen Ting. Nie Cheng-Fu, Chen Ting’s husband, loves his wife profoundly and tries to find more memories of her with Min-Hsiu’s help. At that point, a detective, Kuo Yung-Ming, senses that the truth behind this case may not be as simple as it seems. Death is not the end of life, but another beginning of it...', 'Being a mortuary cosmetologist, Min-Hsiu is used to seeing dead bodies until she accidentally spots a female corpse – her high school teacher Miss Chen Ting. Nie Cheng-Fu, Chen Ting’s husband, loves his wife profoundly and tries to find more memories of her with Min-Hsiu’s help. At that point, a detective, Kuo Yung-Ming, senses that the truth behind this case may not be as simple as it seems. Death is not the end of life, but another beginning of it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diMS7400FWFq1lGyuKbwfdtVbKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80212'),
  ('633798342500069051', 'Make Up', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claire Oakley, Nick Cooke, Olivia Scott-Webb', 'Claire Oakley', 'Molly Windsor, Joseph Quinn, Stefanie Martini, Theo Barklem-Biggs, Elodie Wilton, Lisa Palfrey, Emilia Copeland, Maureen Wild', null, 'After Ruth moves in with her boyfriend in a remote holiday park, tensions rise as she makes an unsettling discovery that lures her into a spiral of obsession.', 'After Ruth moves in with her boyfriend in a remote holiday park, tensions rise as she makes an unsettling discovery that lures her into a spiral of obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9hOwlERpcTkMhXFBJiVq39V0hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584583'),
  ('762703266009011445', 'Make Us Dream', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Sam Blair, David Bird', null, 'Steven Gerrard, Jamie Carragher, Michael Owen, Kenny Dalglish, Steve Bruce, Alex Gerrard, Paul Gerrard, Struan Marshall', null, 'Steven Gerrard became perhaps the greatest player in the history of Liverpool FC, but did so when success and trophies were declining. It became his personal mission to lift the famous club back to the top. That loyalty raised him to God-like status with Liverpool fans, but was an unbearable burden, bringing with it a profound sense of responsibility to live up to their and his own expectations.', 'Steven Gerrard became perhaps the greatest player in the history of Liverpool FC, but did so when success and trophies were declining. It became his personal mission to lift the famous club back to the top. That loyalty raised him to God-like status with Liverpool fans, but was an unbearable burden, bringing with it a profound sense of responsibility to live up to their and his own expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikuKQxE1tfVMCIZVsMyePaZlNEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561894'),
  ('640492400651964975', 'Make Way for Tomorrow', 1937, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leo McCarey, Boris Morros, William C. Mellor', 'Viña Delmar', 'Victor Moore, Beulah Bondi, Fay Bainter, Thomas Mitchell, Porter Hall, Barbara Read, Maurice Moscovitch, Elisabeth Risdon', 'NR', 'An elderly couple are forced to separate themselves from each other after their children refuse to take both into one house.', 'An elderly couple are forced to separate themselves from each other after their children refuse to take both into one house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPl6TfnIIJzdPXk9g6QPwFwTIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41059'),
  ('609387825252764036', 'Make Your Move', 2013, 'Music', 'Duane Adler, Gregory Middleton', 'Duane Adler', 'Derek Hough, Kwon BoA, Will Yun Lee, Wesley Jonathan, Izabella Miko, Jefferson Brown, Miki Ishikawa, Rick Gonzalez', 'PG-13', 'A pair of star-crossed dancers in New York find themselves at the center of a bitter rivalry between their brothers'' underground dance clubs.', 'A pair of star-crossed dancers in New York find themselves at the center of a bitter rivalry between their brothers'' underground dance clubs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQ3isQnlHt5Gm5Mo3FgkxXQDlRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212769'),
  ('530955546905528761', 'Make-Out with Violence', 2008, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Deagol Brothers', 'Deagol Brothers, Cody De Vos, Eric Lehning', 'Eric Lehning, Cody De Vos, Leah High, Brett Miller, Tia Shearer, Jordan Lehning, Josh Duensing, Shellie Marie Shartzer', null, 'A genre-bending tale of a boy trying to fulfill his unrequited love for a girl who has risen from the dead. It tells the story of twin brothers Patrick and Carol Darling, newly graduated from high school and struggling to come to terms with the mysterious disappearance of their friend, the bright and beautiful Wendy Hearst. When a drive through the countryside surrounding their suburban community leads to the discovery of Wendy''s mysteriously animated corpse, the boys secretly transport the un-dead Wendy to an empty house in hopes of somehow bringing her back to life. As the sweltering summer pushes on, they must maintain the appearance of normalcy for their friends and family as they search for ways to revive the Wendy they once knew, or, failing that, to satisfy their own quests for love amongst the living and the dead.', 'A genre-bending tale of a boy trying to fulfill his unrequited love for a girl who has risen from the dead. It tells the story of twin brothers Patrick and Carol Darling, newly graduated from high school and struggling to come to terms with the mysterious disappearance of their friend, the bright and beautiful Wendy Hearst. When a drive through the countryside surrounding their suburban community leads to the discovery of Wendy''s mysteriously animated corpse, the boys secretly transport the un-dead Wendy to an empty house in hopes of somehow bringing her back to life. As the sweltering summer pushes on, they must maintain the appearance of normalcy for their friends and family as they search for ways to revive the Wendy they once knew, or, failing that, to satisfy their own quests for love amongst the living and the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIUeYwV0zTUbJh7Hqshqq5fQt21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51122'),
  ('1063426451951177693', 'Makellos - Eine kurze Welle des Glücks', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Dirk Kummer', 'Uli Brée', 'Adele Neuhauser, Manuel Rubey, Ulrich Noethen, Caroline Frank, Lisa Kreuzer', null, 'Constanze (Adele Neuhauser) steckt in einer leidenschaftslosen Ehe, in der nur noch das gemeinsame Trachtengeschäft harmoniert. Die Flaute im Bett stört ihren Mann Anton (Ulrich Noethen) nicht, doch Constanze sehnt sich nach Leidenschaft. Ihre Freundin Karin (Caroline Frank) schlägt vor, einen Callboy zu engagieren und bucht das Treffen. Doch Constanze flieht peinlich berührt aus der Hotelsuite und trifft zufällig den jüngeren Ricardo (Manuel Rubey), der ebenfalls im Escort-Service arbeitet. Mit ihm beginnt sie eine erfüllende Affäre. Doch dann erpresst jemand die Unternehmerin und ihren Ehemann damit. Constanze ist erschüttert und beginnt Misstrauen zu hegen. Denn auch Ehemann Anton scheint ein Geheimnis zu haben, das alles verändert.', 'Constanze (Adele Neuhauser) steckt in einer leidenschaftslosen Ehe, in der nur noch das gemeinsame Trachtengeschäft harmoniert. Die Flaute im Bett stört ihren Mann Anton (Ulrich Noethen) nicht, doch Constanze sehnt sich nach Leidenschaft. Ihre Freundin Karin (Caroline Frank) schlägt vor, einen Callboy zu engagieren und bucht das Treffen. Doch Constanze flieht peinlich berührt aus der Hotelsuite und trifft zufällig den jüngeren Ricardo (Manuel Rubey), der ebenfalls im Escort-Service arbeitet. Mit ihm beginnt sie eine erfüllende Affäre. Doch dann erpresst jemand die Unternehmerin und ihren Ehemann damit. Constanze ist erschüttert und beginnt Misstrauen zu hegen. Denn auch Ehemann Anton scheint ein Geheimnis zu haben, das alles verändert.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FyOJbXAkMDnYU2dKw4YJ9AeAKoBf.jpg', 'plex:movie:makellos-eine-kurze-welle-des-glucks'),
  ('999372354077593586', 'Makinavaja, el último choriso', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Suárez, Francesc Brualla, Carlos Suárez', 'Carlos Suárez', 'Andrés Pajares, Jesús Bonilla, Mario Pardo, Pedro Reyes, Mary Santpere, Llàtzer Escarceller, Albert Vidal, Carmen Conesa', null, 'A movie based on the Spanish comic strip of the same name.', 'A movie based on the Spanish comic strip of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sGYzCBjgRMOKefySoGlJeppp2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96581'),
  ('1128963558953048380', 'Making ''Taxi Driver''', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Bouzereau, Maury Dahlen, Jim Garcia', 'Laurent Bouzereau', 'Robert De Niro, Martin Scorsese, Cybill Shepherd, Jodie Foster, Paul Schrader, Albert Brooks, Peter Boyle, Harvey Keitel', null, 'A behind the scenes snapshot of the making of one of the greatest films ever made. Filled with trivia, interviews from cast and crew, and more.', 'A behind the scenes snapshot of the making of one of the greatest films ever made. Filled with trivia, interviews from cast and crew, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BgJyNnauningY7LNqQ5b6EZ6Pf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244186'),
  ('1039936416789086571', 'Making ''The Shining''', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Vivian Kubrick', null, 'Jack Nicholson, Vivian Kubrick, Terry Needham, Stanley Kubrick, Danny Lloyd, Scatman Crothers, Shelley Duvall, Gert Kubrick', null, 'Directed and edited by Stanley Kubrick''s daughter Vivian Kubrick, this film offers a look behind the scenes during the making of The Shining.', 'Directed and edited by Stanley Kubrick''s daughter Vivian Kubrick, this film offers a look behind the scenes during the making of The Shining.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upBsuweJjBftrkJGqVf8PHCdH0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18875'),
  ('831694177831890938', 'Making "The Matrix"', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Josh Oreck', null, 'Keanu Reeves, Carrie-Anne Moss, Laurence Fishburne, Hugo Weaving, Joe Pantoliano, Barrie M. Osborne, Joel Silver, Lilly Wachowski', null, 'A promotional making-of documentary for the film The Matrix (1999) that devotes its time to explaining the digital and practical effects contained in the film. This is very interesting, seeing as how they''re giving away the cinematic secrets that they created solely for the this movie, that have now been spoofed and referenced in countless other films.', 'A promotional making-of documentary for the film The Matrix (1999) that devotes its time to explaining the digital and practical effects contained in the film. This is very interesting, seeing as how they''re giving away the cinematic secrets that they created solely for the this movie, that have now been spoofed and referenced in countless other films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2yIfRJYwpCgHON1Ig1pNKMWTxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684431'),
  ('377532434234262061', 'Making a Living', 1914, 'Comedy', 'Henry Lehrman, Frank D. Williams, Enrique Juan Vallejo', 'Reed Heustis', 'Charlie Chaplin, Henry Lehrman, Virginia Kirtley, Alice Davenport, Billy Gilbert, Emma Clifton, Charles Inslee, Beverly Griffith', null, 'A swindler scams a newspaper reporter-photographer and then, not realizing where the man is employed, applies for a job at his newspaper.', 'A swindler scams a newspaper reporter-photographer and then, not realizing where the man is employed, applies for a job at his newspaper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNhgTadTVm7oR6YL20nr7fcrvT6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53368'),
  ('717099780375829434', 'Making All Quiet on the Western Front', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ingo Becker', null, 'Edward Berger, Felix Kammerer, Albrecht Schuch, Aaron Hilmer, Edin Hasanović, Daniel Brühl, Moritz Klaus, James Friend', 'R', 'Go behind the scenes of Edward Berger’s WWI epic and see how the cast and crew crafted its amazing authenticity — from the sets to the SFX prosthetics.', 'Go behind the scenes of Edward Berger’s WWI epic and see how the cast and crew crafted its amazing authenticity — from the sets to the SFX prosthetics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBIWuD6FHhxjkgAd2ESH9dgYbgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086967'),
  ('240222855269268276', 'Making Contact', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror, Adventure', 'Roland Emmerich, Egon Werdin', 'Roland Emmerich', 'Joshua Morrell, Eva Kryll, Tammy Shields, Jan Zierold, Barbara Klein, Jerry L. Hall Jr., Sean Johnson, Matthias Kraus', 'PG', 'A nine year old boy named Joey, who after the tragic death of his father, begins to experience psychic powers such as allowing him to move inanimate objects with his mind, set things on fire, and even communicate with his dead father. However, not everything is good for Joey as his newly gained powers accidentally awake an evil supernatural force that is contained inside the body of an old ventriloquist''s dummy that Joey found in an abandoned house. The supernatural Dummy shows similar powers to Joey''s, and soon he puts the lives of everyone near Joey in danger as the evil Dummy has dark plans for Joey''s special powers.', 'A nine year old boy named Joey, who after the tragic death of his father, begins to experience psychic powers such as allowing him to move inanimate objects with his mind, set things on fire, and even communicate with his dead father. However, not everything is good for Joey as his newly gained powers accidentally awake an evil supernatural force that is contained inside the body of an old ventriloquist''s dummy that Joey found in an abandoned house. The supernatural Dummy shows similar powers to Joey''s, and soon he puts the lives of everyone near Joey in danger as the evil Dummy has dark plans for Joey''s special powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RM5CqGzcG5f5gnt1vtOoMDFv0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7011'),
  ('906573967577598334', 'Making It Up', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Guillermo Calderón', 'Guillermo Calderón', 'Ilse Salas, Paulina Gaitán, Regina Blandón, Martha Claudia Moreno, Michelle Betancourt, Tamara Vallarta, Fabrizio Santini, Mariana Villegas', 'R', 'Ana and Rita are flat broke. So when unpredictable Alex offers them a job, they kind of have to say yes -- to the gig and to a big ol'' mess.', 'Ana and Rita are flat broke. So when unpredictable Alex offers them a job, they kind of have to say yes -- to the gig and to a big ol'' mess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88yU3QJKafHNqc5NprIJ3Cd6Svn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032262'),
  ('71781268026607033', 'Making Love', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Arthur Hiller, David M. Walsh', 'Barry Sandler', 'Michael Ontkean, Kate Jackson, Harry Hamlin, Wendy Hiller, Arthur Hill, Nancy Olson, John Dukakis, Terry Kiser', 'R', 'A perfect typical LA couple find their happily-ever-after life broken when the husband confronts his long-repressed attraction for other men.', 'A perfect typical LA couple find their happily-ever-after life broken when the husband confronts his long-repressed attraction for other men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRH2fvcYqz0kZ1Gid6nJ7Y0t8gm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41913'),
  ('1013638121756695303', 'Making Love', 2000, 'Drama, Music', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Fabio Cianchetti, Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani', 'Paolo Maurensig, Simona Izzo, Ricky Tognazzi', 'Hans Matheson, Mélanie Thierry, Lee Williams, Gabriel Byrne, Ricky Tognazzi, Peter Vaughan, Nia Roberts, Adriano Pappalardo', null, 'Costanza is drinking a beer in a Prague pub, a summer night in 1968, while a violinist enters and starts playing a "canone inverso" for her. It is not a case, that music and that violin have a story behind that could concern her. It is the love story between Jeno Varga and the music, between Jeno and Sophie.', 'Costanza is drinking a beer in a Prague pub, a summer night in 1968, while a violinist enters and starts playing a "canone inverso" for her. It is not a case, that music and that violin have a story behind that could concern her. It is the love story between Jeno Varga and the music, between Jeno and Sophie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l8wiy3rFNwMQbV4Lf55FrxnkJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29866'),
  ('481031332792968154', 'Making Michael Jackson''s Thriller', 1983, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jerry Kramer', null, 'Michael Jackson, John Landis, Rick Baker, Ola Ray, Kelly Kimball, Michael Peters, George Folsey Jr.', null, 'Featuring interviews with director John Landis, make-up artist Rick Baker, and the King of Pop himself, Making Michael Jackson''s Thriller takes you on a behind-the-scenes journey from pre-production to shooting on the ghoulish graveyard set of Michael Jackson''s legendary music video and short film.', 'Featuring interviews with director John Landis, make-up artist Rick Baker, and the King of Pop himself, Making Michael Jackson''s Thriller takes you on a behind-the-scenes journey from pre-production to shooting on the ghoulish graveyard set of Michael Jackson''s legendary music video and short film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwBzYtsKwvS0vwfeOKWpIcAw6c3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118106'),
  ('513498856999738933', 'Making Mr. Right', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Susan Seidelman, Edward Lachman', 'Floyd Byars, Laurie Frank', 'John Malkovich, Ann Magnuson, Glenne Headly, Ben Masters, Laurie Metcalf, Polly Bergen, Harsh Nayyar, Hart Bochner', 'PG-13', 'When image consultant Frankie Stone is hired by a tech company to teach a scientist’s “Ulysses Robot” how to be a man, she winds up developing very real feelings for the faux human.', 'When image consultant Frankie Stone is hired by a tech company to teach a scientist’s “Ulysses Robot” how to be a man, she winds up developing very real feelings for the faux human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsJFNUQz1ObK85kRk06ahyW5dKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32058'),
  ('969688048953226332', 'Making Of', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cédric Kahn, Antoine Carrard, Patrick Ghiringhelli', 'Cédric Kahn, Fanny Burdino, Samuel Doux', 'Denis Podalydès, Jonathan Cohen, Stefan Crepon, Souheila Yacoub, Emmanuelle Bercot, Xavier Beauvois, Valérie Donzelli, Riad Gahmi', null, 'Simon, a well-known French filmmaker, starts shooting his next film. A story about workers fighting to protect their factory from being relocated. But nothing goes as planned... His producer Viviane wants to rewrite the ending and is threatening to cut the budget; his own crew goes on strike; his personal life is in shambles; and to make things worse, his lead actor Alain is an egocentric jerk. Joseph, an extra who wants to get into the film industry, agrees to direct the making of and shoot the behind-the-scenes. He takes his role very seriously and starts following around the crew, capturing all this mess... What follows is proof that the making of can sometimes be far better than the film itself!', 'Simon, a well-known French filmmaker, starts shooting his next film. A story about workers fighting to protect their factory from being relocated. But nothing goes as planned... His producer Viviane wants to rewrite the ending and is threatening to cut the budget; his own crew goes on strike; his personal life is in shambles; and to make things worse, his lead actor Alain is an egocentric jerk. Joseph, an extra who wants to get into the film industry, agrees to direct the making of and shoot the behind-the-scenes. He takes his role very seriously and starts following around the crew, capturing all this mess... What follows is proof that the making of can sometimes be far better than the film itself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcqnq8IAAFpwWduPJYYsTC1Nz0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972119'),
  ('1021345281933906670', 'Making of The Last of Us', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Danny Gariepy, Michael Quigley, Allan Leader', null, 'Pedro Pascal, Bella Ramsey, Neil Druckmann, Craig Mazin, Anna Torv, Troy Baker, Ashley Johnson, Ksenia Sereda', 'PG-13', 'Featuring extensive interviews with the cast and crew, this all-access documentary gives a rare glimpse into the daunting behind-the-scenes efforts that went into the production of the HBO Original smash hit series The Last of Us.', 'Featuring extensive interviews with the cast and crew, this all-access documentary gives a rare glimpse into the daunting behind-the-scenes efforts that went into the production of the HBO Original smash hit series The Last of Us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nter1KTaQjmkGCjvSu5u01FoecP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100287'),
  ('508421905780850562', 'Making Off', 2012, 'Horror, Crime, Comedy', 'Cédric Dupuis, David Gendreau', 'Cédric Dupuis', 'Olivier Bureau, Nathalie Van Tongelen, Céline Berti, Mickaël Collart, Jérôme Thévenet, Sébastien Ventura, Jonathan Juré', null, 'A young filmmaker sets out to make the most terrifying horror film of all time. But shooting without money and a cast of only his non-actor friends, the director soon realizes the only way to make the most realistic horror movie is to actually murder his entire cast on camera. This is the footage from that movie.', 'A young filmmaker sets out to make the most terrifying horror film of all time. But shooting without money and a cast of only his non-actor friends, the director soon realizes the only way to make the most realistic horror movie is to actually murder his entire cast on camera. This is the footage from that movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHt2txXAA167PnFXgRJht5pGvQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108739'),
  ('50630806911582517', 'Making Out', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Walter Boos, Olaf R. Benold, Klaus Werner', 'Günther Hunold', 'Katja Bienert, Manuela Kohldorfer, Sylvia Engelmann, Renate Langer, Gaby Fritz, Rosl Mayr, Margarete Gerber, Helena Rosenkranz', null, 'This is the last of the infamous German "Schoolgirl Report" movies. The story involves a bunch of teenagers and their teacher rehearsing "Romeo and Juliet" and discussing tales of modern love.', 'This is the last of the infamous German "Schoolgirl Report" movies. The story involves a bunch of teenagers and their teacher rehearsing "Romeo and Juliet" and discussing tales of modern love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHlKZkPCoe9RVjU5m7vKhjTftzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70642'),
  ('189344284265637530', 'Making Plans for Lena', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christophe Honoré, Laurent Brunet, Sylvie Peyre', 'Geneviève Brisac, Christophe Honoré', 'Chiara Mastroianni, Marina Foïs, Marie-Christine Barrault, Jean-Marc Barr, Fred Ulysse, Louis Garrel, Marcial Di Fonzo Bo, Alice Butaud', null, 'Ever since she broke up with Nigel, Lena soldiers on through life as best she can with her two kids. She valiantly overcomes the obstacles put in her way. But she has yet to confront the worst of them: Her unstoppable family has decided, by any means necessary, to make her happy.', 'Ever since she broke up with Nigel, Lena soldiers on through life as best she can with her two kids. She valiantly overcomes the obstacles put in her way. But she has yet to confront the worst of them: Her unstoppable family has decided, by any means necessary, to make her happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fG0KSmDxcU6ynnaWt3qrK1WXXVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31208'),
  ('898016951212111963', 'Making Squid Game: The Challenge', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Nicola Brown, Rikki Finlay, Tim Harcourt, Toni Ireland, Stephen Lambert, Rich Leist, Hwang Dong-hyuk, Figgy Figueroa', 'PG-13', 'Go behind the scenes and witness how the "Squid Game"-inspired reality show transformed from a scripted drama to a cutthroat, nail-biting competition.', 'Go behind the scenes and witness how the "Squid Game"-inspired reality show transformed from a scripted drama to a cutthroat, nail-biting competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78yTLvtsMntVN1cLfzBuZj870pe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214667'),
  ('642337630303586506', 'Making the Grade', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Dorian Walker', 'Gene Quintano', 'Judd Nelson, Dana Olsen, Jonna Lee, Gordon Jump, Walter Olkewicz, Ronald Lacey, Dan Schneider, Andrew Dice Clay', 'R', 'Lazy preppie Palmer Woodrow hires street-smart Eddie Keaton to go to school for him while he lives it up in Europe. Eddie falls in love with preppie gal Tracey, upsetting Biff, the Hoover Academy bully. When his bookie from the old neighborhood, Dice, comes to collect on Eddie''s gambling debts and Palmer returns early from Europe, the scheme slowly starts to unravel. Soon, Eddie can''t even tell whose side he''s really on.', 'Lazy preppie Palmer Woodrow hires street-smart Eddie Keaton to go to school for him while he lives it up in Europe. Eddie falls in love with preppie gal Tracey, upsetting Biff, the Hoover Academy bully. When his bookie from the old neighborhood, Dice, comes to collect on Eddie''s gambling debts and Palmer returns early from Europe, the scheme slowly starts to unravel. Soon, Eddie can''t even tell whose side he''s really on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mihPxIkGvGPzDgi1fMrE6cx5Ykq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55727'),
  ('266389216338864277', 'Making The Witcher', 2020, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Nathan Wiley', null, 'Henry Cavill, Joey Batey, Anya Chalotra, Freya Allan, Lauren Schmidt Hissrich, Tomek Bagiński, Eamon Farren, Adam Levy', 'R', 'Journey into the extraordinary world of "The Witcher" — from casting the roles to Jaskier''s catchy song — in this behind-the-scenes look at the series.', 'Journey into the extraordinary world of "The Witcher" — from casting the roles to Jaskier''s catchy song — in this behind-the-scenes look at the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYnwBAUPQn5WmurROH1ravCC6Wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736759'),
  ('35217228010610725', 'Making The Witcher: Season 2', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Nathan Wiley', null, 'Henry Cavill, Anya Chalotra, Freya Allan, Joey Batey, Kim Bodnia, Anna Shaffer, Lauren Schmidt Hissrich, Tomek Bagiński', 'PG-13', 'Explore the secrets and lore of "The Witcher" Season 2 — from new monsters and locales to Geralt''s redesigned armor — in this behind-the-scenes look.', 'Explore the secrets and lore of "The Witcher" Season 2 — from new monsters and locales to Geralt''s redesigned armor — in this behind-the-scenes look.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gV1xbofuPUvEH6IEUPMmj9tUNhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917263'),
  ('21519648146687583', 'Making Unorthodox', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Marlene Melchior', null, null, null, 'Documentary about the making of the Netflix FIlm "Unorthodox"', 'Documentary about the making of the Netflix FIlm "Unorthodox"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9mG4q3e2XlgogJXbsst4LnI8mG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:686786'),
  ('311480384473081382', 'Making Waves: The Art of Cinematic Sound', 2019, 'Documentary, History', 'Midge Costin, Sandra Chandler', 'Bobette Buster', 'Walter Murch, Ben Burtt, Gary Rydstrom, Sofia Coppola, Christopher Nolan, Ryan Coogler, Robert Redford, Barbra Streisand', null, 'The history of cinematic sound, told by legendary sound designers and visionary filmmakers.', 'The history of cinematic sound, told by legendary sound designers and visionary filmmakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jafF7jcl116rzohZydL1VfK1y2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595841'),
  ('133443007083112394', 'Mako: The Jaws of Death', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Grefé, Adrienne Bourbeau, Gayle DeCamp', 'Robert W. Morgan', 'Richard Jaeckel, Jennifer Bishop, Buffy Dee, Harold Sakata, John Davis Chandler, Richard O''Barry, Luke Halpin, Dan Fitzgerald', 'NR', 'A man accidentally learns that he has a mystical connection with sharks, and is given a strange medallion by a shaman. Becoming more and more alienated from normal society, he develops an ability to communicate with sharks telepathically, setting out to destroy anybody who harms sharks. People enter into his strange world to exploit his weird passion, and he uses the animals to gain revenge on anybody who double crosses him.', 'A man accidentally learns that he has a mystical connection with sharks, and is given a strange medallion by a shaman. Becoming more and more alienated from normal society, he develops an ability to communicate with sharks telepathically, setting out to destroy anybody who harms sharks. People enter into his strange world to exploit his weird passion, and he uses the animals to gain revenge on anybody who double crosses him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr59VuliyXNQRtVYUAGXtfTZ0jK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97559'),
  ('895692216856307789', 'Makrykostas and Kontogiorgis', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Vassilis Mariolis', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Dinos Iliopoulos, Kostas Hatzihristos, Pantelis Zervos, Lavrentis Dianellos, Joly Garbi, Periklis Hristoforidis, Aleka Stratigou, Kostas Papahristos', null, 'Stelios Kondogiorgis (Dinos Iliopoulos) and Thomas Makrykostas (Costas Hajihristos) are two quiet men that come from the same Peloponnese village yet do not know each other. Their families however are involved in a bloody feud that started 80 years ago. Stelios and Thomas are the last male members from each family. After the last murders in the village where a member of each family died, Stelios'' uncle (Pantelis Zervos) urges him to find and kill Thomas for revenge lest he finds him and kills him first. At the same time Thomas is visited by his aunt (Joly Garbi) who asks of him the same and provides him with weapons. Despite everything, neither Stelios nor Thomas are interested in murdering one another and they are both terrified from the idea that a stranger is looking for them in order to kill them. So, they decide to leave their respective jobs and hide at some remote hotel. Luck brings them together without them knowing of each other''s identity as they share a room.', 'Stelios Kondogiorgis (Dinos Iliopoulos) and Thomas Makrykostas (Costas Hajihristos) are two quiet men that come from the same Peloponnese village yet do not know each other. Their families however are involved in a bloody feud that started 80 years ago. Stelios and Thomas are the last male members from each family. After the last murders in the village where a member of each family died, Stelios'' uncle (Pantelis Zervos) urges him to find and kill Thomas for revenge lest he finds him and kills him first. At the same time Thomas is visited by his aunt (Joly Garbi) who asks of him the same and provides him with weapons. Despite everything, neither Stelios nor Thomas are interested in murdering one another and they are both terrified from the idea that a stranger is looking for them in order to kill them. So, they decide to leave their respective jobs and hide at some remote hotel. Luck brings them together without them knowing of each other''s identity as they share a room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAK3iKslN77lmc8zRIXNUdUSLGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147330'),
  ('826610233295791703', 'Maksim Perepelitsa', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Anatoliy Granik, V. Sadovskiy, A. Sokolov', 'Ivan Stadnyuk', 'Leonid Bykov, Konstantin Sorokin, Aleksandr Borisov, Mykola Yakovchenko, Tatyana Pelttser, Georgiy Vitsin, Lidiya Fedoseyeva-Shukshina, Boris Arakelov', null, 'Maxim Perepelitsa is a cheerful, mischievous and resourceful young man from a Ukrainian village. He loves to make up stories and invent practical jokes. When he is drafted into the Russian Army, he doesn''t stop his antics.', 'Maxim Perepelitsa is a cheerful, mischievous and resourceful young man from a Ukrainian village. He loves to make up stories and invent practical jokes. When he is drafted into the Russian Army, he doesn''t stop his antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9JRpOahjvOtg7eVG0Xvdg3bpsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174720'),
  ('785184412973560374', 'Maktub', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Paco Arango, Carlos Suárez', 'Paco Arango', 'Diego Peretti, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Goya Toledo, Rosa María Sardà, Amparo Baró, Mariví Bilbao, Andoni Hernandez, Jorge Garcia', null, 'The title refers to those strange coincidences that happen to us sometimes and that seem inevitable, like a product of destiny. Inspired by the experience of a Canarian child victim of cancer, the film is conceived as a Christmas story.', 'The title refers to those strange coincidences that happen to us sometimes and that seem inevitable, like a product of destiny. Inspired by the experience of a Canarian child victim of cancer, the film is conceived as a Christmas story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fB9koSVdEGNzmLuY4nGowCZiE6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80277'),
  ('665393369358421909', 'Mala Mala', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Dan Sickles, Antonio Santini, Adam Uhl', 'Antonio Santini, Dan Sickles', 'Samantha Close, Ivana Fred, Denise Rivera, Soraya Santiango Solla, Alberic Prados, April Carrión', null, 'In a celebration of the trans community in Puerto Rico, the fissure between internal and external is an ever-present battle. A unique exploration of self-discovery and activism, featuring a diverse collection of subjects that include LGBTQ advocates, business owners, sex workers, and a boisterous group of drag performers who call themselves The Doll House, Mala Mala portrays a fight for personal and community acceptance paved with triumphant highs and devastating lows.', 'In a celebration of the trans community in Puerto Rico, the fissure between internal and external is an ever-present battle. A unique exploration of self-discovery and activism, featuring a diverse collection of subjects that include LGBTQ advocates, business owners, sex workers, and a boisterous group of drag performers who call themselves The Doll House, Mala Mala portrays a fight for personal and community acceptance paved with triumphant highs and devastating lows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIwD6NfnxpIVmV8cuc02grV55Bx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264164'),
  ('1049775938448988795', 'Mala Noche', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gus Van Sant, John J. Campbell', 'Gus Van Sant', 'Doug Cooeyate, Tim Streeter, Sam Downey, Nyla McCarthy, Ray Monge, Robert Lee Pitchlynn, Gus Van Sant', 'NR', 'Walt is a lonely convenience store clerk who has fallen in love with a Mexican migrant worker named Johnny. Though Walt has little in common with the object of his affections — including a shared language — his desire to possess Johnny prompts a sexual awakening that results in a tangled love triangle.', 'Walt is a lonely convenience store clerk who has fallen in love with a Mexican migrant worker named Johnny. Though Walt has little in common with the object of his affections — including a shared language — his desire to possess Johnny prompts a sexual awakening that results in a tangled love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAtkeNjk054tEl3jCHtF1wOFCx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383'),
  ('205936962270787112', 'Mala Persona', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Fer García-Ruiz, Rafa García, Irene Puig-Sedó', 'Daniel Padró, Santos Mercero', 'Arturo Valls, Malena Alterio, Julián Villagrán, José Corbacho, Sara Jiménez, Teresa Lozano, Diva O''Branco, Víctor Benjumea', null, 'Pepe is the best person in the world, until he discovers that he has a terminal illness and has months to live. To avoid suffering for his loved ones, Pepe decides to become the worst person in the world and thus keep them away from him so that they don''t miss him when he dies.', 'Pepe is the best person in the world, until he discovers that he has a terminal illness and has months to live. To avoid suffering for his loved ones, Pepe decides to become the worst person in the world and thus keep them away from him so that they don''t miss him when he dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eN0mKvsil3HMcusKp00xWacBFxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187364'),
  ('404528178179869137', 'Malabar Princess', 2004, 'Drama', 'Gilles Legrand', 'Marie-Aude Murail', 'Jacques Villeret, Claude Brasseur, Clovis Cornillac, Michèle Laroque, Jules-Angelo Bigarnet, Damien Jouillerot, Roland Marchisio, Patrick Ligardes', null, 'A man leaves his 8-year old son with his father-in-law who lives near the glacier where the boy''s mother died.', 'A man leaves his 8-year old son with his father-in-law who lives near the glacier where the boy''s mother died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orBkbxbdkcLT18XHwj1nKpOidwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60030'),
  ('871697679259216366', 'Malady of Love', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Deray, Jean-François Robin', 'Danièle Thompson', 'Nastassja Kinski, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Michel Piccoli, Jean-Claude Brialy, Souad Amidou, Jean-Paul Roussillon, Jean-Luc Porraz, Sophie d''Aulan', null, 'Two physicians, one old and one young, fall in love with the same woman, Juliette, a quixotic hairdresser. First, she is with Raoul, the older one; then passion for Clément, the younger doctor, takes over. Raoul fights back, playing on Clément''s guilt and Juliette''s lack of self-assurance; then, Clément makes his case to Juliette, abandons his fiancée, and takes her to the provinces where he sets up practice and asks her to have a baby. She panics and abruptly leaves Clément, taking up with Raoul again. When she contracts Hodgkin''s disease and the treatment does no good, Raoul believes she has the malady of love. Is there a cure?', 'Two physicians, one old and one young, fall in love with the same woman, Juliette, a quixotic hairdresser. First, she is with Raoul, the older one; then passion for Clément, the younger doctor, takes over. Raoul fights back, playing on Clément''s guilt and Juliette''s lack of self-assurance; then, Clément makes his case to Juliette, abandons his fiancée, and takes her to the provinces where he sets up practice and asks her to have a baby. She panics and abruptly leaves Clément, taking up with Raoul again. When she contracts Hodgkin''s disease and the treatment does no good, Raoul believes she has the malady of love. Is there a cure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbIYolgOrrClsIg5QinODJe8myK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97844'),
