  ('578248715228467096', 'Malaikat Malam', 2026, 'Drama', 'Nazifdin Nasrudin, Zikri Iman, Alief Mat Zoher', 'Nazifdin Nasrudin', 'Syafiq Kyle, Tracie Sinidol, Amir Nafis, Kodi Rasheed, Juzzthin, Riezman Khuzaimi, Que Haidar, Akmal Asyraf', null, 'Ashraff, a motorcycle workshop owner, balances his daily life activities between caring for his older brother who struggles with depression, participating in illegal street racing, and winning an innocent blind girl''s heart.', 'Ashraff, a motorcycle workshop owner, balances his daily life activities between caring for his older brother who struggles with depression, participating in illegal street racing, and winning an innocent blind girl''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eneTJD8imT50BmxmNUoVxBAbmAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1535392'),
  ('907408175244467164', 'Malamaal Weekly', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Priyadarshan', 'Aishwarya Kaushik', 'Paresh Rawal, Om Puri, Riteish Deshmukh, Reema Sen, Rajpal Yadav, Sudha Chandran, Asrani, Shakti Kapoor', null, 'After one of his customers dies from the shock of winning a lottery, lottery ticket seller Lilaram hatches a plan to have that money all for himself. But others from the village have also got their eyes on the money.', 'After one of his customers dies from the shock of winning a lottery, lottery ticket seller Lilaram hatches a plan to have that money all for himself. But others from the village have also got their eyes on the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGYn1rK0XBciKqnGHtLSnzJw6Gf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20494'),
  ('87124458336352720', 'Malang', 2020, 'Romance, Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Mohit Suri, Vikas Sivaraman, Rishi Anand', 'Aniruddha Guha', 'Aditya Roy Kapur, Disha Patani, Anil Kapoor, Kunal Khemu, Elli Avram, Keith Sequeira, Shaad Randhawa, Angela Krislinzki', null, 'Advait visits Goa where he meets Sara, a free-spirited girl who lives life unshackled. Opposites attract and all goes well until life turns upside down. Years later, Advait is on a killing spree with cops Aghase and Michael in his way.', 'Advait visits Goa where he meets Sara, a free-spirited girl who lives life unshackled. Opposites attract and all goes well until life turns upside down. Years later, Advait is on a killing spree with cops Aghase and Michael in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2COzaii4BnT1O6bbXfAxtoTmADm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661043'),
  ('1063834597065911117', 'Malarazza: una storia di periferia', 2017, 'Drama', 'Giovanni Mammolotti, Giovanni Virgiliio', 'Giovanni Virgiliio, Luca Arcidiacono', 'Stella Egitto, Paolo Briguglia, David Coco, Cosimo Coltraro, Antonino Frasca Spada', null, 'Rosaria is a young mother, wife of Tommasino Malarazza, downfallen boss of a famous Mafia family in Catania. Forced to marry him because she was pregnant, Rosaria is humiliated everyday by a violent husband, who spends his days drinking and gambling. The woman lives in fear and keeps her head down to protect her son Antonino. She can only rely on her queer brother Franco.', 'Rosaria is a young mother, wife of Tommasino Malarazza, downfallen boss of a famous Mafia family in Catania. Forced to marry him because she was pregnant, Rosaria is humiliated everyday by a violent husband, who spends his days drinking and gambling. The woman lives in fear and keeps her head down to protect her son Antonino. She can only rely on her queer brother Franco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rRO7CQoHeGRpizeIj2HoZEszXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486075'),
