  ('479333413481504336', 'Maldoror', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Fabrice Du Welz, Charlotte Cristin, Manuel Dacosse', 'Fabrice Du Welz, Domenico La Porta', 'Anthony Bajon, Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Alexis Manenti, Sergi López, Laurent Lucas, David Murgia, Béatrice Dalle, Lubna Azabal', null, 'When two girls go missing, Paul Chartier, an impulsive young police recruit, is assigned to “Maldoror”. This secret unit has been set up to monitor a dangerous sex offender. When the operation fails, fed up with the limits of the legal system, Chartier embarks on a solitary hunt to bring down the culprits.', 'When two girls go missing, Paul Chartier, an impulsive young police recruit, is assigned to “Maldoror”. This secret unit has been set up to monitor a dangerous sex offender. When the operation fails, fed up with the limits of the legal system, Chartier embarks on a solitary hunt to bring down the culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdOeeJOZySlQ5pDFijMIUuwLIPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959596'),
