  ('78890650193669867', 'Malila: The Farewell Flower', 2018, 'Drama', 'Saroch Nuamsamran, Thipaphon Puangmaha, Anucha Boonyawatana', 'Waasuthep Ketpetch, Anucha Boonyawatana', 'Sukollawat Kanarot, Anuchit Sapanpong, Sumret Muengput, Akekarad Khalong, Prakasit Horwannapakorn, Punthip Teekul, Bordin Moomeunsri, Werawat Jumroensarn', null, 'Former lovers Pich and Shane reconnect through Thai floral art, but Pich’s illness leads Shane to seek peace by becoming a monk.', 'Former lovers Pich and Shane reconnect through Thai floral art, but Pich’s illness leads Shane to seek peace by becoming a monk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gibCWbBYtMkNHie2ZnfbOceRjAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488512'),
  ('876158638777969063', 'Malina', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Werner Schroeter, Elfi Mikesch, Boris Manner', 'Patricia Moraz, Elfriede Jelinek', 'Isabelle Huppert, Mathieu Carrière, Can Togay, Fritz Schediwy, Isolde Barth, Libgart Schwarz, Peter Kern, Wiebke Frost', null, 'An unusual story of a triangular relationship in Vienna. A woman shares an apartment with a man named Malina. The woman meets Ivan and falls under his spell. It will be her last great passion. Her feelings are so strong and all-encompassing that Ivan can neither understand nor return them.', 'An unusual story of a triangular relationship in Vienna. A woman shares an apartment with a man named Malina. The woman meets Ivan and falls under his spell. It will be her last great passion. Her feelings are so strong and all-encompassing that Ivan can neither understand nor return them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbohIG5vFkg84ZoMTElAZX4cBJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66557'),
  ('1025547693749676881', 'Malizia 2000', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paolo Carnera, Salvatore Samperi', 'Ottavio Jemma, Salvatore Samperi', 'Laura Antonelli, Turi Ferro, Roberto Alpi, Luca Ceccarelli, Barbara Scoppa, Miko Magistro, Marcello Arnone, Mico Cundari', null, 'The teenage son of an architect falls for an older woman, an attractive housewife of his father''s client.', 'The teenage son of an architect falls for an older woman, an attractive housewife of his father''s client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsJ6Iojv0zbxaewlF1Fqvh3QfBl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345714'),
  ('1082751184847956922', 'Malkoçoğlu', 1966, 'History, Action, Adventure', 'Süreyya Duru, Mahmut Demir', 'Ayhan Başoğlu, Remzi Jöntürk', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Selma Güneri, Semih Sergen, Gülbin Eray, Yılmaz Köksal, Tuncer Necmioğlu, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Toron Karacaoğlu', null, 'Story of the famous Malkocoglu family who served Ottoman Empire in various military ranks.', 'Story of the famous Malkocoglu family who served Ottoman Empire in various military ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g3S0lo5EccDfJUglAxxfAkfHl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319364'),
  ('782903297434836820', 'Malkoçoğlu – Cem Sultan', 1970, 'History, Adventure', 'Ali Uğur, Remzi Jöntürk, Hasan Sasanpour', 'Remzi Jöntürk, Bülent Oran, Ayhan Başoğlu', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Feri Cansel, Suzan Avcı, Aytekin Akkaya, Behçet Nacar, Pouri Banaei, Özdemir Han, Jahangir Ghaffari', null, 'During one of his campaigns, Malkoçoğlu Ali Bey was taken prisoner by Homer and spent years in a dungeon, enduring torture. He eventually escapes. Separated from his beloved wife and his unknown son Polat, he continues his life as a cavalry leader on horseback. His son''s desire to become a cavalryman brings together the father and son, who do not know each other. They are given a mission: to prevent Cem Sultan, the son of Fatih Sultan Mehmet and the blood brother of Malkoçoğlu Ali Bey, from falling into the hands of the Venetians. This film tells the story of Malkoçoğlu Ali Bey, the son of the famous raider Malkoçoğlu Bali Bey, who was educated at the Enderun-ı Hümayün, the palace university founded by Fatih Sultan Mehmed Han. He served as the governor of Sofia and was martyred in the Battle of Çaldıran in 1514.', 'During one of his campaigns, Malkoçoğlu Ali Bey was taken prisoner by Homer and spent years in a dungeon, enduring torture. He eventually escapes. Separated from his beloved wife and his unknown son Polat, he continues his life as a cavalry leader on horseback. His son''s desire to become a cavalryman brings together the father and son, who do not know each other. They are given a mission: to prevent Cem Sultan, the son of Fatih Sultan Mehmet and the blood brother of Malkoçoğlu Ali Bey, from falling into the hands of the Venetians. This film tells the story of Malkoçoğlu Ali Bey, the son of the famous raider Malkoçoğlu Bali Bey, who was educated at the Enderun-ı Hümayün, the palace university founded by Fatih Sultan Mehmed Han. He served as the governor of Sofia and was martyred in the Battle of Çaldıran in 1514.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3TwwVyCSA7Y1npm0T1ck18hBQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473430'),
  ('1000281204729471885', 'Malkoçoğlu: Akıncılar Geliyor', 1969, 'Adventure, History', 'Süreyya Duru, Remzi Jöntürk', 'Ayhan Başoğlu, Remzi Jöntürk, Bülent Oran', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Esen Püsküllü, Meltem Mete, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Behçet Nacar, Leman Öztürk, Ayton Sert, Reşit Çıldam', null, 'The Serbian state is a friend of the Ottoman Empire, but the Byzantine Empire wants to destroy this friendship. To this end, the Byzantine knight Nicholas will marry the daughter of the Serbian king and has also kidnapped the Ottoman artillery commander. Malkoçoğlu takes action to rescue the artillery commander and prevent the marriage.', 'The Serbian state is a friend of the Ottoman Empire, but the Byzantine Empire wants to destroy this friendship. To this end, the Byzantine knight Nicholas will marry the daughter of the Serbian king and has also kidnapped the Ottoman artillery commander. Malkoçoğlu takes action to rescue the artillery commander and prevent the marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqayZUMl34K52cFYYf10KEuv2mK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473423'),
  ('409725503503254563', 'Malkoçoğlu: Ölüm Fedaileri', 1972, 'History, Adventure', 'Remzi Jöntürk, Ebrahim Bagheri, Cahit Engin', 'Remzi Jöntürk', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Danyal Topatan, Tuncer Necmioğlu, Yusuf Sezer, Lili, Talat Hussain, Oya Peri, Kamyab Kasravi', null, 'A band of 14th-century warriors with some very unique combat skills protect a princess during an attempted coup.', 'A band of 14th-century warriors with some very unique combat skills protect a princess during an attempted coup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieIXG4zvujKban8TwuIrKNpNf71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473432'),
  ('699885753019648056', 'Mall', 2014, 'Drama', 'Richard Henkels, Joe Hahn', 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Sam Bisbee, Joe Vinciguerra', 'Cameron Monaghan, Bobbi Salvör Menuez, James Frecheville, Gina Gershon, Peter Stormare, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Vincent D''Onofrio, Ron Yuan', null, 'Malcom''s done with his life. Only the noise of Crystal Meth gives him a reason to keep going - everything else it has long regardless. Equipped with a bag full of weapons and self-made bombs, he makes his way to the nearby mall to really stir things up. On his personal war campaign, he not only changes his life radically, but also the fate of other people who are in the wrong place at the same time: a teenager whose favorite pastime is smoking pot in his dreary existence, a housewife, where their best days have been left behind, a greedy businessman whose only desire is to increase his wealth and a depressed pervert.', 'Malcom''s done with his life. Only the noise of Crystal Meth gives him a reason to keep going - everything else it has long regardless. Equipped with a bag full of weapons and self-made bombs, he makes his way to the nearby mall to really stir things up. On his personal war campaign, he not only changes his life radically, but also the fate of other people who are in the wrong place at the same time: a teenager whose favorite pastime is smoking pot in his dreary existence, a housewife, where their best days have been left behind, a greedy businessman whose only desire is to increase his wealth and a depressed pervert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/um8IFziUkc0fstPICsqCNZyPh5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276901'),
  ('172288022908647290', 'Mall Girls', 2009, 'Drama', 'Kasia Rosłaniec, Witold Stok', 'Kasia Rosłaniec', 'Anna Karczmarczyk, Dagmara Krasowska, Dominika Gwit, Magdalena Ciurzynska, Izabela Kuna, Artur Barciś, Ewa Kolasińska-Szramel, Izabela Dąbrowska', null, 'Shopping malls - today''s place of creating desires. Best jewelry, clothes, shoes. Unaffordable by young girls, but they "work" to get themselves sponsors for new items.', 'Shopping malls - today''s place of creating desires. Best jewelry, clothes, shoes. Unaffordable by young girls, but they "work" to get themselves sponsors for new items.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bti0UE5AXzApcKzXADVvoIK5Eie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32559'),
  ('968830183256531621', 'Mallrats', 1995, 'Romance, Comedy', 'David Klein, Kevin Smith, Shari Nicotero', 'Kevin Smith', 'Jason Lee, Jeremy London, Shannen Doherty, Claire Forlani, Ben Affleck, Joey Lauren Adams, Renée Humphrey, Kevin Smith', 'R', 'Both dumped by their girlfriends, two best friends seek refuge in the local mall. Eventually, they decide to try and win back their significant others and take care of their respective nemeses.', 'Both dumped by their girlfriends, two best friends seek refuge in the local mall. Eventually, they decide to try and win back their significant others and take care of their respective nemeses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ip0sGIMPN0XEN6q3lQIoaNI6tP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2293'),
  ('419968656144092618', 'Malmkrog', 2020, 'History, Drama', 'Cristi Puiu, Tudor Vladimir Panduru, Anca Oproiu', 'Cristi Puiu', 'Agathe Bosch, Ugo Broussot, Marina Palii, Frédéric Schulz-Richard, Diana Sakalauskaité, István Téglás, Edith Alibec, Vitalie Bichir', null, 'Among the guests who come to the mansion of aristocratic landowner Nikolai over Christmas are a politician, a young countess, and a general with his wife. They dine and discuss topics such as progress and morality. As the debate becomes more heated, cultural differences become increasingly apparent.', 'Among the guests who come to the mansion of aristocratic landowner Nikolai over Christmas are a politician, a young countess, and a general with his wife. They dine and discuss topics such as progress and morality. As the debate becomes more heated, cultural differences become increasingly apparent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3a18dQrXHzippSG9MsXVgoHBp8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575448'),
  ('359484752595721360', 'MAL·MO·E: The Secret Mission', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Kim Ho-sung, Park Sin-woong, Eom Yu-na', 'Eom Yu-na', 'Yoo Hai-jin, Yoon Kye-sang, Kim Hong-pa, Woo Hyeon, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Sun-young, Min Jin-woong, Heo Sung-tae', null, 'During the Japanese occupation of Korea, the Japanese Empire seeks to eradicate the Korean language and identity. In retaliation, a small group of Korean patriots try to protect their language by compiling the first Korean language dictionary.', 'During the Japanese occupation of Korea, the Japanese Empire seeks to eradicate the Korean language and identity. In retaliation, a small group of Korean patriots try to protect their language by compiling the first Korean language dictionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJNEqYJYxGGYkl39K5sTxxBi52X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564863'),
  ('631350694319735080', 'Malombra', 1917, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Carmine Gallone, Giovanni Grimaldi', null, 'Lyda Borelli, Amleto Novelli, Augusto Mastripietri, Amedeo Ciaffi, Francesco Cacace, Consuelo Spada, Giulia Cassini-Rizzotto, Noemi De Ferrari', null, 'Marina di Malombra (Borelli) lives in a castle prior to her wedding. She begins to read letters written by an ancestor called Cecilia. She finds out that Cecilia was driven to her death by her uncle. Marina identifies with Cecilia and take revenge on her behalf by murdering her uncle.', 'Marina di Malombra (Borelli) lives in a castle prior to her wedding. She begins to read letters written by an ancestor called Cecilia. She finds out that Cecilia was driven to her death by her uncle. Marina identifies with Cecilia and take revenge on her behalf by murdering her uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muAqfyDES0z36ysXEQ9Mi6hFva4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190748'),
