  ('693959193918853862', 'Malombra', 1984, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Pasquale Fanetti, Bruno Gaburro', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Paola Senatore, Maurice Poli, Gino Milli, Stefano Alessandrini, Scilla Jacu, Ludovico Flores, Gloria Brini', null, 'Gothic and erotic mystery about a young man called Marco, who goes to stay with his strange uncle, whose wife (Marco''s beautiful aunt) died some time ago. His uncle''s sister-in-law is the only other person living there. Marco spies on rituals of self-gratification performed every night by a red-headed woman who looks just like his dead aunt! Marco begins to wonder if the woman is actually the sister-in-law made up to look like her dead sister, or the dead aunt haunting the place', 'Gothic and erotic mystery about a young man called Marco, who goes to stay with his strange uncle, whose wife (Marco''s beautiful aunt) died some time ago. His uncle''s sister-in-law is the only other person living there. Marco spies on rituals of self-gratification performed every night by a red-headed woman who looks just like his dead aunt! Marco begins to wonder if the woman is actually the sister-in-law made up to look like her dead sister, or the dead aunt haunting the place', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eu9gbirJqWzptjNuQfSHdB0oDYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106338'),
  ('361823315191661685', 'Malone', 1987, 'Action, Thriller', 'Harley Cokeliss, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Christopher Frank', 'Burt Reynolds, Cliff Robertson, Cynthia Gibb, Kenneth McMillan, Scott Wilson, Lauren Hutton, Tracey Walter, Philip Anglim', 'R', 'Erstwhile C.I.A. assassin Richard Malone hopes for a tranquil retirement in the placid Pacific Northwest, but what he gets is a rumble with a right-wing extremist plotting a secret revolution.', 'Erstwhile C.I.A. assassin Richard Malone hopes for a tranquil retirement in the placid Pacific Northwest, but what he gets is a rumble with a right-wing extremist plotting a secret revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA32G48OnKutmWdifMSi9hp2jed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27342'),
  ('12739559788092838', 'Malos hábitos', 2007, 'Drama', 'Simón Bross', 'Simón Bross, Ernesto Anaya', 'Ximena Ayala, Elena de Haro, Elisa Vicedo, Marco Antonio Treviño, Aurora Cano, Emilio Echevarría, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Marta Aura', null, 'Matilde is a nun convinced that faith moves mountains. She secretly begins a mystic fasting to end what she considers to be the second great flood. Elena is a thin and fashion-conscious woman ashamed of her daughter''s chubbiness. She''s willing to do the impossible to make her daughter Linda thin so Linda will look like a little princess on the day she receives her first communion.', 'Matilde is a nun convinced that faith moves mountains. She secretly begins a mystic fasting to end what she considers to be the second great flood. Elena is a thin and fashion-conscious woman ashamed of her daughter''s chubbiness. She''s willing to do the impossible to make her daughter Linda thin so Linda will look like a little princess on the day she receives her first communion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKcHyyesD1ArayO8Kh2LZNqy0ak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25072'),
  ('318940611670495861', 'Malpertuis', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'Gerry Fisher, Harry Kümel, Philippe Graff', 'Jean Ferry', 'Orson Welles, Susan Hampshire, Michel Bouquet, Mathieu Carrière, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Daniel Pilon, Walter Rilla, Dora van der Groen', null, 'A young sailor finds himself trapped in the labyrinthine mansion of his occultist uncle, along with a number of eccentric and mysterious relatives who all seem to be harboring a dark secret.', 'A young sailor finds himself trapped in the labyrinthine mansion of his occultist uncle, along with a number of eccentric and mysterious relatives who all seem to be harboring a dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDb2K01wbVSJZAf03VMVRcyRaYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46362'),
