  ('698658830901117984', 'Malu', 2024, 'Drama', 'Pedro Freire, Mauro Pinheiro Jr., Sofia Saadi', 'Pedro Freire', 'Yara de Novaes, Juliana Carneiro da Cunha, Carol Duarte, Átila Bee, Márcio Vito, Marina Provenzzano, Felipe Haiut, Cristiane Morilo', null, 'Malu — a mercurial, unemployed actress living with her conservative mother in a precarious house in a Rio de Janeiro slum — tries to deal with her strained relationship with her own adult daughter while surviving on memories of her glorious artistic past.', 'Malu — a mercurial, unemployed actress living with her conservative mother in a precarious house in a Rio de Janeiro slum — tries to deal with her strained relationship with her own adult daughter while surviving on memories of her glorious artistic past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XSeWLTAWhR7e6pfnYcoBSF1UR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214489'),
  ('131043843244790402', 'Malum', 2023, 'Horror', 'Anthony DiBlasi, Sean McDaniel', 'Scott Poiley, Anthony DiBlasi', 'Jessica Sula, Candice Coke, Chaney Morrow, Clarke Wolfe, Morgan Lennon, Valerie Loo, Monroe Cline, Eric Olson', 'R', 'A rookie police officer willingly takes the last shift at a newly decommissioned police station in an attempt to uncover the mysterious connection between her father''s death and a vicious cult.', 'A rookie police officer willingly takes the last shift at a newly decommissioned police station in an attempt to uncover the mysterious connection between her father''s death and a vicious cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1rcLLs0KmS8Cg60sLoMZC2OyDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094403'),
