  ('878797409351163621', 'Malvada', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'José Manuel Cravioto', 'Adriana Pelusi, Carlos Quintanilla Sakar', 'Gisselle Kuri, Michelle Renaud, Giuseppe Gamba, Manuel Calderón, Mercedes Hernández, Anabel Ferreira, María Rojo, Luis Curiel', null, 'A desperate mother contacts his son''s ex-girlfriend to tell her that he''s about to marry a wicked witch.', 'A desperate mother contacts his son''s ex-girlfriend to tell her that he''s about to marry a wicked witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybHIXYgqqGuQWMfnYfkaL7lGR1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016116'),
  ('551558857707201889', 'Mama', 1976, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Elisabeta Bostan, Ion Marinescu, Konstantin Petrichenko', 'Yury Entin, Vasilica Istrate', 'Mikhail Boyarskiy, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Oleg Popov, Savely Kramarov, Vera Ivleva, Evgeniy Gerchakov, Natalya Krachkovskaya, Valentin Manokhin', null, 'Mrs. Rada the Goat tells her five children to behave while she goes to the fair, and under no circumstances open the door to anyone except her. But the Big Bad Wolf, Kostika (Titi) Suru, and his nephew, the Little Bad Wolf, along with friends Rassul the Lynx and Petrika the Donkey has made a plan to kidnap the children while their mother is away. And when the eldest child, Matei, decides to disobey his mother and visit the fair himself, things start to go badly for the goat-family.', 'Mrs. Rada the Goat tells her five children to behave while she goes to the fair, and under no circumstances open the door to anyone except her. But the Big Bad Wolf, Kostika (Titi) Suru, and his nephew, the Little Bad Wolf, along with friends Rassul the Lynx and Petrika the Donkey has made a plan to kidnap the children while their mother is away. And when the eldest child, Matei, decides to disobey his mother and visit the fair himself, things start to go badly for the goat-family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nj8b9hLMZp8LwrSQEKmLVKX5MY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38323'),
  ('754641271996766145', 'Mama', 2013, 'Horror', 'Andy Muschietti, Antonio Riestra', 'Barbara Muschietti, Andy Muschietti, Neil Cross', 'Jessica Chastain, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Megan Charpentier, Isabelle Nélisse, Daniel Kash, Melina Matthews, Morgan McGarry, Javier Botet', 'PG-13', 'Guillermo del Toro presents Mama, a supernatural thriller that tells the haunting tale of two little girls who disappeared into the woods the day that their parents were killed. When they are rescued years later and begin a new life, they find that someone or something still wants to come tuck them in at night.', 'Guillermo del Toro presents Mama, a supernatural thriller that tells the haunting tale of two little girls who disappeared into the woods the day that their parents were killed. When they are rescued years later and begin a new life, they find that someone or something still wants to come tuck them in at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eo8BhR8Q5STmWE9sMLsEPagxmy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132232'),
  ('881453716514529405', 'Mamá', 2008, 'Drama, Horror', 'Andy Muschietti, Sebastián Sarraute, Mar Bastidas', 'Andy Muschietti', 'Victoria Harris, Berta Ros, Irma Monroig', null, 'Lili wakes her sister Victoria and insists that they both leave the house.', 'Lili wakes her sister Victoria and insists that they both leave the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngwSZehKMkySsMCwvFZ7OgPZHgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140656'),
  ('607761737990439743', 'Mama Dracula', 1980, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Boris Szulzinger, Rufus Bohez, Willy Kurant', 'Tony Hendra, Pierre Sterckx, Boris Szulzinger', 'Louise Fletcher, Maria Schneider, Marc-Henri Wajnberg, Alexander Wajnberg, Jess Hahn, Michel Israël, Suzy Falk, Vincent Grass', null, 'A female vampire must bathe in the blood of virgins in order to stay alive. The trouble is that virgins are in short supply nowadays, and she is running into major problems in finding one.', 'A female vampire must bathe in the blood of virgins in order to stay alive. The trouble is that virgins are in short supply nowadays, and she is running into major problems in finding one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNo8vs0ppVpm9QL4aEUCP5eaHqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119169'),
  ('850406886571496942', 'Mama Got Married', 1969, 'Drama', 'Vitaliy Melnikov, Dmitriy Dolinin, Konstantin Lashkov', 'Yuri Klepikov', 'Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Oleg Efremov, Nikolay Burlyaev, Larisa Burkova, Konstantin Tyagunov, Viktor Ilichyov, Lyudmila Arinina, Arkadi Trusov', null, 'A sublime, exceptionally well acted film about a single working class mother and her teenage son. She finds a man and marries him, her son is jealous and full of hot air at first but comes to understand her in the end. That''s all. The simplicity of the story notwithstanding, this is one of the most sincere and lyrical films to have been produced in the 1960s-1970s Soviet Union. Very realistic, too, showing the life as it was then. Lyusyena Ovchinnikova is superb, it is this film that makes one realize what a wonderful and under-appreciated actress she was. Nikolay Burlyayev is very good as a lanky teenager, the final scene with him carrying a glass of carbonated water for his mother is stunning. Oleg Efremov is very convincing as a working class man who found his happiness at last.', 'A sublime, exceptionally well acted film about a single working class mother and her teenage son. She finds a man and marries him, her son is jealous and full of hot air at first but comes to understand her in the end. That''s all. The simplicity of the story notwithstanding, this is one of the most sincere and lyrical films to have been produced in the 1960s-1970s Soviet Union. Very realistic, too, showing the life as it was then. Lyusyena Ovchinnikova is superb, it is this film that makes one realize what a wonderful and under-appreciated actress she was. Nikolay Burlyayev is very good as a lanky teenager, the final scene with him carrying a glass of carbonated water for his mother is stunning. Oleg Efremov is very convincing as a working class man who found his happiness at last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vA96BQaNXTcitquOi6MJoiKpodU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197505'),
  ('450330876908436140', 'Mamá no enRedes', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Daniela Féjerman', 'Daniela Féjerman', 'Malena Alterio, Óscar Ortuño, Eva Ugarte, Ben Temple, Antonio Pagudo, Juan Grandinetti, Sofía Oria, Antonio Garrido', null, 'Clara, a mother of two teenagers, is a woman open to new experiences who decides to create a profile on TILINK, a dating app. What goes through the mind of a twenty-something when she finds her own mother''s profile on Tilink, the trendy dating app? Yes, his mother is still young. Yes, she''s divorced from her father and has the right to rebuild her life, but.... Doesn''t she know what Tilink is? There are only guys who are going to use her and then dump her, sex snipers... like himself. Dani and his sister Milena will embark on the delirious adventure of boycotting their mother''s flirtations, and will go all out when the woman starts a more serious relationship with an Argentine yogurt man, convinced that he will only make her suffer. Only that the brothers'' strategies will have the opposite effect to the desired one, there will be more and more men in their mother''s life and nothing will turn out as they expect.', 'Clara, a mother of two teenagers, is a woman open to new experiences who decides to create a profile on TILINK, a dating app. What goes through the mind of a twenty-something when she finds her own mother''s profile on Tilink, the trendy dating app? Yes, his mother is still young. Yes, she''s divorced from her father and has the right to rebuild her life, but.... Doesn''t she know what Tilink is? There are only guys who are going to use her and then dump her, sex snipers... like himself. Dani and his sister Milena will embark on the delirious adventure of boycotting their mother''s flirtations, and will go all out when the woman starts a more serious relationship with an Argentine yogurt man, convinced that he will only make her suffer. Only that the brothers'' strategies will have the opposite effect to the desired one, there will be more and more men in their mother''s life and nothing will turn out as they expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdNbqKd6F2Tj7WPgZbg11D6rjmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942999'),
  ('235198450957411461', 'Mama Turns 100', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Saura, Teo Escamilla', 'Carlos Saura', 'Geraldine Chaplin, Norman Briski, Amparo Muñoz, Rafaela Aparicio, José Vivó, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Charo Soriano, Ángeles Torres', null, 'Ana and her husband Antonio arrive in the manor in the countryside of Spain where she worked as a nanny many years ago, for the centennial birthday of the matriarch.', 'Ana and her husband Antonio arrive in the manor in the countryside of Spain where she worked as a nanny many years ago, for the centennial birthday of the matriarch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkIumqh8ebEXJiMVI9vfxFwoN31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107288'),
  ('104436455698023778', 'Mama Weed', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Julien Hirsch, Jean-Paul Salomé', 'Jean-Paul Salomé', 'Isabelle Huppert, Liliane Rovère, Hippolyte Girardot, Iris Bry, Pierre Rousselet, Farida Ouchani, Rebecca Marder, Léonore Confino', null, 'A translator working for the police gets involved in the other side of drug dealing.', 'A translator working for the police gets involved in the other side of drug dealing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykXCevEZyEjiT8dMg8a8DDPrN3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575463'),
  ('922318531873251434', 'Mamá, mamá, mamá', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sol Berruezo Pichon-Riviére, Rebeca Rossato Siqueira', 'Sol Berruezo Pichon-Riviére', 'Agustina Milstein, Chloé Cherchyk, Camila Zolezzi, Matilde Creimer Chiabrando, Siumara Castillo, Jennifer Moule, Shirley Giménez, Ana María Monti', null, 'A veil of sadness lies over the oppressively hot summer days. Cleo dives into daydreams with her cousins, the girls share secret signs and rituals. Flowing gently, in impressionistic images, the empty space that the death of Cleo’s sister has left in the family is poetically encircled.', 'A veil of sadness lies over the oppressively hot summer days. Cleo dives into daydreams with her cousins, the girls share secret signs and rituals. Flowing gently, in impressionistic images, the empty space that the death of Cleo’s sister has left in the family is poetically encircled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/693GzhR4UhKydo4UOIvBJj23Cn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666088'),
  ('917082071547635916', 'Mama''s Boy', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tim Hamilton, Jonathan Brown', null, 'Jon Heder, Diane Keaton, Jeff Daniels, Anna Faris, Eli Wallach, Dorian Missick, Sarah Chalke, Mary Kay Place', 'PG-13', 'A twenty-nine year-old slacker who lives with his mom realizes his sweet set-up is threatened when she hears wedding bells with her self-help guru beau.', 'A twenty-nine year-old slacker who lives with his mom realizes his sweet set-up is threatened when she hears wedding bells with her self-help guru beau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e96vm2byFOXoXo7KMRQtmTB8YcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13167'),
  ('584832087275096618', 'Mama''s Boy', 2024, 'Drama', 'Paul Michael Acero', null, 'VR Relosa, Sahara Bernales, Josh Ivan Morales, Stephanie Raz, Ada Hermosa, Marijoy Cacho, Haidee Belleza', null, 'A controversial affair unfolds when a young man, Glen, manipulates his stepmother, Lorraine and her sister, Leilanie, to fall for him to exact revenge on his father, Mauro. But there is twist and Glen is in for life-shattering shock.', 'A controversial affair unfolds when a young man, Glen, manipulates his stepmother, Lorraine and her sister, Leilanie, to fall for him to exact revenge on his father, Mauro. But there is twist and Glen is in for life-shattering shock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zW70wqJWSsDakL0iDt80UyR9z7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1405185'),
  ('858398045144424349', 'Mama''s Little Murderer', 2026, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Andrew Parkes, Cecil Johnson, Shara Désirée King, Emma Hewitt', 'Dane K. Braun', 'Sara Canning, Isaac Kragten, Ian Kilburn, Noah Perchard, Lauren Vandenbrook', null, 'A devoted single mother, Constance, struggles to balance her newfound love with Leo and the obsessive, destructive behavior of her son, Anthony, who goes to extreme lengths to keep her all to himself.', 'A devoted single mother, Constance, struggles to balance her newfound love with Leo and the obsessive, destructive behavior of her son, Anthony, who goes to extreme lengths to keep her all to himself.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F8%2Fgracenote%2F8f9292bb86b49b846a4592f68589ae88.jpg', 'plex:movie:mamas-little-murderer'),
  ('993568529470912366', 'Mama''s New Hat', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Martha Wentworth', null, 'The boys buy mama a new hat for Mother''s Day, but on the way home fall in the mud and ruin it. They swap the bad hat with one that a nearby horse is wearing and head home.', 'The boys buy mama a new hat for Mother''s Day, but on the way home fall in the mud and ruin it. They swap the bad hat with one that a nearby horse is wearing and head home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzwFsXNfZkXKlMS6bTPCGgdzYWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236228'),
  ('472856846433986025', 'Mamacruz', 2023, 'Drama', 'Patricia Ortega, Fran Fernández-Pardo, Marichu Sanz', 'José F. Ortuño', 'Kiti Mánver, Pepe Quero, Inés Benítez Viñuela, Silvia Acosta, Mari Paz Sayago, María José Mariscal, Paula Díaz, Loles Gutiérrez', null, 'Cruz is a grandma who''s spent years, decades actually, without having an orgasm. Religiously devout, it wasn''t something that she considered particularly important, or that she''d even given much thought to... until, one day, while surfing the internet, she again starts to feel those desires and sensations she had believed were long gone. Now she is faced with a dilemma: how can she balance her religious beliefs with this new sexual and sensual awakening that has suddenly come back into her life?', 'Cruz is a grandma who''s spent years, decades actually, without having an orgasm. Religiously devout, it wasn''t something that she considered particularly important, or that she''d even given much thought to... until, one day, while surfing the internet, she again starts to feel those desires and sensations she had believed were long gone. Now she is faced with a dilemma: how can she balance her religious beliefs with this new sexual and sensual awakening that has suddenly come back into her life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxkb2U8Z0HVyt5CQZXrCwLFtZNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058634'),
  ('760103812410816500', 'Maman', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Brunet, Alexandra Leclère', 'Alexandra Leclère', 'Josiane Balasko, Mathilde Seigner, Marina Foïs, Serge Hazanavicius, Michel Vuillermoz, Thomas Gerard, Mathieu Rousseau', null, 'Sandrine and Alice are two sisters who, in their thirties, decide the time has come to attempt a reconciliation with their mother.', 'Sandrine and Alice are two sisters who, in their thirties, decide the time has come to attempt a reconciliation with their mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75McfHTtCgEwX9dVvTUdtGtdf48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106741'),
  ('706231277493382062', 'Mambo Café', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Reuben Gonzalez, Michael F. Barrow', 'Reuben Gonzalez', 'Thalia, Paul Rodríguez, Rosanna DeSoto, Kamar de los Reyes, Robert Costanzo, Danny Aiello, Lillo Brancato, Rick Gonzalez', null, 'A beautiful Puerto Rican girl and her family in Spanish harlem devise a novel plan to attract business to their restaurant, causing a wildly comic sequence of events ending in near disaster.', 'A beautiful Puerto Rican girl and her family in Spanish harlem devise a novel plan to attract business to their restaurant, causing a wildly comic sequence of events ending in near disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSldW60RTAFinLJuZqwndsoQ3Jw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148885'),
  ('86008882083471615', 'Mambo Dreams', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy, Music', 'Emilio Maillé, Martín Boege, Valeria Ariñez', 'Emilio Maillé, Javier Peñalosa', 'Rubén Albarrán, Benny Emmanuel, Blanca Guerra, Paco Rueda, Ari Gallegos, Mikaela Monet, Mario Escalante, Arcelia Ramírez', null, 'Dámaso Pérez Prado, known as "el rey del mambo", came back from the dead to look for the love of his life.', 'Dámaso Pérez Prado, known as "el rey del mambo", came back from the dead to look for the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfuN2CoGMLCsP6irgioV329TrFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045227'),
  ('949180676064178203', 'Mambo Italiano', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Émile Gaudreault, Serge Ladouceur', 'Steve Galluccio, Émile Gaudreault', 'Luke Kirby, Ginette Reno, Paul Sorvino, Mary Walsh, Peter Miller, Claudia Ferri, Sophie Lorain, Tim Post', 'R', 'When an Italian man comes out of the closet, it affects both his life and his crazy family.', 'When an Italian man comes out of the closet, it affects both his life and his crazy family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usuEb1teTxqkK1wx54SmbdXltcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321'),
  ('382016635266131947', 'Mambru Went to War', 1986, 'Drama', 'José Luis Alcaine, Fernando Fernán Gómez', 'Pedro Beltrán', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, María Asquerino, Agustín González, Emma Cohen, Nuria Gallardo, Jorge Sanz, Carlos Cabezas, Francisco Vidal', null, 'After the death of dictator Francisco Franco, Florentina gives her family shocking news.', 'After the death of dictator Francisco Franco, Florentina gives her family shocking news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itctizE9AgR4KhlbUQxtIqVMDxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144319'),
  ('13311725773293064', 'Mame', 1974, 'Comedy, Music', 'Gene Saks, Philip H. Lathrop, Michael D. Moore', 'Paul Zindel', 'Lucille Ball, Bea Arthur, Robert Preston, Bruce Davison, Kirby Furlong, Jane Connell, George Chiang, Joyce Van Patten', 'PG', 'The madcap life of eccentric Mame Dennis and her bohemian, intellectual arty clique is disrupted when her deceased brother''s 10-year-old son Patrick is entrusted to her care. Rather than bow to convention, Mame introduces the boy to her free-wheeling lifestyle, instilling in him her favorite credo, "Life is a banquet, and most poor sons of bitches are starving to death."', 'The madcap life of eccentric Mame Dennis and her bohemian, intellectual arty clique is disrupted when her deceased brother''s 10-year-old son Patrick is entrusted to her care. Rather than bow to convention, Mame introduces the boy to her free-wheeling lifestyle, instilling in him her favorite credo, "Life is a banquet, and most poor sons of bitches are starving to death."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcVNOOSGNgFcFNz49Sx3JdNyvEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35275'),
  ('325930610112629096', 'Mameluke', 1958, 'Drama, Romance, Action, War, Adventure, History', 'David Rondeli', 'David Rondeli', 'Dato Danelia, Vaja Djodjua, Manana Londaridze, Otar Koberidze, Akaki Khorava, Lia Eliava, Edisher Magalashvili, Giorgi Shavgulidze', null, 'In Arabic, “mameluke” means a white slave, a prisoner. In Egypt, this name was given to prisoners of war who had been sold into slavery from Georgia and other countries of the Caucasus. The action of this drama starts in Georgia in the late 18th century. Two friends are abducted and sold into slavery. One ends up in Egypt, the other - in Venice. Years later, they meet by the ancient pyramids, in the desert where a battle is going on between the armies of Bonaparte and Ali-bey, the ruler of Egypt. In a combat with a French officer, the Mameluke injures him. Falling from his horse onto the sand, the officer exclaims in Georgian: “Vai, nana!” (“Oh, mother!”). And the Mameluke recognizes in him a mate of his childhood games.', 'In Arabic, “mameluke” means a white slave, a prisoner. In Egypt, this name was given to prisoners of war who had been sold into slavery from Georgia and other countries of the Caucasus. The action of this drama starts in Georgia in the late 18th century. Two friends are abducted and sold into slavery. One ends up in Egypt, the other - in Venice. Years later, they meet by the ancient pyramids, in the desert where a battle is going on between the armies of Bonaparte and Ali-bey, the ruler of Egypt. In a combat with a French officer, the Mameluke injures him. Falling from his horse onto the sand, the officer exclaims in Georgian: “Vai, nana!” (“Oh, mother!”). And the Mameluke recognizes in him a mate of his childhood games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0XgmP44IJUsTqXBn8MS74DcJKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149106'),
  ('840414318581034484', 'Mamma mia, che impressione!', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Savarese, Franco Montemurro, Carlo Montuori', 'Alberto Sordi, Cesare Zavattini', 'Alberto Sordi, Giovanna Pala, Luigi Pavese, Carlo Giustini, Carlo Delle Piane, Frank Colson, Fausto Guerzoni, Checco Rissone', null, 'Shy, clumsy and petulant, Alberto tries in every way to impress Margherita. With the hope of winning the first prize, he participates in a race.', 'Shy, clumsy and petulant, Alberto tries in every way to impress Margherita. With the hope of winning the first prize, he participates in a race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKvtq1AXpEEnecz1vhqxHa2LkzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82483'),
  ('20340257236561614', 'Mamma Mia!', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Phyllida Lloyd, Haris Zambarloukos, Christopher Newman', 'Catherine Johnson', 'Meryl Streep, Amanda Seyfried, Pierce Brosnan, Colin Firth, Stellan Skarsgård, Julie Walters, Dominic Cooper, Christine Baranski', 'PG-13', 'A spirited young bride-to-be living with her single mother on a small Greek island secretly invites three of her mother''s ex-boyfriends in hope of finding her biological father to walk her down the aisle.', 'A spirited young bride-to-be living with her single mother on a small Greek island secretly invites three of her mother''s ex-boyfriends in hope of finding her biological father to walk her down the aisle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdUA4FNHbXPadzVOJiU0Rgn6cHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11631'),
  ('332417776358572972', 'Mamma Mia! Here We Go Again', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ol Parker, Robert D. Yeoman, Jim Barr', 'Ol Parker', 'Lily James, Amanda Seyfried, Meryl Streep, Cher, Andy Garcia, Julie Walters, Alexa Davies, Christine Baranski', 'PG-13', 'Five years after meeting her three fathers, Sophie Sheridan prepares to open her mother’s hotel. In 1979, young Donna Sheridan meets the men who each could be Sophie’s biological father.', 'Five years after meeting her three fathers, Sophie Sheridan prepares to open her mother’s hotel. In 1979, young Donna Sheridan meets the men who each could be Sophie’s biological father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWicerX4Y7n7tUwRAVHsVcBBpj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458423'),
  ('26726981816696650', 'Mamma, Qui Comando Io', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Giovanni Mammolotti, Federico Moccia, Olga Shapoval', 'Giorgia Colli, Federico Moccia, Luca Biglione', 'Daniela Virgilio, Simone Montedoro, Maurizio Mattioli, Marco Giuliani, Alessio Di Domenicantonio, Marco Capretti, Aida Folch, Pep Munné', null, 'Filippo and Michela are at loggerheads and fighting over custody of their son Francesco. The judge, in an unprecedented ruling, awards the house to the child: the parents will take turns moving every Monday. This forced alternating living arrangements will unleash absurd and hilarious situations, forcing them to confront each other for the sake of their son.', 'Filippo and Michela are at loggerheads and fighting over custody of their son Francesco. The judge, in an unprecedented ruling, awards the house to the child: the parents will take turns moving every Monday. This forced alternating living arrangements will unleash absurd and hilarious situations, forcing them to confront each other for the sake of their son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3B2Q4yVUONcVAIBdbUX6QCTGMR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797682'),
  ('462559824242133549', 'Mammal', 2016, 'Drama', 'Rebecca Daly, Lennart Verstegen', 'Rebecca Daly, Glenn Montgomery', 'Rachel Griffiths, Barry Keoghan, Michael McElhatton, Nika McGuigan, Johnny Ward, Joanne Crawford, Aoife King, Rachel O''Byrne', null, 'After Margaret, a divorcée living in Dublin, loses her teenage son, she develops an unorthodox relationship with Joe, a homeless youth. Their tentative trust is threatened by his involvement with a violent gang and the escalation of her ex-husband''s grieving rage.', 'After Margaret, a divorcée living in Dublin, loses her teenage son, she develops an unorthodox relationship with Joe, a homeless youth. Their tentative trust is threatened by his involvement with a violent gang and the escalation of her ex-husband''s grieving rage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8bHUNWu1EMvVV5LGcdWFSUwJay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371462'),
  ('505761665422374359', 'Mammals', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Roman Polanski, Andrzej Kostenko', 'Andrzej Kondratiuk, Roman Polanski', 'Henryk Kluba, Michał Żołnierkiewicz, Voytek Frykowski', null, '"Waiting for Godot" on ice and snow, without words. Against a barren winter landscape, a figure approaches: it''s a man, pulling a small sleigh on which another man sits, plucking a dead bird. They stop to trade places; the one now on the sleigh takes out his knitting. Accidents, misunderstandings, disagreements, and an outright fight await our absurd protagonists as their trip to nowhere continues, first with one pulling, then the other. What if they were to lose the sleigh? What rules of civilization and partnership would guide them then?', '"Waiting for Godot" on ice and snow, without words. Against a barren winter landscape, a figure approaches: it''s a man, pulling a small sleigh on which another man sits, plucking a dead bird. They stop to trade places; the one now on the sleigh takes out his knitting. Accidents, misunderstandings, disagreements, and an outright fight await our absurd protagonists as their trip to nowhere continues, first with one pulling, then the other. What if they were to lose the sleigh? What rules of civilization and partnership would guide them then?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrNVoikbiZiItJvNbXsbuzrMIQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146131'),
  ('997550803157567487', 'Mammoth', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Abram Cox, Vivi Drăgan Vasile, Frank Pinnock', 'Brook Durham, Sean Keller, Abram Cox', 'Vincent Ventresca, Summer Glau, Tom Skerritt, Constantin Drăgănescu, Cole Williams, Charles Carroll, Mark Irvingsen, David Kallaway', null, 'On a hot summer afternoon in the sleepy town of Blackwater Louisiana, a meteor streaks across the sky and crashes through the roof of the local Natural History Museum. The meteor is actually a spaceship containing an alien life form which animates the museum''s partially frozen Woolly Mammoth and begins a rampage. Local authorities and Government Investigators join forces with Frank Abernathy, the Museum Curator, and his father Simon, a B-Movie enthusiast, to bring down the giant mammoth in this alien-invasion flick!', 'On a hot summer afternoon in the sleepy town of Blackwater Louisiana, a meteor streaks across the sky and crashes through the roof of the local Natural History Museum. The meteor is actually a spaceship containing an alien life form which animates the museum''s partially frozen Woolly Mammoth and begins a rampage. Local authorities and Government Investigators join forces with Frank Abernathy, the Museum Curator, and his father Simon, a B-Movie enthusiast, to bring down the giant mammoth in this alien-invasion flick!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6KHt6MXWnLTRZgb9uO6dt0xl3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41419'),
  ('938013521098290030', 'Mammoth', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lukas Moodysson, Marcel Zyskind', 'Lukas Moodysson', 'Gael García Bernal, Michelle Williams, Marife Necesito, Sophie Nyweide, Tom McCarthy, Natthamonkarn Srinikornchot, Jan David G. Nicdao, Martin Delos Santos', 'NR', 'When Leo travels to Thailand on business, he unwittingly sets off a chain of events that will have dramatic consequences for everyone.', 'When Leo travels to Thailand on business, he unwittingly sets off a chain of events that will have dramatic consequences for everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4im5yJARbUQo4bQO7BTIosXS9cf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33974'),
  ('398027800819498713', 'Mammuth', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Gustave Kervern, Benoît Delépine, Hugues Poulain', 'Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Gérard Depardieu, Yolande Moreau, Isabelle Adjani, Benoît Poelvoorde, Philippe Nahon, Bouli Lanners, Anna Mouglalis, Siné', null, 'Serge Pilardosse has just turned 60. He has worked since the age of 16, never unemployed, never sick. But the hour of retirement has come, and it is disillusionment: he is missing points, some employers having forgotten to declare it! Pushed by Catherine, his wife, he gets on his old motorcycle from the 70s, a "Mammut" which earned him his nickname, and sets off in search of his pay slips. During his journey, he rediscovers his past and his quest for administrative documents soon becomes incidental...', 'Serge Pilardosse has just turned 60. He has worked since the age of 16, never unemployed, never sick. But the hour of retirement has come, and it is disillusionment: he is missing points, some employers having forgotten to declare it! Pushed by Catherine, his wife, he gets on his old motorcycle from the 70s, a "Mammut" which earned him his nickname, and sets off in search of his pay slips. During his journey, he rediscovers his past and his quest for administrative documents soon becomes incidental...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f19wwAy4q1oAmGRBLvxRIq3bvd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37832'),
  ('1113475695405387139', 'Mamochka', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Vilan Trub', 'Vilan Trub', 'Dino Castelli, Maya Murphy, Alexander Kollar', null, 'A psychological horror about a Nazi-era heirloom doll that drives a suburban dad crazy.', 'A psychological horror about a Nazi-era heirloom doll that drives a suburban dad crazy.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FomLP0G9wBDC3UCJcHoxKCrPNnpV.jpg', 'plex:movie:mamochka-2026'),
  ('180809268232746657', 'Mamonas Assassinas: The Movie', 2023, 'Comedy, Music', 'Edson Spinello, Pedro Iorio', 'Carlos Lombardi', 'Ruy Brissac, Rhener Freitas, Adriano Tunes, Robson Lima, Beto Hinoto, Ton Prado, Jarbas Homem de Mello, Guta Ruiz', null, 'The life and times of comedy rock band Mamonas Assassinas, from their beginning to their breakthrough in the late 1990s.', 'The life and times of comedy rock band Mamonas Assassinas, from their beginning to their breakthrough in the late 1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOYKZrePJaHQotqoF6M7azjBPzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1169900'),
  ('208689298642493336', 'Mamonas Forever', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Cláudio Kahns', 'Diana Zatz Muss', 'Dinho, Julio Cesar Rasec, Bento Hinoto, Sérgio Reoli, Samuel Reoli, Ito Reoli, Sueli Reoli, Geraldo Celestino', null, 'In less than ten months, the music band Mamonas Assassinas went from being completely unknown to becoming one of the biggest phenomena in Brazilian music. Irreverent, intelligent, sarcastic and creative, the band took over Brazil and sold two million albums in just six months. Never-before-seen footage and interviews from family, friends, producers, and musicians tell the band’s story, their challenges, their rise to fame, and the tragic aeroplane accident that killed all its members in 1996.', 'In less than ten months, the music band Mamonas Assassinas went from being completely unknown to becoming one of the biggest phenomena in Brazilian music. Irreverent, intelligent, sarcastic and creative, the band took over Brazil and sold two million albums in just six months. Never-before-seen footage and interviews from family, friends, producers, and musicians tell the band’s story, their challenges, their rise to fame, and the tragic aeroplane accident that killed all its members in 1996.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9K9ftcfpycvZh7D2rwWVyWB80M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139432'),
  ('426914749252032610', 'Mamonas: Eu Te Ai Lóve Iú', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Fellipe Awi, Pepão Montes, Thaís Catardo, Juliana Constantini, Tiago Carioca, Pedro Bial', 'Renato Terra', 'Dinho, Julio Cesar Rasec, Bento Hinoto, Samuel Reoli, Sérgio Reoli', null, 'Follows he meteoric rise of Mamonas Assassinas, the Brazilian band that shattered sales records with just one album. Family and friends share intimate stories of five young musicians from Guarulhos who became cultural icons.', 'Follows he meteoric rise of Mamonas Assassinas, the Brazilian band that shattered sales records with just one album. Family and friends share intimate stories of five young musicians from Guarulhos who became cultural icons.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzOd4ITtAdwe0PkqMOOFiGho1IO2.jpg', 'plex:movie:mamonas-eu-te-ai-love-iu'),
