  ('43355525437098335', 'Man - Woman Wanted', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Stanisław Bareja, Jan Laskowski, Karol Chodura', 'Stanisław Bareja, Jacek Fedorowicz', 'Wojciech Pokora, Jolanta Bohdal, Mieczysław Czechowicz, Maria Chwalibóg, Jerzy Dobrowolski, Wiesław Gołas, Adam Mularczyk, Barbara Rylska', null, 'Stanisław Maria Rochowicz, a bumbling art historian, is falsely accused of stealing a painting. The alleged thief faces five years in prison. Desperate, he decides to hide in disguise as a woman until he can paint a copy of the stolen canvas. Lacking means to live, he takes jobs as a maid for a variety of colorful characters.', 'Stanisław Maria Rochowicz, a bumbling art historian, is falsely accused of stealing a painting. The alleged thief faces five years in prison. Desperate, he decides to hide in disguise as a woman until he can paint a copy of the stolen canvas. Lacking means to live, he takes jobs as a maid for a variety of colorful characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75W55GxVdEoGXKK7n9l63WUttE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81309'),
  ('516444074757239264', 'Man & Wife: An Educational Film for Married Adults', 1969, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Matt Cimber, Jacques Descent', null, 'Andreas Kranich, Birgit Müller, Rosanna Romana', null, 'Hosted by some unnamed escapee from a twelve-step program, Man and Wife, moves from anatomy charts and Asian erotic art into actual footage of two couples demonstrating nearly fifty different sexual positions.', 'Hosted by some unnamed escapee from a twelve-step program, Man and Wife, moves from anatomy charts and Asian erotic art into actual footage of two couples demonstrating nearly fifty different sexual positions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2qZxhTDfG6ptMFbt7w72uIFU7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287787'),
  ('747529431403503877', 'Man About the House', 1974, 'Comedy', 'John Robins, James Allen, Derek Whitehurst', 'Johnnie Mortimer, Brian Cooke', 'Richard O''Sullivan, Paula Wilcox, Sally Thomsett, Brian Murphy, Yootha Joyce, Peter Cellier, Doug Fisher, Jack Smethurst', null, 'An unscrupulous property developer wants to flatten the street to make way for new buildings. Householder George Roper is happy to take the offered money and run but his wife Mildred and their lodgers join with other residents to take a stand and keep things as they are.', 'An unscrupulous property developer wants to flatten the street to make way for new buildings. Householder George Roper is happy to take the offered money and run but his wife Mildred and their lodgers join with other residents to take a stand and keep things as they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tT5Gu0LS0s2ToBs8ssWZIUblHCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71992'),
  ('1019120201627489611', 'Man About Town', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mike Binder, Russ T. Alsobrook', 'Mike Binder', 'Ben Affleck, Rebecca Romijn, John Cleese, Mike Binder, Gina Gershon, Adam Goldberg, Howard Hesseman, Jerry O''Connell', 'R', 'A top Hollywood talent agent finds his cushy existence threatened when he discovers that his wife is cheating on him and that his journal has been swiped by a reporter out to bring him down.', 'A top Hollywood talent agent finds his cushy existence threatened when he discovers that his wife is cheating on him and that his journal has been swiped by a reporter out to bring him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eorqaoGq2rU923VGJE5ZmRdWfLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9784'),
  ('474696664711310591', 'Man at Bath', 2010, 'Drama', 'Christophe Honoré, Stéphane Vallée, Frederic Oliver', 'Christophe Honoré', 'François Sagat, Chiara Mastroianni, Omar Ben Sellem, Rabah Zahi, Dennis Cooper, Kate Moran, Dustin Segura-Suarez, Lahcen Elmazouzi', null, 'Between Gennevilliers and New York, Omar and Emmanuel go to great lengths to prove to each other they''re no longer in love.', 'Between Gennevilliers and New York, Omar and Emmanuel go to great lengths to prove to each other they''re no longer in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHMgPBmMBmOh4AJC3oEKPCI9cxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70993'),
  ('1000067913448259529', 'Man Beast', 1956, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jerry Warren, Victor Fisher, Ralph Brooke', 'B. Arthur Cassidy', 'Rock Madison, Asa Maynor, George Skaff, Tom Maruzzi, Lloyd Nelson, George Wells Lewis, Jack Haffner, Wong Sing', null, 'Connie Hayward mounts an expedition into the Himalayan Mountains looking for her brother, who has not returned from a previous trek trying to locate the Yeti, or "Abominable Snowman". Arriving at her brother''s last-known camp Connie and her companions find only a strange old guide, Varga. They are soon attacked by gigantic Snowmen but are not half as surprised as when Vargas reveals his secret origin and the plans he has for Connie.', 'Connie Hayward mounts an expedition into the Himalayan Mountains looking for her brother, who has not returned from a previous trek trying to locate the Yeti, or "Abominable Snowman". Arriving at her brother''s last-known camp Connie and her companions find only a strange old guide, Varga. They are soon attacked by gigantic Snowmen but are not half as surprised as when Vargas reveals his secret origin and the plans he has for Connie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eykoFw9XCqrAwOtLEuloFtWMPFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63091'),
  ('213403793824998105', 'Man Down', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, War', 'Dito Montiel, Shelly Johnson, Phoenix Woung-Bi Lee', 'Adam G. Simon, Dito Montiel', 'Shia LaBeouf, Jai Courtney, Gary Oldman, Kate Mara, Tory Kittles, Clifton Collins Jr., Charlie Shotwell, Jose Pablo Cantillo', 'R', 'When a U.S. Marine returns home from Afghanistan, he finds that the place he once called home is no better than the battlefields he fought on overseas. Accompanied by his best friend, he searches desperately for the whereabouts of his estranged son and wife. In their search, the two intercept a man carrying vital information about his family.', 'When a U.S. Marine returns home from Afghanistan, he finds that the place he once called home is no better than the battlefields he fought on overseas. Accompanied by his best friend, he searches desperately for the whereabouts of his estranged son and wife. In their search, the two intercept a man carrying vital information about his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sv6YqD7CPbk1Wn7ayq5zosPeCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296523'),
  ('399440935298474722', 'Man Facing Southeast', 1987, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Carlos Abbate, Lizzie Otero, Eliseo Subiela', 'Eliseo Subiela', 'Lorenzo Quinteros, Hugo Soto, Inés Vernengo, Cristina Scaramuzza, Tomas Voth, David Edery, Rúbens Correa, Rodolfo Rodas', null, 'A new patient mysteriously appears in a psychiatric ward. He claims to come from another planet to study humans and their behavior. The alien is gentle but criticizes humans for their harsh treatment of each other. The assigned psychiatrist is himself unhappy, and affected by the patient''s insight. But he is ordered to treat the patient according to institutional procedure.', 'A new patient mysteriously appears in a psychiatric ward. He claims to come from another planet to study humans and their behavior. The alien is gentle but criticizes humans for their harsh treatment of each other. The assigned psychiatrist is himself unhappy, and affected by the patient''s insight. But he is ordered to treat the patient according to institutional procedure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxTNlao45QcCr97s0VcBFXXIxF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48797'),
  ('899479493959298357', 'Man Finds Tape', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paul Gandersman, David Coone, Peter S. Hall', 'Paul Gandersman, Peter S. Hall', 'Kelsey Pribilski, William Magnuson, John Gholson, Brian Villalobos, Nell Kessler, Graham Skipper, Judy McMillan, Christine Hall', null, 'Pulled in by a series of strange and unexplainable video clips, a brother and sister team up to investigate the events captured in the footage, only to discover a shocking secret that’s overtaking their small-town Texas community.', 'Pulled in by a series of strange and unexplainable video clips, a brother and sister team up to investigate the events captured in the footage, only to discover a shocking secret that’s overtaking their small-town Texas community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WMaJEwwsw8ALCo1mRGjjTV5e8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1465986'),
  ('565399385338228319', 'Man Friday', 1975, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Jack Gold, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Adrian Mitchell', 'Peter O''Toole, Richard Roundtree, Peter Cellier, Christopher Cabot, Joel Fluellen, Sam Seabrook, Stanley Bennett Clay', 'PG', 'Englishman Robinson Crusoe, stranded alone on an island for years, is overjoyed to find a fellow man, a black islander whom he names Friday. But Crusoe cannot overcome the shackles of his own heritage and upbringing and is incapable of seeing Friday as anything other than a savage who needs Crusoe''s brand of cultural and religious enlightenment. Friday attempts to share his own more generous and unashamed culture, but ultimately realizes that Crusoe can never see him as anything but an inferior being. With that awareness, Friday sets out to turn the tables on Crusoe.', 'Englishman Robinson Crusoe, stranded alone on an island for years, is overjoyed to find a fellow man, a black islander whom he names Friday. But Crusoe cannot overcome the shackles of his own heritage and upbringing and is incapable of seeing Friday as anything other than a savage who needs Crusoe''s brand of cultural and religious enlightenment. Friday attempts to share his own more generous and unashamed culture, but ultimately realizes that Crusoe can never see him as anything but an inferior being. With that awareness, Friday sets out to turn the tables on Crusoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdK17PQRIlq9TxFgalxHsqZuSGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91471'),
  ('516054450900954310', 'Man from Deep River', 1972, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Umberto Lenzi, Franco Fantasia, Victor Tourjansky', 'Francesco Barilli, Massimo D''Avak', 'Ivan Rassimov, Me Me Lai, Prasitsak Singhara, Sulallewan Suxantat, Ong Ard, Prapas Chindang, Pipop Pupinyo, Tuan Tevan', 'R', 'A photographer in the rain forest is captured by wild natives, and after months of living with them, he marries the chief''s daughter and helps protect the village from a vicious cannibal tribe.', 'A photographer in the rain forest is captured by wild natives, and after months of living with them, he marries the chief''s daughter and helps protect the village from a vicious cannibal tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVvbuiSKAcaLb09Jvf4i77LrZDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68146'),
  ('649102949453867043', 'Man from Del Rio', 1956, 'Western', 'Harry Horner, Stanley Cortez', 'Richard Carr', 'Anthony Quinn, Katy Jurado, Peter Whitney, Douglas Fowley, John Larch, Whit Bissell, Douglas Spencer, Bill Erwin', 'NR', 'Mexican gunfighter Dave Robles outdraws the town''s outlaw-turned-sheriff and is invited to fill the dead man''s shoes. But a tin star doesn''t bring automatic respectability and Robles is shunned by the town''s leading citizens. His popularity with its less-savory element, particularly saloonkeeper Bannister, wanes dramatically, too, as he starts to take his job seriously. It is his love for a decent, caring woman that keeps Dave in town, but can she convince him to lay down his gun and start a new life?', 'Mexican gunfighter Dave Robles outdraws the town''s outlaw-turned-sheriff and is invited to fill the dead man''s shoes. But a tin star doesn''t bring automatic respectability and Robles is shunned by the town''s leading citizens. His popularity with its less-savory element, particularly saloonkeeper Bannister, wanes dramatically, too, as he starts to take his job seriously. It is his love for a decent, caring woman that keeps Dave in town, but can she convince him to lay down his gun and start a new life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJ8z1aC47G9DGmHKQeq3g72lwrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91472'),
  ('520735334000037391', 'Man from Podolsk', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aleksei Badygov, Semen Serzin, Daniil Fomichev', 'Yuliya Lukshina, Semen Serzin', 'Vadim Korolev, Vladimir Mayzinger, Viktoriya Isakova, Mikhail Kasapov, Ilya Borisov, Taisiya Vilkova, Oleg Ryazantsev, Evgeny Sangadzhiev', null, 'A simple guy from Podolsk ends up in the Moscow Police Department and morally prepares for all sorts of humiliations. But the representatives of the law suddenly turn out to be exacting intellectuals…', 'A simple guy from Podolsk ends up in the Moscow Police Department and morally prepares for all sorts of humiliations. But the representatives of the law suddenly turn out to be exacting intellectuals…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j34VaE3wL7fsKcg0JsBp14Vdv1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633882'),
  ('971144600865118861', 'Man Hunt', 1941, 'Thriller, War', 'Arthur C. Miller, Fritz Lang', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Walter Pidgeon, Joan Bennett, George Sanders, John Carradine, Roddy McDowall, Ludwig Stössel, Heather Thatcher, Frederick Worlock', null, 'Shortly before the start of WW2, renowned British big-game hunter Alan Thorndike, vacationing in Bavaria, has Hitler in his gun sight. He is captured, beaten, left for dead, and escapes back to London where he is hounded by Nazi agents and aided by a young woman.', 'Shortly before the start of WW2, renowned British big-game hunter Alan Thorndike, vacationing in Bavaria, has Hitler in his gun sight. He is captured, beaten, left for dead, and escapes back to London where he is hounded by Nazi agents and aided by a young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cQ3rmbzMcVeExlAyhgcJXlGgSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22404'),
  ('826393622307116996', 'Man in Love', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Han Dong-wook, Park Noo-ri, Yu Eok', 'Yoo Gap-yeol', 'Hwang Jung-min, Han Hye-jin, Nam Il-woo, Kwak Do-won, Jeong Man-sik, Kim Hye-eun, Kang Min-ah, Kim Hong-pa', null, 'Tae-il lives a fast life as low level thug. He then learns that he has a terminal illness and not much time left to live. Then, for the first time in his life, he falls in love.', 'Tae-il lives a fast life as low level thug. He then learns that he has a terminal illness and not much time left to live. Then, for the first time in his life, he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuyZXiAZtyuZZC60PICF5fGrJqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258313'),
  ('205953240622286104', 'Man in Love', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yin Chen-hao', 'Chih-Chung Chien, Lyra Fu, Yoo Gap-yeol', 'Roy Chiu, Hsu Wei-ning, Tsai Chen-nan, Chung Hsin-ling, Lan Wei-hua, Peace Yang, LULU Huang, Bai Xiao-Ying', null, 'A debt collector strikes a deal with a debt-ridden woman struggling to care for her ailing father: he will take care of her bills if she agrees to date him.', 'A debt collector strikes a deal with a debt-ridden woman struggling to care for her ailing father: he will take care of her bills if she agrees to date him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGFS01I30wgAtsWF2HXFPVmRAmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797787'),
  ('360520632903219352', 'Man in Outer Space', 1962, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Rudolf Jaroš, Marie Hejzlarová, Jiří Růžička', 'Jan Fischer, Oldřich Lipský, Zdeněk Bláha', 'Miloš Kopecký, Radovan Lukavský, Otomar Krejča, Vít Olmer, Anita Kajlichova, Lubomír Lipský, Vladimír Hlavatý, Josef Hlinomaz', null, 'An upholsterer who is preparing a rocket for takeoff accidentally jettisons himself into space and returns to Earth 500 years later with an alien companion who wishes to learn more about the human race.', 'An upholsterer who is preparing a rocket for takeoff accidentally jettisons himself into space and returns to Earth 500 years later with an alien companion who wishes to learn more about the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZCsF6jqE16LMX3MM5ufjLX5RLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198864'),
  ('87784398323740748', 'Man in Space', 1955, 'Science Fiction, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Ward Kimball, William V. Skall', 'William Bosche, Ward Kimball', 'Dick Tufeld, Walt Disney, Ward Kimball, Wernher von Braun, Willy Ley', null, 'With a combination of documentary footage and animation, the science and history of rockets, and the effects of space travel on man are illustrated.', 'With a combination of documentary footage and animation, the science and history of rockets, and the effects of space travel on man are illustrated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GfOdI67JiqgqVzF3nvQB9UfcwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205188'),
  ('1064105366387815918', 'Man in the Attic', 1953, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Hugo Fregonese, Leo Tover', 'Robert Presnell Jr., Barré Lyndon', 'Jack Palance, Constance Smith, Byron Palmer, Frances Bavier, Rhys Williams, Sean McClory, Leslie Bradley, Tita Phillips', null, 'London, 1888: on the night of the third Jack the Ripper killing, soft-spoken Mr. Slade, a research pathologist, takes lodgings with the Harleys, including a gloomy attic room for "experiments." Mrs. Harley finds Slade odd and increasingly suspects the worst; her niece Lily (star of a decidedly Parisian stage revue) finds him interesting and increasingly attractive. Is Lily in danger, or are her mother''s suspicions merely a red herring?', 'London, 1888: on the night of the third Jack the Ripper killing, soft-spoken Mr. Slade, a research pathologist, takes lodgings with the Harleys, including a gloomy attic room for "experiments." Mrs. Harley finds Slade odd and increasingly suspects the worst; her niece Lily (star of a decidedly Parisian stage revue) finds him interesting and increasingly attractive. Is Lily in danger, or are her mother''s suspicions merely a red herring?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fB7gBB9LCLeYbu4fiCWuAVo2kE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41018'),
  ('726709568312052746', 'Man in the Dark', 1953, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Floyd Crosby, Lew Landers', 'George Bricker, Jack Leonard', 'Edmond O''Brien, Audrey Totter, Ted de Corsia, Horace McMahon, Nick Dennis, Dayton Lummis, Dan Riss, Paul Bryar', null, 'Many interested parties are after the loot from a factory payroll heist but the mobster who hid it has amnesia after undergoing experimental brain surgery in the prison hospital.', 'Many interested parties are after the loot from a factory payroll heist but the mobster who hid it has amnesia after undergoing experimental brain surgery in the prison hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5JqXBY3r6IlyJYJlPcYKtknF25.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48633'),
  ('136112265856913767', 'Man in the Frame', 1966, 'Animation, Drama', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Boris Kotov, Georgiy Martynyuk', 'Fyodor Khitruk', null, null, 'The way bureaucracy works is told by men in the frames.', 'The way bureaucracy works is told by men in the frames.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5QnpVXb9AumxVwieGERDd5pVDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90014'),
  ('194020128011318736', 'Man in the Middle', 1964, 'War, Drama', 'Guy Hamilton, Wilkie Cooper, Kip Gowans', 'Willis Hall, Keith Waterhouse', 'Robert Mitchum, France Nuyen, Barry Sullivan, Trevor Howard, Keenan Wynn, Sam Wanamaker, Alexander Knox, Gary Cockrell', null, 'In a remote jungle outpost in the Far Eastern theater of World War II, a hotheaded American soldier murders an allied British sergeant in cold blood. Stalwart American Lt. Colonel Barney Adams (Mitchum) is dispatched to defend him in the ensuing court martial. But when Lt. Adams starts encountering roadblocks in his search for evidence, and his key witnesses start disappearing one after another, he soon realizes he''s merely a pawn in a mysterious conspiracy that could extend to the highest levels of military power.', 'In a remote jungle outpost in the Far Eastern theater of World War II, a hotheaded American soldier murders an allied British sergeant in cold blood. Stalwart American Lt. Colonel Barney Adams (Mitchum) is dispatched to defend him in the ensuing court martial. But when Lt. Adams starts encountering roadblocks in his search for evidence, and his key witnesses start disappearing one after another, he soon realizes he''s merely a pawn in a mysterious conspiracy that could extend to the highest levels of military power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKp5KFm1BGCUAye5qWIuezN2Bsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111752'),
  ('173054204298397003', 'Man in the Saddle', 1951, 'Western', 'André de Toth, Morris Stoloff, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Randolph Scott, Joan Leslie, Ellen Drew, Alexander Knox, Richard Rober, John Russell, Alfonso Bedoya, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams', 'NR', 'A small rancher is being harassed by his mighty and powerful neighbor. When the neighbor even hires gunmen to intimidate him he has to defend himself and his property by means of violence.', 'A small rancher is being harassed by his mighty and powerful neighbor. When the neighbor even hires gunmen to intimidate him he has to defend himself and his property by means of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSswVK4dONQ9UU01yaw7HiYQUS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43378'),
  ('318072107062535834', 'Man in the Shadow', 1957, 'Thriller, Drama, Western', 'Arthur E. Arling, Jack Arnold, David Silver', 'Gene L. Coon', 'Jeff Chandler, Orson Welles, Colleen Miller, Ben Alexander, Barbara Lawrence, John Larch, James Gleason, Royal Dano', 'NR', 'In a modern cow town, the powerful ranch owner’s henchmen kill a ranch hand, prompting the sheriff to investigate despite facing strong opposition. He finds an unlikely ally in the rancher''s overprotected daughter, but their quest for justice puts them both in danger.', 'In a modern cow town, the powerful ranch owner’s henchmen kill a ranch hand, prompting the sheriff to investigate despite facing strong opposition. He finds an unlikely ally in the rancher''s overprotected daughter, but their quest for justice puts them both in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaq7qeQO3E3AeulcjzEBVzhS2Pf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36459'),
  ('1021740417677233084', 'Man in the Trunk', 1973, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Georges Lautner', 'Francis Veber, Georges Lautner', 'Mireille Darc, Michel Constantin, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jean Lefebvre, Michel Galabru, Robert Dalban, Amidou, Raoul Saint-Yves', 'PG', 'Bloch, an Israeli secret agent, seeks refuge in the French embassy in Libya to escape being killed. Augier, his French opposite number, has to get him to safety in a diplomatic suitcase.', 'Bloch, an Israeli secret agent, seeks refuge in the French embassy in Libya to escape being killed. Augier, his French opposite number, has to get him to safety in a diplomatic suitcase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1EEpkIxCbwFhhf5pRZjvpjbSDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70781'),
  ('812419480227144678', 'Man in the Vault', 1956, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, William H. Clothier', 'Burt Kennedy', 'William Campbell, Karen Sharpe, Anita Ekberg, Berry Kroeger, Paul Fix, James Seay, Mike Mazurki, Robert Keys', 'NR', 'A locksmith is pressured into crime when the mob makes him perform an elaborate bank robbery.', 'A locksmith is pressured into crime when the mob makes him perform an elaborate bank robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NeRxeMnP8epdWi3ojtoslW8AP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48886'),
  ('103986579378020152', 'Man in the Well', 2016, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Gao Yihan, Hu Bo', 'Hu Bo', 'Zhang Xiaoqian, Tieguang Gao, Zhao Yiji', null, 'Two starving kids find a dead body in the ruins during the apocalypse.', 'Two starving kids find a dead body in the ruins during the apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKFjtgkc6U2S2GSdeOIPvMqODqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535221'),
  ('289221569272518261', 'Man in the Wilderness', 1971, 'Western, Adventure, Drama', 'Richard C. Sarafian, Gerry Fisher, Kuki López Rodero', 'Jack DeWitt', 'Richard Harris, John Huston, Henry Wilcoxon, Percy Herbert, Prunella Ransome, Dennis Waterman, Sheila Raynor, Norman Rossington', 'PG', 'In the early 1800s, a group of fur trappers and Indian traders are returning with their goods to civilization and are making a desperate attempt to beat the oncoming winter. When guide Zachary Bass is injured in a bear attack, they decide he''s a goner and leave him behind to die. When he recovers instead, he swears revenge on them and tracks them and their paranoiac expedition leader down.', 'In the early 1800s, a group of fur trappers and Indian traders are returning with their goods to civilization and are making a desperate attempt to beat the oncoming winter. When guide Zachary Bass is injured in a bear attack, they decide he''s a goner and leave him behind to die. When he recovers instead, he swears revenge on them and tracks them and their paranoiac expedition leader down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2thgsNTcJ9sz6viuUe6kcRFBlIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46845'),
  ('369244871973445743', 'Man Is a Woman', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Jacques Zilbermann, Pierre Aïm, Ghislaine Boileux', 'Gilles Taurand', 'Antoine de Caunes, Elsa Zylberstein, Gad Elmaleh, Michel Aumont, Judith Magre, Maurice Bénichou, Catherine Hiegel, Stéphane Metzger', 'NR', 'Simon Eskenazy is a gay Parisian clarinet player who lives his single life to the fullest. One day, he receives a very tempting offer from his homophobic uncle, looking to continue the family legacy – if he gets married and has a child, he will receive ten million francs and inherit his uncle''s luxurious mansion. After meeting Rosalie Baumann at his cousin David''s wedding, and with some convincing on his mother''s part, Simon sees an opportunity to fulfill his uncle''s wishes and the pair go ahead and get married, but not before traveling to New York to meet Rosalie''s Orthodox Jewish family. As Simon tries to develop real feelings for Rosalie, he struggles with his feelings for his newlywed cousin David.', 'Simon Eskenazy is a gay Parisian clarinet player who lives his single life to the fullest. One day, he receives a very tempting offer from his homophobic uncle, looking to continue the family legacy – if he gets married and has a child, he will receive ten million francs and inherit his uncle''s luxurious mansion. After meeting Rosalie Baumann at his cousin David''s wedding, and with some convincing on his mother''s part, Simon sees an opportunity to fulfill his uncle''s wishes and the pair go ahead and get married, but not before traveling to New York to meet Rosalie''s Orthodox Jewish family. As Simon tries to develop real feelings for Rosalie, he struggles with his feelings for his newlywed cousin David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxjiQgHSclJiROI8uNzWLIIgGrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60750'),
  ('1023064896684530048', 'Man Is Not a Bird', 1965, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Dušan Makavejev, Aleksandar Petković', 'Dušan Makavejev', 'Milena Dravić, Janez Vrhovec, Eva Ras, Stole Aranđelović, Boris Dvornik, Dušan Antonijević, Dušan Janićijević, Predrag ''Preža'' Milinković', null, 'A Serbian engineer falls for a younger woman, but he is inept at courtship.', 'A Serbian engineer falls for a younger woman, but he is inept at courtship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eS5FwDytiodiCfdGsY38rTGv2ZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71725'),
  ('1021608032090581280', 'Man Monkey', 1906, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A gentleman visits a hair consultant for his baldness problems. The latter recommends a new lotion. The gentleman lets himself be convinced and a bellboy is immediately dispatched for the delivery which arrives at the concierge''s lodge. The concierge, curious, and believing it to be good wine drinks a good part of it. He then tops up the bottle with water from the carafe. His wife goes to take his package to the gentleman. The concierge who does not feel well goes to bed quickly. When he wakes up he is perked up. But dismay, he is completely covered in hair. At first frightened, his wife and he come up with an idea. They get hired by an impresario in a music hall number, to a big success.', 'A gentleman visits a hair consultant for his baldness problems. The latter recommends a new lotion. The gentleman lets himself be convinced and a bellboy is immediately dispatched for the delivery which arrives at the concierge''s lodge. The concierge, curious, and believing it to be good wine drinks a good part of it. He then tops up the bottle with water from the carafe. His wife goes to take his package to the gentleman. The concierge who does not feel well goes to bed quickly. When he wakes up he is perked up. But dismay, he is completely covered in hair. At first frightened, his wife and he come up with an idea. They get hired by an impresario in a music hall number, to a big success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6l3LzMhyjz1G35y1YiNs2xpx6o2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120025'),
  ('599060989705280906', 'Man of a Thousand Faces', 1957, 'Drama', 'Joseph Pevney, Ray DeCamp, Russell Metty', 'R. Wright Campbell , Ben Roberts, Ivan Goff', 'James Cagney, Dorothy Malone, Jane Greer, Marjorie Rambeau, Jim Backus, Robert Evans, Celia Lovsky, Jeanne Cagney', 'NR', 'The turbulent life and professional career of vaudeville actor and silent screen horror star Lon Chaney (1883-1930), the man of a thousand faces; bearer of many personal misfortunes that even his great success could not mitigate.', 'The turbulent life and professional career of vaudeville actor and silent screen horror star Lon Chaney (1883-1930), the man of a thousand faces; bearer of many personal misfortunes that even his great success could not mitigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNqfvDSeyVV5SHzYcthrCAO6I81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43234'),
  ('742905599141949615', 'Man of Aran', 1934, 'Documentary', 'Robert Flaherty, Robert Flaherty, Pat Mullin of Aran', 'Robert Flaherty', 'Colman ''Tiger'' King, Maggie Dirrane, Michael Dirrane, Pat Mullin of Aran, Patch ''Red Beard'' Ruadh, Patcheen Faherty, Tommy O''Rourke, Stephen Dirrane', 'NR', 'A documentary on the life of the people of the Aran Islands, who were believed to contain the essence of the ancient Irish life, represented by a pure uncorrupted peasant existence centred around the struggle between man and his hostile but magnificent surroundings. A blend of documentary and fictional narrative, the film captures the everyday trials of life on Ireland''s unforgiving Aran Islands.', 'A documentary on the life of the people of the Aran Islands, who were believed to contain the essence of the ancient Irish life, represented by a pure uncorrupted peasant existence centred around the struggle between man and his hostile but magnificent surroundings. A blend of documentary and fictional narrative, the film captures the everyday trials of life on Ireland''s unforgiving Aran Islands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A67tl48MWZM8bxEYxJZhFGGth9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47684'),
  ('811306387615471089', 'Man of Flowers', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Cox, Yuri Sokol', 'Bob Ellis, Paul Cox', 'Norman Kaye, Alyson Best, Chris Haywood, Werner Herzog, Victoria Eagger, Sarah L. Walker, Hilary Kelly, Julia Blake', null, 'An eccentric elderly man tries to enjoy the three things in life that he considers real beauty: collecting art, collecting flowers, and watching pretty women undress.', 'An eccentric elderly man tries to enjoy the three things in life that he considers real beauty: collecting art, collecting flowers, and watching pretty women undress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itWzDe11iAO8M1qPmZN4sODchUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126764'),
  ('1093116855072297196', 'Man of God', 2021, 'History, Drama', 'Panagiotis Vasilakis, Yelena Popovic', 'Yelena Popovic', 'Aris Servetalis, Mickey Rourke, Alexander Petrov, Karyofyllia Karabeti, Tonia Sotiropoulou, Manos Gavras, Yannis Stankoglou, Michalis Ikonomou', null, 'Exiled unjustly, convicted without trial, slandered without cause. Man of God depicts the trials and tribulations of Saint Nektarios of Aegina, as he bears the unjust hatred of his enemies while preaching the Word of God.', 'Exiled unjustly, convicted without trial, slandered without cause. Man of God depicts the trials and tribulations of Saint Nektarios of Aegina, as he bears the unjust hatred of his enemies while preaching the Word of God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvbyqV8CPMSiqaeOXteRXYg6CPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733209'),
  ('386748848310923566', 'Man of God: The Cord', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Paul Wittenberger', 'Paul Wittenberger', 'Isaac Anderson, Miriam Anderson, Solomon Anderson, John Anderson', null, 'Documentary on Pastor Steven Anderson and the New IFB movement. Beyond his public image, he led with fear, violence, and psychological abuse. His children speak out about mistreatment in his family and church.', 'Documentary on Pastor Steven Anderson and the New IFB movement. Beyond his public image, he led with fear, violence, and psychological abuse. His children speak out about mistreatment in his family and church.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:man-of-god-the-cord'),
  ('926225640028515048', 'Man of Iron', 1972, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Chang Cheh, Pao Hsueh-Li, Yuen Teng-Bong', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Chen Kuan-Tai, Ching Li, Wong Chung, Chu Mu, Tin Ching, Yang Chi-Ching, Pao Chia-Wen, Yeung Chak-Lam', null, 'Man of Iron was positioned as something of a follow-up to Boxer From Shantung, the rise-and-fall story of Ma Yung Chen and it reunites the directors and some of the cast in a similar but much slighter tale of a lesser gangster''s rise and fall in Shanghai. While the opening narration specifically recalls the events and tragic conclusion of BOXER, this one is set 20 years later in the same section of Shanghai but otherwise has nothing to do with the events or characters of the previous film.', 'Man of Iron was positioned as something of a follow-up to Boxer From Shantung, the rise-and-fall story of Ma Yung Chen and it reunites the directors and some of the cast in a similar but much slighter tale of a lesser gangster''s rise and fall in Shanghai. While the opening narration specifically recalls the events and tragic conclusion of BOXER, this one is set 20 years later in the same section of Shanghai but otherwise has nothing to do with the events or characters of the previous film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olnMdMunyQzZdizsH8hlAObhTJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92679'),
  ('27991791077037110', 'Man of Iron', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Andrzej Wajda, Edward Kłosiński', 'Aleksander Ścibor-Rylski', 'Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Krystyna Janda, Marian Opania, Irena Byrska, Wiesława Kosmalska, Bogusław Linda, Franciszek Trzeciak, Janusz Gajos', null, 'In Warsaw in 1980, the Communist Party sends disgruntled radio reporter Winkel to Gdańsk to dig up dirt on the shipyard strikers - particularly on Maciek Tomczyk, an independent labour union leader whose father was killed in the December 1970 protests. Posing as sympathetic, Winkel interviews the people surrounding Tomczyk, including his detained wife, Agnieszka.', 'In Warsaw in 1980, the Communist Party sends disgruntled radio reporter Winkel to Gdańsk to dig up dirt on the shipyard strikers - particularly on Maciek Tomczyk, an independent labour union leader whose father was killed in the December 1970 protests. Posing as sympathetic, Winkel interviews the people surrounding Tomczyk, including his detained wife, Agnieszka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22wNUqKyz2m6wzAt31f26H8Y433.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225'),
  ('990120889835086008', 'Man of La Mancha', 1972, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Arthur Hiller, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Dale Wasserman', 'Peter O''Toole, Sophia Loren, James Coco, Ian Richardson, Harry Andrews, John Castle, Brian Blessed, Julie Gregg', 'PG', 'In the 16th century, poet, playwright and part-time actor Miguel de Cervantes has been arrested, together with his manservant, by the Spanish Inquisition. They''re accused of presenting an entertainment offensive to the Inquisition. Inside the huge dungeon into which they have been cast, the other inmates gang up on Cervantes and his manservant, staging a mock trial, with the intention of stealing or burning his possessions. Cervantes wishes to desperately save a manuscript he carries with him and stages, with costumes, makeup, and the participation of the other prisoners, an unusual defense—the story of Don Quixote.', 'In the 16th century, poet, playwright and part-time actor Miguel de Cervantes has been arrested, together with his manservant, by the Spanish Inquisition. They''re accused of presenting an entertainment offensive to the Inquisition. Inside the huge dungeon into which they have been cast, the other inmates gang up on Cervantes and his manservant, staging a mock trial, with the intention of stealing or burning his possessions. Cervantes wishes to desperately save a manuscript he carries with him and stages, with costumes, makeup, and the participation of the other prisoners, an unusual defense—the story of Don Quixote.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKpSHHH6cj8YtciW1SHBGJ6pAOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45793'),
  ('729179238716966347', 'Man of Marble', 1977, 'Drama', 'Edward Kłosiński, Andrzej Wajda, Leszek Tarnowski', 'Aleksander Ścibor-Rylski', 'Krystyna Janda, Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Tadeusz Łomnicki, Jacek Lomnicki, Michał Tarkowski, Piotr Cieślak, Wiesław Wójcik, Krystyna Zachwatowicz', null, 'A young Polish filmmaker sets out to find out what happened to Mateusz Birkut, a bricklayer who became a propaganda hero in the 1950s but later fell out of favor and disappeared.', 'A young Polish filmmaker sets out to find out what happened to Mateusz Birkut, a bricklayer who became a propaganda hero in the 1950s but later fell out of favor and disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXrUd8iSUiNvzlOsn3xrQgPpiig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224'),
  ('221148727278131157', 'Man of Men', 2019, 'Drama', 'Yong Soo, Kim Hyo-seong, Bae Tae-jong', 'Yong Soo', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Cho Jin-woong, Huh Joon-ho, Kim Sa-rang, Jin Sun-kyu, Ji Seung-hyun, Kim Min-seok, Park Jae-cheol', null, 'The friendship between a lawyer who will do anything to make money and a nursing home volunteer.', 'The friendship between a lawyer who will do anything to make money and a nursing home volunteer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwUppg1yYiHvZ398fT70uQFWV6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573808'),
  ('638766086915114956', 'Man of Steel', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Amir Mokri, Zack Snyder, Chris Beach', 'David S. Goyer', 'Henry Cavill, Amy Adams, Russell Crowe, Michael Shannon, Kevin Costner, Laurence Fishburne, Diane Lane, Ayelet Zurer', 'PG-13', 'A young boy learns that he has extraordinary powers and is not of this earth. As a young man, he journeys to discover where he came from and what he was sent here to do. But the hero in him must emerge if he is to save the world from annihilation and become the symbol of hope for all mankind.', 'A young boy learns that he has extraordinary powers and is not of this earth. As a young man, he journeys to discover where he came from and what he was sent here to do. But the hero in him must emerge if he is to save the world from annihilation and become the symbol of hope for all mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GFtkImmK0K1VaUChR0n9O61CFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49521'),
  ('483224825784868911', 'Man of Straw', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pietro Germi, Leonida Barboni, Salvatore Rosso', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi', 'Pietro Germi, Luisa Della Noce, Franca Bettoia, Saro Urzì, Edoardo Nevola, Luciano Marin, Milly, Romolo Giordani', null, 'Andrea Zaccardi has returned home from hunting. He and his wife Luisa are very close. Their young son Giulio develops a cough. The doctor recommends the seaside. Luisa leaves with Giulio for several weeks. Andrea stays to work at the metal shop.', 'Andrea Zaccardi has returned home from hunting. He and his wife Luisa are very close. Their young son Giulio develops a cough. The doctor recommends the seaside. Luisa leaves with Giulio for several weeks. Andrea stays to work at the metal shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3POkhbSh737P6hWifFb6ebg1wBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56960'),
  ('674274343016681922', 'Man of Tai Chi', 2013, 'Action, Drama', 'Keanu Reeves, Yuen Woo-Ping, Wong Fei-Fei', 'Michael G. Cooney', 'Tiger Chen Hu, Keanu Reeves, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Yu Hai, Ye Qing, Simon Yam, Yasuyuki Hirata, Julius Brian Siswojo', 'R', 'In Beijing, a young martial artist''s skill places him in position to experience opportunities and sacrifices.', 'In Beijing, a young martial artist''s skill places him in position to experience opportunities and sacrifices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnuT1D0fsFu7chFLtcQqwPBaBVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76544'),
  ('393857629163250220', 'Man of the East', 1972, 'Comedy, Western, Action', 'Enzo Barboni, Aldo Giordani, Victor Tourjansky', 'Enzo Barboni', 'Terence Hill, Gregory Walcott, Yanti Somer, Dominic Barto, Harry Carey, Jr., Enzo Fiermonte, Danika La Loggia, Riccardo Pizzuti', 'PG', 'By his dying father''s last wish Joe is sent to the Wild West to become a real guy. The dreamy young man despises guns and fights likes poems and prefers bicycles to horses. Now his three teachers footpads all of them shall teach him otherwise. This doesn''t work until Joe has to defend himself against gunman Morton who''s jealous of Joe''s love to rancher Ohlsen''s beautiful daughter.', 'By his dying father''s last wish Joe is sent to the Wild West to become a real guy. The dreamy young man despises guns and fights likes poems and prefers bicycles to horses. Now his three teachers footpads all of them shall teach him otherwise. This doesn''t work until Joe has to defend himself against gunman Morton who''s jealous of Joe''s love to rancher Ohlsen''s beautiful daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFwKo4O14PydJjyUYbR9Y7c7R1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54164'),
  ('244670862492439855', 'Man of the House', 1995, 'Comedy, Family', 'James Orr, Jamie Anderson', 'Jim Cruickshank, James Orr', 'Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Chevy Chase, Farrah Fawcett, George Wendt, David Shiner, Art LaFleur, Richard Portnow, Richard Foronjy', 'PG', 'Ben Archer is not happy. His mother, Sandy, has just met a man, and it looks like things are pretty serious. Driven by a fear of abandonment, Ben tries anything and everything to ruin the "love bubble" which surrounds his mom. However, after Ben and Jack''s experiences in the Indian Guides, the two become much closer.', 'Ben Archer is not happy. His mother, Sandy, has just met a man, and it looks like things are pretty serious. Driven by a fear of abandonment, Ben tries anything and everything to ruin the "love bubble" which surrounds his mom. However, after Ben and Jack''s experiences in the Indian Guides, the two become much closer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bnOhhrrrq6RZhMgz4aGyqbJ9Wf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40490'),
  ('82548299935654304', 'Man of the House', 2005, 'Comedy, Action', 'Stephen Herek, Courtenay Miles, Allan Graf', 'John J. McLaughlin, Robert Ramsey, Matthew Stone', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Cedric the Entertainer, Christina Milian, Paula Garcés, Monica Keena, Vanessa Ferlito, Kelli Garner, Anne Archer', 'PG-13', 'Texas Ranger Roland Sharp is assigned to protect the only witnesses to the murder of a key figure in the prosecution of a drug kingpin -- a group of University of Texas cheerleaders. Sharp must now go undercover as an assistant cheerleading coach and move in with the young women.', 'Texas Ranger Roland Sharp is assigned to protect the only witnesses to the murder of a key figure in the prosecution of a drug kingpin -- a group of University of Texas cheerleaders. Sharp must now go undercover as an assistant cheerleading coach and move in with the young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anBhlqCABytNvybE2Xr3tvsCOTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13498'),
  ('352626066488566346', 'Man of the Moment', 1955, 'Comedy', 'John Paddy Carstairs', 'Maurice Cowan, Vernon Sylvaine, John Paddy Carstairs', 'Norman Wisdom, Lana Morris, Belinda Lee, Jerry Desmonde, Karl Stepanek, Garry Marsh, Inia Te Wiata, Evelyn Roberts', null, 'Norman is a file clerk who accidentally becomes a British delegate to a diplomatic conference, befriends the queen of a remote island, and winds up a knight. Norman leaves rooms in shambles, tailors in shreds, and diplomats in bandages. Chased by gunmen and assassins of foreign powers, Norman finds himself running through active TV studio sets and interrupts various programs and performances in progress', 'Norman is a file clerk who accidentally becomes a British delegate to a diplomatic conference, befriends the queen of a remote island, and winds up a knight. Norman leaves rooms in shambles, tailors in shreds, and diplomats in bandages. Chased by gunmen and assassins of foreign powers, Norman finds himself running through active TV studio sets and interrupts various programs and performances in progress', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oHuDipsK7LOYrlGMkXPkYYlDH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38382'),
  ('149926086467369003', 'Man of the West', 1958, 'Western', 'Anthony Mann, Ernest Haller, Dick Moder', 'Reginald Rose', 'Gary Cooper, Julie London, Lee J. Cobb, Arthur O''Connell, Jack Lord, John Dehner, Royal Dano, Robert J. Wilke', null, 'Heading east to Fort Worth to hire a schoolteacher for his frontier town home, Link Jones is stranded with singer Billie Ellis and gambler Sam Beasley when their train is held up. For shelter, Jones leads them to his nearby former home, where he was brought up an outlaw. Finding the gang still living in the shack, Jones pretends to be ready to return to a life crime.', 'Heading east to Fort Worth to hire a schoolteacher for his frontier town home, Link Jones is stranded with singer Billie Ellis and gambler Sam Beasley when their train is held up. For shelter, Jones leads them to his nearby former home, where he was brought up an outlaw. Finding the gang still living in the shack, Jones pretends to be ready to return to a life crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fh9vTJ5mOkKK5nZ1LRhfvP5JrD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14674'),
  ('208020350590833173', 'Man of the World', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Wallace, Victor Milner, Edward Goodman', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'William Powell, Carole Lombard, Wynne Gibson, Lawrence Gray, Guy Kibbee, George Chandler, André Cheron, Harvey Clark', 'NR', 'A young American girl visits Paris accompanied by her fiancee and her wealthy uncle. There she meets and is romanced by a worldly novelist; what she doesn''t know is that he is a blackmailer who is using her to get to her uncle.', 'A young American girl visits Paris accompanied by her fiancee and her wealthy uncle. There she meets and is romanced by a worldly novelist; what she doesn''t know is that he is a blackmailer who is using her to get to her uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gi8AGcB27lWILYmVygJCBlk1Au.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106573'),
  ('1097606760504913217', 'Man of the Year', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'Barry Levinson, Dick Pope', 'Barry Levinson', 'Robin Williams, Christopher Walken, Laura Linney, Lewis Black, Jeff Goldblum, David Alpay, Faith Daniels, Tina Fey', 'PG-13', 'The irreverent host of a political satire talk show decides to run for president and expose corruption in Washington. His stunt goes further than he expects when he actually wins the election, but a software engineer suspects that a computer glitch is responsible for his surprising victory.', 'The irreverent host of a political satire talk show decides to run for president and expose corruption in Washington. His stunt goes further than he expects when he actually wins the election, but a software engineer suspects that a computer glitch is responsible for his surprising victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1etp9ZqcRqZVfonrdFJbQ6mgk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9895'),
  ('100199860679683247', 'Man of Vendetta', 2010, 'Thriller, Action', 'Woo Min-ho, Cho Yong-kyu, Jeon Byeong-yun', 'Woo Min-ho', 'Kim Myung-min, Kim So-hyun, Uhm Ki-joon, Park Joo-mi, Lee Byung-joon, An Seo-hyun, Oh Kwang-rok, Kim Eung-soo', null, 'A respected pastor is shattered when his daughter is kidnapped and not returned. He renounces his faith in God and becomes a corrupt businessman. Years later, he receives a call and finds that his daughter is still alive and is with the kidnapper. His resolute attempt to rescue her begins.', 'A respected pastor is shattered when his daughter is kidnapped and not returned. He renounces his faith in God and becomes a corrupt businessman. Years later, he receives a call and finds that his daughter is still alive and is with the kidnapper. His resolute attempt to rescue her begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y88rlxEAW0sOzktcpIddNDi7EHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50210'),
  ('662388473104088528', 'Man of Violence', 1970, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Pete Walker, Norman G. Langley', 'Pete Walker, Brian Comport', 'Michael Latimer, Luan Peters, Derek Aylward, Maurice Kaufmann, Derek Francis, Kenneth Hendel, George Belbin, Syd Conabere', null, 'Moon is a mercenary who joins forces with two crooked cops in an attempt to steal $90 million in gold from an Arab country decimated by political chaos. Sex, violence and mayhem accompany the group of double-crossing heavies who covet the purloined loot. A bevy of females willingly submit to seduction, and a sadistic, homosexual murderer trails Moon and his malevolent gang for the gold.', 'Moon is a mercenary who joins forces with two crooked cops in an attempt to steal $90 million in gold from an Arab country decimated by political chaos. Sex, violence and mayhem accompany the group of double-crossing heavies who covet the purloined loot. A bevy of females willingly submit to seduction, and a sadistic, homosexual murderer trails Moon and his malevolent gang for the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4xvnP3m2RLzAm2xvroBsXIT4Pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47973'),
  ('527273906679499295', 'Man of Will', 2017, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Moon Dae-young, Kim Jae-keun, Lee Won-tae', 'Lee Won-tae', 'Cho Jin-woong, Song Seung-heon, Jeong Man-sik, Jung Jin-young, Yoo Seung-mok, Shin Jung-keun, Jeong Gyu-su, Jeon Bae-soo', null, 'Young Kim Chang-soo is placed behind bars, charged with murdering a Japanese person who took part in Empress Myeongseong''s assassination. In prison, Kim Chang-soo sees how Koreans are persecuted and grows into a fighter for Korean independence.', 'Young Kim Chang-soo is placed behind bars, charged with murdering a Japanese person who took part in Empress Myeongseong''s assassination. In prison, Kim Chang-soo sees how Koreans are persecuted and grows into a fighter for Korean independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIT6CdzYmNsUxkaoMLi5wY4jugK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477877'),
  ('268065663529299772', 'Man on a Ledge', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Asger Leth, Paul Cameron, David ''Wex'' Wechsler', 'Pablo F. Fenjves', 'Sam Worthington, Elizabeth Banks, Jamie Bell, Anthony Mackie, Edward Burns, Genesis Rodriguez, Ed Harris, Titus Welliver', 'PG-13', 'An ex-cop turned con threatens to jump to his death from a Manhattan hotel rooftop. The NYPD dispatch a female police psychologist to talk him down. However, unbeknownst to the police on the scene, the suicide attempt is a cover for the biggest diamond heist ever pulled.', 'An ex-cop turned con threatens to jump to his death from a Manhattan hotel rooftop. The NYPD dispatch a female police psychologist to talk him down. However, unbeknownst to the police on the scene, the suicide attempt is a cover for the biggest diamond heist ever pulled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pziTpiYy5dtVdvXctYIZv09r5Nk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49527'),
  ('961079717026883026', 'Man on a Swing', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adam Holender, Frank Perry, William Eustace', 'David Zelag Goodman', 'Cliff Robertson, Joel Grey, Dorothy Tristan, Elizabeth Wilson, George Voskovec, Ron Weyand, Peter Masterson, Lane Smith', 'PG', 'When a young schoolteacher is found dead in her car in a parking lot in broad daylight, police chief Lee Tucker can find no clues pointing to her killer. Flamboyant self-proclaimed psychic Franklin Wills offers his help to the skeptical policeman, and, when his supposed visions about the case begin to reveal clues and information that only the killer could possibly have known, he becomes a suspect himself.', 'When a young schoolteacher is found dead in her car in a parking lot in broad daylight, police chief Lee Tucker can find no clues pointing to her killer. Flamboyant self-proclaimed psychic Franklin Wills offers his help to the skeptical policeman, and, when his supposed visions about the case begin to reveal clues and information that only the killer could possibly have known, he becomes a suspect himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RQ4sMsIi7CgHXLAbWqvmlAgrMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131437'),
  ('458884716160774546', 'Man on a Tightrope', 1953, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Elia Kazan, Georg Krause, Hans Tost', 'Robert E. Sherwood', 'Fredric March, Terry Moore, Gloria Grahame, Cameron Mitchell, Adolphe Menjou, Robert Beatty, Richard Boone, Alexander D''Arcy', 'NR', 'The owner of an impoverished circus in Communist-ruled Czechoslovokia plots to flee across the border to freedom, taking his entire troupe of performers and wild animals with him.', 'The owner of an impoverished circus in Communist-ruled Czechoslovokia plots to flee across the border to freedom, taking his entire troupe of performers and wild animals with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alW4hvzjGgdq74ZW4zoQNFA8OEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99898'),
  ('100598343076867648', 'Man on Fire', 1987, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Élie Chouraqui, Jacques Eberhard, Serge Pescetelli', 'Élie Chouraqui, Sergio Donati', 'Scott Glenn, Jade Malle, Brooke Adams, Jonathan Pryce, Danny Aiello, Joe Pesci, Paul Shenar, Laura Morante', 'R', 'Creasy, a traumatized ex-CIA agent, gets a job as a bodyguard for Samantha, the twelve-year-old daughter of a wealthy Italian family living in a swanky villa on the shores of Lake Como.', 'Creasy, a traumatized ex-CIA agent, gets a job as a bodyguard for Samantha, the twelve-year-old daughter of a wealthy Italian family living in a swanky villa on the shores of Lake Como.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQhcV9vPC8bfbmJgZwznAjKCVO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49712'),
  ('604251310418830359', 'Man on Fire', 2004, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tony Scott, Paul Cameron, Carlos Benassini', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Denzel Washington, Dakota Fanning, Christopher Walken, Radha Mitchell, Marc Anthony, Giancarlo Giannini, Rachel Ticotin, Mickey Rourke', 'R', 'Jaded ex-CIA operative John Creasy reluctantly accepts a job as the bodyguard for a 10-year-old girl in Mexico City. They clash at first, but eventually bond, and when she''s kidnapped he''s consumed by fury and will stop at nothing to save her life.', 'Jaded ex-CIA operative John Creasy reluctantly accepts a job as the bodyguard for a 10-year-old girl in Mexico City. They clash at first, but eventually bond, and when she''s kidnapped he''s consumed by fury and will stop at nothing to save her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grCGLCcTHv9TChibzOwzUpykcjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9509'),
  ('424233497039776707', 'Man on High Heels', 2014, 'Action, Drama', 'Jang Jin, Lee Seong-je, Lee Byeong-hoon', 'Jang Jin', 'Cha Seung-won, Esom, Oh Jung-se, Park Sung-woong, An Kil-kang, Lee El, Go Kyung-pyo, Oh Ji-ho', null, 'Ji-wook is a virile detective with a reputation, but deep down in his heart, he always considered himself as a woman and finally decides to get a transsexual operation. However, his plan falls apart as vicious gang members start their revenge on him.', 'Ji-wook is a virile detective with a reputation, but deep down in his heart, he always considered himself as a woman and finally decides to get a transsexual operation. However, his plan falls apart as vicious gang members start their revenge on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u45gBnx1FBgMccThUAFpoqOMBms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267573'),
