  ('52249632367606213', 'Man on the Roof', 1976, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Bo Widerberg, Odd-Geir Sæther, Stefan Jarl', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Carl-Gustaf Lindstedt, Sven Wollter, Thomas Hellberg, Håkan Serner, Ingvar Hirdwall, Birgitta Valberg, Carl-Axel Heiknert, Torgny Anderberg', null, 'When an inspector is murdered in hospital, the investigation led by Detective Martin Beck uncovers reports of misconduct and possibly revenge.', 'When an inspector is murdered in hospital, the investigation led by Detective Martin Beck uncovers reports of misconduct and possibly revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQPoUrIxjk9BhBHxWeXiOenWbCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25699'),
  ('370380423918975601', 'Man on the Run', 1949, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Lawrence Huntington, Leon Bijou, Wilkie Cooper', 'Lawrence Huntington', 'Derek Farr, Joan Hopkins, Edward Chapman, Laurence Harvey, Howard Marion-Crawford, Alfie Bass, John Bailey, John Stuart', null, 'An Army deserter, still a fugitive in Post-War Britain, wanders into a pawn-shop robbery and finds himself wanted for murder. He meets a war widow who helps him elude the police while he looks for the real criminals.', 'An Army deserter, still a fugitive in Post-War Britain, wanders into a pawn-shop robbery and finds himself wanted for murder. He meets a war widow who helps him elude the police while he looks for the real criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IOQNMp3hE1RV3xMk4otlLebudH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290236'),
  ('326548297635257056', 'Man on the Run', 2026, 'Documentary, Music', 'Morgan Neville', null, 'Paul McCartney, Linda McCartney, Denny Laine, Denny Seiwell, Henry McCullough, Jimmy McCulloch, John Lennon, George Harrison', 'R', 'Paul McCartney forms new band Wings after Beatles breakup. Archival home footage shows his life with Linda, who influenced his music. The film follows Wings from formation through the 1970s, during which McCartney wrote hit songs.', 'Paul McCartney forms new band Wings after Beatles breakup. Archival home footage shows his life with Linda, who influenced his music. The film follows Wings from formation through the 1970s, during which McCartney wrote hit songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qX0hwcKvO3FNkI3JMBUnQ3wxKEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1260643'),
  ('371930525688065994', 'Man on the Tracks', 1957, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Andrzej Munk, Jakub Goldberg, Paweł Komorowski', 'Andrzej Munk', 'Kazimierz Opaliński, Zygmunt Maciejewski, Zygmunt Zintel, Zygmunt Listkiewicz, Roman Kłosowski, Kazimierz Fabisiak, Ludosław Kozłowski, Janusz Bylczyński', null, 'One night in 1950 a passenger train runs over a man, who turns out to be the veteran train engineer Władysław Orzechowski, knows for his old ways and stern demeanor. As the inquiry panel tries to deduce why would a man like Orzechowski jump in front of a moving train several of the people involved in the case are interrogated, each telling their own version of the story. Can the panel arrive at the truth in a world where workers unite, inferior coal is a badge of honor, and the old order is suspect?', 'One night in 1950 a passenger train runs over a man, who turns out to be the veteran train engineer Władysław Orzechowski, knows for his old ways and stern demeanor. As the inquiry panel tries to deduce why would a man like Orzechowski jump in front of a moving train several of the people involved in the case are interrogated, each telling their own version of the story. Can the panel arrive at the truth in a world where workers unite, inferior coal is a badge of honor, and the old order is suspect?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkJqzbT8vCcputkk3Co9N6Y8HvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132133'),
  ('924385530100950383', 'Man on the Train', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'Patrice Leconte, Jean-Marie Dreujou, Olivier Coutard', 'Claude Klotz', 'Jean Rochefort, Johnny Hallyday, Jean-François Stévenin, Pascal Parmentier, Charlie Nelson, Isabelle Petit-Jacques, Édith Scob, Maurice Chevit', null, 'A man, Milan steps off a train, into a small French village. As he waits for the day when he will rob the town bank, he runs into an old retired poetry teacher named M. Manesquier. The two men strike up a strange friendship and explore the road not taken, each wanting to live the other''s life.', 'A man, Milan steps off a train, into a small French village. As he waits for the day when he will rob the town bank, he runs into an old retired poetry teacher named M. Manesquier. The two men strike up a strange friendship and explore the road not taken, each wanting to live the other''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3npd5xuegtcYc6HPt5NgdB27sRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22016'),
  ('979075863028239269', 'Man on Wire', 2008, 'Documentary', 'James Marsh, Igor Martinović', 'Philippe Petit', 'Philippe Petit, Jean François Heckel, Jean-Louis Blondeau, Annie Allix, David Forman, Alan Welner, Barry Greenhouse, Jim Moore', 'PG-13', 'On August 7th 1974, French tightrope walker Philippe Petit stepped out on a high wire, illegally rigged between New York''s World Trade Center twin towers, then the world''s tallest buildings. After nearly an hour of performing on the wire, 1,350 feet above the sidewalks of Manhattan, he was arrested. This fun and spellbinding documentary chronicles Philippe Petit''s "highest" achievement.', 'On August 7th 1974, French tightrope walker Philippe Petit stepped out on a high wire, illegally rigged between New York''s World Trade Center twin towers, then the world''s tallest buildings. After nearly an hour of performing on the wire, 1,350 feet above the sidewalks of Manhattan, he was arrested. This fun and spellbinding documentary chronicles Philippe Petit''s "highest" achievement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mS4rhIgHZcHIvf1beP9Av0Ui33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14048'),
  ('220221703133168529', 'Man Push Cart', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ramin Bahrani, Michael Simmonds', 'Ramin Bahrani', 'Ahmad Razvi, Leticia Dolera, Charles Daniel Sandoval, Ali Reza, Farooq ''Duke'' Muhammad, Panicker Upendran, Arun Lal, Razia Mujahid', null, 'Every night while the city sleeps, Ahmad, a former Pakistani rock star turned immigrant, drags his heavy cart along the streets of New York. And every morning, he sells coffee and donuts to a city he cannot call his own. One day, however, the pattern of this harsh existence is broken by a glimmer of hope for a better life.', 'Every night while the city sleeps, Ahmad, a former Pakistani rock star turned immigrant, drags his heavy cart along the streets of New York. And every morning, he sells coffee and donuts to a city he cannot call his own. One day, however, the pattern of this harsh existence is broken by a glimmer of hope for a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGhGa4O6ztK5r3SeFlEmYZE7EUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5717'),
  ('140875776931700924', 'Man spricht deutsh', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Hanns Christian Müller, James Jacobs, Fred Unger', 'Gerhard Polt, Hanns Christian Müller', 'Gerhard Polt, Gisela Schneeberger, Dieter Hildebrandt, Michael Gahr, Werner Schneyder, Enzo Cannavale, Siegfried Mahler, Elisabeth Welz', null, 'A very middle-class Bavarian family spend the last day of their Mediterranean vacation on the beach, day-dreaming and muttering racist remarks about Italian people.', 'A very middle-class Bavarian family spend the last day of their Mediterranean vacation on the beach, day-dreaming and muttering racist remarks about Italian people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wy4q1GYBlJksJ4YR5tvB0kfJjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7458'),
  ('72948509006489794', 'Man to Man', 2005, 'Drama', 'Régis Wargnier, Laurent Dailland', null, 'Joseph Fiennes, Kristin Scott Thomas, Iain Glen, Hugh Bonneville, Lomama Boseki, Cécile Bayiha, Flora Montgomery, Alistair Petrie', null, 'An epic about anthropologists who hunt and capture pygmies for study back in Europe, in an attempt to illustrate the link between man and ape.', 'An epic about anthropologists who hunt and capture pygmies for study back in Europe, in an attempt to illustrate the link between man and ape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eV6ZfUZOa3MyQX0bDEeUjSmy3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10087'),
  ('663843868704614056', 'Man Trouble', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bob Rafelson, Stephen H. Burum', 'Carole Eastman', 'Jack Nicholson, Ellen Barkin, Harry Dean Stanton, Beverly D''Angelo, Michael McKean, Saul Rubinek, Viveka Davis, Veronica Cartwright', 'PG-13', 'A sleazy but affable guard dog trainer is blackmailed to steal a manuscript for a tell-all book from one of his clients.', 'A sleazy but affable guard dog trainer is blackmailed to steal a manuscript for a tell-all book from one of his clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hpxleh58Ln1jLcF9hczRTWxtP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39472'),
  ('365091795067691309', 'Man Up', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ben Palmer, Andrew Dunn, Martin Curry', 'Tess Morris', 'Simon Pegg, Lake Bell, Rory Kinnear, Ken Stott, Harriet Walter, Sharon Horgan, Stephen Campbell Moore, Ophelia Lovibond', 'R', 'A 34 year old single woman, Nancy, hung-over again, exhausted by the endless fruitless set ups by her friends, traveling across London to toast another 10 years of her parent''s successful happy magical marriage runs in with a 40 year old divorcee, Jack, who mistakes her for his 24 year old blind date. Nancy, deciding to go with it, happens to hop on the most chaotic yet hilarious journey of her life which neither of them will ever forget.', 'A 34 year old single woman, Nancy, hung-over again, exhausted by the endless fruitless set ups by her friends, traveling across London to toast another 10 years of her parent''s successful happy magical marriage runs in with a 40 year old divorcee, Jack, who mistakes her for his 24 year old blind date. Nancy, deciding to go with it, happens to hop on the most chaotic yet hilarious journey of her life which neither of them will ever forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJskXY0qQcc21UzkGPyiGRKw2md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332340'),
  ('868826400112003959', 'Man Up!', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Benjamin Parent, Pierre Cottereau, Pierrick Vautier', 'Théo Courtial', 'Thomas Guy, Benjamin Voisin, Isabelle Carré, Laurent Lucas, Anaëlle Othenin-Girard, Tasnim Jamlaoui, Guillaume Arnault, Mohamed Seddiki', null, 'Tom, 16, is a sensitive teenager who is about to enter a new high school after being expelled. He intends to find his place, make friends and seduce the girl he loves. Tom needs the support of his older brother, Leo, a true mentor, who is working to make him a “cool kid”. However, Leo''s fraternal benevolence hides a destructive temperament... Will Tom be able to grow up finding his own path?', 'Tom, 16, is a sensitive teenager who is about to enter a new high school after being expelled. He intends to find his place, make friends and seduce the girl he loves. Tom needs the support of his older brother, Leo, a true mentor, who is working to make him a “cool kid”. However, Leo''s fraternal benevolence hides a destructive temperament... Will Tom be able to grow up finding his own path?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t37i63GN6ja3piv3BhOrbEFZmfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544398'),
  ('755549456211750064', 'Man Vs.', 2015, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Mirosław Baszak, Adam Massey', 'Thomas Michael', 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Chloe Bradt, Michael Cram, Kelly Fanson, Alex Karzis, Sam Kalilieh, Drew Nelson, Kate Ziegler', null, 'As host of his own hit TV series, ''MAN VS'', Doug Woods is forced to fend for himself for five days in remote locations with no crew, food, or water, only the cameras he carries on his back to film his experiences. Doug''s in the remote woods for a routine episode, until he''s awoken by an earth-shaking crash. Things get weirder as it becomes clear Doug isn''t alone. Someone or something is watching him.', 'As host of his own hit TV series, ''MAN VS'', Doug Woods is forced to fend for himself for five days in remote locations with no crew, food, or water, only the cameras he carries on his back to film his experiences. Doug''s in the remote woods for a routine episode, until he''s awoken by an earth-shaking crash. Things get weirder as it becomes clear Doug isn''t alone. Someone or something is watching him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7neRfPEhjruZIBg99Sqs0yBVUk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343112'),
  ('54581909450855870', 'Man vs. Snake', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Tim Kinzy, Andrew Seklir', null, 'Tim McVey, Dwayne Richard, Tom Asaki, Billy Mitchell, Walter Day', null, '1984. One shiny quarter. 44.5 hours of continuous play. The race to be the first gamer in history to score one BILLION points. Until recently, Timothy McVey (not the terrorist) thought he had — for all these years — held the world record on Nibbler.', '1984. One shiny quarter. 44.5 hours of continuous play. The race to be the first gamer in history to score one BILLION points. Until recently, Timothy McVey (not the terrorist) thought he had — for all these years — held the world record on Nibbler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwzJyRTcD9IhASYvW1cxZY3G79n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356335'),
  ('87893276036876593', 'Man Walking Around a Corner', 1887, 'Documentary', 'Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince, Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince', null, null, null, 'The last remaining production of Le Prince''s LPCC Type-16 (16-lens camera) is part of a gelatine film shot in 32 images/second, and pictures a man walking around a corner. Le Prince, who was in Leeds (UK) at that time, sent these images to his wife in New York City in a letter dated 18 August 1887.', 'The last remaining production of Le Prince''s LPCC Type-16 (16-lens camera) is part of a gelatine film shot in 32 images/second, and pictures a man walking around a corner. Le Prince, who was in Leeds (UK) at that time, sent these images to his wife in New York City in a letter dated 18 August 1887.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ7gNpHTyFXKlfX0rvuRWrroLUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159897'),
  ('26995840505792735', 'Man Walking on Snow', 2002, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Kobayashi', 'Masahiro Kobayashi', 'Ken Ogata, Yasufumi Hayashi, Teruyuki Kagawa, Nene Otsuka, Fusako Urabe, Sayoko Ishii', null, 'A young-at-heart widower leads an independent life in a quiet fishing town in northern Japan. He eases his loneliness by walking in the snow and studying the growth of fish at a breeding center.', 'A young-at-heart widower leads an independent life in a quiet fishing town in northern Japan. He eases his loneliness by walking in the snow and studying the growth of fish at a breeding center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNwdEoea9PlH7AWNK3YIpTSAuSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47123'),
  ('175041273784391354', 'Man Wanted', 1932, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'William Dieterle, Gregg Toland', null, 'Kay Francis, David Manners, Una Merkel, Andy Devine, Kenneth Thomson, Claire Dodd, Elizabeth Patterson, Bess Flowers', 'NR', 'A female editor of a magazine falls in love with her male secretary.', 'A female editor of a magazine falls in love with her male secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuwSP57lBJTvPg3TCeWYFiaqF52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95724'),
  ('771362914072290115', 'Man with a Gun', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'David Wyles, Jan Kiesser', 'Laurie Finstad-Knizhnik', 'Michael Madsen, Gary Busey, Jennifer Tilly, Robert Loggia, Ian Tracey, Bill Cobbs, Bill Dow, Jason Schombing', null, 'Madsen plays an assassin who''s hired to kill the woman he loves.', 'Madsen plays an assassin who''s hired to kill the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NKgghQgHwoIDrhaCnrCWdRYpI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104619'),
  ('364708944649866460', 'Man with a Movie Camera', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov, Gleb Troyanski, Mikhail Kaufman', 'Dziga Vertov', 'Mikhail Kaufman', null, 'A cameraman wanders around with a camera slung over his shoulder, documenting urban life with dazzling inventiveness.', 'A cameraman wanders around with a camera slung over his shoulder, documenting urban life with dazzling inventiveness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJgAdgJWX54v0oXfIvhwjlZnmgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26317'),
  ('949093766309742442', 'Man With No Name', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Wang Bing', null, null, null, 'The character of this story lives far from the worlds of the material and the spirit. He has built his own subsistence conditions. He often goes to the neighboring villages, although he doesn’t communicate with other people. He collects some waste but doesn’t beg. He prowls about the ruins of deserted villages, as an animal or as a ghost. Under double political and economical pressure, most of people are depriving of their last dignity into a world where it exists a lack of material and spirit. But a human being stays a human being. He is looking for reasons to continue to live. —Wang Bing', 'The character of this story lives far from the worlds of the material and the spirit. He has built his own subsistence conditions. He often goes to the neighboring villages, although he doesn’t communicate with other people. He collects some waste but doesn’t beg. He prowls about the ruins of deserted villages, as an animal or as a ghost. Under double political and economical pressure, most of people are depriving of their last dignity into a world where it exists a lack of material and spirit. But a human being stays a human being. He is looking for reasons to continue to live. —Wang Bing', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6c1QAleTAoJqxafuXOuchsJKwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251037'),
  ('226934654440032573', 'Man with No Past', 2025, 'Action, Drama', 'James Bamford, Frank Meyer', 'Steven Paul', 'Jon Voight, Adam Woodward, Marton Csokas, Charlotte Vega, Philip Winchester, Charlotte Weston, Jeff Alexander, Nathan Cooper', 'R', 'Waking up in an unfamiliar city, a man with no memory must confront the mysteries of his own identity. However, his desperate search to uncover the past pits him against a powerful enemy, leading to a showdown that ultimately reveals the truth.', 'Waking up in an unfamiliar city, a man with no memory must confront the mysteries of his own identity. However, his desperate search to uncover the past pits him against a powerful enemy, leading to a showdown that ultimately reveals the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLkxfnWMeI2cT2iePD0G8E3l1Ov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315986'),
  ('422133736067614340', 'Man with the Gun', 1955, 'Western', 'Lee Garmes, Richard Wilson, Sid Sidman', 'N.B. Stone Jr., Richard Wilson', 'Robert Mitchum, Jan Sterling, Karen Sharpe, Henry Hull, Emile Meyer, John Lupton, Barbara Lawrence, Ted de Corsia', 'NR', 'A stranger comes to town looking for his estranged wife. He finds her running the local girls. He also finds a town and sheriff afraid of their own shadow, scared of a landowner they never see who rules through his rowdy sidekicks. The stranger is a town tamer by trade, and he accepts a $500 commission to sort things out.', 'A stranger comes to town looking for his estranged wife. He finds her running the local girls. He also finds a town and sheriff afraid of their own shadow, scared of a landowner they never see who rules through his rowdy sidekicks. The stranger is a town tamer by trade, and he accepts a $500 commission to sort things out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QTV9kkliG5wrsHj0x6fNYsaQ34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26758'),
  ('359505753231486675', 'Man with the Screaming Brain', 2005, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Worth, Bruce Campbell', 'Bruce Campbell', 'Bruce Campbell, Tamara Gorski, Ted Raimi, Antoinette Byron, Stacy Keach, Vladimir Kolev, Valentin Giasbeily, Velizar Binev', 'NR', 'The brains of a Russian taxi driver and a wealthy businessman are brought together in one body by a mad scientist.', 'The brains of a Russian taxi driver and a wealthy businessman are brought together in one body by a mad scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWmtvO8DTFnD62br6cAJ3ZX76jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2151'),
