  ('536829352576378523', 'Man-Made Monster', 1941, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'George Waggner, Hans J. Salter, Elwood Bredell', 'George Waggner', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Lionel Atwill, Anne Nagel, Frank Albertson, Samuel S. Hinds, William B. Davidson, Ben Taggart, Constance Bergen', null, 'Mad scientist turns a man into an electrically-controlled monster to do his bidding.', 'Mad scientist turns a man into an electrically-controlled monster to do his bidding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t12DDDsHck8dOVQGI1LiMtNQVf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84719'),
  ('980652348414389972', 'Man-Thing', 2005, 'Action, Horror, Adventure, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Steve Arnold, Brett Leonard, John Platt', 'Hans Rodionoff', 'Matthew Le Nevez, Rachael Taylor, Jack Thompson, Rawiri Paratene, Alex O''Loughlin, Steve Bastoni, Robert Mammone, Patrick Thompson', 'R', 'Agents of an oil tycoon vanish while exploring a swamp marked for drilling. The local sheriff investigates and faces a Seminole legend come to life: Man-Thing, a shambling swamp-monster whose touch burns those who feel fear.', 'Agents of an oil tycoon vanish while exploring a swamp marked for drilling. The local sheriff investigates and faces a Seminole legend come to life: Man-Thing, a shambling swamp-monster whose touch burns those who feel fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfPPnOygXSGaBFpsCUyu7xQdkoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18882'),
  ('168850039859395910', 'Man-Trap', 1961, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Loyal Griggs, Edmond O''Brien', 'Ed Waters', 'Jeffrey Hunter, David Janssen, Stella Stevens, Elaine Devry, Virginia Gregg, Dorothy Green, Hugh Sanders, Frank Albertson', 'NR', 'Helmed by Edmond O''Brien, this slick crime thriller stars Jeffrey Hunter as naïve Matt Jameson, whose Korean War pal Vince Biskay talks Matt into helping commandeer nearly $4 million from a Central American dictator. After Vince is wounded in a gun battle as they''re making off with the loot, the duo holes up at Matt''s house -- where his boozy, promiscuous wife puts the moves on Vince.', 'Helmed by Edmond O''Brien, this slick crime thriller stars Jeffrey Hunter as naïve Matt Jameson, whose Korean War pal Vince Biskay talks Matt into helping commandeer nearly $4 million from a Central American dictator. After Vince is wounded in a gun battle as they''re making off with the loot, the duo holes up at Matt''s house -- where his boozy, promiscuous wife puts the moves on Vince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvkHEi9Bw6p1LW3VvxXhQIqUbie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83781'),
  ('276886267939261683', 'Man, Beast and Virtue', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Lucio Fulci, Mario Damicelli', 'Steno, Lucio Fulci, Vitaliano Brancati', 'Totò, Orson Welles, Viviane Romance, Mario Castellani, Rocco D''Assunta, Carlo Delle Piane, Franca Faldini, Clelia Matania', null, 'Paolino, a teacher at an elementary school near Naples, appears nervous for a few days and his friends do not know why. The man is the lover of Assunta, the mother of one of his pupils, and he discovers that she has become pregnant.', 'Paolino, a teacher at an elementary school near Naples, appears nervous for a few days and his friends do not know why. The man is the lover of Assunta, the mother of one of his pupils, and he discovers that she has become pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUQna9G7Pujj40IDNK9NQg7GxC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221832'),
  ('402714946688140836', 'Man, Pride and Vengeance', 1967, 'Drama, Western', 'Luigi Bazzoni', 'Luigi Bazzoni, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Franco Nero, Tina Aumont, Klaus Kinski, Guido Lollobrigida, Franco Ressel, Karl Schönböck, Marcella Valeri, Alberto Dell''Acqua', null, 'A Spanish army officer, Don Jose, stationed in Seville, meets and begins a relationship with a mysterious gypsy, Carmen. After he discovers she has cheated on him with his Lieutenant, he kills the officer and flees the city with Carmen. He recovers from his wounds and is forced to begin the life of a bandit.', 'A Spanish army officer, Don Jose, stationed in Seville, meets and begins a relationship with a mysterious gypsy, Carmen. After he discovers she has cheated on him with his Lieutenant, he kills the officer and flees the city with Carmen. He recovers from his wounds and is forced to begin the life of a bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g83VS0beYQ4QSpkMbGNa1XhnzEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126415'),
  ('991616362856006308', 'Man, Woman and Beast', 1977, 'Drama', 'Alberto Cavallone, Fabio Spaltro', 'Alberto Cavallone', 'Maria Pia Luzi, Martial Boschero, Angela Doria, Macha Magall, Aldo Massasso, Antonio Mea, Stefania Spugnini, Josiane Tanzilli', null, 'A small town in Italy is about to celebrate their patron saint. The city is full of people with different problems. A Communist in existentialist crisis that also must take care of his mentally ill wife. A woman who is tired of her husband''s inability to show emotions and therefore more and more often slips into the world of dreams. A perverse butcher engaged in sex with the meat he sells when he''s not peeping on young girls. A girl who became pregnant after having sex with her father. In this town a mysterious stranger show up and who turns on several of the inhabitants lives.', 'A small town in Italy is about to celebrate their patron saint. The city is full of people with different problems. A Communist in existentialist crisis that also must take care of his mentally ill wife. A woman who is tired of her husband''s inability to show emotions and therefore more and more often slips into the world of dreams. A perverse butcher engaged in sex with the meat he sells when he''s not peeping on young girls. A girl who became pregnant after having sex with her father. In this town a mysterious stranger show up and who turns on several of the inhabitants lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Adewdvw899v8tUHRxx7nZr8iVuy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104320'),
  ('967927247913221898', 'Man''s Best Friend', 1952, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Goofy buys a pet dog (Bowser) and has trouble training it. As Bowser gets bigger, he becomes a larger problem, angering the neighbors. Goofy goes out for the night, and Bowser proves not to be much of a guard dog until Goofy comes home and tries to get in.', 'Goofy buys a pet dog (Bowser) and has trouble training it. As Bowser gets bigger, he becomes a larger problem, angering the neighbors. Goofy goes out for the night, and Bowser proves not to be much of a guard dog until Goofy comes home and tries to get in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ex8jyVgLkdYpQtvtM8QUEJz8tk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66998'),
  ('936307641423881234', 'Man''s Best Friend', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, Comedy', 'John Lafia, Mark Irwin', 'John Lafia', 'Ally Sheedy, Lance Henriksen, Robert Costanzo, Fredric Lehne, John Cassini, J.D. Daniels, William Sanderson, Trula M. Marcus', 'R', 'A genetic research facility worker exposes animal abuses there to a local TV reporter, who frees and takes in a genetically altered dog from the lab, unaware that he has a violent streak.', 'A genetic research facility worker exposes animal abuses there to a local TV reporter, who frees and takes in a genetically altered dog from the lab, unaware that he has a violent streak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRDOrszc2X9bWsE2LhJuJ6WbVEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41759'),
  ('811339378502258318', 'Man''s Castle', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Borzage, Lew Borzage, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Jo Swerling', 'Spencer Tracy, Loretta Young, Marjorie Rambeau, Glenda Farrell, Walter Connolly, Arthur Hohl, Dickie Moore, Harry Akst', 'NR', 'Bill takes Trina into his depression camp cabin. Later, just as he finds showgirl LaRue who will support him, Trina becomes pregnant.', 'Bill takes Trina into his depression camp cabin. Later, just as he finds showgirl LaRue who will support him, Trina becomes pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1FnexSyXDvR7V5ugPXGXve7B8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109886'),
  ('348208137061049933', 'Man''s Favorite Sport?', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Howard Hawks, Tom Connors Jr., Russell Harlan', 'Steve McNeil, John Fenton Murray', 'Rock Hudson, Paula Prentiss, Maria Perschy, John McGiver, Charlene Holt, Roscoe Karns, James Westerfield, Norman Alden', 'NR', 'Roger Willoughby is a renowned fishing expert, who, unbeknownst to his friends, co-workers, or boss, has never cast a line in his life. One day, he crosses paths with Abigail Paige, a sweetly annoying girl who has just badgered his boss into signing Roger up for an annual fishing tournament.', 'Roger Willoughby is a renowned fishing expert, who, unbeknownst to his friends, co-workers, or boss, has never cast a line in his life. One day, he crosses paths with Abigail Paige, a sweetly annoying girl who has just badgered his boss into signing Roger up for an annual fishing tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ku6w1vtaKM0lIR9jz1MupKmzqZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39231'),
  ('70651004444038675', 'Man''s Gentle Love', 2002, 'Drama', 'Jean-Paul Civeyrac, Céline Bozon', 'Jean-Paul Civeyrac', 'Renaud Bécard, Claire Pérot, Marie-Joséphine Crenn, Serge Bozon, Raphaël Bianchin, Marie Rousseau, Odile Vuillemin, Xavier Maly', null, 'This is the story of a young man at the dawn of the 21st century. He belongs to the most vulnerable, most futile and most appealing segment of society. Raoul flits from woman to woman, searching for seemingly unattainable love, until he meets Jeanne, who is fated to live freely and tragically.', 'This is the story of a young man at the dawn of the 21st century. He belongs to the most vulnerable, most futile and most appealing segment of society. Raoul flits from woman to woman, searching for seemingly unattainable love, until he meets Jeanne, who is fated to live freely and tragically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGfes1RUPQM8rMYTo355um2R1bO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134204'),
  ('1076087400746655225', 'Man''s Job', 2007, 'Drama', 'Aleksi Salmenperä, Tuomo Hutri, Tarja Jakunaho', 'Aleksi Salmenperä', 'Tommi Korpela, Maria Heiskanen, Jani Volanen, Stan Saanila, Konsta Pylkkönen, Noora Dadu, Joanna Haartti, Kaarina Hazard', null, 'Juha is 38 years old and has three small children and a depressed wife. He sees himself as strong and believes a man should provide for his family. But one day Juha is fired from his job. Ashamed, he weaves a web of lies to hide the fact from his family. With the help of his friend Olli, Juha begins prostituting himself to support his wife and children. With this he makes in two hours what it took him two days to earn before. The shame and deception mushroom, but the pay from the new profession seems to offset the downside.', 'Juha is 38 years old and has three small children and a depressed wife. He sees himself as strong and believes a man should provide for his family. But one day Juha is fired from his job. Ashamed, he weaves a web of lies to hide the fact from his family. With the help of his friend Olli, Juha begins prostituting himself to support his wife and children. With this he makes in two hours what it took him two days to earn before. The shame and deception mushroom, but the pay from the new profession seems to offset the downside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6GpLrvjBWpdorKnVIo7q6jKVj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20163'),
  ('645933977180473477', 'Mana ShankaraVaraPrasad Garu', 2026, 'Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'Anil Ravipudi, Sameer Reddy', 'Anil Ravipudi, Adhi Narayana, S. Krishna', 'Chiranjeevi, Nayanthara, Venkatesh, Catherine Tresa, Harsha Vardhan, Abhinav Gomatam, Sachin Khedekar, Sharat Saxena', null, 'National security officer Vara Prasad, protecting his estranged wife and kids from a vengeful ex-cop, sees it as a chance to rebuild their relationship after six years apart.', 'National security officer Vara Prasad, protecting his estranged wife and kids from a vengeful ex-cop, sees it as a chance to rebuild their relationship after six years apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfj6SLSzbzHN2633HcqabHFJz5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1439713'),
  ('404553297528231736', 'Management', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Belber, Eric Alan Edwards, Donald Sparks', 'Stephen Belber', 'Jennifer Aniston, Steve Zahn, Woody Harrelson, Fred Ward, Margo Martindale, Kevin Heffernan, James Hiroyuki Liao, Mark Boone Junior', 'R', 'A traveling art saleswoman tries to shake off a flaky motel manager who falls for her and won''t leave her alone.', 'A traveling art saleswoman tries to shake off a flaky motel manager who falls for her and won''t leave her alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roum0tVUqDWRbxBPlvdBzrxjMpK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21583'),
  ('1119886157421099612', 'Manam', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Swaroop Mittapalli, Vikram Kumar, P. S. Vinod', 'Vikram Kumar', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Nageshwara Rao Akkineni, Naga Chaitanya Akkineni, Shriya Saran, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Brahmanandam, Ali Basha, Posani Krishna Murali', null, 'A married couple die in an accident, leaving behind a son. As he grows up and becomes successful, he comes across reincarnations of his father and mother as youngsters, and vows to bring them back together.', 'A married couple die in an accident, leaving behind a son. As he grows up and becomes successful, he comes across reincarnations of his father and mother as youngsters, and vows to bring them back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pas4iupGgxk0UuhiILiWHDSkMBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253533'),
  ('128408128977613703', 'Mañana te cuento', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Eduardo Mendoza de Echave', 'Eduardo Mendoza de Echave', 'Bruno Ascenzo, Jason Day, Oscar Beltrán, José Peláez, Angie Jibaja, Melania Urbina, Milene Vásquez, Sandra Vergara', null, 'On Halloween night in Lima, four rich kids spend a night on the town, goofing, getting into trouble, and deciding to help Manuel lose his virginity. From Juan Diego''s house they hire three call girls, not much older than they, and they pair up (El Gordo declines - he wants to be true to his girlfriend). The young women are sweet and street smart, the boys are naïve and full of bravado, Romance and violence are possibilities during this night of surprises and self discovery', 'On Halloween night in Lima, four rich kids spend a night on the town, goofing, getting into trouble, and deciding to help Manuel lose his virginity. From Juan Diego''s house they hire three call girls, not much older than they, and they pair up (El Gordo declines - he wants to be true to his girlfriend). The young women are sweet and street smart, the boys are naïve and full of bravado, Romance and violence are possibilities during this night of surprises and self discovery', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6NvmnFgDaJYmNBwOru0clZhhV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67084'),
  ('939969991374160408', 'Manaos', 1979, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Alberto Vázquez Figueroa, Kuki López Rodero', 'Juan Antonio Porto, Carlos Vasallo, Alberto Vázquez Figueroa', 'Fabio Testi, Agostina Belli, Florinda Bolkan, Jorge Rivero, Andrés García, Jorge Luke, Alberto de Mendoza, Milton Rodríguez', null, 'At the beginning of this century some owners of rubber plantations in the Amazonas jungle convert a village into one big prison. But the inhabitants have other plans...', 'At the beginning of this century some owners of rubber plantations in the Amazonas jungle convert a village into one big prison. But the inhabitants have other plans...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifihLxvzI0KiOV6ogS8VGdoBtYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134502'),
  ('812041356270481056', 'Manas', 2025, 'Drama', 'Marianna Brennand, Pierre de Kerchove, Anna Luiza Paes de Almeida', 'Felipe Sholl, Marcelo Grabowsky, Marianna Brennand', 'Jamilli Correa, Fátima Macedo, Rômulo Braga, Emily Pantoja, Samira Eloá, Enzo Maia, Gabriel Rodrigues, Ingrid Trigueiro', null, 'Thirteen-year-old Marcielle lives on Marajó Island in the heart of the Amazon rainforest. To break a terrible cycle that imprisons the women around her in an isolated region, she must do the impossible to liberate herself and her younger sister from a dark abyss of silence held by her own family.', 'Thirteen-year-old Marcielle lives on Marajó Island in the heart of the Amazon rainforest. To break a terrible cycle that imprisons the women around her in an isolated region, she must do the impossible to liberate herself and her younger sister from a dark abyss of silence held by her own family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5k3lHTwKPbrJ5xJX6MbALL0Hta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1256408'),
  ('900296653500200508', 'Manatu', 2007, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Drama', 'Edzard Onneken', null, 'Susanna Simon, Markus Knüfken, Pasquale Aleardi, Stefan Miess, Emilia Schüle, Peter Gavajda, Saskia Valencia, Nada Yearwood', null, 'A boarding game comes alive and drags a family into its world', 'A boarding game comes alive and drags a family into its world', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lc3udAugiYQVMo8L7GQ9dTWb8NN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69215'),
  ('146120872183974033', 'Manav Market', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ghulam Haider', 'Ghulam Haider Mansoori', 'Om Tripathi, Neha Lalita Shukla, Baali Kurre', null, 'A woman’s disappearance leads a simple man into the dark underbelly of the medical world. When Kajal vanishes after returning to the city, Ishwar’s search pulls him into a massive hospital where he uncovers brutal scams and the ruthless exploitation of patients. What begins as a personal quest turns into a dangerous battle against a powerful, corrupt healthcare system — and a fight to save both Kajal and countless innocent lives.', 'A woman’s disappearance leads a simple man into the dark underbelly of the medical world. When Kajal vanishes after returning to the city, Ishwar’s search pulls him into a massive hospital where he uncovers brutal scams and the ruthless exploitation of patients. What begins as a personal quest turns into a dangerous battle against a powerful, corrupt healthcare system — and a fight to save both Kajal and countless innocent lives.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fdt8r7LmIGRtoUgrahbcmJkbS0aI.jpg', 'plex:movie:manav-market'),
  ('967787418199534869', 'Manborg', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Steven Kostanski', 'Steven Kostanski, Jeremy Gillespie', 'Meredith Sweeney, Matthew Kennedy, Adam Brooks, Jeremy Gillespie, Kyle Hebert, Stephen Gomori, Ivan Henwood, Andrea Karr', 'NR', 'The evil Count Draculon and his army of demons have conquered Earth, but a young soldier who lost his life in the first war against Hell has reawakened in the future as MANBORG! Together with a crew of post-apocalyptic rebels, the half-man half-machine hero will fight to defeat Draculon and take back the planet!', 'The evil Count Draculon and his army of demons have conquered Earth, but a young soldier who lost his life in the first war against Hell has reawakened in the future as MANBORG! Together with a crew of post-apocalyptic rebels, the half-man half-machine hero will fight to defeat Draculon and take back the planet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IVoSzuN0JefEoTQRvEekKPCsbb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53101'),
  ('1041254264402915568', 'Manchester by the Sea', 2016, 'Drama', 'Tim LaDue, Kenneth Lonergan, Jody Lee Lipes', 'Kenneth Lonergan', 'Casey Affleck, Lucas Hedges, Michelle Williams, Kyle Chandler, C.J. Wilson, Gretchen Mol, Matthew Broderick, Anna Baryshnikov', 'R', 'After his older brother passes away, Lee Chandler is forced to return home to care for his 16-year-old nephew. There he is compelled to deal with a tragic past that separated him from his family and the community where he was born and raised.', 'After his older brother passes away, Lee Chandler is forced to return home to care for his 16-year-old nephew. There he is compelled to deal with a tragic past that separated him from his family and the community where he was born and raised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9VXYOuaJxCEKOxbA86xqtwmqYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334541'),
  ('763500079365094094', 'Manchurian Tiger', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wang Weihua, Jun Geng', 'Jun Geng', 'Guo Yue, Ma Li, Zhang Yu, Liguo Yuan, Xu Gang, Zhang Zhiyong, Zhang Xun, Xue Baohe', null, 'A dark comedy follows a Siberian tiger, a dog, a forklift driver, a middle school teacher, a poet, a debt collector and a pregnant woman. Beneath the absurdities of an owner trying to avenge his dog and his pregnant wife is a story about reality.', 'A dark comedy follows a Siberian tiger, a dog, a forklift driver, a middle school teacher, a poet, a debt collector and a pregnant woman. Beneath the absurdities of an owner trying to avenge his dog and his pregnant wife is a story about reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjoPGIty8Qn7f4tQw0I6KrmPo9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612696'),
  ('923823653028070281', 'Máncora', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ricardo de Montreuil', 'Ricardo de Montreuil, Oscar Orlando Torres', 'Jason Day, Elsa Pataky, Enrique Murciano, Phellipe Haagensen, Liz Gallardo, Andres Arellano, Anahí de Cárdenas, Lucia Ojeda', 'R', 'Following the suicide of his father, haunted by inner demons and his hatred for the world, Santiago decides to escape from Lima and take refuge in Máncora, a beach to the north of Peru where it is always summer.', 'Following the suicide of his father, haunted by inner demons and his hatred for the world, Santiago decides to escape from Lima and take refuge in Máncora, a beach to the north of Peru where it is always summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgBBMJIEiTWDKuYZAqSQl9V5FKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56948'),
  ('1102932983080428642', 'Mandabi', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ousmane Sembène, Paul Soulignac, Babakar Samb', 'Ousmane Sembène', 'Makhouredia Gueye, Younousse Sèye, Isseu Niang, Mustapha Ture, Mouss Diouf, Christoph Colomb, Farba Sarr, Serigne N''Diayes', null, 'A money order from a relative in Paris throws the life of a Senegalese family man out of order. He deals with corruption, greed, problematic family members, the locals and the changing from his traditional way of living to a more modern one.', 'A money order from a relative in Paris throws the life of a Senegalese family man out of order. He deals with corruption, greed, problematic family members, the locals and the changing from his traditional way of living to a more modern one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8L5GJMgWUfyuIwtKSvoa7Ovejk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99329'),
  ('366138573925644868', 'Mandala', 1971, 'Drama', 'Akio Jissoji, Shizuo Satô, Kenji Shimomura', 'Toshirō Ishidō', 'Shin Kishida, Kōji Shimizu, Hiroko Sakurai, Ryo Tamura, Akiko Mori, Daigo Kusano, Mihiro Wakabayashi, Maya Kitajima', null, 'Two university students from Kyoto decide to swap partners and spend the night in an isolated motel. However, one of the couples is attacked. Desperate for answers, they search for the attackers and come across a cult that promotes sexual freedom.', 'Two university students from Kyoto decide to swap partners and spend the night in an isolated motel. However, one of the couples is attacked. Desperate for answers, they search for the attackers and come across a cult that promotes sexual freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLEOrtYmpgK1VEX8KrKY0FJHvAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104543'),
  ('819724399769670530', 'Mandala', 1981, 'Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Cha Jung-nam, Jung Il-sung', 'Song Gil-han, Lee Sang-hyon', 'Jeon Moo-song, Ahn Sung-ki, Gi Jeong-su, Bang Hee, Yoon Yang-ha, Park Jeong-ja, Park Am, Michelle Okkyung Lee', null, 'A story that follows the lives and interactions of two Buddhist monks living in South Korea.', 'A story that follows the lives and interactions of two Buddhist monks living in South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QuWSgZaDULrGdksIW5imbQyxoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255982'),
  ('219967281486258125', 'Mandalay', 1934, 'Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Frank Shaw, Tony Gaudio', 'Austin Parker, Charles Kenyon', 'Kay Francis, Ricardo Cortez, Warner Oland, Lyle Talbot, Ruth Donnelly, Lucien Littlefield, Reginald Owen, Etienne Girardot', 'NR', 'Abandoned by her lover, a woman becomes the main "hostess" in a decadent nightclub, but tries to put her past behind her on a steamer to Mandalay.', 'Abandoned by her lover, a woman becomes the main "hostess" in a decadent nightclub, but tries to put her past behind her on a steamer to Mandalay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKUlxknCrMUOeRPL1GTvIqeOtjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178341'),
  ('542550052390266514', 'Mandela', 1996, 'Documentary, History', 'Angus Gibson, Jo Menell, Dewald Aukema', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Nelson Mandela, Winnie Mandela, F.W. de Klerk, Eugène Terre''Blanche', null, 'A documentary that chronicles the life of South African leader Nelson Mandela. Mandela is probably best known for his 27 years of imprisonment, and for bringing an end to apartheid. But this film also sheds light on the little-known early period of Mandela''s life.', 'A documentary that chronicles the life of South African leader Nelson Mandela. Mandela is probably best known for his 27 years of imprisonment, and for bringing an end to apartheid. But this film also sheds light on the little-known early period of Mandela''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ERPaGF48gs94TE58AfMWGfNwJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57016'),
  ('489625115009960638', 'Mandela', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Madonne Ashwin, Vidhu Ayanna', 'Madonne Ashwin', 'Yogi Babu, G. M. Sundar, Kanna Ravi, Sangili Murugan, Sheela Rajkumar, Arumugam Bala, Prasanna Balachandran, George Mariyan', null, 'An underprivileged hairdresser becomes the game changer in a local body election in a village where caste politics rules the roost. Will he be able to bring some changes to people''s lives?', 'An underprivileged hairdresser becomes the game changer in a local body election in a village where caste politics rules the roost. Will he be able to bring some changes to people''s lives?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9A7nv8ac8VrXDt6tgu4UXi2zAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806067'),
  ('49365423275459179', 'Mandela: Long Walk to Freedom', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Justin Chadwick, Lol Crawley', 'William Nicholson', 'Idris Elba, Naomie Harris, Tony Kgoroge, Riaad Moosa, Fana Mokoena, Robert Hobbs, Jamie Bartlett, Lindiwe Matshikiza', 'PG-13', 'A chronicle of Nelson Mandela''s life journey from his childhood in a rural village through to his inauguration as the first democratically elected president of South Africa.', 'A chronicle of Nelson Mandela''s life journey from his childhood in a rural village through to his inauguration as the first democratically elected president of South Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzjwDSwLbalv7bCXnFbkAuIxXLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192136'),
  ('388069925667058901', 'Manderlay', 2005, 'Drama', 'Anthony Dod Mantle, Lars von Trier, Anthony Wilcox', 'Lars von Trier', 'Bryce Dallas Howard, Isaach de Bankolé, Danny Glover, Willem Dafoe, Michaël Abiteboul, Lauren Bacall, Jean-Marc Barr, Geoffrey Bateman', 'NR', 'In 1933, a young woman and her father discover an Alabama plantation whose inhabitants live as if slavery had never been abolished. Feeling a sense of duty to those behind the heavy gates, she stays to liberate the people and see them through their first harvest. With four of her father''s colleagues and a lawyer, she faces the daunting task of resurrecting the place known as Manderlay.', 'In 1933, a young woman and her father discover an Alabama plantation whose inhabitants live as if slavery had never been abolished. Feeling a sense of duty to those behind the heavy gates, she stays to liberate the people and see them through their first harvest. With four of her father''s colleagues and a lawyer, she faces the daunting task of resurrecting the place known as Manderlay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HYoHEcLNgETHlJDyQrC4Y7e01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1951'),
  ('262103656425074102', 'Mandibles', 2021, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux, Marine Albert', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, Adèle Exarchopoulos, India Hair, Bruno Lochet, Coralie Russier, Roméo Elvis, Thomas Blanchard', null, 'When two simple-minded best friends find a giant fly trapped in the trunk of a stolen car, they decide to train it in hopes of striking it rich.', 'When two simple-minded best friends find a giant fly trapped in the trunk of a stolen car, they decide to train it in hopes of striking it rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdizbiLiOiV8ysYknz79VMitsfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638965'),
  ('780716446550036080', 'Mandinga', 1976, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Mario Pinzauti', 'Tecla Romanelli', 'Antonio Gismondo, Serafino Profumo, Maria Rosaria Riuzzi, Paola D''Egidio, Cesare Di Vito, Jacqueline Luce, Monica Nickel, Arnold Grostram', null, 'Not America, nor Africa, but the Lazio countryside provides the backdrop for this intricate story of death and more or less incestuous love affairs, inspired by the successful American film Mandingo.', 'Not America, nor Africa, but the Lazio countryside provides the backdrop for this intricate story of death and more or less incestuous love affairs, inspired by the successful American film Mandingo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvpUeD1hZAP54pqOfEMJOUNROIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91473'),
  ('641675600680130174', 'Mandingo', 1975, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Richard Fleischer, Frederic W. Brost, Gary Daigler', 'Jack Kirkland', 'Perry King, James Mason, Susan George, Ken Norton, Richard Ward, Brenda Sykes, Lillian Hayman, Roy Poole', 'R', 'Warren Maxwell, the owner of a run-down plantation, pressures his son, Hammond, to marry and produce an heir to inherit the plantation. Hammond settles on his own cousin, Blanche, but purchases a sex slave when he returns from the honeymoon. He also buys his father a new Mandingo slave named Mede to breed and train as a prize-fighter.', 'Warren Maxwell, the owner of a run-down plantation, pressures his son, Hammond, to marry and produce an heir to inherit the plantation. Hammond settles on his own cousin, Blanche, but purchases a sex slave when he returns from the honeymoon. He also buys his father a new Mandingo slave named Mede to breed and train as a prize-fighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZXmb4HQt24OAzdKoBdSEqcFvBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38027'),
  ('570250219835719249', 'Mandioca Frita', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Gui Campos, Leo Bello, David Alves Mattos, Natália Duarte, Gabriela Santelli, Larissa Rolim', 'Gui Campos, Renata Diniz, Davi Mattos', 'Murilo Grossi, Rômulo Braga, Isabella Baroz, Márcia Duarte, André Araújo', null, 'Mandioca Frita (2026) released on February 9, 2026 starring Murilo Grossi, Rômulo Braga, Isabella Baroz and directed by Gui Campos. Get notified when Mandioca Frita is available to stream!', 'Mandioca Frita (2026) released on February 9, 2026 starring Murilo Grossi, Rômulo Braga, Isabella Baroz and directed by Gui Campos. Get notified when Mandioca Frita is available to stream!', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FniDeR6vC7mQka0rHzfNmKn8EmPk.jpg', 'plex:movie:mandioca-frita-2026'),
  ('304786772146753396', 'Mandıra Filozofu', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı', 'Birol Güven', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı, Rasim Öztekin, Ayda Aksel, Eser Eyüboğlu, Begüm Öner, Ahu Sungur, Hakan Bulut, Kemal Kuruçay', null, 'Mustafaali, as a person who left the modern life behind him and lives in Cokertme Village, spends his days by reading books. Mustafaali, a person who is against working, satisfies all his vital needs from the blessing of nature. Cavit, on the other hand, is a rich businessman who lives in Istanbul. He has worked in his entire life and all he matters is to work, to earn and to make savings. Cavit''s life becomes upside down after he met Mustafaali when he wants to buy Mustafaali''s land to build a boutique hotel in Cokertme Bay. Living far from the modern life in his small land under the natural circumstances, Mustafaali''s philosophy confuses Cavit who is a person from a big city.', 'Mustafaali, as a person who left the modern life behind him and lives in Cokertme Village, spends his days by reading books. Mustafaali, a person who is against working, satisfies all his vital needs from the blessing of nature. Cavit, on the other hand, is a rich businessman who lives in Istanbul. He has worked in his entire life and all he matters is to work, to earn and to make savings. Cavit''s life becomes upside down after he met Mustafaali when he wants to buy Mustafaali''s land to build a boutique hotel in Cokertme Bay. Living far from the modern life in his small land under the natural circumstances, Mustafaali''s philosophy confuses Cavit who is a person from a big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYWGNOoQi6DD8PEVQB8QDO2ER7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297298'),
  ('369873741868147643', 'Mandıra Filozofu: İstanbul', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı', 'Birol Güven', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı, Kemal Kuruçay, Gülnihal Demir, Abdullah Şahin, Zinaida Chistol, Uğur Alibaşoğlu, Alper Düzen, Nihan Durukan', null, 'Mustafali is a man liberated from all ambitions, living in Çökertme Cove, keeping to his own life style. But due to the sickness of his father, who had left him and his mother years ago, he had to come to Istanbul. Mustafali''s philosophy will perplex Istanbul, a city that had been living happily with its own truths before Mustafali came along.', 'Mustafali is a man liberated from all ambitions, living in Çökertme Cove, keeping to his own life style. But due to the sickness of his father, who had left him and his mother years ago, he had to come to Istanbul. Mustafali''s philosophy will perplex Istanbul, a city that had been living happily with its own truths before Mustafali came along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yznUWtDszMkvDTeUg7QKuRMcmjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343739'),
  ('712440740774796857', 'Mandragora', 1997, 'Drama', 'Wiktor Grodecki, Vladimír Holomek, Petr Samec', 'David Švec, Wiktor Grodecki', 'Miroslav Čáslavka, David Švec, Pavel Skřípal, Kostas Zerdaloglu, Miroslav Breu, Jiří Kodeš, Karel Polišenský, Richard Toth', null, 'Marek is a 15-year-old from a provincial village who runs away to Prague when he begins to fail at school. He is mugged shortly after arriving in the city and is rescued by Honza with the promise of work. Marek is taken to an apartment, drugged, and becomes a male prostitute. He is a bit smarter than his colleagues and teams up with a friend, David, in order to go after bigger scores – to cash in and get out. They manage to stash away a bit of money, but when it comes time to return home, Marek loses his nerve and is soon back in the city.', 'Marek is a 15-year-old from a provincial village who runs away to Prague when he begins to fail at school. He is mugged shortly after arriving in the city and is rescued by Honza with the promise of work. Marek is taken to an apartment, drugged, and becomes a male prostitute. He is a bit smarter than his colleagues and teams up with a friend, David, in order to go after bigger scores – to cash in and get out. They manage to stash away a bit of money, but when it comes time to return home, Marek loses his nerve and is soon back in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlN6RBc5Xj4cVqKLTxl9LJp5MFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41914'),
  ('524372798171024963', 'Mandrake', 2022, 'Horror', 'Lynne Davison', 'Matt Harvey', 'Deirdre Mullins, Derbhle Crotty, Paul Kennedy, Seamus O''Hara, Nigel O''Neill, Ian Beattie, Jude Hill, Paul Mallon', null, 'A probation officer, Cathy Madden, is tasked with rehabilitating a notorious killer named ''Bloody'' Mary Laidlaw back into society following a two-decade sentence.', 'A probation officer, Cathy Madden, is tasked with rehabilitating a notorious killer named ''Bloody'' Mary Laidlaw back into society following a two-decade sentence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZiXgVXQG5YJBy5ReWcy875g7Un.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:898798'),
  ('283532177507858801', 'Mandrill', 2009, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza, Nicolás Ibieta, Rosario Onetto', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza', 'Marko Zaror, Celine Reymond, Alejandro Castillo, Luis Alarcón, Augusto Schuster, Francisco Jovanni Guerrero, Juan Pablo Aliaga, Miguel Ángel de Luca', 'R', 'Mandrill is a high-level assassin whose parents many years ago were slaughtered in cold blood by a ruthless drug lord. Now he finds himself finally in a position to get his revenge. But since it falls in love precisely in the pretty daughter of the ruthless killer. Mandrill now faces the most serious decision of his life ...', 'Mandrill is a high-level assassin whose parents many years ago were slaughtered in cold blood by a ruthless drug lord. Now he finds himself finally in a position to get his revenge. But since it falls in love precisely in the pretty daughter of the ruthless killer. Mandrill now faces the most serious decision of his life ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WeUeJeFmdXvQEjN8OS3g2GQJWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82393'),
  ('861303924997123101', 'Mandroid', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Jack Ersgard, Vlad Păunescu', 'Earl Kenton, Jackson Barr, C. Courtney Joyner', 'Mircea Albulescu, Radu Minculescu, Jane Caldwell, Michael Della Femina, Robert Symonds, Curt Lowens, Patrik Ersgård, Ion Haiduc', 'R', 'In his hidden laboratory deep in Russia, Dr. Karl Zimmer has invented the Mandroid, a humanoid robot which follows the motions of a man in a special control suit. He has offered the invention to the USA, who have sent Smith and Wait from the CIA for inspection. However Zimmer''s partner Drago has different plans, wants to sell Mandroid to the military. The night he tries to steal Mandroid, he becomes exposed to the highly toxic Superconn. But he can flee and won''t give up on Mandroid, even though he''s terribly disfigured.', 'In his hidden laboratory deep in Russia, Dr. Karl Zimmer has invented the Mandroid, a humanoid robot which follows the motions of a man in a special control suit. He has offered the invention to the USA, who have sent Smith and Wait from the CIA for inspection. However Zimmer''s partner Drago has different plans, wants to sell Mandroid to the military. The night he tries to steal Mandroid, he becomes exposed to the highly toxic Superconn. But he can flee and won''t give up on Mandroid, even though he''s terribly disfigured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKl160QDXGP0uvwTSQGo12uaxCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57845'),
  ('210992642700199300', 'Mandy', 1952, 'Drama', 'Alexander Mackendrick, Douglas Slocombe', 'Nigel Balchin', 'Phyllis Calvert, Jack Hawkins, Terence Morgan, Godfrey Tearle, Mandy Miller, Marjorie Fielding, Nancy Price, Edward Chapman', null, 'London, the early 1950s. Born deaf, Mandy is mute for most of her childhood. As she reaches school age her family itself is in danger of breaking up. Christine, Mandy''s mother, has heard of a residential school for the oral education of the deaf.', 'London, the early 1950s. Born deaf, Mandy is mute for most of her childhood. As she reaches school age her family itself is in danger of breaking up. Christine, Mandy''s mother, has heard of a residential school for the oral education of the deaf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bwWXoxCjCUDJN6hKPCtUWUzPux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47026'),
  ('662221173169432386', 'Mandy', 2018, 'Fantasy, Action, Horror', 'Baudouin du Bois, Vincent Ridelle, Panos Cosmatos', 'Casper Kelly', 'Nicolas Cage, Andrea Riseborough, Linus Roache, Ned Dennehy, Olwen Fouéré, Richard Brake, Bill Duke, Line Pillet', 'NR', 'The Shadow Mountains, 1983. Red and Mandy lead a loving and peaceful existence; but when their pine-scented haven is savagely destroyed, Red is catapulted into a phantasmagoric journey filled with bloody vengeance and laced with fire.', 'The Shadow Mountains, 1983. Red and Mandy lead a loving and peaceful existence; but when their pine-scented haven is savagely destroyed, Red is catapulted into a phantasmagoric journey filled with bloody vengeance and laced with fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0yf7J7HsKeK6E81SMRcX8vx6mH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460885'),
  ('916958023724315002', 'Maneater', 2007, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Gary Yates, Peter Benison', 'Philip Morton', 'Gary Busey, Ian D. Clark, Ty Wood, Diana Reis, Kathryn Albertson, Jessica Burleson, Sarah Constible, Kristen Harris', null, 'When a dismembered body is found in the Appalachian Mountains, a county Sheriff is shocked to discover that the predator is a six-hundred pound Bengal tiger.', 'When a dismembered body is found in the Appalachian Mountains, a county Sheriff is shocked to discover that the predator is a six-hundred pound Bengal tiger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMVx3okb05J3CxCRGx8IY9QiDlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30938'),
  ('815873513613630455', 'Maneater', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Justin Lee', 'Justin Lee', 'Nicky Whelan, Trace Adkins, Jeff Fahey, Shane West, Branscombe Richmond, Porscha Coleman, Kim DeLonghi, Zoe Cipres', 'R', 'A group of friends on vacation in a seeming island paradise are stalked by an unrelenting great white after an accident leaves them stranded and left for dead.', 'A group of friends on vacation in a seeming island paradise are stalked by an unrelenting great white after an accident leaves them stranded and left for dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwf3DGuWB1AptvIzHhlGxDUNnQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982620'),
  ('321622279323819300', 'Manfish', 1956, 'Adventure', 'W. Lee Wilder, Scotty Welbourne', null, 'John Bromfield, Lon Chaney Jr., Victor Jory, Barbara Nichols, Tessa Prendergast, Eric Coverly, Vincent Chang, Theodore Purcell', null, 'Three deep sea divers get involved in murder while searching for a lost treasure.', 'Three deep sea divers get involved in murder while searching for a lost treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLBsWnUuLvVogRAOu5j2rXgq2fG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144154'),
  ('550687591269176739', 'Mangal Pandey - The Rising', 2005, 'Drama, History', 'Ketan Mehta, Arjun Mathur, Himman Dhamija', 'Farrukh Dhondy', 'Aamir Khan, Rani Mukerji, Toby Stephens, Ameesha Patel, Om Puri, Kirron Kher, Ben Nealon, Habib Tanvir', null, 'The film begins in 1857, when India was ruled by the British East India Company. Mangal Pandey is a sepoy, a soldier of Indian origin, in the army of the East India Company. Pandey is fighting in the Anglo-Afghan Wars and saves the life of his British commanding officer, William Gordon. Gordon is indebted to Pandey and a strong friendship develops between them, transcending both rank and race.', 'The film begins in 1857, when India was ruled by the British East India Company. Mangal Pandey is a sepoy, a soldier of Indian origin, in the army of the East India Company. Pandey is fighting in the Anglo-Afghan Wars and saves the life of his British commanding officer, William Gordon. Gordon is indebted to Pandey and a strong friendship develops between them, transcending both rank and race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lX7chVhAYk17doTX0SOlbLH1HW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20496'),
  ('574775203291354317', 'Manglehorn', 2015, 'Drama', 'David Gordon Green, Tim Orr, Max Sturgeon', 'Paul Logan', 'Al Pacino, Holly Hunter, Harmony Korine, Chris Messina, Natalie Makenna, June Griffin Garcia, Edrick Browne, Skylar Gasper', 'PG-13', 'AJ Manglehorn is an aging, ordinary guy in a small town. He nurses his sick cat, squeezes out a conversation with the local bank teller every Friday, and eats at the same place every day. But there is more to Manglehorn than meets the eye: he’s an ex-con who, 40 years ago, gave up the woman of his dreams for a big ‘job’. After a dramatic effort to start over, Manglehorn faces a terrifying moment and is unmasked as a guy with a very, very dark past.', 'AJ Manglehorn is an aging, ordinary guy in a small town. He nurses his sick cat, squeezes out a conversation with the local bank teller every Friday, and eats at the same place every day. But there is more to Manglehorn than meets the eye: he’s an ex-con who, 40 years ago, gave up the woman of his dreams for a big ‘job’. After a dramatic effort to start over, Manglehorn faces a terrifying moment and is unmasked as a guy with a very, very dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms27YhpvgE5b0JIwaNiWw6EDC8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254905'),
  ('532235536595265912', 'Mango', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mehdi Avaz', 'Milad Avaz', 'Josephine Park, Dar Salim, Josephine Chavarria Højbjerg, Paprika Steen, Anders W. Berthelsen, Sara Jiménez, Sebastian Jessen, Lise Baastrup', null, 'An ambitious hotelier and her reluctant daughter take a trip to Málaga, where they find what they''ve been craving in a farmer''s idyllic mango orchard.', 'An ambitious hotelier and her reluctant daughter take a trip to Málaga, where they find what they''ve been craving in a farmer''s idyllic mango orchard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aTla8ofmtJdfhInKyLTyZifA3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426792'),
  ('346230879800844449', 'Mango Yellow', 2002, 'Drama', 'Cláudio Assis, Tiago Delácio, Dedete Parente Costa', 'Hilton Lacerda', 'Matheus Nachtergaele, Jonas Bloch, Dira Paes, Chico Diaz, Leona Cavalli, Conceição Camaroti, Cosme Soares, Everaldo Pontes', null, 'The lives of a macho butcher, his wife, a lonely waitress, a sadist and a flophouse manager intersect in Recife, Brazil.', 'The lives of a macho butcher, his wife, a lonely waitress, a sadist and a flophouse manager intersect in Recife, Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPpO7RQQQ9pHGowyhLdyX0Koeoh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80426'),
  ('1135791265725725729', 'Manhandled', 1924, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Allan Dwan, Harold Rosson', 'Julian Johnson', 'Gloria Swanson, Tom Moore, Lilyan Tashman, Ian Keith, Arthur Housman, Paul McAllister, Frank Morgan, Pierre Collosse', 'NR', 'A comedy which concerns the struggles of an ambitious department store sales clerk who is caught up in New York high society.', 'A comedy which concerns the struggles of an ambitious department store sales clerk who is caught up in New York high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfZWy613rhGyl9je9kgJplOQVqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176283'),
  ('960518370605283949', 'Manhandled', 1949, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ernest Laszlo, Lewis R. Foster', 'Whitman Chambers, Lewis R. Foster', 'Dorothy Lamour, Sterling Hayden, Dan Duryea, Irene Hervey, Phillip Reed, Harold Vermilyea, Alan Napier, Art Smith', 'NR', 'Merle Kramer works as a stenographer for a psychiatrist. She is casually dating Karl Benson, a private eye and former cop. Merle mentions in passing that one of her boss''s patients is an author with recurring dreams of murdering his wife, and she includes the fact that the wife owns valuable jewels. When the wife is found murdered in a manner identical to that of her husband''s dream, the husband is naturally the prime suspect. But as the investigation of the police and insurance investigator Joe Cooper proceeds, it turns out that several people in the case, including Merle, are not what they seem.', 'Merle Kramer works as a stenographer for a psychiatrist. She is casually dating Karl Benson, a private eye and former cop. Merle mentions in passing that one of her boss''s patients is an author with recurring dreams of murdering his wife, and she includes the fact that the wife owns valuable jewels. When the wife is found murdered in a manner identical to that of her husband''s dream, the husband is naturally the prime suspect. But as the investigation of the police and insurance investigator Joe Cooper proceeds, it turns out that several people in the case, including Merle, are not what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9mYnW3zhuRrb5iFZXJnwGerYqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36461'),
  ('906875555875841879', 'Manhatta', 1921, 'Documentary', 'Charles Sheeler, Paul Strand, Paul Strand', null, null, null, 'Morning reveals New York harbor, the wharves, the Brooklyn Bridge. A ferry boat docks, disgorging its huddled mass. People move briskly along Wall St. or stroll more languorously through a cemetery. Ranks of skyscrapers extrude columns of smoke and steam. In plain view. Or framed, as through a balustrade. A crane promotes the city''s upward progress, as an ironworker balances on a high beam. A locomotive in a railway yard prepares to depart, while an arriving ocean liner jostles with attentive tugboats. Fading sunlight is reflected in the waters of the harbor. The imagery is interspersed with quotations from Walt Whitman, who is left unnamed.', 'Morning reveals New York harbor, the wharves, the Brooklyn Bridge. A ferry boat docks, disgorging its huddled mass. People move briskly along Wall St. or stroll more languorously through a cemetery. Ranks of skyscrapers extrude columns of smoke and steam. In plain view. Or framed, as through a balustrade. A crane promotes the city''s upward progress, as an ironworker balances on a high beam. A locomotive in a railway yard prepares to depart, while an arriving ocean liner jostles with attentive tugboats. Fading sunlight is reflected in the waters of the harbor. The imagery is interspersed with quotations from Walt Whitman, who is left unnamed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scVpkeRVTp1xcwG5mHZeB4Euain.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96948'),
  ('407745207888252774', 'Manhattan Baby', 1982, 'Horror', 'Lucio Fulci, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Elisa Briganti, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Christopher Connelly, Laura Lenzi, Brigitta Boccoli, Giovanni Frezza, Cinzia de Ponti, Cosimo Cinieri, Andrea Bosic, Carlo De Mejo', null, 'An archaeologist opens an Egyptian tomb and accidently releases an evil spirit. His young daughter becomes possessed by the freed entity and, upon their arrival back in New York, the gory murders begin.', 'An archaeologist opens an Egyptian tomb and accidently releases an evil spirit. His young daughter becomes possessed by the freed entity and, upon their arrival back in New York, the gory murders begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHqAB06ofzOisT0kRRfiSeHdnHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30875'),
