  ('1088181624074958296', 'Manhattan Melodrama', 1934, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Douglas Shearer, James Wong Howe', 'Oliver H.P. Garrett, Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Frank Dolan', 'Clark Gable, William Powell, Myrna Loy, Leo Carrillo, Nat Pendleton, George Sidney, Isabel Jewell, Muriel Evans', 'NR', 'The friendship between two orphans endures even though they grow up on opposite sides of the law and fall in love with the same woman.', 'The friendship between two orphans endures even though they grow up on opposite sides of the law and fall in love with the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAuBeXANJ0NhlQY7kmas63dFMz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28564'),
  ('396645374892242967', 'Manhattan Murder Mystery', 1993, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Woody Allen, Carlo Di Palma, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Woody Allen, Marshall Brickman', 'Woody Allen, Diane Keaton, Jerry Adler, Alan Alda, Anjelica Huston, Lynn Cohen, Melanie Norris, Zach Braff', 'PG', 'A middle-aged couple suspects foul play when their neighbor''s wife suddenly drops dead.', 'A middle-aged couple suspects foul play when their neighbor''s wife suddenly drops dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrzBIlMyAP7Ac9W5qAy5ssAUdK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10440'),
  ('987857001845799540', 'Manhattan Night', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Brian DeCubellis, Brendan Butler, David Tumblety', 'Brian DeCubellis', 'Adrien Brody, Yvonne Strahovski, Campbell Scott, Jennifer Beals, Steven Berkoff, Linda Lavin, Kevin Breznahan, Thomas Bair', 'R', 'Porter Wren is a Manhattan tabloid writer with an appetite for scandal. On the beat he sells murder, tragedy, and anything that passes for the truth. At home, he is a dedicated husband and father. But when Caroline, a seductive stranger asks him to dig into the unsolved murder of her filmmaker husband Simon, he is drawn into a very nasty case of sexual obsession and blackmail--one that threatens his job, his marriage, and his life.', 'Porter Wren is a Manhattan tabloid writer with an appetite for scandal. On the beat he sells murder, tragedy, and anything that passes for the truth. At home, he is a dedicated husband and father. But when Caroline, a seductive stranger asks him to dig into the unsolved murder of her filmmaker husband Simon, he is drawn into a very nasty case of sexual obsession and blackmail--one that threatens his job, his marriage, and his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d40J0y6Ha1eakPrmfyEHoKFQrSB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311667'),
  ('372002040476816879', 'Manhole', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Shin Jae-Young, Song Hyun-suk, Cho Young-chun', null, 'Jung Yu-mi, Kim Sae-ron, Jung Kyung-ho, Choi Deok-moon, Jo Dal-hwan, Lee Young-yoo, Yoon Chan-young, Kim Bin-woo', null, 'A young girl is kidnapped by a serial killer. The serial killer uses manholes to kidnap and kill his victims. The young girl''s older sister tries to save her before it''s too late.', 'A young girl is kidnapped by a serial killer. The serial killer uses manholes to kidnap and kill his victims. The young girl''s older sister tries to save her before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1mDaWeB9Z1h8KsUUji7CR02yik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273645'),
  ('222109363086215066', 'Manhunt', 1976, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Junya Satō, Setsuo Kobayashi', 'Kei Tasaka', 'Ken Takakura, Ryoko Nakano, Yoshio Harada, Ryō Ikebe, Hideji Ōtaki, Taketoshi Naitō, Kō Nishimura, Mitsuko Baisho', null, 'A tough prosecutor is falsely accused of theft and goes on the run to clear his name. He is assisted by the beautiful daughter of a rich man.', 'A tough prosecutor is falsely accused of theft and goes on the run to clear his name. He is assisted by the beautiful daughter of a rich man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYWmNHIJ1fT6EDmcOnE0IxNlpBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69846'),
  ('524851631051726569', 'Manhunt', 2008, 'Horror', 'Patrik Syversen, Håvard Andrè Byrkjeland', 'Nini Bull Robsahm, Patrik Syversen', 'Henriette Bruusgaard, Jørn Bjørn Fuller Gee, Lasse Valdal, Nini Bull Robsahm, Janne Beate Bønes, Trym Hagen, Martin Slaatto, Kristofer Hivju', null, 'Its the summer of 1974. Four friends have planned a recreational weekend hiking and camping in the forest. At a remote truck stop they pick up an anxious hitchhiker who only after a short ride demands they stop the vehicle. She is clearly frightened of somethingbut what she cant begin to describe in her carsick terror. Suddenly the group are ambushed and left unconscious.', 'Its the summer of 1974. Four friends have planned a recreational weekend hiking and camping in the forest. At a remote truck stop they pick up an anxious hitchhiker who only after a short ride demands they stop the vehicle. She is clearly frightened of somethingbut what she cant begin to describe in her carsick terror. Suddenly the group are ambushed and left unconscious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lldkGJ70mspipKkhiS2GV8tvYmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11927'),
  ('829293444589768035', 'Manhunt', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Adventure', 'John Woo, Takuro Ishizaka, Kensuke Sonomura', 'John Woo, Lip Wang-Fung, Gordon Chan', 'Zhang Hanyu, Masaharu Fukuyama, Ha Ji-won, Qi Wei, Jun Kunimura, Angeles Woo, Yasuaki Kurata, Naoto Takenaka', null, 'Accused of a murder he didn''t commit, a prosecutor sets out on a mission to clear his name.', 'Accused of a murder he didn''t commit, a prosecutor sets out on a mission to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9ZhBbnB1tSl8NODYciAJHHgZgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372782'),
