  ('665480066545635886', 'Manhunt in the City', 1975, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Umberto Lenzi, Alessandro Metz, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Umberto Lenzi', 'Henry Silva, Luciana Paluzzi, Silvano Tranquilli, Susanna Melandri, Alberto Tarallo, Claudio Gora, Claudio Nicastro, Luciano Catenacci', null, 'A man''s daughter is killed by thieves during a bank robbery. Due to the incompetence of the corrupt authorities, he decides to take to law into his own hands and track down the killers.', 'A man''s daughter is killed by thieves during a bank robbery. Due to the incompetence of the corrupt authorities, he decides to take to law into his own hands and track down the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcAD7Ga5lR6OTeRgTDJpKwLU1UE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105859'),
  ('988590785942682282', 'Manhunt: Escape to the Carpathians', 2016, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Dominik Graf, Alexander Fischerkoesen', 'Rolf Basedow', 'Ulrike C. Tscharre, Ronald Zehrfeld, Arved Birnbaum, Dragoș Bucur, Rainer Laupichler, Leni Adams, Axel Moustache, Eugen Pirvu', null, 'A breathless criminal hunt, which leads into the remote mountain world of Romania, with the portrait of a foreign country, which has remained standing in time. Hanna Landauer and Sven Schröder are part of a special unit of the LKA, which traps fugitives across the borders to the remotest corners of the world.', 'A breathless criminal hunt, which leads into the remote mountain world of Romania, with the portrait of a foreign country, which has remained standing in time. Hanna Landauer and Sven Schröder are part of a special unit of the LKA, which traps fugitives across the borders to the remotest corners of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0p5YYiNCikm7uIdQ0yuK1Hh0wU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351398'),
  ('943869975564878977', 'Manhunter', 1986, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Mann, Dante Spinotti, Charles E. McCarry', 'Michael Mann', 'William Petersen, Tom Noonan, Dennis Farina, Brian Cox, Kim Greist, Joan Allen, Stephen Lang, David Seaman', 'R', 'FBI Agent Will Graham, who retired after catching Hannibal Lecktor, returns to duty to engage in a risky cat-and-mouse game with Lecktor to capture a new killer.', 'FBI Agent Will Graham, who retired after catching Hannibal Lecktor, returns to duty to engage in a risky cat-and-mouse game with Lecktor to capture a new killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rb24x39vV8n5301IelC8rCPJTH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11454'),
  ('800246555560668125', 'Mania', 1974, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Renato Polselli, Claudio Fragasso', 'Renato Polselli', 'Brad Euston, Ivana Giordan, Isarco Ravaioli, Mirella Rossi, Eva Spadaro, Max Dorian, Filomena Desiato, Carla Mancini', null, 'Professor Brecht, a renowned scientist, is obsessively experimenting in his isolated villa. The object of his studies is "apparent death", with the intention that the human body in a cataleptic state can be cured more easily. He lives with his wife Lisa and several other people: his twin brother Germano; Katia, the waitress; Lailo, his assistant and young student Erina. Having discovered his brother''s affair with Lisa, Brecht sets up a plan to kill Germano and take his place. The shock makes Erina dumb. Bercht''s persecution of Lisa soon turns the woman mad, while Lailo, wandering in the villa''s surroundings, vainly tries to find the key to the mystery. A psychiatrist, Louis, firmly believes Lailo''s madness is caused by her inner anguish and seems confident in her recovery. But he''s wrong: the demented woman kills Katia and then throws herself out of a window. Brecht takes back his own identity, but his actions will have further tragic consequences...', 'Professor Brecht, a renowned scientist, is obsessively experimenting in his isolated villa. The object of his studies is "apparent death", with the intention that the human body in a cataleptic state can be cured more easily. He lives with his wife Lisa and several other people: his twin brother Germano; Katia, the waitress; Lailo, his assistant and young student Erina. Having discovered his brother''s affair with Lisa, Brecht sets up a plan to kill Germano and take his place. The shock makes Erina dumb. Bercht''s persecution of Lisa soon turns the woman mad, while Lailo, wandering in the villa''s surroundings, vainly tries to find the key to the mystery. A psychiatrist, Louis, firmly believes Lailo''s madness is caused by her inner anguish and seems confident in her recovery. But he''s wrong: the demented woman kills Katia and then throws herself out of a window. Brecht takes back his own identity, but his actions will have further tragic consequences...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ldmB6rPLAQaFU4FZ93FWbTNHTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105148'),
  ('383079646101327562', 'Maniac', 1934, 'Horror', 'Dwain Esper, William C. Thompson, J. Stuart Blackton Jr.', 'Hildegarde Stadie', 'Bill Woods, Horace B. Carpenter, Ted Edwards, Phyllis Diller, Theo Ramsey, Jenny Dark, Marvelle Andre, Celia McCann', null, 'An ex-vaudeville actor is working as the assistant to a doctor who has Frankenstein aspirations. The ex-vaudeville actor kills the doctor and decides to assume the identity of the dead physician.', 'An ex-vaudeville actor is working as the assistant to a doctor who has Frankenstein aspirations. The ex-vaudeville actor kills the doctor and decides to assume the identity of the dead physician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akRVscTstKGKk8ebb0UGDdJ6q3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23122'),
