  ('88400504037176530', 'Maniac', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Maxime Alexandre, Franck Khalfoun, Matt Henderson', 'C.A. Rosenberg, Joe Spinell', 'Elijah Wood, Nora Arnezeder, America Olivo, Zoe Aggeliki, Jan Broberg Felt, Joshua De La Garza, Dan Hunter, Genevieve Alexandra', 'NR', 'As he helps a young artist with her upcoming exhibition, the owner of a mannequin shop''s deadly, suppressed desires come to the surface.', 'As he helps a young artist with her upcoming exhibition, the owner of a mannequin shop''s deadly, suppressed desires come to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbDkRvhmbYnHDXkoq0sF0PLeo8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103620'),
