  ('117502469078522962', 'Manic', 2001, 'Drama', 'Jordan Melamed, Nicholas Hay', 'Jordan Melamed, Blayne Weaver, Michael Bacall', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Don Cheadle, Zooey Deschanel, Michael Bacall, Elden Henson, Cody Lightning, Sara Rivas, William Richert', 'R', 'Follows the fate of Lyle, a violent adolescent who, in lieu of prison, is placed in a juvenile mental institution, where he encounters a group of equally troubled teens. This motley crew—abused, sexually confused, violent, and yet hanging on by their grit and anger—becomes Lyle''s last lifeline as he fights to find meaning in a world that seems to defy understanding.', 'Follows the fate of Lyle, a violent adolescent who, in lieu of prison, is placed in a juvenile mental institution, where he encounters a group of equally troubled teens. This motley crew—abused, sexually confused, violent, and yet hanging on by their grit and anger—becomes Lyle''s last lifeline as he fights to find meaning in a world that seems to defy understanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af9Ym0HQuChr7e5N34PN9OSfYhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15098'),
  ('970483795098461739', 'Manichitrathazhu', 1993, 'Horror, Comedy, Mystery', 'Fazil, Venu, Anandakuttan', 'Madhu Muttam', 'Shobana, Mohanlal, Suresh Gopi, Nedumudi Venu, Vinaya Prasad, Innocent, Sudheesh, KPAC Lalitha', null, 'A young couple, Ganga and Nakulan, arrives at the ancestral home called Madampalli of the latter. Hailing from a family that follows tradition and superstitions, Nakulan''s uncle Thampi objects to the couple''s idea of moving into the allegedly haunted mansion, which Nakulan ignores. The couple moves in anyway following which seemingly supernatural events begin to happen.', 'A young couple, Ganga and Nakulan, arrives at the ancestral home called Madampalli of the latter. Hailing from a family that follows tradition and superstitions, Nakulan''s uncle Thampi objects to the couple''s idea of moving into the allegedly haunted mansion, which Nakulan ignores. The couple moves in anyway following which seemingly supernatural events begin to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YccrqvJFTfAVyEZp08I3fLx15y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84368'),
  ('1053733948284501509', 'Manifesto', 2017, 'Drama', 'Julian Rosefeldt, Christoph Krauss', 'Julian Rosefeldt', 'Cate Blanchett, Erika Bauer, Carl Dietrich Carls, Marie Borkowski Foedrowitz, Ea-Ja Kim, Marina Michael, Hannelore Ohlendorf, Ottokar Sachse', null, 'An edited version of Rosefeldt''s installation work of the same name, Manifesto is an outstanding tribute to various (art) manifestos of the nineteenth and twentieth century, ranging from Communism to Dogme, in connection with thirteen different characters, including a homeless man, a factory worker and a corporate CEO, who are all played by Cate Blanchett. A striking humorous audio-visual experience.', 'An edited version of Rosefeldt''s installation work of the same name, Manifesto is an outstanding tribute to various (art) manifestos of the nineteenth and twentieth century, ranging from Communism to Dogme, in connection with thirteen different characters, including a homeless man, a factory worker and a corporate CEO, who are all played by Cate Blanchett. A striking humorous audio-visual experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eszm6c7GxD0ztbRQpqkG04P8iui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382127'),
