  ('1046848952615454281', 'Manitou''s Canoe', 2025, 'Comedy, Western', 'Michael Herbig, Armin Golisano, Korbinian Wandinger', 'Rick Kavanian, Christian Tramitz, Michael Herbig', 'Michael Herbig, Christian Tramitz, Rick Kavanian, Jasmin Schwiers, Merlin Sandmeyer, Friedrich Mücke, Jessica Schwarz, Sky du Mont', null, 'Abahachi, the Apache chief, and his white blood brother Ranger fight tirelessly for peace and justice - but a new, up-and-coming gang is making life particularly difficult for them! They lure Abahachi and Ranger into a trap in order to get their hands on the legendary “Canoe of Manitou”.', 'Abahachi, the Apache chief, and his white blood brother Ranger fight tirelessly for peace and justice - but a new, up-and-coming gang is making life particularly difficult for them! They lure Abahachi and Ranger into a trap in order to get their hands on the legendary “Canoe of Manitou”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8d5Qnz2LGbu0kr7RCwdX8E55mYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233066'),
