  ('889256314863183990', 'Manmadhudu', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'K. Vijaya Bhaskar', 'Trivikram Srinivas', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Sonali Bendre, Anshu, Brahmanandam, Chandramohan, Sunil Varma, Tanikella Bharani, Sudha', null, 'Abhiram, a misogynist, works as a manager in his own advertising agency. When his uncle, the chairman, appoints Harika as an assistant manager, he mistreats her, but his hatred soon turns into love.', 'Abhiram, a misogynist, works as a manager in his own advertising agency. When his uncle, the chairman, appoints Harika as an assistant manager, he mistreats her, but his hatred soon turns into love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHjMjCmtpfQzQoDjiL9rWWo4ahd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81083'),
