  ('1027229904037336280', 'Mannequin', 1938, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Borzage, Paul Groesse, Edwin B. Willis', 'Lawrence Hazard, Frank Borzage', 'Joan Crawford, Spencer Tracy, Alan Curtis, Ralph Morgan, Mary Philips, Oscar O''Shea, Elisabeth Risdon, Leo Gorcey', null, 'Jessie, a young working class woman, seeks to improve her life by marrying her boyfriend, only to find out that he is no better than what she left behind.', 'Jessie, a young working class woman, seeks to improve her life by marrying her boyfriend, only to find out that he is no better than what she left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6J1aEBA0nsa8lcIFn7KKo2QGuCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33025'),
  ('358935430843374270', 'Mannequin', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Michael Gottlieb, Tim Suhrstedt, Michael Haley', 'Edward Rugoff, Michael Gottlieb', 'Andrew McCarthy, Kim Cattrall, Estelle Getty, James Spader, G.W. Bailey, Carole Davis, Meshach Taylor, Steve Vinovich', 'PG', 'Jonathan Switcher, an unemployed artist, finds a job as an assistant window dresser for a department store. When Jonathan happens upon a beautiful mannequin he previously designed, she springs to life and introduces herself as Emmy, an Egyptian under an ancient spell. Despite interference from the store''s devious manager, Jonathan and his mannequin fall in love while creating eye-catching window displays to keep the struggling store in business.', 'Jonathan Switcher, an unemployed artist, finds a job as an assistant window dresser for a department store. When Jonathan happens upon a beautiful mannequin he previously designed, she springs to life and introduces herself as Emmy, an Egyptian under an ancient spell. Despite interference from the store''s devious manager, Jonathan and his mannequin fall in love while creating eye-catching window displays to keep the struggling store in business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHMA8euTiZdDFXDi5zaIQQXwl0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10019'),
  ('692558419241042071', 'Mannequin in Red', 1958, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Hilding Bladh, Arne Mattsson', 'Folke Mellvig, Lars Widding', 'Karl-Arne Holmsten, Annalisa Ericson, Nils Hallberg, Lena Granhagen, Anita Björk, Lillebil Ibsen, Bengt Brunskog, Lennart Lindberg', null, 'A model is murdered at a famous fashion house and the Hillmans start to investigate. Kajsa Hillman is employed as a model and discovers that several people had motives to kill her.', 'A model is murdered at a famous fashion house and the Hillmans start to investigate. Kajsa Hillman is employed as a model and discovers that several people had motives to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xg6xJfcnZ3J5SydyLZIzhGwpfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74788'),
  ('104249747765415237', 'Mannequin Two: On the Move', 1991, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Stewart Raffill, Larry Pizer', 'Edward Rugoff, David Isaacs, Ken Levine', 'Kristy Swanson, William Ragsdale, Meshach Taylor, Terry Kiser, Stuart Pankin, Cynthia Harris, Heather Henderson, Andrew Hill Newman', 'PG', 'Although Jason works as a department store clerk, he is also a reincarnated prince. Long ago, his beloved Jessie was snatched away from him by an evil wizard who used his powers to transform her into wooden statue. Now Jessie is in Jason''s department store as a mannequin. When he encounters her, she awakens from her thousand-year sleep. They quickly revive their romance, but the evil wizard has been reincarnated as well, and he''s up to no good.', 'Although Jason works as a department store clerk, he is also a reincarnated prince. Long ago, his beloved Jessie was snatched away from him by an evil wizard who used his powers to transform her into wooden statue. Now Jessie is in Jason''s department store as a mannequin. When he encounters her, she awakens from her thousand-year sleep. They quickly revive their romance, but the evil wizard has been reincarnated as well, and he''s up to no good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OOpLGW4Nz113XVyUCes6wm8M7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34376'),
  ('865508743997082369', 'Männerpension', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Detlev Buck, Sławomir Idziak, Isabel Kleefeld', 'Eckhard Theophil, Detlev Buck', 'Til Schweiger, Detlev Buck, Marie Bäumer, Heike Makatsch, Leander Haußmann, Tana Schanzara, Johannes Silberschneider, Jenny Elvers', null, 'A support program brings the two convicts Gerd and Steinbock into the care of women. There they are supposed to prove that they are capable of integrating into society. Now Gerd stupidly kills a bar owner. This puts an end to their excursion into freedom for the time being.', 'A support program brings the two convicts Gerd and Steinbock into the care of women. There they are supposed to prove that they are capable of integrating into society. Now Gerd stupidly kills a bar owner. This puts an end to their excursion into freedom for the time being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65wbEhyP1oqFQVAm3YLnN78hlMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9269'),
  ('548704977286137943', 'Männersache', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Mario Barth, Gernot Roll, Gernot Roll', 'Mario Barth, Paul Panzer', 'Mario Barth, Paul Panzer, Anja Kling, Michael Gwisdek, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Michael Brandner, Jürgen Vogel, Leander Haußmann', null, 'During the day Paul works in a Berlin pet shop and in the evening he works on his career as a comedian. Things are going really badly until he cracks jokes about his best buddy Hotte and his girlfriend Susi. The audience goes wild with excitement! But Hotte and Susi are p* off. Paul has to decide: friendship or career?', 'During the day Paul works in a Berlin pet shop and in the evening he works on his career as a comedian. Things are going really badly until he cracks jokes about his best buddy Hotte and his girlfriend Susi. The audience goes wild with excitement! But Hotte and Susi are p* off. Paul has to decide: friendship or career?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ip7lu55qzJDdy0m3GPXAzo8QOZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16272'),
  ('38438154176009902', 'Männertag', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Holger Haase', 'Ilja Haller, Philip Voges', 'Oliver Wnuk, Axel Stein, Milan Peschel, Tom Beck, Lavinia Wilson, Carolin Kebekus, Jan-David Bürger, Daniel Gawlowski', null, 'It''s Men''s Day, Men''s Day, Father''s Day, Ascension Day - many terms, one date, but always a reason to celebrate. Having just finished school, five Bavarian friends start a common tradition: Every year they want to get together on Men''s Day and douse their friendship properly. But every good resolution eventually dies, and so after 20 years most of them lost contact.', 'It''s Men''s Day, Men''s Day, Father''s Day, Ascension Day - many terms, one date, but always a reason to celebrate. Having just finished school, five Bavarian friends start a common tradition: Every year they want to get together on Men''s Day and douse their friendship properly. But every good resolution eventually dies, and so after 20 years most of them lost contact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyfQPS6YUCGyPfn6TgJu80DAGXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346238'),
  ('267238306521196355', 'Männertreu', 2014, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Hermine Huntgeburth', 'Thea Dorn', 'Matthias Brandt, Suzanne von Borsody, Maxim Mehmet, Margarita Broich, Claudia Michelsen, Lisa Hagmeister, Peri Baumeister, Philipp Hochmair', null, 'Georg Sahl, one of the last major newspaper publishers with liberal-conservative quality standards, is offered the position of Federal President by the Mayor of Frankfurt. His wife Franziska, a successful divorce lawyer, is initially not very happy about the fact that she will soon only be representing him as "First Lady". When Georg''s young lover Nina is seriously injured after an argument, it is not only his career that is in danger...', 'Georg Sahl, one of the last major newspaper publishers with liberal-conservative quality standards, is offered the position of Federal President by the Mayor of Frankfurt. His wife Franziska, a successful divorce lawyer, is initially not very happy about the fact that she will soon only be representing him as "First Lady". When Georg''s young lover Nina is seriously injured after an argument, it is not only his career that is in danger...', null, 'tmdb:movie:294889'),
  ('108482156943169659', 'Manny', 2014, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Leon Gast, Ryan Moore', null, 'Manny Pacquiao, Jinkee Pacquiao, Freddie Roach, Liam Neeson, Jimmy Kimmel, Jeremy Piven, Mark Wahlberg', 'PG-13', 'From abject poverty to becoming a ten-time boxing world champion, congressman, and international icon, Manny Pacquiao is the true definition of a Cinderella story. In the Philippines, he first entered the ring as a sixteen-year-old weighing ninety-eight pounds with the goal of earning money to feed his family. Now, almost twenty years later, when he fights, the country of 100 million people comes to a complete standstill to watch. Regarded for his ability to bring people together, Pacquiao entered the political arena in 2010. As history’s first boxing congressman, Pacquiao now fights for his people both inside and outside of the ring. Now at the height of his career, he is faced with maneuvering an unscrupulous sport while maintaining his political duties. The question now is, what bridge is too far for Manny Pacquiao to cross?', 'From abject poverty to becoming a ten-time boxing world champion, congressman, and international icon, Manny Pacquiao is the true definition of a Cinderella story. In the Philippines, he first entered the ring as a sixteen-year-old weighing ninety-eight pounds with the goal of earning money to feed his family. Now, almost twenty years later, when he fights, the country of 100 million people comes to a complete standstill to watch. Regarded for his ability to bring people together, Pacquiao entered the political arena in 2010. As history’s first boxing congressman, Pacquiao now fights for his people both inside and outside of the ring. Now at the height of his career, he is faced with maneuvering an unscrupulous sport while maintaining his political duties. The question now is, what bridge is too far for Manny Pacquiao to cross?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYnQXI0Dm4Tp9prSa6ZqX1NpXAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253295'),
  ('877499360213644874', 'Manny & Lo', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lisa Krueger, Wendy Jo Cohen, Tom Krueger', 'Lisa Krueger', 'Scarlett Johansson, Aleksa Palladino, Mary Kay Place, Paul Guilfoyle, Glenn Fitzgerald, Cameron Boyd, Dean Silvers, Marlen Hecht', null, 'A pregnant teen and her younger sister run away from foster homes and kidnap a woman whom they believe can help with the pregnancy.', 'A pregnant teen and her younger sister run away from foster homes and kidnap a woman whom they believe can help with the pregnancy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aaykv8QSg5iXOVXcaIy1mm0qd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88224'),
  ('1068563267226414931', 'Manodrome', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'John Trengove, Wyatt Garfield, Ben Smith-Petersen', 'John Trengove', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Adrien Brody, Odessa Young, Philip Ettinger, Sallieu Sesay, Evan Jonigkeit, Caleb Eberhardt, Ethan Suplee', 'R', 'Ralphie is an Uber driver and aspiring bodybuilder who is inducted into a libertarian masculinity cult and loses his grip on reality when his repressed desires are awakened.', 'Ralphie is an Uber driver and aspiring bodybuilder who is inducted into a libertarian masculinity cult and loses his grip on reality when his repressed desires are awakened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSAqIzuCqCQAt3HFsHwiffFSj96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843942'),
  ('840922562062078487', 'Manolito Four Eyes', 1999, 'Comedy, Family', 'Miguel Albaladejo, Alfonso Sanz', 'Miguel Albaladejo', 'David Sánchez del Rey, Adriana Ozores, Roberto Álvarez, Antonio Gamero, Fedra Lorente, Laura Calabuig, Marta Fernández Muro, Gloria Muñoz', null, 'The usually absent father of a chubby kid shows up to take him on a road trip.', 'The usually absent father of a chubby kid shows up to take him on a road trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13vPWBJa085mAeVK8uyMAkBk30c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72900'),
  ('451525200585126953', 'Manolito Four Eyes: The Mischievous Holidays', 2001, 'Family, Comedy', 'Joan Potau, Juan Molina', 'Lola Salvador, Joan Potau, Cecilia Bartolomé', 'Doro Berenguer, José Luis Carrillo, Rubén Carrillo, El Gran Wyoming, Vicente Haro, María Barranco, Óscar Ladoire, Marcela Walerstein', null, 'This is a hilarious look at contemporary Madrid from the point of view of ten year old Manolito. Witty, funny and moving, the film has crossed-over from Spain to become a classic family entertainment.On this particular occasion, Manolito is in the middle of Chrismas break and ready to celebrate the holidays with his nutty family: his mother, Cata, his father, Manolo, Grandpa and Imbecile. This year holds a big surprise: Uncle Nico, his mother''s brother who lives an works in Oslo as a waiter. Uncle Nico shows up in an unbelieveable motor home to spend Christmas Eve with the family. He is accompanied by his flashy Norwegian fiancée, Trudi Bergenkoklass, who is something like part fairy, part Viking and part Pippi Long Stocking. This lady immediately catches Manolito''s eye.', 'This is a hilarious look at contemporary Madrid from the point of view of ten year old Manolito. Witty, funny and moving, the film has crossed-over from Spain to become a classic family entertainment.On this particular occasion, Manolito is in the middle of Chrismas break and ready to celebrate the holidays with his nutty family: his mother, Cata, his father, Manolo, Grandpa and Imbecile. This year holds a big surprise: Uncle Nico, his mother''s brother who lives an works in Oslo as a waiter. Uncle Nico shows up in an unbelieveable motor home to spend Christmas Eve with the family. He is accompanied by his flashy Norwegian fiancée, Trudi Bergenkoklass, who is something like part fairy, part Viking and part Pippi Long Stocking. This lady immediately catches Manolito''s eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tj4J6pR6JieIDykknr2rex1uo0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98986'),
  ('807405663630299501', 'Manolo by Night', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Zacarías Urbiola, Manuel Rojas', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Vicente Coello', 'Alfredo Landa, María José Alfonso, Josele Román, Antonio Ozores, Juanjo Menéndez, José Sacristán, Rafaela Aparicio, Ricardo Merino', null, 'While Manolo, employed in a tourism agency in the Costa del Sol, enjoys the foreign babes, his wife suffers at home in the city. Advised by a girlfriend she plans revenge by simulating pregnancy. At first, Manolo is very happy to have a baby. However, soon he realizes that he cannot be the father since he was not in the city at the time of conception.', 'While Manolo, employed in a tourism agency in the Costa del Sol, enjoys the foreign babes, his wife suffers at home in the city. Advised by a girlfriend she plans revenge by simulating pregnancy. At first, Manolo is very happy to have a baby. However, soon he realizes that he cannot be the father since he was not in the city at the time of conception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iCTZiXwgPVXGR2Gyi3cv2JB1BD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254161'),
  ('28325817192868391', 'Manon', 1949, 'Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Louis Wipf, Serge Vallin', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Jean Ferry', 'Serge Reggiani, Michel Auclair, Cécile Aubry, Andrex, Raymond Souplex, André Valmy, Henri Vilbert, Héléna Manson', null, 'Port of Marseille, France, recently liberated from the German yoke. Caught as stowaways aboard a ship, Manon, a young woman who was accused of collaborating with the Nazis, and Robert, a freedom fighter who saved her from reprisals, tell the captain about the many challenges they have had to face in order to survive.', 'Port of Marseille, France, recently liberated from the German yoke. Caught as stowaways aboard a ship, Manon, a young woman who was accused of collaborating with the Nazis, and Robert, a freedom fighter who saved her from reprisals, tell the captain about the many challenges they have had to face in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBnz0NP8mHnIlSLzeT7hOBM7a0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132332'),
  ('906904543023748317', 'Manon 70', 1968, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jean Aurel, Edmond Richard', 'Jacques Laurent, Jean Aurel', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jean-Claude Brialy, Sami Frey, Elsa Martinelli, Robert Webber, Paul Hubschmid', null, 'Manon is an amoral, free spirit who uses sex to surround herself in relatively luxurious surroundings.', 'Manon is an amoral, free spirit who uses sex to surround herself in relatively luxurious surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahmOv12sxuRMdj7MtNmX3HNsZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99419'),
  ('1026649554711667791', 'Manon of the Spring', 1953, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Marcel Pagnol, Willy Faktorovitch, Charles Pons', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Jacqueline Pagnol, Rellys, Raymond Pellegrin, Henri Poupon, Robert Vattier, Fernand Sardou, Henri Vilbert, Charles Blavette', null, 'Marcel Pagnol''s adaptation of his own novel Manon des sources, the story of a shepherdess who exacts her revenge on the townsfolk she blames for killing her father, in two parts: Manon des sources and Ugolin.', 'Marcel Pagnol''s adaptation of his own novel Manon des sources, the story of a shepherdess who exacts her revenge on the townsfolk she blames for killing her father, in two parts: Manon des sources and Ugolin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DqWKXkmRq2ZYy9jf3O54zgVPR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65703'),
  ('63025993314965748', 'Manon of the Spring', 1986, 'Drama', 'Bruno Nuytten, Claude Berri, Xavier Castano', 'Claude Berri, Gérard Brach', 'Yves Montand, Daniel Auteuil, Emmanuelle Béart, Hippolyte Girardot, Margarita Lozano, Yvonne Gamy, Ticky Holgado, Jean Bouchaud', 'PG', 'In this, the sequel to Jean de Florette, Manon has grown into a beautiful young shepherdess living in the idyllic Provencal countryside. She plots vengeance on the men who greedily conspired to acquire her father''s land years earlier.', 'In this, the sequel to Jean de Florette, Manon has grown into a beautiful young shepherdess living in the idyllic Provencal countryside. She plots vengeance on the men who greedily conspired to acquire her father''s land years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qpu6Zc1PSDL3UbDNIZJ6YuhJDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4481'),
