  ('790772629737512987', 'Mansion of the Doomed', 1976, 'Horror', 'Michael Pataki, Richard Band, Andrew Davis', 'Frank Ray Perilli', 'Richard Basehart, Gloria Grahame, Lance Henriksen, JoJo D''Amore, Trish Stewart, Al Ferrara, Donna Andresen, Marilyn Joi', 'R', 'An insane surgeon finds himself up to his armpits in eyeballs after guilt prompts him to begin removing the eyes of abducted people in hopes of performing transplants on his daughter who lost her own in a car-accident he caused.', 'An insane surgeon finds himself up to his armpits in eyeballs after guilt prompts him to begin removing the eyes of abducted people in hopes of performing transplants on his daughter who lost her own in a car-accident he caused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AvD9lfGytbndj1OpgDICfvHZ6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40139'),
  ('536576497064175827', 'Mansion of the Living Dead', 1982, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Antonio Mayans, Mabel Escaño, Eva León, Mari Carmen Nieto, Elisa Vela, Albino Graziani', null, 'Four strippers take a vacation and wind up at a Spanish resort complex that, despite the hotel receptionist''s claims of it being fully booked, appears to be completely empty. After one of the girls mysteriously vanishes and another ends up dead in the pool, both accompanied by the tolling bell from a nearby monastery, Candy and Caty must try to solve the mystery that seems to involve the Spanish Inquisition.', 'Four strippers take a vacation and wind up at a Spanish resort complex that, despite the hotel receptionist''s claims of it being fully booked, appears to be completely empty. After one of the girls mysteriously vanishes and another ends up dead in the pool, both accompanied by the tolling bell from a nearby monastery, Candy and Caty must try to solve the mystery that seems to involve the Spanish Inquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62Q8uURku3sCNEPK8bJVT6iCtoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28806'),
  ('775384685912829327', 'Manslaughter', 1922, 'Drama', 'Cecil B. DeMille, L. Guy Wilky, Alvin Wyckoff', 'Jeanie Macpherson', 'Leatrice Joy, Thomas Meighan, Lois Wilson, John Miltern, George Fawcett, Julia Faye, Edythe Chapman, Jack Mower', 'NR', 'Society-girl thrillseeker Lydia''s fun comes to an end when she accidentally causes the death of motorcycle policeman.', 'Society-girl thrillseeker Lydia''s fun comes to an end when she accidentally causes the death of motorcycle policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWyKsjzkexx0UrOWWLAeXMh8WeL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166472'),
  ('183542425520269384', 'Manslaughter', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Per Fly, Harald Gunnar Paalgard', 'Per Fly, Kim Leona, Mogens Rukov', 'Jesper Christensen, Pernilla August, Charlotte Fich, Beate Bille, Vibeke Hastrup, Julie R. Ølgaard, Samy Andersen, Thomas Voss', null, 'A college professor abandons his family and his career in order to champion his mistress, a student radical accused of killing a policeman.', 'A college professor abandons his family and his career in order to champion his mistress, a student radical accused of killing a policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JKV4aELfPXVlk3OK8WQSilbNRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15840'),
  ('925589414415778119', 'Mansome', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Morgan Spurlock', null, 'Will Arnett, Jason Bateman, Judd Apatow, Adam Carolla, Zach Galifianakis, Isaiah Mustafa, Paul Rudd, Morgan Spurlock', null, 'From America''s greatest beardsman, to Morgan Spurlock''s own mustache, Executive Producers Will Arnett, Jason Bateman, and Ben Silverman bring us a hilarious look at men''s identity in the 21st century. Models, actors, experts and comedians weigh in on what it is to be a man in a world where the definition of masculinity has become as diverse as a hipster''s facial hair in Williamsburg. The hilarious follicles of men''s idiosyncratic grooming habits are thoroughly combed over as men finally take a long hard look in the mirror.', 'From America''s greatest beardsman, to Morgan Spurlock''s own mustache, Executive Producers Will Arnett, Jason Bateman, and Ben Silverman bring us a hilarious look at men''s identity in the 21st century. Models, actors, experts and comedians weigh in on what it is to be a man in a world where the definition of masculinity has become as diverse as a hipster''s facial hair in Williamsburg. The hilarious follicles of men''s idiosyncratic grooming habits are thoroughly combed over as men finally take a long hard look in the mirror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjPJxKVDi8BLgnJSjnadQGopBPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104155'),
  ('1038709193049370631', 'Manson', 1973, 'Documentary', 'Robert Hendrickson, Laurence Merrick', 'Laurence Merrick, Joan Huntington', 'Charles Manson, Vincent Bugliosi, Lynette Fromme, Bruce Davis, Paul Watkins, Mary Brunner, Jesse Pearson', 'R', 'Prosecuting attorney Vincent Bugliosi and Manson "family" members Lynette Fromme, Mary Brunner and Sandra Good discuss the Tate-LaBianca murders.', 'Prosecuting attorney Vincent Bugliosi and Manson "family" members Lynette Fromme, Mary Brunner and Sandra Good discuss the Tate-LaBianca murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpWstkfnE2wONwjiNW0BMUAdqpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54505'),
  ('467263322582431595', 'Manson Family Vacation', 2015, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Sean McElwee, J. Davis', 'J. Davis', 'Jay Duplass, Linas Phillips, Tobin Bell, Leonora Pitts, Adam Chernick, Davie-Blue, Justin M. Rasch', null, 'The story of two brothers: one who’s devoted to his family, the other who’s obsessed with the Manson Family.', 'The story of two brothers: one who’s devoted to his family, the other who’s obsessed with the Manson Family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zenlCYnD5Gg8YMXyGBFheEbM0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323679'),
  ('1047060798229853479', 'ManSuang', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Chartchai Ketnust, Bhanbhassa Dhubthien, Krisda Witthayakhajorndet', 'Krisda Witthayakhajorndet, Bhanbhassa Dhubthien, Parida Manomaiphibul', 'Nattawin Wattanagitiphat, Phakphum Romsaithong, Asavapatr Ponpiboon, Thanayut Thakoonauttaya, Ornanong Panyawong, Nonthakorn Chalermnai, Pradit Prasartthong, Gandhi​ Wasuvitchayagit', 'PG-13', 'In a fight for their lives, two dancers infiltrate a high-profile social club and seek the help of a newfound ally to unmask traitors to Siam.', 'In a fight for their lives, two dancers infiltrate a high-profile social club and seek the help of a newfound ally to unmask traitors to Siam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QKjUcpO0x9XUORzi8MjunDKm4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076011'),
  ('508773843245593472', 'Manta - Der Film', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Otto Kirchhoff, Peter Timm', 'Xaõ Seffcheque, Michael Arnal', 'Sebastian Rudolph, Nadeshda Brennicke, Jophi Ries, Edda Fischer, Jochen Nickel, Helge Schneider, Dieter Pfaff, Brigitte Janner', null, 'Life is tough on car fanatic Fred. As soon as he has convinced the beautiful hairdresser Tina, he wins an Opel Manta in a raffle and is rid of the lady immediately. From now on, Tina prefers to turn to the photographer Phil. He has what Fred always wanted: a Golf GTI. To make matters worse, he now has to listen to the mocking remarks of his fellow men at every traffic light. But Fred doesn''t give up. He finally finds support in the Manta Club. In a big race he finally wants to put his rival GTI-Phil in his place.', 'Life is tough on car fanatic Fred. As soon as he has convinced the beautiful hairdresser Tina, he wins an Opel Manta in a raffle and is rid of the lady immediately. From now on, Tina prefers to turn to the photographer Phil. He has what Fred always wanted: a Golf GTI. To make matters worse, he now has to listen to the mocking remarks of his fellow men at every traffic light. But Fred doesn''t give up. He finally finds support in the Manta Club. In a big race he finally wants to put his rival GTI-Phil in his place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/798G8opEUfVr299ySNbuVBOabJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2169'),
  ('997790223274601902', 'Manta Ray', 2019, 'Drama', 'Patiparn Boontarig, Phuttiphong Aroonpheng, Nawarophaat Rungphiboonsophit', 'Phuttiphong Aroonpheng', 'Aphisit Hama, Wanlop Rungkumjad, Rasmee Wayrana, Kumjorn Sankwan, Sanit Pasingchop, Tawan Hirunyapong, Athasit Phumhiram, Manus Prasitwattanachai', null, 'Near a coastal village of Thailand, a local fisherman rescues a stranger, who does not speak a word, offers him his friendship and names him Thongchai. When the fisherman suddenly disappears at sea, Thongchai slowly begins to take over his friend''s life—his house, his job and his marriage.', 'Near a coastal village of Thailand, a local fisherman rescues a stranger, who does not speak a word, offers him his friendship and names him Thongchai. When the fisherman suddenly disappears at sea, Thongchai slowly begins to take over his friend''s life—his house, his job and his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adRTcgZhFbM2svocrUHq0eA5ciT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539033'),
  ('775347736016169589', 'Manta, Manta', 1991, 'Comedy, Action', 'Roland Willaert, Wolfgang Büld', 'Stefan Cantz', 'Til Schweiger, Tina Ruland, Stefan Gebelhoff, Sabine Berg, Michael Kessler, Nadja Naidenow, Ömer Simsek, Beatrice Manowski', null, 'A not-so-clever guy called Bertie with an Opel Manta (a low-budget European sports coupé from the ''80s) gets competition in a street race from a guy with a fast Mercedes, and another slick guy with a Ferrari tries to get his hands on Bertie''s girlfriend.', 'A not-so-clever guy called Bertie with an Opel Manta (a low-budget European sports coupé from the ''80s) gets competition in a street race from a guy with a fast Mercedes, and another slick guy with a Ferrari tries to get his hands on Bertie''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHBEudYatUvo6T6R5W1NtvQNUVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1915'),
  ('1146231754599037332', 'Manta, Manta: Legacy', 2023, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Til Schweiger', 'Til Schweiger, Michael David Pate, Miguel Angelo Pate', 'Til Schweiger, Tina Ruland, Luna Schweiger, Tim Oliver Schultz, Michael Kessler, Moritz Bleibtreu, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Zachi Noy', null, 'When a former racer faces the prospect of his car repair shop and go-kart track being foreclosed, he comes up with a daring plan: to win the prize for the big race on the Bilster Berg. He has one month to turn his old Opel into a rocket from the old days, but his ex-wife suddenly enters his life with a request to take care of their son.', 'When a former racer faces the prospect of his car repair shop and go-kart track being foreclosed, he comes up with a daring plan: to win the prize for the big race on the Bilster Berg. He has one month to turn his old Opel into a rocket from the old days, but his ex-wife suddenly enters his life with a request to take care of their son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYMPaNG3nl2tcYJfqXcMK5whUMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058100'),
  ('1074380927936106355', 'Manthan', 1976, 'Drama', 'Shyam Benegal, Girish Ghanekar, Prahlad Kakar', 'Kaifi Azmi', 'Smita Patil, Girish Karnad, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Naseeruddin Shah, Mohan Agashe, Anant Nag, Amrish Puri, Sadhu Meher', null, 'A veterinarian, Dr. Rao, makes a visit to a village, where he intends to commence a co-operative society dairy for the betterment of the rural people. The film is set against the backdrop of the White Revolution of India (Operation Flood) which started in 1970. It was entirely crowdfunded by 500,000 farmers who donated Rs. 2 each.', 'A veterinarian, Dr. Rao, makes a visit to a village, where he intends to commence a co-operative society dairy for the betterment of the rural people. The film is set against the backdrop of the White Revolution of India (Operation Flood) which started in 1970. It was entirely crowdfunded by 500,000 farmers who donated Rs. 2 each.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/977xa8rLPM8PdYJLlfWAYF43mAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242826'),
  ('189650472480567420', 'Manticore', 2005, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Tripp Reed, Lorenzo Senatore, Asya Chakarova', 'John Werner', 'Robert Beltran, Jeff Fahey, Chase Masterson, Heather Donahue, Faran Tahir, A.J. Buckley, Jeff M. Lewis, Richard Gnolfo', null, 'During Operation Iraqi Freedom, a US Army Squad is sent to a small Iraqi town to locate a missing news crew, only to find the residents of the town dead and a living weapon of mass destruction, a Manticore, awakened from its long slumber by a terrorist leader wanting to rid his land of the American invaders at any price.', 'During Operation Iraqi Freedom, a US Army Squad is sent to a small Iraqi town to locate a missing news crew, only to find the residents of the town dead and a living weapon of mass destruction, a Manticore, awakened from its long slumber by a terrorist leader wanting to rid his land of the American invaders at any price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5EhUVHr5rsTtgFlqUIkc0GKeTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90840'),
  ('848042983038547291', 'Manticore', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carlos Vermut, Alana Mejía González', 'Carlos Vermut', 'Nacho Sánchez, Zoe Stein, Catalina Sopelana, Javier Lago, Patrick Martino, Ángela Boix, Vicenta N''Dongo, Joan Amargós Rubert', null, 'Julián is a successful video-game designer whose life is plagued by a dark secret. But when Diana pops up in his life, the man will feel as though a chance at happiness is within his grasp.', 'Julián is a successful video-game designer whose life is plagued by a dark secret. But when Diana pops up in his life, the man will feel as though a chance at happiness is within his grasp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjjQksxvBFDkraifSGzft9j6MXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760158'),
  ('250765571379666469', 'Mantis', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Lee Tae-sung, Kang Min-woo, Lee Seung-ho', 'Lee Tae-sung, Byun Sung-hyun, Lee Jin-seong', 'Yim Si-wan, Park Gyu-young, Choi Hyun-wook, Bae Gang-hee, Hwang Sung-bin, Yoo Su-bin, Jeon Bae-soo, Jo Woo-jin', 'R', 'The secret society of contract killers falls into chaos, unleashing a new breed of assassins. With old rules in ruins, who dares claim the shadows?', 'The secret society of contract killers falls into chaos, unleashing a new breed of assassins. With old rules in ruins, who dares claim the shadows?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6WLRwwddFKattMseWL3m7Geskd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1267319'),
  ('235588744471877342', 'Manto', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Nandita Das, Kartik Vijay', 'Nandita Das', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Rasika Dugal, Tahir Raj Bhasin, Feryna Wazheir, Javed Akhtar, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Rishi Kapoor, Inaamulhaq', null, 'In Bombay''s seedy-shiny film world, Manto and his stories are widely read and accepted. But as sectarian violence engulfs the nation, Manto makes the difficult choice of leaving his beloved Bombay. In Lahore, he finds himself bereft of friends and unable to find takers for his writings.', 'In Bombay''s seedy-shiny film world, Manto and his stories are widely read and accepted. But as sectarian violence engulfs the nation, Manto makes the difficult choice of leaving his beloved Bombay. In Lahore, he finds himself bereft of friends and unable to find takers for his writings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63Ar6C4ZyHALlxrc2nDR9fR2kmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517975'),
  ('1146997951948278790', 'Mantra Warrior: The Legend of The Eight Moons', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jinanavin Veerapatra', 'Sornperes Subsermsri', 'Ranee Campen, Tachaya Pathumwan, Sorawit Tongteng, Nalinee Cheewasakorn, Pattechin Sasipatthanathada, Rujira Khajicharoen, Apinan Teeranantakul, Manop Srijupao', 'NR', 'A story inspired by the original RAMAYANA, retold in a futuristic universe, involving brave warriors who possess ancient powers from another dimension.', 'A story inspired by the original RAMAYANA, retold in a futuristic universe, involving brave warriors who possess ancient powers from another dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fj8Cmtw7j2PoiKDnd1MKOA0YaAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1134424'),
  ('543912631651562198', 'Mantrap', 1926, 'Western, Comedy', 'Victor Fleming, James Wong Howe, Henry Hathaway', 'Adelaide Heilbron, Ethel Doherty', 'Clara Bow, Ernest Torrence, Percy Marmont, Eugene Pallette, Tom Kennedy, Josephine Crowell, William Orlamond, Charles Stevens', 'NR', 'A sexy young manicurist living with her older backwoodsman husband in a small Canadian town finds herself attracted to a young, rich and famous divorce lawyer who comes to town on vacation.', 'A sexy young manicurist living with her older backwoodsman husband in a small Canadian town finds herself attracted to a young, rich and famous divorce lawyer who comes to town on vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWbpOoK1oQkL8dGv7qwFJLcZCIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72821'),
  ('969985371109200514', 'Manual of Arms', 1966, null, 'Hollis Frampton', null, 'Michael Snow, Joyce Wieland, Marcia Steinbrecher, Rosemarie Castoro, Lucinda Childs, Robert Huot, Larry Poons, Twyla Tharp', null, 'In this "fourteen-part drill for the camera," Frampton created a portrait gallery of his art-world friends engaging in a variety of ordinary activities.', 'In this "fourteen-part drill for the camera," Frampton created a portrait gallery of his art-world friends engaging in a variety of ordinary activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0XZfcYaoDITtFvZba7KxbKYe73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149047'),
  ('881571136303663184', 'Manuale d''amore 2 (capitoli successivi)', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Tani Canevari', 'Ugo Chiti, Andrea Agnello, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Carlo Verdone, Monica Bellucci, Riccardo Scamarcio, Fabio Volo, Sergio Rubini, Antonio Albanese, Claudio Bisio, Barbora Bobuľová', null, 'Paralyzed from a crash, Nicola falls for his physiotherapist Lucia. Franco and Manuela seek fertility treatment in Barcelona. Filippo and Fosco, a gay couple, plan their wedding. Ernesto, a waiter, has an affair with Spanish cook Cecilia.', 'Paralyzed from a crash, Nicola falls for his physiotherapist Lucia. Franco and Manuela seek fertility treatment in Barcelona. Filippo and Fosco, a gay couple, plan their wedding. Ernesto, a waiter, has an affair with Spanish cook Cecilia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mDPqJ8HQNs9oyziI88EelJCzoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20069'),
  ('1061976329590677829', 'Manuel', 2018, 'Drama', 'Dario Albertini, Luca Agatensi', 'Simone Ranucci, Dario Albertini', 'Andrea Lattanzi, Francesca Antonelli, Giulia Elettra Gorietti, Renato Scarpa, Loretta Rossi Stuart, Raffaella Rea, Alessandra Scirdi, Monica Carpanese', null, 'An eighteen-year-old boy is released from an institute for minors with no family support, and for the first time tastes the bittersweet flavor of freedom; an imprisoned mother longs to go back and start all over again. These are the characters taken from the real world and transferred into a film that is first of all a shadowing of human beings, of their hopes and little acts of cowardice. But it is also the story of a time of waiting, of a soul going around in circles, a coming of age in a desolate and oppressive, marginal context that becomes a character in its own right.', 'An eighteen-year-old boy is released from an institute for minors with no family support, and for the first time tastes the bittersweet flavor of freedom; an imprisoned mother longs to go back and start all over again. These are the characters taken from the real world and transferred into a film that is first of all a shadowing of human beings, of their hopes and little acts of cowardice. But it is also the story of a time of waiting, of a soul going around in circles, a coming of age in a desolate and oppressive, marginal context that becomes a character in its own right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cS3mNVLzecBvvyKqe0MtmvdoQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475855'),
  ('929897921171888009', 'Manuelita', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Manuel García Ferré', 'Manuel García Ferré', 'Rosario Sánchez Almada, Cecilia Gispert, Enrique Conlazo, Pelusa Suero, Ariel Abadi, Néstor D''Alessandro, Susana Sisto', null, 'Animated Argentine film about a young girl turtle who gets lost on a balloon trip.', 'Animated Argentine film about a young girl turtle who gets lost on a balloon trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w67V5qcB3yUVrq3W49NMFNL8H12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65931'),
  ('1139690110924064356', 'Manufactured Landscapes', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Jennifer Baichwal, Noah Weinzweig, Peter Mettler', null, 'Edward Burtynsky', null, 'MANUFACTURED LANDSCAPES is the striking new documentary on the world and work of renowned artist Edward Burtynsky. Internationally acclaimed for his large-scale photographs of “manufactured landscapes”—quarries, recycling yards, factories, mines and dams—Burtynsky creates stunningly beautiful art from civilization’s materials and debris.', 'MANUFACTURED LANDSCAPES is the striking new documentary on the world and work of renowned artist Edward Burtynsky. Internationally acclaimed for his large-scale photographs of “manufactured landscapes”—quarries, recycling yards, factories, mines and dams—Burtynsky creates stunningly beautiful art from civilization’s materials and debris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkU59j039xv2er6Y6V8PbFRcFUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24582'),
  ('984427266345586037', 'Manufacturing Consent: Noam Chomsky and the Media', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Mark Achbar, Peter Wintonick, Antonin Lhotsky', null, 'Noam Chomsky, Mark Achbar, Edward S. Herman, William F. Buckley Jr., Peter Jennings, Bill Moyers, Tom Wolfe', null, 'A film about the noted American linguist/political dissident and his warning about corporate media''s role in modern propaganda.', 'A film about the noted American linguist/political dissident and his warning about corporate media''s role in modern propaganda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Izpz5pgB5ScVrXkIxK4TXDxZLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36947'),
  ('1099743086224874754', 'Manufacturing Dissent', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Rick Caine, Debbie Melnyk', null, 'Michael Moore, Debbie Melnyk , Rick Caine, Dave Barber, Peter Bart, Tony Bennett, Elizabeth Bourgeois, José Bové', 'R', '"Michael Moore doesn''t like documentaries. That''s why he doesn''t make them." A documentary that looks to distinguish what''s fact, fiction, legend, and otherwise as a camera crew trails Michael Moore as he tours with his film, Fahrenheit 9/11.', '"Michael Moore doesn''t like documentaries. That''s why he doesn''t make them." A documentary that looks to distinguish what''s fact, fiction, legend, and otherwise as a camera crew trails Michael Moore as he tours with his film, Fahrenheit 9/11.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OkdoxIC6v2afGttvSpZFxPMkod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27827'),
  ('677061746590190564', 'Manufacturing Ignorance', 2020, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Pascal Vasselin, Franck Cuveillier, Pascal Vasselin', 'Stéphane Foucart, Mathias Girel, Pascal Vasselin', 'Pascal Vasselin, Fani Hatjina, Matthias Groß, Linsey McGoey, Naomi Oreskes, Stéphane Foucart, Catherine Collinet, Stanton A. Glantz', null, 'Tobacco, climate change, pesticides,... Never has scientific knowledge seemed so vast, detailed and shared. And yet it appears to be increasingly challenged. It is no longer surprising to see private corporations put strategies in place to confuse the public debate and paralyze political decision-making. Overwhelmed by excess of information, how can we, as citizens, sort out fact from fiction? One by one, this film dismantles the workings of this clever manoeuvre that aims to turn science against itself. Thanks to declassified archives, graphic animations and testimonies from experts, lobbyists and politicians, this investigation plunges us into the science of doubt. Along with a team of experts (philosophers, economists, cognitive scientists, political men, or even agnotologists), we explore concrete examples of doubt making and try to understand the whole process and the issues behind it.', 'Tobacco, climate change, pesticides,... Never has scientific knowledge seemed so vast, detailed and shared. And yet it appears to be increasingly challenged. It is no longer surprising to see private corporations put strategies in place to confuse the public debate and paralyze political decision-making. Overwhelmed by excess of information, how can we, as citizens, sort out fact from fiction? One by one, this film dismantles the workings of this clever manoeuvre that aims to turn science against itself. Thanks to declassified archives, graphic animations and testimonies from experts, lobbyists and politicians, this investigation plunges us into the science of doubt. Along with a team of experts (philosophers, economists, cognitive scientists, political men, or even agnotologists), we explore concrete examples of doubt making and try to understand the whole process and the issues behind it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOQj2KEFKRklpwaQRTtBM0xeQBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767466'),
  ('425898760393606313', 'Manufractur', 1985, 'Drama', 'Peter Tscherkassky, Peter Tscherkassky', null, null, null, 'A tangled network woven with tiny particles of movements broken out of found footage and compiled anew: the elements of the "to the left, to the right, back and forth" grammar of narrative space, discharged from all semantic burden. What remains is a self-sufficient swarm of splinters, fleeting vectors of lost direction, furrowed with the traces of the manual process of production.', 'A tangled network woven with tiny particles of movements broken out of found footage and compiled anew: the elements of the "to the left, to the right, back and forth" grammar of narrative space, discharged from all semantic burden. What remains is a self-sufficient swarm of splinters, fleeting vectors of lost direction, furrowed with the traces of the manual process of production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4FyeiVbZ487heEzdXAU3tzRgck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179837'),
  ('1091421158288344820', 'Many Rivers to Cross', 1955, 'Western, Comedy, Romance', 'Roy Rowland, John F. Seitz, Ridgeway Callow', 'Harry Brown, Guy Trosper', 'Robert Taylor, Eleanor Parker, Victor McLaglen, Jeff Richards, Russ Tamblyn, James Arness, Alan Hale Jr., John Hudson', null, 'Robert Taylor and Eleanor Parker star as a Kentucky backwoodsman and the woman who will NOT let anything interfere with her plans to marry him in this humorous romantic adventure through the American Frontier of 1798.', 'Robert Taylor and Eleanor Parker star as a Kentucky backwoodsman and the woman who will NOT let anything interfere with her plans to marry him in this humorous romantic adventure through the American Frontier of 1798.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyUgt1VbNfBkHLsIGGBPVMXDHB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81512'),
  ('977160303421986110', 'Many Wars Ago', 1970, 'Drama, War', 'Francesco Rosi, Marco Guarnaschelli, Svetislav Pavlović', 'Tonino Guerra, Francesco Rosi, Raffaele La Capria', 'Mark Frechette, Alain Cuny, Gian Maria Volonté, Giampiero Albertini, Pier Paolo Capponi, Franco Graziosi, Mario Feliciani, Alberto Mastino', null, 'Time after time, soldiers of the Italian Army are forced to leave their mountain trenches in attempts to storm an enemy fortress, always with the same disastrous results. As casualties mount, indignation spreads among the rank and file. Disturbed by his superiors'' decisions, Lieutenant Sassu is led to question the purpose of war and reconsider where his real duties lie.', 'Time after time, soldiers of the Italian Army are forced to leave their mountain trenches in attempts to storm an enemy fortress, always with the same disastrous results. As casualties mount, indignation spreads among the rank and file. Disturbed by his superiors'' decisions, Lieutenant Sassu is led to question the purpose of war and reconsider where his real duties lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCqNhRFXmqBMZePXauTLBC5RyfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78101'),
  ('163461863251595401', 'Mao’s Last Dancer', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruce Beresford, Peter James', 'Jan Sardi', 'Amanda Schull, Chi Cao, Chengwu Guo, Wen Bin Huang, Joan Chen, Bruce Greenwood, Kyle MacLachlan, Jack Thompson', 'PG', 'At the age of 11, Li was plucked from a poor Chinese village by Madame Mao''s cultural delegates and taken to Beijing to study ballet. In 1979, during a cultural exchange to Texas, he falls in love with an American woman. Two years later, he managed to defect and went on to perform as a principal dancer for the Houston Ballet and as a principal artist with the Australian Ballet.', 'At the age of 11, Li was plucked from a poor Chinese village by Madame Mao''s cultural delegates and taken to Beijing to study ballet. In 1979, during a cultural exchange to Texas, he falls in love with an American woman. Two years later, he managed to defect and went on to perform as a principal dancer for the Houston Ballet and as a principal artist with the Australian Ballet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvHW6UTlrn60RhyYsoqxXxTPIFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33870'),
  ('537640616857486720', 'Map of the Human Heart', 1993, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, War', 'Vincent Ward, Eduardo Serra', 'Louis Nowra', 'Jason Scott Lee, Robert Joamie, Anne Parillaud, Annie Galipeau, Patrick Bergin, Clotilde Courau, John Cusack, Jeanne Moreau', 'R', 'In an Arctic village in 1931, British mapmaker Walter Russell selects 12-year-old Eskimo Avik as his guide. When the boy contracts tuberculosis, Walter flies him to a Montreal hospital, where Avik meets Albertine and is infatuated. A decade later, a grown Avik encounters Albertine again in London, where he''s serving as a British combat pilot. Despite her relationship with Walter, she and Avik begin an affair.', 'In an Arctic village in 1931, British mapmaker Walter Russell selects 12-year-old Eskimo Avik as his guide. When the boy contracts tuberculosis, Walter flies him to a Montreal hospital, where Avik meets Albertine and is infatuated. A decade later, a grown Avik encounters Albertine again in London, where he''s serving as a British combat pilot. Despite her relationship with Walter, she and Avik begin an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ritKJM436bbvFhXlWKbwKzjs8SM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36709'),
  ('1098442299101388358', 'Map of the Sounds of Tokyo', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Isabel Coixet, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Rinko Kikuchi, Sergi López, Min Tanaka, Manabu Oshio, Takeo Nakahara, Hideo Sakaki', null, 'A Japanese assassin falls in love with the Spanish wine seller she was hired to kill.', 'A Japanese assassin falls in love with the Spanish wine seller she was hired to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXUvJlnQdB8hBiBRumpFj8hj0Wl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46458'),
  ('265068459184420968', 'Mapado', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Choo Chang-min, Baek Dong-hyeon, Park Gun-woo', 'Jo Joong-hoon', 'Lee Moon-sik, Lee Jung-jin, Kil Hae-yeon, Kim Soo-mi, Yeo Un-gye, Kim Eul-dong, Kim Hyung-ja, Seo Young-hee', null, 'A gangster and a corrupt police officer travel to the tiny remote island of Mapado to hunt down a young woman who has run off with a winning lottery ticket. Upon arriving, they discover that no one lives there except for five old women who have not once seen a man for 20 years. Both men soon experience a nightmare of hard labor and harassment.', 'A gangster and a corrupt police officer travel to the tiny remote island of Mapado to hunt down a young woman who has run off with a winning lottery ticket. Upon arriving, they discover that no one lives there except for five old women who have not once seen a man for 20 years. Both men soon experience a nightmare of hard labor and harassment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tgoMsCHWKH6yKemD9WLTWbvrJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153422'),
  ('1070786691277091536', 'Maple Leaf Viewing', 1899, 'Action, Fantasy, Music', 'Tsunekichi Shibata', null, 'Danjuro Ichikawa, Kikugoro Onoe V', null, 'A reel of the Noh drama Momiji-gari, in which Danjuro Ichikawa played opposite Onoe Kikugoro V as an ogress who has disguised herself as the Princess Sarashina. Filmed by Shibata Tsunekichi in the open air on a windy day in November 1899, Danjuro would allow only the one take, so that when his fan blew away in mid-performance the scene had to stay. The film re-emerged at the Kikikan theatre in 1907 where it was a great success and inspired a wave of fiction filmmaking based on traditional Japanese narratives.', 'A reel of the Noh drama Momiji-gari, in which Danjuro Ichikawa played opposite Onoe Kikugoro V as an ogress who has disguised herself as the Princess Sarashina. Filmed by Shibata Tsunekichi in the open air on a windy day in November 1899, Danjuro would allow only the one take, so that when his fan blew away in mid-performance the scene had to stay. The film re-emerged at the Kikikan theatre in 1907 where it was a great success and inspired a wave of fiction filmmaking based on traditional Japanese narratives.', null, 'tmdb:movie:285334'),
  ('648026355429166066', 'Maps and Mistletoe', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Tien, Max McGuire, Johnny Ross', 'W. Stewart', 'Humberly González, Ronnie Rowe, Simon Webster, Justine Christensen, Michael Gordin Shore, Tedd Dillon, Allison Busner, Drew Moss', 'G', 'Emilia Martin, a cartographer of school maps, has plans for a cozy Christmas at home until her boss has a last-minute project for her, designing a novelty treasure map of the North Pole. Emilia decides to seek out the expertise of North Pole explorer Drew Campbell, who reluctantly agrees to help her. As the two work closely, they discover more than either of them ever expected.', 'Emilia Martin, a cartographer of school maps, has plans for a cozy Christmas at home until her boss has a last-minute project for her, designing a novelty treasure map of the North Pole. Emilia decides to seek out the expertise of North Pole explorer Drew Campbell, who reluctantly agrees to help her. As the two work closely, they discover more than either of them ever expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIKM3Tw5pdSoL0pdcXpO5eyxGrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883955'),
  ('528228997321047393', 'Maps to the Stars', 2014, 'Drama', 'David Cronenberg, Peter Suschitzky, Jack Boem', 'Bruce Wagner', 'Julianne Moore, Mia Wasikowska, Robert Pattinson, John Cusack, Evan Bird, Olivia Williams, Sarah Gadon, Kiara Glasco', 'R', 'Driven by an intense need for fame and validation, members of a dysfunctional Hollywood family chase celebrity, one another, and the relentless ghosts of their pasts. Their fragile ecosystem is disrupted by the arrival of Agatha, the scarred and estranged pyromaniac daughter.', 'Driven by an intense need for fame and validation, members of a dysfunctional Hollywood family chase celebrity, one another, and the relentless ghosts of their pasts. Their fragile ecosystem is disrupted by the arrival of Agatha, the scarred and estranged pyromaniac daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoMNfiaMmT7o7wY8oXWCLErZtah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157851'),
  ('275212849416828322', 'Maqbool', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Hemant Chaturvedi', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Abbas Tyrewala', 'Irrfan Khan, Tabu, Pankaj Kapur, Om Puri, Naseeruddin Shah, Piyush Mishra, Ankur Vikal, Ajay Gehi', null, 'The Scottish tragedy ''Macbeth'' set in the contemporary underworld of India''s commercial capital; two corrupt, fortune telling policemen take the roles of the weird sisters, and "Duncan" is Abbaji, the head of a crime family.', 'The Scottish tragedy ''Macbeth'' set in the contemporary underworld of India''s commercial capital; two corrupt, fortune telling policemen take the roles of the weird sisters, and "Duncan" is Abbaji, the head of a crime family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ULTBxnbt0NrWlDm5fahbQooj91.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21265'),
  ('870326496815386351', 'Mar.IA', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Nicanor Loreti, Gabriel Grieco, Mariano Suárez', 'Nicanor Loreti', 'Malena Sánchez, Sofía Gala Castiglione, Juan Palomino, Gabriel Grieco, Demián Salomón, Ezequiel de Almeida, William Prociuk, Daria Panchenko', null, 'Alina is a movie sound engineer. One day she receives an offer to do the direct sound for an erotic film featuring Maria Black, a famous star of the genre who had already retired. When Maria has a heart attack and dies in the middle of the shoot, and the producers decide not to call the police, a series of sinister and unexpected events are unleashed that will endanger everyone''s lives.', 'Alina is a movie sound engineer. One day she receives an offer to do the direct sound for an erotic film featuring Maria Black, a famous star of the genre who had already retired. When Maria has a heart attack and dies in the middle of the shoot, and the producers decide not to call the police, a series of sinister and unexpected events are unleashed that will endanger everyone''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRI4NVCb78WFPq0Dhh2cm5gforG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912032'),
  ('372611846166745778', 'Mara', 2018, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Barnard, Emil Topuzov, Clive Tonge', 'Jonathan Frank', 'Olga Kurylenko, Javier Botet, Mitch Eakins, Lance E. Nichols, Rosie Fellner, Mackenzie Imsand, Dandy Barrett, Craig Conway', 'R', 'Criminal psychologist Kate Fuller is assigned to the murder of a man who has seemingly been strangled in his sleep by his wife and the only witness is their eight-year-old daughter, Sophie. As Kate digs into the mystery of an ancient demon which kills people in their sleep, she experiences the same petrifying symptoms as all previous victims and spirals through a chilling nightmare to save herself and Sophie before she dares fall asleep again.', 'Criminal psychologist Kate Fuller is assigned to the murder of a man who has seemingly been strangled in his sleep by his wife and the only witness is their eight-year-old daughter, Sophie. As Kate digs into the mystery of an ancient demon which kills people in their sleep, she experiences the same petrifying symptoms as all previous victims and spirals through a chilling nightmare to save herself and Sophie before she dares fall asleep again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQDmXAef1Oc1SXci5mui2x5DJwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514277'),
  ('835235342684337853', 'Mara and the Firebringer', 2015, 'Fantasy', 'Tommy Krappweis', 'Tommy Krappweis, Sebastian B. Voss', 'Lilian Prent, Jan Josef Liefers, Esther Schweins, Christoph Maria Herbst, Eva Habermann, Carin C. Tietze, Joseph Hannesschläger, Thomas Fritsch', null, 'Mara Lorbeer, a fifteen year old girl, finds out that she has to save the world because the Norse god Loki is threatening to break free of his chains.', 'Mara Lorbeer, a fifteen year old girl, finds out that she has to save the world because the Norse god Loki is threatening to break free of his chains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2K6nFLxjMxDY9BYW9WNlKpi23Rx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328032'),
