  ('1121283583452416609', 'Mara''akame''s Dream', 2016, 'Drama', 'Federico Cecchetti, Ivan Hernandez, Jessica Villamil', 'Federico Cecchetti', 'Luciano Bautista Maxa Temai, Antonio Parra Haka Temai, Mariana Treviño, Patricio Fernández, Inocencio de la Cruz Domínguez, Pascual Hernández, Paly Omar Ezequiel, Cruz de la Cruz', null, 'Nieri is an indigenous teenage boy from the Wixarika culture, who is being indoctrinated by his father on the path of dreaming to reach the Blue Deer and become a Marakame. However, Nieri doubts about having the gift that is necessary to become a Marakame. His real dream is to play Mexican country music and to go to Mexico City to play there with his friends.', 'Nieri is an indigenous teenage boy from the Wixarika culture, who is being indoctrinated by his father on the path of dreaming to reach the Blue Deer and become a Marakame. However, Nieri doubts about having the gift that is necessary to become a Marakame. His real dream is to play Mexican country music and to go to Mexico City to play there with his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBz1zr2eaTHTAFaauJ0eScU7wk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275257'),
  ('297803185817585153', 'Maracaibo', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Miguel Ángel Rocca', 'Maximiliano González, Miguel Ángel Rocca', 'Jorge Marrale, Mercedes Morán, Nicolás Francella, Alejandro Paker, Matías Mayer', null, 'The crime of Facundo provokes in Gustavo and Cristina, his parents, an irreparable vacuum. The tragedy demonstrates everything that could not be in the link between Gustavo and son and disarms appearances with his wife; Cristina Gustavo undertakes a desperate attempt to understand his guilt: a tortuous guilt that provokes a deep sense of revenge. You need to find the person responsible for that crime.', 'The crime of Facundo provokes in Gustavo and Cristina, his parents, an irreparable vacuum. The tragedy demonstrates everything that could not be in the link between Gustavo and son and disarms appearances with his wife; Cristina Gustavo undertakes a desperate attempt to understand his guilt: a tortuous guilt that provokes a deep sense of revenge. You need to find the person responsible for that crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNjAMONXNx8TrtOem36tYiegq6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450643'),
