  ('729886005755351710', 'Mararía', 1998, 'Drama', 'Antonio José Betancor', 'Carlos Álvarez, Antonio José Betancor', 'Goya Toledo, Carmelo Gómez, Iain Glen, Manuel Manquiña, José Manuel Cervino', null, 'Fermín (Carmelo Gómez) is a Basque doctor who arrives on the island of Lanzarote. Meet a beautiful girl named Mararía (Goya Toledo), which falls in love in silence. One day a handsome Englishman named Beltrahn (Iain Glen) appears, who will win the love of Mararía and unleash the wrath of Fermín, who will lead the lovers to misfortune, destroying himself at the same time and becoming another kind of person, capable to get to kill for love.', 'Fermín (Carmelo Gómez) is a Basque doctor who arrives on the island of Lanzarote. Meet a beautiful girl named Mararía (Goya Toledo), which falls in love in silence. One day a handsome Englishman named Beltrahn (Iain Glen) appears, who will win the love of Mararía and unleash the wrath of Fermín, who will lead the lovers to misfortune, destroying himself at the same time and becoming another kind of person, capable to get to kill for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fZs40mkKwFdSOhpmvn1vTTOyte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186902'),
  ('483454116415728455', 'Marat/Sade', 1967, 'Music, Drama, History', 'David Watkin, Peter Brook, Ariel Levy', 'Adrian Mitchell', 'Patrick Magee, Ian Richardson, Michael Williams, Clifford Rose, Glenda Jackson, Freddie Jones, Hugh Sullivan, John Hussey', 'NR', 'In Charenton Asylum, the Marquis de Sade directs a play about Jean Paul Marat''s death, using the patients as actors. Based on ''The Persecution and Assassination of Jean-Paul Marat as Performed by the Inmates of the Asylum of Charenton Under the Direction of the Marquis de Sade'', a 1963 play by Peter Weiss.', 'In Charenton Asylum, the Marquis de Sade directs a play about Jean Paul Marat''s death, using the patients as actors. Based on ''The Persecution and Assassination of Jean-Paul Marat as Performed by the Inmates of the Asylum of Charenton Under the Direction of the Marquis de Sade'', a 1963 play by Peter Weiss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aucmdXXvqB4uW63K6t7P9sTc1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44258'),
  ('618709948296570219', 'Marathon', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Chung Yoon-chul, Lee Jae-hyuk', 'Song Ye-jin, Chung Yoon-chul, Yoon Jin-ho', 'Cho Seung-woo, Kim Mi-sook, Lee Ki-young, Baek Sung-hyun, Ahn Nae-sang, Jo Young-kwan, Kim Min-ki, Kim Sun-jae', null, 'Cho-won is an autistic but happy young man who loves to draw zebras and run. His mother wants him to feel normal by accomplishing a feat that no one thought his son could achieve. With the help of a coach in exile, she trains him to become a marathon runner.', 'Cho-won is an autistic but happy young man who loves to draw zebras and run. His mother wants him to feel normal by accomplishing a feat that no one thought his son could achieve. With the help of a coach in exile, she trains him to become a marathon runner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqZBClMG9JhyQq5NguKMQmvm8Mk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59423'),
  ('928769274942590293', 'Marathon Man', 1976, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'John Schlesinger, Conrad Hall', 'William Goldman', 'Dustin Hoffman, Laurence Olivier, Roy Scheider, William Devane, Marthe Keller, Fritz Weaver, Richard Bright, Marc Lawrence', 'R', 'A graduate student and obsessive runner in New York is drawn into a mysterious plot involving his brother, a member of the secretive Division.', 'A graduate student and obsessive runner in New York is drawn into a mysterious plot involving his brother, a member of the secretive Division.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPNgubSiri2yvBQRPtP77ViYjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10518'),
  ('71978651505113565', 'Marauders', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Steven C. Miller, Brandon Cox, Karla Strum', 'Michael Cody, Chris Sivertson', 'Bruce Willis, Dave Bautista, Christopher Meloni, Danny A. Abeckaser, Lydia Hull, Tyler Jon Olson, Christopher Rob Bowen, Johnathon Schaech', 'R', 'An untraceable group of elite bank robbers is chased by a suicidal FBI agent who uncovers a deeper purpose behind the robbery-homicides.', 'An untraceable group of elite bank robbers is chased by a suicidal FBI agent who uncovers a deeper purpose behind the robbery-homicides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAvmDn5C7arBoRrfaG3b3Kdue1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359412'),
  ('349216416159627007', 'Maravillas', 1981, 'Drama', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón, Josetxo San Mateo', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón, Luis Megino', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Cristina Marcos, Enrique San Francisco, José Luis Fernández ''Pirri'', Francisco Merino, León Klimovsky, Eduardo MacGregor, Gérard Tichy', null, 'A young Catholic girl takes viewers through a changing Spanish political and social landscape as she develops from her confirmation day to adulthood. Her first experience with the real Spain comes when her Jewish godfathers cannot come to her confirmation. One of the godfathers, using a ring, poses an early challenge to her innocence that puts her in danger. He later returns, indirectly introducing her to a new boyfriend. If he is one of the symbols for Jewish life under Franco, or for a Judeo-Christian interaction, that interaction is complex. The young woman encounters different lovers as she grows into adulthood, but at the same time she is burdened with financially supporting her father and his own rather decadent lifestyle. Again, this difference in generations could be understood as a difference between the "new" and "old" Spain; it is up to the viewers to interpret the story elements as they decide.', 'A young Catholic girl takes viewers through a changing Spanish political and social landscape as she develops from her confirmation day to adulthood. Her first experience with the real Spain comes when her Jewish godfathers cannot come to her confirmation. One of the godfathers, using a ring, poses an early challenge to her innocence that puts her in danger. He later returns, indirectly introducing her to a new boyfriend. If he is one of the symbols for Jewish life under Franco, or for a Judeo-Christian interaction, that interaction is complex. The young woman encounters different lovers as she grows into adulthood, but at the same time she is burdened with financially supporting her father and his own rather decadent lifestyle. Again, this difference in generations could be understood as a difference between the "new" and "old" Spain; it is up to the viewers to interpret the story elements as they decide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lnOV5D2va3v3Cahwxbyv37sC26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179005'),
  ('535768581334612638', 'Marc by Sofia', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Sofia Coppola, Roman Coppola, Jenna Rosher, Shane Sigler', null, 'Marc Jacobs, Spike Jonze, Romy Mars, Eric Nagy, Sofia Coppola', 'PG-13', 'An intimate, unconventional portrait of Marc Jacobs, crafted by Sofia Coppola to capture the genius and singular universe of the iconic American designer.', 'An intimate, unconventional portrait of Marc Jacobs, crafted by Sofia Coppola to capture the genius and singular universe of the iconic American designer.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FoFIW0VvoxPWCC15trTNzaMzpc7r.jpg', 'plex:movie:marc-by-sofia'),
  ('548320096375530555', 'Marc Maron: End Times Fun', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Lynn Shelton', 'Marc Maron', 'Marc Maron', null, 'Marc Maron wades through a swamp of vitamin hustlers, evangelicals and grown male nerd children, culminating in a gleefully filthy end-times fantasy.', 'Marc Maron wades through a swamp of vitamin hustlers, evangelicals and grown male nerd children, culminating in a gleefully filthy end-times fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBf5pWB3NFseW0Go9HR5M73RtD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675595'),
  ('913667592418279433', 'Marcel Reich-Ranicki - Mein Leben', 2009, 'Drama', 'Dror Zahavi', null, 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Katharina Schüttler, Maja Maranow, Joachim Król, Sylvester Groth, Holger Handtke, Henriette Richter-Röhl, Alexander Khuon', null, 'The film tells the early life story of Marcel Reich-Ranicki, who was born in Wloclawek, Poland in 1920. During the Third Reich, the family was in great danger. Nevertheless, he returned to Germany with his wife.', 'The film tells the early life story of Marcel Reich-Ranicki, who was born in Wloclawek, Poland in 1920. During the Third Reich, the family was in great danger. Nevertheless, he returned to Germany with his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUILHTnZjTreRmos7tshgdHYKiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72421'),
  ('806079248383255803', 'Marcel!', 2022, 'Drama', 'Daria D''Antonio, Jasmine Trinca', 'Francesca Manieri, Jasmine Trinca', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Maayane Conti, Giovanna Ralli, Umberto Orsini, Dario Cantarelli, Valentina Cervi, Valeria Golino, Giuseppe Cederna', null, 'The young girl, an insomniac. The mother, an artist. The dog, named Marcel. The little girl loves her mother immensely, but her mother loves Marcel more than anything else. Will an unpredictable event allow those circles of love to reconnect?', 'The young girl, an insomniac. The mother, an artist. The dog, named Marcel. The little girl loves her mother immensely, but her mother loves Marcel more than anything else. Will an unpredictable event allow those circles of love to reconnect?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKSvqodgPZdgMZf1dhm3Vlhirwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919260'),
  ('561018863383722389', 'Marcello Hernandez: American Boy', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Nicholaus Goossen, Seamus Tierney, Peter Maestrey', 'Marcello Hernández', 'Marcello Hernández', 'TV-14', 'Filmed in Miami, Hernández''s special features his comedic take on his first-generation American upbringing before a local audience.', 'Filmed in Miami, Hernández''s special features his comedic take on his first-generation American upbringing before a local audience.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6RWiGwDaCG6nrxC1ZQzWZ8A3wfH.jpg', 'plex:movie:marcello-hernandez-american-boy'),
  ('1006512985292633655', 'Marcello Marcello', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Denis Rabaglia', 'Mark David Hatwood', 'Francesco Mistichelli, Elena Cucci, Alfio Alessi, Luigi Petrazzuolo, Luca Sepe, Rosa Masciopinto', null, 'For the love of the beautiful Elena the young fisherman''s son Marcello turns a whole village upside down.', 'For the love of the beautiful Elena the young fisherman''s son Marcello turns a whole village upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjRr4f0zmygtkzghngnXrYq9dDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86713'),
  ('609380579647291289', 'Marcello Mastroianni: I Remember', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Anna Maria Tatò, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Anna Maria Tatò', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Renato Berta, Manoel de Oliveira, Diogo Dória, Leonor Silveira', null, 'In 1996, Marcello Mastroianni talks about life as an actor. It''s an anecdotal and philosophical memoir, moving from topic to topic, fully conscious of a man "of a certain age" looking back. He tells stories about Fellini and De Sica''s direction, of using irony in performances, of constantly working (an actor tries to find himself in characters). He''s diffident about prizes, celebrates Rome and Paris, salutes Naples and its people. He answers the question, why make bad films; recalls his father and grandfather, carpenters, his mother, deaf in her old age, and his brother, a film editor; he''s modest about his looks. In repose, time''s swift passage holds Mastroianni inward gaze.', 'In 1996, Marcello Mastroianni talks about life as an actor. It''s an anecdotal and philosophical memoir, moving from topic to topic, fully conscious of a man "of a certain age" looking back. He tells stories about Fellini and De Sica''s direction, of using irony in performances, of constantly working (an actor tries to find himself in characters). He''s diffident about prizes, celebrates Rome and Paris, salutes Naples and its people. He answers the question, why make bad films; recalls his father and grandfather, carpenters, his mother, deaf in her old age, and his brother, a film editor; he''s modest about his looks. In repose, time''s swift passage holds Mastroianni inward gaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffRcvOWpRyrs7i2gWsa4WjmrfFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126996'),
  ('552615902243967501', 'Marcello Mio', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rémy Chevrin, Julie Gouet, Christophe Honoré', 'Christophe Honoré', 'Chiara Mastroianni, Catherine Deneuve, Fabrice Luchini, Nicole Garcia, Benjamin Biolay, Melvil Poupaud, Hugh Skinner, Stefania Sandrelli', null, 'Pressured from all sides by the figure of her father, Chiara Mastroianni decides to bring him back to life through her own self. She goes by the name of Marcello, dresses like him and asks to now be considered an actor, not an actress. The people around her believe this to be a temporary joke, but Chiara is determined not to give up her new identity…', 'Pressured from all sides by the figure of her father, Chiara Mastroianni decides to bring him back to life through her own self. She goes by the name of Marcello, dresses like him and asks to now be considered an actor, not an actress. The people around her believe this to be a temporary joke, but Chiara is determined not to give up her new identity…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gr3oOAUYR4ttdYPfd1Nr9bUMCf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145608'),
  ('708164744750237520', 'March Comes In Like a Lion', 1991, 'Drama', 'Hitoshi Yazaki, Isao Ishii, Shin''ichi Ishii', 'Hiroshi Miyazaki, Hitoshi Yazaki', 'Bang-ho Cho, Yoshiko Yura, Kiyomi Itō, Kōen Okumura, Takashi Naito, Sho Saito, Gakuryu Ishii, Shunichi Nagasaki', null, 'The film begins with some Polaroids of a young boy and a young girl. A female voice over tells us who these people are. They are brother and sister, she is seven and he is eight. She goes on to say that when she was seven and he was eight, she told her brother that she would marry him.', 'The film begins with some Polaroids of a young boy and a young girl. A female voice over tells us who these people are. They are brother and sister, she is seven and he is eight. She goes on to say that when she was seven and he was eight, she told her brother that she would marry him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6EFlxKn22l9pf6W7FxFXYvDQqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185725'),
  ('445491922751625273', 'March Comes In Like a Lion', 2017, 'Drama', 'Keishi Otomo, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Ryohei Watanabe, Keishi Otomo, Yuko Iwashita', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Kasumi Arimura, Kana Kurashina, Shota Sometani, Kaya Kiyohara, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Ryo Kase, Gin Maeda', null, 'Rei Kiriyama is a 17-years-old shogi (Japanese chess) player. He debuted as a professional shogi player when he was in middle school. He lives by himself in Tokyo, because his parents and younger sister died in an traffic accident when he was little. One day, Rei Kiriyama meets three sisters who are his neighbors. The three sisters are Akari Kawamoto, Hinata Kawamoto and Momo Kawamoto. This is his first meeting with someone outside of the shogi world in many years. Having meals with the Kawamoto family brings warm feelings to Rei Kiriyama. As Rei Kiriyama continues his shogi career, his interactions with his neighbors allows him to grow as a shogi player and as a person.', 'Rei Kiriyama is a 17-years-old shogi (Japanese chess) player. He debuted as a professional shogi player when he was in middle school. He lives by himself in Tokyo, because his parents and younger sister died in an traffic accident when he was little. One day, Rei Kiriyama meets three sisters who are his neighbors. The three sisters are Akari Kawamoto, Hinata Kawamoto and Momo Kawamoto. This is his first meeting with someone outside of the shogi world in many years. Having meals with the Kawamoto family brings warm feelings to Rei Kiriyama. As Rei Kiriyama continues his shogi career, his interactions with his neighbors allows him to grow as a shogi player and as a person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9L8Erl1cLusUtb3VuNFBNUdiPuR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433892'),
  ('338322918668608296', 'March Goes out Like a Lamb', 2017, 'Drama', 'Keishi Otomo, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Yuko Iwashita, Keishi Otomo, Ryohei Watanabe', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Kasumi Arimura, Kana Kurashina, Shota Sometani, Kaya Kiyohara, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Ryo Kase, Gin Maeda', null, 'The time spent between professional Shogi player Kiriyama and his three stories helps to heal his wounds. As he prepares to secure another win in an upcoming tournament, the father who left the three sisters appears and disturbs the peace.', 'The time spent between professional Shogi player Kiriyama and his three stories helps to heal his wounds. As he prepares to secure another win in an upcoming tournament, the father who left the three sisters appears and disturbs the peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayJzs7pc00FQCXPEwBClD8V6qF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438664'),
  ('333777931547370015', 'March of the Penguins', 2005, 'Documentary, Family', 'Luc Jacquet, Laurent Chalet, Jérôme Maison', 'Jordan Roberts', 'Charles Berling, Romane Bohringer, Jules Sitruk, Morgan Freeman', 'G', 'Every year, thousands of Antarctica''s emperor penguins make an astonishing journey to breed their young. They walk, marching day and night in single file 70 miles into the darkest, driest and coldest continent on Earth. This amazing, true-life tale is touched with humour and alive with thrills. Breathtaking photography captures the transcendent beauty and staggering drama of devoted parent penguins who, in the fierce polar winter, take turns guarding their egg and trekking to the ocean in search of food. Predators hunt them, storms lash them. But the safety of their adorable chicks makes it all worthwhile. So follow the leader... to adventure!!', 'Every year, thousands of Antarctica''s emperor penguins make an astonishing journey to breed their young. They walk, marching day and night in single file 70 miles into the darkest, driest and coldest continent on Earth. This amazing, true-life tale is touched with humour and alive with thrills. Breathtaking photography captures the transcendent beauty and staggering drama of devoted parent penguins who, in the fierce polar winter, take turns guarding their egg and trekking to the ocean in search of food. Predators hunt them, storms lash them. But the safety of their adorable chicks makes it all worthwhile. So follow the leader... to adventure!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9xJ1xG1WKlHkl8ACqq0LShOuMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1667'),
  ('430516675573750953', 'March of the Penguins 2: The Next Step', 2017, 'Documentary, Family, Adventure', 'Jérôme Bouvier, Luc Jacquet', 'Luc Jacquet', 'Lambert Wilson, Morgan Freeman', 'G', 'A young penguin, driven by his instinct, embarks on his first major trip to an unknown destination.', 'A young penguin, driven by his instinct, embarks on his first major trip to an unknown destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XqqYfGRoWYSJ2Mfv2BDFcOWyJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405931'),
  ('299553064676807900', 'March on Rome', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Alfio Contini, Dino De Palma, Dino Risi', 'Ruggero Maccari, Agenore Incrocci, Ghigo De Chiara', 'Vittorio Gassman, Ugo Tognazzi, Roger Hanin, Mario Brega, Angela Luce, Gérard Landry, Alberto Vecchietti, Claudio Perone', null, 'March on Rome (Italian: La marcia su Roma) is a 1962 comedy film by Dino Risi with Vittorio Gassman and Ugo Tognazzi, aimed at describing the March on Rome of Benito Mussolini''s black shirts from the point of view of two newly recruited, naïve black shirts', 'March on Rome (Italian: La marcia su Roma) is a 1962 comedy film by Dino Risi with Vittorio Gassman and Ugo Tognazzi, aimed at describing the March on Rome of Benito Mussolini''s black shirts from the point of view of two newly recruited, naïve black shirts', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23SOvTW0jFAhIcHqew4GyNytHVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76575'),
  ('621336692111170473', 'March on the River Drina', 1964, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Žika Mitrović', null, 'Aleksandar Gavrić, Ljuba Tadić, Nikola Jovanović, Vladimir Popović, Husein Čokić, Branko Pleša, Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić, Strahinja Petrović', null, 'A Serbian artillery battery of the Combined Division makes a forced march to the Cer Mountain in western Serbia to meet Austro-Hungarian troops, who have invaded the country by crossing over the Drina River. A chronicle of the Battle of Cer; a landmark battle of World War I and the first Allied victory over the Central Powers.', 'A Serbian artillery battery of the Combined Division makes a forced march to the Cer Mountain in western Serbia to meet Austro-Hungarian troops, who have invaded the country by crossing over the Drina River. A chronicle of the Battle of Cer; a landmark battle of World War I and the first Allied victory over the Central Powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cw1qDV1XCpPpXBpmJ5LXtBvIZWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230648'),
  ('841626698919730824', 'March or Die', 1977, 'Drama, Adventure, War', 'Dick Richards, John Alcott, David Tomblin', 'David Zelag Goodman', 'Gene Hackman, Terence Hill, Catherine Deneuve, Max von Sydow, Ian Holm, Jack O''Halloran, Rufus, Marcel Bozzuffi', 'PG', 'Just after World War I, Major Foster is incorporating new recruits into his French Foreign Legion platoon when he is sent to his former remote outpost located in the French Morocco to protect an archaeological excavation from El Krim, a Rifian leader who intends to unite all local tribes to fight the colonial government…', 'Just after World War I, Major Foster is incorporating new recruits into his French Foreign Legion platoon when he is sent to his former remote outpost located in the French Morocco to protect an archaeological excavation from El Krim, a Rifian leader who intends to unite all local tribes to fight the colonial government…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jW21NrRlcrA4kucmD9hfnPbQEvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25388'),
  ('667811441990109659', 'Marche à l''ombre', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Michel Blanc, Eduardo Serra, Étienne Dhaene', 'Michel Blanc, Patrick Dewolf', 'Michel Blanc, Gérard Lanvin, Sophie Duez, François Berléand, Bernard Farcy, Mimi Félixine, Béatrice Camurat, Katrine Boorman', null, 'Two friends, one a musician the other constantly depressed wander around Greece and France till they get to Paris without a penny to their name. Here they spend nights in the underground, and squat in houses with the African immigrants. One day they both fall in love with Mathilde a blond dancer and follow her to New York.', 'Two friends, one a musician the other constantly depressed wander around Greece and France till they get to Paris without a penny to their name. Here they spend nights in the underground, and squat in houses with the African immigrants. One day they both fall in love with Mathilde a blond dancer and follow her to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Vr7N7edmLZRpv0rHy7SjTHLSu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55976'),
  ('1152749741968697036', 'Marching in Darkness', 1996, 'Drama', 'Massimo Spano, Bruno Cascio', 'Massimo Spano, Claudio Lizza', 'Jean-Marc Barr, Massimo Dapporto, Thomas Kretschmann, Ottavia Piccolo, Flavio Albanese, Roberto Citran, Bruno Corazzari, Franco Interlenghi', null, 'A young recruit to the Italian army discovers and rejects the seedy world of soldiers who prostitute themselves to supplement their income. But before leaving this world he is raped by a highly-respected senior officer and must decide whether to risk bringing proceedings against him.', 'A young recruit to the Italian army discovers and rejects the seedy world of soldiers who prostitute themselves to supplement their income. But before leaving this world he is raped by a highly-respected senior officer and must decide whether to risk bringing proceedings against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7AXIwucYt3Rj7z8vXN3zI17EFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385181'),
  ('675010292275819776', 'Marching Powder', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Romance', 'Nick Love, Simon Stolland', 'Nick Love', 'Danny Dyer, Stephanie Leonidas, Calum MacNab, Arty Dyer, Bailey Patrick, Lex Shrapnel, Janet Kumah, Geoff Bell', null, 'Middle-aged Jack, arrested for drugs, strives in six weeks to repair his marriage, curb a bullying in-law, and guide his stepbrother in the right direction, but all efforts fail as his life spirals further out of control.', 'Middle-aged Jack, arrested for drugs, strives in six weeks to repair his marriage, curb a bullying in-law, and guide his stepbrother in the right direction, but all efforts fail as his life spirals further out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDzRpQpzNE0W8hwbJMQuMLzcbVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1253003'),
  ('951959772637861360', 'Marci X', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Richard Benjamin, Robbie Greenberg, Julie A. Bloom', 'Paul Rudnick', 'Lisa Kudrow, Damon Wayans, Richard Benjamin, Jane Krakowski, Christine Baranski, Paula Garcés, Charles Kimbrough, Veanne Cox', 'R', 'Marci Feld, a pampered Jewish-American Princess, doesn’t know about rap or the business world. But everything changes after rapper Dr. S releases a controversial CD for the hard-core hip-hop record label owned by Marci’s father. After a national protest breaks out to boycott the new CD and the record label, her father is hospitalized by a heart attack. Marci decides to step in to save his reputation and the family business by taming the raunchy rapper''s wild bad boy image.', 'Marci Feld, a pampered Jewish-American Princess, doesn’t know about rap or the business world. But everything changes after rapper Dr. S releases a controversial CD for the hard-core hip-hop record label owned by Marci’s father. After a national protest breaks out to boycott the new CD and the record label, her father is hospitalized by a heart attack. Marci decides to step in to save his reputation and the family business by taming the raunchy rapper''s wild bad boy image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gDhnXFVARqa5F2sCZdelDhiVjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32316'),
  ('53351999930894377', 'Marco', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Haneef Adeni, Chandru Selvaraj, Anirudh Padmanabhan', 'Haneef Adeni', 'Unni Mukundan, Siddique, Ishan Shoukath, Jagadish, Abhimanyu Thilakan, Kabir Duhan Singh, Anson Paul, Ajit Koshy', 'R', 'The adoptive son of the Adattu family, Marco, sets off on a ruthless quest for vengeance after his brother is brutally murdered, finding only betrayal, loss and unimaginable brutality at every step.', 'The adoptive son of the Adattu family, Marco, sets off on a ruthless quest for vengeance after his brother is brutally murdered, finding only betrayal, loss and unimaginable brutality at every step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/il3ao5gcF6fZNqo1o9o7lusmEyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186350'),
  ('741280565523352464', 'Marco Luque - We are together', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Marco Luque', null, 'Eclectic character comedian Marco Luque plays himself in this stand-up special about relationships, regional differences and his own love of movies.', 'Eclectic character comedian Marco Luque plays himself in this stand-up special about relationships, regional differences and his own love of movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lETnDVbznntrmYkRYxK2w1cJYSK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461980'),
  ('555367585025922325', 'Marco Polo', 2007, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Kevin Connor, Thomas Burstyn', 'Ron Hutchinson', 'Ian Somerhalder, BD Wong, Desiree Ann Siahaan, Brian Dennehy, Lim Kay Tong, Christian Lee, Luo Yan, Alan Shearman', 'PG', 'Assigned to accompany two priests on a mission to convert the court of Kublai Khan to Christianity, Marco Polo is abandoned in the mountains when the priests, doubting the very existence of China, turn back. Polo eventually pushes bravely forth alone toward the fabled country where he is accepted as an envoy into Khan''s court. Marooned on the far side of the world, Polo, accompanied by his servant, Pedro, advances as a Mongol grandee for twenty extraordinary years. What he eventually brings back with him to the West is a chronicle that changed history forever.', 'Assigned to accompany two priests on a mission to convert the court of Kublai Khan to Christianity, Marco Polo is abandoned in the mountains when the priests, doubting the very existence of China, turn back. Polo eventually pushes bravely forth alone toward the fabled country where he is accepted as an envoy into Khan''s court. Marooned on the far side of the world, Polo, accompanied by his servant, Pedro, advances as a Mongol grandee for twenty extraordinary years. What he eventually brings back with him to the West is a chronicle that changed history forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zG2hugRwC2x44IeI3CtOKiLBUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59557'),
  ('181326717391001307', 'Marco Polo: One Hundred Eyes', 2015, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Alik Sakharov, Gavin Struthers, Edd Bennetto', 'John Fusco', 'Tom Wu, Masayoshi Haneda, Benedict Wong, Michelle Yeoh', null, 'A defiant warrior-monk arrives at Kublai Khan''s court in chains and soon earns his tragic nickname in this 30-minute origin story.', 'A defiant warrior-monk arrives at Kublai Khan''s court in chains and soon earns his tragic nickname in this 30-minute origin story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0rxzDimOAX5QL9jSBz1CsSZpWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372981'),
  ('264184001429146958', 'Marco the Magnificent', 1965, 'Adventure', 'Denys de La Patellière, Raoul Lévy, Wladimir Ivanov', 'Noël Howard, Denys de La Patellière, Jean-Paul Rappeneau', 'Horst Buchholz, Anthony Quinn, Orson Welles, Bruno Cremer, Omar Sharif, Robert Hossein, Akim Tamiroff, Elsa Martinelli', null, 'Young Marco Polo travels to China to help Kublai Khan fight against rebels, headed by his own son, with a new invention: gunpowder.', 'Young Marco Polo travels to China to help Kublai Khan fight against rebels, headed by his own son, with a new invention: gunpowder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47bW5T9oxJrmaIO1d3WNcCbv0RJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131384'),
  ('164514274466749983', 'Marco: The Invented Truth', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Aitor Arregi, Jon Garaño, Javier Agirre Erauso', 'Jon Garaño, Aitor Arregi, Jose Mari Goenaga', 'Eduard Fernández, Nathalie Poza, Sonia Almarcha, Daniela Brown, Chani Martín, Júlia Molins, Fermí Reixach, Jordi Rico', null, 'Enric Marco, a Spanish trade unionist, claims to be a survivor of Nazi concentration camps.', 'Enric Marco, a Spanish trade unionist, claims to be a survivor of Nazi concentration camps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5trCq9c5rlZf5QJKM6iQHMA7u6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195100'),
  ('524945122803275194', 'Mard', 1985, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Manmohan Desai', 'K.K. Shukla', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Amrita Singh, Dara Singh, Prem Chopra, Nirupa Roy, Goga Kapoor, Kamal Kapoor, Bob Christo', null, 'King Azad gets locked in a dungeon by the British general Dyer who wants to take over his kingdom. Years later, Azad''s son decides to put an end to Dyer''s tyranny and comes to his father''s rescue.', 'King Azad gets locked in a dungeon by the British general Dyer who wants to take over his kingdom. Years later, Azad''s son decides to put an end to Dyer''s tyranny and comes to his father''s rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GF0wzkQd1LcecHkuwe0BFulC2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223091'),
  ('638506332989805925', 'Mardaani', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Pradeep Sarkar, Artur Żurawski', 'Vibha Singh, Gopi Puthran', 'Rani Mukerji, Tahir Raj Bhasin, Jisshu Sengupta, Sanjay Taneja, Mona Ambegaonkar, Priyanka Sharma, Anil George, Aman Uppal', null, 'A Mumbai police officer''s search for a missing teenage girl leads her to the depraved world of child trafficking. What follows is a cat-and-mouse game between the officer and a ruthless mafia kingpin.', 'A Mumbai police officer''s search for a missing teenage girl leads her to the depraved world of child trafficking. What follows is a cat-and-mouse game between the officer and a ruthless mafia kingpin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fD1zfYXgMbDkgIt9ZrHfte6mWHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287767'),
  ('122852854782442019', 'Mardaani 2', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Gopi Puthran, Pratishtha Sehgal, Kshitij Singh Lakhawat', 'Gopi Puthran', 'Rani Mukerji, Vishal Jethwa, Rajesh Sharma, Shruti Bapna, Vikram Singh Chauhan, Jisshu Sengupta, Prasanna Ketkar, Anurag Sharma', null, 'Officer Shivani Shivaji Roy is stationed at Kota where she goes against a ferocious serial killer who rapes and murders women.', 'Officer Shivani Shivaji Roy is stationed at Kota where she goes against a ferocious serial killer who rapes and murders women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oChaDVWUy5tfpKRYTPzrJxp3YC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591101'),
