  ('313681745531931850', 'Mardi Gras Massacre', 1978, 'Horror', 'Don Piel, Jack Weis, Jack McGowan', 'Jack Weis', 'Curt Dawson, Gwen Arment, William Metzo, Laura Misch Owens, Cathryn Lacey, Nancy Dancer, Butch Benit, Wayne Mack', 'NR', 'Police try to capture someone who is commiting ritual murders of women during Mardi Gras in New Orleans.', 'Police try to capture someone who is commiting ritual murders of women during Mardi Gras in New Orleans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8dXisOBFbff2dkMpAERjnix0As.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58644'),
  ('1135855787201956436', 'Mardi Gras: Spring Break', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Phil Dornfeld, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Josh Heald', 'Nicholas D''Agosto, Josh Gad, Bret Harrison, Danneel Ackles, Arielle Kebbel, Carmen Electra, Regina Hall, Gary Grubbs', 'R', 'For three college guys, it’s senior year and the co-ed experience has left them high and dry. Their solution: A road trip to Mardi Gras, where beautiful babes are happy to lift their shirts and open containers are always welcome. But after dressing in drag, breaking into Carmen Electra’s hotel room, starring in a scandalous sex show and accidentally exploding a feces bomb in a swank hotel lobby, will the Mardi Gras magic kick in and their wildest fantasies come true?', 'For three college guys, it’s senior year and the co-ed experience has left them high and dry. Their solution: A road trip to Mardi Gras, where beautiful babes are happy to lift their shirts and open containers are always welcome. But after dressing in drag, breaking into Carmen Electra’s hotel room, starring in a scandalous sex show and accidentally exploding a feces bomb in a swank hotel lobby, will the Mardi Gras magic kick in and their wildest fantasies come true?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFcWzKt2Sbt8GRJGHvSWkbHulU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58231'),
  ('683248835980976038', 'Mardock Scramble: The First Compression', 2010, 'Thriller, Animation, Action, Drama', 'Susumu Kudo, Toru Fukushi', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Norito Yashima, Hiroki Touchi, Kazuya Nakai, Tsutomu Isobe, Kenta Miyake, Masahiko Tanaka, Mika Kanai', 'NR', 'Rune Ballot is a down-and-out teen prostitute in Mardock City. One day, she''s picked up by an ambitious casino manager named Shell who gives her everything she could want. Renewed by a false innocence, a false past, and now the false life Shell has given her, Ballot feels grateful. However, she can''t help but be curious about why he''s done so much for her, so she does some research about his past on a computer. This turns out to be a mistake which will change her life greatly. When Shell finds out what she''s done, he attempts to burn her to death by blowing up her car.', 'Rune Ballot is a down-and-out teen prostitute in Mardock City. One day, she''s picked up by an ambitious casino manager named Shell who gives her everything she could want. Renewed by a false innocence, a false past, and now the false life Shell has given her, Ballot feels grateful. However, she can''t help but be curious about why he''s done so much for her, so she does some research about his past on a computer. This turns out to be a mistake which will change her life greatly. When Shell finds out what she''s done, he attempts to burn her to death by blowing up her car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdeuUQGv0nZMnztMUjzrxlG0nnN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73529'),
  ('663001548273128537', 'Mardock Scramble: The Second Combustion', 2011, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Susumu Kudo, Toru Fukushi, Jun Nakai', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Norito Yashima, Tsutomu Isobe, Hiroki Touchi, Kazuya Nakai, Takaya Hashi, Toshiko Fujita, Akiko Katsuta', 'R', 'Second film of the Mardock Scramble series. Balot and a severely injured Oeufcoque seem to be at the mercy of an obsessed Boiled. Dr. Easter comes to the rescue and the group escapes to "Paradise" where many secrets of Mardock lie and where Balot will need to come to a decision herself about what she will and can do.', 'Second film of the Mardock Scramble series. Balot and a severely injured Oeufcoque seem to be at the mercy of an obsessed Boiled. Dr. Easter comes to the rescue and the group escapes to "Paradise" where many secrets of Mardock lie and where Balot will need to come to a decision herself about what she will and can do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pT03GGpr6lUiIEtMwMqzna7NHht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73530'),
  ('787914553316922416', 'Mardock Scramble: The Third Exhaust', 2012, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Susumu Kudo, Toru Fukushi, Jun Nakai', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Hiroki Touchi, Kazuya Nakai, Norito Yashima, Tsutomu Isobe, Takaya Hashi, Toshiko Fujita', 'R', 'Third film of the Mardock Scramble series. Rune Balot goes to a casino connected to the October corporation to try to wrap up her case once and for all.', 'Third film of the Mardock Scramble series. Rune Balot goes to a casino connected to the October corporation to try to wrap up her case once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sZkW8mDO5Gre1pILdRYc9AGd4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122662'),
