  ('64464755131635483', 'Marebito', 2004, 'Horror', 'Takashi Shimizu, Tsukasa Tanabe', 'Chiaki J. Konaka', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Tomomi Miyashita, Kazuhiro Nakahara, Miho Ninagawa, Shun Sugata, Masayoshi Haneda, Ayumu Saito, Kaori Fujii', null, 'A fear-obsessed freelance cameraman investigates an urban legend involving mysterious spirits that haunt the subways of Tokyo.', 'A fear-obsessed freelance cameraman investigates an urban legend involving mysterious spirits that haunt the subways of Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1KyQx8mHwxQHTQgJDra84RfTYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52398'),
  ('1046835744732994101', 'Marecek, Pass Me the Pen!', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Aleš Dospiva, Jiří Macák', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Ladislav Smoljak', 'Jiří Sovák, Míla Myslíková, Jiří Schmitzer, Václav Lohniský, Iva Janžurová, Josef Kemr, Ladislav Smoljak, Zdeněk Svěrák', null, 'This comedy is about one average family. The father works as master in the factory and his son is studying on high school. One day father must start to visit the evening school. It''s the same school as his son visiting. The lives both students are connecting together. The son must teach the math and physics his own father. The father getting to know, that the life of the students is not simple as he supposed.', 'This comedy is about one average family. The father works as master in the factory and his son is studying on high school. One day father must start to visit the evening school. It''s the same school as his son visiting. The lives both students are connecting together. The son must teach the math and physics his own father. The father getting to know, that the life of the students is not simple as he supposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ntcRPK1xXsh9Bdmv0wTRV7qSrJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75023'),
  ('384443836464408933', 'Marfa Girl', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Larry Clark, David Newbert', 'Larry Clark', 'Adam Mediano, Drake Burnette, Jeremy St. James, Mary Farley, Mercedes Maxwell, Indigo Rael, Tina Rodriguez, Ulysses Lopez', null, 'A disaffected Texas teen spends his 16th birthday getting high, hanging out and having casual sex.', 'A disaffected Texas teen spends his 16th birthday getting high, hanging out and having casual sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSfvmK5XFKUVn6k869lG1UUAMfF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137174'),
  ('1070348319816561047', 'Margaret', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kenneth Lonergan, Ryszard Lenczewski, Todd Pfeiffer', 'Kenneth Lonergan', 'Anna Paquin, J. Smith-Cameron, Mark Ruffalo, Jeannie Berlin, Jean Reno, Sarah Steele, John Gallagher Jr., Cyrus Hernstadt', 'R', '17-year-old Lisa feels certain that she inadvertently played a role in causing a traffic accident that claimed a woman''s life. In her attempts to set things right, she meets with opposition at every step. Torn apart with frustration, she begins emotionally brutalizing her family, her friends, her teachers, and, most of all, herself. She has been confronted quite unexpectedly with a basic truth: that her youthful ideals are on a collision course with the realities and compromises of the adult world.', '17-year-old Lisa feels certain that she inadvertently played a role in causing a traffic accident that claimed a woman''s life. In her attempts to set things right, she meets with opposition at every step. Torn apart with frustration, she begins emotionally brutalizing her family, her friends, her teachers, and, most of all, herself. She has been confronted quite unexpectedly with a basic truth: that her youthful ideals are on a collision course with the realities and compromises of the adult world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqBao8uRH6TQAJd13tqC22vPB76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44754'),
  ('838813285349501066', 'Margaret''s Museum', 1995, 'Drama', 'Mort Ransen, Darlene Sheils, Vic Sarin', 'Gerald Wexler, Mort Ransen', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Clive Russell, Craig Olejnik, Kate Nelligan, Kenneth Welsh, Andrea Morris, Paul Young', null, 'In a town where half the men die down the coalpit, Margaret MacNeil is quite happy being single in her small Cape Breton island town. Until she meets Neil Currie, a charming and sincere bagpipe-playing, Gaelic-speaking dishwasher. But no matter what you do, you can''t avoid the spectre of the pit forever.', 'In a town where half the men die down the coalpit, Margaret MacNeil is quite happy being single in her small Cape Breton island town. Until she meets Neil Currie, a charming and sincere bagpipe-playing, Gaelic-speaking dishwasher. But no matter what you do, you can''t avoid the spectre of the pit forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulhih7Th6S9zuhR5kOiVdCm8Il4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71754'),
  ('195974534491136282', 'Margarita with a Straw', 2015, 'Drama', 'Shonali Bose, Anne Misawa, Nilesh Maniyar', 'Nilesh Maniyar', 'Kalki Koechlin, Revathi, Sayani Gupta, Hussain Dalal, William Moseley, Kuljeet Singh, Malhar Khushu, Tenzing Dalha', null, 'A rebellious young woman with cerebral palsy leaves India to study in New York. On her journey of self-discovery, she unexpectedly falls in love.', 'A rebellious young woman with cerebral palsy leaves India to study in New York. On her journey of self-discovery, she unexpectedly falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cY2MKU0EBZye6wAfWadA3oecy8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287499'),
  ('995852439377912786', 'Margaux', 2022, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Steven C. Miller, Neil Cervin', 'Chris Sivertson, Nick Waters, Chris Beyrooty', 'Jedidiah Goodacre, Madison Pettis, Vanessa Morgan, Richard Harmon, Lochlyn Munro, Phoebe Miu, Jordan Buhat, Brittany Mitchell', 'R', 'As a group of seniors celebrate their final college days at a smart house, the house''s highly advanced AI system, Margaux, begins to take on a deadly presence of her own. A carefree weekend of partying turns into a dystopian nightmare as they realize Margaux''s plans to eliminate her tenants one way or another. Time begins to run out as the group desperately tries to survive and outsmart the smart home.', 'As a group of seniors celebrate their final college days at a smart house, the house''s highly advanced AI system, Margaux, begins to take on a deadly presence of her own. A carefree weekend of partying turns into a dystopian nightmare as they realize Margaux''s plans to eliminate her tenants one way or another. Time begins to run out as the group desperately tries to survive and outsmart the smart home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNzgeMetu9l4q9NDw7gtiUFwPOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846778'),
  ('169541149861652063', 'Margaux Hartmann', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ludovic Bergery, Martin Roux', 'Ludovic Bergery, Julien Boivent', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Vincent Dedienne, Tibo Vandenborre, Éva Ionesco, Sandor Funtek, Nelson Delapalme, Marie Zabukovec, Arthur Verret', null, 'Recently widowed fifty-something Margaux looks to start chapter two. Moving in with her sister, she re-enrolls at university for pursuits she’d never realized. However, Margaux begins to experience another kind of awakening, the compulsions of which begin to take over.', 'Recently widowed fifty-something Margaux looks to start chapter two. Moving in with her sister, she re-enrolls at university for pursuits she’d never realized. However, Margaux begins to experience another kind of awakening, the compulsions of which begin to take over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdhtxumxqFwBHhXNkaGy2NqPMqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660949'),
  ('616040577690439721', 'Margen de error', 2019, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Liliana Paolinelli', 'Liliana Paolinelli', 'Susana Pampín, Camila Plaate, María Pessacq, Victoria Carreras, Mónica Gonzaga, Elvira Onetto, Daniela Pal, Eva Bianco', null, 'Iris'' quiet and peaceful life begins to change dramatically when she hosts Maia, her friend''s daughter. When Iris realizes that Maia is in love with an older woman, she begins to wonder if she herself might be that woman.', 'Iris'' quiet and peaceful life begins to change dramatically when she hosts Maia, her friend''s daughter. When Iris realizes that Maia is in love with an older woman, she begins to wonder if she herself might be that woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHP2GZcIQN42L8Gpb8m8znxOt6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594226'),
  ('586842622423816943', 'Margherita delle stelle', 2024, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Giuseppe Riccobene, Cristina Corna, Giulio Base', null, 'Cristiana Capotondi, Flavio Parenti, Cesare Bocci, Sandra Ceccarelli, Giulia Battistini, Caterina Rossi, Francesca Orsini, Mario Grossi', null, 'The life of astrophysics Margherita Hack, from curious child to unconventional girl at the direction of the Trieste Astronomical Observatory.', 'The life of astrophysics Margherita Hack, from curious child to unconventional girl at the direction of the Trieste Astronomical Observatory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ak4V6fWZiSpW9AKFKZMkiYYSAm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155918'),
  ('172192914195483893', 'Margin Call', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama', 'J.C. Chandor, Frankie DeMarco, Kamen Velkovsky', 'J.C. Chandor', 'Kevin Spacey, Zachary Quinto, Paul Bettany, Jeremy Irons, Simon Baker, Penn Badgley, Demi Moore, Stanley Tucci', 'R', 'Set in the high-stakes world of the financial industry, involving the key players at an investment firm during one perilous 24-hour period in the early stages of the 2008 financial crisis. An entry-level analyst unlocks information that could prove to be the downfall of the firm.', 'Set in the high-stakes world of the financial industry, involving the key players at an investment firm during one perilous 24-hour period in the early stages of the 2008 financial crisis. An entry-level analyst unlocks information that could prove to be the downfall of the firm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtO57obCJuUBS0en3HLgFgZ19Xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50839'),
  ('597783494673222371', 'Margins', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Veridiani, Niccolò Falsetti', 'Francesco Turbanti, Niccolò Falsetti, Tommaso Renzoni', 'Francesco Turbanti, Emanuele Linfatti, Matteo Creatini, Valentina Carnelutti, Nicola Rignanese, Paolo Cioni, Aurora Malianni, Silvia D''Amico', null, 'Summer 2008. Three friends have the chance of a lifetime: opening for their favourite punk hardcore band. At the very last moment, the concert falls through but Edo, Iac and Miche don’t give up. To them punk is more than music, it’s a lifestyle. In a blink, they decide to bring the gig to Grosseto, the silent and conservative city where they live. Nevertheless, all the difficulties and problems they face on their way risk to blow up their lives and their friendship.', 'Summer 2008. Three friends have the chance of a lifetime: opening for their favourite punk hardcore band. At the very last moment, the concert falls through but Edo, Iac and Miche don’t give up. To them punk is more than music, it’s a lifestyle. In a blink, they decide to bring the gig to Grosseto, the silent and conservative city where they live. Nevertheless, all the difficulties and problems they face on their way risk to blow up their lives and their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xFgBFYyznqGxiyU12qEJcZpdD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840119'),
  ('1089987257572425289', 'Margot at the Wedding', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Noah Baumbach, Harris Savides', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Nicole Kidman, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Jack Black, John Turturro, Ciarán Hinds, Zane Pais, Flora Cross, Halley Feiffer', 'R', 'Margot Zeller is a short story writer with a sharp wit and an even sharper tongue. On the eve of her estranged sister Pauline''s wedding to unemployed musician/artist/depressive Malcolm at the family seaside home, Margot shows up unexpectedly to rekindle the sisterly bond and offer her own brand of support. What ensues is a nakedly honest and subversively funny look at family dynamics.', 'Margot Zeller is a short story writer with a sharp wit and an even sharper tongue. On the eve of her estranged sister Pauline''s wedding to unemployed musician/artist/depressive Malcolm at the family seaside home, Margot shows up unexpectedly to rekindle the sisterly bond and offer her own brand of support. What ensues is a nakedly honest and subversively funny look at family dynamics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmR1TBIur00or8JgyNkycHekfxb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13998'),
  ('498331558771203592', 'Margrete: Queen of the North', 2021, 'History, Drama', 'Charlotte Sieling, Rasmus Videbæk', 'Charlotte Sieling, Jesper Fink, Maya Ilsøe', 'Trine Dyrholm, Søren Malling, Morten Hee Andersen, Jakob Oftebro, Bjørn Floberg, Magnus Krepper, Thomas W. Gabrielsson, Agnes Westerlund Rase', null, '1402. Queen Margrete I has gathered the Nordic kingdoms in a union, ruled through her adopted son, Erik. But a conspiracy is in the making and Margrete finds herself in an impossible dilemma that could shatter her life''s work: The Kalmar Union.', '1402. Queen Margrete I has gathered the Nordic kingdoms in a union, ruled through her adopted son, Erik. But a conspiracy is in the making and Margrete finds herself in an impossible dilemma that could shatter her life''s work: The Kalmar Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vurl6gQWmoDAWp0kYSBs2W0Z5WQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659370'),
  ('809584842755918699', 'Marguerite', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Xavier Giannoli, Glynn Speeckaert, Tomáš Pavlacký', 'Xavier Giannoli, Marcia Romano', 'Catherine Frot, André Marcon, Michel Fau, Christa Théret, Denis Mpunga, Sylvain Dieuaide, Aubert Fenoy, Sophia Leboutte', null, 'Paris in the 1920s. Marguerite Dumont is a wealthy woman with a passion for music and the opera. For years, she has performed regularly for a circle of guests. But Marguerite sings tragically out of tune and no one has ever told her. Her husband and her close friends have always encouraged her in her illusions. Things become very complicated the day she gets it into her head to perform in front of a genuine public, at the Opera.', 'Paris in the 1920s. Marguerite Dumont is a wealthy woman with a passion for music and the opera. For years, she has performed regularly for a circle of guests. But Marguerite sings tragically out of tune and no one has ever told her. Her husband and her close friends have always encouraged her in her illusions. Things become very complicated the day she gets it into her head to perform in front of a genuine public, at the Opera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfIleyisIzYfvUNXTLIfJjHiJz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352157'),
  ('1032468357115909064', 'Marguerite', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marc Simpson-Threlford, Marianne Farley', 'Marianne Farley', 'Béatrice Picard, Sandrine Bisson', null, 'An aging woman and her nurse develop a friendship that inspires her to unearth unacknowledged longing, and thus help her make peace with her past.', 'An aging woman and her nurse develop a friendship that inspires her to unearth unacknowledged longing, and thus help her make peace with her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gsaXWy2gVfy6sBaHgAdaLtaZvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487625'),
  ('2558099408108700', 'Marguerite & Julien', 2015, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Valérie Donzelli, Céline Bozon', 'Valérie Donzelli, Jérémie Elkaïm, Gilles Marchand', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Jérémie Elkaïm, Aurélia Petit, Frédéric Pierrot, Geraldine Chaplin, Sami Frey, Raoul Fernandez, Esther Garrel', null, 'Julien and Marguerite de Ravalet, son and daughter of the Lord of Tourlaville, have loved each other tenderly since childhood. But as they grow up, their affection veers toward voracious passion.', 'Julien and Marguerite de Ravalet, son and daughter of the Lord of Tourlaville, have loved each other tenderly since childhood. But as they grow up, their affection veers toward voracious passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUUJ8gTY4wJGTKHgQqQe9fM4fLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330294'),
  ('1097431884428588611', 'Marguerite of the Night', 1955, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Jacques Natteau', 'Gabriel Arout, Ghislaine Autant-Lara', 'Michèle Morgan, Yves Montand, Jean-François Calvé, Massimo Girotti, Jacques Clancy, Jean Debucourt, Louis Seigner, Pierre Palau', null, 'It tells the story of an older pedant who buys adolescence from Satan.', 'It tells the story of an older pedant who buys adolescence from Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hI6bebmzP6PUPAwIFfWeeQqsxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85902'),
  ('139236410129832810', 'Marguerite''s Theorem', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Anna Novion, Jacques Girault', 'Agnès Feuvre, Marie-Stéphane Imbert, Mathieu Robin', 'Ella Rumpf, Julien Frison, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Sonia Bonny, Clotilde Courau, Édouard Sulpice, Idir Azougli, Xiaoxing Cheng', null, 'The future of Marguerite, a brilliant student in Mathematics at the prestigious Ecole Normale Supérieure, seems all planned out. The only woman from her year, Marguerite is finishing a thesis she has to present to an audience of researchers. On the big day, a mistake shakes all her certainties and all her foundations collapse.', 'The future of Marguerite, a brilliant student in Mathematics at the prestigious Ecole Normale Supérieure, seems all planned out. The only woman from her year, Marguerite is finishing a thesis she has to present to an audience of researchers. On the big day, a mistake shakes all her certainties and all her foundations collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJ8OaSqXxlFnmb2SbHHcahMYfQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960033'),
  ('137236226468605623', 'Mari-Cookie and the Killer Tarantula', 1998, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Michelle Bauer, Linnea Quigley, Amber Newman, Analía Ivars, Robert King, Pedro Temboury, Mavi Tienda', 'NR', 'Down at the docks a very enterprising but dangerous element is making life miserable for Sheriff Marga. But she is distracted by a series of puzzling kidnappings that is plaguing her parish. Could the culprit be the mysterious Queen - the dance hall queen of the docks? Or could it be an even more sinister figure: The Killer Tarantula?', 'Down at the docks a very enterprising but dangerous element is making life miserable for Sheriff Marga. But she is distracted by a series of puzzling kidnappings that is plaguing her parish. Could the culprit be the mysterious Queen - the dance hall queen of the docks? Or could it be an even more sinister figure: The Killer Tarantula?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4RhUuEeYSQEZiJrKSy2MdTis2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30729'),
  ('783757577684161009', 'Maria', 1988, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Maria Semionovna Voinova', null, 'A requiem for a Russian peasant woman, Maria Semionovna Voinova. The film is in two chapters. The first chapter consists of an impression of Maria Semionovna, scenes of the colours of summer time: hay–making, bathing in a river, work in the flax fields and a holiday in the Crimea. The second chapter, set nine years later, is in black and white and deals with how Maria Semionovna''s life ended. The mood is one of a sad and elegiac narration.', 'A requiem for a Russian peasant woman, Maria Semionovna Voinova. The film is in two chapters. The first chapter consists of an impression of Maria Semionovna, scenes of the colours of summer time: hay–making, bathing in a river, work in the flax fields and a holiday in the Crimea. The second chapter, set nine years later, is in black and white and deals with how Maria Semionovna''s life ended. The mood is one of a sad and elegiac narration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKqXWvYoH3AR9fpn3S58RTVKrMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326038'),
  ('234814286107632196', 'Maria', 2019, 'Action, Crime', 'Pedring Lopez, Pao Orendain, Kristine Joi A. Bayan', 'Rex Lopez, Yz Carbonell', 'Cristine Reyes, Ivan Padilla, KC Montero, Ronnie Lazaro, Freddie Webb, Guji Lorenzana, Johanna Rish Tongcua, Jennifer Lee', null, 'When a former BlackRose cartel assassin deliberately betrays them by refusing to complete her mission, the cartel orders her execution. Unbeknownst to them, she fakes her own death and is able to create a new life of her own. When the cartel discovers she is alive, the hunter becomes the hunted as she fights to get revenge on those who took her new life away from her.', 'When a former BlackRose cartel assassin deliberately betrays them by refusing to complete her mission, the cartel orders her execution. Unbeknownst to them, she fakes her own death and is able to create a new life of her own. When the cartel discovers she is alive, the hunter becomes the hunted as she fights to get revenge on those who took her new life away from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJ1ePsQmB984EvTOaKXfIliKsCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591121'),
  ('294055357682933695', 'Maria', 2024, 'History, Drama, Music', 'Edward Lachman, Pablo Larraín, Anna Döbrössy', 'Steven Knight', 'Angelina Jolie, Pierfrancesco Favino, Alba Rohrwacher, Haluk Bilginer, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Stephen Ashfield, Valeria Golino, Caspar Phillipson', 'R', 'Maria Callas, the world''s greatest opera singer, lives the last days of her life in 1970s Paris, as she confronts her identity and life.', 'Maria Callas, the world''s greatest opera singer, lives the last days of her life in 1970s Paris, as she confronts her identity and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oQRG0bwPUqE4N4n8z2kAzr7e40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1038263'),
  ('151520378799625362', 'María', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tito Davison, Gabriel Figueroa', null, 'Taryn Power, Fernando Allende, José Suárez, Alicia Caro, Edna Necoechea, María Cecilia Botero, Hernán Bolívar', null, 'Romance melodrama set in 19th century Colombia.', 'Romance melodrama set in 19th century Colombia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLrbJ1Udlj9B9z76JGlkYEzgAw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400472'),
  ('499260462357383157', 'María (and Everybody Else)', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aitor Echeverría, Nely Reguera', 'Nely Reguera, Diego Ameixeiras, Eduard Sola', 'Bárbara Lennie, José Ángel Egido, Pablo Derqui, Vito Sanz, Julián Villagrán, Rocío León, Aixa Villagrán, María Vázquez', null, 'Ever since her mum died when she was fifteen, Maria has taken care of her father and her siblings. Responsible and in control, she''s always been a rock for the family and feels proud of her efforts. That''s why her father''s sudden love for his nurse and the announcement of their marriage brings Maria''s world crashing down around her. At the age of 35 and unable to find a steady partner, she''ll have to take the plunge and dare to change her own fate.', 'Ever since her mum died when she was fifteen, Maria has taken care of her father and her siblings. Responsible and in control, she''s always been a rock for the family and feels proud of her efforts. That''s why her father''s sudden love for his nurse and the announcement of their marriage brings Maria''s world crashing down around her. At the age of 35 and unable to find a steady partner, she''ll have to take the plunge and dare to change her own fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nchyZZosuTD50Du9O42wUAdQyBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415396'),
  ('137744991373623969', 'Maria Candelaria', 1944, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Fernández, Jaime Contreras, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Mauricio Magdaleno, Emilio Fernández', 'Dolores del Río, Pedro Armendáriz, Alberto Galán, Margarita Cortés, Miguel Inclán, Beatriz Ramos, Rafael Icardo, Julio Ahuet', null, 'A young journalist asks an old artist about the portrait of a naked Indian woman that he has in his study. The artist tells the story of Maria Candelaria, a young Indian woman who was rejected by her own people for being the daughter of a prostitute. She is protected by a young Indian man, Lorenzo Rafael, who has fallen in love with her.', 'A young journalist asks an old artist about the portrait of a naked Indian woman that he has in his study. The artist tells the story of Maria Candelaria, a young Indian woman who was rejected by her own people for being the daughter of a prostitute. She is protected by a young Indian man, Lorenzo Rafael, who has fallen in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whd229FgEBmzxZOGgOWffKOcuRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60225'),
  ('129012828876843529', 'Maria Chapdelaine', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michel La Veaux, Sébastien Pilote, Ludovic Poirot', 'Sébastien Pilote', 'Sara Montpetit, Sébastien Ricard, Hélène Florent, Antoine Olivier Pilon, Émile Schneider, Robert Naylor, Martin Dubreuil, Gabriel Arcand', null, 'In 1910, Maria Chapdelaine, a young girl of seventeen, lived with her family on the banks of the Péribonka River, north of Lake Saint-Jean. The Chapdelaines work tirelessly to push the limits of the forest. In a home where even physical exhaustion cannot dampen the warmth of family life, Maria, strong and full of hope, finds herself faced with major dilemmas. Thrust into the world of adults, Maria will suddenly be forced to decide on her future as a woman.', 'In 1910, Maria Chapdelaine, a young girl of seventeen, lived with her family on the banks of the Péribonka River, north of Lake Saint-Jean. The Chapdelaines work tirelessly to push the limits of the forest. In a home where even physical exhaustion cannot dampen the warmth of family life, Maria, strong and full of hope, finds herself faced with major dilemmas. Thrust into the world of adults, Maria will suddenly be forced to decide on her future as a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkdITEw7yrL6EV16Uxzdpt1HUbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757750'),
  ('211871008654214696', 'María de la O', 1959, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Ramón Torrado, Víctor López Iglesias, Juan Mariné', 'Manuel Tamayo Castro', 'Lola Flores, Gustavo Rojo, Manuel Luna, Antonio González ''El Pescaílla'', Manuel Arbó, Aurora García Alonso, Rafael Vaquero, Francisco Bernal', null, 'María de la O leaves her family and her former boyfriend Miguel to go with a rich landowner who''s supposedly in love with her...', 'María de la O leaves her family and her former boyfriend Miguel to go with a rich landowner who''s supposedly in love with her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPslV7ICoozPxtY7wCrVokBQvrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132994'),
