  ('132312509799162972', 'Maria into Life', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lauriane Escaffre, Yvo Muller, Antoine Sanier', 'Lauriane Escaffre, Yvo Muller', 'Karin Viard, Grégory Gadebois, Noée Abita, Philippe Uchan, Muriel Combeau, Tom Rivoire, Samira Sedira, Catherine Vidal', null, 'Maria is a cleaning lady, who is reserved, shy and clumsy. When she is assigned to the School of Fine Arts, she meets Hubert, the school''s whimsical guardian. There she discovers a fascinating place where freedom, creativity and daring reign.', 'Maria is a cleaning lady, who is reserved, shy and clumsy. When she is assigned to the School of Fine Arts, she meets Hubert, the school''s whimsical guardian. There she discovers a fascinating place where freedom, creativity and daring reign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7dUglqhRJweIAUCIF65tSLE7ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960057'),
  ('221015441125255653', 'María Isabel', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Federico Curiel', 'Julio Alejandro', 'Silvia Pinal, José Suárez, Norma Lazareno, Irma Lozano, Tito Junco, Oscar Morelli, Lucy Buj, Maura Monti', null, 'A woman jumping from the poverty of the countryside to the splendor of wealth in the city without losing its simplicity', 'A woman jumping from the poverty of the countryside to the splendor of wealth in the city without losing its simplicity', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecCgaydI50SPStPVaqWEQuNnyjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221213'),
  ('416565253641135964', 'Maria Life', 2007, 'Animation, Drama', 'Márcio Ramos', 'Márcio Ramos', 'Márcio Ramos', null, 'A five-year-old girl enjoys learning to write her name, but she is forced by her mother to drop out of school and start taking care of household chores and working on the farm.', 'A five-year-old girl enjoys learning to write her name, but she is forced by her mother to drop out of school and start taking care of household chores and working on the farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqdtQbESQ8AZGTUTQcisN2xDHmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90680'),
  ('611252453851303477', 'Maria Mafiosi', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jule Ronstedt, Peter von Haller, Korbinian Wandinger', 'Jule Ronstedt', 'Lisa Maria Potthoff, Antonella Attili, Maximilian Dirr, Alexander Held, Johannes Silberschneider, David Zimmerschied, Monika Gruber, Sigi Zimmerschied', null, 'Policewoman Maria Moosandl and her lover Rocco Pacelli are expecting offspring. Unfortunately, the family conditions are anything but optimal: Maria''s father is the police chief in the tranquil Landsberg and her future father-in-law Silvio the best connected owner of the pizzeria "Il Paradiso" and governor of a Sicilian Mafiaclans. In order to advance their own family business, the patron has already arranged a wedding for his only son - naturally with the daughter of the powerful clan chief from Naple', 'Policewoman Maria Moosandl and her lover Rocco Pacelli are expecting offspring. Unfortunately, the family conditions are anything but optimal: Maria''s father is the police chief in the tranquil Landsberg and her future father-in-law Silvio the best connected owner of the pizzeria "Il Paradiso" and governor of a Sicilian Mafiaclans. In order to advance their own family business, the patron has already arranged a wedding for his only son - naturally with the daughter of the powerful clan chief from Naple', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXhLOZsq60godWF0xzsnLtXxV11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425217'),
  ('143167797916193239', 'Maria Marten, or The Murder in the Red Barn', 1935, 'Crime, Drama', 'Milton Rosmer, Leo T. Croke, Pat Walker', null, 'Tod Slaughter, Sophie Stewart, D.J. Williams, Eric Portman, Clare Greet, Gerard Tyrell, Ann Trevor, Stella Rho', null, 'In 1820s rural England, a young girl is tricked by tales of marriage from a villainous Squire. When she becomes pregnant and disappears, a gipsy lad is blamed.', 'In 1820s rural England, a young girl is tricked by tales of marriage from a villainous Squire. When she becomes pregnant and disappears, a gipsy lad is blamed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfvEvrJkH1bYYfYCITZJ3y5SJ7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125682'),
  ('564849609826054062', 'Maria Montessori', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Alessandra Maccotta, Stefania Valestro, Justinien Schricke', 'Léa Todorov', 'Jasmine Trinca, Leïla Bekhti, Rafaëlle Sonneville-Caby, Raffaele Esposito, Laura Borelli, Nancy Huston, Agathe Bonitzer, Sébastien Pouderoux', null, 'Set in 1900, Lili d’Alengy, a Parisian cocotte at the height of her fame, flees Paris to hide her “idiot” daughter. There she meets Maria Montessori, who is pioneering a teaching method that may help the child.', 'Set in 1900, Lili d’Alengy, a Parisian cocotte at the height of her fame, flees Paris to hide her “idiot” daughter. There she meets Maria Montessori, who is pioneering a teaching method that may help the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zonDvNfq4UPqHMB7NlnHnpYcj0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959395'),
  ('888616463705569469', 'Maria Montessori: una vita per i bambini', 2007, 'Drama', 'Gianluca Maria Tavarelli, Roberto Forza', 'Gianmario Pagano, Monica Zapelli', 'Paola Cortellesi, Massimo Poggio, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Alberto Cracco, Alessandro Lucente, Adalberto Maria Merli, Imma Piro, Giulia Lazzarini', null, 'The story of Maria Montessori the most famous pedagogue of the world. She spent all her life to make her "metodo" (method) accepted in the archaic Italian school system, while the rest of the world immediately understand the importance of her theories. She was the first Italian Doctor, a famous feminist, a scientist. Her private life was hit by having an illegitimate son and by the Fascism that didn''t want to accept completely her theories.', 'The story of Maria Montessori the most famous pedagogue of the world. She spent all her life to make her "metodo" (method) accepted in the archaic Italian school system, while the rest of the world immediately understand the importance of her theories. She was the first Italian Doctor, a famous feminist, a scientist. Her private life was hit by having an illegitimate son and by the Fascism that didn''t want to accept completely her theories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feHAnvZFEnnMqCE4GwfDG742AJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173483'),
  ('753662559659960525', 'Maria of My Heart', 1979, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo, Ángel Goded', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo, Gabriel García Márquez', 'María Rojo, Héctor Bonilla, Ana Ofelia Murguía, Xóchitl, Salvador Sánchez, Evangelina Martínez, Martha Navarro, Margarita Isabel', null, 'Héctor and María meet again after eight years of not seeing each other. She works as a magician in cabarets and he robs houses. María convinces Héctor to become a magician and work together. Life seems to smile on them until one day, when Maria travels to another city, the couple''s situation will be overshadowed by an unfortunate event.', 'Héctor and María meet again after eight years of not seeing each other. She works as a magician in cabarets and he robs houses. María convinces Héctor to become a magician and work together. Life seems to smile on them until one day, when Maria travels to another city, the couple''s situation will be overshadowed by an unfortunate event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gE1Jqe4cet1TbADpJd6bS93SOCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194170'),
  ('395878943701959960', 'Maria of the Sea', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'José Leitão de Barros, Salazar Dinis, Manuel Luís Vieira', 'Norberto Lopes', 'Rosa Maria, Oliveira Martins, Adelina Abranches, Alves da Cunha, Perpétua dos Santos, Álvaro Horta e Costa, Maria Leo, António Duarte', null, 'Falacha is the captain of a fishing boat, who loses his men in a shipwreck. Among them was the husband of Aurélia, who holds Falacha responsible for the tragedy. Maria, Falacha''s daughter, falls in love with Manuel, Aurélia''s son, a situation that their mothers refuse to accept.', 'Falacha is the captain of a fishing boat, who loses his men in a shipwreck. Among them was the husband of Aurélia, who holds Falacha responsible for the tragedy. Maria, Falacha''s daughter, falls in love with Manuel, Aurélia''s son, a situation that their mothers refuse to accept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFTbT0CwEMzPmIozmROoLTnWKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166526'),
  ('1032243581725993621', 'Maria per Roma', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Maura Morales Bergmann, Karen Di Porto', 'Karen Di Porto', 'Karen Di Porto, Lorenzo Adorni, Alessia Alciati, Mia Benedetta, Carlotta Galmarini, Francesco Liotard, Alexia Murray, Bruno Pavoncello', null, 'The story of the day, from early morning to night, of Mary, a confused but dynamic woman who pursues her career as an actress, but is lost in the fragmentation of the Roman daily. A newspaper that revolves around what seems to be the only source of livelihood for the Eternal City: tourism. Let''s see Maria run from the theaters to check-in at the tourists and from check-in to screening in a frenzy that will blur in comical and grueling situations.', 'The story of the day, from early morning to night, of Mary, a confused but dynamic woman who pursues her career as an actress, but is lost in the fragmentation of the Roman daily. A newspaper that revolves around what seems to be the only source of livelihood for the Eternal City: tourism. Let''s see Maria run from the theaters to check-in at the tourists and from check-in to screening in a frenzy that will blur in comical and grueling situations.', null, 'tmdb:movie:422590'),
  ('803880991547433180', 'Maria-Conception-Action: Hermann Nitsch', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Ed Sommer, Irm Sommer', null, null, null, 'A performance of Hermann Nitsch''s "7th Abreaction Action", which was initially banned by police, is put on the following morning instead. The action consists of gutting a lamb, pouring the innards over a recumbent woman, mating with a dildo, crucifixion and a concluding scuffle. The action is accompanied by electric organ, percussion and recorded music.', 'A performance of Hermann Nitsch''s "7th Abreaction Action", which was initially banned by police, is put on the following morning instead. The action consists of gutting a lamb, pouring the innards over a recumbent woman, mating with a dildo, crucifixion and a concluding scuffle. The action is accompanied by electric organ, percussion and recorded music.', null, 'tmdb:movie:147821'),
  ('1152096069716714345', 'Maria, I''m Dying!', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Gabriela Sobarzo', 'Aníbal Herrera', 'Natalia Téllez, Ricardo Fastlicht, José Sefami, Paz Bascuñan, Minnie West, Tato Alexander, Héctor Suárez Gomís, Erik Hayser', null, '“Maria, I''m dying!” is a comedy about a hypochondriac man, the only being in the world capable of even terminal colds, and his wife who has to put up with it until he decides to do something about it. The fear of death has never been so fun.', '“Maria, I''m dying!” is a comedy about a hypochondriac man, the only being in the world capable of even terminal colds, and his wife who has to put up with it until he decides to do something about it. The fear of death has never been so fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BMzmf3vEAVdapBU59KQmux0V9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360170'),
  ('625113870396540307', 'Maria, Mirabella', 1982, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ion Popescu-Gopo, Nataliya Bodyul, Alecu Popescu', 'Ion Popescu-Gopo', 'Gilda Manolescu, Medeea Marinescu, Ion Popescu-Gopo, Ingrid Celia, Lyudmila Gnilova, Klara Rumyanova, Leonid Serebrennikov, Rogvold Sukhoverko', null, 'Two little girls - Maria and Mirabella - go to the woods for a walk and encounter several magical characters, among them a frog with his feet frozen in ice, a fireworm whose shoes keep catching fire, and a butterfly who''s afraid of flying. To help their new friends, the girls must carry them to a sorceress who lives deep in the forest.', 'Two little girls - Maria and Mirabella - go to the woods for a walk and encounter several magical characters, among them a frog with his feet frozen in ice, a fireworm whose shoes keep catching fire, and a butterfly who''s afraid of flying. To help their new friends, the girls must carry them to a sorceress who lives deep in the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9mY3WCmkH8YYzNDt0dVVKGPOHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75372'),
  ('432477382755872487', 'Maria, the Wonderful Weaver', 1959, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Rou, Dmitri Surensky, B. Kanevskiy', 'Yevgeni Shvarts', 'Ninel Myshkova, Viktor Perevalov, Mikhail Kuznetsov, Anatoliy Kubatskiy, Olga Khadhapuridze, Georgi Millyar, Vera Altayskaya, Aleksandr Khvylia', null, 'An old soldier helps a young boy find his mother, who''s been kidnapped to the magical underwater kingdom in a remote Russian lake.', 'An old soldier helps a young boy find his mother, who''s been kidnapped to the magical underwater kingdom in a remote Russian lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QnsdqRmVa9qxi7ylEqunHTSGMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20935'),
  ('368528039876835864', 'Maria''s Lovers', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Gérard Brach, Floyd Byars', 'Nastassja Kinski, John Savage, Robert Mitchum, Keith Carradine, Anita Morris, Bud Cort, Karen Young, Tracy Nelson', null, 'A World War II prisoner returns home to his childhood sweetheart. However, back home, he discovers that he has to compete to win her love.', 'A World War II prisoner returns home to his childhood sweetheart. However, back home, he discovers that he has to compete to win her love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4ltpB20GY0t8ox2n6hnMmo9lDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77985'),
  ('1021434330576255773', 'Mariage à Mendoza', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Édouard Deluc', null, 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Philippe Rebbot, Benjamin Biolay', null, 'Marcus and his brother Antoine head to Argentina for their cousin’s wedding. They plan to explore all that Buenos Aires has to offer before making the trip to Mendoza in the west. Marcus is thrilled to be on the road and determined to have fun, while Antoine is depressed after being dumped by his wife, who refused to come with them at the last minute. Marcus will do anything it takes to cheer up his little brother. After a very caliente evening in the capital, they hit the road, discovering Argentina vineyard’s and making unlikely encounters –with a crackpot receptionist, a divine beauty, a pregnant ewe, and a guy afflicted by Stendhal syndrome –until, at the end of their journey, the two brothers find peace.', 'Marcus and his brother Antoine head to Argentina for their cousin’s wedding. They plan to explore all that Buenos Aires has to offer before making the trip to Mendoza in the west. Marcus is thrilled to be on the road and determined to have fun, while Antoine is depressed after being dumped by his wife, who refused to come with them at the last minute. Marcus will do anything it takes to cheer up his little brother. After a very caliente evening in the capital, they hit the road, discovering Argentina vineyard’s and making unlikely encounters –with a crackpot receptionist, a divine beauty, a pregnant ewe, and a guy afflicted by Stendhal syndrome –until, at the end of their journey, the two brothers find peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlLim9rBKCzkrv2GabTOKD00vVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161073'),
  ('929147640244216460', 'Mariage chez les Bodin''s', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Éric Le Roch', 'Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Éric Le Roch, Vincent Dubois', 'Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Vincent Dubois, Muriel Dubois, Faru, Carole Massana, Jean-Pierre Bigard, Louis-Marie Audubert, Philippe Manesse', null, 'Nous sommes dans un coin de France reculé... très reculé.', 'Nous sommes dans un coin de France reculé... très reculé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHwHyMVbZ86j4F1N2L1eaaAMzwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14406'),
  ('357908771258756375', 'Mariages!', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valérie Guignabodet, Pierre Aïm', 'Valérie Guignabodet', 'Jean Dujardin, Mathilde Seigner, Antoine Duléry, Miou-Miou, Lio, Catherine Allégret, Chloé Lambert, Michel Lagueyrie', null, 'A wedding is an opportunity for three couples of different generations to question commitment and the strength of love.', 'A wedding is an opportunity for three couples of different generations to question commitment and the strength of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR5VF8uwqQzJLozryGXzqc0FwNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52538'),
  ('991902231542229202', 'Mariah Carey: Butterfly World Tour - Live at Tokyo Dome', 1998, 'Music', 'Debbie Allen, Masao Shimizu', null, 'Mariah Carey, Trey Lorenz, Randy Jackson', null, 'The Butterfly World Tour is the third concert tour by Mariah Carey, visited Asia, Australia and the United States. The four dates at Japan''s largest stadium, Tokyo Dome, sold out in under one hour, breaking the previous record she held at the stadium.', 'The Butterfly World Tour is the third concert tour by Mariah Carey, visited Asia, Australia and the United States. The four dates at Japan''s largest stadium, Tokyo Dome, sold out in under one hour, breaking the previous record she held at the stadium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yl1xwZomepf7La3r47vYerJCVnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518526'),
  ('786110368485744595', 'Mariah Carey''s All I Want for Christmas Is You', 2017, 'Animation, Family', 'Guy Vasilovich', 'Temple Mathews', 'Mariah Carey, Breanna Yde, Henry Winkler, Laya DeLeon Hayes, Montse Hernandez, Issac Ryan Brown, Bria Danielle Singleton, Phil Morris', 'G', 'When young Mariah sees a darling little puppy named "Princess" at the pet store, she suddenly knows exactly what she wants for Christmas. But before her Christmas wish can come true, she must prove that she can dog-sit her uncle''s dog, Jack, a scraggly rascal; in fact, the worst dog in the county!', 'When young Mariah sees a darling little puppy named "Princess" at the pet store, she suddenly knows exactly what she wants for Christmas. But before her Christmas wish can come true, she must prove that she can dog-sit her uncle''s dog, Jack, a scraggly rascal; in fact, the worst dog in the county!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jv1ZhB4H5SdlG9Q1dEL8WSIIGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474498'),
  ('145547081568587224', 'Mariah Carey''s Magical Christmas Special', 2020, 'Family, Music', 'Hamish Hamilton, Roman Coppola, Keyan Safyari', 'Caroline Fox', 'Mariah Carey, Monroe Cannon, Moroccan Cannon, Misty Copeland, Snoop Dogg, Jermaine Dupri, Billy Eichner, Ariana Grande', 'G', 'Faced with a holiday cheer crisis, the North Pole knows there''s only one person who can save the day: Santa''s great friend Mariah Carey. The Queen of Christmas creates a fabulous and star-studded spectacular to make the whole world merry!', 'Faced with a holiday cheer crisis, the North Pole knows there''s only one person who can save the day: Santa''s great friend Mariah Carey. The Queen of Christmas creates a fabulous and star-studded spectacular to make the whole world merry!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjPoAenlch0JVZVGCpei5XWOGiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766319'),
