  ('10688791053778447', 'Mariana', 2017, null, 'Chris Gude', 'Chris Gude', 'Jorge Gaviria, Edward Duigenan, Mago Cayory, Marcos Fidel Maldonado, Yair Mejía', null, 'Chris Gude returns to Colombia – specifically La Guajira, a peninsula on the frontier with Venezuela – following the footsteps of a sailor and smuggler who travelled through isolated ports and deserted lands, at the edges of the rules of State and capital.', 'Chris Gude returns to Colombia – specifically La Guajira, a peninsula on the frontier with Venezuela – following the footsteps of a sailor and smuggler who travelled through isolated ports and deserted lands, at the edges of the rules of State and capital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fknCEPDQLEs5SEfeHEoY6WnI73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489157'),
  ('700749166243197781', 'Mariana Mariana', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Antonio Álvarez, Luis Gaitán, Alberto Isaac', 'Vicente Leñero', 'Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Elizabeth Aguilar, Saby Kamalich, Aarón Hernán, Luis Mario Quiroz, Juan Carlos Andrews, Gerardo Quiroz, José Luis Cruz', null, 'The story runs in the 1940s Mexico City. A schoolboy (Carlos) falls in love with his best friend''s mother (Mariana). Carlos is impressed because this family is not like the ordinary mexican families of the time, because they have many expensive American things, although they are not rich. The drama begins when Carlos gets out of school to go to declare his love to Mariana, and is discovered by his teachers.', 'The story runs in the 1940s Mexico City. A schoolboy (Carlos) falls in love with his best friend''s mother (Mariana). Carlos is impressed because this family is not like the ordinary mexican families of the time, because they have many expensive American things, although they are not rich. The drama begins when Carlos gets out of school to go to declare his love to Mariana, and is discovered by his teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyslfXQDn2rxYWe4o00s4yAL1E4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253792'),
  ('1135899550839045157', 'Mariana''s Room', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Emmanuel Finkiel, András Hárskúti, Lóránd Banner-Szûcs', 'Emmanuel Finkiel', 'Mélanie Thierry, Artem Kyryk, Anastasia Fein, Julia Goldberg, Olena Khokhlatkina, Minou Monfared, Valerii Bartkovska, Dorka Gryllus', null, 'In the darkest days of the Second World War, Yulia and Hugo, a Jewish mother and son, escape from a Ukrainian ghetto. Fearing for his safety, Yulia entrusts her boy to the care of her friend Mariana, a sex worker who lives in a brothel. Hugo is placed in a closet, nominally for his safety, but from which he rarely leaves. With little view of the outside world, he conjures up ghosts and scenarios. But over time, Mariana brings the boy out and in doing so transforms his life.', 'In the darkest days of the Second World War, Yulia and Hugo, a Jewish mother and son, escape from a Ukrainian ghetto. Fearing for his safety, Yulia entrusts her boy to the care of her friend Mariana, a sex worker who lives in a brothel. Hugo is placed in a closet, nominally for his safety, but from which he rarely leaves. With little view of the outside world, he conjures up ghosts and scenarios. But over time, Mariana brings the boy out and in doing so transforms his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvdeYHZxJZvTqYOvzYxETPuokpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000828'),
  ('72161751481654710', 'Marianela', 1972, 'Drama', 'Jean-Jacques Tarbès, Angelino Fons', 'Alfredo Mañas', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Germán Cobos, María del Carmen Aguado, Lola Gaos, José Jaspe, Pierre Orcel, Jacqueline Parent, José Suárez', null, 'Marianela is a poor girl with a disfigured face who works as Pablo''s guide, a blind young man from a wealthy family. Pablo falls in love with Marianela because of her spirit and vitality and imagines her as the most beautiful woman in the world. When Pablo has the chance to recover his sight, Marianela becomes very sad because she is sure that the young man will reject her when he can see her', 'Marianela is a poor girl with a disfigured face who works as Pablo''s guide, a blind young man from a wealthy family. Pablo falls in love with Marianela because of her spirit and vitality and imagines her as the most beautiful woman in the world. When Pablo has the chance to recover his sight, Marianela becomes very sad because she is sure that the young man will reject her when he can see her', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rS4gwYLsJXcc3qC0pmxnhrK4wjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382798'),
  ('782057598878300718', 'Marianna Ucrìa', 1997, 'Drama', 'Tonino Delli Colli, Gianni Arduini, Filippo Macelloni', 'Roberto Faenza, Sandro Petraglia', 'Emmanuelle Laborit, Roberto Herlitzka, Laura Morante, Laura Betti, Bernard Giraudeau, Leopoldo Trieste, Lorenzo Crespi, Selvaggia Quattrini', null, 'In 18th-century Sicily, deaf-mute highborn Marianna Ucrìa is forced to marry at age 13, bearing three children before even turning 16, when she finally gives birth to a boy. Despite everything, she''ll find a way to emancipate herself from the oppressive social conventions of the time.', 'In 18th-century Sicily, deaf-mute highborn Marianna Ucrìa is forced to marry at age 13, bearing three children before even turning 16, when she finally gives birth to a boy. Despite everything, she''ll find a way to emancipate herself from the oppressive social conventions of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LG1yRZcmnE5hd3hUzXQWZRZOyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110312'),
  ('186802638026454903', 'Marianne and Juliane', 1981, 'Drama', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Franz Rath, Helenka Hummel', 'Margarethe von Trotta', 'Jutta Lampe, Barbara Sukowa, Ina Robinski, Julia Biedermann, Rüdiger Vogler, Doris Schade, Vérénice Rudolph, Luc Bondy', null, 'Germany, 1968: The priest''s daughters Marianna and Juliane both fight for changes in society, like making abortion legal. However their means are totally different: while Juliane''s committed as a reporter, her sister joins a terroristic organization. After she''s caught by the police and put into isolation jail, Juliane remains as her last connection to the rest of the world. Although she doesn''t accept her sister''s arguments and her boyfriend Wolfgang doesn''t want her to, Juliane keeps on helping her sister. She begins to question the way her sister is treated.', 'Germany, 1968: The priest''s daughters Marianna and Juliane both fight for changes in society, like making abortion legal. However their means are totally different: while Juliane''s committed as a reporter, her sister joins a terroristic organization. After she''s caught by the police and put into isolation jail, Juliane remains as her last connection to the rest of the world. Although she doesn''t accept her sister''s arguments and her boyfriend Wolfgang doesn''t want her to, Juliane keeps on helping her sister. She begins to question the way her sister is treated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOPTepFzMlwJzupQDPe481hI0sN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42142'),
  ('479458695999302491', 'Maridos en vacaciones', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Enrique Cahen Salaberry, Víctor Hugo Caula', 'Jorge Basurto', 'Jorge Porcel, Alberto Olmedo, Gogó Rojo, Ethel Rojo, Javier Portales, Tito Climent, Esmeralda Berard, Horacio Bruno', null, 'Friends Alberto and Jorge, who work together in an insurance company and live in the same building, are married to two sisters (Elsa and Alicia). When they go on vacation to Mar del Plata, Alberto and Jorge decide to enjoy their "single life". In addition to this, they have to fulfill a duty entrusted by their boss: to find the revue theater entrepreneur Félix Sagastume, to sign an insurance contract. It is in a canteen where they go to look for him, and there they meet two aspiring vedettes (Zuzú and Bibí), who confuse them with important businessmen and see in them a possibility of achieving fame.', 'Friends Alberto and Jorge, who work together in an insurance company and live in the same building, are married to two sisters (Elsa and Alicia). When they go on vacation to Mar del Plata, Alberto and Jorge decide to enjoy their "single life". In addition to this, they have to fulfill a duty entrusted by their boss: to find the revue theater entrepreneur Félix Sagastume, to sign an insurance contract. It is in a canteen where they go to look for him, and there they meet two aspiring vedettes (Zuzú and Bibí), who confuse them with important businessmen and see in them a possibility of achieving fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9rnww1Nh3H2iPtEGLe2UCfgKmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316076'),
  ('1151588490832251231', 'Marie and the Misfits', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Sébastien Betbeder', null, 'Pierre Rochefort, Vimala Pons, Éric Cantona, Damien Chapelle, André Wilms, Juliette Armanet', null, '"Marie is dangerous", Antoine warns. It hasn''t stopped Siméon from dropping everything, or, more precisely, letting go the little that he had, to secretly follow her. Oscar, his roommate, a musician with sleepwalking tendencies, and Antoine, a novelist lacking inspiration, quickly follow in his footsteps. Here they all are at the end of the Earth, which is to say, on an island. It''s quite possible that these four are linked by something beyond their comprehension. Perhaps simply a taste for adventure. Or the desire to add some fantasy and a touch of the romantic to their lives.', '"Marie is dangerous", Antoine warns. It hasn''t stopped Siméon from dropping everything, or, more precisely, letting go the little that he had, to secretly follow her. Oscar, his roommate, a musician with sleepwalking tendencies, and Antoine, a novelist lacking inspiration, quickly follow in his footsteps. Here they all are at the end of the Earth, which is to say, on an island. It''s quite possible that these four are linked by something beyond their comprehension. Perhaps simply a taste for adventure. Or the desire to add some fantasy and a touch of the romantic to their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64wd1v3gS1An9D8qRrrJJ5W6mtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384589'),
  ('1070158448153555990', 'Marie Antoinette', 1938, 'Drama, History', 'George J. Folsey, W.S. Van Dyke, Julien Duvivier', 'Claudine West, Donald Ogden Stewart, Ernest Vajda', 'Norma Shearer, Tyrone Power, John Barrymore, Robert Morley, Anita Louise, Joseph Schildkraut, Gladys George, Henry Stephenson', 'NR', 'The young Austrian princess Marie Antoinette is arranged to marry Louis XVI, future king of France, in a politically advantageous marriage for the rival countries. The opulent Marie indulges in various whims and flirtations. When Louis XV passes and Louis XVI ascends the French throne, his queen''s extravagant lifestyle earns the hatred of the French people, who despise her Austrian heritage.', 'The young Austrian princess Marie Antoinette is arranged to marry Louis XVI, future king of France, in a politically advantageous marriage for the rival countries. The opulent Marie indulges in various whims and flirtations. When Louis XV passes and Louis XVI ascends the French throne, his queen''s extravagant lifestyle earns the hatred of the French people, who despise her Austrian heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmsqzJUN6B0guVHfXINhofe4Myt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43847'),
  ('896293269197827792', 'Marie Antoinette', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Sofia Coppola, Lance Acord, Roman Coppola', 'Sofia Coppola', 'Kirsten Dunst, Jason Schwartzman, Steve Coogan, Judy Davis, Rip Torn, Asia Argento, Molly Shannon, Shirley Henderson', 'PG-13', 'A retelling of the story of France’s iconic but ill-fated queen, Marie Antoinette - from her betrothal and marriage to Louis XVI at fifteen to her reign as queen at nineteen and ultimately the fall of Versailles.', 'A retelling of the story of France’s iconic but ill-fated queen, Marie Antoinette - from her betrothal and marriage to Louis XVI at fifteen to her reign as queen at nineteen and ultimately the fall of Versailles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cybXGmv8Rjd5Os8Xml6YxMBQ0Zt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1887'),
  ('762265101347853856', 'Marie Curie', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Marie Noëlle, Michał Englert', 'Marie-Noëlle Himbert, Andrea Stoll', 'Karolina Gruszka, Arieh Worthalter, Charles Berling, Izabela Kuna, Malik Zidi, André Wilms, Daniel Olbrychski, Marie Denarnaud', null, 'The most turbulent five years in the life of a genius woman: Between 1905, where Maria Skłodowska-Curie comes with Pierre Curie to Stockholm to be awarded the Nobel Prize for the discovery of the radioactivity, and 1911, where she receives her second Nobel Prize, after challenging France''s male-dominated academic establishment both as a scientist and a woman.', 'The most turbulent five years in the life of a genius woman: Between 1905, where Maria Skłodowska-Curie comes with Pierre Curie to Stockholm to be awarded the Nobel Prize for the discovery of the radioactivity, and 1911, where she receives her second Nobel Prize, after challenging France''s male-dominated academic establishment both as a scientist and a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wA2IsvqX3VoLF6rymPWk95gaBXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412204'),
  ('881285601071946400', 'Marie from the Bay of Angels', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Manuel Pradal, Christophe Pollock', 'Manuel Pradal', 'Vahina Giocante, Frédéric Malgras, Nicolas Welbers, Amira Casar, Roxane Mesquida, Brigitte Roüan, Swan Carpio, Jamie Harris', null, 'A random montage of disturbing images tell a story about one summer in the lives of two teenagers who somehow find love within each other, Orso and Marie. After they realize this, they run off to a hidden island off the coast of France where they can not be bothered until Orso''s hunger for danger and crime become too much for him, forcing him to return to his normal life...', 'A random montage of disturbing images tell a story about one summer in the lives of two teenagers who somehow find love within each other, Orso and Marie. After they realize this, they run off to a hidden island off the coast of France where they can not be bothered until Orso''s hunger for danger and crime become too much for him, forcing him to return to his normal life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvoRrGik2ZACsgiIlwJHBauBXzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47481'),
  ('1127867793299556918', 'Marie Galante', 1934, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, John F. Seitz', 'Edmund L. Hartmann', 'Spencer Tracy, Ketti Gallian, Ned Sparks, Helen Morgan, Sig Ruman, Leslie Fenton, Arthur Byron, Jay C. Flippen', null, 'On the French coast, unlucky Marie Galante is abducted and forced to board an American cargo ship bound for the Panama Canal. When an escape attempt leaves Marie high and dry in the Yucatan, she takes work as a nightclub singer to earn her safe passage to the Canal region. But Marie faces bigger problems when she gets mixed up in a destructive plot against the U.S. Naval fleet, and so she accepts the kindly assistance of secret agent Dr. Crawbett.', 'On the French coast, unlucky Marie Galante is abducted and forced to board an American cargo ship bound for the Panama Canal. When an escape attempt leaves Marie high and dry in the Yucatan, she takes work as a nightclub singer to earn her safe passage to the Canal region. But Marie faces bigger problems when she gets mixed up in a destructive plot against the U.S. Naval fleet, and so she accepts the kindly assistance of secret agent Dr. Crawbett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYg9Y6QFEnhe4wWf7Pr1k232KSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180453'),
  ('532061328634762235', 'Marie of the Port', 1950, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcel Carné, Henri Alekan', 'Louis Chavance, Marcel Carné', 'Jean Gabin, Blanchette Brunoy, Nicole Courcel, Claude Romain, Julien Carette, Jane Marken, Louis Seigner, Odette Laure', null, 'Henri Chatelard is well into his forties, owns a restaurant and a cinema in the city, and appreciates women. When he meets Marie, an 18-ish strong-head who just lost her father in a small fishing village, it is not clear who is the hunter and who is the prey.', 'Henri Chatelard is well into his forties, owns a restaurant and a cinema in the city, and appreciates women. When he meets Marie, an 18-ish strong-head who just lost her father in a small fishing village, it is not clear who is the hunter and who is the prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6yk6cMULSPjhvpRQtY0sa0VekF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67494'),
  ('153463298089863241', 'Marie-Antoinette, la véritable histoire', 2006, 'Documentary, Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Yves Simoneau, Francis Leclerc, Guy Dufaux', 'Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Karine Vanasse, Olivier Aubin, Hélène Florent, Marie-Éve Beaulieu, Danny Gilmore, Chloé Rocheleau, Paul Ahmarani, Catherine de Léan', null, 'Marie Antoinette, Archduchess of Austria and a very young girl, marries King Louis-Auguste, Dauphine of France. This historical drama tells the tragic tale of a young woman who, in the beginning started out with task, that ended with great sadness and sorrow.', 'Marie Antoinette, Archduchess of Austria and a very young girl, marries King Louis-Auguste, Dauphine of France. This historical drama tells the tragic tale of a young woman who, in the beginning started out with task, that ended with great sadness and sorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxHXQc0f93IXNNpkOqjLQaLoYo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154873'),
  ('652363113081462618', 'Marie-Francine', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Valérie Lemercier', 'Valérie Lemercier, Sabine Haudepin', 'Valérie Lemercier, Denis Podalydès, Patrick Timsit, Xavier Lemaître, Hélène Vincent, Philippe Laudenbach, Marie Petiot, Nadège Beausson-Diagne', null, 'A woman at the age of 50 moves back in with her parents after her husband leave her for a younger woman.', 'A woman at the age of 50 moves back in with her parents after her husband leave her for a younger woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfcoM69h0EKLXP8Qb0msvbi5rVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428756'),
  ('384849053853693016', 'Marie-Jo and Her 2 Loves', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Guédiguian, Renato Berta', 'Jean-Louis Milesi, Robert Guédiguian', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Julie-Marie Parmentier, Jacques Boudet, Yann Trégouët, Frédérique Bonnal, Souhade Temimi, Gérard Meylan', null, 'Marie-Jo is a middleaged woman living an ordinary life in Marseilles with her husband, Daniel and her daughter, Julie. Daniel runs a small construction business in which Marie-Jo helps. She also works at the local hospital. Outwardly their marriage is loving. But Marie-Jo has been in love with another man for more than twelve months.Marco works as a harbour pilot and is deeply in love with Marie-Jo. Learning that loving two men is impossible, Marie-Jo is forced to make a choice.', 'Marie-Jo is a middleaged woman living an ordinary life in Marseilles with her husband, Daniel and her daughter, Julie. Daniel runs a small construction business in which Marie-Jo helps. She also works at the local hospital. Outwardly their marriage is loving. But Marie-Jo has been in love with another man for more than twelve months.Marco works as a harbour pilot and is deeply in love with Marie-Jo. Learning that loving two men is impossible, Marie-Jo is forced to make a choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nN1Ke4rIEOoywa5McheQWi4bA6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12513'),
  ('731889737406976506', 'Marie-Line', 2000, 'Drama', 'Mehdi Charef', 'Mehdi Charef', 'Muriel Robin, Fejria Deliba, Valérie Stroh, Yan Epstein, Gilles Treton, Mbembo, Aïssa Maïga, Selma Kouchy', null, 'A woman learns to care for others when she''s forced to help people on the wrong side of the law in this drama. Marie-Line (Muriel Robin) is a single woman in her mid-forties who oversees the cleaning crew at a large office building. On the job, Marie-Line is all business, with no patience for laziness and no tolerance for employees who do less than a perfect job. But Marie-Line''s bosses are in the midst of a money crunch and they''ve cut back on her budget, so when several of her employees quit, she has to find new cleaners willing to work for a lower wage. Marie-Line soon finds new workers willing to work hard for low pay, but there''s a catch -- most of them are illegal aliens, smuggled into France from Africa, Albania, or the Middle East, and when police begin asking questions about Marie-Line''s new cleaners, she has to scramble to cover for them.', 'A woman learns to care for others when she''s forced to help people on the wrong side of the law in this drama. Marie-Line (Muriel Robin) is a single woman in her mid-forties who oversees the cleaning crew at a large office building. On the job, Marie-Line is all business, with no patience for laziness and no tolerance for employees who do less than a perfect job. But Marie-Line''s bosses are in the midst of a money crunch and they''ve cut back on her budget, so when several of her employees quit, she has to find new cleaners willing to work for a lower wage. Marie-Line soon finds new workers willing to work hard for low pay, but there''s a catch -- most of them are illegal aliens, smuggled into France from Africa, Albania, or the Middle East, and when police begin asking questions about Marie-Line''s new cleaners, she has to scramble to cover for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1EXza1Yja3loRkoL19hOwRdyEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267287'),
  ('850503529908334179', 'Marie-Octobre', 1959, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Julien Duvivier, Robert Lefebvre, Michel Romanoff', 'Julien Duvivier', 'Danielle Darrieux, Paul Meurisse, Bernard Blier, Noël Roquevert, Lino Ventura, Robert Dalban, Paul Frankeur, Serge Reggiani', null, 'A group of ex-resistance fighters are brought together by Marie-Octobre, the code name of Marie-Helene Dumoulin. The former members of the network have carried on with their lives after the war, but this evening they are going to have to live again a fateful night – the night their leader was killed. He had been betrayed, his name given to the Germans. The search for the traitor puts each personality in the spotlight – and also that of the killed leader, Castille.', 'A group of ex-resistance fighters are brought together by Marie-Octobre, the code name of Marie-Helene Dumoulin. The former members of the network have carried on with their lives after the war, but this evening they are going to have to live again a fateful night – the night their leader was killed. He had been betrayed, his name given to the Germans. The search for the traitor puts each personality in the spotlight – and also that of the killed leader, Castille.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jU1FRo2rmGAEkhb8A2EB6UpTW0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76777'),
  ('125002786016774540', 'Marie: A True Story', 1985, 'Drama', 'Roger Donaldson, Chris Menges', 'John Briley', 'Sissy Spacek, Jeff Daniels, Keith Szarabajka, Morgan Freeman, Fred Thompson, Lisa Banes, Trey Wilson, John Cullum', 'PG-13', 'In 1978 Tennessee, a single mother and political appointee risks her career and her life to blow the whistle on rampant corruption in the penal system.', 'In 1978 Tennessee, a single mother and political appointee risks her career and her life to blow the whistle on rampant corruption in the penal system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulZH8aa972yRBDnbbt07LCvHjDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87400'),
  ('428196777452140124', 'Marie''s Story', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Philippe Blasband', 'Isabelle Carré, Ariana Rivoire, Brigitte Catillon, Laure Duthilleul, Martine Gautier, Sonia Laroze, Patricia Legrand, Christophe Tourrette', 'PG', 'Marie Heurtin is born both blind and deaf. Sister Marguerette wins her trust and teaches her how to express herself.', 'Marie Heurtin is born both blind and deaf. Sister Marguerette wins her trust and teaches her how to express herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEOVzmg8KFfypgFNqahvHDK7DPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286595'),
  ('734300158749029673', 'Marielle and Monica', 2018, null, 'Fabio Erdos, Fabio Erdos', null, null, null, 'The LGBT activists resisting Bolsonaro''s Brazil. Marielle Franco, a Brazilian LGBT and human rights activist, was killed in March 2018. Her widow, Monica Benicio, continued her fight for better treatment of the poor, the LGBT community and black Brazilians. The case of her murder has still not been solved and, as the police investigation drifts, Monica is a plunged into a new crisis: the probable election of Jair Bolsonaro.', 'The LGBT activists resisting Bolsonaro''s Brazil. Marielle Franco, a Brazilian LGBT and human rights activist, was killed in March 2018. Her widow, Monica Benicio, continued her fight for better treatment of the poor, the LGBT community and black Brazilians. The case of her murder has still not been solved and, as the police investigation drifts, Monica is a plunged into a new crisis: the probable election of Jair Bolsonaro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEKiwXkRSivLFvTwIBaxy5Ss4iH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601850'),
  ('891667878497369583', 'Marighella', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Isa Grinspum Ferraz, Alziro Barbosa', null, 'Lázaro Ramos, Isa Grinspum Ferraz, Carlos Marighella, Antonio Risério, Carlos Augusto Marighella, Armênio Guedes, Jacob Gorender, Antônio Cândido', null, 'This communist and parliamentarian leader was arrested and tortured, and became famous for having written the "Minimanual of the Urban Guerrilla". Greatest name of the left-wing militancy in Brazil in the 1960s, Carlos Marighella acted in the main political events of Brazil between the 1930s and 1969 and was considered enemy number one of the Brazilian military dictatorship. His life was a great act of resistance and courage.', 'This communist and parliamentarian leader was arrested and tortured, and became famous for having written the "Minimanual of the Urban Guerrilla". Greatest name of the left-wing militancy in Brazil in the 1960s, Carlos Marighella acted in the main political events of Brazil between the 1930s and 1969 and was considered enemy number one of the Brazilian military dictatorship. His life was a great act of resistance and courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cT1LDiWCt7ijRHZwUMyGXrCs6q7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203593'),
  ('325426233550606542', 'Marighella', 2021, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Cristiane Façanha, Rafael Salgado, Wagner Moura', 'Wagner Moura, Felipe Braga', 'Seu Jorge, Bruno Gagliasso, Luiz Carlos Vasconcelos, Humberto Carrão, Jorge Paz, Bella Camero, Henrique Vieira, Ana Paula Bouzas', null, 'Afro-Brazilian poet and politician, the legendary Carlos Marighella. Driven to fight against the erosion of civil and human rights following the CIA-backed military coup of 1964 and the brutal, racist right-wing dictatorship that followed, the revolutionary leaves behind his wife and son to take up arms, becoming a notorious enemy to the power structure.', 'Afro-Brazilian poet and politician, the legendary Carlos Marighella. Driven to fight against the erosion of civil and human rights following the CIA-backed military coup of 1964 and the brutal, racist right-wing dictatorship that followed, the revolutionary leaves behind his wife and son to take up arms, becoming a notorious enemy to the power structure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Wdrdooav23KNxOntYYFJ6ddXD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500458'),
  ('236192746686583497', 'Marihuana', 1936, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dwain Esper, Roland Price', 'Hildegarde Stadie', 'Harley Wood, Hugh McArthur, Pat Carlyle, Paul Ellis, Bill Woods, Richard Erskine, Juanita Fletcher, Gloria Browne', null, 'A young girl named Burma attends a beach party with her boyfriend and after she smokes marijuana with a bunch of other girls, she gets pregnant and another girl drowns while skinny dipping in the ocean. Burma and her boyfriend go to work for the pusher in order to make money so they can get married. However, during a drug deal her boyfriend is killed leaving Burma to fend for herself. Burma then becomes a major narcotics pusher in her own right after giving up her baby for adoption.', 'A young girl named Burma attends a beach party with her boyfriend and after she smokes marijuana with a bunch of other girls, she gets pregnant and another girl drowns while skinny dipping in the ocean. Burma and her boyfriend go to work for the pusher in order to make money so they can get married. However, during a drug deal her boyfriend is killed leaving Burma to fend for herself. Burma then becomes a major narcotics pusher in her own right after giving up her baby for adoption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFcCIZeRxGPzatObMegvqpFjMOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63180'),
  ('548533410593769413', 'Marija', 2016, 'Drama', 'Michael Koch', 'Michael Koch, Juliane Grossheim', 'Margarita Breitkreiz, Georg Friedrich, Olga Dinnikova, Sahin Eryilmaz, Georges Devdariani, Dmitri Alexandrov', null, 'Marija, a young Ukrainian woman, earns a living as a cleaning woman in a hotel in Dortmund, but dreams of having her own hairstyling salon, and puts away some money each month. But when she is fired without notice, her dream is suddenly postponed to an uncertain future. Jobless and under financial pressure, she is forced to look for alternatives but, in order to achieve her goal, she is ready to discard her body, her social relationships and her own feelings.', 'Marija, a young Ukrainian woman, earns a living as a cleaning woman in a hotel in Dortmund, but dreams of having her own hairstyling salon, and puts away some money each month. But when she is fired without notice, her dream is suddenly postponed to an uncertain future. Jobless and under financial pressure, she is forced to look for alternatives but, in order to achieve her goal, she is ready to discard her body, her social relationships and her own feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2yGm0QZlo4GSHVNTmbjTZVSnGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408197'),
  ('1041021005232559047', 'Marijuana', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Max Miller', 'Max Miller', 'Sonny Bono', null, 'Sonny Bono appears onscreen to tell kids that marijuana is a "bummer" that turns you into a "weedhead" and will make you "trip out" (the fact that, based upon his performance, Sonny appears to have ingested unknown substances before the cameras started rolling tends to limit the film''s crediblity somewhat).', 'Sonny Bono appears onscreen to tell kids that marijuana is a "bummer" that turns you into a "weedhead" and will make you "trip out" (the fact that, based upon his performance, Sonny appears to have ingested unknown substances before the cameras started rolling tends to limit the film''s crediblity somewhat).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xz7MGKKyxPK3AF56D8iPCeRzxoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129390'),
  ('336912064902035773', 'Marilena from P7', 2006, 'Drama', 'Cristian Nemescu', 'Cristian Nemescu, Tudor Voican', 'Mădălina Ghițescu, Gabriel Huian, Andi Vasluianu, Gabriel Spahiu, Aura Călărașu, Cristi Olesher, Andi Vasluianu, Cătălin Paraschiv', null, 'Andrei, a 13 year old teenager, living on Bucharest outskirts, decides one day to steal a trolleybus in order to impress Marilena, a prostitute he fell in love with.', 'Andrei, a 13 year old teenager, living on Bucharest outskirts, decides one day to steal a trolleybus in order to impress Marilena, a prostitute he fell in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UQnjmVC4poRnszfgkSc4Cb58tL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34064'),
  ('553139434030150838', 'Marilyn', 2018, 'Drama', 'Martín Rodríguez Redondo, Guillermo Saposnik, Felipe Solari Yrigoyen', 'Mariana Docampo, Martín Rodríguez Redondo, Mara Pescio', 'Walter Pez, Catalina Saavedra, Germán de Silva, Ignacio Giménez, Rodolfo García Werner, Andrew Bargsted, Josefina Paredes, Germán Baudino', null, 'Marcos and his family work as ranch hands. While his father and brother handle the heavier tasks, Marcos stays home, close to his mother. Each one has their future laid out before them, yet Marcos bides his time waiting for Carnival, the one moment where he can let his true self out to shine. The sudden death of his father leaves his family in a very vulnerable situation. The ranch owner hounds them to go away, while Marcos’s mother pressures him to take over the work in the fields. Nicknamed Marilyn by the other teenagers in town, Marcos is a target for desire and discrimination.', 'Marcos and his family work as ranch hands. While his father and brother handle the heavier tasks, Marcos stays home, close to his mother. Each one has their future laid out before them, yet Marcos bides his time waiting for Carnival, the one moment where he can let his true self out to shine. The sudden death of his father leaves his family in a very vulnerable situation. The ranch owner hounds them to go away, while Marcos’s mother pressures him to take over the work in the fields. Nicknamed Marilyn by the other teenagers in town, Marcos is a target for desire and discrimination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hQOCWJcQgrlrPYueP0nwG09zPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500831'),
  ('166111303375694953', 'Marilyn Hotchkiss'' Ballroom Dancing & Charm School', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Randall Miller, Jonathan Sela', 'Randall Miller', 'Robert Carlyle, John Goodman, Marisa Tomei, Mary Steenburgen, Elden Henson, Donnie Wahlberg, Sean Astin, David Paymer', 'PG-13', 'Frank Keane, a baker by trade, has been consumed by grief over his wife''s untimely death. But everything changes when he pulls his bread truck over on a rural highway to help a dying stranger entangled in a car wreck, who was on his way to a fateful reunion.', 'Frank Keane, a baker by trade, has been consumed by grief over his wife''s untimely death. But everything changes when he pulls his bread truck over on a rural highway to help a dying stranger entangled in a car wreck, who was on his way to a fateful reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEwS94mnWGL3tGpZFc5dU79Fbx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53905'),
  ('996126605521463869', 'Marilyn Monroe: The Final Days', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Patty Ivins', 'Monica Bider', 'James Coburn, Marilyn Monroe, Cyd Charisse, David Brown, Walter Bernstein, Gene Allen, George Barris', null, 'Marilyn Monroe''s final project, "Something''s Got to Give", has become one of the most talked about unfinished films in history. The story of the film and Marilyn''s last days were seemingly lost… until now. Through interviews, never-before-seen footage and an edited reconstruction of "Something''s Got to Give", Marilyn Monroe: The Final Days provides a definitive and fascinating look at the last act in the life of the world''s most famous and tragic superstar.', 'Marilyn Monroe''s final project, "Something''s Got to Give", has become one of the most talked about unfinished films in history. The story of the film and Marilyn''s last days were seemingly lost… until now. Through interviews, never-before-seen footage and an edited reconstruction of "Something''s Got to Give", Marilyn Monroe: The Final Days provides a definitive and fascinating look at the last act in the life of the world''s most famous and tragic superstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eZ7KAo85MXSYixv1IlqUVSQjGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64821'),
  ('212231712182821660', 'Marilyn Times Five', 1973, null, 'Bruce Conner', null, 'Arline Hunter', null, 'A commentary on the destructive expectations of females in a male dominated society, Marilyn Times Five was made from an old stag film called "The Apple-Knockers, and the Coke"(1948) these sections of the film were set to Marilyn Monroe''s song "I''m Through With Love". The film depicts a Marilyn Monroe look-a-like slowly taking her clothes off for the camera (the viewer). The woman''s actions are looped several times which gives the audience a sensation of exhaustion. That exhaustion keeps building until the very end where the woman is shown crumpled on the floor in an awkward position, which makes it appear as if she is lifeless.', 'A commentary on the destructive expectations of females in a male dominated society, Marilyn Times Five was made from an old stag film called "The Apple-Knockers, and the Coke"(1948) these sections of the film were set to Marilyn Monroe''s song "I''m Through With Love". The film depicts a Marilyn Monroe look-a-like slowly taking her clothes off for the camera (the viewer). The woman''s actions are looped several times which gives the audience a sensation of exhaustion. That exhaustion keeps building until the very end where the woman is shown crumpled on the floor in an awkward position, which makes it appear as if she is lifeless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igYKEVj6fIM3Kv4dxIypjgKrict.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130849'),
  ('287597329660846437', 'Marilyn''s Eyes', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Thérèse, Alessandro Specchio, Fabrizio Procaccini', 'Giulia Louise Steigerwalt', 'Miriam Leone, Stefano Accorsi, Thomas Trabacchi, Mario Pirrello, Orietta Notari, Marco Messeri, Andrea Di Casa, Valentina Oteri', null, 'Clara and Diego, under the guidance of the psychiatrist of a day rehabilitation center for disturbed people who attend, decide to transform the treatment center into a restaurant, involving all their other companions.', 'Clara and Diego, under the guidance of the psychiatrist of a day rehabilitation center for disturbed people who attend, decide to transform the treatment center into a restaurant, involving all their other companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpF3kiZhC1k2GkauHlolDy6UTSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776328'),
  ('860087627122986035', 'Marimbas from Hell', 2010, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Julio Hernández Cordón, María Secco', 'Julio Hernández Cordón', 'Roberto González Arévalo, Víctor Hugo Monterroso, Alfonso Tunché', null, 'Don Alfonso plays marimbas, the traditional Guatemalan instrument. Facing extortion and without work due to the population''s lack of interest for his instrument, he seeks refuge with his godson Chiquilín. Blacko is a pioneer of the Heavy Metal Guatemalan underground stage. He is also a doctor in the public hospital but nobody wants to be treated by him because of his long hair and his tattoos. Chiquilín makes connections for Don Alfonso and Blacko to combine their talents and create a brand new band called Marimbas from Hell.', 'Don Alfonso plays marimbas, the traditional Guatemalan instrument. Facing extortion and without work due to the population''s lack of interest for his instrument, he seeks refuge with his godson Chiquilín. Blacko is a pioneer of the Heavy Metal Guatemalan underground stage. He is also a doctor in the public hospital but nobody wants to be treated by him because of his long hair and his tattoos. Chiquilín makes connections for Don Alfonso and Blacko to combine their talents and create a brand new band called Marimbas from Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FRuDuwJoiQ4VwTA5Tubvg1LvtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95520'),
  ('899880040762318327', 'Marina', 2013, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Stijn Coninx', 'Rik D''Hiet', 'Matteo Simoni, Luigi Lo Cascio, Donatella Finocchiaro, Maité Redal, Evelien Bosmans, Cristiaan Campagna, Federica Marinò, Marte Bosmans', null, 'The true story of Rocco Granata, an Italian coal miner''s son who followed his passion for music against his father''s wishes and social barriers.', 'The true story of Rocco Granata, an Italian coal miner''s son who followed his passion for music against his father''s wishes and social barriers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ96f9bLfmW4XiyQH0nqtIYcmQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229582'),
  ('303763722687613864', 'Marina Abramović: The Artist Is Present', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Matthew Akers, Matthew Akers, Jeff Dupre', null, 'Marina Abramović, Ulay, Klaus Biesenbach, David Balliano, Chrissie Iles, Arthur Danto, David Blaine, James Franco', null, 'Performance artist Marina Abramovic prepares for a major retrospective of her work at the Museum of Modern Art in New York.', 'Performance artist Marina Abramovic prepares for a major retrospective of her work at the Museum of Modern Art in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CbjWJpB4TowXNXykRoUzqvyfVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84309'),
  ('695667344184610577', 'Marine Boy', 2009, 'Action, Thriller', 'Yoon Jong-seok, Kim Ji-yong, Shin Sang-yeul', 'Yoon Jong-seok', 'Kim Kang-woo, Cho Jae-hyun, Park Si-yeon, Kim Joon-bae, Jang Hye-jin, Oh Dae-hwan, Choi Su-rin', null, 'Marine Boy is the story of a former national swimmer who finds himself in debt, and out of desperation is employed as a mule by a gangster boss, smuggling drugs by sea.', 'Marine Boy is the story of a former national swimmer who finds himself in debt, and out of desperation is employed as a mule by a gangster boss, smuggling drugs by sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNNh4OdS5b6tvWNm6QgghYGU7H5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15286'),
  ('401099511424463851', 'Marine Life Interviews', 2016, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Ross Stevenson, Justin Ritter', 'Victoria Strouse, Andrew Stanton, Bob Peterson', 'Ty Burrell, Ellen DeGeneres, Idris Elba, Ed O''Neill, Kaitlin Olson, Dominic West', 'PG', 'Interviews with the animals at the Marine Life Institute about their experiences with Dory.', 'Interviews with the animals at the Marine Life Institute about their experiences with Dory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKTFsng12wXI75c84WFKnDHQ2Qa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427004'),
  ('963670412126366259', 'Marinette', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Xavier Dolléans, Sophie Pochon, Maryam Barakat', 'Virginie Verrier', 'Garance Marillier, Émilie Dequenne, Fred Testot, Sylvie Testud, Alban Lenoir, Frankie Wallach, Caroline Proust, Gore Abrams', null, 'Born in 1975, Marinette Pichon was a born soccer player. Raised by a courageous mother who had to deal with an abusive husband, she overcame difficulties and developed unwavering determination. While juggling odd jobs and her sporting career, she was selected for the French national team and then spotted by a major American club. Marinette then moved to the United States with her mother, pursuing her dream of becoming the best player in the world.', 'Born in 1975, Marinette Pichon was a born soccer player. Raised by a courageous mother who had to deal with an abusive husband, she overcame difficulties and developed unwavering determination. While juggling odd jobs and her sporting career, she was selected for the French national team and then spotted by a major American club. Marinette then moved to the United States with her mother, pursuing her dream of becoming the best player in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aM7o55PKT45q630Qmma1fNu99Cd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953735'),
  ('622219458917347988', 'Mario', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sophie Maintigneux, Marcel Gisler', 'Frederic Moriette, Marcel Gisler, Thomas Hess', 'Max Hubacher, Aaron Altaras, Jessy Moravec, Jürg Plüss, Doro Müggler, Andreas Matti, Joris Gratwohl, Scherwin Amini', 'NR', 'Two young gay soccer players get caught up between the politics of the game and the politics of love.', 'Two young gay soccer players get caught up between the politics of the game and the politics of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VD60V0a1jyuL6thW5yeSL3LLR6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500259'),
