  ('742327474240539035', 'Mario, Maria and Mario', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ettore Scola, Luciano Tovoli', 'Ettore Scola, Silvia Scola', 'Giulio Scarpati, Valéria Cavalli, Enrico Lo Verso, Laura Betti, Willer Bordon, Maria Laura De Rosa', null, 'Mario and Maria Boschi, a 30-year-old couple with small children, are hit by a crisis: husband and wife cannot agree on a party name. A colleague, also named Mario, makes an impressive speech, and Maria find herself increasingly attracted to him. She feels able to relate to him like she could to her husband in the old days. They spend the night together, and she falls ill. When she is asked by her husband to leave the house, she realizes that there may be a difference between real love and a vague need for understanding.', 'Mario and Maria Boschi, a 30-year-old couple with small children, are hit by a crisis: husband and wife cannot agree on a party name. A colleague, also named Mario, makes an impressive speech, and Maria find herself increasingly attracted to him. She feels able to relate to him like she could to her husband in the old days. They spend the night together, and she falls ill. When she is asked by her husband to leave the house, she realizes that there may be a difference between real love and a vague need for understanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNMG0LMZnyY78yDFq8bPTd68VND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95614'),
  ('911268377447618009', 'Mario''s War', 2006, 'Drama', 'Antonio Capuano, Luca Bigazzi, Gennaro Fasolino', 'Antonio Capuano', 'Valeria Golino, Marco Grieco, Andrea Renzi, Imma Villa, Sergio Longobardi, Rossella Vitantonio, Angela Colella, Davide Giacobbe', null, 'A court takes 9-year-old Mario away from his abusive family and entrusts him to a childless couple. For the three of them, living together is difficult and often painful, since they come from two different worlds. To cope with loneliness and displacement, Mario creates his own world, where he meets Schad Sky, an imaginary friend.', 'A court takes 9-year-old Mario away from his abusive family and entrusts him to a childless couple. For the three of them, living together is difficult and often painful, since they come from two different worlds. To cope with loneliness and displacement, Mario creates his own world, where he meets Schad Sky, an imaginary friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qgHtvQSLsIQ2kofOhVK07ovWjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24176'),
  ('582777982132059459', 'Marion, 13 ans pour toujours', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Bourlem Guerdjou, Steven Ghouti, Pierre Milon', 'Lorraine Lévy', 'Julie Gayet, Fabrizio Rongione, Luàna Bajrami, Tatiana Rojo, Alice Perez-Malartre, Xavier Robic, Mohamed Badissy, Laura Renoncourt', null, 'The real story of Marion Fraisse, who committed suicide at the age of 13 after being viciously and repeatedly bullied by her classmates.', 'The real story of Marion Fraisse, who committed suicide at the age of 13 after being viciously and repeatedly bullied by her classmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSKdBOQ4IiOOTR4ypwmtmLuFkUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418308'),
  ('295816998803469621', 'Marionette', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Park Kyung-kun, Lee Han-uk, Park Gyeong-gyun', 'Lee Han-uk', 'Lee You-young, Kim Hie-won, Oh Ha-ni, Lee Hak-ju, Kim Da-mi, Kim Young-sun, Lee Je-yeon, Jang Hyuk-jin', null, 'A mystery crime thriller about a man who calls himself Master and sends mysterious texts with images of young women that they don''t remember taking. A teacher and a former detective become involved in the escalating series of crimes.', 'A mystery crime thriller about a man who calls himself Master and sends mysterious texts with images of young women that they don''t remember taking. A teacher and a former detective become involved in the escalating series of crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4usf7LwVmEvzhul0HAO1j0hkrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490176'),
  ('751873316199302311', 'Marionette', 2020, 'Drama', 'Álvaro Curiel', 'Arturo Arango, Álvaro Curiel', 'Rafael Ernesto, Fátima Molina, Juan Manuel Bernal, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Ethan Meberek, Aleyda Gallardo, Martha Claudia Moreno, Nicolasa Ortíz Monasterio', null, 'Ernesto, a Cuban actor who decides to audition in Mexico, is stranded in the gigantic city when he fails to achieve a leading role in an important play. Facing the dilemma of returning defeated to his home, he accidentally meets Belén in the subway, a spontaneous actress who tells stories or lies in exchange for some coins.', 'Ernesto, a Cuban actor who decides to audition in Mexico, is stranded in the gigantic city when he fails to achieve a leading role in an important play. Facing the dilemma of returning defeated to his home, he accidentally meets Belén in the subway, a spontaneous actress who tells stories or lies in exchange for some coins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSAMCU0kGxPGDFuxcORmbk4wgRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567360'),
  ('604723597756115136', 'Marisa', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Bolognini, Carlo Carlini, Enzo De Pasquale', 'Lucia Drudi Demby, Pier Paolo Pasolini, Mauro Bolognini', 'Marisa Allasio, Renato Salvatori, Francisco Rabal, Luz Márquez, Ángel Aranda, María Cuadra, Giancarlo Zarfati, Ennio Girolami', null, 'For the 17-year-old Mariza, there is no other house than the train station in Civitavecchia. Here, an orphaned girl lives early after the death of her father, a railwayman; here she earns additionally at the station buffet, selling ice cream to passengers of passing trains. Beautiful and brisk, she was accustomed to the admiration of others and perfectly mastered the art of coquetry, but Marise’s heart remains calm until the young sailor Angelo, who is in a hurry on her first voyage, leaves the train on the platform on a sunny Sunday morning.', 'For the 17-year-old Mariza, there is no other house than the train station in Civitavecchia. Here, an orphaned girl lives early after the death of her father, a railwayman; here she earns additionally at the station buffet, selling ice cream to passengers of passing trains. Beautiful and brisk, she was accustomed to the admiration of others and perfectly mastered the art of coquetry, but Marise’s heart remains calm until the young sailor Angelo, who is in a hurry on her first voyage, leaves the train on the platform on a sunny Sunday morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyLdAPpPAgh6hXZpSNBD3M7sAcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206674'),
  ('942509766903452136', 'Marisa in the Woods', 2018, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Antonio Morales, Dani Lisón', 'Antonio Morales', 'Patricia Jordá, Aida de la Cruz, Mauricio Bautista, Ibán Malo', null, 'Marisa feels that she is the supporting actress of her own life. She has no job, no projects, no prospects for the future. She looks away from her own life''s downfall to become the rescuer of her best friend Mina, who is immersed in a desperate crisis after the break-up of her relationship with Salvador. When she tries to get help from other friends, she only finds more lives adrift. Then, some unexpected news breaks the difficult balance of her life, and Marisa can only find comfort in the city nightlife. She is ready to disappear, silent and quietly, like fading into black.', 'Marisa feels that she is the supporting actress of her own life. She has no job, no projects, no prospects for the future. She looks away from her own life''s downfall to become the rescuer of her best friend Mina, who is immersed in a desperate crisis after the break-up of her relationship with Salvador. When she tries to get help from other friends, she only finds more lives adrift. Then, some unexpected news breaks the difficult balance of her life, and Marisa can only find comfort in the city nightlife. She is ready to disappear, silent and quietly, like fading into black.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6iHOHRbgIitlj5FtH3h4L9UMWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453546'),
  ('225170410506705073', 'Marisol rumbo a Río', 1963, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Fernando Palacios, Antonio L. Ballesteros, Manuel de la Cueva', 'José María Palacio, Arturo Rígel, Alfonso Paso', 'Marisol, Isabel Garcés, José Marco Davó, Rafaela Aparicio, Gisia Paradís, Fernando Cebrián, George Rigaud, José Thelman', null, 'Separated by continents, twin sisters Marisol and Mariluz live worlds apart—one in Madrid with her struggling mother, the other in Rio under the care of a wealthy uncle. When Marisol’s mother sacrifices everything to reunite the family in Brazil, their arrival threatens a sinister scheme: Mariluz’s governess and her lover are plotting to steal the uncle’s fortune. With the truth unraveling and danger closing in, the twins must fight not just for reunion—but for survival.', 'Separated by continents, twin sisters Marisol and Mariluz live worlds apart—one in Madrid with her struggling mother, the other in Rio under the care of a wealthy uncle. When Marisol’s mother sacrifices everything to reunite the family in Brazil, their arrival threatens a sinister scheme: Mariluz’s governess and her lover are plotting to steal the uncle’s fortune. With the truth unraveling and danger closing in, the twins must fight not just for reunion—but for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zs208fYHyqqoG0lrf9xpLOXxVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103925'),
  ('460683601143066791', 'Marius', 1931, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alexander Korda, Theodore J. Pahle', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Raimu, Pierre Fresnay, Orane Demazis, Fernand Charpin, Robert Vattier, Paul Dullac, Alida Rouffe, Alexandre Mihalesco', null, 'César runs a bar along Marseilles'' port, assisted by his 23-year-old son, Marius. Friends since childhood, Fanny and Marius love each other, but Marius has a secret wanderlust: every ship''s whistle stirs a longing for foreign lands. When M. Panisse seeks Fanny''s hand in marriage and when a departing clipper needs a deckhand, Marius and Fanny must decide who and what they love most. César, with his generous, wise spirit, tries to guide his son.', 'César runs a bar along Marseilles'' port, assisted by his 23-year-old son, Marius. Friends since childhood, Fanny and Marius love each other, but Marius has a secret wanderlust: every ship''s whistle stirs a longing for foreign lands. When M. Panisse seeks Fanny''s hand in marriage and when a departing clipper needs a deckhand, Marius and Fanny must decide who and what they love most. César, with his generous, wise spirit, tries to guide his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dpo4ZJ4Sdv9XEUKNRGXvO6gp87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42818'),
  ('990182547257242542', 'Marius', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel Auteuil, Jean-François Robin, Alain Olivieri', 'Daniel Auteuil', 'Daniel Auteuil, Raphaël Personnaz, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Victoire Bélézy, Marie-Anne Chazel, Nicolas Vaude, Daniel Russo, Rufus', null, '"Marius" takes place in Marseilles'' Old Port, at the La Marine Bar, owned by César and his son Marius. Marius'' biggest dream is to embark on one of the boats passing by his dad''s bar and to set off to a faraway land. Fanny, a young and pretty seafood peddler, has secretly been in love with Marius since her childhood; Marius, never admitting it, has always loved Fanny. One day, a sailor drops by La Marine and offers him a job on an exploratory ship. Trying to hold him off and to make him jealous, Fanny confesses his love to him and provokes a fight between Marius and one of César''s old friends, Panisse, a boat merchant, who despite his old age, has been courting Fanny for a while. Torn between the call of the sea and his love for her, Marius abandons his dream to be with Fanny who gives herself to him. As César and Honorine, Fanny''s mother, are getting ready for the wedding, Marius changes his mind, drawn back to the call of the sea.', '"Marius" takes place in Marseilles'' Old Port, at the La Marine Bar, owned by César and his son Marius. Marius'' biggest dream is to embark on one of the boats passing by his dad''s bar and to set off to a faraway land. Fanny, a young and pretty seafood peddler, has secretly been in love with Marius since her childhood; Marius, never admitting it, has always loved Fanny. One day, a sailor drops by La Marine and offers him a job on an exploratory ship. Trying to hold him off and to make him jealous, Fanny confesses his love to him and provokes a fight between Marius and one of César''s old friends, Panisse, a boat merchant, who despite his old age, has been courting Fanny for a while. Torn between the call of the sea and his love for her, Marius abandons his dream to be with Fanny who gives herself to him. As César and Honorine, Fanny''s mother, are getting ready for the wedding, Marius changes his mind, drawn back to the call of the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SF1K2NNF4jTAwTj3ersomzjDzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200645'),
  ('523183797113062400', 'Marius & The Treasure Hunters', 2025, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Tony T. Datis, Arnaud Depiesse, Benjamin Dol', 'Dominique Gauriaud, Tony T. Datis, Jim Birmant', 'Soprano, Anys Ajbouh, Imran Bouzalim, Fatou Niass, Sofia Belabbes, Nordine Salhi, Walid Ben Amar, Nassim Bouguezzi', null, 'As a group of kids, whose families have been kicked out of their Marseille neighborhood, are about to leave forever, and just as they''re about to pack up their dreams they find a mysterious box containing clues to a hidden treasure. Hoping to save their homes, they seek the help of Marius, the so-called "King of Marseille"?', 'As a group of kids, whose families have been kicked out of their Marseille neighborhood, are about to leave forever, and just as they''re about to pack up their dreams they find a mysterious box containing clues to a hidden treasure. Hoping to save their homes, they seek the help of Marius, the so-called "King of Marseille"?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fZnhn0SmHztpsHPu8BybUCPbDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284484'),
  ('1145768340179178675', 'Marius and Jeannette', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Robert Guédiguian, Bernard Cavalié', 'Robert Guédiguian, Jean-Louis Milesi', 'Ariane Ascaride, Gérard Meylan, Pascale Roberts, Jacques Boudet, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Frédérique Bonnal, Laetitia Pesenti, Miloud Nacer', null, 'Jeannette is a single mother living in a working-class community in Marseilles; she tries to support herself and her two kids on her salary as a check-out girl at a supermarket and lives in an apartment complex where everyone is thrown into close proximity with everyone else. Marius is working as a security guard at a cement factory that has gone out of business; he''s also squatting in the building, since the plant is soon to be demolished and he''ll be needing his money later on. One day, Jeannette happens by the factory, and spotting several cans of paint, tries to take two of them home with her. Marius spots her and tries to chase her away, while she rails at him with curses against the capitalist system. The next day, an apologetic Marius appears at her doorstep, cans of paint in hand; the two soon become friendly, and a romance begins to bloom, though it quickly becomes obvious that Jeannette''s romance novel fantasies are a bit off the mark from what Marius has in mind.', 'Jeannette is a single mother living in a working-class community in Marseilles; she tries to support herself and her two kids on her salary as a check-out girl at a supermarket and lives in an apartment complex where everyone is thrown into close proximity with everyone else. Marius is working as a security guard at a cement factory that has gone out of business; he''s also squatting in the building, since the plant is soon to be demolished and he''ll be needing his money later on. One day, Jeannette happens by the factory, and spotting several cans of paint, tries to take two of them home with her. Marius spots her and tries to chase her away, while she rails at him with curses against the capitalist system. The next day, an apologetic Marius appears at her doorstep, cans of paint in hand; the two soon become friendly, and a romance begins to bloom, though it quickly becomes obvious that Jeannette''s romance novel fantasies are a bit off the mark from what Marius has in mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6avoR3mDjg2UN5BGVrkpe5M94RF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64968'),
  ('922474331483434055', 'Marjaavaan', 2019, 'Romance, Action', 'Abhishek Banerjee, Priyanka Gaherwar, Anmol Ahuja', null, 'Riteish Deshmukh, Sidharth Malhotra, Tara Sutaria, Rakul Preet Singh, Nassar, Ravi Kishan, Bikramjeet Kanwarpal, Nora Fatehi', null, 'Raghu and Zoya are enjoying their lives together until a gang leader with harmful intentions turns their world upside down.', 'Raghu and Zoya are enjoying their lives together until a gang leader with harmful intentions turns their world upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xILMQFZMQdJq3D7J6TuLrW6A3W5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627715'),
  ('1115887242188849456', 'Marjoe', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Howard Smith, Sarah Kernochan, Ed Lynch', null, 'Marjoe Gortner, Vernon Gortner, Agnes Benjamin, Sarah Kernochan', 'PG', 'Part documentary, part expose, this film follows one-time child evangelist Marjoe Gortner on the "church tent" Revivalist circuit, commenting on the showmanship of Evangelism and "the religion business", prior to the start of "televangelism". Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', 'Part documentary, part expose, this film follows one-time child evangelist Marjoe Gortner on the "church tent" Revivalist circuit, commenting on the showmanship of Evangelism and "the religion business", prior to the start of "televangelism". Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVSNmaflCEso1i9JAlJmQdJvUnf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38616'),
  ('198788112724748332', 'Marjorie Morningstar', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Irving Rapper, Harry Stradling Sr., Don Alvarado', 'Everett Freeman', 'Gene Kelly, Natalie Wood, Claire Trevor, Everett Sloane, Martin Milner, Carolyn Jones, George Tobias, Martin Balsam', 'NR', 'While working as a counselor at a summer camp, college-student Marjorie Morgenstern falls for 32-year-old Noel Airman, a would-be dramatist working at a nearby summer theater. Like Marjorie, he is an upper-middle-class New York Jew, but has fallen away from his roots, and Marjorie''s parents object among other things to his lack of a suitable profession. Noel himself warns Marjorie repeatedly that she''s much too naive and conventional for him, but they nonetheless fall in love.', 'While working as a counselor at a summer camp, college-student Marjorie Morgenstern falls for 32-year-old Noel Airman, a would-be dramatist working at a nearby summer theater. Like Marjorie, he is an upper-middle-class New York Jew, but has fallen away from his roots, and Marjorie''s parents object among other things to his lack of a suitable profession. Noel himself warns Marjorie repeatedly that she''s much too naive and conventional for him, but they nonetheless fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GcFa930a5FJRxLs1bTGAscMxdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33731'),
  ('10965219258825033', 'Marjorie Prime', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Michael Almereyda, Sean Price Williams', 'Michael Almereyda, Jordan Harrison', 'Geena Davis, Hannah Gross, Jon Hamm, India Reed Kotis, Leslie Lyles, Cashus Muse, Tim Robbins, Hana Colley', null, 'A service which creates holographic projections of late family members allows an elderly woman to spend time with a younger version of her deceased husband.', 'A service which creates holographic projections of late family members allows an elderly woman to spend time with a younger version of her deceased husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvTZFjcNvzPFYJnmdrvSrGvqx67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426254'),
  ('311454608536383923', 'Mark Antony', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Abinandhan Ramanujam, Adhik Ravichandran, Ravi Kandasamy', 'Adhik Ravichandran', 'Vishal Krishna, S. J. Suryah, Sunil Varma, Selvaraghavan, Ritu Varma, Abhinaya, Redin Kingsley, Y. G. Mahendran', null, 'Set in 1995, Mark, a skilled mechanic and the son of a former gangster, stumbles upon a phone that has the ability to connect with the past, tries to save his estranged mother from a grim fate. While facing his own family''s legacy, Mark must navigate through dangerous consequences of altering the past, as it causes unforeseen repercussions in the present.', 'Set in 1995, Mark, a skilled mechanic and the son of a former gangster, stumbles upon a phone that has the ability to connect with the past, tries to save his estranged mother from a grim fate. While facing his own family''s legacy, Mark must navigate through dangerous consequences of altering the past, as it causes unforeseen repercussions in the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xz1lfMrFlNtZ4H8DQKvYog8ilR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922087'),
  ('696862528206688052', 'Mark Cavendish: Never Enough', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Alex Kiehl', null, 'Mark Cavendish, Lance Armstrong, Patrick Lefèvere, Peta Louise Todd', null, 'An uplifting profile in resilience and self-belief that reveals the inside story of one of the most inspiring and unexpected comebacks in sporting history.', 'An uplifting profile in resilience and self-belief that reveals the inside story of one of the most inspiring and unexpected comebacks in sporting history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4tGTDDCjSko6a7fNU2rbK7ur7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148445'),
  ('1082142359779954401', 'Mark Felt: The Man Who Brought Down the White House', 2017, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Peter Landesman, Adam Kimmel', 'Peter Landesman', 'Liam Neeson, Diane Lane, Maika Monroe, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Julian Morris, Josh Lucas, Tony Goldwyn, Kate Walsh', 'PG-13', 'The story of Mark Felt, who under the name "Deep Throat" helped journalists Bob Woodward and Carl Bernstein uncover the Watergate scandal in 1974.', 'The story of Mark Felt, who under the name "Deep Throat" helped journalists Bob Woodward and Carl Bernstein uncover the Watergate scandal in 1974.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Oq2lQaePXJJwcguc8aqB7EpduZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390061'),
  ('431845236295142763', 'Mark of an Angel', 2008, 'Drama', 'Safy Nebbou', 'Cyril Gomez-Mathieu, Safy Nebbou', 'Catherine Frot, Sandrine Bonnaire, Wladimir Yordanoff, Antoine Chappey, Michel Aumont, Michèle Moretti, Sophie Quinton, Geneviève Rey-Penchenat', null, 'Elsa Valentin is in the middle of a brutal divorce and custody battle when she is struck by the appearance of a pretty young girl named Lola (Héloïse Cunin). Her interest in the child grows to an obsession, and she finds any possible excuse to be near her. When Lola''s mother, Claire, grows unnerved by all this, Elsa admits she believes Lola is her daughter.', 'Elsa Valentin is in the middle of a brutal divorce and custody battle when she is struck by the appearance of a pretty young girl named Lola (Héloïse Cunin). Her interest in the child grows to an obsession, and she finds any possible excuse to be near her. When Lola''s mother, Claire, grows unnerved by all this, Elsa admits she believes Lola is her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQgVKteuKjlBNdsXIIqFLCAiEaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12446'),
  ('316726188758043003', 'Mark of the Devil', 1970, 'Horror, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Michael Armstrong, Adrian Hoven, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Michael Armstrong, Adrian Hoven', 'Herbert Lom, Udo Kier, Olivera Katarina, Reggie Nalder, Herbert Fux, Johannes Buzalski, Michael Maien, Gaby Fuchs', null, 'In 1700s Austria, a witch-hunter''s apprentice has doubts about the righteousness of witch-hunting when he witnesses the brutality, the injustice, the falsehood, the torture and the arbitrary killing that go with the job.', 'In 1700s Austria, a witch-hunter''s apprentice has doubts about the righteousness of witch-hunting when he witnesses the brutality, the injustice, the falsehood, the torture and the arbitrary killing that go with the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbSXuasXM9wLL8xSq280TkGqmf8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39931'),
  ('653974888503277662', 'Mark of the Devil Part II', 1973, 'Horror', 'Adrian Hoven, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Michael Armstrong, Adrian Hoven, Fred Denger', 'Erika Blanc, Anton Diffring, Percy Hoven, Reggie Nalder, Jean-Pierre Zola, Lukas Ammann, Ellen Umlauf, Harry Hardt', 'R', 'A tribunal interrogates, tortures and murders "witches" and "heretics" during the Inquisition.', 'A tribunal interrogates, tortures and murders "witches" and "heretics" during the Inquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMUd4AC4PnoZWUZuP2gWDIexuaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27489'),
  ('663319955271790262', 'Mark of the Tortoise', 1964, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Alfred Vohrer, Bruno Mondi, Eva Ebner', 'Will Tremper', 'Hildegard Knef, Götz George, Richard Münch, Heinz Reincke, Carl Lange, Pinkas Braun, Adelheid Seeck, Hans Paetsch', null, 'English millionaire Sir Cyrus Bradley is being blackmailed by “The Tortoise” Crime Syndicate. He is to pay £ 100,000.00 Pounds to stay alive and not be murdered. After his refusal to pay the money, he is quickly killed. Cyrus‘ nephew, Don Micklem, plans to avenge the death of his uncle and sets out on a quest to expose “The Tortoise“…', 'English millionaire Sir Cyrus Bradley is being blackmailed by “The Tortoise” Crime Syndicate. He is to pay £ 100,000.00 Pounds to stay alive and not be murdered. After his refusal to pay the money, he is quickly killed. Cyrus‘ nephew, Don Micklem, plans to avenge the death of his uncle and sets out on a quest to expose “The Tortoise“…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AHSH9aDfZ1bGKJHHNzbGv6S1TC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70470'),
  ('853354355676552501', 'Mark of the Vampire', 1935, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Tod Browning, James Wong Howe, Harry Sharrock', 'John L. Balderston, H.S. Kraft, Samuel Ornitz', 'Lionel Barrymore, Elizabeth Allan, Bela Lugosi, Lionel Atwill, Jean Hersholt, Henry Wadsworth, Donald Meek, Jessie Ralph', null, 'Sir Borotyn, a prominent Prague resident, is discovered murdered in his home, with all indications pointing to a vampire assault. The victim''s friend, Baron Otto, and the physician who analyzes the body, are certain that the vampire is the mysterious Count Mora or his daughter. Receiving little help from the law, Professor Zelen, an expert in the occult, is called in to assist with their investigation.', 'Sir Borotyn, a prominent Prague resident, is discovered murdered in his home, with all indications pointing to a vampire assault. The victim''s friend, Baron Otto, and the physician who analyzes the body, are certain that the vampire is the mysterious Count Mora or his daughter. Receiving little help from the law, Professor Zelen, an expert in the occult, is called in to assist with their investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6JN2kIEYwXEHHmqEa86aMKDJj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28910'),
  ('312915601717864740', 'Mark of the Witch', 1970, 'Horror', 'Tom Moore, Jim Carver', 'Martha Peters, Mary Davis', 'Robert Elston, Barbara Brownell, Gary Brockette, Anitra Walsh, Darryl Wells, Jack Gardner, Marie Santell, Sande Drewes', 'NR', 'A 300-year-old witch terrorizes a college town to get revenge on the descendant of the man who persecuted her.', 'A 300-year-old witch terrorizes a college town to get revenge on the descendant of the man who persecuted her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qObcGnlli4zlCc99DpTQv95GBZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156068'),
  ('290725450321699469', 'Mark, Mary + Some Other People', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hannah Marks, Casey Stolberg', 'Hannah Marks', 'Ben Rosenfield, Hayley Law, Nik Dodani, Odessa A''zion, Matt Shively, Sofia Bryant, Maggie Wheeler, Kelli Berglund', null, 'Mark and Mary''s meet-cute happens at a neighborhood drug store, where she is busy buying a pregnancy test, and he has to make an effort to remind her they met in college. After asking her out, he accompanies her as she takes the test, and upon it showing negative, she agrees to a date. One year later, they have fallen deeply, passionately, head over heels in love, and their whirlwind romance leads to marriage. So when Mary suddenly requests they open their relationship to “ethical non-monogamy”, Mark is taken by surprise, but agrees to try it. And that''s where this story really begins.', 'Mark and Mary''s meet-cute happens at a neighborhood drug store, where she is busy buying a pregnancy test, and he has to make an effort to remind her they met in college. After asking her out, he accompanies her as she takes the test, and upon it showing negative, she agrees to a date. One year later, they have fallen deeply, passionately, head over heels in love, and their whirlwind romance leads to marriage. So when Mary suddenly requests they open their relationship to “ethical non-monogamy”, Mark is taken by surprise, but agrees to try it. And that''s where this story really begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kbBVx5MRaPq7sN01CR4dF6quqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820923'),
  ('61116375277481656', 'Marked Eyes', 1964, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Hossein, Jean Boffety', 'André Tabet, Georges Tabet', 'Michèle Morgan, Robert Hossein, François Patrice, Paul Mercey, Yvette Etiévant, Pascal Mazzotti, Marie-France Pisier', null, 'A story about a widow who begins to receive blackmail letters demanding money from her. This is when everyone in the small town she lives in dismissing her husband.', 'A story about a widow who begins to receive blackmail letters demanding money from her. This is when everyone in the small town she lives in dismissing her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsOF4lhusaQZy7jIio2yYhiKEOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104916'),
  ('481410339564675752', 'Marked for Death', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Dwight H. Little, Ric Waite, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Michael Grais, Mark Victor', 'Steven Seagal, Basil Wallace, Keith David, Tom Wright, Joanna Pacula, Elizabeth Gracen, Bette Ford, Danielle Harris', 'R', 'Just retired from the Drug Enforcement Agency, John Hatcher returns to his hometown and quickly discovers that drugs have infiltrated his old neighborhood. Determined to drive the dealers out, Hatcher crosses paths with a ferocious Jamaican drug lord who vows that Hatcher and his family are now marked for death.', 'Just retired from the Drug Enforcement Agency, John Hatcher returns to his hometown and quickly discovers that drugs have infiltrated his old neighborhood. Determined to drive the dealers out, Hatcher crosses paths with a ferocious Jamaican drug lord who vows that Hatcher and his family are now marked for death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYaetJsSm5FC1zxhdW8UR1NVXzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10173'),
  ('588258129793275141', 'Marked Men: Rule + Shaw', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nick Cassavetes, Kenji Katori', 'Sharon Soboil', 'Chase Stokes, Sydney Taylor, Ella Balinska, Evan Mock, Alexander Ludwig, Natalie Alyn Lind, Matthew Noszka, Hannah Kepple', 'R', 'Shaw Landon has loved Rule Archer from the moment she laid eyes on him. Rule, a fiery-tempered rebel tattoo artist, doesn’t have time for a good girl pre-med student like Shaw — even if she’s the only one who can see the person he truly is. She lives by other people’s rules; he makes his own. But a short skirt, too many birthday cocktails, and spilled secrets lead to a night neither can forget. Now, Shaw and Rule must figure out how a girl like her and a guy like him are supposed to be together without destroying their love…or each other.', 'Shaw Landon has loved Rule Archer from the moment she laid eyes on him. Rule, a fiery-tempered rebel tattoo artist, doesn’t have time for a good girl pre-med student like Shaw — even if she’s the only one who can see the person he truly is. She lives by other people’s rules; he makes his own. But a short skirt, too many birthday cocktails, and spilled secrets lead to a night neither can forget. Now, Shaw and Rule must figure out how a girl like her and a guy like him are supposed to be together without destroying their love…or each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZQU8BtCH2IbMZq6QETiU4HXQSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078600'),
  ('950960755302059414', 'Marked Woman', 1937, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lloyd Bacon, George Barnes, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Robert Rossen, Abem Finkel', 'Bette Davis, Humphrey Bogart, Lola Lane, Isabel Jewell, Rosalind Marquis, Mayo Methot, Jane Bryan, Allen Jenkins', 'NR', 'In the underworld of Manhattan, a woman dares to stand up to one of the city''s most powerful gangsters.', 'In the underworld of Manhattan, a woman dares to stand up to one of the city''s most powerful gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJHNkbEnyjQUl8DXWxk127hNEhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25563'),
  ('415137366096010455', 'Marketa Lazarová', 1967, 'Drama, History', 'František Vláčil, Jiří Zobač, Josef Zavadil', 'František Pavlíček, František Vláčil', 'František Velecký, Magda Vášáryová, Ivan Palúch, Pavla Polášková, Vlastimil Harapes, Michal Kožuch, Josef Kemr, Naďa Hejná', null, 'Mikolás and his brother Adam end up with a young German hostage of noble blood during a robbery. While their clan prepares for the wrath of the German king, Mikolás is sent to pressure his neighbor Lazar into a defense pact. Persuasion fails and he abducts Lazar''s daughter Marketa on the eve of her initiation as a nun in an act of vengeance.', 'Mikolás and his brother Adam end up with a young German hostage of noble blood during a robbery. While their clan prepares for the wrath of the German king, Mikolás is sent to pressure his neighbor Lazar into a defense pact. Persuasion fails and he abducts Lazar''s daughter Marketa on the eve of her initiation as a nun in an act of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c16ArEPUqb0RdUyZBH6fnO7ZiLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25904'),
  ('21461609493016672', 'Marlene', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Maximilian Schell, Pavel Hispler, Henry Hauck', null, 'Marlene Dietrich, Maximilian Schell, David Hemmings, Annie Albers, Bernard Hall, Patricia Schell, Marta Rasoknik', null, 'Retrospective on the career of enigmatic screen diva Marlene Dietrich.', 'Retrospective on the career of enigmatic screen diva Marlene Dietrich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkjXTH5LZlAQt48SvqFLV4CK4Pm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42093'),
  ('150978497978838409', 'Marlene', 2000, 'Drama', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'Christian Pfannenschmidt', 'Katja Flint, Herbert Knaup, Heino Ferch, Hans-Werner Meyer, Christiane Paul, Suzanne von Borsody, Armin Rohde, Monica Bleibtreu', null, 'In this biopic, Marlene Dietrich leaves Berlin for Hollywood, where she establishes herself as an international star through various film roles.', 'In this biopic, Marlene Dietrich leaves Berlin for Hollywood, where she establishes herself as an international star through various film roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVHrLET8E5PMh4B8jYKnD5orgMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10415'),
  ('1006041312038665242', 'Marlene', 2020, 'Action', 'Stefan Müller', 'Stefan Müller', 'Caroline Mercedes Hochfelner, Paul Hassler, August Schmölzer, Eva Maria Marold, David Miesmer, Siruan Darbandi, Sophia Grabner, Corinna Pumm', null, 'Frank is a contract killer working for a large Styrian crime syndicate. When he is given the task of abducting a girl named Marlene and delivering her to the syndicate, everything changes for Frank. He falls in love with Marlene and disobeys his superiors, who in turn take matters into their own hands and abduct Marlene themselves. Now Frank has to battle the blunt forces of the syndicate in order to save Marlene.', 'Frank is a contract killer working for a large Styrian crime syndicate. When he is given the task of abducting a girl named Marlene and delivering her to the syndicate, everything changes for Frank. He falls in love with Marlene and disobeys his superiors, who in turn take matters into their own hands and abduct Marlene themselves. Now Frank has to battle the blunt forces of the syndicate in order to save Marlene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVXSmL8XS7hOcejq2lR3SFyLx99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484664'),
  ('185116487323494732', 'Marley', 2012, 'Music, Documentary', 'Mike Eley, Alwin H. Küchler, Kevin Macdonald', null, 'Bob Marley, Rita Marley, Ziggy Marley, Bunny Wailer, Jimmy Cliff, Cedella Marley, Chris Blackwell', 'NR', 'Bob Marley''s universal appeal, impact on music history and role as a social and political prophet is both unique and unparalleled. Directed by Academy Award-winning director Kevin Macdonald (The Last King of Scotland), MARLEY is the definitive life story of the musician, revolutionary, and legend, from his early days to his rise to international superstardom. Made with the support of the Marley family, the film features rare footage, incredible performances and revelatory interviews with the people that knew him best.', 'Bob Marley''s universal appeal, impact on music history and role as a social and political prophet is both unique and unparalleled. Directed by Academy Award-winning director Kevin Macdonald (The Last King of Scotland), MARLEY is the definitive life story of the musician, revolutionary, and legend, from his early days to his rise to international superstardom. Made with the support of the Marley family, the film features rare footage, incredible performances and revelatory interviews with the people that knew him best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UQM8zsQ4HhUr4dMgDDDMBrsq5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90125'),
  ('365114311898961821', 'Marley & Me', 2008, 'Comedy, Family', 'David Frankel, Florian Ballhaus, Mario Ventenilla', 'Scott Frank, Don Roos', 'Owen Wilson, Jennifer Aniston, Eric Dane, Kathleen Turner, Alan Arkin, Nathan Gamble, Haley Bennett, Haley Higgins', 'PG', 'A newly married couple, in the process of starting a family, learn many of life''s important lessons from their trouble-loving retriever, Marley. Packed with plenty of laughs to lighten the load, the film explores the highs and lows of marriage, maturity and confronting one''s own mortality, as seen through the lens of family life with a dog.', 'A newly married couple, in the process of starting a family, learn many of life''s important lessons from their trouble-loving retriever, Marley. Packed with plenty of laughs to lighten the load, the film explores the highs and lows of marriage, maturity and confronting one''s own mortality, as seen through the lens of family life with a dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnB6hjTKylb0Ve2nUWt16gzkErr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14306'),
  ('477354168214050738', 'Marley & Me: The Puppy Years', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michael Damian, Ron Stannett, Tracey Poirier', 'Michael Damian, Janeen Damian', 'Travis Turner, Julia Rhodes, Geoff Gustafson, Christopher Goodman, Alex Zahara, Donnelly Rhodes, Sydney Imbeau, Chelah Horsdal', 'G', 'Fall into puppy love with “the world’s worst dog”, who now has a frisky voice and an attitude to match. Join Marley for his mischievous puppy years, as he and his summer pal, Bodie Grogan, wreak havoc on a neighborhood dog contest. Marley outwits Dobermans, Shepherds and Collies, while stealing hearts in his own unique and lovable way.', 'Fall into puppy love with “the world’s worst dog”, who now has a frisky voice and an attitude to match. Join Marley for his mischievous puppy years, as he and his summer pal, Bodie Grogan, wreak havoc on a neighborhood dog contest. Marley outwits Dobermans, Shepherds and Collies, while stealing hearts in his own unique and lovable way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mQCF7U07cFkHwG3GKzpbnB8DHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72391'),
  ('622644479704462212', 'Marlina the Murderer in Four Acts', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, Western', 'Ramadhan Setiawan, Joko Balung, Deasy Buwana', 'Mouly Surya, Rama Adi', 'Marsha Timothy, Egy Fedly, Tumpal Tampubolon, Dea Panendra, Yoga Pratama, Haydar Salishz, Yayu Unru, Norman R. Akyuwen', null, 'After encountering a group of bandits with plans to rape and steal from her, a young widow ventures into the wilderness in search of justice.', 'After encountering a group of bandits with plans to rape and steal from her, a young widow ventures into the wilderness in search of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pDpym7ix9dsB9a1KWVLN95X4z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453276'),
