  ('918301785322860339', 'Marlon Brando: An Actor Named Desire', 2014, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Philippe Kohly, Fouhad Hadef, Adeline Dos Santos', 'Philippe Kohly', 'Thierry Hancisse, Robert Duvall, George Englund, Patricia Bosworth, Ellen Adler, Sondra Lee, Jay Kanter, Rita Moreno', null, 'In his early days as an actor, Marlon Brando (1924-2004) was a shy young man with theatrical ambitions, like many others; but his charisma and superb acting skills made him truly unique, so that the doors to the starry sky of Hollywood opened for him. However, his peculiar manners, political commitment and complicated love life always overshadowed his artistic success.', 'In his early days as an actor, Marlon Brando (1924-2004) was a shy young man with theatrical ambitions, like many others; but his charisma and superb acting skills made him truly unique, so that the doors to the starry sky of Hollywood opened for him. However, his peculiar manners, political commitment and complicated love life always overshadowed his artistic success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0dceiSR9S0oJKD6qsMNODHs34A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390105'),
  ('456876049383969826', 'Marlon Wayans: God Loves Me', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Troy Miller', 'Marlon Wayans', 'Marlon Wayans', 'R', 'Filmed at the Center Stage Theater in Atlanta, Wayans delivers a hilarious hour-long performance, unleashing his spot-on impressions and fearless physical comedy to address one of the most infamous recent events in pop culture – “the slap” that took place at the 94th Academy Awards® ceremony.', 'Filmed at the Center Stage Theater in Atlanta, Wayans delivers a hilarious hour-long performance, unleashing his spot-on impressions and fearless physical comedy to address one of the most infamous recent events in pop culture – “the slap” that took place at the 94th Academy Awards® ceremony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpnftnnGXNBz3R12cWZnyKdYHYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090241'),
  ('1095052344880577750', 'Marlowe', 1969, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Paul Bogart, William H. Daniels', 'Stirling Silliphant, Raymond Chandler', 'James Garner, Gayle Hunnicutt, Carroll O''Connor, Rita Moreno, Sharon Farrell, William Daniels, H.M. Wynant, Jackie Coogan', 'PG', 'Mysterious Orfamay Quest hires Los Angeles private investigator Philip Marlowe to find her missing brother. Though the job seems simple enough, it leads Marlowe into the underbelly of the city, turning up leads who are murdered with ice picks, exotic dancers, blackmailed television stars and self-preserving gangsters. Soon, Marlowe''s life is on the line right along with his case.', 'Mysterious Orfamay Quest hires Los Angeles private investigator Philip Marlowe to find her missing brother. Though the job seems simple enough, it leads Marlowe into the underbelly of the city, turning up leads who are murdered with ice picks, exotic dancers, blackmailed television stars and self-preserving gangsters. Soon, Marlowe''s life is on the line right along with his case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKXAvMFKZZpiq5FPR6asC0p6WZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1846'),
  ('558958346979829391', 'Marlowe', 2023, 'Crime', 'Neil Jordan, Xavi Giménez', 'William Monahan, Neil Jordan', 'Liam Neeson, Diane Kruger, Jessica Lange, Danny Huston, Alan Cumming, Ian Hart, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Daniela Melchior', 'R', 'Private detective Philip Marlowe becomes embroiled in an investigation involving a wealthy Californian family after a beautiful blonde hires him to track down her former lover.', 'Private detective Philip Marlowe becomes embroiled in an investigation involving a wealthy Californian family after a beautiful blonde hires him to track down her former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjAMj81oYBryzGBhJk4gcK0M636.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844417'),
  ('876954755975234237', 'Marmaduke', 2010, 'Family, Comedy', 'Tom Dey, Greg Gardiner, Greg Michael', 'Vince Di Meglio, Tim Rasmussen', 'Owen Wilson, Emma Stone, George López, Caroline Sunshine, Finley Jacobsen, Steve Coogan, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Fergie', 'PG', 'When Phil and Debbie Winslow relocate from their native Kansas to the sunny climes of Orange County, their big-hearted, havoc-wreaking Great Dane gets a taste of the dog''s life, California-style.', 'When Phil and Debbie Winslow relocate from their native Kansas to the sunny climes of Orange County, their big-hearted, havoc-wreaking Great Dane gets a taste of the dog''s life, California-style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNNqAqvOn717AWBhBQskH2Lnzmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38579'),
  ('1091056173865877007', 'Marmaduke', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Phil Nibbelink, Youngki Lee, Mark A.Z. Dippé', 'Byron Kavanagh', 'Pete Davidson, J.K. Simmons, David Koechner, Mary Hart, Julie Nathanson, Terri Douglas, Erin Fitzgerald, Stephen Stanton', null, 'Great Dane Marmaduke epitomizes the overgrown lapdog, with an irascible streak and a penchant for mischief that is tempered with a deep sense of love and responsibility for his human family, the Winslows. The new animation is set in the world of elite dog shows, rife divas, rivalries and slapstick comedy.', 'Great Dane Marmaduke epitomizes the overgrown lapdog, with an irascible streak and a penchant for mischief that is tempered with a deep sense of love and responsibility for his human family, the Winslows. The new animation is set in the world of elite dog shows, rife divas, rivalries and slapstick comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMUhBeMp0vLQzaPBX0izFdnFvh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678287'),
  ('544425239021656352', 'Marmalade', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Keir O''Donnell, Polly Morgan', 'Keir O''Donnell', 'Joe Keery, Camila Morrone, Aldis Hodge, Ozioma Akagha, Wayne Duvall, Amy Warner, Hans Christopher, Andrew E. Wheeler', null, 'Baron, an imprisoned man, strikes up a friendship with cellmate Otis. As the pair hatch an escape plan together, Baron recalls the story of how he met Marmalade, the love of his life, and their Bonnie and Clyde scheme to rob a bank in order to care for his sick mother and give the couple the life they’ve always dreamed of.', 'Baron, an imprisoned man, strikes up a friendship with cellmate Otis. As the pair hatch an escape plan together, Baron recalls the story of how he met Marmalade, the love of his life, and their Bonnie and Clyde scheme to rob a bank in order to care for his sick mother and give the couple the life they’ve always dreamed of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt66TPbmJn8E4LepeLhBO5V1AED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997162'),
  ('440666480734852729', 'Marmalade Boy', 1995, 'Animation, Romance', 'Yoshihiko Umakoshi, Akinori Yabe', 'Aya Matsui', 'Ryotaro Okiayu, Mariko Kouda, Wakana Yamazaki, Hiroko Emori, Bin Shimada', null, 'Miki''s lying in bed in the school''s nursery after being hit in the face by a ball, supposedly asleep when Yuu comes in. Yuu asks her if she is asleep but she does not answer, so he looks at her as she sleeps. Then he kisses her and leaves. As soon as he has left, Miki jumps up, surprised and wonders what he is up to, since they have just met... or have they?', 'Miki''s lying in bed in the school''s nursery after being hit in the face by a ball, supposedly asleep when Yuu comes in. Yuu asks her if she is asleep but she does not answer, so he looks at her as she sleeps. Then he kisses her and leaves. As soon as he has left, Miki jumps up, surprised and wonders what he is up to, since they have just met... or have they?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGCzVVPNCfYViLa2NHHn4GU5o7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423590'),
  ('929858664008499590', 'Marmalade Boy', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Atsuhiro Nabeshima, Ryuichi Hiroki', 'Taeko Asano', 'Hinako Sakurai, Ryo Yoshizawa, Miho Nakayama, Rei Dan, Shosuke Tanihara, Michitaka Tsutsui, Taiki Sato, Sasha Ueda', null, 'Two sets of parents divorce and marry each other, while their children Miki and Yuu are caught in the middle and start falling for each other.', 'Two sets of parents divorce and marry each other, while their children Miki and Yuu are caught in the middle and start falling for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZ96nM425RidGm6efWOUHIQUTij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521049'),
  ('1107729466272663709', 'Marnie', 1964, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Robert Burks, James H. Brown', 'Jay Presson Allen', 'Tippi Hedren, Sean Connery, Diane Baker, Martin Gabel, Louise Latham, Bob Sweeney, Milton Selzer, Mariette Hartley', 'PG', 'Marnie is a beautiful but emotionally withdrawn thief, stealing from employers before disappearing under new identities. When her new boss, Mark Rutland, discovers her secret, his fascination turns to obsession, and he blackmails her into marriage, convinced he can cure her. But as he probes deeper into Marnie’s fractured mind, long-buried fears and compulsions begin to surface.', 'Marnie is a beautiful but emotionally withdrawn thief, stealing from employers before disappearing under new identities. When her new boss, Mark Rutland, discovers her secret, his fascination turns to obsession, and he blackmails her into marriage, convinced he can cure her. But as he probes deeper into Marnie’s fractured mind, long-buried fears and compulsions begin to surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRRy4VO2A3Py7wiZBPz11PAlogp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506'),
  ('138131971518493926', 'Maroc 7', 1967, 'Thriller, Action', 'Gerry O''Hara', 'David D. Osborn', 'Gene Barry, Elsa Martinelli, Leslie Phillips, Cyd Charisse, Denholm Elliott, Angela Douglas, Alexandra Stewart, Eric Barker', 'NR', 'The lady of a top fashion magazine doubles as a jewel thief and becomes involved in Moroccan intrigue.', 'The lady of a top fashion magazine doubles as a jewel thief and becomes involved in Moroccan intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LTkzmYoe2UaVJFL0xPa0jUfWFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206174'),
  ('603476184817788842', 'Marock', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Laïla Marrakchi, Ali Cherkaoui, Yann Mari Faget', 'Laïla Marrakchi', 'Morjana Alaoui, Matthieu Boujenah, Razika Simozrag, Fatym Layachi, Assaad Bouab, Rachid Benhaissan, Khalid Maadour, Michael Souda', null, 'Casablanca, the year of the baccalaureate. The carefree life of Morocco''s golden youth and all its excesses: car races, friendships, music, alcohol, but also first loves and the anxiety of transitioning to adulthood... Marock presents a side of Morocco that is often unknown, seen through the eyes of Rita, 17, who is determined to live life on her own terms.', 'Casablanca, the year of the baccalaureate. The carefree life of Morocco''s golden youth and all its excesses: car races, friendships, music, alcohol, but also first loves and the anxiety of transitioning to adulthood... Marock presents a side of Morocco that is often unknown, seen through the eyes of Rita, 17, who is determined to live life on her own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpLFVzw8UXz4SCiA76g4jaAiV24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61686'),
  ('527401206544830838', 'Marona''s Fantastic Tale', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Anca Damian, Sergiu Negulici, Dan Panaitescu', 'Anghel Damian', 'Lizzie Brocheré, Bruno Salomone, Thierry Hancisse, Nathalie Boutefeu, Shirelle Mai-Yvart, Maïra Schmitt, Georges Claisse, Annie Mercier', 'NR', 'Marona, an innocent and empathetic little female dog, remembers the life she has shared with different masters, whom she has loved unconditionally.', 'Marona, an innocent and empathetic little female dog, remembers the life she has shared with different masters, whom she has loved unconditionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4r3EKD3v2q9vx9nGj5ziq8oUtfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568381'),
  ('901687849761599517', 'Marooned', 1969, 'Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'John Sturges, Daniel L. Fapp, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Mayo Simon', 'Gregory Peck, Richard Crenna, David Janssen, James Franciscus, Gene Hackman, Lee Grant, Nancy Kovack, Mariette Hartley', 'G', 'After spending several months in an orbiting lab, three astronauts prepare to return to Earth only to find their de-orbit thrusters won''t activate. After initially thinking they might have to abandon them in orbit, NASA decides to launch a daring rescue. Their plans are complicated by a hurricane headed towards the launch site—and a shrinking air supply in the astronauts'' capsule.', 'After spending several months in an orbiting lab, three astronauts prepare to return to Earth only to find their de-orbit thrusters won''t activate. After initially thinking they might have to abandon them in orbit, NASA decides to launch a daring rescue. Their plans are complicated by a hurricane headed towards the launch site—and a shrinking air supply in the astronauts'' capsule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFnHHKGzTXg4TND5YiS2KYs8AMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40140'),
  ('1031299730766064257', 'Maroun Returns to Beirut', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Feyrouz Serhal', null, null, null, '2023 marked the thirtieth anniversary of Maroun Baghdadi’s sudden and tragic death. Maroun was a Lebanese filmmaker who wrote and directed films during the Lebanese civil war and contributed to documentary and fiction filmmaking from 1973 up until his death in 1993. In this film, Feyrouz Serhal embarks on a day trip in Beirut and navigates the city that profoundly shaped Maroun’s journey in life and cinema. Here she encounters individuals who were close to him and who shared his experiences. And as she traverses Maroun’s life and career, the social and political backdrop moves to the foreground. The film reflects on the last fifty years of the history of the country from a present standpoint. Through Maroun’s story, we perceive how cinema can, beautifully and dramatically, portray our stories and discourse our life events..', '2023 marked the thirtieth anniversary of Maroun Baghdadi’s sudden and tragic death. Maroun was a Lebanese filmmaker who wrote and directed films during the Lebanese civil war and contributed to documentary and fiction filmmaking from 1973 up until his death in 1993. In this film, Feyrouz Serhal embarks on a day trip in Beirut and navigates the city that profoundly shaped Maroun’s journey in life and cinema. Here she encounters individuals who were close to him and who shared his experiences. And as she traverses Maroun’s life and career, the social and political backdrop moves to the foreground. The film reflects on the last fifty years of the history of the country from a present standpoint. Through Maroun’s story, we perceive how cinema can, beautifully and dramatically, portray our stories and discourse our life events..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2Kv6mdYZQgKzyG3L5dDo65cz0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320485'),
  ('4199240023788625', 'Marquis', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Henri Xhonneux, Étienne Fauduet', 'Roland Topor, Henri Xhonneux', 'François Marthouret, Valérie Kling, Michel Robin, Isabelle Wolfe, Vicky Messica, Nathalie Juvet, René Lebrun, Bob Morel', 'R', 'On the eve of revolution, French activist and author Marquis and his talking penis, Colin, await judgment in the Bastille for allegedly plotting against the state. While Marquis dedicates himself to his art and Colin longs for action, the provocative pair unwittingly rouse the interest of competing ideological factions.', 'On the eve of revolution, French activist and author Marquis and his talking penis, Colin, await judgment in the Bastille for allegedly plotting against the state. While Marquis dedicates himself to his art and Colin longs for action, the provocative pair unwittingly rouse the interest of competing ideological factions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYuJROKtanslSpoKCPj60CHOhKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36068'),
  ('1026917209403069669', 'Marquis de Sade: Justine', 1969, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Manuel Merino', 'Harry Alan Towers, Marquis de Sade', 'Klaus Kinski, Romina Power, Maria Rohm, Rosemary Dexter, Jack Palance, Sylva Koscina, Mercedes McCambridge, Akim Tamiroff', 'R', 'Without a family, penniless and separated from her sister, a beautiful chaste woman will have to cope with an endless parade of villains, perverts and degenerates who will claim not only her treasured virtue but also her life.', 'Without a family, penniless and separated from her sister, a beautiful chaste woman will have to cope with an endless parade of villains, perverts and degenerates who will claim not only her treasured virtue but also her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6oZpGbGuEp7wAPXkwLu0AiD8ML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72309'),
  ('398748271376701389', 'Marquise', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Véra Belmont, Jean-Marie Dreujou, Valentino Salvati', 'Marcel Beaulieu, Jean-François Josselin', 'Sophie Marceau, Bernard Giraudeau, Lambert Wilson, Patrick Timsit, Thierry Lhermitte, Anémone, Remo Girone, Georges Wilson', null, 'Marquise is a drama about the rise and fall of a beauteous actress. As cheerfully portrayed by Sophie Marceau, the eponymous heroine is an engagingly ribald, but perhaps rather too modern, character. She rises from an impoverished background to become a favourite of the Sun King, Louis XIV, and the mistress of the celebrated Racine, who wrote roles especially for her; but her fate, in the end, is a tragic one.', 'Marquise is a drama about the rise and fall of a beauteous actress. As cheerfully portrayed by Sophie Marceau, the eponymous heroine is an engagingly ribald, but perhaps rather too modern, character. She rises from an impoverished background to become a favourite of the Sun King, Louis XIV, and the mistress of the celebrated Racine, who wrote roles especially for her; but her fate, in the end, is a tragic one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FlAhORNIfOwL5XPEtXUbSAKnTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5144'),
  ('1064229812026934361', 'Marrakech Express', 1989, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Italo Petriccione, Ahmed Hatimi', 'Enzo Monteleone, Carlo Mazzacurati, Umberto Contarello', 'Diego Abatantuono, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Cristina Marsillach, Giuseppe Cederna, Gigio Alberti, Massimo Venturiello, Corinna Agustoni, Antonio Carlucci', null, 'After learning that an old friend of theirs has been arrested in Morocco on drug charges, four former college buddies set out for Marrakech to bail him out.', 'After learning that an old friend of theirs has been arrested in Morocco on drug charges, four former college buddies set out for Marrakech to bail him out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dZ3OhtxJa1CqjVmrjU8L40O87n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41583'),
  ('1060029838943977870', 'Marriage Blue', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Hong Ji-young, Lee Seon-yeong, Kim Min-jae', 'Ko Myung-ju', 'Kim Kang-woo, Kim Hyo-jin, Lee Yeon-hee, Ju Ji-hoon, Ok Taec-yeon, Don Lee, Guzal Tursunova, Lee Hee-jun', null, 'Some may dream of, some may be afraid of, some may look forward to, and some may want to avoid THE NIGHT BEFORE MARRIAGE! 4 different couples disclose 4 different stories all about marriage.', 'Some may dream of, some may be afraid of, some may look forward to, and some may want to avoid THE NIGHT BEFORE MARRIAGE! 4 different couples disclose 4 different stories all about marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVPjsCRuhnmSnEVjtzvNIpgLErw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237490'),
  ('369988704644630160', 'Marriage Is a Crazy Thing', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoo Ha, Jung Young-min', 'Yoo Ha', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Kam Woo-sung, Park Won-sang, Lee Joo-sil, Kim Ki-cheon, Yoon Ye-Ri', null, 'Joon-yeong is a Korean professor of English literature and confirmed bachelor. But when he meets Yeon-hee on a blind date, his days of bachelorhood seem numbered.', 'Joon-yeong is a Korean professor of English literature and confirmed bachelor. But when he meets Yeon-hee on a blind date, his days of bachelorhood seem numbered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQG2mfXzKfn5vdEwx5iVh3jGiGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64222'),
  ('1103567913846294992', 'Marriage Is a Partnership', 1951, 'Documentary', 'David A Smart', null, null, null, 'Flashback on the problems, adjustments and transformations occurring in the first year of a couple''s married life. Pretty surprising film coming from Coronet about the "honeymoon is over" drama that newlyweds face. The marriage between Dotty and Pete is pretty traditional--Dotty quits her job to be a homemaker once they are married--but some more modernistic ideas come out, such as the idea that the two newlyweds decide together how the money that Pete earns will be spent, and the small mentions of sex. (!!) The "educational collaborator" listed at the beginning, Lemo Rockwood, was a professor at Cornell University, and her marriage course advocated sexual frankness and pre-marital experimentation, so it''s easy to see her stamp on this film.', 'Flashback on the problems, adjustments and transformations occurring in the first year of a couple''s married life. Pretty surprising film coming from Coronet about the "honeymoon is over" drama that newlyweds face. The marriage between Dotty and Pete is pretty traditional--Dotty quits her job to be a homemaker once they are married--but some more modernistic ideas come out, such as the idea that the two newlyweds decide together how the money that Pete earns will be spent, and the small mentions of sex. (!!) The "educational collaborator" listed at the beginning, Lemo Rockwood, was a professor at Cornell University, and her marriage course advocated sexual frankness and pre-marital experimentation, so it''s easy to see her stamp on this film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTazGXmjGYzqLJV32h5G3DD0ZQZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128322'),
  ('1014906601782228546', 'Marriage of the Blessed', 1989, 'War, Drama, Crime', 'Ali Reza Zarrindast, Mohammad Nasrollahi, Moharram Zaynalzadeh', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Ebrahim Abadi, Mahmud Bigham, Roya Nownahali, Mohsen Zaehtab', null, 'Haji is severely traumatized by the war with Iraq. Back from the front, he''s unable to adapt to civilian life. Despite family opposition, his fiancée stands by him as together they challenge both the authority of family and state to lead their own lives.', 'Haji is severely traumatized by the war with Iraq. Back from the front, he''s unable to adapt to civilian life. Despite family opposition, his fiancée stands by him as together they challenge both the authority of family and state to lead their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5NcXNankNbb7iLrmSxaEO2372u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43983'),
  ('490961537277450031', 'Marriage of the Century', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Philippe Galland', 'Anémone, Philippe Galland, Jean-Luc Voulfow', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Anémone, Michel Aumont, Jean-Claude Brialy, Dominique Lavanant, Martin Lamotte, Michèle Moretti, Gisèle Grimm', null, 'Princess Charlotte is scheduled to marry a boring duke, but before that event happens, Paul has taken a bet that he can seduce her. He does, profits from his act, and then falls in love with her. Meanwhile, the wedding with the duke is still planned, and it remains to be seen whether Paul will give in and give up.', 'Princess Charlotte is scheduled to marry a boring duke, but before that event happens, Paul has taken a bet that he can seduce her. He does, profits from his act, and then falls in love with her. Meanwhile, the wedding with the duke is still planned, and it remains to be seen whether Paul will give in and give up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PQb9v8NJDr6nhkzQXuTCSGWgzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80336'),
  ('843970887148937736', 'Marriage on the Rocks', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jack Donohue, William H. Daniels, Richard Lang', 'Cy Howard', 'Frank Sinatra, Deborah Kerr, Dean Martin, Cesar Romero, Hermione Baddeley, Tony Bill, John McGiver, Nancy Sinatra', 'NR', 'Ad-agency president Dan Edwards goes to Mexico to celebrate his nineteenth wedding anniversary and winds up getting divorced by mistake, whereupon his wife Valerie marries his best friend Ernie Brewer by mistake.', 'Ad-agency president Dan Edwards goes to Mexico to celebrate his nineteenth wedding anniversary and winds up getting divorced by mistake, whereupon his wife Valerie marries his best friend Ernie Brewer by mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNMyMrCkUw62yBG1pyQFPg0Rxnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98648'),
  ('993927961441204875', 'Marriage Story', 2019, 'Drama', 'Robbie Ryan, Karen Kane, Paul Schmitz', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Adam Driver, Scarlett Johansson, Laura Dern, Alan Alda, Ray Liotta, Julie Hagerty, Merritt Wever, Azhy Robertson', 'R', 'A stage director and an actress struggle through a grueling, coast-to-coast divorce that pushes them to their personal extremes.', 'A stage director and an actress struggle through a grueling, coast-to-coast divorce that pushes them to their personal extremes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JRyCKaRKyJAVpsIHeLvPw5nHmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492188'),
  ('1141606275767488292', 'Marriageable Girls', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Janusz Kondratiuk, Marek Piestrak, Maria Pietrzak', 'Janusz Kondratiuk', 'Ewa Szykulska, Ewa Pielach-Mierzyńska, Regina Regulska, Jan Stawarz, Jan Mateusz Nowakowski, Zbigniew Buczkowski, Iga Cembrzyńska, Jadwiga Chojnacka', null, 'Three naive girls from the provinces travel to the city to find the men of their dreams.', 'Three naive girls from the provinces travel to the city to find the men of their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8cf0bCXIXXKMtZZqwTRVS6CXC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156691'),
  ('705998662848352510', 'Married by Christmas', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Romance', 'Chris Furukawa-Burgon, Letia Clouston', 'Alison Spuck McNeeley, Casie Tabanou', 'Jes Macallan, April Bowlby, Coby Ryan McLaughlin, James Eckhouse, Lee Garlington, Ryan Caltagirone, Adam Senn, Lauren Pritchard', null, 'Due to an antiquated clause in her grandmother’s will, an ambitious young executive may lose her place at the family company unless she can get married by Christmas.', 'Due to an antiquated clause in her grandmother’s will, an ambitious young executive may lose her place at the family company unless she can get married by Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sZDEStEnm2NwDBh8pBWY4nznuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406129'),
  ('370122239730503242', 'Married by Mistake', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Mike Rohl, Lucas Zhou, Dylan Castro', 'Meg Jackson', 'Chloe Bennet, Anthony Konechny, Jill Morrison, Eric Keenleyside, Ashley Ross, Doron Bell, Linda Ko, Blair Penner', 'PG-13', 'After losing her dream job, Riley gets drunk with Nate and the next morning they find themselves married. Accepting Nate''s proposal they travel to Tennessee to rescue his family''s business, but will they be able to keep up the deception?', 'After losing her dream job, Riley gets drunk with Nate and the next morning they find themselves married. Accepting Nate''s proposal they travel to Tennessee to rescue his family''s business, but will they be able to keep up the deception?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYWTeTmmRpJot6QBXu1On7L8nvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036311'),
  ('645465044162830364', 'Married Life', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Deming, Ira Sachs', 'Ira Sachs, Oren Moverman', 'Pierce Brosnan, Chris Cooper, Patricia Clarkson, Rachel McAdams, David Wenham, Annabel Kershaw, Sheila Paterson, David Richmond-Peck', 'PG-13', 'A very gentle middle-aged man is married, but when he falls in love with another woman, he decides that to divorce his wife would humiliate her too much – so instead he decides to kill her.', 'A very gentle middle-aged man is married, but when he falls in love with another woman, he decides that to divorce his wife would humiliate her too much – so instead he decides to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdJKmRh3AKX5CVCdwdw1dNTqEJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8060'),
  ('213575969905249474', 'Married People, Single Sex', 1994, 'Drama', 'Mike Sedan', 'Catherine Tavel, Ariel Hart', 'Chase Masterson, Joseph Pilato, Bob Rudd, Darla Haun, Wendi Westbrook, Robert Zachar, Shelley Michelle, Teri Fruichantie', 'R', 'Various husbands, wives, friends, and lovers pair off in a study of sexual dysfunction. A frustrated construction worker turns to phone sex when his wife can''t satisfy him; a topless dancer submits to the alluring mind games.', 'Various husbands, wives, friends, and lovers pair off in a study of sexual dysfunction. A frustrated construction worker turns to phone sex when his wife can''t satisfy him; a topless dancer submits to the alluring mind games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DmKanYFmFnkL6kkONVl72YUs9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227014'),
  ('753821436197968806', 'Married to a Stranger', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Serge Meynard, Bruno Privat', 'Elsa Marpeau', 'Déborah François, Philippe Bas, Samira Lachhab, Serge Riaboukine, Grégori Derangère, Christine Citti, Julie Victor, Florian Bonnard', null, 'Young couple recently married. Soon a child comes. Perfect happiness. For their honeymoon, Emma and David chose a house in the forest. But the escapade turns to drama: attacked by a masked man, Emma escapes to death. For the police, no doubt, David is the No. 1 suspect: his strange refusal to cooperate, his unexplained absence at the time of the facts, the testimony of a neighbor, the fortune he would inherit ... Doubt interferes in the spirit of Emma. Does she really know the man she married?', 'Young couple recently married. Soon a child comes. Perfect happiness. For their honeymoon, Emma and David chose a house in the forest. But the escapade turns to drama: attacked by a masked man, Emma escapes to death. For the police, no doubt, David is the No. 1 suspect: his strange refusal to cooperate, his unexplained absence at the time of the facts, the testimony of a neighbor, the fortune he would inherit ... Doubt interferes in the spirit of Emma. Does she really know the man she married?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMmnrI54wJHTWiXVsSLJngN99p5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363443'),
  ('334113479760435947', 'Married to It', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur Hiller, Victor J. Kemper', 'Janet Kovalcik', 'Beau Bridges, Stockard Channing, Robert Sean Leonard, Mary Stuart Masterson, Cybill Shepherd, Ron Silver, Don Francks, Donna Vivino', 'R', 'While setting up a school pageant, the parents at an elite private academy in New York City with contrastive lifestyles and professional paths reflect on their lives and marriages.', 'While setting up a school pageant, the parents at an elite private academy in New York City with contrastive lifestyles and professional paths reflect on their lives and marriages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSRbQbEU5eeRsMeUG4pQWaXze98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32083'),
  ('219366818444303554', 'Married to the Mob', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Jonathan Demme, Tak Fujimoto', 'Barry Strugatz, Mark R. Burns', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Matthew Modine, Dean Stockwell, Mercedes Ruehl, Alec Baldwin, Trey Wilson, Joan Cusack, Oliver Platt', 'R', 'Angela de Marco is fed up with her gangster husband''s line of work and wants no part of the crime world. When her husband is killed for having an affair with the mistress of mob boss Tony "The Tiger" Russo, Angela and her son depart for New York City to make a fresh start. Unfortunately, Tony has set his sights upon Angela -- and so has an undercover FBI agent looking to use her to bust Tony.', 'Angela de Marco is fed up with her gangster husband''s line of work and wants no part of the crime world. When her husband is killed for having an affair with the mistress of mob boss Tony "The Tiger" Russo, Angela and her son depart for New York City to make a fresh start. Unfortunately, Tony has set his sights upon Angela -- and so has an undercover FBI agent looking to use her to bust Tony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkOsxv1RvV5smRnm6wrmn2wDXyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2321'),
  ('34584556966655881', 'Married Women', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gyeong Seok-Ho', null, 'Han Chae-you, Je Dong-hwa, Lee Ha-roo, Kim So-hyeon-II, Park Ji-chan, Yoon Seung-hoon, Choi Eun-ji, Jeon Eun-jin', null, 'We are in a fling! They know men better than men and they don''t even need to play hard to get! Some female owners of a salon, DVD room and beer pub are out looking for some fresh meat other than their husbands. From a building owner to a part-time officer and even guests, these women have what it takes to have them eating out of their hands.', 'We are in a fling! They know men better than men and they don''t even need to play hard to get! Some female owners of a salon, DVD room and beer pub are out looking for some fresh meat other than their husbands. From a building owner to a part-time officer and even guests, these women have what it takes to have them eating out of their hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MGoNQQpwHqPW0YhBaCGsOc4h9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387834'),
  ('91654688617060310', 'Marrowbone', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Kike Maíllo, F. Javier Soto, Olga Pujalte López', 'Sergio G. Sánchez', 'George MacKay, Anya Taylor-Joy, Charlie Heaton, Mia Goth, Matthew Stagg, Nicola Harrison, Kyle Soller, Tom Fisher', 'R', 'A young man and his three younger siblings are plagued by a sinister presence in the sprawling manor in which they live.', 'A young man and his three younger siblings are plagued by a sinister presence in the sprawling manor in which they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iX77zMSqUv2Qt7ToEnN2mmEudEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399366'),
  ('1102520644767335523', 'Marry Go Round', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'David Weaver', 'Robert Tate Miller', 'Amanda Schull, Brennan Elliott, Mary-Beth Manning, Jaycie Dotin, Zak Santiago, Bill Marchant, Dee Jay Jackson, Anni Ramsay', 'G', 'Abby Foster and Luke Walker were high school sweethearts who were married for a brief time. Many years later, Abby’s life seems perfect as she gets ready for a new life in Paris along with her soon-to-be husband, Edward. When an unexpected letter arrives throwing Abby off course, she must decide what her heart really wants.', 'Abby Foster and Luke Walker were high school sweethearts who were married for a brief time. Many years later, Abby’s life seems perfect as she gets ready for a new life in Paris along with her soon-to-be husband, Edward. When an unexpected letter arrives throwing Abby off course, she must decide what her heart really wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6K6XXzl9uzUlGEo3oqab9wejc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006305'),
  ('677190108644199170', 'Marry Me', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Harriet Marin, Gérard Simon', 'Harriet Marin, Laurent Chouchan', 'Michèle Laroque, Vincent Perez, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Arnaud Giovaninetti, Audrey Tautou, Philippe Bas, François Caron, Jean Dell', null, 'Oriane and Hadrian''s couple is going through a crisis. Determined to save their marriage, Oriane visits a Gypsy fortune teller who foresees a dark future. But Oriane won''t hear of anything but a happy ending and the psychic is forced to read another future which, unfortunately, also happens to end bitterly. Will the third reading satisfy the young woman?', 'Oriane and Hadrian''s couple is going through a crisis. Determined to save their marriage, Oriane visits a Gypsy fortune teller who foresees a dark future. But Oriane won''t hear of anything but a happy ending and the psychic is forced to read another future which, unfortunately, also happens to end bitterly. Will the third reading satisfy the young woman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EtMl1RfdUZQYE679XbhxjRdRbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160066'),
  ('675761730006028358', 'Marry Me', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Florian Ballhaus, Derek Haas, Jeannette Kim', 'John Rogers, Tami Sagher, Harper Dill', 'Jennifer Lopez, Owen Wilson, Maluma, John Bradley, Sarah Silverman, Chloe Coleman, Michelle Buteau, Khalil Middleton', 'PG-13', 'After finding out about her fiancé''s cheating ways, a pop superstar impulsively marries a total stranger. They must soon decide if two people from such different worlds can find true love.', 'After finding out about her fiancé''s cheating ways, a pop superstar impulsively marries a total stranger. They must soon decide if two people from such different worlds can find true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ko1JVbGj4bT8IhCWqjBQ6ZtF2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615904'),
  ('2034029485721956', 'Marry Me at Christmas', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Ryan McMaster, Terry Ingram', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Rachel Skarsten, Trevor Donovan, Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Emily Tennant, Blair Penner, Camille Mitchell, Nicole LaPlaca, Michele Scarabelli', 'G', 'Organizing a Christmas wedding is a true treat for bridal boutique owner Madeline Krug. She loves the challenge of finding the perfect dress for the bride and orchestrating an exquisite event. What Madeline didn’t expect was to be swept off her feet by the bride’s gorgeous brother, movie star, Jonny Blaze. Jonny came to the quirky town of Fool’s Gold to support his sister -- not to fall in love. Yet Madeline is the most extraordinary woman he’s ever met, and she finds the real Jonny even more captivating than her celebrity crush. Will the action star be brave enough to take on the role of a lifetime?', 'Organizing a Christmas wedding is a true treat for bridal boutique owner Madeline Krug. She loves the challenge of finding the perfect dress for the bride and orchestrating an exquisite event. What Madeline didn’t expect was to be swept off her feet by the bride’s gorgeous brother, movie star, Jonny Blaze. Jonny came to the quirky town of Fool’s Gold to support his sister -- not to fall in love. Yet Madeline is the most extraordinary woman he’s ever met, and she finds the real Jonny even more captivating than her celebrity crush. Will the action star be brave enough to take on the role of a lifetime?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAzbrvZLiurV0i7rJdVCXlOmVOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474987'),
  ('744901649052299755', 'Marry Me, Dude', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Tarek Boudali', 'Tarek Boudali, Khaled Amara, Nadia Lakhdar', 'Tarek Boudali, Philippe Lacheau, Charlotte Gabris, David Marsais, Julien Arruti, Philippe Duquesne, Jonathan Louis, Sissi Duparc', null, 'Yassine asks his best friend Fred to marry him in order to avoid deportation...', 'Yassine asks his best friend Fred to marry him in order to avoid deportation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYGkGZhNKajryEyYOrIF6snqIYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432613'),
  ('628164239318855281', 'Marry Me!', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Neelesha Barthel, Florian Foest', 'Sintje Rosema, Daniela Baumgärtl, Nina Pourlak', 'Maryam Zaree, Fahri Yardım, Steffen Groth, Bharti Jaffrey, Mira Kandathil, Rebecca Rudolph, Wolfgang Stumph, Renate Krößner', null, 'Kishori, unmarried and mother to a daughter, and her sister Sonal live in a house in Berlin. The house and a cafe on the ground floor are led by Kishori. All of a sudden, her strict and traditional grandmother comes for a visit from India. She wants to sell the house unless Kishori agrees to marry the father of her daughter, Robert. As Kishori feels obliged to all the befriended inhabitants of the house, including Robert, to keep the house, Kishori und Robert prepare to have a traditional Indian wedding.', 'Kishori, unmarried and mother to a daughter, and her sister Sonal live in a house in Berlin. The house and a cafe on the ground floor are led by Kishori. All of a sudden, her strict and traditional grandmother comes for a visit from India. She wants to sell the house unless Kishori agrees to marry the father of her daughter, Robert. As Kishori feels obliged to all the befriended inhabitants of the house, including Robert, to keep the house, Kishori und Robert prepare to have a traditional Indian wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iu7BTs40SU1ezawkXWGPvN7EVlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345632'),
  ('701485421772923221', 'Marry My Dead Body', 2023, 'Comedy, Action, Horror', 'Cheng Wei-hao, Chen Chi-wen, Lucy Chen', 'Sharon Wu, Cheng Wei-hao', 'Greg Hsu, Austin Lin, Gingle Wang, Tsai Chen-nan, Wang Man-chiao, Tou Tsung-hua, Ma Nien-Hsien, Aaron Yan', 'R', 'After finding an odd envelope, Policeman Ming-han''s life takes a spooky turn: He''s now wed to a ghost husband, and they must solve a crime together.', 'After finding an odd envelope, Policeman Ming-han''s life takes a spooky turn: He''s now wed to a ghost husband, and they must solve a crime together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmOaSOo5wB7cMDhhp6Msnd4IsLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983883'),
  ('216947851489872886', 'Marrying the Mafia', 2002, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Chung Hung-soon, Kim Yun-su', 'Chung Hung-soon', 'Jung Jun-ho, Kim Jung-eun, Yoo Dong-geun, Sung Ji-ru, Park Sang-wook, Park Keun-hyong, Kim Hae-sook, Lee Ki-young', null, 'An up-and-coming lawyer wakes up next to a beautiful woman with mafia connections, but neither remembers how they got there. That''s a problem.', 'An up-and-coming lawyer wakes up next to a beautiful woman with mafia connections, but neither remembers how they got there. That''s a problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rill2hWzIkcWEopNrArrGRGJLYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49202'),
  ('812552047527318487', 'Marrying the Mafia 2', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Action, Romance', 'Jeong Yong-ki, Mun Yong-sik', 'Kim Yeong-chan', 'Shin Hyun-jun, Kim Won-hee, Kim Soo-mi, Tak Jae-hoon, Lim Hyung-jun, Gong Hyung-jin, Kim Hyo-jin, Jung Ho-bin', null, 'The oldest son of the White Tiger Gang is pressured by his family to settle down and get married; but when he finds the perfect girl, she turns out to be a state prosecutor for crimes of violence, specifically gangster related. The district attorney is a look-a-like of the gangster''s former fiancee who died getting hit by a truck. Their feelings develop for each other but her co-worker turns out to like her as well. She does not like him so the latter turns to the darker side of the law, by conspiring with the rival Axe Gang. Unfortunately for him, the mafia son has more that a few tricks up his sleeve and gets support from his dim-witted brothers and henchman.', 'The oldest son of the White Tiger Gang is pressured by his family to settle down and get married; but when he finds the perfect girl, she turns out to be a state prosecutor for crimes of violence, specifically gangster related. The district attorney is a look-a-like of the gangster''s former fiancee who died getting hit by a truck. Their feelings develop for each other but her co-worker turns out to like her as well. She does not like him so the latter turns to the darker side of the law, by conspiring with the rival Axe Gang. Unfortunately for him, the mafia son has more that a few tricks up his sleeve and gets support from his dim-witted brothers and henchman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1utAWEmCuwtnnHXYpXZdQ2kCcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49203'),
  ('334226670120604967', 'Marrying the Mafia 3: Family Hustle', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Jeong Yong-ki', 'Jeong Yong-ki, Kim Yeong-chan', 'Shin Hyun-jun, Kim Won-hee, Kim Soo-mi, Tak Jae-hoon, Lim Hyung-jun, Gong Hyung-jin, Shin Yi, Kim Yong-geon', null, 'This gangster comedy chronicles the White Tiger Family of Jeolla Province. Hong Deok-ja, head of the crime family, quits the syndicate to open a kimchi business after her son marries a prosecutor. She is pulled back into the crime family when the familiar member of the rival Axe Gang is released from prison and seeks revenge upon the White Tiger Family.', 'This gangster comedy chronicles the White Tiger Family of Jeolla Province. Hong Deok-ja, head of the crime family, quits the syndicate to open a kimchi business after her son marries a prosecutor. She is pulled back into the crime family when the familiar member of the rival Axe Gang is released from prison and seeks revenge upon the White Tiger Family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR8O2WY2mjHEmIQP71wvUnToE1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49204'),
  ('868098977931896146', 'Mars', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Jon Hess', 'Steven Hartov, Avi Nesher', 'Olivier Gruner, Shari Belafonte, Gabriel Dell Jr., Alex Hyde-White', 'R', 'In the future, Mars has been colonized. A martial artist arrives to investigate what happened to his brother. A powerful mining company is the prime suspect.', 'In the future, Mars has been colonized. A martial artist arrives to investigate what happened to his brother. A powerful mining company is the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/is5BkQN916PM40lluDN1P2GuAmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57843'),
  ('239133896543756421', 'Mars', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Sevan Najarian', 'Trevor Moore, Zach Cregger, Sam Brown, Timmy Williams, Darren Trumeter', 'Trevor Moore, Zach Cregger, Sam Brown', 'Not Rated', 'A zany crew of misfits blasts off to Mars, only to find they''ve been duped by a scheming billionaire. Chaos ensues as they face bizarre challenges and unexpected surprises on their wacky interplanetary journey.', 'A zany crew of misfits blasts off to Mars, only to find they''ve been duped by a scheming billionaire. Chaos ensues as they face bizarre challenges and unexpected surprises on their wacky interplanetary journey.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrJdT3kiG2q0CAnPNKkldIG7McqG.jpg', 'plex:movie:mars-2026'),
  ('18079483793175749', 'Mars and April', 2012, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Martin Villeneuve, Benoit Beaulieu', 'Martin Villeneuve', 'Jacques Languirand, Caroline Dhavernas, Paul Ahmarani, Robert Lepage, Jean Asselin, Stéphane Demers, Jean Marchand, Kathleen Fortin', null, 'In the near future, as humanity prepares to set foot on Mars, Jacob Obus, an elderly musician, takes pride in slowing down time by playing instruments inspired by women''s bodies, designed by his friend Arthur. A love triangle develops when Jacob and Arthur both fall in love with Avril, a young photographer. Enter Eugène Spaak, Arthur''s father, an inventor and cosmologist who unveils a new theory about man''s desire to reach Mars and helps Jacob find the true meaning of life and love.', 'In the near future, as humanity prepares to set foot on Mars, Jacob Obus, an elderly musician, takes pride in slowing down time by playing instruments inspired by women''s bodies, designed by his friend Arthur. A love triangle develops when Jacob and Arthur both fall in love with Avril, a young photographer. Enter Eugène Spaak, Arthur''s father, an inventor and cosmologist who unveils a new theory about man''s desire to reach Mars and helps Jacob find the true meaning of life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awcopYL4ODnu9gqhMWYdLkrUtCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177117'),
  ('636717370960438231', 'Mars Attacks!', 1996, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tim Burton, Peter Suschitzky, Thomas J. Mack', 'Jonathan Gems', 'Jack Nicholson, Glenn Close, Annette Bening, Pierce Brosnan, Danny DeVito, Martin Short, Sarah Jessica Parker, Michael J. Fox', 'PG-13', 'A fleet of Martian spacecraft surrounds the world''s major cities and all of humanity waits to see if the extraterrestrial visitors have, as they claim, "come in peace." U.S. President James Dale receives assurance from science professor Donald Kessler that the Martians'' mission is a friendly one. But when a peaceful exchange ends in the total annihilation of the U.S. Congress, military men call for a full-scale nuclear retaliation.', 'A fleet of Martian spacecraft surrounds the world''s major cities and all of humanity waits to see if the extraterrestrial visitors have, as they claim, "come in peace." U.S. President James Dale receives assurance from science professor Donald Kessler that the Martians'' mission is a friendly one. But when a peaceful exchange ends in the total annihilation of the U.S. Congress, military men call for a full-scale nuclear retaliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hll4O5vSAfnZDb6JbnP06GPtz7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75'),
  ('628745708194671108', 'Mars Express', 2023, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jérémie Périn', 'Jérémie Périn, Laurent Sarfati', 'Léa Drucker, Mathieu Amalric, Daniel Njo Lobé, Marie Bouvet, Sébastien Chassagne, Marthe Keller, Geneviève Doang, Thomas Roditi', 'NR', 'In 2200, private detective Aline Ruby and her android partner Carlos Rivera are hired by a wealthy businessman to track down a notorious hacker. On Mars, they descend deep into the underbelly of the planet''s capital city where they uncover a darker story of brain farms, political corruption, and a missing girl who holds a secret about the robots that threatens to change the face of the universe.', 'In 2200, private detective Aline Ruby and her android partner Carlos Rivera are hired by a wealthy businessman to track down a notorious hacker. On Mars, they descend deep into the underbelly of the planet''s capital city where they uncover a darker story of brain farms, political corruption, and a missing girl who holds a secret about the robots that threatens to change the face of the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8rUn0khoYB3G4gPPGTF1Xv9Olu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586810'),
  ('354628387194775251', 'Mars Needs Moms', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Simon Wells, Robert Presley', 'Wendy Wells', 'Seth Green, Seth Robert Dusky, Joan Cusack, Dan Fogler, Breckin Meyer, Elisabeth Harnois, Tom Everett Scott, Mindy Sterling', 'PG', 'When Martians suddenly abduct his mom, mischievous Milo rushes to the rescue and discovers why all moms are so special.', 'When Martians suddenly abduct his mom, mischievous Milo rushes to the rescue and discovers why all moms are so special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZBrpe4bxwDIDKBxPeJYrlyDK5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50321'),
  ('908985444941336579', 'Mars Needs Women', 1968, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Larry Buchanan, Robert C. Jessup', 'Larry Buchanan', 'Tommy Kirk, Yvonne Craig, Byron Lord, Roger Ready, Barnett Shaw, Neil Fletcher, Chet Davis, Ron Scott', null, 'Tommy Kirk leads his fellow Martians to Earth on an interplanetary quest for females. Kirk proves that Martians have impeccable taste when one of his first conquests turns out to be sexy scientist Yvonne Craig.', 'Tommy Kirk leads his fellow Martians to Earth on an interplanetary quest for females. Kirk proves that Martians have impeccable taste when one of his first conquests turns out to be sexy scientist Yvonne Craig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnTHZUgEJZiFtHZGUXBiRCWze6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24563'),
  ('610784681902255346', 'Mars of Destruction', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Yoshiteru Satou', null, 'Nozomu Taiga, Kaori Nazuka, Minori Chihara, Erina Nakayama, Aizawa Asuka, Yukari Kawabuchi', null, 'Some time after a space mission to Mars ends in destruction, strange monsters called "Ancients" begin appearing around Tokyo. A group of specialists consisting of three girls and one troubled young boy must fight the Ancients until they can come to understand exactly what it is they are fighting. When one of the Ancients tells them that they are the true invaders of Earth, they must search within themselves to grasp what truly is reality.', 'Some time after a space mission to Mars ends in destruction, strange monsters called "Ancients" begin appearing around Tokyo. A group of specialists consisting of three girls and one troubled young boy must fight the Ancients until they can come to understand exactly what it is they are fighting. When one of the Ancients tells them that they are the true invaders of Earth, they must search within themselves to grasp what truly is reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5B7j8B9wC71nvRVrGIOR4YbwvH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155661'),
  ('624945820377467329', 'Mars One', 2022, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Martins, Leonardo Feliciano, Marianne Macedo Martins', 'Gabriel Martins', 'Cícero Lucas, Rejane Faria, Carlos Francisco, Camilla Damião, Ana Hilário, Dircinha Macêdo, Russo Apr, Juan Pablo Sorín', null, 'A middle-class Black family in Brazil copes with the election of a far-right extremist president. The mother believes that she''s cursed after an unexpected encounter, while her husband puts all of his hopes into their son''s soccer career.', 'A middle-class Black family in Brazil copes with the election of a far-right extremist president. The mother believes that she''s cursed after an unexpected encounter, while her husband puts all of his hopes into their son''s soccer career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrEHCuGyXpkBpQW5Xqt5kaHOyap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913816'),
  ('717404505745514310', 'Marseille', 2004, 'Drama', 'Angela Schanelec, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Angela Schanelec', 'Maren Eggert, Alexis Loret, Emily Atef, Marie-Lou Sellem, Devid Striesow, Sophie Aigner, Wolfgang Michael, Friederike Kammer', null, 'A young Berlin photographer participates in an apartment swap with a stranger in Marseille to briefly explore the French city.', 'A young Berlin photographer participates in an apartment swap with a stranger in Marseille to briefly explore the French city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMbKbXMAZzAbSdf7hEFVFUlk6CG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153770'),
  ('733213194774618087', 'Marseille', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kad Merad, Gordon Spooner', 'Patrick Bosso, Judith El Zein, Kad Merad', 'Kad Merad, Patrick Bosso, Venantino Venantini, Judith El Zein, Anne Charrier, Julien Boisselier, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Philippe Lefebvre', null, 'Faced with the insistence of his brother Joseph, whom he has not seen for 25 years, Paolo resolves to give up his calm and harmonious life in Canada, to return to Marseilles at the bedside of his rugged father. He left, therefore, with his son under his arm, determined not to linger in that city which he had fled years before, after a tragedy. He does not imagine that the affection of his newfound family, his love affair with a young woman and the joyful and simple solidarity of the Marseillais will reconcile him with this city he would never have wanted to leave...Marseillle.', 'Faced with the insistence of his brother Joseph, whom he has not seen for 25 years, Paolo resolves to give up his calm and harmonious life in Canada, to return to Marseilles at the bedside of his rugged father. He left, therefore, with his son under his arm, determined not to linger in that city which he had fled years before, after a tragedy. He does not imagine that the affection of his newfound family, his love affair with a young woman and the joyful and simple solidarity of the Marseillais will reconcile him with this city he would never have wanted to leave...Marseillle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8g3SpOmbVriTzSidaPJ2oNskpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375809'),
  ('479868361432509449', 'Marseille, la Canebière', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Auguste Lumière, Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Pedestrian, trams, carriages and carts traffic at the intersection of two streets on La Canebière in Marseille.', 'Pedestrian, trams, carriages and carts traffic at the intersection of two streets on La Canebière in Marseille.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooSSabmdptvyGTvuGiZhTOnAx3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194569'),
  ('898770380757622055', 'Marsella', 2014, 'Drama', 'Belén Macías', 'Aitor Gabilondo, Verónica Fernández, Belén Macías', 'Goya Toledo, María León, Àlex Monner, Eduard Fernández, Rachel Lascar, Noa Fontanals, María Jesús Hoyos, Juan Blanco', null, 'A biological mother, Sara, and a foster mother, Virginia, share a girl. Sara lost custody due to problems with alcohol and drugs. Five years later, the girl is returned to her.', 'A biological mother, Sara, and a foster mother, Virginia, share a girl. Sara lost custody due to problems with alcohol and drugs. Five years later, the girl is returned to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYH3YVTlOIzt9Xcel9TxKiVu5hz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283459'),
  ('767830630737923833', 'Marshal Tito''s Spirit', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Vinko Brešan', 'Vinko Brešan', 'Dražen Kuhn, Linda Begonja, Ilija Ivezić, Ivo Gregurević, Boris Buzančić, Ljubomir ''Kiki'' Kapor, Inge Appelt, Bojan Navojec', null, 'Stipan is a policeman who comes to small Adriatic island off the Croatian coast in order to investigate reported strange phenomena that had frightened the whole population. At first, nobody wants to co-operate with him, but he finally finds that the island is being allegedly haunted by the ghost of Josip Broz Tito, Communist leader of former Yugoslavia. For Luka, the mayor, this is the opportunity to turn entire island into Tito-themed amusement park. Tito''s WW2 veterans, on the other hand, don''t believe in ghosts; for them, the apparition is actually Tito himself, who had returned in order to lead them into a new revolution which would restore Communism. Written by Anonymous', 'Stipan is a policeman who comes to small Adriatic island off the Croatian coast in order to investigate reported strange phenomena that had frightened the whole population. At first, nobody wants to co-operate with him, but he finally finds that the island is being allegedly haunted by the ghost of Josip Broz Tito, Communist leader of former Yugoslavia. For Luka, the mayor, this is the opportunity to turn entire island into Tito-themed amusement park. Tito''s WW2 veterans, on the other hand, don''t believe in ghosts; for them, the apparition is actually Tito himself, who had returned in order to lead them into a new revolution which would restore Communism. Written by Anonymous', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF1YFmGRUQbEklAmVsGq7WZU2XD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194941'),
  ('904099650631347567', 'Marshall', 2017, 'Drama', 'Reginald Hudlin, Newton Thomas Sigel, Victoria Thomas', 'Jacob Koskoff, Michael Koskoff', 'Chadwick Boseman, Josh Gad, Kate Hudson, Sterling K. Brown, James Cromwell, Dan Stevens, Sophia Bush, Jussie Smollett', 'PG-13', 'Thurgood Marshall, the first African-American Supreme Court Justice, battles through one of his career-defining cases.', 'Thurgood Marshall, the first African-American Supreme Court Justice, battles through one of his career-defining cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KfdXsXTCbMie0wB1mSmIX60C2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392982'),
  ('1129041382581182992', 'Marshland', 2014, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alberto Rodríguez, Álex Catalán, Beatriz Mateos', 'Rafael Cobos, Alberto Rodríguez', 'Javier Gutiérrez, Raúl Arévalo, María Varod, Perico Cervantes, Jesús Ortiz, Jesús Carroza, Salva Reina, Antonio de la Torre', null, 'The Spanish Deep South, 1980. A series of brutal murders of adolescent girls in a remote and forgotten town bring together two disparate characters – both detectives in the homicide division – to investigate the cases.', 'The Spanish Deep South, 1980. A series of brutal murders of adolescent girls in a remote and forgotten town bring together two disparate characters – both detectives in the homicide division – to investigate the cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaXobQ6Y1o5sOH9twNz1oUFFRU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236735'),
  ('70076971598199912', 'Marshmallow', 2025, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Daniel DelPurgatorio, Filip Vandewal', 'Andy Greskoviak', 'Pierson Fodé, Corbin Bernsen, Giorgia Whigham, Alysia Reiner, Paul Soter, Miya Cech, Kue Lawrence, Amanda Clayton', 'NR', 'At a secluded summer camp, timid and introverted 12-year-old Morgan is thrust into a waking nightmare when a once-fabled campfire tale becomes real. As a mysterious figure descends upon the camp, Morgan and his newfound friends must embark on a treacherous journey and uncover a sinister reality buried beneath the surface.', 'At a secluded summer camp, timid and introverted 12-year-old Morgan is thrust into a waking nightmare when a once-fabled campfire tale becomes real. As a mysterious figure descends upon the camp, Morgan and his newfound friends must embark on a treacherous journey and uncover a sinister reality buried beneath the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxCJDzkFahBxRaeKoCBJwQkJZUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1134048'),
  ('657577262173014315', 'Marsupilami', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Philippe Lacheau, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille, Ivan Rousseau', 'Pierre Dudan, Philippe Lacheau, Pierre Lacheau', 'Philippe Lacheau, Jamel Debbouze, Tarek Boudali, Élodie Fontan, Julien Arruti, Jean Reno, Corentin Guillot, Gérard Jugnot', null, 'David is tasked to deliver a mysterious package from South America, only to find out he is carrying a baby Marsupilami!', 'David is tasked to deliver a mysterious package from South America, only to find out he is carrying a baby Marsupilami!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJNHFa07Id2ylQgw0ttzGwpeczE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145899'),
  ('1030445534315082952', 'Marta', 1971, 'Thriller, Horror', 'José Antonio Nieves Conde, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Juan José Alonso Millán, Tito Carpi, Ricardo López Aranda', 'Marisa Mell, Stephen Boyd, Jesús Puente, George Rigaud, Howard Ross, Isa Miranda, Nélida Quiroga', 'R', 'A wealthy landowner haunted by the spectre of his dead mother has a fling with a beautiful fugitive who bears a striking resemblance to his missing wife, who may have been murdered.', 'A wealthy landowner haunted by the spectre of his dead mother has a fling with a beautiful fugitive who bears a striking resemblance to his missing wife, who may have been murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUPj4B5JYA6kAubZrHGIVftR0Am.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3402'),
  ('296130370985923982', 'Martha', 1967, 'Comedy, Family', 'Erik Balling', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Helge Kjærulff-Schmidt, Poul Bundgaard, Karl Stegger, Poul Reichhardt, Hanne Borchsenius, Birger Jensen', null, 'The oldest ship in the fleet, Martha, and her jolly crew, must race Harald and win, or it''s the scrappers next.', 'The oldest ship in the fleet, Martha, and her jolly crew, must race Harald and win, or it''s the scrappers next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VsgYv8ilUiiWHkhGWDIthY0ikk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31704'),
  ('1003031411552188345', 'Martha', 1974, 'TV Movie, Drama, Thriller', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Margit Carstensen, Karlheinz Böhm, Barbara Valentin, Peter Chatel, Gisela Fackeldey, Adrian Hoven, Ortrud Beginnen, Wolfgang Schenck', null, 'After the death of her abusive father, lonely librarian Martha finds herself caught up in a strange, sadomasochistic relationship with a monstrous husband whom she begins to suspect may be trying to murder her.', 'After the death of her abusive father, lonely librarian Martha finds herself caught up in a strange, sadomasochistic relationship with a monstrous husband whom she begins to suspect may be trying to murder her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wmPwtE2ZBW1FWs7C8ftM0Fa2Kt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10311'),
  ('575908749428940561', 'Martha', 2024, 'Documentary', 'R. J. Cutler, Jenna Rosher, Bill Winters', 'R. J. Cutler', 'Martha Stewart', 'R', 'Told in her own words, this candid documentary charts the unstoppable rise, sudden fall and hard-won comeback of lifestyle icon Martha Stewart.', 'Told in her own words, this candid documentary charts the unstoppable rise, sudden fall and hard-won comeback of lifestyle icon Martha Stewart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WN19oCTXlK8jXC0QZgNkBpcJcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1330409'),
  ('248594980383128048', 'Martha Marcy May Marlene', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sean Durkin, Jody Lee Lipes', 'Sean Durkin', 'Elizabeth Olsen, Sarah Paulson, Hugh Dancy, John Hawkes, Brady Corbet, Louisa Krause, Christopher Abbott, Maria Dizzia', 'R', 'After several years of living with a cult, Martha finally escapes and calls her estranged sister, Lucy, for help. Martha finds herself at the quiet Connecticut home Lucy shares with her new husband, Ted, but the memories of what she experienced in the cult make peace hard to find. As flashbacks continue to torment her, Martha fails to shake a terrible sense of dread, especially in regard to the cult''s manipulative leader.', 'After several years of living with a cult, Martha finally escapes and calls her estranged sister, Lucy, for help. Martha finds herself at the quiet Connecticut home Lucy shares with her new husband, Ted, but the memories of what she experienced in the cult make peace hard to find. As flashbacks continue to torment her, Martha fails to shake a terrible sense of dread, especially in regard to the cult''s manipulative leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgB4sa9UfCyGdamfKAZXyEWuAwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50837'),
  ('292756873993196912', 'Martial Arts of Shaolin', 1986, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Lau Chaw-Chau, Cho On-Sun', 'Sze Yeung-Ping', 'Jet Li, Hu Jian-Qiang, Huang Qiuyan, Yu Chenghui, Yu Hai, Sun Jiankui, Liu Huai-Liang, Ji Chunhua', null, 'In ancient China, Zhi Ming trains at the legendary Northern Shaolin temple to avenge the death of his father at the hands of a nefarious magistrate.', 'In ancient China, Zhi Ming trains at the legendary Northern Shaolin temple to avenge the death of his father at the hands of a nefarious magistrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Gk38G7JcGJY6aR4cdrZ8sftSsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37032'),
  ('648351666537006146', 'Martial Club', 1981, 'Action', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Lee Tai-Hang, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Ni Kuang', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Robert Mak Tak-Law, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Ku Feng, Hsiao Ho, Wong Ching-Ho, Ching Miao', 'R', 'Wong Fei Hung and his friend are constantly having contests to see who has the better martial arts skill. After getting in trouble with their fathers, Wong Fei Hung settles down and starts to train seriously, while his friend still horses around. After his friend is hurt by a rival school, Wong goes to the school for retribution. Instead his skill is tested through a series of events which climax with him taking on a Northern martial artist. In an excellent battle of skill, he earns the respect of the rival school. Also stars Mai Te Lo and Hui Ying Hung.', 'Wong Fei Hung and his friend are constantly having contests to see who has the better martial arts skill. After getting in trouble with their fathers, Wong Fei Hung settles down and starts to train seriously, while his friend still horses around. After his friend is hurt by a rival school, Wong goes to the school for retribution. Instead his skill is tested through a series of events which climax with him taking on a Northern martial artist. In an excellent battle of skill, he earns the respect of the rival school. Also stars Mai Te Lo and Hui Ying Hung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7w6dolXHCOaoVo4fInOHe4BWx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64994'),
  ('582864352708175615', 'Martial Law', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'John Huneck, Steve Cohen, Steve Love', 'Richard Brandes', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Chad McQueen, David Carradine, Andy McCutcheon, Philip Tan, Tony Longo, Vincent Craig Dupree, Jim Malinda', 'R', 'An undercover cop teams up with a martial-arts expert to stop a gang of drug smugglers and car thieves.', 'An undercover cop teams up with a martial-arts expert to stop a gang of drug smugglers and car thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1BlNztDoAk7BNzYwx1ar2PGYTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65497'),
  ('873892145538788940', 'Martial Law II: Undercover', 1991, 'Action, Crime', 'Steve Barnett, Kurt Anderson, Peter Fernberger', 'Richard Brandes, Jiles Fitzgerald', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Jeff Wincott, Paul Johansson, Evan Lurie, Charles Taylor, Sherrie Rose, Billy Drago, Deborah Driggs', 'R', 'Sean and Billie are undercover cops and martial arts masters. Investigating the death of a cop, they uncover a deadly ring of murder and corruption at a glitzy nightclub, where the rich are entertained by seductive women and protected by martial arts experts. Billie goes undercover to infiltrate the crime ring, leading to an explosive finale.', 'Sean and Billie are undercover cops and martial arts masters. Investigating the death of a cop, they uncover a deadly ring of murder and corruption at a glitzy nightclub, where the rich are entertained by seductive women and protected by martial arts experts. Billie goes undercover to infiltrate the crime ring, leading to an explosive finale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPrY3AQ51kp3BjSKlHVRvbSJeK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61802'),
  ('722898963584474884', 'Martial Outlaw', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Christina Fong, Jürgen Baum, Kurt Anderson', 'Thomas Ritz', 'Jeff Wincott, Gary Hudson, Krista Errickson, Natasha Pavlovich, Vladimir Skomarovsky, Liliana Komorowska, Gary Wood, Ari Barak', 'R', 'A DEA agent and his brother, a Los Angeles cop, battle the Russian mafia.', 'A DEA agent and his brother, a Los Angeles cop, battle the Russian mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7YEvLUgAzxhjEbNCG7EZ3FmZ1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175682'),
  ('279191591756464984', 'Martian Child', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert D. Yeoman, Menno Meyjes, Chris Beach', 'Seth Bass, Jonathan Tolins', 'John Cusack, Bobby Coleman, Amanda Peet, Sophie Okonedo, Joan Cusack, Oliver Platt, Richard Schiff, Taya Calicetto', 'PG-13', 'A recently-widowed science fiction writer considers whether to adopt a hyper-imaginative 6-year-old abandoned and socially-rejected boy who says he''s really from Mars.', 'A recently-widowed science fiction writer considers whether to adopt a hyper-imaginative 6-year-old abandoned and socially-rejected boy who says he''s really from Mars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amRUHHflkZsbcvRnfJN9ZKxv8R3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5126'),
  ('507416044015679964', 'Martian Land', 2015, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Scott D. Wheeler, Mark Atkins, Liam Parry', 'Jeremy M. Inman', 'Alan Pietruszewski, Lane Townsend, Jennifer Dorogi, Arianna Afsar, Chloe Farnworth, Dionne Neish, Chaim Dunbar, Caroline Williams', 'NR', 'In the distant future, mankind lives on Mars, in cities that resemble those once found on Earth, protected from the alien atmosphere by dome-like force-fields. When a massive sandstorm breaks through the dome and destroys Mars New York, those in Mars Los Angeles must figure out how to stop the storm before it wipes them out next.', 'In the distant future, mankind lives on Mars, in cities that resemble those once found on Earth, protected from the alien atmosphere by dome-like force-fields. When a massive sandstorm breaks through the dome and destroys Mars New York, those in Mars Los Angeles must figure out how to stop the storm before it wipes them out next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUe6dZIFTdyIgoyRstxthFiSwJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355309'),
  ('881556300408991230', 'Martian Successor Nadesico: The Motion Picture - Prince of Darkness', 1998, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Drama, Action', 'Tatsuo Sato, Akiharu Ishii, Shinichi Yamaoka', 'Tatsuo Sato', 'Yuji Ueda, Houko Kuwashima, Omi Minami, Naoko Takano, Maya Okamoto, Kentaro Ito, Chisa Yokoyama, Shiho Kikuchi', null, 'Two years have passed since the Great War. Akito and Yurika have vanished. The Jovians and the Earthlings have joined forces and Ruri is now captain of Nadesico B. As the popularity of Boson Jumping grows, a vast transportation network has been developed. Dubbed the Hisago Plan, this network of Chulip portals holds the answers to the mysteries behind Bose particles and their power. If those secrets should fall into the wrong hands, it could mean big trouble. And big trouble there is. A Martian splinter group has launched an offensive, leaving the United Forces befuddled and desperate. So much so, in fact, that the former crew of the Nadesico is called back to active duty for a special unsanctioned mission-to save us all. Does this menagerie of misfits have what it takes? Who will win the race for the Boson technology? And what the heck happened to Akito and Yurika?', 'Two years have passed since the Great War. Akito and Yurika have vanished. The Jovians and the Earthlings have joined forces and Ruri is now captain of Nadesico B. As the popularity of Boson Jumping grows, a vast transportation network has been developed. Dubbed the Hisago Plan, this network of Chulip portals holds the answers to the mysteries behind Bose particles and their power. If those secrets should fall into the wrong hands, it could mean big trouble. And big trouble there is. A Martian splinter group has launched an offensive, leaving the United Forces befuddled and desperate. So much so, in fact, that the former crew of the Nadesico is called back to active duty for a special unsanctioned mission-to save us all. Does this menagerie of misfits have what it takes? Who will win the race for the Boson technology? And what the heck happened to Akito and Yurika?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcLVfVAQthw78bGNIoZWATsPdbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36613'),
  ('374803209846685026', 'Martian Through Georgia', 1962, 'Comedy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones, Abe Levitow, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc, Ed Prentiss, June Foray', null, 'Way out in space, on another world whose population is contented, one of its people decides that travel broadens the mind and relieves boredom. So, he flies to Earth in hope of helping the alien Earthlings improve their lot, only to cause panic and be declared a monster just because he looks different. So, he decides to return home, where, at least, he can find love.', 'Way out in space, on another world whose population is contented, one of its people decides that travel broadens the mind and relieves boredom. So, he flies to Earth in hope of helping the alien Earthlings improve their lot, only to cause panic and be declared a monster just because he looks different. So, he decides to return home, where, at least, he can find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MHzHYL8vHXR74ePjFjBCQyaxV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234537'),
  ('950688306785798713', 'Martians Go Home', 1989, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'David Odell, Peter Deming', 'Charles S. Haas', 'Randy Quaid, Margaret Colin, Anita Morris, John Philbin, Ronny Cox, Rob Schneider, O-Lan Jones, Gerrit Graham', 'PG-13', 'Song writer Mark Devereaux accidentally calls millions of green Martians to invade Earth. No they aren''t dangerous, just wise-cracking, intrusive, pain in neck, annoyances. No one can escape their distracting influence. It''s up to Mark to figure out how they got here, and most importantly, how to get rid of them before they drive everyone crazy!', 'Song writer Mark Devereaux accidentally calls millions of green Martians to invade Earth. No they aren''t dangerous, just wise-cracking, intrusive, pain in neck, annoyances. No one can escape their distracting influence. It''s up to Mark to figure out how they got here, and most importantly, how to get rid of them before they drive everyone crazy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iCRw4Z0F6exno4V0UxJAZri5rV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117342'),
  ('65530923452208500', 'Martians vs Mexicans', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Rafael Luna Esparza, Rodolfo Riva Palacio Alatriste, Gabriel Riva Palacio Alatriste', 'Rodolfo Riva Palacio Alatriste, Gabriel Riva Palacio Alatriste', 'Adal Ramones, Omar Chaparro, Martha Higareda, Angélica Vale, Eduardo Manzano, Humberto Vélez, Fernando Meza, Rodolfo Riva Palacio Alatriste', 'NR', 'A group of martian aliens invade earth, but they never expected mexicans to be immune to their multiple attacks.', 'A group of martian aliens invade earth, but they never expected mexicans to be immune to their multiple attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJgST3eXOVB8w7aW6Cjnsc1BxEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387836'),
  ('94801667521649801', 'Martin', 1978, 'Horror, Drama', 'George A. Romero, Michael Gornick', 'George A. Romero', 'John Amplas, Lincoln Maazel, Christine Forrest, Elyane Nadeau, Tom Savini, Francine Middleton, Roger Caine, Sara Venable', 'R', 'A young man, convinced he''s a vampire, goes to live with his elderly and hostile cousin in a small Pennsylvanian town, where he tries to suppress his bloodlust.', 'A young man, convinced he''s a vampire, goes to live with his elderly and hostile cousin in a small Pennsylvanian town, where he tries to suppress his bloodlust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZMyVazoLcwqF9hCX5nNjb453sd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26517'),
  ('98973573944906942', 'Martin', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'A. P. Arjun, Mani Sharma, Satya Hegde', 'A. P. Arjun', 'Dhruva Sarja, Vaibhavi Shandilya, Anveshi Jain, Giorgia Andriani, Chikkanna, Malavika Avinash, Achyuth Kumar, Nikitin Dheer', null, 'Martin revolves around Lt. Brigadier Arjun Saxena, whose journey takes him from Pakistan to India to discover his real identity and fight against black market dealers, who are involved with terrorists to orchestrate massive attacks in the country.', 'Martin revolves around Lt. Brigadier Arjun Saxena, whose journey takes him from Pakistan to India to discover his real identity and fight against black market dealers, who are involved with terrorists to orchestrate massive attacks in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmCJCFrEwPC0u0Y1smihwDo4Cf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861451'),
  ('1090445525518184542', 'Martin (Hache)', 1997, 'Drama', 'Adolfo Aristarain, Juanma Pagazaurtundua, Noemí Nemirovsky', 'Adolfo Aristarain, Kathy Saavedra', 'Federico Luppi, Juan Diego Botto, Eusebio Poncela, Cecilia Roth, Ana María Picchio, Sancho Gracia, José María Sacristán, Joaquin A. Colmenares', 'NR', 'After having a nearly fatal drug overdose, 19-year-old Argentine Martin is sent to Madrid, where his film director father lives with his new, younger lover, Alicia, and his bisexual actor friend, Dante.', 'After having a nearly fatal drug overdose, 19-year-old Argentine Martin is sent to Madrid, where his film director father lives with his new, younger lover, Alicia, and his bisexual actor friend, Dante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe7dC06Eb0hNKzWSsHtA2oTUDK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43429'),
  ('1112376518096002923', 'Martin Eden', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alessandro Abate, Francesco Di Giacomo, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Pietro Marcello, Maurizio Braucci', 'Luca Marinelli, Jessica Cressy, Carlo Cecchi, Vincenzo Nemolato, Marco Leonardi, Denise Sardisco, Carmen Pommella, Autilia Ranieri', null, 'The tale of an individualist proletarian in a time marked by the rise of mass political movements. In early 20th-century Italy, illiterate sailor Martin Eden seeks fame as a writer while torn between the love of a bourgeois girl and allegiance to his social class.', 'The tale of an individualist proletarian in a time marked by the rise of mass political movements. In early 20th-century Italy, illiterate sailor Martin Eden seeks fame as a writer while torn between the love of a bourgeois girl and allegiance to his social class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lkrx1xQI4tOuvug4zZURKxQfet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582873'),
