  ('864805708972529978', 'Martyrs', 2008, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Pascal Laugier, Stéphane Martin, Nathalie Moliavko-Visotzky', 'Pascal Laugier', 'Morjana Alaoui, Mylène Jampanoï, Catherine Bégin, Robert Toupin, Patricia Tulasne, Juliette Gosselin, Xavier Dolan, Jean-Marie Moncelet', 'R', 'A young woman’s quest for revenge against the people who kidnapped and tortured her as a child leads her and her best friend, also a victim of child abuse, on a terrifying journey into a living hell of depravity.', 'A young woman’s quest for revenge against the people who kidnapped and tortured her as a child leads her and her best friend, also a victim of child abuse, on a terrifying journey into a living hell of depravity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaaoQLCT38CrKxX53WRpjw1ZPVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9539'),
