  ('980639201518719551', 'Martyrs Lane', 2022, 'Horror', 'Jessie Frost, Márk Győri, Ruth Platt', 'Ruth Platt', 'Kiera Thompson, Denise Gough, Sienna Sayer, Steven Cree, Hannah Rae, Anastasia Hille, Donna Banya, Catherine Terris', null, 'Leah, 10, has terrible nightmares. Her mother seems distant somehow, lost in her thoughts. A small, nightly visitor brings Leah comfort, but soon Leah will realize that her little visitor offers knowledge that might be very, very dangerous.', 'Leah, 10, has terrible nightmares. Her mother seems distant somehow, lost in her thoughts. A small, nightly visitor brings Leah comfort, but soon Leah will realize that her little visitor offers knowledge that might be very, very dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2p9ATFUEiXT75LmMsSCBicnpX8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797815'),
