  ('255755698206404776', 'Maruja', 1959, 'Drama', 'Óscar Orzábal Quintana, Jerónimo Mitchell Meléndez, Luis A. Maisonet', 'Manuel G. Piñera, Jerónimo Mitchell Meléndez', 'Marta Romero, Roberto Rivera Negrón, Mario Pabón, Axel Anderson, Manuel Pérez Durán, Víctor Arrillaga, Mona Marti, Eugenio Navarro', null, 'In a small rural town, everybody lays eyes on Maruja, the most beautiful woman there. After the son of the mayor comes back from France, he also notices Maruja, setting forth events of love, jealousy, guilt, and anger.', 'In a small rural town, everybody lays eyes on Maruja, the most beautiful woman there. After the son of the mayor comes back from France, he also notices Maruja, setting forth events of love, jealousy, guilt, and anger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0KuJSd7tRzcUGC1rKTo83h3xbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352613'),
