  ('187919052005940667', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Black Panther: Wakanda Forever', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh, Pete Chiaramonte', 'Brandon Bestenheider, Brenton Covington', 'Ryan Coogler, Letitia Wright, Lupita Nyong''o, Danai Gurira, Winston Duke, Dominique Thorne, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Angela Bassett', 'PG', 'Follow the production of “Black Panther: Wakanda Forever” as the cast and crew take on the incredible challenge of remembering T’Challa with a chapter befitting the late king. Through intimate behind-the-scenes footage and interviews, watch Shuri take on the mantel of Wakanda’s hero and face a new foe from the ocean’s depths in Namor.', 'Follow the production of “Black Panther: Wakanda Forever” as the cast and crew take on the incredible challenge of remembering T’Challa with a chapter befitting the late king. Through intimate behind-the-scenes footage and interviews, watch Shuri take on the mantel of Wakanda’s hero and face a new foe from the ocean’s depths in Namor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYTPKWO7a4mHKLyksJgB8CMq9Qx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076032'),
  ('91807401140260531', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Deadpool & Wolverine', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh, Simon Firsht', 'Meghan Leon', 'Shawn Levy, Ryan Reynolds, Kevin Feige, Hugh Jackman, Wendy Jacobson, Zeb Wells, Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick', 'R', 'Hugh Jackman, Ryan Reynolds, and director Shawn Levy sit down and spill the proverbial beans about how "Deadpool & Wolverine" was conceived, carried to term, and then birthed.', 'Hugh Jackman, Ryan Reynolds, and director Shawn Levy sit down and spill the proverbial beans about how "Deadpool & Wolverine" was conceived, carried to term, and then birthed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dQyDFxTY6o3v67ncYCExog6aPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1386628'),
  ('775215189266249165', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Michael Rizzi, Callum Holt, Brad Baruh', 'Steve Elkins', 'Bruce Campbell, Kevin Feige, Sam Raimi, Richie Palmer, Michael Waldron, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Doug Lefler, Benedict Cumberbatch', 'PG-13', 'Join visionary director Sam Raimi and the cast of the film as they recount their experiences bringing Marvel’s darkest story to life. From world-building to universe-building, hear first hand accounts from the cast and crew on what it took to design, create and make each universe unique and believable.', 'Join visionary director Sam Raimi and the cast of the film as they recount their experiences bringing Marvel’s darkest story to life. From world-building to universe-building, hear first hand accounts from the cast and crew on what it took to design, create and make each universe unique and believable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIzPe62s12uHsIPhGWY1yp68DY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980017'),
  ('722449893785239259', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Eternals', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Bradley Hogan, Bradley Hogan', 'Charlie Visnic', 'Gemma Chan, Nate Moore, Kit Harington, Kumail Nanjiani, Lauren Ridloff, Kevin Feige, Chloé Zhao, Salma Hayek Pinault', 'PG', 'Join director Chloe Zhao and the Cast of Eternals as they recount their experiences during the making of Marvel Studios’ most ambitious film to date. Discover how the ensemble cast felt stepping into their roles, filming in remote locations, and creating bonds that would help to create the on-screen relationships that span over 7,000 years.', 'Join director Chloe Zhao and the Cast of Eternals as they recount their experiences during the making of Marvel Studios’ most ambitious film to date. Discover how the ensemble cast felt stepping into their roles, filming in remote locations, and creating bonds that would help to create the on-screen relationships that span over 7,000 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBJ5ZjFJ6IHQWz90SsW80PizVlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939356'),
  ('78533157810036609', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Hawkeye', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh, Pete Chiaramonte', 'Meghan Leon', 'Trinh Tran, Hiroyuki Sanada, Bert, Bertie, Rhys Thomas, Ava Russo, Brad Winderbaum, Jeremy Renner', 'PG-13', 'Join the likes of Jeremy Renner, Hailee Steinfeld, Florence Pugh, and Vincent D’Onofrio as they reveal how Marvel Studios’ “Hawkeye” was conceived and created. Witness firsthand what it took to pull off the show’s pulse-pounding action set pieces, and discover how iconic characters from the pages of Marvel Comics such as Kate Bishop were adapted and brought to life for the six-episode series.', 'Join the likes of Jeremy Renner, Hailee Steinfeld, Florence Pugh, and Vincent D’Onofrio as they reveal how Marvel Studios’ “Hawkeye” was conceived and created. Witness firsthand what it took to pull off the show’s pulse-pounding action set pieces, and discover how iconic characters from the pages of Marvel Comics such as Kate Bishop were adapted and brought to life for the six-episode series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQOLNPHe4rwXl3RpKNa0VWjYNLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936643'),
  ('489149711060862353', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Loki Season 2', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh, Callum Holt', 'Meghan Leon', 'Tom Hiddleston, Owen Wilson, Eric Martin, Justin Benson, Aaron Moorhead, Kevin R. Wright, Stephen Broussard, Sophia Di Martino', 'PG-13', 'Through candid interviews with the creative minds behind the show, and exclusive on-set footage, discover how the talented team that powered "Loki: Season 2" raised the stakes for this latest MCU adventure. Witness imaginative costumes, elaborate environments, and far-out variants come to life, meet new allies and foes, and time-slip across the Multiverse.', 'Through candid interviews with the creative minds behind the show, and exclusive on-set footage, discover how the talented team that powered "Loki: Season 2" raised the stakes for this latest MCU adventure. Witness imaginative costumes, elaborate environments, and far-out variants come to life, meet new allies and foes, and time-slip across the Multiverse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa4HvgQO1sLQTobjJR10kDOJzWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1192825'),
  ('1035644847818329384', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Moon Knight', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh, Byron Werner, Zsolt Big Nagy', 'Amir Shoucri, Jason Hillhouse', 'Kevin Feige, Brad Winderbaum, Grant Curtis, Mohamed Diab, Aaron Moorhead, Justin Benson, Jeremy Slater, Oscar Isaac', 'PG-13', 'Join the likes of Oscar Isaac and Ethan Hawke as they reveal how Marvel Studios'' Moon Knight was painstakingly brought to life. Through insightful interviews with cast and crew, along with immersive footage from the set, and a candid "roundtable discussion" with the series'' directors, this "making-of" pulls back the curtain on the groundbreaking series of Marvel Studios'' newest hero.', 'Join the likes of Oscar Isaac and Ethan Hawke as they reveal how Marvel Studios'' Moon Knight was painstakingly brought to life. Through insightful interviews with cast and crew, along with immersive footage from the set, and a candid "roundtable discussion" with the series'' directors, this "making-of" pulls back the curtain on the groundbreaking series of Marvel Studios'' newest hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM6Y4uLzeF4rqbmKBzR0wAsTxby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964943'),
  ('83808281348193028', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Ms. Marvel', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh', 'Meghan Leon', 'Bisha K. Ali, Iman Vellani, Kevin Feige, Mohan Kapur, Matt Lintz, Zenobia Shroff, Aramis Knight, Laurel Marsden', 'PG-13', 'Go behind-the-scenes every step of the way with immersive footage from the making of the series, along with insightful interviews on set from the cast and crew of Ms. Marvel as we watch Iman Vellani and her character, Kamala Khan, become the fan-favorite superhero right before our eyes.', 'Go behind-the-scenes every step of the way with immersive footage from the making of the series, along with insightful interviews on set from the cast and crew of Ms. Marvel as we watch Iman Vellani and her character, Kamala Khan, become the fan-favorite superhero right before our eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6m0rG2bS90FOlUaxEq8ZPCTQMei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001912'),
  ('1070578498006525094', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Secret Invasion', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Callum Holt, Brad Baruh', 'Brandon Bestenheider, Brenton Covington, Meghan Leon', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Jonathan Schwartz, Brian Tucker, Ali Selim, Cobie Smulders, Claire Anderson, Ben Mendelsohn, Emilia Clarke', 'PG-13', 'Through in-depth interviews with cast and crew, and exclusive behind-the-scenes footage, Assembled uncovers how Marvel Studios’ “Secret Invasion” was born. Witness what it took to conjure the world of the show, and spend time with Samuel L. Jackson as he dons the patch once again to engage in the most baffling battle of Nick Fury’s career.', 'Through in-depth interviews with cast and crew, and exclusive behind-the-scenes footage, Assembled uncovers how Marvel Studios’ “Secret Invasion” was born. Witness what it took to conjure the world of the show, and spend time with Samuel L. Jackson as he dons the patch once again to engage in the most baffling battle of Nick Fury’s career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YDNwj9gsAQlcHQALPtjJipoGx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1165500'),
  ('580208518640585354', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of She-Hulk: Attorney at Law', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh, Kyle Leonard', 'Meghan Leon', 'Tatiana Maslany, Mark Ruffalo, Tim Roth, Benedict Wong, Ginger Gonzaga, Josh Segarra, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Jameela Jamil', 'PG-13', 'Join the likes of Tatiana Maslany, Mark Ruffalo, Tim Roth, and Benedict Wong as they reveal how Marvel Studios’ She-Hulk: Attorney at Law was conceived and shaped. Discover what it took for She-Hulk’s creators to pull off the show’s tricky tone and deliver Marvel Studios’ first truly comedic series – one that boldly breaks the fourth wall to acknowledge its own audience, no less!', 'Join the likes of Tatiana Maslany, Mark Ruffalo, Tim Roth, and Benedict Wong as they reveal how Marvel Studios’ She-Hulk: Attorney at Law was conceived and shaped. Discover what it took for She-Hulk’s creators to pull off the show’s tricky tone and deliver Marvel Studios’ first truly comedic series – one that boldly breaks the fourth wall to acknowledge its own audience, no less!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhFN7yvskzm1Tsknkg46eQbQr9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026208'),
  ('118304912758368199', 'Marvel Studios Assembled: The Making of Thor: Love and Thunder', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Brad Baruh, Anthony Rose', 'Brenton Covington, Brandon Bestenheider', 'Chris Hemsworth, Kevin Feige, Taika Waititi, Brad Winderbaum, Brian Chapek, Chris Pratt, Tessa Thompson, Jake Morrison', 'PG-13', 'Settle in with the likes of Taika Waititi, Chris Hemsworth, Natalie Portman, Christian Bale, and Tessa Thompson, and as they divulge the secrets behind the creation of Thor: Love and Thunder. Through in-depth interviews with cast and crew, along with raw, unseen footage from the set and beyond, this documentary special pulls back the curtain on the God of Thunder’s fourth feature film.', 'Settle in with the likes of Taika Waititi, Chris Hemsworth, Natalie Portman, Christian Bale, and Tessa Thompson, and as they divulge the secrets behind the creation of Thor: Love and Thunder. Through in-depth interviews with cast and crew, along with raw, unseen footage from the set and beyond, this documentary special pulls back the curtain on the God of Thunder’s fourth feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb7GP3cttApzilOOM52L129Eaaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015595'),
  ('114577761172230942', 'Marvel Studios: Assembling a Universe', 2014, 'Documentary, TV Movie, Fantasy', null, null, 'Robert Downey Jr., Clark Gregg, Scarlett Johansson, Kenneth Branagh, Hayley Atwell, Victoria Alonso, Mark Ruffalo, Samuel L. Jackson', 'PG', 'A look at the story behind Marvel Studios and the Marvel Cinematic Universe, featuring interviews and behind-the-scenes footage from all of the Marvel films, the Marvel One-Shots and "Marvel''s Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D."!', 'A look at the story behind Marvel Studios and the Marvel Cinematic Universe, featuring interviews and behind-the-scenes footage from all of the Marvel films, the Marvel One-Shots and "Marvel''s Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D."!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41Ke02UzYoPsiTc3YbomPGiQKMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259910'),
  ('607867534508070452', 'Marvel Studios'' 2021 Disney+ Day Special', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chris Hemsworth, Tom Hiddleston, Mark Ruffalo, Elizabeth Olsen, Paul Bettany, Benedict Cumberbatch, Chadwick Boseman, Jeremy Renner', 'PG', 'Explore the Disney+ series of the MCU—past, present and future!', 'Explore the Disney+ series of the MCU—past, present and future!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zh0B5DDP93e3zokktb5aHHfIh01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877188'),
  ('1005194395976986185', 'Marvel: 75 Years, from Pulp to Pop!', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Zak Knutson', 'Laura Shields', 'Emily VanCamp, Stan Lee, Hayley Atwell, Scarlett Johansson, Nicole Perlman, Chris Pratt, Joss Whedon, Kevin Feige', 'PG', 'In celebration of the publisher''s 75th anniversary, the hour-long special will take a detailed look at the company''s journey from fledgling comics publisher to multi-media juggernaut. Hosted by Emily VanCamp (S.H.I.E.L.D. Agent Sharon Carter), the documentary-style feature will include interviews with comic book icons, pop culture authorities, and Hollywood stars. The special also promises an "extraordinary peek into Marvel''s future!" Might Marvel release the first official footage from next year''s Avengers: Age of Ultron or Ant-Man? If they do, you''ll know about it here.', 'In celebration of the publisher''s 75th anniversary, the hour-long special will take a detailed look at the company''s journey from fledgling comics publisher to multi-media juggernaut. Hosted by Emily VanCamp (S.H.I.E.L.D. Agent Sharon Carter), the documentary-style feature will include interviews with comic book icons, pop culture authorities, and Hollywood stars. The special also promises an "extraordinary peek into Marvel''s future!" Might Marvel release the first official footage from next year''s Avengers: Age of Ultron or Ant-Man? If they do, you''ll know about it here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biud0bsRfQryGBfcTXN2ep6ODwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299969'),
  ('96384937132525562', 'Marvel''s Behind the Mask', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Joshua Weinstein, Mike Jacobs', null, 'Joe Quesada, Peter Sanderson, Sana Amanat, Neal Kirby, Reginald Hudlin, Darryl ''DMC'' McDaniels, Ann Nocenti, Roy Thomas', 'PG-13', 'A documentary special that explores the power of identity behind the iconic superheroes we know and love today. These legendary Marvel creations and stories have not only reflected the world outside our window – they have become a reflection of our own identities and who we truly are.', 'A documentary special that explores the power of identity behind the iconic superheroes we know and love today. These legendary Marvel creations and stories have not only reflected the world outside our window – they have become a reflection of our own identities and who we truly are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p71YgDQk5sFHTqF3FBygLPmZEX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787923'),
  ('771968412863658966', 'Marvellous', 2014, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Julian Farino, David Odd, Simon Maloney', 'Peter Bowker', 'Toby Jones, Gemma Jones, Tony Curran, Nicholas Gleaves, Greg McHugh, Jordan Murphy, Oliver Ashworth, Liam Ainsworth', null, 'Dramatisation of the true story of the life of Neil "Nello" Baldwin. Born with a mild learning disability but without the burden of social embarrassment &amp; how his inexhaustible ability to see the good in any situation overcame any stigma society tried to label him with.', 'Dramatisation of the true story of the life of Neil "Nello" Baldwin. Born with a mild learning disability but without the burden of social embarrassment &amp; how his inexhaustible ability to see the good in any situation overcame any stigma society tried to label him with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6enWpJ7IAN54krCOXQDrbMRcuCb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295144'),
  ('202314736601541699', 'Marvelous and the Black Hole', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nanu Segal, Justin Hogan, Kate Tsang', 'Kate Tsang', 'Miya Cech, Rhea Perlman, Leonardo Nam, Kannon Omachi, Paulina Lule, Keith Powell, Lauren Knutti, Aris Alvarado', null, 'A teenage delinquent befriends a surly magician who helps her navigate her inner demons and dysfunctional family with sleight of hand magic.', 'A teenage delinquent befriends a surly magician who helps her navigate her inner demons and dysfunctional family with sleight of hand magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8JiuRrSdg6qXNnJWTqOftTy6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685411'),
  ('478514238411424881', 'Marvelous Stunts Of Kung Fu', 1979, null, null, null, null, null, 'The stars are cast as a gorgeous woman, a mystic and a kung-fu expert. They team up to form a united front when an insidious empire threatens the well-being of the land they love.', 'The stars are cast as a gorgeous woman, a mystic and a kung-fu expert. They team up to form a united front when an insidious empire threatens the well-being of the land they love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLs9RqwkrEDFM3MhcbiPvcn95tP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443985'),
  ('706729669419824394', 'Marvin Gaye - Visionär des Soul', 2026, 'Documentary, Music', 'Schyda Vasseghi', 'Schyda Vasseghi', 'Marvin Gaye, Dan Dombrowe, Hadnet Tesfai, Jamie Lidell, David Ritz', null, 'He was the gentle rebel of soul: Marvin Gaye, one of the greatest musicians of the 20th century. With his unmistakable voice and hits like "I Heard It Through the Grapevine," "What''s Going On," and "Sexual Healing," he shaped American pop culture-a legacy that continues to this day. Without any knowledge of music theory or formal training, the "Prince of Soul" worked his way up from background singer to one of the most important artists on the legendary Motown label. His songs combined melancholy and hope, sensuality and social commentary-making him a voice of change. But behind the perfect facade hid a deeply wounded man. Early childhood trauma, depression, stage fright, substance abuse, and family conflicts overshadowed Gaye''s life. A sabbatical in Ostend, Belgium, in the early 1980s seemed to offer temporary healing-but the inner turmoil remained. On April 1, 1984, one day before his 45th birthday, his life ended tragically: shot by his own father.', 'He was the gentle rebel of soul: Marvin Gaye, one of the greatest musicians of the 20th century. With his unmistakable voice and hits like "I Heard It Through the Grapevine," "What''s Going On," and "Sexual Healing," he shaped American pop culture-a legacy that continues to this day. Without any knowledge of music theory or formal training, the "Prince of Soul" worked his way up from background singer to one of the most important artists on the legendary Motown label. His songs combined melancholy and hope, sensuality and social commentary-making him a voice of change. But behind the perfect facade hid a deeply wounded man. Early childhood trauma, depression, stage fright, substance abuse, and family conflicts overshadowed Gaye''s life. A sabbatical in Ostend, Belgium, in the early 1980s seemed to offer temporary healing-but the inner turmoil remained. On April 1, 1984, one day before his 45th birthday, his life ended tragically: shot by his own father.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2OhTAc1ch2Z64AaJbazanbTsezL.jpg', 'plex:movie:marvin-gaye-visionar-des-soul'),
  ('553734795598377738', 'Marvin''s Room', 1996, 'Drama', 'Jerry Zaks, Ellen H. Schwartz, Piotr Sobociński', 'Scott McPherson', 'Meryl Streep, Diane Keaton, Leonardo DiCaprio, Robert De Niro, Hume Cronyn, Gwen Verdon, Hal Scardino, Dan Hedaya', 'PG-13', 'A leukemia patient attempts to end a 20-year feud with her sister to get her bone marrow.', 'A leukemia patient attempts to end a 20-year feud with her sister to get her bone marrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTHq1K5Y6EDRjxTBvReXHY6AKQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9819'),
  ('640638522519695309', 'Marwencol', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Malmberg, Jeff Malmberg, Kevin W. Walsh', null, 'Mark Hogancamp, Emmanuel Nneji, Edda Hogancamp, Tom Neubauer, Julie Swarthout, Janet Wikane, Mark Wikane, Bert', null, 'After a vicious attack leaves him brain-damaged and broke, Mark Hogancamp seeks recovery in "Marwencol", a 1/6th scale World War II-era town he creates in his backyard.', 'After a vicious attack leaves him brain-damaged and broke, Mark Hogancamp seeks recovery in "Marwencol", a 1/6th scale World War II-era town he creates in his backyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdlOAvKrHe4jLO9LUCxjqOqST4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52013'),
  ('415608094606269511', 'Marx Can Wait', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Michele Cherchi Palmieri, Paolo Ferrari, Valerio Ferrara', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Alberto Bellocchio, Letizia Bellocchio, Marco Bellocchio, Maria Luisa Bellocchio, Pia Bareggi, Elena Bellocchio, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Francesco Bellocchio', null, '"Marx can wait" was something Camillo Bellocchio said to his twin Marco the last time they met before the former died at a young age in the heated days of 1968. This documentary is dedicated to his memory.', '"Marx can wait" was something Camillo Bellocchio said to his twin Marco the last time they met before the former died at a young age in the heated days of 1968. This documentary is dedicated to his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PiGxD0tEp78wkq6sU0DNTqkO3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777726'),
  ('516677814619725098', 'Mary', 1931, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Alma Reville', 'Alfred Abel, Olga Tschechowa, Paul Graetz, Lotte Stein, Ekkehard Arendt, John Mylong, Louis Ralph, Hermine Sterler', null, 'When actress Mary Baring is found in a daze beside her colleague’s murdered body, all evidence points to her guilt. During the trial, juror Sir John Menier doubts the verdict, but yields to pressure. Haunted by remorse, he launches his own investigation. (Filmed in German on the same sets as Murder! (1930), this version was directed by Alfred Hitchcock with a new cast for international release.)', 'When actress Mary Baring is found in a daze beside her colleague’s murdered body, all evidence points to her guilt. During the trial, juror Sir John Menier doubts the verdict, but yields to pressure. Haunted by remorse, he launches his own investigation. (Filmed in German on the same sets as Murder! (1930), this version was directed by Alfred Hitchcock with a new cast for international release.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emjGGHlgr3fsIin5XRjjofbvczX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97867'),
  ('661437877976840801', 'Mary', 2005, 'Drama', 'Abel Ferrara, Stefano Falivene', 'Scott Pardo', 'Juliette Binoche, Forest Whitaker, Matthew Modine, Marion Cotillard, Stefania Rocca, Heather Graham, Marco Leonardi, Luca Lionello', null, 'The filming of a movie about Jesus’ death deeply affects three people — an egotistical director who cast himself as Christ, the actress playing Mary Magdalene who cannot bring herself to leave Bethlehem and a TV journalist whose spiritual doubts start to consume him.', 'The filming of a movie about Jesus’ death deeply affects three people — an egotistical director who cast himself as Christ, the actress playing Mary Magdalene who cannot bring herself to leave Bethlehem and a TV journalist whose spiritual doubts start to consume him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8BwKOM75G8AOd1Z4zL0AWfI0zS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64942'),
  ('288605090519783508', 'Mary', 2017, 'Drama', 'Juraj Primorac', 'Ivan Turković Krnjak, Juraj Primorac', 'Josip Lukić, Nikša Butijer, Ksenija Marinković, Sandra Lončarić, Igor Serdar, Verica Radić, Zdenko Jelčić, Tanja Smoje', null, 'Marinko, an assistant worker in the tow-away service has had visions of Virgin Mary. He does not know what to do with her.', 'Marinko, an assistant worker in the tow-away service has had visions of Virgin Mary. He does not know what to do with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1I8pFEz6tTKPATWcOdslvGjQNtz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490174'),
  ('154611948329717133', 'Mary', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Goi, Greg Hale, Marty Eli Schwartz', 'Anthony Jaswinski', 'Gary Oldman, Emily Mortimer, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Owen Teague, Jennifer Esposito, Stefanie Scott, Chloe Perrin, Douglas Urbanski', 'R', 'A struggling family buys an old ship at auction with high hopes of starting a charter business, only to discover her horrifying secrets on the isolated open waters.', 'A struggling family buys an old ship at auction with high hopes of starting a charter business, only to discover her horrifying secrets on the isolated open waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdcyHzqqBrzPGJFVH29ONnzsV6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419706'),
  ('376957585930370096', 'Mary', 2024, 'Drama, History, Action', 'D.J. Caruso, Gavin Struthers', 'Timothy Michael Hayes', 'Noa Cohen, Ido Tako, Anthony Hopkins, Ori Pfeffer, Hilla Vidor, Dudley O''Shaughnessy, Ray Clark, Mili Avital', 'PG-13', 'A miraculous conception. A merciless king. A murderous pursuit. Mary''s journey to give birth to Jesus unfolds in this biblical coming-of-age epic.', 'A miraculous conception. A merciless king. A murderous pursuit. Mary''s journey to give birth to Jesus unfolds in this biblical coming-of-age epic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpApuf1xky92ug8n5mP5aP7DiDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1243381'),
  ('964046009879705367', 'Mary and Martha', 2013, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Scott Hardwick, Phillip Noyce, Roberto De Angelis', 'Richard Curtis', 'Hilary Swank, Brenda Blethyn, Sam Claflin, Frank Grillo, James Woods, Adam Neill, Stephen Jennings, Chandler McIntyre', 'NR', 'Wealthy American housewife Mary Morgan takes her bullied son George out of school for home education,including a trip to Southern Africa. Whilst in Mozambique George is bitten by a mosquito which crawls through a hole in his net and dies of malaria. After his funeral at home Mary feels a compulsion to return to Africa where she meets English woman Martha O''Connell,whose 24 year old son Ben, a teacher with voluntary service overseas,has also died of malaria. Ben gave his net to one of his pupils,believing adults cannot catch malaria. The two women are shocked to see the high death rate caused by the disease and,whilst Martha stays in Africa as a voluntary helper,Mary petitions the American government to change things. Martha turns up at Mary''s house unannounced and,helped by Mary''s ex-diplomat father,they address a senate committee on health spending,persuading them to do more to combat malaria. They meet with some success though a coda states that much more can be done.', 'Wealthy American housewife Mary Morgan takes her bullied son George out of school for home education,including a trip to Southern Africa. Whilst in Mozambique George is bitten by a mosquito which crawls through a hole in his net and dies of malaria. After his funeral at home Mary feels a compulsion to return to Africa where she meets English woman Martha O''Connell,whose 24 year old son Ben, a teacher with voluntary service overseas,has also died of malaria. Ben gave his net to one of his pupils,believing adults cannot catch malaria. The two women are shocked to see the high death rate caused by the disease and,whilst Martha stays in Africa as a voluntary helper,Mary petitions the American government to change things. Martha turns up at Mary''s house unannounced and,helped by Mary''s ex-diplomat father,they address a senate committee on health spending,persuading them to do more to combat malaria. They meet with some success though a coda states that much more can be done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smDcAghsfl6mdMzRhy41MPikp0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176339'),
  ('364531950310519248', 'Mary and The Witch''s Flower', 2017, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Koji Kasamatsu, Toru Fukushi, Takeshi Inamura', 'Riko Sakaguchi, Hiromasa Yonebayashi', 'Yuki Amami, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Hana Sugisaki, Fumiyo Kohinata, Hikari Mitsushima, Jiro Sato, Kenichi Endo, Eri Watanabe', 'PG', 'Mary Smith, a young girl who lives with her great-aunt in the countryside, follows a mysterious cat into the nearby forest where she finds a strange flower and an old broom, none of which is as ordinary as it seems.', 'Mary Smith, a young girl who lives with her great-aunt in the countryside, follows a mysterious cat into the nearby forest where she finds a strange flower and an old broom, none of which is as ordinary as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lq3OJQiJ8hlCr23LAdHbeU3eqBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430447'),
  ('593710664824415688', 'Mary Forever', 1989, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marco Risi, Umberto Castagna, Giovanni Giancono', 'Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Michele Placido, Claudio Amendola, Francesco Benigno, Alessandra Di Sanzo, Tony Sperandeo, Roberto Mariano, Maurizio Prollo, Filippo Genzardi', null, 'A teacher discovers his calling. Marco relocates to Palermo from Milan and takes a job teaching in a reform school while he waits for a high school position. He tries to understand and motivate his handful of students, reading them colloquial poetry, encouraging them to stand up for their rights, finding out about their histories. Natale, in for murder, enamoured of the Mafia, the King Rat within the group; Mery, a drag queen, arrested for assault when defending himself, in love with Mario and, in daylight, rejected by all; Pietro, illiterate, muscular, believing his destiny is set; the callow Claudio, vulnerable, learning to harden himself. What can Mario learn and do in such a short time?', 'A teacher discovers his calling. Marco relocates to Palermo from Milan and takes a job teaching in a reform school while he waits for a high school position. He tries to understand and motivate his handful of students, reading them colloquial poetry, encouraging them to stand up for their rights, finding out about their histories. Natale, in for murder, enamoured of the Mafia, the King Rat within the group; Mery, a drag queen, arrested for assault when defending himself, in love with Mario and, in daylight, rejected by all; Pietro, illiterate, muscular, believing his destiny is set; the callow Claudio, vulnerable, learning to harden himself. What can Mario learn and do in such a short time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGgJH7580UkEaqrwxMolpqQ7a1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41585'),
  ('362062944331103481', 'Mary Is Happy, Mary Is Happy.', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit, Pairach Khumwan', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit', 'Patcha Poonpiriya, Chonnikan Netjui, Thanapob Leeratanakachorn, Vasuphon Kriangprapakit, Udomporn Hongladdaporn, Rossarin Ananchanachai, Awat Ratanapintha, Wattanapume Laisuwanchai', null, 'Mary is in her last course of school. She''ll confront sudden changes in her life, loving relations and friendship. Based on some tweets of an anonymous girl.', 'Mary is in her last course of school. She''ll confront sudden changes in her life, loving relations and friendship. Based on some tweets of an anonymous girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxReatI9DaIn7YnXl0e4pWZU6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250312'),
  ('491726346472347994', 'Mary J. Blige''s My Life', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Vanessa Roth, Kalilah Robinson', null, 'Mary J. Blige, Sean Combs, Taraji P. Henson, Method Man', 'R', 'Mary J. Blige set the music world on fire with her trailblazing 1994 LP "My Life." The singer, producer and actress reveals the demons and blessings that inspired the record and propelled her to international stardom. She celebrates the 25th anniversary of her most influential work by performing the album live for the first time.', 'Mary J. Blige set the music world on fire with her trailblazing 1994 LP "My Life." The singer, producer and actress reveals the demons and blessings that inspired the record and propelled her to international stardom. She celebrates the 25th anniversary of her most influential work by performing the album live for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlnZnhYHl9gfBoEWvOA1T7HNBwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835860'),
