  ('531619208288926707', 'Mary Kom', 2014, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Omung Kumar, Nitin Rana, Keiko Nakahara', 'Saiwyn Quadras', 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Darshan Kumaar, Shishir Sharma, Sunil Thapa, Robin Das, Zachary Coffin, Shiva Dagar, Lin Laishram', 'PG-13', 'A chronicle of the life of Indian boxer ''Mary Kom'' who went through several hardships before audaciously accomplishing her ultimate dream.', 'A chronicle of the life of Indian boxer ''Mary Kom'' who went through several hardships before audaciously accomplishing her ultimate dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eI1rxHzxO2sWeeBMvr42buetYnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284288'),
  ('142631174295320356', 'Mary Magdalene', 2000, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Raffaele Mertes, Elisabetta Marchetti', 'Gareth Jones, Gianmario Pagano', 'Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Giuliana De Sio, Massimo Ghini, Nathalie Caldonazzo, Ambra Angiolini, Gottfried John, Roberta Armani, Benjamin Sadler', null, 'Employed as a spy and given the task of investigating the threat posed by John the Baptist, Mary Magdalene is overwhelmed by John''s powerful message of the coming of the Messiah. Gazing into John''s eyes before he dies, Mary is left with the certainty that her place is at the side of this great man, Jesus Christ.', 'Employed as a spy and given the task of investigating the threat posed by John the Baptist, Mary Magdalene is overwhelmed by John''s powerful message of the coming of the Messiah. Gazing into John''s eyes before he dies, Mary is left with the certainty that her place is at the side of this great man, Jesus Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wR4lcZV9AECJerFqjaS7eSVKXLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58437'),
  ('461951790202894184', 'Mary Magdalene', 2018, 'Drama', 'Silvia Colafranceschi, Garth Davis, Phil Jones', 'Helen Edmundson, Philippa Goslett', 'Rooney Mara, Joaquin Phoenix, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Ariane Labed, Ryan Corr, Tahar Rahim, Hadas Yaron, Charles Babalola', 'R', 'In the first century, free-spirited Mary Magdalene flees the marriage her family has arranged for her, finding refuge and a sense of purpose in a radical new movement led by the charismatic, rabble-rousing preacher named Jesus.', 'In the first century, free-spirited Mary Magdalene flees the marriage her family has arranged for her, finding refuge and a sense of purpose in a radical new movement led by the charismatic, rabble-rousing preacher named Jesus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLbqnVAmD8ISel1SLTY3Ek0TWz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407439'),
  ('991691982018926488', 'Mary of Scotland', 1936, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'John Ford, Joseph H. August, Eddie Donahoe', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Katharine Hepburn, Florence Eldridge, Fredric March, Douglas Walton, John Carradine, Robert Barrat, Gavin Muir, Ian Keith', 'NR', 'The recently widowed Mary Stuart returns to Scotland to reclaim her throne but is opposed by her half-brother and her own Scottish lords.', 'The recently widowed Mary Stuart returns to Scotland to reclaim her throne but is opposed by her half-brother and her own Scottish lords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AKInVpVxnGQLSrmnOUoqTlCtdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43875'),
