  ('548498953976232187', 'Mary Shelley', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'David Ungaro, Haifaa al-Mansour, Patrick Creighton', 'Emma Jensen, Haifaa al-Mansour', 'Elle Fanning, Douglas Booth, Bel Powley, Stephen Dillane, Joanne Froggatt, Tom Sturridge, Ben Hardy, Maisie Williams', 'PG-13', 'The love affair between poet Percy Shelley and Mary Wollstonecraft Godwin resulted in the creation of an immortal novel, “Frankenstein; or, The Modern Prometheus.”', 'The love affair between poet Percy Shelley and Mary Wollstonecraft Godwin resulted in the creation of an immortal novel, “Frankenstein; or, The Modern Prometheus.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKHJTsrfxJtfFNPQJn2hDNEMtFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332283'),
  ('1077436614762099670', 'Mary Shelley''s Frankenstein', 1994, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Roger Pratt, Kenneth Branagh, Martin Childs', 'Frank Darabont, Steph Lady', 'Robert De Niro, Kenneth Branagh, Tom Hulce, Helena Bonham Carter, Aidan Quinn, Ian Holm, Richard Briers, John Cleese', 'R', 'Victor Frankenstein is a promising young doctor who, devastated by the death of his mother during childbirth, becomes obsessed with bringing the dead back to life. His experiments lead to the creation of a monster, which Frankenstein has put together with the remains of corpses. It''s not long before Frankenstein regrets his actions.', 'Victor Frankenstein is a promising young doctor who, devastated by the death of his mother during childbirth, becomes obsessed with bringing the dead back to life. His experiments lead to the creation of a monster, which Frankenstein has put together with the remains of corpses. It''s not long before Frankenstein regrets his actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOwCAQsZlEKrwhPi1ejY6BS8jpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3036'),
  ('492348990427076401', 'Mary Stevens, M.D.', 1933, 'Drama', 'Lloyd Bacon, Chuck Hansen', 'Rian James, Robert Lord', 'Kay Francis, Lyle Talbot, Glenda Farrell, Thelma Todd, Harold Huber, Una O''Connor, Charles C. Wilson, Hobart Cavanaugh', null, 'Lifelong friends and medical school graduates Mary Stevens and Don Andrews decide to set up office together. While Mary struggles to earn respect because of her gender, Don gets caught up in his ambitions for a bigger life.', 'Lifelong friends and medical school graduates Mary Stevens and Don Andrews decide to set up office together. While Mary struggles to earn respect because of her gender, Don gets caught up in his ambitions for a bigger life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysEqJqMJVPmTi6v0hqCqanKm2c2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176627'),
  ('985056108877201535', 'Mary, Mary, Bloody Mary', 1975, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Juan López Moctezuma, Miguel Garzón', 'Malcolm Marmorstein', 'Cristina Ferrare, David Young, John Carradine, Helena Rojo, Arthur Hansel, Enrique Lucero, Susana Kamini, José Ángel Espinosa ''Ferrusquilla''', 'R', 'Mexican horror film about an American painter named Mary who is living in Mexico where she sells her works and also kills people for their blood. It turns out Mary is a vampire but not the traditional one with fangs. Since she has no fangs she must stab or slash the throats of her victims but soon she has a new man in her life as well as a mysterious man in black who appears to be doing the same type of murders.', 'Mexican horror film about an American painter named Mary who is living in Mexico where she sells her works and also kills people for their blood. It turns out Mary is a vampire but not the traditional one with fangs. Since she has no fangs she must stab or slash the throats of her victims but soon she has a new man in her life as well as a mysterious man in black who appears to be doing the same type of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4X5FWWbGzgnRaEs4gAlzTmAGv6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115131'),
  ('684661106357524087', 'Mary, Mother of Jesus', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Kevin Connor, Elemér Ragályi', 'Albert Ross', 'Christian Bale, Pernilla August, Melinda Kinnaman, David Threlfall, Geraldine Chaplin, Edward Hardwicke, John Shrapnel, Hywel Bennett', null, 'Mary, Mother of Jesus is a 1999 made-for-television Biblical film that retells the story of Jesus through the eyes of Mary, his mother.', 'Mary, Mother of Jesus is a 1999 made-for-television Biblical film that retells the story of Jesus through the eyes of Mary, his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqzIkjVMkTK3wJpGEZJHd0yhl41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139751'),
  ('203083590108769990', 'Mary, Mother of the Son of God', 2003, 'Drama', 'Moacyr Góes, Flávio Zangrandi', 'Moacyr Góes, Maria de Souza, Thiego Balteiro', 'Giovanna Antonelli, Luigi Baricelli, Ana Beatriz Cisneiros, Padre Marcelo Rossi, José Wilker, José Dumont, Cláudio Gabriel, Expedito Barreira', null, 'Maria Auxiliadora is a 24 year-old woman very poor, that she lives Joana, her 7 year-old daughter close to. Needing go look for the result of Joana''s exam in the hospital, Maria asks the priest of the local church that takes care of her to return. In spite of Joana''s insistence to go with the mother Maria insists that she is with the priest, because she distrusts that her daughter suffers of a serious disease. To entertain the girl while it awaits the mother''s return, the priest decides to tell her a mother''s history that dedicated her life to the son: Mary, mother of Jesus Christ.', 'Maria Auxiliadora is a 24 year-old woman very poor, that she lives Joana, her 7 year-old daughter close to. Needing go look for the result of Joana''s exam in the hospital, Maria asks the priest of the local church that takes care of her to return. In spite of Joana''s insistence to go with the mother Maria insists that she is with the priest, because she distrusts that her daughter suffers of a serious disease. To entertain the girl while it awaits the mother''s return, the priest decides to tell her a mother''s history that dedicated her life to the son: Mary, mother of Jesus Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ39uUUzNtovwHXP45et8uhLWbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84758'),
  ('1088633512845983295', 'Mary, Queen of Scots', 1971, 'Drama, History', 'Charles Jarrott, Christopher Challis, Simon Relph', 'John Hale', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Glenda Jackson, Patrick McGoohan, Timothy Dalton, Nigel Davenport, Trevor Howard, Daniel Massey, Ian Holm', null, 'Mary Stuart, who was named Queen of Scotland when she was only six days old, is the last Roman Catholic ruler of Scotland. She is imprisoned at the age of 23 by her cousin Elizabeth Tudor, the English Queen and her arch adversary. Nineteen years later the life of Mary is to be ended on the scaffold and with her execution the last threat to Elizabeth''s throne has been removed. The two Queens with their contrasting personalities make a dramatic counterpoint to history.', 'Mary Stuart, who was named Queen of Scotland when she was only six days old, is the last Roman Catholic ruler of Scotland. She is imprisoned at the age of 23 by her cousin Elizabeth Tudor, the English Queen and her arch adversary. Nineteen years later the life of Mary is to be ended on the scaffold and with her execution the last threat to Elizabeth''s throne has been removed. The two Queens with their contrasting personalities make a dramatic counterpoint to history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNz2smYRTVGs7NHh34aHh7knVIY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46067'),
  ('586680067540734992', 'Mary''s Land', 2013, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Alexis Martínez, Juan Manuel Cotelo', 'Alexis Martínez, Juan Manuel Cotelo', 'Juan Manuel Cotelo, Lola Falana, Carmen Losa, Clara Cotelo, Amanda Rosa Pérez', null, 'A figure skater seeks wisdom from a local sage to cure her diabetes.', 'A figure skater seeks wisdom from a local sage to cure her diabetes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpYyaRHQPZf1peRpgPNLAMf7B4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238710'),
  ('944723877474614624', 'Maryline', 2017, 'Drama', 'Christophe Beaucarne, Guillaume Gallienne', 'Guillaume Gallienne', 'Adeline D''Hermy, Vanessa Paradis, Alice Pol, Eric Ruf, Xavier Beauvois, Lars Eidinger, Pascale Arbillot, Clotilde Mollet', null, 'A wannabe actress follows her dreams and moves to Paris.', 'A wannabe actress follows her dreams and moves to Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2GfXN8JfH1LAuIcURmw1VzeQSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456162'),
  ('427622472580629643', 'Más bonita que ninguna', 1965, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Luis César Amadori, José Puyol, Alejandro Ulloa', 'Gabriel Peña', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Luigi Giuliani, Gracita Morales, Tomás Blanco, Paquito Cano, Pedro Porcel, José María Caffarel, Jesús Puente', null, 'Roberto (Luigi Giuliani) and Luisa (Rocío Durcal) are a couple but are not as sincere as they should be. She tells him she works at Telefónica when she actually sells cigarettes at "The Green Windmill" cabaret. She''s surprised when she discovers plans for a bachelor party there in honor of Roberto, who is marrying a wealthy heiress. In revenge, Luisa adopts the role of Luisito and faces Roberto in disguise.', 'Roberto (Luigi Giuliani) and Luisa (Rocío Durcal) are a couple but are not as sincere as they should be. She tells him she works at Telefónica when she actually sells cigarettes at "The Green Windmill" cabaret. She''s surprised when she discovers plans for a bachelor party there in honor of Roberto, who is marrying a wealthy heiress. In revenge, Luisa adopts the role of Luisito and faces Roberto in disguise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beyGfHb6kxKZZYafP86bJIZ6SUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383516'),
  ('891936490324056485', 'Más respeto que soy tu madre', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Marcos Carnevale, Eliana Roses, Florencia Orce', 'Christian Basilis, Hernán Casciari', 'Diego Peretti, Florencia Peña, Guillermo Arengo, Ángela Torres, Agustín Battioni, Bruno Giganti, Daniel Campomenosi, Silvina Quintanilla', null, 'Mirta is doing her best to navigate the social and economic crisis pummeling Argentina on the eve of the 21st century, after all, she''s got an unemployed husband, three stressed-out kids, and a drug addict father-in-law to look after. As the crisis promises to boot the family from the middle class, Mirta decides to open a pizzeria that will serve slices with lots of laughs and extra drama.', 'Mirta is doing her best to navigate the social and economic crisis pummeling Argentina on the eve of the 21st century, after all, she''s got an unemployed husband, three stressed-out kids, and a drug addict father-in-law to look after. As the crisis promises to boot the family from the middle class, Mirta decides to open a pizzeria that will serve slices with lots of laughs and extra drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFL9IuEwA35xmG3kSKFEWxWJDaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848763'),
  ('1007502319436500697', 'Masaan', 2015, 'Drama', 'Neeraj Ghaywan, Karuna Dutt, Avinash Arun', 'Varun Grover, Neeraj Ghaywan', 'Richa Chadha, Sanjay Mishra, Vicky Kaushal, Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Vineet Kumar, Pankaj Tripathi, Bhagwan Tiwari, Nikhil Sahni', 'PG-13', 'Four lives intersect along the Ganges: a low caste boy in hopeless love, a daughter ridden with guilt of a sexual encounter ending in a tragedy, a hapless father with fading morality, and a spirited child yearning for a family, long to escape the moral constructs of a small-town.', 'Four lives intersect along the Ganges: a low caste boy in hopeless love, a daughter ridden with guilt of a sexual encounter ending in a tragedy, a hapless father with fading morality, and a spirited child yearning for a family, long to escape the moral constructs of a small-town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgcPR6Weth2yJDo5wBdNqW2TD6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336203'),
  ('86290629119876901', 'Masacre en el río Tula', 1985, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ismael Rodríguez Jr., Fernando Colín', 'Jorge Manrique, Ismael Rodríguez Jr., Ismael Rodríguez', 'Cuitláhuac Rodríguez, Narciso Busquets, Roxana Chávez, Abril Campillo, Carmen Salinas, Gerardo Zepeda, Hugo Stiglitz, Carlos Cámara', null, 'Based on a real event, twelve dead bodies are found in the Tula River, we see the events that lead up to the massacre in a tale of crime, vice, corruption and sleaze.', 'Based on a real event, twelve dead bodies are found in the Tula River, we see the events that lead up to the massacre in a tale of crime, vice, corruption and sleaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlKOCIBlTZz0lKqXpleuJIBtWRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248782'),
  ('341072926501071734', 'Masameer: The Movie', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Malik Nejer', 'Malik Nejer, Abdulaziz Almuzaini', 'Abdulaziz Alshehri, Ibrahim Alkhairallah, Shahad Alahmari, Mazroa Al-Mazroa, Mohammed Sendi, Riyad Al Salhani, Yousef Aldakheel, Malik Nejer', null, 'Danah, a Saudi girl with a passion for artificial intelligence embark on a journey to create good in the world using robotics. Meanwhile, three friends Saad, Saltooh and Kalb hit rock bottom and go on a journey of their own to prove themselves to society by becoming crime fighting superheroes.', 'Danah, a Saudi girl with a passion for artificial intelligence embark on a journey to create good in the world using robotics. Meanwhile, three friends Saad, Saltooh and Kalb hit rock bottom and go on a journey of their own to prove themselves to society by becoming crime fighting superheroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKNvAIGwYzk8sSx8MILQkbRkzur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659676'),
  ('818552857564996773', 'Mascara', 1987, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Patrick Conrad, Gilberto Azevedo, Nathalie Rogoz', 'Hugo Claus, Patrick Conrad, Pierre Drouot', 'Charlotte Rampling, Michael Sarrazin, Derek de Lint, Jappe Claes, Herbert Flack, Harry Cleven, Serge-Henri Valcke, Romy Haag', null, 'A respected police commissioner has a reputation as a opera lover, but by night he also enjoys plunging into the transvestite scene. In addition, he harbors a longing for his very own sister. When he learns that his wife has been murdered, he tries to implicate the set designer who has designs on his sister.', 'A respected police commissioner has a reputation as a opera lover, but by night he also enjoys plunging into the transvestite scene. In addition, he harbors a longing for his very own sister. When he learns that his wife has been murdered, he tries to implicate the set designer who has designs on his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojphGud0hggC2g6wwpQyaLfDPqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200987'),
  ('292835709672565614', 'Mascarades', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pierre Cottereau, Lyes Salem', 'Nathalie Saugeon, Lyes Salem', 'Sarah Reguieg, Rym Takoucht, Merouane Zmirli, Mohamed Bouchaib, Mourad Khen, Lyes Salem, Khaled Benaissa, Fouad Trifi', null, 'Mounir Mekbek lives with his family in a small village in the heart of the Algerian countryside. Very proud and sure of himself, he has only one dream- to finally be appreciated by his fellow villagers. Screwing up his carefully maintained image is his headstrong, narcoleptic sister Rym who falls asleep anywhere and whom the village is convinced will end up a spinster. One evening, Mounir returns from town drunk and announces that he''s found a suitor for his sister. The fake story snowballs and snowballs until the suitor morphs into a rich, blonde Australian. The village begins preparing for the wedding in earnest - but without a bridegroom in sight.', 'Mounir Mekbek lives with his family in a small village in the heart of the Algerian countryside. Very proud and sure of himself, he has only one dream- to finally be appreciated by his fellow villagers. Screwing up his carefully maintained image is his headstrong, narcoleptic sister Rym who falls asleep anywhere and whom the village is convinced will end up a spinster. One evening, Mounir returns from town drunk and announces that he''s found a suitor for his sister. The fake story snowballs and snowballs until the suitor morphs into a rich, blonde Australian. The village begins preparing for the wedding in earnest - but without a bridegroom in sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFIt2Yis53RuPiiTtyGzSM1yHsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64643'),
  ('322246352669719340', 'Mascarpone', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alessandro Guida, Matteo Pilati, Michel-Clement Franco', 'Giuseppe Paternò Raddusa, Alessandro Guida, Matteo Pilati', 'Giancarlo Commare, Eduardo Valdarnini, Gianmarco Saurino, Michela Giraud, Lorenzo Adorni, Carlo Calderone, Vittorio Magazzù, Barbara Chichiarelli', null, 'Antonio is a 30 year old family man, whose life finds an unexpected twist when he''s suddenly dumped by his husband, whom he depends both psychologically and economically: he needs to find a new place to stay, a job and a new purpose in life. Antonio finds a room in an apartment owned by Denis and starts to work in a bakery owned by Luca, while attending pastry school. Through this process he discovers that it was wrong of him to give up his independence for the sake of his relationship in the past.', 'Antonio is a 30 year old family man, whose life finds an unexpected twist when he''s suddenly dumped by his husband, whom he depends both psychologically and economically: he needs to find a new place to stay, a job and a new purpose in life. Antonio finds a room in an apartment owned by Denis and starts to work in a bakery owned by Luca, while attending pastry school. Through this process he discovers that it was wrong of him to give up his independence for the sake of his relationship in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n1qEqPMcxRzE383b7fcHysizwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826353'),
  ('1023570509640720622', 'Mascarpone: The Rainbow Cake', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alessandro Guida', 'Gaia Marianna Musacchio, Giuseppe Paternò Raddusa, Alessandro Guida', 'Giancarlo Commare, Gianmarco Saurino, Michela Giraud, Andrea Fuorto, Francesco Gheghi, Mirko Trovato, Giulio Corso, Nicole Rossi', null, 'Three years have passed, Antonio and Luca are seeing each other for the first time since Denis''s death. Luca, who has hit rock bottom after the death of his friend, was lucky enough to meet Tancredi, his current boyfriend, ...while Antonio has focused on his work, so much so that he is now a well-known chef in a pastry shop. It is clear that there is still a special relationship between the two, but Antonio mistakes Luca''s affection for something more and does everything he can to ruin his relationship with Tancredi, even though Cristina does not approve of his behavior. Will Antonio learn to leave the past behind in order to fully experience what the future has to offer him?', 'Three years have passed, Antonio and Luca are seeing each other for the first time since Denis''s death. Luca, who has hit rock bottom after the death of his friend, was lucky enough to meet Tancredi, his current boyfriend, ...while Antonio has focused on his work, so much so that he is now a well-known chef in a pastry shop. It is clear that there is still a special relationship between the two, but Antonio mistakes Luca''s affection for something more and does everything he can to ruin his relationship with Tancredi, even though Cristina does not approve of his behavior. Will Antonio learn to leave the past behind in order to fully experience what the future has to offer him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mg11CIXKEPu5US71jXZlUcSGaR5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1224447'),
  ('291331532616883001', 'Mascots', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Guest, Kris Kachikis, Jody Spilkoman', 'Christopher Guest, Jim Piddock', 'Carrie Aizley, Sarah Baker, Bob Balaban, Ed Begley Jr., Tom Bennett, Maria Blasucci, Jennifer Coolidge, Kerry Godliman', null, 'Eager contestants don big heads and furry suits to vie for the title of World''s Best Mascot.', 'Eager contestants don big heads and furry suits to vie for the title of World''s Best Mascot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1OIQmekcJvaQxtQvyBllZQCzmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368993'),
  ('44237304516166858', 'Masculin Féminin', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'Willy Kurant, Jean-Luc Godard, Jacques Henri Barratier', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Chantal Goya, Marlène Jobert, Michel Debord, Catherine-Isabelle Duport, Evabritt Strandberg, Birger Malmsten, Yves Afonso', 'NR', 'Paul, a young idealist trying to figure out what he wants to do with his life, takes a job interviewing people for a marketing research firm. He moves in with aspiring pop singer Madeleine. Paul, however, is disillusioned by the growing commercialism in society, while Madeleine just wants to be successful. The story is told in a series of 15 unrelated vignettes.', 'Paul, a young idealist trying to figure out what he wants to do with his life, takes a job interviewing people for a marketing research firm. He moves in with aspiring pop singer Madeleine. Paul, however, is disillusioned by the growing commercialism in society, while Madeleine just wants to be successful. The story is told in a series of 15 unrelated vignettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AroNQnZiqjJOWf32lLNZUzWlGvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4710'),
  ('160797425965933621', 'Mashenka', 1942, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Yuli Raizman, Yevgeni Andrikanis, Galina Pyshkova', 'Sergey Yermolinsky, Yevgeni Gabrilovich', 'Valentina Karavayeva, Mikhail Kuznetsov, Dariya Pankratova, Vera Altayskaya, Georgi Svetlani, Nikolai Gritsenko, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Viktor Lazarev', null, 'Lovely telegraph operator Masha Stepanova is a sanitary nurse. During a training alarm, she meets a taxi driver Alexei (Alyosha) Solovyov. He reads verses to a girl and invites her to the theater. But at the appointed time, Alyosha doesn''t come, and Mashenka finds him, helps to recover. Young people fell in love with each other, but Alexei was too frivolous, and brings the girl a lot of sorrows and insults. Because of Alexei’s hobby for another girl, Masha breaks up with him. But she will be able to convey her faithful and true-hearted feeling through years of separation and the hardships of wartime, and when they meet again at the front of the Finnish War, Solovyov realizes what a gift of fate was meeting him with this girl.', 'Lovely telegraph operator Masha Stepanova is a sanitary nurse. During a training alarm, she meets a taxi driver Alexei (Alyosha) Solovyov. He reads verses to a girl and invites her to the theater. But at the appointed time, Alyosha doesn''t come, and Mashenka finds him, helps to recover. Young people fell in love with each other, but Alexei was too frivolous, and brings the girl a lot of sorrows and insults. Because of Alexei’s hobby for another girl, Masha breaks up with him. But she will be able to convey her faithful and true-hearted feeling through years of separation and the hardships of wartime, and when they meet again at the front of the Finnish War, Solovyov realizes what a gift of fate was meeting him with this girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNJqKVNAdr0IrQuhpBD7fh2Xe6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158155'),
  ('16566813703763494', 'Mask', 1985, 'Drama', 'László Kovács, Peter Bogdanovich, Lisa Marmon', 'Anna Hamilton Phelan', 'Cher, Sam Elliott, Eric Stoltz, Estelle Getty, Richard Dysart, Laura Dern, Micole Mercurio, Harry Carey, Jr.', 'PG-13', 'A significantly deformed but highly intelligent teenage boy and his biker gang mother attempt to live as normal a life as possible under the circumstances.', 'A significantly deformed but highly intelligent teenage boy and his biker gang mother attempt to live as normal a life as possible under the circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBYzEETDHNyt12VCD5owVW6bpEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11177'),
  ('1042997067015875154', 'Mask Danshi wa Koishitakunai noni', 2023, 'Animation, Romance', 'Naoko Takeichi, Erika Ikeda, Megumi Himeno', 'Fumiyo Sakai', 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Takuya Eguchi', null, 'When Saikawa rips off Keigo’s mask, he sparks unexpected feelings—and a deal: tutoring in exchange for learning to love what’s behind the mask.', 'When Saikawa rips off Keigo’s mask, he sparks unexpected feelings—and a deal: tutoring in exchange for learning to love what’s behind the mask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIFcHOF4jeJGMvYpANxLufz3Ckx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1223906'),
  ('1023791214330387', 'Mask of Death', 1996, 'Thriller, Action', 'Anthony Preston, David Mitchell, David Pelletier', 'R.C. Rossenfier', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Rae Dawn Chong, Billy Dee Williams, Tom Cavanagh, Conrad Dunn, Kevin McNulty, Jerry Wasserman, Tim Henry', 'R', 'While attempting to flee from the FBI, the criminal Frank Dallio kills Detective McKenna''s wife, Rachel. McKenna himself is shot in the face by the professional killer Lyle Mason, who dies in a car crash shortly thereafter. The FBI persuades McKenna to undergo facial surgery and take the place of Lyle Mason in order to find Dallio and a valuable microchip.', 'While attempting to flee from the FBI, the criminal Frank Dallio kills Detective McKenna''s wife, Rachel. McKenna himself is shot in the face by the professional killer Lyle Mason, who dies in a car crash shortly thereafter. The FBI persuades McKenna to undergo facial surgery and take the place of Lyle Mason in order to find Dallio and a valuable microchip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A089bh65EQpzfzkHDGzYkQXnIAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153879'),
  ('678454143936261551', 'Mask of Dust', 1954, 'Drama', 'Terence Fisher, Jack Causey, Walter J. Harvey', 'Richard H. Landau', 'Richard Conte, Mari Aldon, Peter Illing, Alec Mango, James Copeland, George Coulouris, Meredith Edwards, Edwin Richfield', 'NR', 'An idol of auto-racing fans attempts a comeback after serving in the Air Force. When his former rival lies dying in the hospital he must decide whether to continue in the Grand Prix, or make peace with his adversary. Featuring race car greats Stirling Moss, Reg Parnell, John Cooper, Alan Brown, Geoffrey Taylor and Leslie Marr.', 'An idol of auto-racing fans attempts a comeback after serving in the Air Force. When his former rival lies dying in the hospital he must decide whether to continue in the Grand Prix, or make peace with his adversary. Featuring race car greats Stirling Moss, Reg Parnell, John Cooper, Alan Brown, Geoffrey Taylor and Leslie Marr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmBtgOY4KnqNXFVGknyPE00n2xL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124571'),
  ('889784794949779195', 'Mask of Murder', 1985, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Arne Mattsson, Tomislav Pinter', 'Volodja Semitjov', 'Rod Taylor, Valerie Perrine, Christopher Lee, Terrence Hardiman, Heinz Hopf, Lisbeth Zachrisson, Anneli Martini, Hjördis Petterson', null, 'In a Canadian village are women being killed by a psychopath. Chief Rich and Inspector McLane have no clue until McLane shoots a suspicious man. Now the killing seems to have ended, but the killer picks yet another victim...', 'In a Canadian village are women being killed by a psychopath. Chief Rich and Inspector McLane have no clue until McLane shoots a suspicious man. Now the killing seems to have ended, but the killer picks yet another victim...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBudILyexCCQuPRV0Fw0JFKmmQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104621'),
  ('565043871867988029', 'Mask the Kekkou: Reborn', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Nozomu Kasagi', 'Kosuke Komatsu', 'Aino Kishi, Rei Toda, Takanori Suzuka, Keigo Kasuya, Yoshifumi Aoki, Misako Shimizu', null, 'Sparta Academy is the nation''s top prep school, where students with poor grades undergo frightening torture under the school headmaster''s direction. Kekko Kamen makes her appearance at the school in outrageous attire, completely naked except for her red mask, boots and gloves, and attacks the torturing teacher.', 'Sparta Academy is the nation''s top prep school, where students with poor grades undergo frightening torture under the school headmaster''s direction. Kekko Kamen makes her appearance at the school in outrageous attire, completely naked except for her red mask, boots and gloves, and attacks the torturing teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeabJomLyqqJvaep2WEa5HmzIyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344777'),
  ('433771400035366906', 'Maska', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Neeraj Udhwani, Eeshit Narain, Deepa Alimchandani', 'Neeraj Udhwani', 'Manisha Koirala, Prit Kamani, Nikita Dutta, Javed Jaffrey, Shirley Setia, Boman Irani', null, 'Determined to make it in showbiz, an aspiring young actor considers turning his back on the beloved Irani café run by his family for generations.', 'Determined to make it in showbiz, an aspiring young actor considers turning his back on the beloved Irani café run by his family for generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tYTGLcsuxhmBtiKq57yGqh0xQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:686919'),
  ('52727053969362447', 'Masked and Anonymous', 2003, 'Drama, Music', 'Larry Charles, Rogier Stoffers', 'Bob Dylan, Larry Charles', 'Bob Dylan, Jeff Bridges, Penélope Cruz, John Goodman, Jessica Lange, Luke Wilson, Val Kilmer, Angela Bassett', 'PG-13', 'A nation wracked with civil war and social unrest anticipates a giant charity concert, organized by deceptive promoter Uncle Sweetheart, who plans on raking in huge sums for himself from the event. Headlining is legendary musician Jack Fate, whose prison time is cut short with Sweetheart''s help. Meanwhile, journalist Tom Friend investigates the corrupt concert and sets out to unmask the truth to the public.', 'A nation wracked with civil war and social unrest anticipates a giant charity concert, organized by deceptive promoter Uncle Sweetheart, who plans on raking in huge sums for himself from the event. Headlining is legendary musician Jack Fate, whose prison time is cut short with Sweetheart''s help. Meanwhile, journalist Tom Friend investigates the corrupt concert and sets out to unmask the truth to the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKxB2Ivm1717Hbnuvvy2lONC4R1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24356'),
  ('988543789964658456', 'Masked Avengers', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Chiang Sheng, Lo Yuen-Ming', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Phillip Kwok Chui, Chin Siu-Ho, Chiang Sheng, Lu Feng, Chu Ko, Wong Lik, Yu Tai-Ping, Sek Gong', null, 'Philip Kwok plays a repentant killer who vows to destroy the masked gang of which he was a member. A young fighter and his martial arts brothers come to the town to catch the killers, but one of them is not to be trusted!', 'Philip Kwok plays a repentant killer who vows to destroy the masked gang of which he was a member. A young fighter and his martial arts brothers come to the town to catch the killers, but one of them is not to be trusted!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vr54E7RjvMLE4rFgb1NPgZdnpj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63441'),
  ('380502231405636643', 'Masked Mobsters', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ariel Zeitoun, Sébastien Pentecouteau', 'Daniel Saint-Hamont, Laurence Siari', 'Vincent Elbaz, Sami Bouajila, Pascal Elbé, Gilles Lellouche, Clémence Poésy, Grégory Gadebois, Matthieu Boujenah, Gabriella Wright', null, 'From petty theft on the benches of Belleville to the over-publicised hold-ups of the large Parisian banks, this is the spectacular rise of Simon and his gang. They are capable of emptying a series of safes under the very nose of the police who are bewildered by the calm audacity shown by the group.', 'From petty theft on the benches of Belleville to the over-publicised hold-ups of the large Parisian banks, this is the spectacular rise of Simon and his gang. They are capable of emptying a series of safes under the very nose of the police who are bewildered by the calm audacity shown by the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IL1oAu9yzGpqdlwqOGvxpFA5OQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17228'),
  ('1004189727368975145', 'Masked Ward', 2020, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Hisashi Kimura, Takahito Kasai', 'Shota Koyama, Itaru Era', 'Kentaro Sakaguchi, Mei Nagano, Rio Uchida, Noriko Eguchi, Ryohei Otani, Masanobu Takashima, Show Kasamatsu', null, 'On-call substitute doctor Shugo suddenly finds himself faced with a terrifying criminal in a clown mask. The assailant demands that Shugo treat injured high school student Hitomi. The perpetrator sets siege to the building and Shugo finds himself confined with 64 unknown patients.', 'On-call substitute doctor Shugo suddenly finds himself faced with a terrifying criminal in a clown mask. The assailant demands that Shugo treat injured high school student Hitomi. The perpetrator sets siege to the building and Shugo finds himself confined with 64 unknown patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vp34eSLZFqwBklvUHTCmghbGNW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704933'),
  ('674155705665963977', 'Masks', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Andreas Marschall, Enrique Timoteo, Bennet Togler', 'Andreas Marschall', 'Susen Ermich, Julita Witt, Magdalena Ritter, Dieter Rita Scholl, Teresa Nawrot, Norbert Losch, Franziska Breite, Katja Lawrenz', null, 'In the 70s Matteusz Gdula invented an acting method that was supposed to make every actor “shine”. Still, lots of his students die mysteriously and Gdula commits suicide. His method gets banned. Now: Stella, an ambitious, but rather untalented drama student, gets accepted at the „Matteusz Gdula“-school. When she bears witness to some strange occurrences, she gets drawn into the bizarre and deadly web that surrounds the dark secret of the school...', 'In the 70s Matteusz Gdula invented an acting method that was supposed to make every actor “shine”. Still, lots of his students die mysteriously and Gdula commits suicide. His method gets banned. Now: Stella, an ambitious, but rather untalented drama student, gets accepted at the „Matteusz Gdula“-school. When she bears witness to some strange occurrences, she gets drawn into the bizarre and deadly web that surrounds the dark secret of the school...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/it3eQNwjEyeiryJ97YtC8XPJH0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124733'),
  ('906906123642365038', 'Masoom', 1983, 'Drama, Family', 'Shekhar Kapur, Pravin Bhatt', 'Gulzar', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Shabana Azmi, Jugal Hansraj, Urmila Matondkar, Aradhana, Tanuja Samarth, Saeed Jaffrey, Supriya Pathak', null, 'A loving husband and father''s joyful family life is rocked to its core upon the discovery that he has a young son borne from a past extramarital affair.', 'A loving husband and father''s joyful family life is rocked to its core upon the discovery that he has a young son borne from a past extramarital affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2PVNqiTbALVhyQVuqDMROy21Pt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21462'),
  ('529289951065647945', 'Maspalomas', 2025, 'Drama', 'Aitor Arregi, Jose Mari Goenaga, Javier Agirre Erauso', 'Jose Mari Goenaga', 'José Ramón Soroiz, Nagore Aranburu, Kandido Uranga, Zorion Eguileor, Kepa Errasti, Julian Hackenberg, Isaac Dos Santos, Armani Dvyne', null, 'After breaking up with his partner, 76 year-old Vicente leads life the way he likes it in Maspalomas: he spends his days lying in the sun, partying, and looking for pleasure. An unexpected accident obliges him to return to San Sebastián and to the daughter he abandoned years ago. Vicente will have to live in a retirement home where he finds himself driven back into the closet and to conceal a part of himself that he thought was long resolved. In this new environment, Vicente must ask himself if he has enough time left to make his peace with others… and with himself.', 'After breaking up with his partner, 76 year-old Vicente leads life the way he likes it in Maspalomas: he spends his days lying in the sun, partying, and looking for pleasure. An unexpected accident obliges him to return to San Sebastián and to the daughter he abandoned years ago. Vicente will have to live in a retirement home where he finds himself driven back into the closet and to conceal a part of himself that he thought was long resolved. In this new environment, Vicente must ask himself if he has enough time left to make his peace with others… and with himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2g5UBmSaxqwavsDrUGlf4OX2Aj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400214'),
  ('233264860345538117', 'Masque of the Red Death', 1989, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Larry Brand', 'Larry Brand, Daryl Haney', 'Patrick Macnee, Adrian Paul, Clare Hoak, Jeff Osterhage, Tracy Reiner, Maria Ford, Kelly Ann Sabatasso, Daryl Haney', null, 'With a deadly plague ravaging his Renaissance kingdom, Prince Prospero invites his friends to retire to the protection of his castle for ongoing revels, leaving the peasantry to die. But fate is not so easily escaped by the debauched nobility.', 'With a deadly plague ravaging his Renaissance kingdom, Prince Prospero invites his friends to retire to the protection of his castle for ongoing revels, leaving the peasantry to die. But fate is not so easily escaped by the debauched nobility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83s7ML2InDCSkMw8CLpF8PmYfZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30522'),
  ('775630577216277547', 'Masquerade', 1965, 'Comedy, Adventure, Thriller', 'Basil Dearden, Otto Heller, John Peverall', 'Michael Relph, William Goldman', 'Cliff Robertson, Jack Hawkins, Marisa Mell, Michel Piccoli, Bill Fraser, Charles Gray, John Le Mesurier, Felix Aylmer', 'NR', 'The British send an American and a war hero to kidnap and hide an oil-country prince.', 'The British send an American and a war hero to kidnap and hide an oil-country prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n74iYlPohvkk4waaXTpUVDRaonU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2995'),
  ('1127961478175367847', 'Masquerade', 1971, 'Romance, Drama', 'Boštjan Hladnik', 'Vitomil Zupan', 'Igor Galo, Vida Jerman, Miha Baloh, Blanka Jenko, Bojan Setina, Franjo Kumer, Tatjana Vovk', null, 'Banned for over a decade because of its "explicit" sexual situations, when this film was released in Yugoslavia in 1983 the "explicit" scenes had become tame. Other than the notoriety it obtained through censorship, the film has an undistinguished story about the forbidden love affair between the older wife of a sports director and a young athlete.', 'Banned for over a decade because of its "explicit" sexual situations, when this film was released in Yugoslavia in 1983 the "explicit" scenes had become tame. Other than the notoriety it obtained through censorship, the film has an undistinguished story about the forbidden love affair between the older wife of a sports director and a young athlete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc4yu8SSomQrkAlyXNRsP34hEUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80756'),
  ('153156010459043913', 'Masquerade', 1988, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Bob Swaim, David Watkin', 'Dick Wolf', 'Rob Lowe, Meg Tilly, Kim Cattrall, Doug Savant, John Glover, Dana Delany, Bruce Tuthill, Brian Davies', 'R', 'A recently orphaned heiress meets a young racing yacht captain on Long Island. He shows interest in her and, being heiress to $200,000,000, love may not be the reason.', 'A recently orphaned heiress meets a young racing yacht captain on Long Island. He shows interest in her and, being heiress to $200,000,000, love may not be the reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCVrSsjp5Hlb4y96reEKo1nQJ2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41963'),
