  ('381317066430480044', 'Massacre in Rome', 1973, 'Drama, History, War', 'George P. Cosmatos, Luciano Sacripanti, Marcello Gatti', 'Robert Katz, George P. Cosmatos, Lucio De Caro', 'Richard Burton, Marcello Mastroianni, Peter Vaughan, Leo McKern, John Steiner, Anthony Steel, Robert Harris, Anthony Dawson', null, 'In the Nazi occupied city of Rome, an assault on an SS brigade draws retaliation from the military governship. "Massacre in Rome" is the true story of how this partisan attack led to the mass execution of Italian nationals under the orders of SS-Lieutenant Colonel Kappler.', 'In the Nazi occupied city of Rome, an assault on an SS brigade draws retaliation from the military governship. "Massacre in Rome" is the true story of how this partisan attack led to the mass execution of Italian nationals under the orders of SS-Lieutenant Colonel Kappler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7mz1jkufrnEZVBE8GblgYz8W0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61278'),
  ('770569991671858604', 'Massacre Mafia Style', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Duke Mitchell, Peter Milo, Ken Gibb', 'Duke Mitchell', 'Duke Mitchell, Vic Caesar, Louis Zito, Cara Peters, Fred Otash, Jimmy Williams, George Buck Flower, Lorenzo Dardado', null, 'Terror reigns when Mimi, the son of a deported Don, along with his associate Jolly Rizzo wage a bloody war for control of the West Coast underworld, battling hordes of hard-boiled mobsters and deadly black pimps on their rise to the top!', 'Terror reigns when Mimi, the son of a deported Don, along with his associate Jolly Rizzo wage a bloody war for control of the West Coast underworld, battling hordes of hard-boiled mobsters and deadly black pimps on their rise to the top!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/K4taZgu6BSFtlgig6sqGTv0wlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70490'),
  ('846159682630066561', 'Massacre Time', 1966, 'Western, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Lucio Fulci, Giovanni Fago, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Fernando Di Leo', 'Franco Nero, George Hilton, Giuseppe Addobbati, Nino Castelnuovo, Linda Sini, Tom Felleghy, Rina Franchetti, Franco Moruzzi', null, 'In 1866, prospector Tom Corbett returns to his hometown of Laramie, Texas, now under the brutal control of gangster Jason Scott and his violent son, Junior. With his brother Jeff, a struggling drunk cared for by their maid Mercedes, Tom seeks to overthrow the Scotts'' tyrannical rule and restore peace to the town.', 'In 1866, prospector Tom Corbett returns to his hometown of Laramie, Texas, now under the brutal control of gangster Jason Scott and his violent son, Junior. With his brother Jeff, a struggling drunk cared for by their maid Mercedes, Tom seeks to overthrow the Scotts'' tyrannical rule and restore peace to the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vR071DK3PNAkApOTkPW4PPGBdCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40141'),
  ('458682704334966173', 'Massage Parlor Murders', 1973, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Chester Fox, Alex Stevens, Victor Petrashevic', null, 'George Spencer, Sandra Peabody, John Moser, Anne Gaybis, Marlene Kallevig, Theodore Gottlieb, Kathie Fitch, Arlana Blue', 'R', 'A vicious serial killer is stalking the streets of New York City, murdering Times Square massage girls in a variety of brutal ways. It''s up to a rogue detective team to solve the case as the body count continues to rise!', 'A vicious serial killer is stalking the streets of New York City, murdering Times Square massage girls in a variety of brutal ways. It''s up to a rogue detective team to solve the case as the body count continues to rise!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgIC47oXt1LUiAHmnGAMkMVZjF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29547'),
  ('905591377783504275', 'Masseuse', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fred Olen Ray, Gary Graver, Cody Allen', 'Mark Haggard, Steve Armogida', 'Griffin Drew, Tim Abell, Monique Parent, Matt Tanner, Amy Rochelle, Gail Harris, Hoke Howell, John Blyth Barrymore', null, 'Jack is a real scum-bag who is going to marry Kristy. He has a bad habit of sleeping with other women and stealing all of their money. Two weeks before their marriage, Kristy sees Jack having sex with their maid, Rosa. It turns out that he was threatening Rosa into having sex as well as his secretary, Diane. When he goes away on business, Kristy, Rosa, and Diane devise a way to get him back for all of the things he has put them through. They also decide to turn his house into a special massage parlor for a few nights so Kristy can try to make some of the money back that Jack stole from her.', 'Jack is a real scum-bag who is going to marry Kristy. He has a bad habit of sleeping with other women and stealing all of their money. Two weeks before their marriage, Kristy sees Jack having sex with their maid, Rosa. It turns out that he was threatening Rosa into having sex as well as his secretary, Diane. When he goes away on business, Kristy, Rosa, and Diane devise a way to get him back for all of the things he has put them through. They also decide to turn his house into a special massage parlor for a few nights so Kristy can try to make some of the money back that Jack stole from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37cxNiZ5ngy5BfQUKsVcMn04HhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322332'),
  ('714053715977947136', 'Massimo Troisi: Somebody Down There Likes Me', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Mario Martone, Luca Federico, Paolo Carnera', 'Mario Martone, Anna Pavignano', 'Massimo Troisi, Mario Martone, Paolo Sorrentino, Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Anna Pavignano, Fabio Balsamo, Aurora Leone', null, 'The life of a dying young man at the short age of only forty-one after playing the lead in Il postino. He was a brilliant stage actor before becoming an astonishing film director.', 'The life of a dying young man at the short age of only forty-one after playing the lead in Il postino. He was a brilliant stage actor before becoming an astonishing film director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uZtXmlXM098QCJX8n0C8rTzie3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006141'),
