  ('104989170326287989', 'Master', 2022, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Charlotte Hornsby, Max Nadilo, Mariama Diallo', 'Mariama Diallo', 'Regina Hall, Zoë Renee, Amber Gray, Talia Ryder, Talia Balsam, Ella Hunt, Noa Fisher, Kara Young', 'R', 'At an elite New England university built on the site of a Salem-era gallows hill, two black women strive to find their place. Navigating politics and privilege, they encounter increasingly terrifying manifestations of the school''s haunted past… and present.', 'At an elite New England university built on the site of a Salem-era gallows hill, two black women strive to find their place. Navigating politics and privilege, they encounter increasingly terrifying manifestations of the school''s haunted past… and present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxbwRHsQ2v6DQv28ttp7pIx7Utj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680829'),
  ('35743601885993890', 'Master and Commander: The Far Side of the World', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'Peter Weir, Russell Boyd, Kevin Ishioka', 'John Collee, Peter Weir', 'Russell Crowe, Paul Bettany, James D''Arcy, Robert Pugh, David Threlfall, Lee Ingleby, Max Pirkis, Max Benitz', 'PG-13', 'After an abrupt and violent encounter with a French warship inflicts severe damage upon his ship, a captain of the British Royal Navy begins a chase over two oceans to capture or destroy the enemy, though he must weigh his commitment to duty and ferocious pursuit of glory against the safety of his devoted crew, including the ship''s thoughtful surgeon, his best friend.', 'After an abrupt and violent encounter with a French warship inflicts severe damage upon his ship, a captain of the British Royal Navy begins a chase over two oceans to capture or destroy the enemy, though he must weigh his commitment to duty and ferocious pursuit of glory against the safety of his devoted crew, including the ship''s thoughtful surgeon, his best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1cVTQEZYn4nSjZLnFbzLP0j8y2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8619'),
  ('173299540505596137', 'Master Cheng', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jari Mutikainen, Mika Kaurismäki, Mika Purola', 'Hannu Oravisto', 'Tommy Chu Pak-Hong, Anna-Maija Tuokko, Lucas Hsuan, Kari Väänänen, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Paula Miettinen, Hannu Oravisto, Jonne Kaaretkoski', null, 'Cheng, 45, a restaurant owner from China, has travelled with his young son halfway around the world to a remote village in Finland. His wife died recently in an accident, and Cheng wanted to have a break from everything by traveling with his son to see an old Finnish friend who lives on a farm in the countryside of Finland. It’s the most remote place Cheng can imagine with endless forests, thousands of lakes, a country with entire population of one-fifth of Cheng’s home town, Shanghai.', 'Cheng, 45, a restaurant owner from China, has travelled with his young son halfway around the world to a remote village in Finland. His wife died recently in an accident, and Cheng wanted to have a break from everything by traveling with his son to see an old Finnish friend who lives on a farm in the countryside of Finland. It’s the most remote place Cheng can imagine with endless forests, thousands of lakes, a country with entire population of one-fifth of Cheng’s home town, Shanghai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXXvSPZ3noWh4M1vw9MbLk9VSCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524779'),
  ('870729014060838726', 'Master Eder and his Pumuckl', 1982, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Animation', 'Ulrich König, Horst Schier, Béla Ternovszky', 'Ellis Kaut, Ulrich König', 'Gustl Bayrhammer, Hans Clarin, Helga Feddersen, Edith Hancke, Willy Harlander, Carlamaria Heim, Hugo Lindinger, Wolfgang Völz', null, 'The adventures of an old-fashioned master cabinet maker in Munich and the tiny red-haired goblin Pumuckl, who becomes visible to him when he gets stuck to the pot of glue in his workshop. The tiny creature is visible to nobody else and full of mischief, and hilarity ensues as objects are seen moving around and the elderly craftsman seems to be talking to thin air.', 'The adventures of an old-fashioned master cabinet maker in Munich and the tiny red-haired goblin Pumuckl, who becomes visible to him when he gets stuck to the pot of glue in his workshop. The tiny creature is visible to nobody else and full of mischief, and hilarity ensues as objects are seen moving around and the elderly craftsman seems to be talking to thin air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZRPZDdMtRrWLYRxY7SOLffw7XG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12494'),
  ('400865199820360871', 'Master Gardener', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paul Schrader, Alexander Dynan, Eric Scott Williamson', 'Paul Schrader', 'Joel Edgerton, Sigourney Weaver, Quintessa Swindell, Esai Morales, Eduardo Losan, Victoria Hill, Amy Le, Erika Ashley', 'R', 'Narvel Roth is a meticulous horticulturist who is devoted to tending the grounds of a beautiful estate and pandering to his employer, the wealthy dowager Mrs. Haverhill. When she demands that he take on her wayward and troubled niece, it unlocks dark secrets from a buried violent past.', 'Narvel Roth is a meticulous horticulturist who is devoted to tending the grounds of a beautiful estate and pandering to his employer, the wealthy dowager Mrs. Haverhill. When she demands that he take on her wayward and troubled niece, it unlocks dark secrets from a buried violent past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afkyHDaMblwX2F1zJzMrTnPsDUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869612'),
  ('94480614981913180', 'Master Kid', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Liu Zhijiang, Yu Qiao', 'Zhang Ting', 'Bai Wenxian, Yang Li', null, 'The film tells the story of Jigong before he became a Buddha. In Yongning Village at the foot of Chicheng Mountain, in order to make the long-sick mother heal, Li Xiuyuan, wants to become a hero. Despite his good intentions things turn bad, causing a ruckus in the village. After encountering a series of dangerous encounters, Li Xiuyuan learned that he was the reincarnation of the great hero Dragon Slaying Luohan.', 'The film tells the story of Jigong before he became a Buddha. In Yongning Village at the foot of Chicheng Mountain, in order to make the long-sick mother heal, Li Xiuyuan, wants to become a hero. Despite his good intentions things turn bad, causing a ruckus in the village. After encountering a series of dangerous encounters, Li Xiuyuan learned that he was the reincarnation of the great hero Dragon Slaying Luohan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cTYqokoGh0UMiFjVU7mhmydAn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844414'),
  ('474952783986696641', 'Master KIMs', 2007, 'Comedy, Action', 'Park Seong gyun', 'Park Seong gyun', 'Shin Hyun-jun, Choi Sung-kook, Kwon Oh-joong, Oh Seung-hyun, Noh Joo-hyun, Jeong Jun-ha, Lee Han-wi, Park Cheol-min', null, 'The plot is instantly familiar in the great martial arts tradition, being set in a small town which is home to two rival masters, one who practices Taekkyun and the other Kendo, both of who just happen to be called Kim. As well as competing for students, the two are locked in deadly combat for the hand of the local beauty, who seems to be pretty much the only woman in town. Into their conflict comes yet another master Kim, this time a kung fu expert who puts them both to shame with his dizzying skills and suave charm. Eventually, real danger arrives in the form of some unscrupulous land developers, forcing the three to join forces for the greater good.', 'The plot is instantly familiar in the great martial arts tradition, being set in a small town which is home to two rival masters, one who practices Taekkyun and the other Kendo, both of who just happen to be called Kim. As well as competing for students, the two are locked in deadly combat for the hand of the local beauty, who seems to be pretty much the only woman in town. Into their conflict comes yet another master Kim, this time a kung fu expert who puts them both to shame with his dizzying skills and suave charm. Eventually, real danger arrives in the form of some unscrupulous land developers, forcing the three to join forces for the greater good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lt6Az7y0Xu0gxGkCahL76KHSitd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92513'),
  ('278510042613521547', 'Master of the Drunken Fist: Beggar So', 2016, 'Action', 'Guo Jianyong', 'Zhao Heng', 'Cao Jun, Jiang Mingyang, Wang Meiying, Zhao Qiusheng, Yu Yankai, Chen Zhihui, Zhai Xiaoguang', null, 'Due to a conspiracy, the wealthy So Chan loses everything but is saved by the Beggars'' Sect. He learns the long lost martial art - Drunken Fist, to defeat the person who framed him.', 'Due to a conspiracy, the wealthy So Chan loses everything but is saved by the Beggars'' Sect. He learns the long lost martial art - Drunken Fist, to defeat the person who framed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82TPqtDsJObgSRwZpmfzgpgGfEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432937'),
  ('643439673282712183', 'Master of the Flying Guillotine', 1976, 'Fantasy, Action, Drama', 'Jimmy Wang Yu', 'Jimmy Wang Yu', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Doris Lung Chun-Erh, Sham Chin-Bo, Lung Fei, Wong Wing-Sang, Hsueh Han, Lau Kar-Wing, Wong Fei-Lung', 'R', 'A one-armed martial arts master is being stalked by an Imperial assassin, the master of two fighters killed in the previous film. When the One-Armed Boxer is invited to attend a martial arts tournament, his efforts to lay low are unsuccessful, and the assassin soon tracks him down with the help of his three subordinates: a Thai boxer, a yoga master, and a kobojutsu user.', 'A one-armed martial arts master is being stalked by an Imperial assassin, the master of two fighters killed in the previous film. When the One-Armed Boxer is invited to attend a martial arts tournament, his efforts to lay low are unsuccessful, and the assassin soon tracks him down with the help of his three subordinates: a Thai boxer, a yoga master, and a kobojutsu user.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upa8qI25kJrrQHgYz66IO2ccvoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49636'),
  ('582697034799286937', 'Master of the House', 1925, 'Drama', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, George Schnéevoigt', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Johannes Meyer, Astrid Holm, Karin Nellemose, Mathilde Nielsen, Clara Schønfeld, Johannes Nielsen, Petrine Sonne, Vilhelm Petersen', null, 'When a man becomes tyrannical towards his family, the women of the house decide to teach him a lesson in gratitude.', 'When a man becomes tyrannical towards his family, the women of the house decide to teach him a lesson in gratitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRxogRnql0tmHRhuH8XsV1pOSFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55589'),
  ('418783199612133583', 'Master of the Universe', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Marc Bauder', 'Marc Bauder', 'Rainer Voss, Angela Merkel', null, 'He was one of Germany''s leading investment experts with an income of several million Euros per day. Now, he sits on one of the upper floors of an empty bank building in the middle of Frankfurt, overlooking a skyline of glass and steel. And talks. In an extended mix of a monologue and an in-depth interview, which is as frightening as it is fascinating, he shares his inside knowledge from a megalomaniac parallel world where illusions are the market''s hardest currency. Marc Bauder''s ''Master of the Universe'' is based on meticulous research and provides us with geniune insight into the notoriously secretive and self-protective ''universe'' of which our nameless protagonist experiences himself a master. Where other films on the financial meltdown have focused on the epic nature of larger-than-life business, Bauder probes the mentality that made it possible in the first place. A tense drama where psychology meets finance - two things that are more closely linked than you would like to believe.', 'He was one of Germany''s leading investment experts with an income of several million Euros per day. Now, he sits on one of the upper floors of an empty bank building in the middle of Frankfurt, overlooking a skyline of glass and steel. And talks. In an extended mix of a monologue and an in-depth interview, which is as frightening as it is fascinating, he shares his inside knowledge from a megalomaniac parallel world where illusions are the market''s hardest currency. Marc Bauder''s ''Master of the Universe'' is based on meticulous research and provides us with geniune insight into the notoriously secretive and self-protective ''universe'' of which our nameless protagonist experiences himself a master. Where other films on the financial meltdown have focused on the epic nature of larger-than-life business, Bauder probes the mentality that made it possible in the first place. A tense drama where psychology meets finance - two things that are more closely linked than you would like to believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcaxlNmtMDJdyPFCcUmZdjEjYpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246308'),
  ('752816044467717978', 'Master of the World', 1961, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'William Witney, Gilbert Warrenton, Robert Agnew', 'Richard Matheson', 'Vincent Price, Charles Bronson, Mary Webster, Henry Hull, David Frankham, Wally Campo, Vito Scotti, Richard Harrison', 'NR', 'A mad genius tries to bomb the world into peace.', 'A mad genius tries to bomb the world into peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNBXfjC4vj27MYQIlmmqjhqtcll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72693'),
  ('164542778143370014', 'Master Z: Ip Man Legacy', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Seppe Van Grieken, Mak Ho-Pong', 'Edmond Wong Chi-Mun, Chan Tai-Lee', 'Max Zhang, Dave Bautista, Michelle Yeoh, Xing Yu, Liu Yan, Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Tony Jaa, Chrissie Chau Sau-Na', 'NR', 'Following his defeat by Master Ip, Cheung Tin Chi tries to make a life with his young son in Hong Kong, waiting tables at a bar that caters to expats. But it''s not long before the mix of foreigners, money, and triad leaders draw him once again to the fight.', 'Following his defeat by Master Ip, Cheung Tin Chi tries to make a life with his young son in Hong Kong, waiting tables at a bar that caters to expats. But it''s not long before the mix of foreigners, money, and triad leaders draw him once again to the fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VxEvOF7QDovsG6ro9OVyjH07LF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450001'),
  ('735832441427846129', 'Master, a Building in Copacabana', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Eduardo Coutinho', 'Eduardo Coutinho', 'Fernando José, Eduardo Coutinho', null, 'The daily lives and routine of 37 families living in a huge 12-story building in Copacabana, Rio de Janeiro: their drama, aspirations, intimate revelations, loneliness, dreams...', 'The daily lives and routine of 37 families living in a huge 12-story building in Copacabana, Rio de Janeiro: their drama, aspirations, intimate revelations, loneliness, dreams...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3Nf5XD3PjoQoX0z41bNBwOC8Kx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60142'),
  ('271553318748800813', 'Masterminds', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Thriller', 'Roger Christian, Nic Morris', 'Floyd Byars', 'Patrick Stewart, Vincent Kartheiser, Brenda Fricker, Bradley Whitford, Matt Craven, Annabelle Gurwitch, Jon Abrahams, Katie Stuart', 'PG-13', 'A rebellious computer engineering prodigy uses his talent for pranks to outwit the security consultant who has taken the students at his prestigious private school hostage.', 'A rebellious computer engineering prodigy uses his talent for pranks to outwit the security consultant who has taken the students at his prestigious private school hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l14qIp5XNV7AZ7En4xpbRHSDIpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25224'),
  ('1018634365021408782', 'Masterminds', 2016, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Jared Hess, Pete Waterman, Richard L. Fox', 'Chris Bowman, Hubbel Palmer, Emily Spivey', 'Zach Galifianakis, Owen Wilson, Kristen Wiig, Kate McKinnon, Leslie Jones, Jason Sudeikis, Mary Elizabeth Ellis, Ken Marino', 'PG-13', 'A night guard at an armored car company in the Southern U.S. organizes one of the biggest bank heists in American history.', 'A night guard at an armored car company in the Southern U.S. organizes one of the biggest bank heists in American history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CXgye1p8Vr7taDG389QhhHDUZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213681'),
  ('393164906704988352', 'Masters in the Forbidden City', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Han Xiao, Yao Qian', null, 'Shi Liancang, Qi Haonan, Wang Wusheng, Chen Yang, Wang Youliang, Wang Jin, Ji Dongge', null, 'This documentary shines a light on the unsung life stories of restorers of cultural relics working inside the Forbidden City, together with the history of the antiques and the palace, the procedures of restoration and the development of cultural protection.', 'This documentary shines a light on the unsung life stories of restorers of cultural relics working inside the Forbidden City, together with the history of the antiques and the palace, the procedures of restoration and the development of cultural protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDaUkcUXcZkRHsFC0d9RuU4ht6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479702'),
  ('986922880364014211', 'Masters of Menace', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Raskov', 'Tino Insana, Daniel Raskov', 'David Rasche, Catherine Bach, Tino Insana, Lee Ving, David Bowe, Dan Aykroyd, Jim Belushi, John Candy', null, 'When one of their own dies, members of a motorcycle gang travel the country to take home the body of their recently deceased friend. The problem is, they must also outrun a pesky lawyer who is trying to bring the group to justice for breaking their probation.', 'When one of their own dies, members of a motorcycle gang travel the country to take home the body of their recently deceased friend. The problem is, they must also outrun a pesky lawyer who is trying to bring the group to justice for breaking their probation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siWXMgucVPiMdkzikgjf3LYytsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49476'),
  ('243221923075719039', 'Masters of the Universe', 1987, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Gary Goddard, Hanania Baer, Bill Neil', 'David Odell', 'Dolph Lundgren, Frank Langella, Meg Foster, Billy Barty, Jon Cypher, Chelsea Field, Courteney Cox, Robert Duncan McNeill', 'PG', 'When the evil Skeletor finds a mysterious power called the Cosmic Key, he becomes nearly invincible, seizing Castle Grayskull and the surrounding city. The Sorceress is now Skeletor''s prisoner and he begins to drain her life-force as he waits for the moon of Eternia to align with the Great Eye of the Universe which will bestow god-like power upon him. However, courageous warrior He-Man locates the locksmith inventor Gwildor, who created the Key and has another version of it. During a battle, one of the Keys is transported to Earth, where it is found by teenagers Julie and Kevin. Now, both He-Man and Skeletor''s forces arrive on Earth searching for the potent weapon.', 'When the evil Skeletor finds a mysterious power called the Cosmic Key, he becomes nearly invincible, seizing Castle Grayskull and the surrounding city. The Sorceress is now Skeletor''s prisoner and he begins to drain her life-force as he waits for the moon of Eternia to align with the Great Eye of the Universe which will bestow god-like power upon him. However, courageous warrior He-Man locates the locksmith inventor Gwildor, who created the Key and has another version of it. During a battle, one of the Keys is transported to Earth, where it is found by teenagers Julie and Kevin. Now, both He-Man and Skeletor''s forces arrive on Earth searching for the potent weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaUecXFd31V68yOTJPJYaB9YhAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11649'),
  ('690758929388392689', 'Masters of the Universe', 2026, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Travis Knight, Fabian Wagner, Tom Brown', 'Chris Butler, Aaron Nee, Adam Nee', 'Nicholas Galitzine, Camila Mendes, Alison Brie, Idris Elba, Jared Leto, Sam C. Wilson, Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson, Kojo Attah', null, 'After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.', 'After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nm2ianYVp7OXElUZVeeAbNTqBLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454639'),
  ('362310597090060788', 'Masterson of Kansas', 1954, 'Western', 'William Castle, Henry Freulich, Charles S. Gould', 'Douglas Heyes', 'George Montgomery, Nancy Gates, James Griffith, Jean Willes, Benny Rubin, Jay Silverheels, Frank Wilcox, Bruce Cowling', 'NR', 'Western lawman Bat Masterson sets out to prove a man standing trial for murder is innocent.', 'Western lawman Bat Masterson sets out to prove a man standing trial for murder is innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWrObZBt0TPXEB17y6aUv4Rwbem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176465'),
  ('534058277577659703', 'Masthishka Maranam', 2026, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Krishand, Prayag Mukundan', 'Krishand', 'Rajisha Vijayan, Niranjan, Jagadish, Zhinz Shan, Nandhu', 'TV-14', 'Centred on a grieving father who navigates a virtual reality memory game in an attempt to reconnect with his lost child.', 'Centred on a grieving father who navigates a virtual reality memory game in an attempt to reconnect with his lost child.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvJrDoDEJzx6jF71dvocT3bgCzFB.jpg', 'plex:movie:masthishka-maranam-2026'),
  ('576350680732135352', 'Masti', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Indra Kumar, Mazhar Kamran', 'Milap Zaveri, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Vivek Oberoi, Aftab Shivdasani, Riteish Deshmukh, Amrita Rao, Genelia D''Souza, Tara Sharma, Lara Dutta, Ajay Devgn', null, 'Three henpecked friends try to escape their unhappy marriages by seeking out some extramarital fun, only to end up being blackmailed.', 'Three henpecked friends try to escape their unhappy marriages by seeking out some extramarital fun, only to end up being blackmailed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cUfjsn5uCiDiTdkjiEQM2HXYLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76684'),
  ('679048488855786945', 'Mastiii 4', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Milap Zaveri, Sanket Shah, Meet Bros Anjjan', 'Milap Zaveri, Farrukh Dhondy', 'Riteish Deshmukh, Vivek Oberoi, Aftab Shivdasani, Ruhi Singh, Shreya Sharma, Elnaaz Norouzi, Nishant Malkani, Shaad Randhawa', null, 'Three frustrated husbands seek freedom from their dull marriages. A wild idea promises escape and excitement. But what follows is anything but expected.', 'Three frustrated husbands seek freedom from their dull marriages. A wild idea promises escape and excitement. But what follows is anything but expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99rpDOk540UDaCMlJSonpSvQCPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1228827'),
  ('339872793183039826', 'Mastizaade', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Milap Zaveri', null, 'Tusshar Kapoor, Vir Das, Sunny Leone, Shaad Randhawa, Asrani, Sushmita Mukherjee, Suresh Menon, Riteish Deshmukh', null, 'Two womanizing bachelors fall in love with twin sisters who run a sex addiction clinic.', 'Two womanizing bachelors fall in love with twin sisters who run a sex addiction clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5d7A6HJS7d8R2LDb4JG4pS5c5hr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363185'),
  ('494442556171138894', 'Mastropiero que nunca', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Les Luthiers', null, 'Marcos Mundstock, Daniel Rabinovich, Carlos López Puccio, Ernesto Acher, Jorge Maronna, Carlos Núñez Cortés', null, '''Mastropiero que nunca'' was a theatrical humour/music show by Les Luthiers, first performed on Friday 9 September 1977 and last done on Sunday 27 February 1983 (although it was headlining only during 1977 and 1978). It consisted of nine new (never performed previously) live numbers, which ranged from a madrigal to a salsa skit. PROGRAM: 1. Jingle Bass-Pipe (Obertura); 2. La Bella y Graciosa Moza Marchose a Lavar la Ropa; 3. El Asesino Misterioso; 4. Visita a la Universidad de Wildstone; 5. Kathy, la Rrina del Saloon; 6. El Beso de Ariadna; 7. Lazy Daisy; 8. Sonatas para Latín y Piano; 9. Payada de la vaca; 10. Cantata del Adelantado Don Rodrigo Díaz de Carreras, de sus Hazañas en Tierras de Indias, de los Singulares Acontecimientos en que se vió Envuelto, y de cómo se Desenvolvió; 11. El explicado. Two new instruments were introduced during this show: the ''Calephone da Casa'' and the ''Shoephone''.', '''Mastropiero que nunca'' was a theatrical humour/music show by Les Luthiers, first performed on Friday 9 September 1977 and last done on Sunday 27 February 1983 (although it was headlining only during 1977 and 1978). It consisted of nine new (never performed previously) live numbers, which ranged from a madrigal to a salsa skit. PROGRAM: 1. Jingle Bass-Pipe (Obertura); 2. La Bella y Graciosa Moza Marchose a Lavar la Ropa; 3. El Asesino Misterioso; 4. Visita a la Universidad de Wildstone; 5. Kathy, la Rrina del Saloon; 6. El Beso de Ariadna; 7. Lazy Daisy; 8. Sonatas para Latín y Piano; 9. Payada de la vaca; 10. Cantata del Adelantado Don Rodrigo Díaz de Carreras, de sus Hazañas en Tierras de Indias, de los Singulares Acontecimientos en que se vió Envuelto, y de cómo se Desenvolvió; 11. El explicado. Two new instruments were introduced during this show: the ''Calephone da Casa'' and the ''Shoephone''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nwKkA5MolesdeJetF8Xm29f5tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67887'),
  ('908197779640950624', 'Mata Hari', 1931, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'George Fitzmaurice, Douglas Shearer, William H. Daniels', 'Benjamin Glazer, Leo Birinski', 'Greta Garbo, Ramon Novarro, Lionel Barrymore, Lewis Stone, C. Henry Gordon, Karen Morley, Alec B. Francis, Blanche Friderici', 'NR', 'A semi-fictionalized account of the life of Mata Hari, an exotic dancer who was accused of spying for Germany during World War I.', 'A semi-fictionalized account of the life of Mata Hari, an exotic dancer who was accused of spying for Germany during World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HvUY98WbP1HuIFk8W3f1gDLKZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35545'),
  ('253634822098142737', 'Mata Hari', 1985, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Curtis Harrington, David Gurfinkel', 'Joel Ziskin', 'Sylvia Kristel, Christopher Cazenove, Oliver Tobias, Gaye Brown, Gottfried John, William Fox, Vernon Dobtcheff, Anthony Newlands', 'R', 'Based loosely on the real-life story of the World War I spy. The exotic dancer uses her contacts in European high society, along with her seductive charm, to collect military secrets during the war. She successfully plays both sides against each other until at last her deceptions catch up with her.', 'Based loosely on the real-life story of the World War I spy. The exotic dancer uses her contacts in European high society, along with her seductive charm, to collect military secrets during the war. She successfully plays both sides against each other until at last her deceptions catch up with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caGQ9SFwLku7ceIu63bbKYKGkUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70903'),
  ('77375250494769683', 'Mata Hari, Agent H21', 1964, 'Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Jean-Louis Richard, Michel Kelber, Christian de Chalonge', 'François Truffaut, Jean-Louis Richard', 'Jeanne Moreau, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Claude Rich, Henri Garcin, Georges Riquier, Frank Villard, Albert Rémy, Hella Petri', null, 'Ordered to seduce French captain and steal from him classified papers, Mata Hari, an exotic dancer and a spy, instead falls in love with him and blows the cover.', 'Ordered to seduce French captain and steal from him classified papers, Mata Hari, an exotic dancer and a spy, instead falls in love with him and blows the cover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oemw4xFK8yTeGNwXpFVbRrqU21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186783'),
  ('580506048608871513', 'Mataharis', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Icíar Bollaín, Kiko de la Rica, Arantza Etxeberría', 'Icíar Bollaín, Tatiana Rodríguez', 'Najwa Nimri, Tristán Ulloa, María Vázquez, Diego Martín, Nuria González, Antonio de la Torre, Fernando Cayo, Manuel Morón', null, 'Private detectives Inés, Eva, and Carmen often invade others'' privacy but are clueless about confronting their own secrets. While on the job, these three surveillance specialists will have to cross the thin line dividing public and private matters, bringing their own issues to light in order to solve more than just their professional cases.', 'Private detectives Inés, Eva, and Carmen often invade others'' privacy but are clueless about confronting their own secrets. While on the job, these three surveillance specialists will have to cross the thin line dividing public and private matters, bringing their own issues to light in order to solve more than just their professional cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw1MZNCvuvzQaXRmmNBC4fNhpyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34985'),
  ('1086826275192133530', 'Matalo! (Kill Him)', 1970, 'Thriller, Western, Action, Drama', 'Cesare Canevari', 'Eduardo Manzanos, Mino Roli, Nico Ducci', 'Corrado Pani, Lou Castel, Claudia Gravy, Luis Dávila, Miguel del Castillo, Ana María Noé, Mirella Pamphili, Ana María Mendoza', null, 'A gang of cattle thieves rescue a criminal from the gallows, and later rob a stagecoach loaded with gold. When they get the loot, he is betrayed and left dying in the middle of the desert. In the escape they reach a mysterious ghost town, where they perceive there is something strange about ...', 'A gang of cattle thieves rescue a criminal from the gallows, and later rob a stagecoach loaded with gold. When they get the loot, he is betrayed and left dying in the middle of the desert. In the escape they reach a mysterious ghost town, where they perceive there is something strange about ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26UekrPFeZ2r9IQvwSeGr380S1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92690'),
  ('579951673428009651', 'Matango', 1963, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Koji Kajita', 'Takeshi Kimura', 'Akira Kubo, Kumi Mizuno, Hiroshi Koizumi, Kenji Sahara, Hiroshi Tachikawa, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Miki Yashiro, Takuzō Kumagai', null, 'Five vacationers and two crewmen become stranded on a tropical island near the equator. The island has little edible food for them to use as they try to live in a fungus covered hulk while repairing Kessei''s yacht. Eventually they struggle over the food rations which were left behind by the former crew. Soon they discover something unfriendly there...', 'Five vacationers and two crewmen become stranded on a tropical island near the equator. The island has little edible food for them to use as they try to live in a fungus covered hulk while repairing Kessei''s yacht. Eventually they struggle over the food rations which were left behind by the former crew. Soon they discover something unfriendly there...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfUJ1XO15yWz6U2N7vmubJS9aX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52302'),
  ('210343936572343886', 'Match', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen Belber, Luke Geissbühler', 'Stephen Belber', 'Patrick Stewart, Carla Gugino, Matthew Lillard, Maduka Steady, Jamie Tirelli, Daphne Fernberger, Geoffrey Nauffts, Gregory Korostishevsky', null, 'A Seattle couple travel to New York to interview colorful former dancer Tobi for research on a dissertation about dance. But soon, common niceties and social graces erode when the questions turn personal and the true nature of the interview is called into question.', 'A Seattle couple travel to New York to interview colorful former dancer Tobi for research on a dissertation about dance. But soon, common niceties and social graces erode when the questions turn personal and the true nature of the interview is called into question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DpIWptBtqyeZD1mNS25N1XeZgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261036'),
  ('722282868098845039', 'Match', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Danishka Esterhazy, Alex Lee', 'Al Kaplan, Jon Kaplan', 'Humberly González, Shaeane Jimenez, Dianne Simpson, Jacques Adriaanse, Luke Volker, Nikita Faber, Dean Goldblum, Peter Butler', null, 'After Paola is matched with a handsome online suitor, she arrives for a first date to discover a house full of dark and terrifying secrets.', 'After Paola is matched with a handsome online suitor, she arrives for a first date to discover a house full of dark and terrifying secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCJGLANqs90OZcaUkAClhBLyoDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1554419'),
  ('872733628728351911', 'Match Made in Mistletoe', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family, Drama', 'Adrian Langley, Ryan Knight', 'Jenny Miller, Jennifer Edwards', 'Damon Runyan, Natalie Lisinska, Madeline Leon, Kathleen Laskey, Tessa Kozma, Jill Frappier, Nneka Elliott, Alex Harrouch', 'PG', 'When talented interior designer Emily Barnes is hired by a foreign embassy in D.C. to decorate for their annual holiday charity ball, the newly appointed ambassador Magnus Andersson''s "minimalist" approach creates a roadblock between them. As Emily''s undeniable love for the holiday season begins to thaw his heart, an unexpected romance begins between the two.', 'When talented interior designer Emily Barnes is hired by a foreign embassy in D.C. to decorate for their annual holiday charity ball, the newly appointed ambassador Magnus Andersson''s "minimalist" approach creates a roadblock between them. As Emily''s undeniable love for the holiday season begins to thaw his heart, an unexpected romance begins between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtvAdXFVJy1DAxenFIC72B9Hjx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854199'),
  ('102356271973098890', 'Match Point', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Remi Adefarasin, Woody Allen, Richard Goodwin', 'Woody Allen', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Scarlett Johansson, Emily Mortimer, Matthew Goode, Brian Cox, Penelope Wilton, James Nesbitt, Ewen Bremner', 'R', 'Chris, a former tennis pro, takes a job as an instructor and befriends his wealthy young student, Tom. After being introduced to his family, Chris is soon engaged to Tom''s sister, Chloe. Despite the professional and financial advantages that this relationship affords him, Chris becomes obsessed with Tom''s fiancee, American actress Nola.', 'Chris, a former tennis pro, takes a job as an instructor and befriends his wealthy young student, Tom. After being introduced to his family, Chris is soon engaged to Tom''s sister, Chloe. Despite the professional and financial advantages that this relationship affords him, Chris becomes obsessed with Tom''s fiancee, American actress Nola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHjEVTD8ucuwKSFOZJeyAnTZYli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116'),
  ('47911312903549397', 'Matchbox', 2003, 'Drama', 'Yannis Economides, Stelios Zogopoulos', 'Lenia Spiropoulou, Yannis Economides', 'Errikos Litsis, Eleni Kokkidou, Costas Xikominos, Yannis Voulgarakis, Ioanna Ivanoudi, Stavros Yagoulis, Angeliki Papoulia, Serafita Grigoriadou', null, 'Dimitris, a grumpy middle-aged man, is having a hard time with his business partner on a particular decision as to opening a new business; and he''s also having a hell of a time with his family members. He has a really short temper, and the unpleasant behaviour of his nasty wife and his disrespectful children don''t contribute much to his health.', 'Dimitris, a grumpy middle-aged man, is having a hard time with his business partner on a particular decision as to opening a new business; and he''s also having a hell of a time with his family members. He has a really short temper, and the unpleasant behaviour of his nasty wife and his disrespectful children don''t contribute much to his health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4qO46PThmTqhVKvoxG95HV5FXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47106'),
