  ('545708938309235647', 'Matching Hearts', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Shawn Seifert, Lidia Stante, Daniella Bonan', null, 'Taylor Cole, Ryan Paevey, Donna Benedicto, Osric Chau, Lossen Chambers, Debs Howard, Latonya Williams, Antonio Cayonne', null, 'As Valentine''s Day nears, a matchmaker is tasked by her mentor to find a match for an entrepreneur who believes staying single is the key to success.', 'As Valentine''s Day nears, a matchmaker is tasked by her mentor to find a match for an entrepreneur who believes staying single is the key to success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvQGosiD0rF7bWaI5W39O8s3n5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661332'),
  ('736952854227187989', 'MatchMaker Mysteries: A Fatal Romance', 2020, 'Mystery, TV Movie', 'Terry Ingram, Ron Stannett', 'Marcy Holland', 'Danica McKellar, Victor Webster, Cory Lee, Garrett Black, Rebecca Davis, Dan Payne, Andrew Dunbar, Lara Gilchrist', null, 'When a romance writer is murdered, matchmaker Angie Dove gets entangled in another case…and with Detective Kyle Cooper. Can they read between the lines to find the murderer?', 'When a romance writer is murdered, matchmaker Angie Dove gets entangled in another case…and with Detective Kyle Cooper. Can they read between the lines to find the murderer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AscNWcxorJTjdnLFRyRPkWuOXw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681630'),
  ('524783217786693134', 'MatchMaker Mysteries: The Art of the Kill', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Ron Stannett, Jackie Lind, Catherine Cyran', 'Marcy Holland, Dave Thomas', 'Danica McKellar, Victor Webster, Bruce Boxleitner, Cory Lee, Aliyah O''Brien, Andrew Dunbar, Alisha Ahamed, Jane McGregor', 'PG', 'Angie Dove gets Det. Carter''s attention by stumbling on a murder at an art museum. Angie''s father Nick is on his own case, trying to solve a series of petty thefts at the museum.', 'Angie Dove gets Det. Carter''s attention by stumbling on a murder at an art museum. Angie''s father Nick is on his own case, trying to solve a series of petty thefts at the museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tzpiXAogo7pWUPLe07obKo9tPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799360'),
  ('693595583695545395', 'Matchmaker Santa', 2012, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David S. Cass Sr., Maximo Munzi', 'Joany Kane', 'Lacey Chabert, Adam Mayfield, Nikki Hahn, Elizabeth Ann Bennett, Florence Henderson, Robert Pine, John Ratzenberger, Lin Shaye', null, 'As a little girl, Melanie Hogan wished to find her own prince charming just like her parents found true love. Now an adult, Melanie is running her own bakery and dating a handsome CEO, Justin. Although things seem perfect when Justin asks Melanie to spend the holidays together at his beautiful lake house upstate—and meet his mother. Melanie finds herself spending more time with Justin’s best friend and loyal assistant, Dean, who just might be harboring a secret crush on her. When complications arise that throw Melanie and Dean together over the holiday, will the two realize they''re meant to be?', 'As a little girl, Melanie Hogan wished to find her own prince charming just like her parents found true love. Now an adult, Melanie is running her own bakery and dating a handsome CEO, Justin. Although things seem perfect when Justin asks Melanie to spend the holidays together at his beautiful lake house upstate—and meet his mother. Melanie finds herself spending more time with Justin’s best friend and loyal assistant, Dean, who just might be harboring a secret crush on her. When complications arise that throw Melanie and Dean together over the holiday, will the two realize they''re meant to be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFZa0qzBRpyBJDHesv8oZhz2ut9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144785'),
  ('246116637848117704', 'Matchstick Men', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Ridley Scott, John Mathieson, Daniel R. Jennings', 'Nicholas Griffin, Ted Griffin', 'Nicolas Cage, Sam Rockwell, Alison Lohman, Bruce Altman, Bruce McGill, Jenny O''Hara, Steve Eastin, Beth Grant', 'PG-13', 'A phobic con artist and his protege are on the verge of pulling off a lucrative swindle when the con artist''s teenage daughter arrives unexpectedly.', 'A phobic con artist and his protege are on the verge of pulling off a lucrative swindle when the con artist''s teenage daughter arrives unexpectedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIWQzIoWOvx0piZM0UpiHMhzHWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7270'),
  ('554103499843351986', 'Mater', 2017, 'Drama', 'Diego Poleri, Pablo D''Alo Abba', 'Pablo D''Alo Abba', 'Patricio Aranguren, Marina Bellati, Araceli Dvoskin, Luciana Fuks, Tamara Kiper, Inda Lavalle, Miriam Odorico, Lautaro Perotti', null, 'Mater is a film about the struggle between love and law; about social differences and distances that these generate. And about love, that crosses all, allows all: both good and evil.', 'Mater is a film about the struggle between love and law; about social differences and distances that these generate. And about love, that crosses all, allows all: both good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOF95C50o7cBSQ9m3albGEhOBRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476273'),
  ('1022521606931829408', 'Mater and the Ghostlight', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Horror', 'John Lasseter, Dan Scanlon', null, 'Larry the Cable Guy, Owen Wilson, Bonnie Hunt, Paul Newman, Michael Wallis, Cheech Marin, Paul Dooley, Katherine Helmond', 'G', 'Mater, the rusty but trusty tow truck from Cars, spends a day in Radiator Springs playing scary pranks on his fellow townsfolk. That night at Flo''s V8 Café, the Sheriff tells the story of the legend of the Ghostlight, and as everyone races home Mater is left alone primed for a good old-fashioned scare.', 'Mater, the rusty but trusty tow truck from Cars, spends a day in Radiator Springs playing scary pranks on his fellow townsfolk. That night at Flo''s V8 Café, the Sheriff tells the story of the legend of the Ghostlight, and as everyone races home Mater is left alone primed for a good old-fashioned scare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thZHluscCvT3SCzVckmFszOVVtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13934'),
  ('525986002048071659', 'Mater Private Eye', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery', 'Rob Gibbs', 'Rob Gibbs, Valerie LaPointe, Daniel Chong', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, Lindsey Collins, Elissa Knight, Carol Bach Rita, Torbin Xan Bullock, Josh Cooley, John Cygan', 'G', 'Detective Mater is hot on the trail of a dastardly car-napping! When Tia''s sister goes missing, Mater is the only car she can turn to. With this tow truck on the case, anything can happen.', 'Detective Mater is hot on the trail of a dastardly car-napping! When Tia''s sister goes missing, Mater is the only car she can turn to. With this tow truck on the case, anything can happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy5fx1rJXfJPxNHx0qqdcTYr1Wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148606'),
