  ('617721132007849671', 'Material Girls', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Martha Coolidge, Johnny E. Jensen, Xochi Blymyer', 'John Quaintance, Amy Rardin, Jessica O''Toole', 'Hilary Duff, Haylie Duff, María Conchita Alonso, Anjelica Huston, Lukas Haas, Marcus Coloma, Obba Babatundé, Henry Cho', 'PG', 'Two wealthy sisters, both heiresses to their family''s cosmetics fortune, are given a wake-up call when a scandal and ensuing investigation strip them of their wealth.', 'Two wealthy sisters, both heiresses to their family''s cosmetics fortune, are given a wake-up call when a scandal and ensuing investigation strip them of their wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJaTKE5kP0BQCR2hkltnr8aEpnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10118'),
  ('773275403847416681', 'Materialists', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Celine Song, Shabier Kirchner, Ben Kahn', 'Celine Song', 'Dakota Johnson, Chris Evans, Pedro Pascal, Zoë Winters, Marin Ireland, Dasha Nekrasova, Emmy Wheeler, Louisa Jacobson', 'R', 'A young, ambitious New York City matchmaker finds herself torn between the perfect match and her imperfect ex.', 'A young, ambitious New York City matchmaker finds herself torn between the perfect match and her imperfect ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDo0pNruy0Qgj6BdTyHIR4cxHY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136867'),
  ('717599080859987980', 'Maternal', 2019, 'Drama', 'Inés Vera, Ana Inés Berard, Soledad Rodríguez', 'Maura Delpero', 'Lidiya Liberman, Denise Carrizo, Agustina Malale, Marta Lubos, Livia Fernán, Isabella Cilia, Alan Rivas, Renata Palminiello', null, 'Lu and Fati are teen mums living in a religious shelter in Buenos Aires. Sister Paola arrives there to take her final vows. But the girls’ impending motherhood faces her with a challenging situation.', 'Lu and Fati are teen mums living in a religious shelter in Buenos Aires. Sister Paola arrives there to take her final vows. But the girls’ impending motherhood faces her with a challenging situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4go0AbNNOAcBhbdekhPyeWNe9ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616221'),
  ('246069375752148747', 'Maternal Half-Brothers', 1988, 'Drama', 'Zdravko Šotra', 'Zdravko Šotra', 'Žarko Laušević, Mira Furlan, Slavko Štimac, Goran Višnjić, Sonja Savić, Petar Božović, Dragomir Čumić, Dragan Bjelogrlić', null, 'This story about two maternal half-brothers, a Croat and a Serb. Although they never met, and both lose their loved ones in ethnic clashes, there is a bond between them. Filmed in 1988, it prophetically forsees the war that would engulf former Yugoslavia three years later.', 'This story about two maternal half-brothers, a Croat and a Serb. Although they never met, and both lose their loved ones in ethnic clashes, there is a bond between them. Filmed in 1988, it prophetically forsees the war that would engulf former Yugoslavia three years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6CrQFkyZHG2mQwgSUVvXayFFab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67633'),
  ('487838537421565435', 'Matewan', 1987, 'Drama, History', 'John Sayles, Matia Karrell, Benita Allen', 'John Sayles', 'Chris Cooper, James Earl Jones, Mary McDonnell, Will Oldham, David Strathairn, Ken Jenkins, Kevin Tighe, Gordon Clapp', 'PG-13', 'Filmed in the coal country of West Virginia, "Matewan" celebrates labor organizing in the context of a 1920s work stoppage. Union organizer, Joe Kenehan, a scab named "Few Clothes" Johnson and a sympathetic mayor and police chief heroically fight the power represented by a coal company and Matewan''s vested interests so that justice and workers'' rights need not take a back seat to squalid working conditions, exploitation and the bottom line.', 'Filmed in the coal country of West Virginia, "Matewan" celebrates labor organizing in the context of a 1920s work stoppage. Union organizer, Joe Kenehan, a scab named "Few Clothes" Johnson and a sympathetic mayor and police chief heroically fight the power represented by a coal company and Matewan''s vested interests so that justice and workers'' rights need not take a back seat to squalid working conditions, exploitation and the bottom line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMYqoM60clzYIQriM1wYXXBjU3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24276'),
  ('851911996554392384', 'Mathilde', 2017, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Alexei Uchitel, Kirill Vasilenko, Kristina Uchuvatkina', 'Alexander Terekhov, Michael Katims', 'Michalina Olszańska, Lars Eidinger, Luise Wolfram, Danila Kozlovsky, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Sergey Garmash, Evgeny Mironov, Grigoriy Dobrygin', null, 'It portrays the memories of Matilda Kshesinskaya and her love affair with the last Tsar of Russia, Nicholas II. Matilda, a Polish-born ballerina from the Mariinsky Theatre in St. Petersburg, had a brief and intense romance with Nicholas between 1892 and 1894, before Nicholas married Alexandra Feodorovna and was crowned Tsar after his father''s death. It also explores their relationship, facing societal pressures and interference from Nicholas''s mother, Empress Maria Feodorovna, as well as Matilda''s involvement with other members of the imperial family, the Romanovs, such as Grand Duke Sergei Mikhailovich and Grand Duke Andrei Vladimirovich.', 'It portrays the memories of Matilda Kshesinskaya and her love affair with the last Tsar of Russia, Nicholas II. Matilda, a Polish-born ballerina from the Mariinsky Theatre in St. Petersburg, had a brief and intense romance with Nicholas between 1892 and 1894, before Nicholas married Alexandra Feodorovna and was crowned Tsar after his father''s death. It also explores their relationship, facing societal pressures and interference from Nicholas''s mother, Empress Maria Feodorovna, as well as Matilda''s involvement with other members of the imperial family, the Romanovs, such as Grand Duke Sergei Mikhailovich and Grand Duke Andrei Vladimirovich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFXGRh6zIgX4e9x4ym4C4l5aVLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376540'),
  ('796589924830006976', 'Mathilukal', 1990, 'Romance, Drama', 'Adoor Gopalakrishnan, Mankada Ravi Varma', 'Adoor Gopalakrishnan', 'Mammootty, Murali, Ravi Vallathol, Thilakan, Sreenath, Karamana Janardanan Nair, M R Gopakumar, K. P. A. C. Azeez', null, 'Mathilukal (''Walls'') is a free adaptation of the novelette of the same name, written by the celebrated Malayalam writer, Vaikom Muhammad Basheer. Autobiographical in character, it is set against the background of India’s freedom struggle in the ’40s when he was serving a term of imprisonment in the Trivandrum Central Jail. When the film opens, we see Basheer in a police lock-up, quite at home in the company of a few petty criminals. He has been languishing there for more than a year now without a trial.', 'Mathilukal (''Walls'') is a free adaptation of the novelette of the same name, written by the celebrated Malayalam writer, Vaikom Muhammad Basheer. Autobiographical in character, it is set against the background of India’s freedom struggle in the ’40s when he was serving a term of imprisonment in the Trivandrum Central Jail. When the film opens, we see Basheer in a police lock-up, quite at home in the company of a few petty criminals. He has been languishing there for more than a year now without a trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPZDmGkzOvJSRaHK3LF8Fb7kPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255607'),
  ('262028036467959067', 'Matias and Jeronimo', 2015, 'Drama', 'Pablo Gonzales Galetto, Papu Curotto', 'Andi Nachon', 'Rodrigo Coutinho Da Silva, Gabriel Rost, Regina Lara Do Santos, José Sandoval, Ivan Colunga, Sergio White, Rodrigo Benitez', null, 'Matías and Jerónimo know each other since they were just kids. Their friendship is a mix of fun and desire, but everything changes the night they go to the carnival and they see how a group of thugs beat a gay performer behind the scene.', 'Matías and Jerónimo know each other since they were just kids. Their friendship is a mix of fun and desire, but everything changes the night they go to the carnival and they see how a group of thugs beat a gay performer behind the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mo3eBI5i6wvSS6ozOY3iUAtgWHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424193'),
  ('143385475732168767', 'Matilda', 1996, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Danny DeVito, Stefan Czapsky, Cara Giallanza', 'Nicholas Kazan, Robin Swicord', 'Mara Wilson, Danny DeVito, Rhea Perlman, Embeth Davidtz, Pam Ferris, Paul Reubens, Tracey Walter, Jean Speegle Howard', 'PG', 'Matilda Wormwood is an brilliant and intelligent little girl. Unfortunately, her parents, Harry and Zinnia, fail to see that fact. As time passes, she finally starts school and has a kind teacher, loyal friends, and a terrifying, sadistic headmistress. As she becomes fed up with the constant cruelty, she discovers she has a special gift that she just might be able to use to outwit the unruly adults around her.', 'Matilda Wormwood is an brilliant and intelligent little girl. Unfortunately, her parents, Harry and Zinnia, fail to see that fact. As time passes, she finally starts school and has a kind teacher, loyal friends, and a terrifying, sadistic headmistress. As she becomes fed up with the constant cruelty, she discovers she has a special gift that she just might be able to use to outwit the unruly adults around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYoDpWInsBEVSmWStnRH06ddoyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10830'),
  ('1020748288214826688', 'Matinee', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe Dante, John Hora', 'Charles S. Haas', 'John Goodman, Cathy Moriarty, Simon Fenton, Omri Katz, Lisa Jakub, Kellie Martin, Jesse Lee Soffer, Lucinda Jenney', 'PG', 'A showman introduces a small coastal town to a unique movie experience and capitalizes on the Cuban Missile crisis hysteria with a kitschy horror extravaganza combining film effects, stage props and actors in rubber suits in this salute to the B-movie.', 'A showman introduces a small coastal town to a unique movie experience and capitalizes on the Cuban Missile crisis hysteria with a kitschy horror extravaganza combining film effects, stage props and actors in rubber suits in this salute to the B-movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Hkt61mL0yixpC6ML24R8gDdh8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25389'),
  ('484381292822422277', 'Matinee', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Toyotarô Shigemori, Hideaki Murakami, Hiroshi Nishitani', 'Yumiko Inoue', 'Masaharu Fukuyama, Yuriko Ishida, Yūsuke Iseya, Yuki Sakurai, Haruka Kinami, Jun Fubuki, Yuka Itaya, Ikko Furuya', null, 'Satoshi Makino is a genius classical guitarist. One day, he meets journalist Yoko Komine. They become attracted to each other, but Yoko Komine has a fiancé.', 'Satoshi Makino is a genius classical guitarist. One day, he meets journalist Yoko Komine. They become attracted to each other, but Yoko Komine has a fiancé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF0ih0vEt5rmW9VwnZvYM8rMUAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619585'),
  ('173954658607439620', 'Matinée', 1977, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Adventure', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'Héctor Bonilla, Manuel Ojeda, Rodolfo Chávez Martínez, Armando Martín Martínez, Narciso Busquets, Marilú Elízaga, Farnesio de Bernal, Ernesto Bañuelos', null, 'Jorge and Aarón, two young boys growing up in a quiet town often miss classes to go together to the cinema matinee. One day they are kidnapped by robbers while traveling in a truck. After the disintegration of the band, they begin to participate in the robberies until the adventure turns into something more sinister and dangerous.', 'Jorge and Aarón, two young boys growing up in a quiet town often miss classes to go together to the cinema matinee. One day they are kidnapped by robbers while traveling in a truck. After the disintegration of the band, they begin to participate in the robberies until the adventure turns into something more sinister and dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQGdEB6pc8pD2Ocva5PSymgL1SG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222600'),
  ('997418082753685544', 'Matinee Mouse', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tom Ray, Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, null, 'Tom is chasing Jerry through the back yard. Jerry escapes to a bird house. A bit more chasing. Jerry crashes into the wall. Both decide they''ve had enough, and wave the truce flag; they go to the movies of themselves, which is an excuse for another bargain clip show. The truce doesn''t hold, and eventually the characters on screen stop and take notice.', 'Tom is chasing Jerry through the back yard. Jerry escapes to a bird house. A bit more chasing. Jerry crashes into the wall. Both decide they''ve had enough, and wave the truce flag; they go to the movies of themselves, which is an excuse for another bargain clip show. The truce doesn''t hold, and eventually the characters on screen stop and take notice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abxPcVgCmwBruqyKs7RDbaBsboR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234323'),
  ('979389547891462214', 'Mato Sem Cachorro', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Gigi Soares, Daniel Lentini, Malu Miranda', 'André Pereira', 'Bruno Gagliasso, Leandra Leal, Danilo Gentili, Enrique Díaz, Letícia Isnard, Gabriela Duarte, Rafinha Bastos, Joaquim Lopes', null, 'The day a man almost runs-over a puppy, he meets the love of his life. The couple and their dog live the dream, until she wants out.', 'The day a man almost runs-over a puppy, he meets the love of his life. The couple and their dog live the dream, until she wants out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3smHWlrTpGSZKPj5BiAu11tZ1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224233'),
  ('841286457255055499', 'Matri-Phony', 1942, 'Comedy', 'Harry Edwards', null, 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Vernon Dent, Marjorie Deanne, Bobby Barber, Eddy Chandler, Joe Garcio', 'NR', 'The stooges are potters in ancient Rome during the reign of Emperor Octopus Grabus. When the emperor orders all beautiful red-headed women to be brought before him so he can select a wife, Diana, a pretty red-head, seeks refuge with the stooges. Some soldiers find Diana''s hiding place and they are all brought to the palace where the stooges escape and try to pass of Curly as Diana, having broken the emperor''s glasses. Their ruse fails and they''re caught by the palace guards as they try to escape.', 'The stooges are potters in ancient Rome during the reign of Emperor Octopus Grabus. When the emperor orders all beautiful red-headed women to be brought before him so he can select a wife, Diana, a pretty red-head, seeks refuge with the stooges. Some soldiers find Diana''s hiding place and they are all brought to the palace where the stooges escape and try to pass of Curly as Diana, having broken the emperor''s glasses. Their ruse fails and they''re caught by the palace guards as they try to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRoCANZwnbpuPIRlto3B1y0aMvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116067'),
  ('255153224528083086', 'Matriarch', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Scott Vickers, Doug Inman, Donald Maclean', 'Scott Vickers', 'Charlie Blackwood, Julie Hannan, Scott Vickers, Briony Monroe, Thoren Ferguson, Martin Murphy, Alan Cuthbert, Kris McDowall', 'R', 'A pregnant woman and her husband are taken in by a farmer and his wife after crashing their car in the Scottish countryside. Once inside, they realize their hosts’ daughter is a missing child from the news years earlier. Things take a sinister twist when the farmer and his wife inform the couple they intend to keep their baby once born.', 'A pregnant woman and her husband are taken in by a farmer and his wife after crashing their car in the Scottish countryside. Once inside, they realize their hosts’ daughter is a missing child from the news years earlier. Things take a sinister twist when the farmer and his wife inform the couple they intend to keep their baby once born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQWxzYlqywzxXZ0Njq6XVxnnsDN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560252'),
  ('602762051087318380', 'Matriarch', 2022, 'Horror', 'Ben Steiner, Alan C. McLaughlin', 'Ben Steiner', 'Jemima Rooper, Kate Dickie, Sarah Paul, Nick Haverson, Franc Ashman, Anna Frost, Keith David Bartlett, Kathryn McGarr', 'R', 'Afflicted with a mysterious disease after surviving an overdose, a woman returns to her childhood home to confront her personal demons but instead discovers a real one.', 'Afflicted with a mysterious disease after surviving an overdose, a woman returns to her childhood home to confront her personal demons but instead discovers a real one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyr8okTqsFTUVW3DD1edTMsWc3u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024535'),
