  ('152641566076568663', 'Matrimonio al Sud', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Agostino Castiglioni, Paolo Costella', 'Gianluca Bomprezzi, Paolo Costella', 'Massimo Boldi, Biagio Izzo, Paolo Conticini, Debora Villa, Barbara Tabita, Fatima Trotta, Luca Peracino, Enzo Salvi', null, 'A Milanese businessman is beside himself when his son tells him he''s going to marry the daughter of a pizza maker from Naples.', 'A Milanese businessman is beside himself when his son tells him he''s going to marry the daughter of a pizza maker from Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ad3AOzwpwcBTvq9A5cRUGWAH2sT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368002'),
  ('681387267362432529', 'Matrimonio alle Bahamas', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Claudio Risi, Alessandro Tonda', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Massimo Boldi, Anna Maria Barbera, Enzo Salvi, Bruno Arena, Max Cavallari, Biagio Izzo, Lucrezia Piaggio, Loredana De Nardis', null, 'Getting ready for the wedding that will unite two very different families- the humble Italian taxi driver Cristoforo Colombo and his wife Rosy, and the rich Italian-Americans Alessandro and Patricia Di Giacomo.', 'Getting ready for the wedding that will unite two very different families- the humble Italian taxi driver Cristoforo Colombo and his wife Rosy, and the rich Italian-Americans Alessandro and Patricia Di Giacomo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/947K0bAMHKKh7anZpygSaS9Ha5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77496'),
  ('743407966570503954', 'Matrix', 1973, null, 'James Cagle', null, null, null, '"MATRIX is a flicker film which utilizes 81 still photographs of my wife''s head. It is a film dependent upon variation of intense light changes by calculated combinations of black and white frame alternations with exposure changes. Throughout, the light intensity rises and falls as the head rotates in varying directions within a 360 degree frontal area." — James Cagle', '"MATRIX is a flicker film which utilizes 81 still photographs of my wife''s head. It is a film dependent upon variation of intense light changes by calculated combinations of black and white frame alternations with exposure changes. Throughout, the light intensity rises and falls as the head rotates in varying directions within a 360 degree frontal area." — James Cagle', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frDqG8rmqKUg4HzQ604LZo8VLHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775293'),
  ('570030549349425714', 'Matrix', 1998, null, 'Nicky Hamlyn', null, null, null, 'The film is composed of receding planes in a landscape: a back garden and the houses beyond. The wooden lattice fence, visible in the image, marks the border between enclosed and open, private and public space, and forms both a fulcrum for the work and a formal grid by which the shots are framed and organised.', 'The film is composed of receding planes in a landscape: a back garden and the houses beyond. The wooden lattice fence, visible in the image, marks the border between enclosed and open, private and public space, and forms both a fulcrum for the work and a formal grid by which the shots are framed and organised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfFD10ZqEx2vkxM2yvRZkybsGB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555879'),
  ('889110948258105331', 'Matru Ki Bijlee Ka Mandola', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Rahil Patel, Kartik Vijay', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Abhishek Chaubey', 'Imran Khan, Anushka Sharma, Pankaj Kapur, Shabana Azmi, Arya Babbar, Navneet Nishan, Ranvir Shorey, Lekha Washington', 'PG-13', 'Harry is an industrialist who loves his daughter Bijlee, and the bond they share with Harry''s man friday, Matru. Bijlee''s plan to wed the son of a politician, however, brings twists and turns in the lives of Matru, Bijlee and Mandola.', 'Harry is an industrialist who loves his daughter Bijlee, and the bond they share with Harry''s man friday, Matru. Bijlee''s plan to wed the son of a politician, however, brings twists and turns in the lives of Matru, Bijlee and Mandola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUc4nB4FgGFrwhhFlmUlvspa1RN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139521'),
  ('406815301812666014', 'Matrubhoomi: A Nation Without Women', 2005, 'Drama', 'Manish Jha, Venu', 'Manish Jha', 'Tulip Joshi, Sudhir Pandey, Sushant Singh, Pankaj Jha, Piyush Mishra, Vinamra Pancharia, Deepak Kumar Bandhu, Sanjay Kumar', null, 'A woman, attended by two midwives, is giving birth in a small village in India. When the child''s cry rings, the father bangs on a steel plate to attract the attention of all the villagers, ...', 'A woman, attended by two midwives, is giving birth in a small village in India. When the child''s cry rings, the father bangs on a steel plate to attract the attention of all the villagers, ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cBn5q6mt3wiKM2Etafx6Qn23nY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127763'),
  ('676264344629909825', 'Matt and Mara', 2024, 'Drama', 'Kazik Radwanski, Nikolay Michaylov', 'Kazik Radwanski', 'Deragh Campbell, Matt Johnson, Mounir al Shami, Emma Healey, Avery Nayman, Marlowe Granados, Simon Reynolds, Kinshuk Dhingra', 'NR', 'Mara is a young creative writing professor struggling with problems in her marriage to an experimental musician. One day, she runs into Matt, a charismatic, free-spirited author from her past, when he wanders onto her university campus. Bonded by their shared interests, the two gradually become closer. When Mara’s husband unexpectedly cancels plans to drive her to an out-of-town conference, Matt accompanies Mara on the trip instead. Along the way, the tension surrounding their undefined relationship slowly grows.', 'Mara is a young creative writing professor struggling with problems in her marriage to an experimental musician. One day, she runs into Matt, a charismatic, free-spirited author from her past, when he wanders onto her university campus. Bonded by their shared interests, the two gradually become closer. When Mara’s husband unexpectedly cancels plans to drive her to an out-of-town conference, Matt accompanies Mara on the trip instead. Along the way, the tension surrounding their undefined relationship slowly grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeyNyRSCwgXgRAg9cwoYr4qN1EY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887180'),
  ('287316871804554837', 'Matt Rife: Lucid - A Crowd Work Special', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Erik Griffin', 'Matt Rife', 'Matt Rife', 'R', 'In Netflix''s first-ever crowd work special, Matt Rife gets up close and personal with an unpredictable Charlotte audience to riff on all things dreams.', 'In Netflix''s first-ever crowd work special, Matt Rife gets up close and personal with an unpredictable Charlotte audience to riff on all things dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ObrP6RumYHRRoIiiyY5IaWs9dV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318411'),
  ('377902859393013521', 'Matt Rife: Natural Selection', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Erik Griffin, Jay Lafayette', 'Matt Rife', 'Matt Rife', 'R', 'From his problem with protection crystals to his beef with social media trolls, comedian Matt Rife holds nothing back in this rollicking stand-up special.', 'From his problem with protection crystals to his beef with social media trolls, comedian Matt Rife holds nothing back in this rollicking stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnSCLaB4phSI2B4I3ErUlQ1IGLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195988'),
  ('683179217766856752', 'Matter of Time', 2026, 'Science Fiction', 'Jeremy Snead', 'Jeremy Snead, Zach Smith, Sean Wilkie, Jason Baumgardner, Chris Dowling, Anthony Tyler Quinn, Matt Green', 'Sean Astin, Myles Erlick, Ali Astin, Jamie Alexander, Patrick Britton', 'PG-13', 'Charlie Fleck, a 29-year-old aspiring videogame designer, is given the opportunity of a lifetime with a time-stopping device given to him by his friend, an eccentric Toy shop owner Gibbs.', 'Charlie Fleck, a 29-year-old aspiring videogame designer, is given the opportunity of a lifetime with a time-stopping device given to him by his friend, an eccentric Toy shop owner Gibbs.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F5%2Fgracenote%2F53b56fd4e63aad55b3022f3637c67813.jpg', 'plex:movie:matter-of-time-2026-1'),
  ('189883049726205785', 'Matthew''s Days', 1968, 'Drama', 'Witold Leszczyński, Wanda Jakubowska, Andrzej Kostenko', 'Witold Leszczyński, Wojciech Solarz', 'Franciszek Pieczka, Anna Milewska, Wirgiliusz Gryń, Aleksander Fogiel, Hanna Skarżanka, Małgorzata Braunek, Maria Janiec, Elżbieta Nowacka', null, 'A man who is socially inept and out of touch with the world lives with his sister in a small farmhouse. The overly sensitive man lives off his hard-working sibling, taking odd jobs as he gets them to secure his meager earnings. When he brings home a woodcutter from the forest, the sister and the newcomer fall in love. Terrified over a life without his sister, the man can''t cope.', 'A man who is socially inept and out of touch with the world lives with his sister in a small farmhouse. The overly sensitive man lives off his hard-working sibling, taking odd jobs as he gets them to secure his meager earnings. When he brings home a woodcutter from the forest, the sister and the newcomer fall in love. Terrified over a life without his sister, the man can''t cope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLCcu3AfD7BZdHZKFeU4dg1LDGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198782'),
  ('47982730429945029', 'Matthias & Maxime', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Xavier Dolan, André Turpin', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Gabriel D''Almeida Freitas, Xavier Dolan, Pier-Luc Funk, Samuel Gauthier, Antoine Pilon, Adib Alkhalidey, Micheline Bernard, Anne Dorval', 'NR', 'Two childhood best friends are asked to share a kiss for the purposes of a student short film. Soon, a lingering doubt sets in, confronting both men with their preferences, threatening the brotherhood of their social circle, and, eventually, changing their lives.', 'Two childhood best friends are asked to share a kiss for the purposes of a student short film. Soon, a lingering doubt sets in, confronting both men with their preferences, threatening the brotherhood of their social circle, and, eventually, changing their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3DI3UjYBRqIbO1keUU1Bzn5qG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519141'),
  ('784927400712075247', 'Matti and Sami and the Three Biggest Mistakes in the Universe', 2018, 'Adventure, Family', 'Stefan Westerwelle', 'Ingo Schuenemann, Stefan Westerwelle', 'Mikke Rasch, Nick Holaschke, Sabine Timoteo, Tommi Korpela, Roy Peter Link, Eero Milonoff, Bendix Hansen, Tristan Göbel', null, 'Matti is 11 years old and dreams of a family vacation in his father’s native country, Finland. He manages to get what he wants by telling a whopping lie. But once they get there, Matti, his younger brother Sami and his parents find themselves without a place to stay, no money and no car in the middle of Finnish wilderness. Only a miracle can save them – or Uncle Jussi, who has been struggling to compete with Matti’s father his whole life. This movie based on Salah Naoura’s award-winning children book offers entertainment for people of all ages.', 'Matti is 11 years old and dreams of a family vacation in his father’s native country, Finland. He manages to get what he wants by telling a whopping lie. But once they get there, Matti, his younger brother Sami and his parents find themselves without a place to stay, no money and no car in the middle of Finnish wilderness. Only a miracle can save them – or Uncle Jussi, who has been struggling to compete with Matti’s father his whole life. This movie based on Salah Naoura’s award-winning children book offers entertainment for people of all ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMENCdqKMuLQhRxluVo5rzOHLF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513360'),
  ('458663326889207139', 'Matti: Hell Is for Heroes', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aleksi Mäkelä, Pini Hellstedt, Jouni Mutanen', 'Marko Leino', 'Jasper Pääkkönen, Elina Hietala, Juha Veijonen, Peter Franzén, Elina Knihtilä, Kari Hietalahti, Jope Ruonansuu, Jani Volanen', null, 'Four Olympic gold medals, seven World Championship titles, four World Cup tour championships, and forty six World Cup circuit victories. Once his career as a professional athlete ended however, the other side of his personality emerged into public view in all of its vulgarity. An alcohol dependency, several marriages accompanied by numerous marital problems, petty crime, uncontrolled acts of violence, and greedy hangers-on.', 'Four Olympic gold medals, seven World Championship titles, four World Cup tour championships, and forty six World Cup circuit victories. Once his career as a professional athlete ended however, the other side of his personality emerged into public view in all of its vulgarity. An alcohol dependency, several marriages accompanied by numerous marital problems, petty crime, uncontrolled acts of violence, and greedy hangers-on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UAfy9NDIlenfIjDyBHmsnDiSJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29040'),
  ('627709624952721138', 'Mattie the Goose-Boy', 1977, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Attila Dargay, Irén Henrik', 'József Nepp, Attila Dargay, József Romhányi', 'András Kern, Péter Geszti, László Csákányi, Gábor Agárdy, Antal Farkas, László Csurka, Gellért Raksányi, Sándor Suka', 'PG', 'A young peasant boy stands up to tyranny, aided by his trusting friend - a goose.', 'A young peasant boy stands up to tyranny, aided by his trusting friend - a goose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlmnfwBhlknPMW79iHonFfEXekJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41061'),
