  ('708746959156872509', 'Matusalén', 2024, 'Comedy, Music', 'David Galán Galindo', 'Fernando Hernández Barral, María José Moreno, David Galán Galindo', 'Julián López, Miren Ibarguren, Raúl Cimas, Antonio Resines, María Barranco, Manuel Galiana, Carlos Areces, Adrián Lastra', null, 'The story of a forty-something rapper considered a boy by his parents and a grandfather by his classmates. They send him to the university to change and he changes everyone else. This is Matusalen''s history.', 'The story of a forty-something rapper considered a boy by his parents and a grandfather by his classmates. They send him to the university to change and he changes everyone else. This is Matusalen''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za8c915kuzBi9Y7MDK4J1sTTS02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1074054'),
  ('757278580930598375', 'Mau Mau Maria', 2014, 'Comedy', 'José Alberto Pinheiro, Pedro Negrão', 'Marco Horácio, Marta Gomes', 'Inês Aires Pereira, Diana Chaves, Maria Botelho Moniz, Débora Monteiro, São José Correia, António Raminhos, José Pedro Gomes, Ana Varela', null, 'Three brothers are confronted with an imposing father who avail them the heritage, identity and emotional intelligence: seven weeks is the deadline for each of them find the respect and love of a woman.', 'Three brothers are confronted with an imposing father who avail them the heritage, identity and emotional intelligence: seven weeks is the deadline for each of them find the respect and love of a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o168O5miZpz0c4ZmFnoLy4ozODO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286330'),
  ('406497485566219843', 'Maundy Thursday', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Song Hae-sung, Kang Seung-gi', 'Jang Min-seok, Park Eun-young', 'Lee Na-young, Gang Dong-won, Youn Yuh-jung, Kang Shin-il, Jung Young-sook, Kim Ji-young, Oh Kwang-rok, Kim Bu-seon', null, 'Yu-jeong is suicidal, yet she reluctantly goes to prison for volunteer work. There, she meets a prisoner who is waiting for death penalty. The two quickly fall in love despite their differences, yet they do not have much time.', 'Yu-jeong is suicidal, yet she reluctantly goes to prison for volunteer work. There, she meets a prisoner who is waiting for death penalty. The two quickly fall in love despite their differences, yet they do not have much time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQoVrNNCkplnOIKVvqnkaAYKCvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63963'),
  ('335609419327604329', 'Mauprat', 1926, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Epstein, Albert Duverger', 'Jean Epstein', 'Sandra Milovanoff, Maurice Schutz, Nino Constantini, René Ferté, Halma, Alex Allin, Alexej Bondireff, Luis Buñuel', null, 'Romantic novelist George Sand''s Mauprat as adapted by cinema visionary Jean Epstein. As a child, orphan Bernard de Mauprat was adopted by Tristan, a brigand who brought him up with his biological sons to hate, kill and pillage. Hubert de Mauprat, the elder brother of Tristan, the very incarnation of nobility, and his daughter, the beautiful and intrepid Edmée, undertake to tear wild-eyed Bernard away from his uncle. Still uncouth and rough, Bernard endeavors to wrest the love of Edmée away from her betrothed.', 'Romantic novelist George Sand''s Mauprat as adapted by cinema visionary Jean Epstein. As a child, orphan Bernard de Mauprat was adopted by Tristan, a brigand who brought him up with his biological sons to hate, kill and pillage. Hubert de Mauprat, the elder brother of Tristan, the very incarnation of nobility, and his daughter, the beautiful and intrepid Edmée, undertake to tear wild-eyed Bernard away from his uncle. Still uncouth and rough, Bernard endeavors to wrest the love of Edmée away from her betrothed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnNr2OzjKFhRENUHBHXACqLKx8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189567'),
  ('961875427595434018', 'Maurice', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ivory, Pierre Lhomme, Michael Zimbrich', 'Kit Hesketh-Harvey, James Ivory', 'James Wilby, Hugh Grant, Rupert Graves, Denholm Elliott, Simon Callow, Billie Whitelaw, Barry Foster, Judy Parfitt', 'R', 'After his lover rejects him, Maurice attempts to come to terms with his sexuality within the restrictiveness of Edwardian society.', 'After his lover rejects him, Maurice attempts to come to terms with his sexuality within the restrictiveness of Edwardian society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HhCyxxzoUqEBmVGK25Jq69LhVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26371'),
  ('96834939846211013', 'Maurice''s Bar', 2024, 'Animation', 'Tom Prezman, Tzor Edery', 'Tzor Edery, Tom Prezman', 'Soa De Muse', null, 'In 1942, on a train to nowhere, a former drag queen remembers a night from her past in one of Paris’ first queer bars. Remnants of customer gossip recall this mythic bar and its mysterious Jewish-Algerian owner.', 'In 1942, on a train to nowhere, a former drag queen remembers a night from her past in one of Paris’ first queer bars. Remnants of customer gossip recall this mythic bar and its mysterious Jewish-Algerian owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOdJto0vtZJzMds6frexNJx3AlB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121750'),
  ('632759590107335963', 'Mauricio Meirelles: Generating Chaos', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Diego Pignataro', 'Maurício Meirelles', 'Maurício Meirelles', null, 'He''s mid-30s going on 79, with scathingly funny views on fatherhood, marriage and society. Let Maurício Meirelles give you a tour of his chaotic mind.', 'He''s mid-30s going on 79, with scathingly funny views on fatherhood, marriage and society. Let Maurício Meirelles give you a tour of his chaotic mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMWGpRryYsofDLmqNxzGCfEkgwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693826'),
  ('850465999977750551', 'Mausam', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Pankaj Kapur, Binod Pradhan, Honey Trehan', 'Carl Austin, Pankaj Kapur', 'Shahid Kapoor, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Anupam Kher, Supriya Pathak, Aditi Sharma, Manoj Pahwa, Vaibhav Talwar, Herry Tangiri', null, 'A war, religious conflicts, and misunderstandings create obstacles for a couple of different faiths.', 'A war, religious conflicts, and misunderstandings create obstacles for a couple of different faiths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxk7w6CDQLc1yjkZZCiGdusU0n1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75157'),
  ('625127391926937157', 'Mausoleum', 1983, 'Horror', 'Michael Dugan, Robert Barich', 'Robert Barich, Robert Madero', 'Marjoe Gortner, Bobbie Bresee, Norman Burton, Maurice Sherbanee, LaWanda Page, Laura Hippe, Sheri Mann, Joel Kramer', 'R', 'By way of an unnatural urge during her Mother''s funeral, Susan enters her family''s mausoleum, which unleashes an evil presence to lurk inside of her.', 'By way of an unnatural urge during her Mother''s funeral, Susan enters her family''s mausoleum, which unleashes an evil presence to lurk inside of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja8PGBkwYu347N08iAyR5rs7YZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17923'),
  ('60924991129653951', 'Mauvais Sang', 1986, 'Crime, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Leos Carax, Jean-Yves Escoffier, Ariel Sctrick', 'Leos Carax', 'Juliette Binoche, Denis Lavant, Michel Piccoli, Hans Meyer, Julie Delpy, Carroll Brooks, Hugo Pratt, Mireille Perrier', 'NR', 'Two aging crooks are given two weeks to repay a debt to a woman named The American. They recruit their recently deceased partner''s son to help them break into a laboratory and steal the vaccine against STBO, a sexually transmitted disease that is sweeping the country. It''s spread by having sex without emotional involvement, and most of its victims are teenagers who make love out of curiosity rather than commitment.', 'Two aging crooks are given two weeks to repay a debt to a woman named The American. They recruit their recently deceased partner''s son to help them break into a laboratory and steal the vaccine against STBO, a sexually transmitted disease that is sweeping the country. It''s spread by having sex without emotional involvement, and most of its victims are teenagers who make love out of curiosity rather than commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjUmAFx8Z3E0K1IUpQSyUilL5P9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64131'),
  ('796298811889635637', 'Maverick', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Richard Donner, Vilmos Zsigmond, Andrew M. Flinn', 'William Goldman', 'Mel Gibson, Jodie Foster, James Garner, Graham Greene, Alfred Molina, James Coburn, Dub Taylor, Geoffrey Lewis', 'PG', 'Bret Maverick is a gambler who would rather con someone than fight them, and needs an additional $3k in order to enter a winner-takes-all poker game beginning in a few days. He joins forces with a woman with a marvelous Southern accent, and the two try and enter the game.', 'Bret Maverick is a gambler who would rather con someone than fight them, and needs an additional $3k in order to enter a winner-takes-all poker game beginning in a few days. He joins forces with a woman with a marvelous Southern accent, and the two try and enter the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTVbGGi5PIexmxVzeyFd2RYKwfM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9359'),
  ('558963268084065275', 'Mavi Gözlü Dev', 2007, 'Drama', 'Biket İlhan, Claudio Bolivar', 'Metin Belgin', 'Yetkin Dikinciler, Dolunay Soysert, Uğur Polat, Özge Özberk, Ferit Kaya, Suna Keskin, Rıza Sönmez, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan', null, 'The beloved poet of Turkey, Nazım Hikmet, is featured on the silver screen for the period he spent in prison after 1941. Imprisoned for communist propaganda, Nazım became legendary within the prison walls as his fame grew by word of mouth. A group of friends formed around him, inspired by his poetry and painting. However, the only thing on Nazım Hikmet''s mind was his wife, Piraye. He was very curious about his wife, from whom he had not heard for a long time. As the misery of the war years made itself felt, the devastating news for Nazım was not long in coming. His 28-year prison sentence was confirmed.', 'The beloved poet of Turkey, Nazım Hikmet, is featured on the silver screen for the period he spent in prison after 1941. Imprisoned for communist propaganda, Nazım became legendary within the prison walls as his fame grew by word of mouth. A group of friends formed around him, inspired by his poetry and painting. However, the only thing on Nazım Hikmet''s mind was his wife, Piraye. He was very curious about his wife, from whom he had not heard for a long time. As the misery of the war years made itself felt, the devastating news for Nazım was not long in coming. His 28-year prison sentence was confirmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLHCy8yTyiEDw1RNv7kOe4hZlNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350680'),
  ('709743034640025121', 'Mavka: The Forest Song', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Oleh Malamuzh, Yevhen Yermak, Oleksandra Ruban', 'Yaroslav Voytseshek', 'Natalka Denysenko, Artem Pyvovarov, Nazar Zadniprovskyi, Oleh Skrypka, Olena Kravets, Serhii Prytula, Oleh Mykhailiuta, Nataliia Sumska', 'PG', 'Mavka, a Soul of the Forest, faces an impossible choice between love and her duty as Guardian of the Heart of the Forest when she falls for a human, a talented young musician named Lukas.', 'Mavka, a Soul of the Forest, faces an impossible choice between love and her duty as Guardian of the Heart of the Forest when she falls for a human, a talented young musician named Lukas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeJjd9JU2Mdj9d7nWRFLWlrcExi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459003'),
  ('1023256514586408425', 'Mavka. A Real Myth', 2026, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama, Horror', 'Katya Tsarik, Yurii Korol', 'Yaroslav Voytseshek, Lesia Ukrainka', 'Arina Bocharova, Ivan Dovzhenko, Maksym Nimenko', null, 'Mavka is a dangerous nymph of the forest lake that lure people into its depths for the mermaids to feed on their energy. When she meets Lukian, a biology whizz, Mavka falls in love disrupting the natural order.', 'Mavka is a dangerous nymph of the forest lake that lure people into its depths for the mermaids to feed on their energy. When she meets Lukian, a biology whizz, Mavka falls in love disrupting the natural order.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3fCkTGO8g6d5HQvOx0CKhvRDROe.jpg', 'plex:movie:mavka-the-true-myth'),
  ('861073700070519454', 'Max', 2002, 'War, Drama', 'Menno Meyjes, Lajos Koltai', 'Menno Meyjes', 'John Cusack, Noah Taylor, Leelee Sobieski, Molly Parker, Kevin McKidd, Yuliya Vysotskaya, Peter Capaldi, Ulrich Thomsen', 'R', 'In 1918, a young, disillusioned Adolf Hitler strikes up a friendship with a Jewish art dealer while weighing a life of passion for art vs. talent at politics', 'In 1918, a young, disillusioned Adolf Hitler strikes up a friendship with a Jewish art dealer while weighing a life of passion for art vs. talent at politics', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2zqJWEAqSyPS7VZP0biBdJIpHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13560'),
  ('111465815468726469', 'Max', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stéphanie Murat', 'Thierry Ardisson', 'Mathilde Seigner, JoeyStarr, Shana Castera, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Sylvie Testud, François Berléand, Zinedine Soualem, Dominique Besnehard', null, 'Max is 6 years old. She lives with her dad Toni, a small time crook with a golden heart. For Xmas, Max offers him Rose, a call-girl found on the street whom she’s very fond of. Despite the complicated situation, Toni’s gonna have a hard time refusing her daughter’s «gift» and must coexist with Rose.', 'Max is 6 years old. She lives with her dad Toni, a small time crook with a golden heart. For Xmas, Max offers him Rose, a call-girl found on the street whom she’s very fond of. Despite the complicated situation, Toni’s gonna have a hard time refusing her daughter’s «gift» and must coexist with Rose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qROjXKBxOnuNMGLxWmKz1V92ML4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158423'),
  ('332744451510200170', 'Max', 2015, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Boaz Yakin, Mark Anthony Little, Stefan Czapsky', 'Sheldon Lettich, Boaz Yakin', 'Thomas Haden Church, Josh Wiggins, Lauren Graham, Robbie Amell, Mia Xitlali, Dejon LaQuake, Luke Kleintank, Jay Hernandez', 'PG', 'A dog that helped soldiers in Afghanistan returns to the U.S. and is adopted by his handler''s family after suffering a traumatic experience.', 'A dog that helped soldiers in Afghanistan returns to the U.S. and is adopted by his handler''s family after suffering a traumatic experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3ACos3t4YwXML8keTA0wKN8e36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272878'),
  ('8283604826822703', 'Max & Co', 2007, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama', 'Samuel Guillaume, Frédéric Guillaume, Renato Berta', 'Christine Dory, Emmanuel Salinger', 'Lorànt Deutsch, Virginie Efira, Patrick Bouchitey, Denis Podalydès, Sanseverino, Amélie Lerma', null, '15-year-old Max is in search of his father, the famous troubadour Johnny Bigoude, who disappeared shortly after Max''s birth. He reaches Saint-Hilare where Madam Doudou, the old teacher, takes care of him and finds him a job as elevator musician in the fly swatter factory Bzzz &amp; Co. But the factory doesn''t run well and half of the village gets fired. To boost the swatter sales, a dangerous scientist creates a mass production of flies. Soon, a thick cloud of insects attacks the village... With courage and determination, Max and his new friend Félicie will do their best to neutralize the insane projects of Bzzz&amp;Co. Will they manage to convince the villagers to help them in this adventure? All together will they stop the scientist''s crazy handlings? And will Max find his father?', '15-year-old Max is in search of his father, the famous troubadour Johnny Bigoude, who disappeared shortly after Max''s birth. He reaches Saint-Hilare where Madam Doudou, the old teacher, takes care of him and finds him a job as elevator musician in the fly swatter factory Bzzz &amp; Co. But the factory doesn''t run well and half of the village gets fired. To boost the swatter sales, a dangerous scientist creates a mass production of flies. Soon, a thick cloud of insects attacks the village... With courage and determination, Max and his new friend Félicie will do their best to neutralize the insane projects of Bzzz&amp;Co. Will they manage to convince the villagers to help them in this adventure? All together will they stop the scientist''s crazy handlings? And will Max find his father?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wL17zbHNyvUvtZj0Ji7gd2FioKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67941'),
  ('835713597336731541', 'Max & Jeremie', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Claire Devers, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Teri White', 'Philippe Noiret, Christopher Lambert, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Christine Dejoux, Christophe Odent, Feodor Chaliapin Jr., José Quaglio, Patrick Rocca', null, 'Even among bombers and murderers, there is a social ladder, a hierarchy to climb. Jeremie is a mere bomber who blows up people and places for mobsters in Paris. He may not look it, scruffy lad that he is, but he is a sensitive fellow, and he feels his lowly status keenly. If only he could graduate to the ranks of hitmen, who are honored in his world, perhaps then he would feel more like somebody. He finally gets his chance when he receives instructions to kill the eminent hitman Max, who knows too much to be left alive. Instead of planning a cool and distant hit, Jeremie gets to know his quarry personally and thereby gets entangled in a mass of conflicting allegiances. Max has one more assignment and has asked Jeremie to help him with it. The hero-worshipping boy can''t bring himself to knock of this classy guy. However, just having such an inept apprentice as Jeremie around is enormously dangerous for the soon-to-be-retired killer.', 'Even among bombers and murderers, there is a social ladder, a hierarchy to climb. Jeremie is a mere bomber who blows up people and places for mobsters in Paris. He may not look it, scruffy lad that he is, but he is a sensitive fellow, and he feels his lowly status keenly. If only he could graduate to the ranks of hitmen, who are honored in his world, perhaps then he would feel more like somebody. He finally gets his chance when he receives instructions to kill the eminent hitman Max, who knows too much to be left alive. Instead of planning a cool and distant hit, Jeremie gets to know his quarry personally and thereby gets entangled in a mass of conflicting allegiances. Max has one more assignment and has asked Jeremie to help him with it. The hero-worshipping boy can''t bring himself to knock of this classy guy. However, just having such an inept apprentice as Jeremie around is enormously dangerous for the soon-to-be-retired killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QMrdwcoIlLFbApnTmjfyl11lGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77701'),
  ('46721658105595225', 'Max & Leon', 2016, 'Comedy, War, Adventure', 'Sacha Wiernik, Jonathan Barré', 'Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, David Marsais', 'Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, Bernard Farcy, Dominique Pinon, Julien Pestel, Alice Vial, Nicolas Marié, Christopher Lambert', null, 'In this WW2 epic comedy – in the vein of “La Grande Vadrouille” – our two heroes, Max and Léon, two lazy and partier pals, will try by all possible means to avoid going in the battle zone… This will lead the duo to demented and wild adventures.', 'In this WW2 epic comedy – in the vein of “La Grande Vadrouille” – our two heroes, Max and Léon, two lazy and partier pals, will try by all possible means to avoid going in the battle zone… This will lead the duo to demented and wild adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47qB83tIFr9CuX6RHsTapk0W3Ls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392142'),
  ('532563002755129778', 'Max 2: White House Hero', 2017, 'Family', 'Brian Levant, Jan Kiesser', 'Steven Altiere', 'Zane Austin, Francesca Capaldi, Lochlyn Munro, Andrew Kavadas, Reese Alexander, Carrie Genzel, Bradley Stryker, Kathryn Kirkpatrick', 'PG', 'Max is assigned to the White House while Butch, the secret service dog, is on maternity leave. He meets TJ, a 12 year old boy, who is the President''s son. Due to his father''s high profile, he is trying hard to fit in and lead a normal life. During a state visit by the Russian President and his daughter, Alexandra (Alex), TJ is asked to accompany her, during their stay. TJ befriends Alex, but when they get into trouble, Max comes to the rescue!', 'Max is assigned to the White House while Butch, the secret service dog, is on maternity leave. He meets TJ, a 12 year old boy, who is the President''s son. Due to his father''s high profile, he is trying hard to fit in and lead a normal life. During a state visit by the Russian President and his daughter, Alexandra (Alex), TJ is asked to accompany her, during their stay. TJ befriends Alex, but when they get into trouble, Max comes to the rescue!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roIpyS1wlXFCiunN7WGkKSY3BGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446829'),
  ('63749615121530675', 'Max and His Mother-in-Law', 1911, 'Comedy', 'Lucien Nonguet, Max Linder', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder, Léon Belières, Charles De Rochefort, Gabrielle Lange, Paulette Lorsy, Madame Pâquerette, Jacques Vandenne', null, 'Max and his young bride attempt to enjoy an Alpine honeymoon, despite the presence of her mother.', 'Max and his young bride attempt to enjoy an Alpine honeymoon, despite the presence of her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VDNjxal9S8RMArtJABL39kBPBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130058'),
  ('874904982165205776', 'Max and Me', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Seth Fuller, Claire Andrew', 'Claire Andrew', 'Matthew Erick White, Lily Bleu Andrew, Mathew Odette, Grant Anstine, Melissa Ponzio', null, 'A coming of age story about an awkward teenage boy who falls in love with the girl next door, who he soon discovers passed away the year before from Cystic Fibrosis, and he''s in love...with a ghost.', 'A coming of age story about an awkward teenage boy who falls in love with the girl next door, who he soon discovers passed away the year before from Cystic Fibrosis, and he''s in love...with a ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2G7TbHgLq2bcsVAONXycGV98ew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747827'),
  ('1131169763665893920', 'Max and Moritz Reloaded', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Annette Stefan, Thomas Frydetzki, Jens Harant', 'Thomas Frydetzki', 'Kai Michael Müller, Willi Gerk, Katy Karrenbauer, Antonia Holfelder, Franziska Petri, Anna Hausburg, Roxanne Borski, Sebastian Krumbiegel', null, 'Max and Moritz are two young brothers living an adventurous life of petty crime in Hamburg, Germany. After the two boys steal a car and get into an accident, with the adolescent daughter of a Hamburg Senator sitting in the passenger seat, the two scoundrels are packed up and sent to a boot camp. This military-style camp is run by Axel and Henry, two former East German soldiers who still strongly believe in Communism but are secretly gay lovers. Max and Moritz steal another car...a red Ferrari owned by small-town pimp Murder-Hanne. The nationalistic sadist teaches the boys a painful lesson, but Max and Moritz wouldn’t be Max and Moritz if they let this weekend-fascist get them down... and when they acquire the key to their military school’s ordinance depot, things start to change.', 'Max and Moritz are two young brothers living an adventurous life of petty crime in Hamburg, Germany. After the two boys steal a car and get into an accident, with the adolescent daughter of a Hamburg Senator sitting in the passenger seat, the two scoundrels are packed up and sent to a boot camp. This military-style camp is run by Axel and Henry, two former East German soldiers who still strongly believe in Communism but are secretly gay lovers. Max and Moritz steal another car...a red Ferrari owned by small-town pimp Murder-Hanne. The nationalistic sadist teaches the boys a painful lesson, but Max and Moritz wouldn’t be Max and Moritz if they let this weekend-fascist get them down... and when they acquire the key to their military school’s ordinance depot, things start to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLiuBPsIinmqSSkknknFzLOIjn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57823'),
  ('50038090675892489', 'Max and the Junkmen', 1971, 'Crime, Romance', 'Claude Sautet, René Mathelin, Jean-Claude Sussfeld', 'Claude Néron, Claude Sautet, Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Michel Piccoli, Romy Schneider, Bernard Fresson, François Périer, Georges Wilson, Boby Lapointe, Philippe Léotard, Michel Creton', null, 'A detective decides to go undercover and set up a group of robbers, but he may be getting too caught up in the task at hand.', 'A detective decides to go undercover and set up a group of robbers, but he may be getting too caught up in the task at hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtFINNmvCqR5av2y5aDPS5SlhfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3427'),
  ('89832341967971646', 'Max as a Chiropodist', 1914, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder', null, 'Max Linder, Gabrielle Lange, Georges Gorby, Lucy d''Orbel', null, 'Coming to visit a girl, Max presents himself as a pedicurist.', 'Coming to visit a girl, Max presents himself as a pedicurist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IkpqUpBpCXk4WUVi5qusnaWDdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226910'),
  ('409143227063677323', 'Max Dugan Returns', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Herbert Ross, David M. Walsh, Jack Roe', 'Neil Simon', 'Marsha Mason, Jason Robards, Donald Sutherland, Matthew Broderick, Dody Goodman, Sal Viscuso, Panchito Gómez, Charley Lau', 'PG', 'An English teacher and struggling single mother has her life disrupted when the father who abandoned her as a child comes back into her life.', 'An English teacher and struggling single mother has her life disrupted when the father who abandoned her as a child comes back into her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYOmBIJwliiu43CwWqx79f8Zp8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1793'),
  ('1008391224515236934', 'Max Havelaar: or, The Coffee Auctions of the Dutch Trading Company', 1976, 'Drama, History', 'Fons Rademakers, Jan de Bont, Mochtar Soemodimedjo', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Peter Faber, Sacha Bulthuis, E.M. Adenan Soesilaningrat, Maruli Sitompul, Krijn ter Braak, Carl van der Plas, Rima Melati, Joop Admiraal', null, 'An idealistic Dutch colonial officer posted to Indonesia in the 19th century is cohvinced that he can make the kinds of changes that will actually help the local people he is in charge of, but circumstances soon make him realize just how out of touch he really is, and it doesn''t take long for things to go from bad to worse.', 'An idealistic Dutch colonial officer posted to Indonesia in the 19th century is cohvinced that he can make the kinds of changes that will actually help the local people he is in charge of, but circumstances soon make him realize just how out of touch he really is, and it doesn''t take long for things to go from bad to worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjs6zB6Gi7CogNi6Ihc415CckM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25947'),
  ('579569027173505041', 'Max Headroom: 20 Minutes into the Future', 1985, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Annabel Jankel, Rocky Morton, Phil Meheux', 'Steve Roberts', 'Matt Frewer, Amanda Pays, William Morgan Sheppard, Nickolas Grace, Hilary Tindall, Paul Spurrier, Hilton McRae, George Rossi', null, 'While trying to expose corruption and greed, television reporter Edison Carter discovers that his employer, Network 23, has created a new form of subliminal advertising (termed "blip-verts") that can be fatal to certain viewers.', 'While trying to expose corruption and greed, television reporter Edison Carter discovers that his employer, Network 23, has created a new form of subliminal advertising (termed "blip-verts") that can be fatal to certain viewers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qL2kwjt2Ggt83YBjDhZcmVp3zkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35933'),
