  ('444120431688809675', 'Max Manus: Man of War', 2008, 'History, War, Action, Crime', 'Espen Sandberg, Joachim Rønning, Geir Hartly Andreassen', 'Thomas Nordseth-Tiller', 'Aksel Hennie, Agnes Kittelsen, Nicolai Cleve Broch, Christian Rubeck, Julia Bache-Wiig, Kyrre Haugen Sydness, Eirik Evjen, Knut Joner', null, 'Max Manus is a Norwegian 2008 biographic war film based on the real events of the life of resistance fighter Max Manus (1914–96), after his contribution in the Winter War against the Soviet Union. The story follows Manus through the outbreak of World War II in Norway until peacetime in 1945.', 'Max Manus is a Norwegian 2008 biographic war film based on the real events of the life of resistance fighter Max Manus (1914–96), after his contribution in the Winter War against the Soviet Union. The story follows Manus through the outbreak of World War II in Norway until peacetime in 1945.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9Z7CUGW1Q5L8GdGH3rY5SkU72L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13752'),
  ('272588810770459579', 'Max My Love', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Raoul Coutard', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Anthony Higgins, Charlotte Rampling, Anne-Marie Besse, Victoria Abril, Pierre Étaix, Fabrice Luchini, Diana Quick, Sabine Haudepin', null, 'The wife of a British diplomat in Paris takes a chimpanzee as her lover.', 'The wife of a British diplomat in Paris takes a chimpanzee as her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ht2axTqOFapMRa89J9aky8XiRrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64097'),
  ('643393054483759420', 'Max Payne', 2008, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'John Moore, Jonathan Sela, Jeff J.J. Authors', 'Beau Thorne', 'Mark Wahlberg, Mila Kunis, Beau Bridges, Ludacris, Chris O''Donnell, Donal Logue, Amaury Nolasco, Kate Burton', 'PG-13', 'A DEA agent whose family was slain as part of a conspiracy, and an assassin out to avenge her sister''s death, join forces to solve a series of murders in New York City.', 'A DEA agent whose family was slain as part of a conspiracy, and an assassin out to avenge her sister''s death, join forces to solve a series of murders in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cWnCG5NyXJYARO2hmNqfbbgrMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13051'),
  ('1036123633215669320', 'Max Q: Emergency Landing', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Michael Shapiro', null, 'Billy Campbell, Paget Brewster, Ned Vaughn, Tasha Smith, Denis Arndt, Geoffrey Blake, Christopher John Fields, Kevin McNulty', 'PG-13', 'A shuttle is launched into space to release a new satellite. When an explosion occurs the crew has to think of a way to get back to Earth without atmospheric pressure (max q) crushing the damaged shuttle.', 'A shuttle is launched into space to release a new satellite. When an explosion occurs the crew has to think of a way to get back to Earth without atmospheric pressure (max q) crushing the damaged shuttle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NG3TN8Dcbl1AZ4DBcDOo53piNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306974'),
  ('1097671011116776537', 'Max Reload and the Nether Blasters', 2020, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jeremy Tremp, Scott Conditt, Jeremy Tremp', 'Scott Conditt, Jeremy Tremp', 'Tom Plumley, Joey Morgan, Hassie Harrison, Greg Grunberg, Joseph D. Reitman, Kevin Smith, Wil Wheaton, Lin Shaye', null, 'A small town video game store clerk must go from zero to hero after accidentally unleashing the forces of evil from a cursed Colecovision game.', 'A small town video game store clerk must go from zero to hero after accidentally unleashing the forces of evil from a cursed Colecovision game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82ltslLbMtEz3Gw9qthi09bO7Kw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680267'),
  ('767768388261226274', 'Max Richter''s Sleep', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jacki Moonves, Natalie Johns, Elisha Christian', 'Natalie Johns', 'Max Richter, Yulia Mahr, Grace Davidson, Emily Brausa, Clarice Jensen, Isabel Hagen, Ben Russell, Andrew Tholl', null, 'This is a film for these frenetic times; a meditative respite from the rush and chaos of the modern world. A study of the universal experience of sleep, that unites us all.', 'This is a film for these frenetic times; a meditative respite from the rush and chaos of the modern world. A study of the universal experience of sleep, that unites us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCJ93G2sfYamV5CwTUonEuytWbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649812'),
  ('723036177490143800', 'Max Schmeling', 2010, 'Action, Drama', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann', 'Timo Berndt', 'Henry Maske, Arthur Abraham, Susanne Wuest, Vladimir Weigl, Yoan Pablo Hernández, Detlef Bothe, Christian Kahrmann, Stefan Gebelhoff', null, 'Based on the true story of Max Schmeling. A national hero in the 1930''s when he became World heavyweight champion. He lost favour with the Nazi regime when he lost to a black man, Joe Louis, and is sent to the front in the hope he will be killed in battle.', 'Based on the true story of Max Schmeling. A national hero in the 1930''s when he became World heavyweight champion. He lost favour with the Nazi regime when he lost to a black man, Joe Louis, and is sent to the front in the hope he will be killed in battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk7prsgDDTt7ZMx1IQYkFNOQIVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60479'),
  ('898089123438948778', 'Max Steel', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Scott Hardwick, Stewart Hendler, Brett Pawlak', 'Christopher L. Yost', 'Ben Winchell, Josh Brener, Ana Villafañe, Andy Garcia, Maria Bello, Billy Slaughter, Mike Doyle, Brandon Larracuente', 'PG-13', 'The adventures of teenager Max McGrath and alien companion Steel, who must harness and combine their tremendous new powers to evolve into the turbo-charged superhero Max Steel.', 'The adventures of teenager Max McGrath and alien companion Steel, who must harness and combine their tremendous new powers to evolve into the turbo-charged superhero Max Steel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuEzNLF8yvzd169guYEFisqvy5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286567'),
  ('1098540050578328624', 'Max Steel: Dark Rival', 2007, 'Animation, Action, Family', 'William Lau', 'Steven Melching', 'Brian Drummond, Christian Campbell, Alessandro Juliani, Scott McNeil, Lisa Ann Beley, David Kaye, Elias Toufexis', null, 'Max Steel returns in a new action-packed adventure to face his latest rival: former extreme sports star Troy Winter, the only guy Max could never beat. In a race to recover a mysterious and powerful meteorite of crystal, Troy Winter accidentally becomes a new and dangerous villain named Extroyer. Extroyer has the power to "extract and become", can steal their victims their power and strength. With the help of his team in N-Tek and his powerful vehicles, Max will protect the world and face his darkest rival.', 'Max Steel returns in a new action-packed adventure to face his latest rival: former extreme sports star Troy Winter, the only guy Max could never beat. In a race to recover a mysterious and powerful meteorite of crystal, Troy Winter accidentally becomes a new and dangerous villain named Extroyer. Extroyer has the power to "extract and become", can steal their victims their power and strength. With the help of his team in N-Tek and his powerful vehicles, Max will protect the world and face his darkest rival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hugqSXuS60624SOLjHiCWfucfJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690278'),
  ('1064508776067768643', 'Max Steel: Endangered Species', 2004, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Sean Frewer, Ben Burden Smith', 'Dean Stefan', 'Christian Campbell, Alessandro Juliani, Kathleen Barr, Scott McNeil', 'PG', 'More powerful than any human, Max Steel is more radical than ever in his first movie "Endangered Species". Along with his friends Kat and Berto, Max Steel will have to face his greatest enemies, Bio-Constrictor and Psycho, who want to genetically modify animals and terrorize the world.', 'More powerful than any human, Max Steel is more radical than ever in his first movie "Endangered Species". Along with his friends Kat and Berto, Max Steel will have to face his greatest enemies, Bio-Constrictor and Psycho, who want to genetically modify animals and terrorize the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTQ12xGHfDbCVBBobsFNO5HdOMX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498437'),
  ('242013041793325521', 'Max Takes a Bath', 1911, 'Comedy', 'Lucien Nonguet', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder', null, 'On doctor''s orders Max buys a new bathtub, but Max struggles to fill it, and when he does, he can''t bathe in peace!', 'On doctor''s orders Max buys a new bathtub, but Max struggles to fill it, and when he does, he can''t bathe in peace!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7Of1HgZUlfoQ8kABDWw2TXptUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188934'),
  ('488241448294269375', 'Max Takes Back His Freedom', 1912, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder, Delphine Renot, Jane Renouardt', null, '"Max quarrels so with his wife that the lady leaves him. Our hero then attempts to do his own cooking, etc. He buys a fowl, but it proves to be still alive, and after he has chased it with a revolver, partly plucked it, shaved and finally half-roasted it, the bird is still alive and wings its way off. Max next turns his attention to blacking his boots, upsets the liquid blacking, spoons it up, and a minute later is using the same spoon to stir the broth. He writes for his wife to return home, but soon after sending the letter hears he is heir to a large fortune, and lives in the seventh heaven of delight - until his wife returns." (The Bioscope, Feb. 15, 1912)', '"Max quarrels so with his wife that the lady leaves him. Our hero then attempts to do his own cooking, etc. He buys a fowl, but it proves to be still alive, and after he has chased it with a revolver, partly plucked it, shaved and finally half-roasted it, the bird is still alive and wings its way off. Max next turns his attention to blacking his boots, upsets the liquid blacking, spoons it up, and a minute later is using the same spoon to stir the broth. He writes for his wife to return home, but soon after sending the letter hears he is heir to a large fortune, and lives in the seventh heaven of delight - until his wife returns." (The Bioscope, Feb. 15, 1912)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ADpGnHWJ6RWh6sgs0iuXj755mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127104'),
  ('1070399102401417901', 'Max Takes Tonics', 1911, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder', 'Maurice Delamare', 'Max Linder, Georges Coquet, Lucy d''Orbel, Maurice Delamare, Georges Gorby, Gabrielle Lange, Paulette Lorsy, Jacques Vandenne', null, 'Max visits a doctor who prescribes a tonic (Bordeaux of Cinchona) for him to drink every morning. Upon returning home, Max sees a large glass which was left by his wife and labeled "Souvenir de Bordeaux". He consumes it its entirety after assuming that it was his medicine. Immediately Max feels much better. Hilarity ensues as Max goes about the day in a completely drunken state.', 'Max visits a doctor who prescribes a tonic (Bordeaux of Cinchona) for him to drink every morning. Upon returning home, Max sees a large glass which was left by his wife and labeled "Souvenir de Bordeaux". He consumes it its entirety after assuming that it was his medicine. Immediately Max feels much better. Hilarity ensues as Max goes about the day in a completely drunken state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qalkRPrRBWoNzsLAoCeRx1yGYRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130044'),
  ('824481871120505665', 'Max und die wilde 7', 2020, 'Family, Adventure, Crime', 'Andreas Löv, Winfried Oelsner, Christian Becker', 'Lisa-Marie Dickreiter', 'Jona Eisenblätter, Uschi Glas, Thomas Thieme, Günther Maria Halmer, Alwara Höfels, Nina Petri, Roman Knižka, Dieter Schaad', null, 'Nine-year-old Max moves to Geroldseck Castle, together with his mother, who takes up a position as a geriatric nurse there. Apparently a shrewd thief is up to mischief here. His mother is suspected, she is threatened with dismissal. Therefore, together with the three residents of the old people''s home at table no. 7, Max does everything possible to convict the real perpetrator.', 'Nine-year-old Max moves to Geroldseck Castle, together with his mother, who takes up a position as a geriatric nurse there. Apparently a shrewd thief is up to mischief here. His mother is suspected, she is threatened with dismissal. Therefore, together with the three residents of the old people''s home at table no. 7, Max does everything possible to convict the real perpetrator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjiiik2oWsc0XW5EXgA2cR3NlDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629210'),
  ('1115572644221138857', 'Max Winslow and The House of Secrets', 2020, 'Family, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Sean Olson, Paul Ruddy, Isaac Alongi', 'Jeff Wild', 'Sydne Mikelle, Tanner Buchanan, Jason Genao, Emery Kelly, Jade Chynoweth, Tyler Christopher, Anton Starkman, Marina Sirtis', null, 'Five teenagers compete to win a mansion owned by entrepreneur and scientist Atticus Virtue. To win the teens must face-off against a super computer named HAVEN who controls the mansion.', 'Five teenagers compete to win a mansion owned by entrepreneur and scientist Atticus Virtue. To win the teens must face-off against a super computer named HAVEN who controls the mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPF67nMClP8ZUIvHhaOZe5F0V9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596053'),
  ('372433086164233688', 'Max''s First Job', 1910, 'Comedy', 'Louis J. Gasnier, Max Linder', null, 'Max Linder, Georges Monca, Lucien Nonguet, Charles Pathé', null, 'Recommended by a friend of the Ambigu Theatre, Max is summoned to Joinville studios. His first role is that of a husband who comes home late.', 'Recommended by a friend of the Ambigu Theatre, Max is summoned to Joinville studios. His first role is that of a husband who comes home late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duiPyiticdOrSZyhX1WjPmiB6wc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205425'),
  ('836579226534665913', 'Max''s Hat', 1913, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder', null, 'Max has been invited to meet with his in-laws and must dress formally, but each hat he attempts to wear for the occasion gets destroyed.', 'Max has been invited to meet with his in-laws and must dress formally, but each hat he attempts to wear for the occasion gets destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhw3tmroqXWoM5j6gzDZFQUe2LY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191936'),
  ('457196452983192393', 'Max''s Vacation', 1914, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder, Lucy d''Orbel, Georges Gorby, Gaby Morlay', null, 'Max is invited to join his uncle for a holiday, but he hasn''t invited his wife, so he sneaks her in in his suitcase, always hiding her from his uncle...', 'Max is invited to join his uncle for a holiday, but he hasn''t invited his wife, so he sneaks her in in his suitcase, always hiding her from his uncle...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVHfljmsiw6S4ETtdkbKsjfauNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226907'),
  ('1130599459306545438', 'Maxed Out', 2006, 'Documentary', 'James D. Scurlock', 'James D. Scurlock', 'Beth Naef, Mike Hudson, Louis C.K., Richard Shelby, Chris Dodd, Jack Reed', null, 'Maxed Out takes us on a journey deep inside the American debt-style, where everything seems okay as long as the minimum monthly payment arrives on time. Sure, most of us may have that sinking feeling that something isn''t quite right, but we''re told not to worry. After all, there''s always more credit!', 'Maxed Out takes us on a journey deep inside the American debt-style, where everything seems okay as long as the minimum monthly payment arrives on time. Sure, most of us may have that sinking feeling that something isn''t quite right, but we''re told not to worry. After all, there''s always more credit!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiZqlsKTPscUCxUzGiAEC2oimnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33003'),
  ('703994723480873205', 'Maxhumain', 1998, null, 'Carlos Reygadas, Diego Martínez Vignatti', 'Carlos Reygadas', 'Stéphan Brodzky, Sandrine Laroche, Simon Gérard', null, 'A suicidal man recalls life with his mother as a boy.', 'A suicidal man recalls life with his mother as a boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aofYZVJLihOkOiDJaEIP1UsFez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143716'),
  ('1061893482335994610', 'Maxie', 1985, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Paul Aaron, Fred Schuler', 'Patricia Resnick', 'Glenn Close, Mandy Patinkin, Ruth Gordon, Barnard Hughes, Valerie Curtin, Googy Gress, Michael Ensign, Michael Laskin', null, 'When Nick and Jan move into their new apartment in San Francisco, the batty landlady upstairs tells them about a girl who used to live there in the 20''s: a brash young party girl named Maxie, who died in a car crash the morning before her big audition for a Hollywood studio. The trouble is, Maxie, or rather her ghost, hasn''t left the house. Worse, she can take over Jan''s body. And the only way she''s going to leave is if she gets that audition.', 'When Nick and Jan move into their new apartment in San Francisco, the batty landlady upstairs tells them about a girl who used to live there in the 20''s: a brash young party girl named Maxie, who died in a car crash the morning before her big audition for a Hollywood studio. The trouble is, Maxie, or rather her ghost, hasn''t left the house. Worse, she can take over Jan''s body. And the only way she''s going to leave is if she gets that audition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8r4kohTjz3rL7RdLDl2FRsQVHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89300'),
  ('604138357505071941', 'Maximum Conviction', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Keoni Waxman, Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle, Nathan Wilson', 'Richard Beattie', 'Steven Seagal, Steve Austin, Michael Paré, Bren Foster, Aliyah O''Brien, Steph Song, Toby Levins, J.J. Makaro', 'R', 'When former black ops operative Cross and his partner Manning are assigned to decommission an old prison, they must oversee the arrival of two mysterious female prisoners. Before long, an elite force of mercenaries assault the prison in search of the new arrivals. As the true identities of the women are revealed, Cross realizes he''s caught in the middle of something far bigger than he had imagined.', 'When former black ops operative Cross and his partner Manning are assigned to decommission an old prison, they must oversee the arrival of two mysterious female prisoners. Before long, an elite force of mercenaries assault the prison in search of the new arrivals. As the true identities of the women are revealed, Cross realizes he''s caught in the middle of something far bigger than he had imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVzFbz7WTjXTt7c9L41oNeyhc8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118683'),
  ('359771424453953094', 'Maximum Force', 1992, 'Action', 'Joseph Merhi, Scott McAboy, Ken Blakey', 'John Weidner, Ken Lamplugh', 'Sam J. Jones, Sherrie Rose, John Saxon, Jason Lively, Richard Lynch, Mickey Rooney, Sonny Landham, Ken Davitian', null, 'Three renegade cops team up to take on the corrupt chief of police and a crime lords hatchet-man.', 'Three renegade cops team up to take on the corrupt chief of police and a crime lords hatchet-man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqnlMrW5qsKvFPPFbDPijpRWc90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246984'),
  ('330618498135041007', 'Maximum Overdrive', 1986, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Stephen King, Armando Nannuzzi, Tony Lucibello', 'Stephen King', 'Emilio Estevez, Pat Hingle, Laura Harrington, Yeardley Smith, John Short, Ellen McElduff, J.C. Quinn, Christopher Murney', 'R', 'When a comet passes close to the earth, machines all over the world come alive and go on homicidal rampages. A group of people at a desolate truck stop are held hostage by a gang of murderous 18-wheelers. The frightened people set out to defeat the killer machines…Or be killed by them.', 'When a comet passes close to the earth, machines all over the world come alive and go on homicidal rampages. A group of people at a desolate truck stop are held hostage by a gang of murderous 18-wheelers. The frightened people set out to defeat the killer machines…Or be killed by them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pGYesuatPnMS8lhS4NvwiDjKbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9980'),
  ('1631735949608902', 'Maximum Ride', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jay Martin, Ed Wu', 'Jesse Spears, Angelique Hanus', 'Allie Marie Evans, Patrick Johnson, Lyliana Wray, Tetona Jackson, Zayne Emory, Gavin Lewis, Carrie Wampler, Luke Gregory Crosby', 'PG-13', 'Six children genetically cross-bred with avian DNA, complete with wings, take flight around the country to discover their origins.', 'Six children genetically cross-bred with avian DNA, complete with wings, take flight around the country to discover their origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xMMUsqz7MxQUPToJqhfYAebQBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339116'),
  ('775984695804075634', 'Maximum Risk', 1996, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Alexander Gruszynski, Charlie Picerni', 'Larry Ferguson', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Natasha Henstridge, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Zach Grenier, Paul Ben-Victor, Frank Senger, Stefanos Miltsakakis, David Hemblen', 'R', 'Alain Moreau''s investigation into the death of his identical twin brother leads him from the beauty of the south of France to the mean streets of New York City and into the arms of his brother''s beautiful girlfriend. Pursued by ruthless Russian mobsters and renegade FBI agents, the duo race against time to solve his brother''s murder and expose an international conspiracy.', 'Alain Moreau''s investigation into the death of his identical twin brother leads him from the beauty of the south of France to the mean streets of New York City and into the arms of his brother''s beautiful girlfriend. Pursued by ruthless Russian mobsters and renegade FBI agents, the duo race against time to solve his brother''s murder and expose an international conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18HVWwyLihWJPzGpSVl3omRRMyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10861'),
  ('348740819091605740', 'Maximum Velocity (V-Max)', 2002, 'Drama, Action', 'Gherardo Gossi, Giovanni Vaccarelli, Lucia Di Donato', 'Laura Paolucci, Daniele Vicari, Maura Nuccetelli', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Cristiano Morroni, Alessia Barela, Ivano De Matteo, Emanuela Barilozzi, Massimiliano Dau, Massimiliano Varrese, Ennio Girolami', null, 'In search of purpose, 17-year-old Claudio helps easygoing mechanic Stefano build a car capable of winning a street race that could solve his financial problems, but gets himself involved with the latter''s former girlfriend.', 'In search of purpose, 17-year-old Claudio helps easygoing mechanic Stefano build a car capable of winning a street race that could solve his financial problems, but gets himself involved with the latter''s former girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0EBUkZQfTrGGgm7EDk8JPYeqRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82832'),
  ('766282269259222251', 'Maxwell''s Demon', 1968, null, 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'Scottish physicist James Clerk Maxwell''s classic theory about the behavior of gas molecules is represented on-screen by a man performing a series of Canadian air force exercises.', 'Scottish physicist James Clerk Maxwell''s classic theory about the behavior of gas molecules is represented on-screen by a man performing a series of Canadian air force exercises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pt5w0oXsOJCTXOIgGCY1W8Ekbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154525'),
  ('909318452274700875', 'MaXXXine', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ti West, Nicole Burke, Eliot Rockett', 'Ti West', 'Mia Goth, Elizabeth Debicki, Moses Sumney, Michelle Monaghan, Bobby Cannavale, Halsey, Lily Collins, Giancarlo Esposito', 'R', 'In 1980s Hollywood, adult film star and aspiring actress Maxine Minx finally gets her big break. But as a mysterious killer stalks the starlets of Hollywood, a trail of blood threatens to reveal her sinister past.', 'In 1980s Hollywood, adult film star and aspiring actress Maxine Minx finally gets her big break. But as a mysterious killer stalks the starlets of Hollywood, a trail of blood threatens to reveal her sinister past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArvoFK6nlouZRxYmtIOUzKIrg90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023922'),
  ('903798563660417381', 'May', 2003, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy', 'Lucky McKee, Jaron Presant, Brad Arnold', 'Lucky McKee', 'Angela Bettis, Jeremy Sisto, Anna Faris, James Duval, Nichole Hiltz, Kevin Gage, Merle Kennedy, Chandler Riley Hecht', 'R', 'A socially awkward veterinary assistant with a lazy eye and obsession with perfection descends into depravity after developing a crush on a boy with perfect hands.', 'A socially awkward veterinary assistant with a lazy eye and obsession with perfection descends into depravity after developing a crush on a boy with perfect hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFXhJYTax1cnNtgvLdKlXuYiWPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10894'),
  ('330458513513106312', 'May 18', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Kim Ji-hoon, Kang Seong-hoon, Lee Doo-man', 'Na Hyun', 'Kim Sang-kyung, Ahn Sung-ki, Lee Yo-won, Lee Joon-gi, Park Cheol-min, Park Won-sang, Song Jae-ho, Na Moon-hee', null, 'The citizens of Gwangju lead a relatively peaceful life, until one day the military takes over the city, accusing the residents of conspiracy and claiming that they are communist sympathisers preparing a revolution against the current government. Seeing as the soldiers beat defenceless people, mainly students, to death, the citizens are in for retaliation and form a militia.', 'The citizens of Gwangju lead a relatively peaceful life, until one day the military takes over the city, accusing the residents of conspiracy and claiming that they are communist sympathisers preparing a revolution against the current government. Seeing as the soldiers beat defenceless people, mainly students, to death, the citizens are in for retaliation and form a militia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prfKmhgM3HiUSU1tfXvIw831iEA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58069'),
  ('1007151531478159529', 'May Allah Bless France!', 2014, 'Drama', 'Abd Al Malik', 'Abd Al Malik', 'Marc Zinga, Sabrina Ouazani, Larouci Didi, Gianni Giardinelli, Mickaël Nagenraft, Matteo Falkone, Stéphane Fayette-Mikano, Mireille Perrier', null, 'The true story of a French teenager rising out of the underprivileged suburbs through love, education and rap music. Regis is a culturally gifted boy who dreams of success for his rap band, but he must accept drug money for the sake of his project. Discovering Islam and love, he bears with the harsh loss and paybacks of delinquency, until he finds the strength to express himself through music and slam-poetry and ultimately becomes a major artist of the French music scene.', 'The true story of a French teenager rising out of the underprivileged suburbs through love, education and rap music. Regis is a culturally gifted boy who dreams of success for his rap band, but he must accept drug money for the sake of his project. Discovering Islam and love, he bears with the harsh loss and paybacks of delinquency, until he finds the strength to express himself through music and slam-poetry and ultimately becomes a major artist of the French music scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iR5CyA8peUYajsMrzlBvItL6Gtt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287611'),
  ('1040779144988252452', 'May December', 2023, 'Drama', 'Todd Haynes, Kristina M. Peterson, Christopher Blauvelt', 'Samy Burch', 'Natalie Portman, Julianne Moore, Charles Melton, Cory Michael Smith, Elizabeth Yu, Gabriel Chung, Piper Curda, D.W. Moffett', 'R', 'Twenty years after their notorious tabloid romance gripped the nation, a married couple buckles under the pressure when an actress arrives to do research for a film about their past.', 'Twenty years after their notorious tabloid romance gripped the nation, a married couple buckles under the pressure when an actress arrives to do research for a film about their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhV7B610l7hjlri4ywikJ18ONuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839369'),
  ('435162072264231160', 'May Fools', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Louis Malle, Renato Berta, Luc Etienne', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Louis Malle', 'Michel Piccoli, Miou-Miou, Michel Duchaussoy, Paulette Dubost, Harriet Walter, Bruno Carette, Martine Gautier, Rozenne Le Tallec', null, 'During the events of May 1968 in France, different worldviews of conflicting relatives collide in their family estate.', 'During the events of May 1968 in France, different worldviews of conflicting relatives collide in their family estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AnNzNDKuteS7BthVJGwqv31B6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1785'),
  ('887803620270784395', 'May God Forgive You... But I Won''t', 1968, 'Western', 'Vincenzo Musolino, Mario Mancini', 'Vincenzo Musolino', 'George Ardisson, Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić, Pietro Martellanza, Cristina Iosani, Ignazio Spalla, Luigi Pavese, Tano Cimarosa, Dante Maggio', null, 'While Cjamango is away from his ranch, bandits attack and kill his family. Disrupted by this tragedy, he sets out to take his revenge, helped by a Mexican who has seen the bandits. The writer of the western Cjamango directed this unofficial sequel to Cjamango.', 'While Cjamango is away from his ranch, bandits attack and kill his family. Disrupted by this tragedy, he sets out to take his revenge, helped by a Mexican who has seen the bandits. The writer of the western Cjamango directed this unofficial sequel to Cjamango.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzRbg9S32zFxbOsMsdOkClILa0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144737'),
  ('1090328144990724026', 'May God Save Us', 2016, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Alejandro de Pablo, David Pareja', 'Isabel Peña, Rodrigo Sorogoyen', 'Antonio de la Torre, Roberto Álamo, Javier Pereira, Luis Zahera, Raúl Prieto, María de Nati, María Ballesteros, José Luis García Pérez', null, 'Madrid, summer 2011. Economic crisis. 15-M movement and 1.5 million pilgrims waiting for the Pope’s arrival live side by side in a Madrid that’s hotter and more chaotic than ever. In this context, detectives Velarde and Alfaro must find what seems to be a serial killer. Their against-the-clock hunt will make them realise something they’d never imagined: neither of them are so very different from the killer.', 'Madrid, summer 2011. Economic crisis. 15-M movement and 1.5 million pilgrims waiting for the Pope’s arrival live side by side in a Madrid that’s hotter and more chaotic than ever. In this context, detectives Velarde and Alfaro must find what seems to be a serial killer. Their against-the-clock hunt will make them realise something they’d never imagined: neither of them are so very different from the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTF8FzV5CgiH4Qi8YrF1Ef3w63U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394684'),
  ('986587395467820049', 'May I Speak with the Enemy?', 2024, 'Comedy, War', 'Alexis Morante, Carlos Garcia de Dios, Carmen Martínez', 'Alexis Morante, Raúl Santos', 'Óscar Lasarte, Carlos Cuevas, Natalia de Molina, Salva Reina, Adelfa Calvo, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Iván Villanueva, Antonio Bachiller', null, 'Madrid, Spain, 1936. The young Miguel Gila lives happily with his grandparents in a humble attic; but the outbreak of the Civil War forces him to go to fight.', 'Madrid, Spain, 1936. The young Miguel Gila lives happily with his grandparents in a humble attic; but the outbreak of the Civil War forces him to go to fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssuQCqehj0DUrU8ZsgPMM96Yivc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275209'),
  ('922424164273609377', 'May Night, or the Drowned Maiden', 1952, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Aleksandr Rou, Gavriil Egiazarov, A. Ulyantsev', 'Konstantin Isayev', 'Nikolai Dosenko, Tatyana Konyukhova, Liliya Yudina, Georgi Millyar, Aleksandr Zhukov, Galina Grigoryeva, Aleksandr Khvylia, Emma Tsesarskaya', null, 'The son of an obstinate mayor cannot get his father''s consent to wed the beautiful Hanna. He receives unexpected assistance from evil, mysterious forces – Satan, witches, and rusalki – who work together to bring the couple happiness, bringing mayhem and celebration.', 'The son of an obstinate mayor cannot get his father''s consent to wed the beautiful Hanna. He receives unexpected assistance from evil, mysterious forces – Satan, witches, and rusalki – who work together to bring the couple happiness, bringing mayhem and celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MiKhbBQf3w31TkCuDpdefpLqqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279622'),
  ('378800594458355529', 'May the 12th Be with You', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'David Silverman, Drew McPhail, Nelson Shin', 'David Mirkin, Joel H. Cohen, Jeff Westbrook', 'Julie Kavner, Dan Castellaneta, Chris Edgerly, Tress MacNeille, Carolyn Omine, Maggie Roswell, Maurice LaMarche, Seth MacFarlane', 'PG', 'It''s Mother''s Day and Marge Simpson joins the moms of Disney+ on a special holiday outing that turns into an epic galactic adventure filled with heroes, villains, and Stewie from Family Guy.', 'It''s Mother''s Day and Marge Simpson joins the moms of Disney+ on a special holiday outing that turns into an epic galactic adventure filled with heroes, villains, and Stewie from Family Guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHJ2OIgpcpSmhqXkuSWxZ3nwg1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284004'),
  ('724050387148421775', 'May the Devil Take You', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard R. Ponda''ag, Stanley Saklil, Fajar Yuskemal', 'Timo Tjahjanto', 'Chelsea Islan, Pevita Pearce, Karina Suwandi, Ray Sahetapy, Ruth Marini, Samo Rafael, Hadijah Shahab, Clara Bernadeth', 'R', 'Hoping to find answers to her estranged father''s mysterious illness, a young woman visits his old villa and uncovers a horrifying truth from the past.', 'Hoping to find answers to her estranged father''s mysterious illness, a young woman visits his old villa and uncovers a horrifying truth from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3UqtKPPWmDX4514kWF8hluCbsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524738'),
