  ('908962871085753745', 'Maya', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mia Hansen-Løve, Hélène Louvart', 'Mia Hansen-Løve', 'Roman Kolinka, Aarshi Banerjee, Alex Descas, Judith Chemla, Johanna ter Steege, Suzan Anbeh, Pathy Aiyar, Sandrine Dumas', null, 'The film follows a 30-year-old man named Gabriel, a French war reporter who was taken to hostage in Syria and then heads to India after months in captivity.', 'The film follows a 30-year-old man named Gabriel, a French war reporter who was taken to hostage in Syria and then heads to India after months in captivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9FiTIiXPgsjrCFvmNR5rurtD9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471858'),
  ('858832767531739542', 'Maya Memsaab', 1993, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Ketan Mehta, Anoop Jotwani', 'Sitanshu Yashaschandra, Ketan Mehta', 'Deepa Sahi, Farooq Shaikh, Raj Babbar, Shah Rukh Khan, Paresh Rawal, Raghubir Yadav, Shreeram Lagoo, Satyadev Dubey', null, 'A frustrated housewife whose marriage to an average man does not meet her expectations enters into an affair with a younger man. Of course, there are no easy escapes from reality.', 'A frustrated housewife whose marriage to an average man does not meet her expectations enters into an affair with a younger man. Of course, there are no easy escapes from reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIRLy3RGceFWQ9SMKN26ZudxvLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170991'),
  ('567795433571224494', 'Maya the Bee Movie', 2014, 'Family, Animation', 'Alexs Stadermann, Laura Anderson, Simon Pickard', 'Fin Edquist, Marcus Sauermann', 'Coco Jack Gillies, Justine Clarke, Heather Mitchell, Jacki Weaver, Miriam Margolyes, Noah Taylor, Richard Roxburgh, Andy McPhee', 'G', 'A bubbly little bumblebee rebels against the rules of the hive to make all kinds of friends—from violin-playing grasshoppers to a hornet named Sting.', 'A bubbly little bumblebee rebels against the rules of the hive to make all kinds of friends—from violin-playing grasshoppers to a hornet named Sting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMQ88CvnQroSjxk4IhM7YNbcjTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261103'),
