  ('609518234021817707', 'Maya the Bee: The Honey Games', 2018, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Noel Cleary, Sergio Delfino, Alexs Stadermann', 'Fin Edquist, Adrian Bickenbach', 'Coco Jack Gillies, Benson Jack Anthony, Sam Haft, Justine Clarke, Jimmy James Eaton, Rupert Degas, Linda Ngo, Tess Meyer', 'G', 'Following an unproductive harvest season, it’s up to Maya and her brave friends to save their hive by competing in a series of games.', 'Following an unproductive harvest season, it’s up to Maya and her brave friends to save their hive by competing in a series of games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yx4jdeTbDvZfmHPpd0D3L78VYDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499088'),
  ('66296752205977294', 'Mayabazar', 1957, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Kadri Venkata Reddy, Ghantasala, Marcus Bartley', 'Pingali Nagendra Rao', 'N.T. Rama Rao, S. V. Ranga Rao, Savitri, Nageshwara Rao Akkineni, Gummadi, Mukkamala, C S R Anjaneyulu, Relangi Venkata Ramaiah', null, 'Balarama promises Subhadra that he''ll marry his daughter to her son. But when the Pandavas lose their kingdom to the Kauravas, Balarama breaks his promise.', 'Balarama promises Subhadra that he''ll marry his daughter to her son. But when the Pandavas lose their kingdom to the Kauravas, Balarama breaks his promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLtcUnDZZuBNSONZbRTiS67bnyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158023'),
  ('114004755668986709', 'Mayasabha: The Hall of Illusion', 2026, 'Fantasy, Thriller', 'Rahi Anil Barve, Kuldeep Mamania, Yusuf Khan', 'Rahi Anil Barve', 'Javed Jaffrey, Mohammad Samad, Veena Jamkar, Deepak Damle, Surendra Prajapati', null, 'Parmeshwar Khanna a film producer has launched many new faces. He falls in love with one of the actress whom he has launched and gets married to her. But she ditches him over the hero whom he had launched and they elope with all his money. Years later the only thing with which Khanna is left is a dilapidated theatre which nobody wants to visit.', 'Parmeshwar Khanna a film producer has launched many new faces. He falls in love with one of the actress whom he has launched and gets married to her. But she ditches him over the hero whom he had launched and they elope with all his money. Years later the only thing with which Khanna is left is a dilapidated theatre which nobody wants to visit.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhIC4knJmcAO02JPjF840FJBI4ib.jpg', 'plex:movie:mayasabha'),
  ('333348317806738377', 'Maybe a Love Story', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hélcio Alemão Nagamine, Rodrigo Bernardo', 'Rodrigo Bernardo, Ben Frahm', 'Mateus Solano, Thaila Ayala, Bianca Comparato, Marco Luque, Totia Meireles, Nathalia Dill, Paulo Vilhena, Cynthia Nixon', null, 'Virgílio’s quiet, predictable life unravels with one message: a breakup from a woman he doesn’t remember. As he searches for her, he’s swept into a journey of memory, longing, and the unexpected chance to find the love of his life.', 'Virgílio’s quiet, predictable life unravels with one message: a breakup from a woman he doesn’t remember. As he searches for her, he’s swept into a journey of memory, longing, and the unexpected chance to find the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bflYSyIxPCL1DJJ4bp3t6VBJ1Dj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492826'),
  ('869315850461739424', 'Maybe Baby', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ben Elton, Roger Lanser, Sara Desmond', 'Ben Elton', 'Hugh Laurie, Joely Richardson, Adrian Lester, Matthew Macfadyen, Yasmin Bannerman, Joanna Lumley, Rowan Atkinson, Emma Thompson', 'R', 'Sam and Lucie Bell are a married couple who seem to have it all: good looks, successful careers, matching motorbikes, and an enthusiastic love life. The only thing they lack is the one thing they want more—a baby.', 'Sam and Lucie Bell are a married couple who seem to have it all: good looks, successful careers, matching motorbikes, and an enthusiastic love life. The only thing they lack is the one thing they want more—a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PLm3BZiOXhDIbbqH8ipVyPVA1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13966'),
  ('995936500886979020', 'Maybe Baby', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Barbara Topsøe-Rothenborg', 'Pia Konstantin Berg', 'Mille Dinesen, Lars Ranthe, Thomas Bo Larsen, Neel Rønholt, Laura Bro, Katinka Lærke Petersen, Kasper Dalsgaard, Sarah Boberg', 'R', 'When two pregnant women learn that the fertility clinic mistakenly swapped their eggs, they must navigate the error — and their disdain for each other.', 'When two pregnant women learn that the fertility clinic mistakenly swapped their eggs, they must navigate the error — and their disdain for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKG7t9pHxt8XNr3Ssnqg4Cv2WXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079201'),
  ('743652352666274750', 'Maybe Baby 2', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Barbara Topsøe-Rothenborg, Lars Reinholdt', 'Pia Konstantin Berg, Line Mørkeby, Barbara Topsøe-Rothenborg', 'Mille Dinesen, Lars Ranthe, Katinka Lærke Petersen, Kasper Dalsgaard, Thomas Bo Larsen, Sarah Boberg, Magnus Haugaard, Troels Lyby', null, 'When two couples learn that the fertility clinic didn''t swap their eggs after all, they resolve to move in together and raise their kids collectively.', 'When two couples learn that the fertility clinic didn''t swap their eggs after all, they resolve to move in together and raise their kids collectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ikADeVa7HAEOMmi0CZWiT95KHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1382511'),
  ('667829627770884123', 'Maybe I Do', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Jacobs, Tim Suhrstedt, Zachary Citarella', 'Michael Jacobs', 'Diane Keaton, Richard Gere, Susan Sarandon, Emma Roberts, Luke Bracey, William H. Macy, DazMann Still, Azriél Patricia', 'PG-13', 'Michelle and Allen, who have reached the point in their relationship where they are considering next steps, decide to invite their parents to finally meet and to offer some understanding of why marriage works. Except the parents already know each other quite well, which leads to some very distinct opinions about the value of marriage.', 'Michelle and Allen, who have reached the point in their relationship where they are considering next steps, decide to invite their parents to finally meet and to offer some understanding of why marriage works. Except the parents already know each other quite well, which leads to some very distinct opinions about the value of marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AepEHAUDEbvxzuKV4ll0gKobdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972230'),
  ('1076013180224662271', 'Maybe More', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wilfried Méance, Stéphen Méance, Olivier Ducray', 'Wilfried Méance, Olivier Ducray, Jean-Paul Bathany', 'Bernard Campan, Isabelle Carré, Pablo Pauly, Julia Faure', null, 'After 25 years together, married life has taken its toll on Xavier and Sophie, so when Sophie decides to invite their neighbours over for dinner, Xavier is less than enthusiastic to say the least! He can’t stand how obviously still in love they are and their lack of discretion… especially at night! On coming face-to-face with the uninhibited couple, Xavier and Sophie will be forced to confront their own, sad reality, before finding themselves pushed into a corner by a somewhat… indecent proposal.', 'After 25 years together, married life has taken its toll on Xavier and Sophie, so when Sophie decides to invite their neighbours over for dinner, Xavier is less than enthusiastic to say the least! He can’t stand how obviously still in love they are and their lack of discretion… especially at night! On coming face-to-face with the uninhibited couple, Xavier and Sophie will be forced to confront their own, sad reality, before finding themselves pushed into a corner by a somewhat… indecent proposal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lABR9HrMcvHDSouESUlCpYzGBVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1174024'),
  ('694735882899640854', 'Maybe... Maybe Not', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gernot Roll, Sönke Wortmann, Heike Hempel', 'Sönke Wortmann', 'Til Schweiger, Katja Riemann, Joachim Król, Rufus Beck, Armin Rohde, Martina Gedeck, Kai Wiesinger, Monty Arnold', null, 'The heterosexual man Axel is thrown out of his girlfriends home for cheating and ends up moving in with a gay man. Axel learns the advantages of living with gay men even though they are attracted to him and when his girlfriend wants him back he must make a tough decision.', 'The heterosexual man Axel is thrown out of his girlfriends home for cheating and ends up moving in with a gay man. Axel learns the advantages of living with gay men even though they are attracted to him and when his girlfriend wants him back he must make a tough decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TcZBHcseRXLxNq2RXnKIsbKZwi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159'),
  ('339955981765444501', 'Mayday', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jan Jakub Wiatrzyk, Jarosław Wierzbicki, Jules Jones', 'Hanna Węsierska, Sam Akina, Wojciech Pałys', 'Piotr Adamczyk, Adam Woronowicz, Anna Dereszowska, Weronika Książkiewicz-Nathaniel, Andrzej Grabowski, Ewa Kasprzyk, Sandra Staniszewska, Bartosz Porczyk', null, 'Janek, who has two wives, skillfully maneuvers between them. The risk that one of his loved ones will learn about a double relationship increases dramatically and every lie will have colossal effects.', 'Janek, who has two wives, skillfully maneuvers between them. The risk that one of his loved ones will learn about a double relationship increases dramatically and every lie will have colossal effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Qcn0KBtmVulFSKexYXjxNLFITs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660037'),
  ('78455521838792369', 'Mayday', 2021, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Drama', 'Karen Cinorre, Sam Levy', 'Karen Cinorre', 'Grace Van Patten, Mia Goth, Havana Rose Liu, Soko, Juliette Lewis, Théodore Pellerin, Frano Mašković, Zlatko Burić', null, 'Ana is transported to a dreamlike and dangerous land where she joins an army of girls engaged in a never-ending war. Even though she finds strength in this exhilarating world, she realizes that she''s not the killer they want her to be, and time is running out for her to get home.', 'Ana is transported to a dreamlike and dangerous land where she joins an army of girls engaged in a never-ending war. Even though she finds strength in this exhilarating world, she realizes that she''s not the killer they want her to be, and time is running out for her to get home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNyaHdnXM5ewq0zI0qsdjrpMJ0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672521'),
  ('181604754087779209', 'Mayerling', 1936, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Anatole Litvak, René Montis, Jean Isnard', 'Marcel Achard', 'Charles Boyer, Danielle Darrieux, Jean Dax, Yolande Laffon, Suzy Prim, Gina Manès, Marthe Régnier, Odette Talazac', null, 'Rudolf, the only heir to Emperor Franz Josef of Austria-Hungary, is trapped in a loveless marriage to a Belgian princess. As he seeks to flee his stifling environment, he meets the beautiful Maria, and the two enter into a scandalous affair. Despite the interference of the Emperor, the couple refuse to give each other up.', 'Rudolf, the only heir to Emperor Franz Josef of Austria-Hungary, is trapped in a loveless marriage to a Belgian princess. As he seeks to flee his stifling environment, he meets the beautiful Maria, and the two enter into a scandalous affair. Despite the interference of the Emperor, the couple refuse to give each other up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Jd1hVkhkxHsO5voDjg0cmD69u6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43876'),
  ('144544576541470784', 'Mayerling', 1968, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Terence Young, Henri Alekan, Bernard Farrel', 'Terence Young', 'Omar Sharif, Catherine Deneuve, James Mason, Ava Gardner, James Robertson Justice, Geneviève Page, Andréa Parisy, Ivan Desny', null, 'Crown Prince Rudolf of Austria clashes with his father, Emperor Franz Joseph I of Austria, over implementing progressive policies for their country. Rudolf soon feels he is a man born at the wrong time in a country that doesn''t realize the need for social reform. The Prince of Wales, later to become Britain''s King Edward VII, provides comic relief. Rudolf finds refuge from a loveless marriage with Princess Stéphanie by taking a mistress, Baroness Maria Vetsera. Their untimely demise at Mayerling, the imperial family''s hunting lodge, is cloaked in mystery.', 'Crown Prince Rudolf of Austria clashes with his father, Emperor Franz Joseph I of Austria, over implementing progressive policies for their country. Rudolf soon feels he is a man born at the wrong time in a country that doesn''t realize the need for social reform. The Prince of Wales, later to become Britain''s King Edward VII, provides comic relief. Rudolf finds refuge from a loveless marriage with Princess Stéphanie by taking a mistress, Baroness Maria Vetsera. Their untimely demise at Mayerling, the imperial family''s hunting lodge, is cloaked in mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yV66NIGGJO3Th7KCn8I21Atwtf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63888'),
  ('118530011416787955', 'Mayhem', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Maria Nita, Milana Milunović, Christopher Landry', 'Matias Caruso', 'Steven Yeun, Samara Weaving, Steven Brand, Caroline Chikezie, Kerry Fox, Dallas Roberts, Mark Frost, André Eriksen', 'NR', 'A virus spreads through an office complex causing white collar workers to act out their worst impulses.', 'A virus spreads through an office complex causing white collar workers to act out their worst impulses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF5ULrCAQ8TULXyFGlPlQ2s3Jie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429733'),
  ('496237904159986975', 'Mayhem!', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Gilles Porte, Xavier Gens, Jude Poyer', 'Magali Rossitto, Guillaume Lemans, Xavier Gens', 'Nassim Lyes, Loryn Nounay, Olivier Gourmet, Vithaya Pansringarm, Mehdi Hadim, Kenneth Won, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Chananticha Chaipa', 'R', 'Sam is a professional boxer about to get released from prison. While on parole, his past catches up with him and he has no choice but to flee. Five years later, he has rebuilt a simple life on an exotic island in Thailand with his wife and her daughter, but when he gets blackmailed by a dangerous local godfather, he must embark on a dangerous drug smuggling mission which results in a tragedy. Now he has only one purpose: to seek merciless vengeance.', 'Sam is a professional boxer about to get released from prison. While on parole, his past catches up with him and he has no choice but to flee. Five years later, he has rebuilt a simple life on an exotic island in Thailand with his wife and her daughter, but when he gets blackmailed by a dangerous local godfather, he must embark on a dangerous drug smuggling mission which results in a tragedy. Now he has only one purpose: to seek merciless vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9035lysUz3ccloQt0SeIp1Mu8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959092'),
  ('208203089148932301', 'Mayor of the Sunset Strip', 2003, 'Documentary, Music', 'George Hickenlooper', 'George Hickenlooper', 'Rodney Bingenheimer, Kim Fowley, Exene Cervenka, John Doe, Courtney Love, Alice Cooper, Debbie Harry, Neil Young', null, 'A look at the history of fame in the world through the eyes of pop star impresario, Rodney Bingenheimer', 'A look at the history of fame in the world through the eyes of pop star impresario, Rodney Bingenheimer', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vRVeVhozMozvQSubTlcmQlHKK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61487'),
  ('1038007370100473021', 'Maysoon', 2026, 'Drama', 'Nancy Biniadaki', 'Nancy Biniadaki', 'Sabrina Amali, Florian Stetter, Josef Mohamed, Heike Hanold-Lynch, Katharina Wittenbrink', null, 'A relationship falls apart, a passport expires - and suddenly everything is at stake: Egyptian archaeologist Maysoon lives in Berlin with her partner Tobi and their two children when her past catches up with her: once politically active before the Arab Spring, returning to Egypt could cost her her freedom. As she fears the loss of her home, her family, and her sense of control, Maysoon begins a battle.', 'A relationship falls apart, a passport expires - and suddenly everything is at stake: Egyptian archaeologist Maysoon lives in Berlin with her partner Tobi and their two children when her past catches up with her: once politically active before the Arab Spring, returning to Egypt could cost her her freedom. As she fears the loss of her home, her family, and her sense of control, Maysoon begins a battle.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1RfYLEEurFa0rMQYIQh0lVQuSQr.jpg', 'plex:movie:maysoon'),
  ('972503042629114340', 'Maytime', 1937, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Marvin Stuart, Joseph M. Newman', 'Noel Langley', 'Jeanette MacDonald, Nelson Eddy, John Barrymore, Herman Bing, Tom Brown, Lynne Carver, Rafaela Ottiano, Charles Judels', null, 'An aging opera singer looks back on her long life, including her relationships with her vocal teacher and a student.', 'An aging opera singer looks back on her long life, including her relationships with her vocal teacher and a student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P3dENCnuxlhyer7k0SzESRVZrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43862'),
  ('334612241884339845', 'Maze', 2017, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Stephen Burke, David Grennan', 'Stephen Burke', 'Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Barry Ward, Martin McCann, Niamh McGrady, Eileen Walsh, Aaron Monaghan, Ross McKinney, Elva Trill', null, 'Inspired by the true events of the infamous 1983 prison breakout of 38 IRA prisoners from HMP Maze, which was to become the biggest prison escape in Europe since World War II.', 'Inspired by the true events of the infamous 1983 prison breakout of 38 IRA prisoners from HMP Maze, which was to become the biggest prison escape in Europe since World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWEF3a1qErRIjmLW0xU28zAgV9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464566'),
  ('1132967247886845325', 'Maze Runner: The Death Cure', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Wes Ball, Gyula Pados, Christophe Dalberg', 'T.S. Nowlin', 'Dylan O''Brien, Kaya Scodelario, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Ki Hong Lee, Dexter Darden, Rosa Salazar, Giancarlo Esposito, Will Poulter', 'PG-13', 'Thomas leads his group of escaped Gladers on their final and most dangerous mission yet. To save their friends, they must break into the legendary Last City, a WCKD-controlled labyrinth that may turn out to be the deadliest maze of all. Anyone who makes it out alive will get answers to the questions the Gladers have been asking since they first arrived in the maze.', 'Thomas leads his group of escaped Gladers on their final and most dangerous mission yet. To save their friends, they must break into the legendary Last City, a WCKD-controlled labyrinth that may turn out to be the deadliest maze of all. Anyone who makes it out alive will get answers to the questions the Gladers have been asking since they first arrived in the maze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drbERzlA4cuRWhsTXfFOY4mRR4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336843'),
  ('415853478698358284', 'Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'John M. Morse, Walter E. Myal, Patrick Scalise', 'T.S. Nowlin', 'Dylan O''Brien, Kaya Scodelario, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Giancarlo Esposito, Ki Hong Lee, Dexter Darden, Rosa Salazar, Patricia Clarkson', 'PG-13', 'Thomas and his fellow Gladers face their greatest challenge yet: searching for clues about the mysterious and powerful organization known as WCKD. Their journey takes them to the Scorch, a desolate landscape filled with unimaginable obstacles. Teaming up with resistance fighters, the Gladers take on WCKD’s vastly superior forces and uncover its shocking plans for them all.', 'Thomas and his fellow Gladers face their greatest challenge yet: searching for clues about the mysterious and powerful organization known as WCKD. Their journey takes them to the Scorch, a desolate landscape filled with unimaginable obstacles. Teaming up with resistance fighters, the Gladers take on WCKD’s vastly superior forces and uncover its shocking plans for them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYw7ZyejqSCPFlrT2jHZOESZDU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294254'),
  ('537283108274632310', 'Mazel Tov', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Adrián Suar, Iair Said, Guillermo Nieto', 'Pablo Solarz', 'Adrián Suar, Fernán Mirás, Natalie Pérez, Benjamín Rojas, Alberto Ajaka, Lorena Vega, Guillermo Arengo, Esteban Bigliardi', null, 'When Dario Roitman returns from the U.S. to Argentina for a family wedding and Bat Mitzvah, he anticipates the usual family drama. But his carefully laid plans for a family reunion are suddenly upended when he learns, just hours before his flight, that his father has passed away. As the Roitmans gather for the funeral, old wounds resurface and longstanding tensions reach a boiling point. Despite the emotional turmoil, Dario remains determined to celebrate both the wedding and Bat Mitzvah, even if it means challenging tradition and risking further discord. Navigating grief, sibling rivalry, and delightfully eccentric grudges, the Roitmans reveal the messy yet enduring love of family.', 'When Dario Roitman returns from the U.S. to Argentina for a family wedding and Bat Mitzvah, he anticipates the usual family drama. But his carefully laid plans for a family reunion are suddenly upended when he learns, just hours before his flight, that his father has passed away. As the Roitmans gather for the funeral, old wounds resurface and longstanding tensions reach a boiling point. Despite the emotional turmoil, Dario remains determined to celebrate both the wedding and Bat Mitzvah, even if it means challenging tradition and risking further discord. Navigating grief, sibling rivalry, and delightfully eccentric grudges, the Roitmans reveal the messy yet enduring love of family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fjePrWCOAjTTEI6b6twIWO6ZXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339374'),
  ('299302056489836502', 'Mazes and Monsters', 1982, 'Fantasy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Steven Hilliard Stern, Laszlo George', null, 'Tom Hanks, Wendy Crewson, David Wallace, Chris Makepeace, Lloyd Bochner, Peter Donat, Anne Francis, Murray Hamilton', 'PG', 'Bound together by a desire to play "Mazes and Monsters," Robbie and his four college classmates decide to move the board game into the local cavern. Robbie loses his mind, and the line between reality and fantasy fuse into a harrowing nightmare.', 'Bound together by a desire to play "Mazes and Monsters," Robbie and his four college classmates decide to move the board game into the local cavern. Robbie loses his mind, and the line between reality and fantasy fuse into a harrowing nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4i0ISVGGZczwl3RaTIAa8BMu6Df.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27348'),
  ('675961662576033905', 'Mazha Peyyunnu Maddalam Kottunnu', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Priyadarshan', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Lissy, Sreenivasan, Mukesh, Jagathy Sreekumar, Maniyanpilla Raju, Kuthiravattam Pappu, Bahadoor', null, 'Mazha Peyyunnu Maddalam Kottunnu is a 1986 Malayalam comedy film directed by Priyadarshan. Starring Mohanlal, Mukesh, Lizy, Sreenivasan, Jagathi Sreekumar, Maniyanpilla Raju, and Kuthiravattam Pappu in the main roles. This film was a huge hit in theaters and is considered as one of the best comedy films in Malayalam cinema.', 'Mazha Peyyunnu Maddalam Kottunnu is a 1986 Malayalam comedy film directed by Priyadarshan. Starring Mohanlal, Mukesh, Lizy, Sreenivasan, Jagathi Sreekumar, Maniyanpilla Raju, and Kuthiravattam Pappu in the main roles. This film was a huge hit in theaters and is considered as one of the best comedy films in Malayalam cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sPZ2WHsm8KIrN92qL33iOZNisD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274232'),
  ('532302215583759491', 'Mazinger Z vs The Great Dark General', 1974, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Nobutaka Nishizawa', 'Susumu Takaku', 'Hiroya Ishimaru, Ryoichi Tanaka, Kazuko Sawada, Chikao Ohtsuka, Hiroshi Otake, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Joji Yanami, Saiko Egawa', null, 'Kouji and his friends have defeated Dr. Hell and are now enjoying a break, but suddenly a strange prophet appears and warns everyone of an oncoming danger, mechanical beasts never seen before start appearing all around the world wrecking havoc. Its up to Kouji and his Mazinger Z to stand up to this threat but it seems he is vastly outnumber and outmatched.', 'Kouji and his friends have defeated Dr. Hell and are now enjoying a break, but suddenly a strange prophet appears and warns everyone of an oncoming danger, mechanical beasts never seen before start appearing all around the world wrecking havoc. Its up to Kouji and his Mazinger Z to stand up to this threat but it seems he is vastly outnumber and outmatched.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twcn1KSU5CakLFtPKrGUT4EYbb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74617'),
  ('99643696094477850', 'Mazinger Z vs. Devilman', 1973, 'Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Tomoharu Katsumata, Koichi Tsunoda', 'Susumu Takaku', 'Ryoichi Tanaka, Hiroya Ishimaru, Haruko Kitahama, Hidekatsu Shibata, Hiroshi Otake, Joji Yanami, Kazuko Sawada, Kosei Tomita', null, 'Mazinger Z vs. Devilman is a 1973 animated movie that crossed over two then-popular Anime series, both of which were created by Manga artist Go Nagai. While fighting with some of his enemies Mazinger Z inadvertently knocks them into a volcano, where they crash into the prison of the Satan race and release Phoenix Jenny! Dr. Hell, learning of this, frees the rest of the Satan race and teams up with them to defeat Mazinger Z, and their ability to fly proves to be too much for our hero. Meanwhile, Devilman is also individually fighting the members of the Satan race, but their combined power is too much for him as well; can Mazinger and Devilman put aside their differences and team up to defeat Dr. Hell and the Satan race?', 'Mazinger Z vs. Devilman is a 1973 animated movie that crossed over two then-popular Anime series, both of which were created by Manga artist Go Nagai. While fighting with some of his enemies Mazinger Z inadvertently knocks them into a volcano, where they crash into the prison of the Satan race and release Phoenix Jenny! Dr. Hell, learning of this, frees the rest of the Satan race and teams up with them to defeat Mazinger Z, and their ability to fly proves to be too much for our hero. Meanwhile, Devilman is also individually fighting the members of the Satan race, but their combined power is too much for him as well; can Mazinger and Devilman put aside their differences and team up to defeat Dr. Hell and the Satan race?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g54ikhveHSb8KSI3CE0bwkYT0UR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74619'),
  ('578799315652973545', 'Mazinger Z: Infinity', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Yoo Nakano, Junji Shimizu, Koji Kawasaki', 'Takahiro Ozawa', 'Showtaro Morikubo, Ai Kayano, Sumire Uesaka, Toshihiko Seki, Ami Koshimizu, Junpei Morita, Unsho Ishizuka, Keiji Fujiwara', 'PG-13', 'When the evil Dr. Hell attacks the Earth, the mighty giant mecha Mazinger Z is formed to stop him.', 'When the evil Dr. Hell attacks the Earth, the mighty giant mecha Mazinger Z is formed to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muN1Gf5SnGz8Il2ViqsIX4pkfxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452970'),
  ('316522171550713150', 'Mazinkaizer SKL', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action', 'Jun Kawagoe, Akeshi Itou', 'Go Nagai', 'Shintaro Asanuma, Satoshi Hino, Saori Hayami', null, 'Mazinkaizer SKL (マジンカイザースカル Majinkaizā Sukaru?) is a Japanese OVA spinoff of Go Nagai''s Mazinkaiser, which was in itself a spinoff of Mazinger Z. The first episode was released on November 27, 2010 and was first screened on November 27, 2010. It also has a novel adaptation serialized in ASCII Media Works'' Dengeki Hobby Magazine and a manga adaptation published in the mobile phone magazine Shu 2 Comic Gekkin. Like Shin Mazinger Shougeki! Z Hen, characters and references to other works of Go Nagai appear in this series.', 'Mazinkaizer SKL (マジンカイザースカル Majinkaizā Sukaru?) is a Japanese OVA spinoff of Go Nagai''s Mazinkaiser, which was in itself a spinoff of Mazinger Z. The first episode was released on November 27, 2010 and was first screened on November 27, 2010. It also has a novel adaptation serialized in ASCII Media Works'' Dengeki Hobby Magazine and a manga adaptation published in the mobile phone magazine Shu 2 Comic Gekkin. Like Shin Mazinger Shougeki! Z Hen, characters and references to other works of Go Nagai appear in this series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYFuGXAkKTlvGa1CC3I8r2C9MrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102747'),
  ('465575002655530426', 'Mazzabubù... quante corna stanno quaggiù?', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Tino Santoni, Alessandro Metz', 'Sandro Continenza, Amedeo Sollazzo', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Sylva Koscina, Carlo Giuffrè, Maurizio Arena, Lino Banfi, Isabella Biagini, Mariolina Cannuli', null, 'During a monologue on the theme of adultery, a man reviews a series of famous and anonymous cases of conjugal betrayals ...', 'During a monologue on the theme of adultery, a man reviews a series of famous and anonymous cases of conjugal betrayals ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nPTZfOiJkGXTPGyqMnh8TxQ8YS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280752'),
  ('439560851357485805', 'McBain', 1991, 'Action, War, Drama', 'James Glickenhaus, Robert M. Baldwin', 'James Glickenhaus', 'Christopher Walken, Michael Ironside, Michael Joseph DeSare, Chick Vennera, Steve James, Thomas G. Waites, Jay Patterson, María Conchita Alonso', null, 'Santos attempts to lead a people''s revolt in Colombia to overthrow the Presidente. When his revolt fails and he is killed, his sister Christina goes to New York to find McBain, a lieutenant Santos rescued during the Vietnam War. McBain agrees to help, recruits his old war buddies, raises some cash by killing a few drug dealers, then leads an attack to topple the Colombian government.', 'Santos attempts to lead a people''s revolt in Colombia to overthrow the Presidente. When his revolt fails and he is killed, his sister Christina goes to New York to find McBain, a lieutenant Santos rescued during the Vietnam War. McBain agrees to help, recruits his old war buddies, raises some cash by killing a few drug dealers, then leads an attack to topple the Colombian government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOYtB42P1njhR5vN7gulIKf6TVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27350'),
  ('984563084349475921', 'McCabe & Mrs. Miller', 1971, 'Western, Drama', 'Robert Altman, Lou Lombardo, Rod Parkhurst', 'Brian McKay, Robert Altman', 'Warren Beatty, Julie Christie, René Auberjonois, William Devane, John Schuck, Corey Fischer, Bert Remsen, Shelley Duvall', 'R', 'A gambler and a prostitute become thriving business partners in a remote Old West mining town until a large corporation arrives on the scene.', 'A gambler and a prostitute become thriving business partners in a remote Old West mining town until a large corporation arrives on the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR839yRsFAiQHwJ78hdKZYjEBg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29005'),
  ('325112309086089241', 'McCinsey''s Island', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Sam Firstenberg', null, 'Hulk Hogan, Grace Jones, Robert Vaughn, Todd Sheeler, Paul Wight, Isaac C. Singleton, Jr., Ed Leslie', null, 'Hulk Hogan and Grace Jones star in this adventure tale about a onetime secret agent who finds a treasure map on the shell of a turtle. Soon he''s on a chase to recover the loot, just one step ahead of other seekers of wealth.', 'Hulk Hogan and Grace Jones star in this adventure tale about a onetime secret agent who finds a treasure map on the shell of a turtle. Soon he''s on a chase to recover the loot, just one step ahead of other seekers of wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHBgMJgOAomZ2obwfPK3GPA0K1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83361'),
  ('468905596068193302', 'McDull, Prince de la Bun', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Toe Yuen', 'Alice Mak, Brian Tse', 'Andy Lau, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Jan Lam Hoi-Fung, Chet Lam, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, May Che Yuet-Mei, Eman Lam Yi-Man, Cedric Chan Ho-Fung', null, 'To secure a better future, Mrs Mc sends her son McDull (who is a piglet attending kindergarten) to many different classes and she has also bought her grave on mortgage. Inspired by J K Rowling, Mrs Mc tries her hand at writing. At bedtime, she tells McDull the story she wrote although McDull keeps asking her to read him Harry Potter instead. The story she wrote is actually the story of McDull''s father, McBing, Prince de la Bun', 'To secure a better future, Mrs Mc sends her son McDull (who is a piglet attending kindergarten) to many different classes and she has also bought her grave on mortgage. Inspired by J K Rowling, Mrs Mc tries her hand at writing. At bedtime, she tells McDull the story she wrote although McDull keeps asking her to read him Harry Potter instead. The story she wrote is actually the story of McDull''s father, McBing, Prince de la Bun', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YszLwGvok4L7vftt8RwbDY716N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85508'),
  ('1029991961522101494', 'McDull: Me & My Mum', 2014, 'Comedy, Animation, Drama', 'Brian Tse', 'Brian Tse, Lee Chun-Man', 'Zhang Zheng-Zhong, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, BabyJohn Choi Hon-Yik, Li Yundi, Dejay Choi, Huang Lei', null, 'As a child, Bobby Mak was known as Mcdull. Although Mcdull wasn‘t the sharpest tool in the shed, his mother was a different story. Her astounding intelligence and resourcefulness enabled her to, for example, simultaneously run more than six businesses from a space of less than 100 square feet. Mcdull and his mother lived together happily during Mcdull‘s childhood, but things began to change as Mcdull got older. A distance that never existed before began to grow between him and his mother…', 'As a child, Bobby Mak was known as Mcdull. Although Mcdull wasn‘t the sharpest tool in the shed, his mother was a different story. Her astounding intelligence and resourcefulness enabled her to, for example, simultaneously run more than six businesses from a space of less than 100 square feet. Mcdull and his mother lived together happily during Mcdull‘s childhood, but things began to change as Mcdull got older. A distance that never existed before began to grow between him and his mother…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDfqnGYrdo2AZlrhAWxL3GMtfQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313616'),
  ('858284573299065858', 'McDull: The Pork of Music', 2012, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy', 'Brian Tse', 'Brian Tse, Alice Mak', 'Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Dejay Choi, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Zhang Zheng-Zhong', null, 'McDull: The Pork of Music is virtually a musical, describing how the kindergarten, now destitute in HK''s depressed economy, forms a student chorus to raise operating funds. The choir, of course, becomes wildly famous, and, guided by shady manager Big M (Ronald Cheng), reaches the apotheosis of HK culture: on stage with superstar Andy Lau.', 'McDull: The Pork of Music is virtually a musical, describing how the kindergarten, now destitute in HK''s depressed economy, forms a student chorus to raise operating funds. The choir, of course, becomes wildly famous, and, guided by shady manager Big M (Ronald Cheng), reaches the apotheosis of HK culture: on stage with superstar Andy Lau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCMtuRroWP3aSOxS8hGrPwfYBJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137386'),
  ('766763672586068470', 'McEnroe', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Barney Douglas', 'Barney Douglas', 'John McEnroe, Patty Smyth, Kevin McEnroe, Emily McEnroe, Ruby Smyth Meyers-McEnroe, Anna McEnroe, Ava McEnroe, Mark McEnroe', null, 'Legendary "bad boy of tennis" John McEnroe finally tells his side of his storied career and famously hot-tempered performances on the court in this engrossing documentary revisiting the record-setting career of one of the all-time greats.', 'Legendary "bad boy of tennis" John McEnroe finally tells his side of his storied career and famously hot-tempered performances on the court in this engrossing documentary revisiting the record-setting career of one of the all-time greats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viDGPxajRmUmOjNCe8m0AswdU5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965737'),
  ('230877436884922792', 'McFarland, USA', 2015, 'Drama, Family', 'Niki Caro, Adam Arkapaw', 'Grant Thompson, Bettina Gilois, Christopher Cleveland', 'Kevin Costner, Maria Bello, Elsie Fisher, Morgan Saylor, Martha Higareda, Vincent Martella, Daniel Moncada, Johnny Ortiz', 'PG', 'A track coach in a small California town transforms a team of athletes into championship contenders.', 'A track coach in a small California town transforms a team of athletes into championship contenders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyhniD8A7Mv6SOn8oo1Ba2K0mKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228203'),
  ('665330818905886433', 'McHale''s Navy', 1964, 'Comedy, War', 'Edward Montagne', 'George Carleton Brown, Frank Gill Jr.', 'Ernest Borgnine, Tim Conway, Joe Flynn, Bob Hastings, Gary Vinson, John Wright, Carl Ballantine, Billy Sands', 'NR', 'The crew of PT-73 get into trouble when they back the wrong horse in a race. Now they have to come up with a way to raise the money to pay off the winners.', 'The crew of PT-73 get into trouble when they back the wrong horse in a race. Now they have to come up with a way to raise the money to pay off the winners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ho517k1uK7zGgrtM9vGonIl7iXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54295'),
  ('515796040721570535', 'McHale''s Navy', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Bryan Spicer, Buzz Feitshans IV', 'Peter Crabbe, Andy Rose', 'Tom Arnold, Dean Stockwell, Debra Messing, David Alan Grier, Bruce Campbell, French Stewart, Tim Curry, Ernest Borgnine', 'PG', 'Retired Lieutenant Commander Quinton McHale spends his days puttering around the Caribbean in the old PT-73 selling homebrew, ice cream, and swimsuit calendars. He''s brought out of retirement when his old nemesis turned the second best terrorist in the world, Major Vladikov, takes over the island of San Moreno and starts building a nuclear launch silo on it. With help from his old crew and hindrances from Captain Wallace B. Binghampton, who sank a cruise liner a while back, McHale tries to put Vladikov out of business.', 'Retired Lieutenant Commander Quinton McHale spends his days puttering around the Caribbean in the old PT-73 selling homebrew, ice cream, and swimsuit calendars. He''s brought out of retirement when his old nemesis turned the second best terrorist in the world, Major Vladikov, takes over the island of San Moreno and starts building a nuclear launch silo on it. With help from his old crew and hindrances from Captain Wallace B. Binghampton, who sank a cruise liner a while back, McHale tries to put Vladikov out of business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg9qzqF349j526pNZnjPB4p2UED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14908'),
  ('373631961896251790', 'McLaren', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Roger Donaldson, Robyn Grace', 'Matthew Metcalfe, Glenn Standring', 'Dwayne Cameron, Bruce McLaren, Mario Andretti, Alastair Caldwell, Jackie Stewart, Dan Gurney, Emerson Fittipaldi, Howden Ganley', null, 'The story of New Zealander Bruce McLaren, who founded the McLaren Motor Racing team, showing the world that a man of humble beginnings could take on the elite of motor racing and win.', 'The story of New Zealander Bruce McLaren, who founded the McLaren Motor Racing team, showing the world that a man of humble beginnings could take on the elite of motor racing and win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvGipOPJ03Vfqte6jhC6qRppNiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419192'),
  ('945403034178914187', 'McLintock!', 1963, 'Western, Comedy', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, William H. Clothier, Frank Parmenter', 'James Edward Grant', 'John Wayne, Maureen O''Hara, Patrick Wayne, Stefanie Powers, Jack Kruschen, Chill Wills, Yvonne De Carlo, Jerry Van Dyke', 'NR', 'Aging rancher and self-made man, George Washington McLintock is forced to deal with numerous personal and professional problems. Seemingly everyone wants a piece of his enormous farmstead, including high-ranking government men and nearby Native Americans. As McLintock tries to juggle his various adversaries, his wife—who left him two years previously—suddenly returns. But she isn''t interested in George; she wants custody of their daughter.', 'Aging rancher and self-made man, George Washington McLintock is forced to deal with numerous personal and professional problems. Seemingly everyone wants a piece of his enormous farmstead, including high-ranking government men and nearby Native Americans. As McLintock tries to juggle his various adversaries, his wife—who left him two years previously—suddenly returns. But she isn''t interested in George; she wants custody of their daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjaAtWJqGomsE5qNQStHcHhSzES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15263'),
  ('638022574162248349', 'McMansion', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joaquín Mazón, Chiqui Palma, Alex Martín', 'Roberto Jiménez', 'Pablo Chiapella, Raquel Guerrero, María Córdoba, Iñaki Miramón, Edurne, Nerea Pascual, Álvaro Lafuente, Noah Casas', null, 'A family of five living in 50 square meters without air conditioning on a scorching summer day decides that perhaps the best option is to stay overnight in the empty ''mansion'' where the father works as a gardener.', 'A family of five living in 50 square meters without air conditioning on a scorching summer day decides that perhaps the best option is to stay overnight in the empty ''mansion'' where the father works as a gardener.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/godwprYhs8weMqDEA1iI3bJmm6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1336928'),
  ('674845273578417392', 'McQ', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Sturges, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Lawrence Roman', 'John Wayne, Eddie Albert, Diana Muldaur, Colleen Dewhurst, Clu Gulager, David Huddleston, Julian Christopher, Al Lettieri', 'PG', 'Police Lieutenant Lon McQ investigates the killing of his best friend and uncovers corrupt elements of the police department dealing in confiscated drugs.', 'Police Lieutenant Lon McQ investigates the killing of his best friend and uncovers corrupt elements of the police department dealing in confiscated drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2s6ti9dFmqqxd9HvWmegAsC92p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26185'),
  ('1075134514263121680', 'McQueen', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Ian Bonhôte, Will Pugh, Peter Ettedgui', 'Peter Ettedgui', 'Bernard Arnault, Joseph Bennett, Magdalena Frackowiak, Jodie Kidd, Kate Moss', 'R', 'Alexander McQueen''s rags-to-riches story is a modern-day fairy tale, laced with the gothic. Mirroring the savage beauty, boldness and vivacity of his design, this documentary is an intimate revelation of McQueen''s own world, both tortured and inspired, which celebrates a radical and mesmerizing genius of profound influence.', 'Alexander McQueen''s rags-to-riches story is a modern-day fairy tale, laced with the gothic. Mirroring the savage beauty, boldness and vivacity of his design, this documentary is an intimate revelation of McQueen''s own world, both tortured and inspired, which celebrates a radical and mesmerizing genius of profound influence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bc5kAqhNfLitH7zMlLvLRbxV0xD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508003'),
  ('816514517060591631', 'McVicar', 1980, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tom Clegg, Vernon Layton', 'Tom Clegg', 'Roger Daltrey, Adam Faith, Cheryl Campbell, Billy Murray, Georgina Hale, Steven Berkoff, Brian Hall, Malcolm Tierney', null, 'John McVicar was a London Bad Boy. he graduated to armed bank robbery and was Britain''s "Public Enemy No. 1". He was captured and put into a high security prison. Will even the highest security prison be able to hold him? This is the true story of his life, his criminal exploits and his eventual rehabilitation.', 'John McVicar was a London Bad Boy. he graduated to armed bank robbery and was Britain''s "Public Enemy No. 1". He was captured and put into a high security prison. Will even the highest security prison be able to hold him? This is the true story of his life, his criminal exploits and his eventual rehabilitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oA2yUKbEKRMEtinpMtcRQsm0nt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38539'),
  ('215163383967481034', 'McWalter', 2025, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Simon Astier, Andreas Meszaros, Augustine Girard', 'Yvick Letexier, Vincent Tirel, Freddy Gladieux', 'Yvick Letexier, Géraldine Nakache, William Lebghil, Vincent Dedienne, François Berléand, Simon Astier, Delphine Baril, Freddy Gladieux', null, 'McWalter, a legendary American elite agent, is falsely accused of a series of attacks all around the globe. Determined to clear his name, he goes on the run to solve the mystery, thwart a earthwise conspiracy, and save the world…', 'McWalter, a legendary American elite agent, is falsely accused of a series of attacks all around the globe. Determined to clear his name, he goes on the run to solve the mystery, thwart a earthwise conspiracy, and save the world…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCpkLB39ZOaQMWJcAuYYdhZYe8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301072'),
  ('576165414628569997', 'Me & Marilyn', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Federica Ciciarelli, Mark Melville', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Suzie Kennedy, Biagio Izzo, Barbara Tabita, Rocco Papaleo, Marta Gastini, Francesco Pannofino, Francesco Guccini', null, 'During a séance with some friends, divorced carny Gualtiero successfully conjures the spirit of Marilyn Monroe, who''ll help him win his family back.', 'During a séance with some friends, divorced carny Gualtiero successfully conjures the spirit of Marilyn Monroe, who''ll help him win his family back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3EjXnlSrL5vu83BC0emUFgtwLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52124'),
  ('73940359431003144', 'Me & Roboco: The Movie', 2025, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Michihiro Satou, Akitaro Daichi, Kazuya Tanaka', 'Sayuri Oba', 'Shun Matsuo, Minami Tsuda, Shigeru Chiba, Sumire Uesaka, Masako Nozawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Hirofumi Nojima, Kenji Nojima', null, 'While Roboco is having fun showing off her signature knee impersonations in a nearby vacant lot, Bondo notices something and turns around. Not only does he sense that something unusual is about to happen, he also sees Roboco as if she is enveloping him and the others...!?', 'While Roboco is having fun showing off her signature knee impersonations in a nearby vacant lot, Bondo notices something and turns around. Not only does he sense that something unusual is about to happen, he also sees Roboco as if she is enveloping him and the others...!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42vqRpZFCEepFIesludCFLZmUP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148706'),
  ('365040002615606609', 'Me & The Beasts', 2021, 'Drama, Music, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Nico Manzano, Orangel Lugo, Victoria Rodrín', 'Nico Manzano', 'Jesús Nunes, Gael Gaviota, Eduardo Bol, Gabriel Agüero, Carolina Leandro, Estefania Quijada, Irving Coronel, Jesús Carreño', null, 'When the alternative rock band Los Pijamistas agrees to play at Suena Caracas 2016, a propaganda festival organized by the Nicolás Maduro regime, the patience of guitarist and singer Andrés Bravo reaches a limit. He leaves the band and starts his solo project from scratch. The severe symptoms of the crisis and an alienated environment will break his armor. However, he will not be alone: The Beasts, two masked and mysterious beings, will accompany him along the way.', 'When the alternative rock band Los Pijamistas agrees to play at Suena Caracas 2016, a propaganda festival organized by the Nicolás Maduro regime, the patience of guitarist and singer Andrés Bravo reaches a limit. He leaves the band and starts his solo project from scratch. The severe symptoms of the crisis and an alienated environment will break his armor. However, he will not be alone: The Beasts, two masked and mysterious beings, will accompany him along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVxxRGYaQj0z0uGY1ZSYHqxFS9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764521'),
  ('1007382986608712790', 'Me & You', 2012, 'Drama', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Barbara Melega, Fabio Cianchetti', 'Francesca Marciano, Umberto Contarello, Bernardo Bertolucci', 'Jacopo Olmo Antinori, Tea Falco, Sonia Bergamasco, Veronica Lazăr, Tommaso Ragno, Pippo Delbono, Carlo Cozzani, Alessandra Vanzi', null, 'An introverted teenager tells his parents he is going on a ski trip, but instead spends his time alone in his mom''s basement. But things didn''t go as planned after his half sister joins him.', 'An introverted teenager tells his parents he is going on a ski trip, but instead spends his time alone in his mom''s basement. But things didn''t go as planned after his half sister joins him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvwPVIo33VT192KRx4aBiWTQ5Fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119360'),
  ('85870159168074209', 'Me and Charly', 1978, 'Drama', 'Henning Kristiansen, Morten Arnfred', 'Morten Arnfred, Henning Kristiansen', 'Allan Olsen, Kim Jensen, Ghita Nørby, Jens Okking, Else Højgaard, Erno Müller, Per Pallesen, Johnny Olsen', null, 'Steffen is a good kid, a teenager who has recently finished school and is looking for work. He lives with his widowed mother, a newspaper reporter. Very little throws him off his stride, whether it is his girlfriend''s jealousy of his friendship with Charly, a reform-school boy, or his mother''s drunken, playful amorousness one night, because he reminds her of his father.', 'Steffen is a good kid, a teenager who has recently finished school and is looking for work. He lives with his widowed mother, a newspaper reporter. Very little throws him off his stride, whether it is his girlfriend''s jealousy of his friendship with Charly, a reform-school boy, or his mother''s drunken, playful amorousness one night, because he reminds her of his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXbpAHpLrQYeTynBwU4bVgG3TJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76312'),
  ('124381882882742397', 'Me and Earl and the Dying Girl', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chung Chung-hoon, Alfonso Gomez-Rejon, Dana Zolli', 'Jesse Andrews', 'Olivia Cooke, Thomas Mann, RJ Cyler, Connie Britton, Nick Offerman, Molly Shannon, Jon Bernthal, Chelsea Zhang', 'PG-13', 'Greg is coasting through senior year of high school as anonymously as possible, avoiding social interactions like the plague while secretly making spirited, bizarre films with Earl, his only friend. But both his anonymity and friendship threaten to unravel when his mother forces him to befriend a classmate with leukemia.', 'Greg is coasting through senior year of high school as anonymously as possible, avoiding social interactions like the plague while secretly making spirited, bizarre films with Earl, his only friend. But both his anonymity and friendship threaten to unravel when his mother forces him to befriend a classmate with leukemia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLjS2bLMjln2n2I73Xu6TaANPDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308369'),
  ('1079308443845385507', 'Me and Him', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Howard McMaster, Julie A. Bloom, Debbie DeVilla', 'Warren Leight', 'Griffin Dunne, Ellen Greene, Kelly Bishop, Carey Lowell, Kim Flowers, Bill Raymond, David Alan Grier, Kara Glover', 'R', 'A man''s enthusiastic penis starts talking to him, getting him into awkward situations and convincing everyone he tells that he''s completely insane.', 'A man''s enthusiastic penis starts talking to him, getting him into awkward situations and convincing everyone he tells that he''s completely insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51l2wBTxizULfzDfOnCDIqPuMn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252407'),
  ('81683930775001255', 'Me and Kaminski', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Becker, Jürgen Jürges', 'Wolfgang Becker, Thomas Wendrich', 'Daniel Brühl, Jesper Christensen, Amira Casar, Geraldine Chaplin, Denis Lavant, Bruno Cathomas, Jördis Triebel, Jan Decleir', null, 'Young journalist Sebastian Zöllner is writing an article on artist Manuel Kaminski. Zöllner hopes that Kaminski dies soon, so that he can cash in on his article.', 'Young journalist Sebastian Zöllner is writing an article on artist Manuel Kaminski. Zöllner hopes that Kaminski dies soon, so that he can cash in on his article.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jr5E9HuBdttsF9t7ceiAyEeTXZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277968'),
  ('469698136670872179', 'Me and Me', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jung Jin-young, Kim Hyun-seok, Song Dong-kyu', 'Jung Jin-young', 'Cho Jin-woong, Bae Soo-bin, Jung Hae-kyun, Cha Soo-yeon, Lee Sun-bin, Shin Dong-mi, Jang Won-young, Sin Gang-gyun', null, 'In a small South Korean village, while investigating the death of two people in strange circumstances, a grumpy policeman will live an overwhelming experience beyond the reality he has known so far.', 'In a small South Korean village, while investigating the death of two people in strange circumstances, a grumpy policeman will live an overwhelming experience beyond the reality he has known so far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9JGHjlffcK8eEiXQkECWxSWc6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581529'),
  ('210596676471090334', 'Me and Morrison', 2001, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Lenka Hellstedt, Mark Stubbs, Jouni Mutanen', 'Marko Leino', 'Irina Björklund, Samuli Edelmann, Roope Karisto, Eva Röse, Titta Jokinen, Yorick van Wageningen, Baltasar Kormákur, Irina Pulkka', null, 'A bittersweet tale of a love affair between two people whose lives seem to have lost all direction. The female lead, Milla, is drifting aimlessly through life until she meets Aki. They fall in love - but happiness in a relationship shadowed by crime and drugs is not necessarily a given. The movie is based on the novel Minä ja Morrison by first-time author Kata Kärkkäinen', 'A bittersweet tale of a love affair between two people whose lives seem to have lost all direction. The female lead, Milla, is drifting aimlessly through life until she meets Aki. They fall in love - but happiness in a relationship shadowed by crime and drugs is not necessarily a given. The movie is based on the novel Minä ja Morrison by first-time author Kata Kärkkäinen', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ShXVJoJBoHqtnCJCcFgFrDAFe8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53503'),
  ('939037456154418510', 'Me and My Gal', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Raoul Walsh, Horace Hough, Arthur C. Miller', 'Arthur Kober', 'Spencer Tracy, Joan Bennett, Marion Burns, George Walsh, J. Farrell MacDonald, Noel Madison, Henry B. Walthall, Bert Hanlon', 'NR', 'Jaunty young policeman Danny Dolan falls in love with waterfront cafe waitress Helen Riley.', 'Jaunty young policeman Danny Dolan falls in love with waterfront cafe waitress Helen Riley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAPxl1vECf3hmyX1W4juWd2Fzil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84337'),
  ('691248386963634277', 'Me and My Pal', 1933, 'Comedy', 'Charley Rogers, Lloyd French', 'Stan Laurel, Frank Terry, Oliver Hardy', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Marion Bardell, Billy Bletcher, Charlie Hall', 'NR', 'On the morning of his wedding to oil baron Peter Cucumber''s daughter, Ollie receives a jigsaw puzzle from Stan as a wedding gift. The boys soon become absorbed in the puzzle. A taxi driver, butler, policeman and messenger boy join in as well.', 'On the morning of his wedding to oil baron Peter Cucumber''s daughter, Ollie receives a jigsaw puzzle from Stan as a wedding gift. The boys soon become absorbed in the puzzle. A taxi driver, butler, policeman and messenger boy join in as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuteJlfqLIr26BzJGWEFX8zJ69Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48830'),
  ('896323928866297271', 'Me and My Sister', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alexandra Leclère, Michel Amathieu', 'Alexandra Leclère', 'Isabelle Huppert, Catherine Frot, François Berléand, Brigitte Catillon, Michel Vuillermoz, Christiane Millet, Rose Thiéry, Bruno Chiche', null, 'Louise, who has just written a novel, comes to Paris to meet with a potential publisher. While in the city, she stays with her older sister, Martine, who in many ways is the exact opposite of Louise: she lives in a fashionable neighborhood, is cold to others, and has snobby friends, while Louise lives in a small town and is thoroughly unpretentious. Louise''s apparent happiness -- and similarities to their mother -- gradually gets on Martine''s nerves.', 'Louise, who has just written a novel, comes to Paris to meet with a potential publisher. While in the city, she stays with her older sister, Martine, who in many ways is the exact opposite of Louise: she lives in a fashionable neighborhood, is cold to others, and has snobby friends, while Louise lives in a small town and is thoroughly unpretentious. Louise''s apparent happiness -- and similarities to their mother -- gradually gets on Martine''s nerves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2obYnhA22UMOtwhMHLZVCNTRL4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1935'),
  ('377926916074268369', 'Me and My Umbrella', 2010, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Toni Vanzolini', 'Adriana Falcão, Marcelo Gonçalves, Bernardo Guilherme', 'Lucas Cotrim, Victor Froiman, Rafaela Victor, Daniel Dantas, Camila Amado, Mariana Lima, Raul Barretto, Orã Figueiredo', null, 'Eugênio (Lucas Cotrim) é um garoto de 11 anos que jamais se separa do guarda chuva herdado de seu avô. No último dia de férias ele e Cebola (Victor Froiman), seu melhor amigo, precisam entrar na sombria casa onde fica sua nova escola. O motivo é para resgatar Frida (Rafaela Victor), a grande paixão de Eugênio, que foi sequestrada pelo fantasma do Barão Von Staffen (Daniel Dantas)', 'Eugênio (Lucas Cotrim) é um garoto de 11 anos que jamais se separa do guarda chuva herdado de seu avô. No último dia de férias ele e Cebola (Victor Froiman), seu melhor amigo, precisam entrar na sombria casa onde fica sua nova escola. O motivo é para resgatar Frida (Rafaela Victor), a grande paixão de Eugênio, que foi sequestrada pelo fantasma do Barão Von Staffen (Daniel Dantas)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyfNyuKNIQeXreMSZ2Est6azY3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65105'),
  ('796616744428146205', 'Me and Orson Welles', 2008, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Richard Linklater, Dick Pope', 'Holly Gent, Vincent Palmo Jr.', 'Zac Efron, Christian McKay, Claire Danes, Ben Chaplin, Zoe Kazan, Eddie Marsan, Kelly Reilly, James Tupper', 'PG-13', 'New York, 1937. A teenager hired to star in Orson Welles'' production of Julius Caesar becomes attracted to a career-driven production assistant.', 'New York, 1937. A teenager hired to star in Orson Welles'' production of Julius Caesar becomes attracted to a career-driven production assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jU7KFn4O1HLgzj9WkkmBkzJNPlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12404'),
  ('958984626949383360', 'Me and the Colonel', 1958, 'Comedy, War', 'Peter Glenville, Burnett Guffey', 'S. N. Behrman, George Froeschel', 'Danny Kaye, Curd Jürgens, Nicole Maurey, Françoise Rosay, Akim Tamiroff, Martita Hunt, Alexander Scourby, Liliane Montevecchi', null, 'Nazis are about to overrun France, and a Jewish man named Jacobowsky is stranded in Paris. He hitches a ride with reluctant Polish serviceman Colonel Prokoszny, who harbors a bias against Jews. They are soon joined by Prokoszny''s bride-to-be, Suzanne, who takes an immediate liking to the engaging Jacobowsky. This furthers the hostility between Jacobowsky and Prokoszny, but they must put their differences aside to evade the Nazis trailing them.', 'Nazis are about to overrun France, and a Jewish man named Jacobowsky is stranded in Paris. He hitches a ride with reluctant Polish serviceman Colonel Prokoszny, who harbors a bias against Jews. They are soon joined by Prokoszny''s bride-to-be, Suzanne, who takes an immediate liking to the engaging Jacobowsky. This furthers the hostility between Jacobowsky and Prokoszny, but they must put their differences aside to evade the Nazis trailing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9Dz3TbEhc9v4w08IapLtIFjdeu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114060'),
  ('544199136765689977', 'Me and the Mafia', 1973, 'Comedy, Family', 'Henning Ørnbak', 'Lise Nørgaard', 'Dirch Passer, Klaus Pagh, Tove Maës, Poul Bundgaard, Jørgen Kiil, Ann-Mari Max Hansen, Vera Gebuhr, Anette Karlsen', null, 'Charming con artist Victor "Viffer" Hansen and his friend Richard Abelsteen pull off a million-dollar scam in Sweden. Disguised as Swedish diplomats representing the royal family, they swindle Italian businessman Vittorio Fercci out of 10 million Swedish kronor by arranging a marriage between the king and Vittorio''s daughter Marcellina.', 'Charming con artist Victor "Viffer" Hansen and his friend Richard Abelsteen pull off a million-dollar scam in Sweden. Disguised as Swedish diplomats representing the royal family, they swindle Italian businessman Vittorio Fercci out of 10 million Swedish kronor by arranging a marriage between the king and Vittorio''s daughter Marcellina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19TErhNqVv31oypAIRt2YYgWqLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46714'),
  ('409471919880644640', 'Me and Will', 1999, 'Drama', 'Sherrie Rose, Melissa Behr, Joey Forsyte', 'Melissa Behr, Sherrie Rose', 'Sherrie Rose, Melissa Behr, Patrick Dempsey, Seymour Cassel, Grace Zabriskie, M. Emmet Walsh, Billy Wirth, Johnny Whitworth', 'R', 'Two women with a passion for motorcycles meet while going through rehab. When they discover they''ve both longed to ride Captain America''s red, white, and blue chopper from Easy Rider, they escape the rehab clinic and hit the highway in search of their dream bike.', 'Two women with a passion for motorcycles meet while going through rehab. When they discover they''ve both longed to ride Captain America''s red, white, and blue chopper from Easy Rider, they escape the rehab clinic and hit the highway in search of their dream bike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jEAAeZjfQGFXVOVTR1wyGdfbEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45264'),
  ('524467772763430155', 'Me and You and Everyone We Know', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miranda July, Chuy Chávez, Erinn McCormack', 'Miranda July', 'Miranda July, John Hawkes, Brandon Ratcliff, Miles Thompson, Carlie Westerman, Brad William Henke, Natasha Slayton, Najarra Townsend', 'R', 'Single dad Richard meets Christine, a starving artist who moonlights as a cabbie. They awkwardly attempt to start a romance, but Richard’s divorce has left him emotionally damaged. Meanwhile, Richard’s sons—one a teenager, the other 6-years-old—take part in clumsy experiments with the opposite sex.', 'Single dad Richard meets Christine, a starving artist who moonlights as a cabbie. They awkwardly attempt to start a romance, but Richard’s divorce has left him emotionally damaged. Meanwhile, Richard’s sons—one a teenager, the other 6-years-old—take part in clumsy experiments with the opposite sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrj9VsInHnqSDBhEc2FvY0qd79F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1382'),
  ('767321603928207077', 'Me Before You', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Thea Sharrock, Remi Adefarasin, Nick Dent', 'Scott Neustadter, Jojo Moyes, Michael H. Weber', 'Emilia Clarke, Sam Claflin, Janet McTeer, Charles Dance, Brendan Coyle, Jenna Coleman, Matthew Lewis, Samantha Spiro', 'PG-13', 'Lou Clark, a directionless 26-year-old from the English countryside, takes a job at the local castle as a caregiver and companion to a wealthy young banker, Will Traynor. Wheelchair-bound from an accident two years prior, the once adventurous Will has all but given up — that is until Lou determines to show him that life is worth living.', 'Lou Clark, a directionless 26-year-old from the English countryside, takes a job at the local castle as a caregiver and companion to a wealthy young banker, Will Traynor. Wheelchair-bound from an accident two years prior, the once adventurous Will has all but given up — that is until Lou determines to show him that life is worth living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ia3dzj5LnCj1ZBdlVeJrbKJQxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296096'),
  ('569657618833277431', 'Me casé con un idiota', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Batan Silva', 'Alejandra Cárdenas', 'Paulina Gaitán, Alfonso Herrera, Andrés Almeida, Harding Junior, Lucía Uribe, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Mauricio Barrientos, Rodrigo Murray', null, 'A woman falls in love with a man in a set and eventually gets married, however she realizes she fell in love of the character and wants to leave him, when the man realizes about it, he does everything he can to get her back.', 'A woman falls in love with a man in a set and eventually gets married, however she realizes she fell in love of the character and wants to leave him, when the man realizes about it, he does everything he can to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFOOlBp7BkVO1V7xaX3gHkdLWDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660643'),
  ('763662291026223250', 'Me contro Te: Il film - Missione giungla', 2023, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Gianluca Leuzzi, Vito Trecarichi, Luca Anastasio', 'Andrea Boin, Luigi Calagna, Sofia Scalia', 'Sofia Scalia, Luigi Calagna, Nicola Pavese, Angelica Furlato, Gennaro Pelliccia, Martina Palmitesta, Massimiliano Vado, Gianluca Briganti', null, 'After their adventures in Ancient Egypt, Luì and Sofì just want to rest, but a new threat looms over the Earth. A magical spring hidden in the jungle holds the key to undoing all the world''s spells, but if tainted, it can turn the Earth into a barren, lifeless wasteland. Viperiana has discovered this and with the help of her faithful Serpe servant has already started mixing enchanted potions in the spring that turn the water purple; it will only take a few days for everything to be irreversibly poisoned. A fight against time begins for Luì and Sofì who, together with Pongo''s assistant and accompanied by the guide Serenino and Tara, daughter of the Pesantosi tribal chief, will have to decipher the map that will lead them to the magical spring and foil Viperiana''s diabolical plan . But they have to be careful, because an unexpected enemy lurks among them.', 'After their adventures in Ancient Egypt, Luì and Sofì just want to rest, but a new threat looms over the Earth. A magical spring hidden in the jungle holds the key to undoing all the world''s spells, but if tainted, it can turn the Earth into a barren, lifeless wasteland. Viperiana has discovered this and with the help of her faithful Serpe servant has already started mixing enchanted potions in the spring that turn the water purple; it will only take a few days for everything to be irreversibly poisoned. A fight against time begins for Luì and Sofì who, together with Pongo''s assistant and accompanied by the guide Serenino and Tara, daughter of the Pesantosi tribal chief, will have to decipher the map that will lead them to the magical spring and foil Viperiana''s diabolical plan . But they have to be careful, because an unexpected enemy lurks among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqhW1TH09EOACM1eNvyjYZrFwY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955659'),
