  ('111275992132505461', 'Me gusta, pero me asusta', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Beto Gómez, Jerry Garay', 'Aurora Jauregui, Alfonso Suárez, Beto Gómez', 'Alejandro Speitzer, Minnie West, Joaquín Cosío, Marlene Favela, Camila Selser, Lisette Morelos, Hector Kotsifakis, Silverio Palacios', null, 'Brayan Rodriguez is an innocent heir to a criminal Sinaloa family sent to Mexico City to expand the business, and where he meets Claudia, and their worlds collide. Love and fun are everywhere.', 'Brayan Rodriguez is an innocent heir to a criminal Sinaloa family sent to Mexico City to expand the business, and where he meets Claudia, and their worlds collide. Love and fun are everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8YhZyktGdm13z4sOgOTy8ZfwCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476265'),
