  ('494990610155048323', 'Me Myself I', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pip Karmel', 'Pip Karmel', 'Rachel Griffiths, David Roberts, Sandy Winton, Yael Stone, Shaun Loseby, Trent Sullivan, Rebecca Frith, Christine Stephen-Daly', null, 'Pamela Drury is unhappy, and alone. On her birthday she stumbles across a photo of Robert Dickson, and wonders what would''ve happened had she said yes to his proposal. A freak accident causes Pamela to live out the life she could''ve had, but is the grass on the other side always greener?', 'Pamela Drury is unhappy, and alone. On her birthday she stumbles across a photo of Robert Dickson, and wonders what would''ve happened had she said yes to his proposal. A freak accident causes Pamela to live out the life she could''ve had, but is the grass on the other side always greener?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI8AjPZMeRKn5mQ7LD4uYTStTMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49721'),
  ('687306132831569921', 'Me or My Aunt', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Amr Hanafi, Sherif Ismail, Saeed Hamed', 'Ahmed Abdallah', 'Mohamed Henedi, Hassan Hosny, Donia Samir Ghanem, Lotfy Labib, Alaa Morsy, Nabil Issa, Hatem Gamil, Alaa Zinhom', null, 'Henedy plays Taimor, a Young man studies music. He loves his colleague and intends to marry her. Her mother, who believes in magic, refuses their marriage.', 'Henedy plays Taimor, a Young man studies music. He loves his colleague and intends to marry her. Her mother, who believes in magic, refuses their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etUDmMO1lobnCG5cqOAu8pJpj5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406854'),
  ('1068501353391323862', 'Me Sinto Bem Com Você', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Matheus Souza, Camila Cornelsen, Erica Coelho', 'Matheus Souza', 'Manu Gavassi, Matheus Souza, Clarissa Müller, Gabz, Richard Abelha, Amanda Benevides, Isabella Moreira, Thuany Parente', null, 'Five stories of love in times of quarantine. Five differently shaped love stories, from five different origins. Five stories about the importance of being with someone who makes you feel good in the midst of chaos. People, during these times of social isolation, doing everything possible to stay close. A film about connection: virtual and real.', 'Five stories of love in times of quarantine. Five differently shaped love stories, from five different origins. Five stories about the importance of being with someone who makes you feel good in the midst of chaos. People, during these times of social isolation, doing everything possible to stay close. A film about connection: virtual and real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXSukM1UOE5BDYkmvB3uyO3z4D6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828483'),
  ('1045408973783979839', 'Me Time', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ayla Yildiz', null, null, null, 'In this documentary, 6 protagonists tell their personal experiences of abortion and sterilization, from unplanned pregnancy to a happy mother and vice versa from the wanted child to regretting motherhood.', 'In this documentary, 6 protagonists tell their personal experiences of abortion and sterilization, from unplanned pregnancy to a happy mother and vice versa from the wanted child to regretting motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ux1r6p43tCLDvsb4CCrL3UP13aX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980417'),
  ('1110430959636933406', 'Me Too', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Antonio Naharro, Álvaro Pastor, Alfonso Postigo', 'Antonio Naharro, Álvaro Pastor', 'Lola Dueñas, Pablo Pineda, Isabel García Lorca, Antonio Naharro, Pedro Álvarez-Ossorio, María Bravo, Consuelo Trujillo, Joaquín Perles', null, 'Daniel, a recent university graduate with Down''s Syndrome falls in love on his first day at work in the Department of Social Services. Laura is an outsider who spends her nights in the city''s crowded clubs and singles'' bars, escaping her problems in the arms of total strangers. Yet despite their apparent incompatibility, the two strike up a moving, bittersweet friendship that touches them both and eventually sets them on the road to happiness.', 'Daniel, a recent university graduate with Down''s Syndrome falls in love on his first day at work in the Department of Social Services. Laura is an outsider who spends her nights in the city''s crowded clubs and singles'' bars, escaping her problems in the arms of total strangers. Yet despite their apparent incompatibility, the two strike up a moving, bittersweet friendship that touches them both and eventually sets them on the road to happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guwpvXtvhITzhoPYmxW121bhGmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45765'),
  ('878552648703631133', 'Me Too', 2012, 'Drama', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Aleksandr Simonov, Stanislav Mikheyev', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Aleksandr Mosin, Oleg Garkusha, Yuri Matveev, Alisa Shitikova, Aleksei Balabanov, Pyotr Balabanov, Viktor Gorbunov, Avdotya Smirnova', null, 'Five passengers - the Bandit, his friend Matvei, Matvei''s old father, the Musician, and a young woman - race along an empty road in a big black jeep, searching for the Belfry of Happiness which, according to hearsay, lies somewhere between St. Petersburg and the town of Uglich, near a deserted nuclear power station. The Belfry takes people, but it does not take everyone. Each of the five passengers believes that he or she will be chosen.', 'Five passengers - the Bandit, his friend Matvei, Matvei''s old father, the Musician, and a young woman - race along an empty road in a big black jeep, searching for the Belfry of Happiness which, according to hearsay, lies somewhere between St. Petersburg and the town of Uglich, near a deserted nuclear power station. The Belfry takes people, but it does not take everyone. Each of the five passengers believes that he or she will be chosen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRyRJjtFgWQKXz94SJzvMhexexq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127236'),
  ('165822475787559679', 'Me Two', 2008, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Nicolas Charlet, Bruno Lavaine, Laurent Dailland', 'Nicolas Charlet, Bruno Lavaine', 'Daniel Auteuil, Alain Chabat, Marina Foïs, François Damiens, Frédéric Beigbeder, Édith Le Merdy, Denis Maréchal, Fred Tousch', null, '80''s pop icon Gilles Gabriel is about to make a comeback in the French music scene, until he accidentally hits Ranu, a slightly nutty accountant, when out driving one day. Both are horrified to realise that Gilles died in the crash, and that his spirit now lives in Ranu''s head! The kooky accountant''s life soon becomes chaos!', '80''s pop icon Gilles Gabriel is about to make a comeback in the French music scene, until he accidentally hits Ranu, a slightly nutty accountant, when out driving one day. Both are horrified to realise that Gilles died in the crash, and that his spirit now lives in Ranu''s head! The kooky accountant''s life soon becomes chaos!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd3ev4I518cqWhGdYiMKVB2nuyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14408'),
  ('750956533640405897', 'Me vuelves loca', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Boris Quercia', 'Guillermo Amoedo', 'Aislinn Derbez, Minnie West, Alejandro de la Madrid, Elizabeth Guindi, Tamara Acosta, Paz Bascuñan, Giovanna Romo, Loreto Aravena', null, 'Carolina has a perfect life: she lives in a luxurious house, works in a fashion magazine and is married to a successful publicist. One day everything goes to waste: she discovers that she is sterile, the same day that her husband leaves her for her best friend, who, in addition, is pregnant with him. After the impact of this news, Carolina has a crisis, drinks too much, trips and falls from the second floor of her house, a fact that is interpreted as a suicide attempt.Carolina is interned against her will, in the exclusive psychiatric center Eden. In that place she will meet a group of "madmen" who will help her heal and glimpse that her previous life was not so perfect. He also discovers that perhaps the craziest are those outside the psychiatric hospital.', 'Carolina has a perfect life: she lives in a luxurious house, works in a fashion magazine and is married to a successful publicist. One day everything goes to waste: she discovers that she is sterile, the same day that her husband leaves her for her best friend, who, in addition, is pregnant with him. After the impact of this news, Carolina has a crisis, drinks too much, trips and falls from the second floor of her house, a fact that is interpreted as a suicide attempt.Carolina is interned against her will, in the exclusive psychiatric center Eden. In that place she will meet a group of "madmen" who will help her heal and glimpse that her previous life was not so perfect. He also discovers that perhaps the craziest are those outside the psychiatric hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQeyfqLEDdY6x4P4Fl5r6jcstN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175306'),
  ('1052288589678267037', 'Me Without You', 2001, 'Drama', 'Sandra Goldbacher, Denis Crossan, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Sandra Goldbacher, Laurence Coriat', 'Anna Friel, Michelle Williams, Oliver Milburn, Trudie Styler, Marianne Denicourt, Steve John Shepherd, Allan Corduner, Nicky Henson', 'R', 'During a long, hot summer in seventies London, young neighbors Holly and Marina make a childhood pact to be friends forever. For Marina, troubled, fiercely independent, determined to try everything, Holly stays the only constant in a life of divorcing parents, experimental drugs and fashionable self-destruction. But for Holly, a friendship that has never been equal gradually starts to feel like a trap.', 'During a long, hot summer in seventies London, young neighbors Holly and Marina make a childhood pact to be friends forever. For Marina, troubled, fiercely independent, determined to try everything, Holly stays the only constant in a life of divorcing parents, experimental drugs and fashionable self-destruction. But for Holly, a friendship that has never been equal gradually starts to feel like a trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/424IEKHWFSH9TNBzNLcwCVzjpDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26290'),
  ('203226968407897166', 'Me You Madness', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Boa Simon, Reinhart Peschke, Louise Linton', 'Kristen Ruhlin, Louise Linton', 'Louise Linton, Ed Westwick, Shuya Chang, Joel Michaely, Grant Goodman, Gwen Van Dam, Seth Coltan, Tyler Barnes', null, 'Beautiful, ruthlessly ambitious, intelligent, and successful businesswoman Catherine Black lives a life of luxury in an architectural dream house in Malibu with exclusive designer fashions, fast cars, and exquisite jewelry. She has no need for a man except to satisfy her natural serial killer instinct, literally. When Tyler, a petty thief, responds to her online roommate ad, he thinks he''s struck gold. But he has no idea that after a night of partying and passion, he is really just on her menu to be her next victim… until real romance gets in the way.', 'Beautiful, ruthlessly ambitious, intelligent, and successful businesswoman Catherine Black lives a life of luxury in an architectural dream house in Malibu with exclusive designer fashions, fast cars, and exquisite jewelry. She has no need for a man except to satisfy her natural serial killer instinct, literally. When Tyler, a petty thief, responds to her online roommate ad, he thinks he''s struck gold. But he has no idea that after a night of partying and passion, he is really just on her menu to be her next victim… until real romance gets in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l48b4R6m9VZ1ArvlFHtlDJnz7PE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706646'),
  ('737297171024225801', 'Me, a Groupie', 1970, 'Music, Drama', 'Erwin C. Dietrich, Jack Hill, Peter Baumgartner', 'Jack Hill, Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Ingrid Steeger, Vivian Weiss, Rolf Eden, Stewart West, Petra Prinz, Li Paelz, Terry Mason, Sharon Richardson', null, 'A beautiful blonde hooks up with a rock star, and after a night of sex and drugs, he leaves. She, though, has fallen madly in love with him, and sets out with her girlfriend across Europe to track him down. On the way, however, she gets mixed up with everyone from a gang of nasty bikers to a ring of devil worshipers.', 'A beautiful blonde hooks up with a rock star, and after a night of sex and drugs, he leaves. She, though, has fallen madly in love with him, and sets out with her girlfriend across Europe to track him down. On the way, however, she gets mixed up with everyone from a gang of nasty bikers to a ring of devil worshipers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ciR39wiV4SOzPkrLlIiQw9ySBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143983'),
  ('980851216325571372', 'Me, Grandma, Iliko and Ilarion', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Vasili Dolenko, Giorgi Kalatozishvili', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Nodar Dumbadze', 'Soso Ordjonikidze, Sesilia Takaishvili, Aleksandre Jorjoliani, Grigol Tkabladze, Manana Abazadze, Kira Andronikashvili, Tengiz Daushvili, Ioseb Gogichaishvili', null, 'The residents of a Georgian village bungle their way through war, peace, life and death.', 'The residents of a Georgian village bungle their way through war, peace, life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSOcksuHjddOOj7taME2YpwxGWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87248'),
  ('500441906162350059', 'Me, Me, Me... and the Others', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Isa Bartalini, Aldo Giordani', 'Ennio Flaiano, Giorgio Carlo Rossi, Libero Solaroli', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Silvana Mangano, Walter Chiari, Vittorio De Sica, Nino Manfredi, Marcello Mastroianni, Sylva Koscina, Marisa Merlini', null, 'Sandro is a well-known journalist and he is conducting a survey on human selfishness. Every man and every woman he meets turns into a theme for his inquiry. Even his own wife, Titta.', 'Sandro is a well-known journalist and he is conducting a survey on human selfishness. Every man and every woman he meets turns into a theme for his inquiry. Even his own wife, Titta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CDmzq3Xz3eNAdMrkjRGQAOiCyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58749'),
  ('1079415572606401391', 'Me, Myself & I: Lost in Time', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Gianluca Leuzzi, Vito Trecarichi, Anthony Steven Visciglia', 'Emanuela Canonico, Andrea Boin, Luigi Calagna', 'Sofia Scalia, Luigi Calagna, Michele Savoia, Pierpaolo Zizzi, Antonella Carone, Valentina Tomada, Fernando Di Virgilio, Andrea Garofalo', null, 'Luì is about to receive his diploma as a scientist until Mr. S and Perfidia will try to undermine the Me against You.', 'Luì is about to receive his diploma as a scientist until Mr. S and Perfidia will try to undermine the Me against You.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18URyTcpuJOrbPDrld9v4YGh8gk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839738'),
  ('1032573834394318467', 'Me, Myself & Irene', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Peter Farrelly, Bobby Farrelly, Mark Irwin', 'Peter Farrelly, Bobby Farrelly, Mike Cerrone', 'Jim Carrey, Renée Zellweger, Anthony Anderson, Mongo Brownlee, Jerod Mixon, Chris Cooper, Michael Bowman, Richard Jenkins', 'R', 'Rhode Island State Trooper Charlie Baileygates has a multiple personality disorder. One personality is crazy and aggressive, while the other is more friendly and laid back. Both of these personalities fall in love with the same woman named Irene after Charlie loses his medication.', 'Rhode Island State Trooper Charlie Baileygates has a multiple personality disorder. One personality is crazy and aggressive, while the other is more friendly and laid back. Both of these personalities fall in love with the same woman named Irene after Charlie loses his medication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvRrcbLbpn7UJGRH1JupgHOeJFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2123'),
  ('1025230196267876514', 'Me, Myself and Her', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Maria Sole Tognazzi, Arnaldo Catinari, Anna Elisabetta Conti', 'Chiara Sfregola, Ivan Cotroneo, Francesca Marciano', 'Margherita Buy, Sabrina Ferilli, Alessia Barela, Fausto Maria Sciarappa, Domenico Diele, Ennio Fantastichini, Massimiliano Gallo, Anna Bellato', null, 'Two women -- a restaurateur and an architect -- have a seemingly idyllic romantic relationship, until the latter encounters a man she had a fling with.', 'Two women -- a restaurateur and an architect -- have a seemingly idyllic romantic relationship, until the latter encounters a man she had a fling with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7pOEKuLGWqVz1ppJJ1nopYO0fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362155'),
  ('715699484048548061', 'Me, Myself and Mum', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Guillaume Gallienne, Glynn Speeckaert', 'Guillaume Gallienne, Nicolas Vassiliev, Claude Mathieu', 'Guillaume Gallienne, Françoise Fabian, André Marcon, Diane Kruger, Nanou Garcia, Götz Otto, Brigitte Catillon, Reda Kateb', null, 'How to become a man when your mother and your closed circle have decided otherwise? This is the challenge Guillaume took up. The film recounts Guillaume''s tragicomic battle from the young age of eight, as he adopts the role of a girl then of a homosexual... until, aged 30, he meets the woman who, after his mother, will become the other woman in his life. Beyond this story of a heterosexual coming-out, the film tells the tale of an actor who never stopped loving women, maybe even a little too much.', 'How to become a man when your mother and your closed circle have decided otherwise? This is the challenge Guillaume took up. The film recounts Guillaume''s tragicomic battle from the young age of eight, as he adopts the role of a girl then of a homosexual... until, aged 30, he meets the woman who, after his mother, will become the other woman in his life. Beyond this story of a heterosexual coming-out, the film tells the tale of an actor who never stopped loving women, maybe even a little too much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FunclNlH3HjMXrSWMFUHWGy4Pp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190880'),
  ('215087514859126172', 'Me, Myself and My Dead Wife', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Santi Amodeo', 'Santi Amodeo, Rafael Cobos', 'Oscar Martínez, Carlos Areces, Ingrid García Jonsson, Malena Solda, Cris Nollet, José Luis Adserías', null, 'Bernardo is a renowned architect and professor at the University of Buenos Aires. He just buried his wife, refusing to fulfill her desire to be cremated and her ashes scattered into “Costa del Sol”. Only when his wife’s grave is desecrated, he decides to take the trip to Spain. With Abel, owner of a bankrupt real estate business, and Amalia, a beautiful public relations employee, Bernardo will be involved in absurd situations to get rid of the ashes of his wife. Bernardo will discover that he didn’t know his wife as much as he imagined.', 'Bernardo is a renowned architect and professor at the University of Buenos Aires. He just buried his wife, refusing to fulfill her desire to be cremated and her ashes scattered into “Costa del Sol”. Only when his wife’s grave is desecrated, he decides to take the trip to Spain. With Abel, owner of a bankrupt real estate business, and Amalia, a beautiful public relations employee, Bernardo will be involved in absurd situations to get rid of the ashes of his wife. Bernardo will discover that he didn’t know his wife as much as he imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MiMQsE90f5yCbXUsaRuFae6mqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587981'),
  ('976774251783244986', 'Me, Natalie', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fred Coe, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'A. Martin Zweiback', 'Patty Duke, James Farentino, Martin Balsam, Nancy Marchand, Elsa Lanchester, Bob Balaban, Al Pacino, Salome Jens', null, 'Since she was a child, Natalie Miller has always thought she was an ugly ducking. Despite her mother''s encouragement that she will grow up to be pretty, Natalie has never believed it will happen. She runs away to Greenwich Village to find herself and discovers a vibrant bohemian counterculture.', 'Since she was a child, Natalie Miller has always thought she was an ugly ducking. Despite her mother''s encouragement that she will grow up to be pretty, Natalie has never believed it will happen. She runs away to Greenwich Village to find herself and discovers a vibrant bohemian counterculture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KAYtHlO618SmRqw10Q9QZSD8uf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181553'),
  ('746388032876204885', 'Me, Them and Lara', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Danilo Desideri, Carlo Verdone, Inti Carboni', 'Carlo Verdone, Francesca Marciano, Pasquale Plastino', 'Carlo Verdone, Laura Chiatti, Angela Finocchiaro, Anna Bonaiuto, Marco Giallini, Sergio Fiorentini, Agnese Claisse, Tamara Di Giulio', null, 'A priest, after spending years in humanitary missions in Africa, reunites with his family, which is in worse conditions than when he left, and above all meets a young lady who will make him doubt both himself and his faith.', 'A priest, after spending years in humanitary missions in Africa, reunites with his family, which is in worse conditions than when he left, and above all meets a young lady who will make him doubt both himself and his faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bu5KsogttEN2K5UlDeBiseD478W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36298'),
  ('78082629125642652', 'Me, You, Them', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrucha Waddington, Lamartine Ferreira, Kátia Lund', 'Elena Soarez', 'Regina Casé, Lima Duarte, Stênio Garcia, Luiz Carlos Vasconcelos, Nilda Spencer, Diogo Lopes, Helena Araújo, Iami Rebouças', null, 'A true story that comically depicts the relationship between an ordinary woman and her three husbands, who live in the same house in a poor and arid small village of the Brazilian northeast.', 'A true story that comically depicts the relationship between an ordinary woman and her three husbands, who live in the same house in a poor and arid small village of the Brazilian northeast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRpjzOjse06s4SOpH7ipAsqK0gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82103'),
  ('1131776811984352244', 'ME!ME!ME!', 2014, 'Animation, Music', 'Hibiki Yoshizaki', 'Hibiki Yoshizaki', 'Koichi Yamadera, Megumi Hayashibara', null, 'An anime-obsessed young man fantasizes about his favorite voluptuous heroines, but his sex-addled dream quickly transforms into a nightmare which threatens to consume him.', 'An anime-obsessed young man fantasizes about his favorite voluptuous heroines, but his sex-addled dream quickly transforms into a nightmare which threatens to consume him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqEuu3jrYMkbSakwUveP69AxsMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787561'),
  ('155837171392786841', 'Me... and My Bird', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Errikos Thalassinos', 'Lakis Mihailidis', 'Sotiris Moustakas, Maria Bonelou, Lakis Komninos, Thanos Papadopoulos, Vina Asiki, Kostas Palios, Kostas Bakalis, Kostas Karagiorgis', null, 'A photo reporter, shortly before leaving for a job in Cyprus, becomes unwittingly the recipient of a golden owl, who stole a gang from the archaeological museum, who are following him in order to take the owl back.', 'A photo reporter, shortly before leaving for a job in Cyprus, becomes unwittingly the recipient of a golden owl, who stole a gang from the archaeological museum, who are following him in order to take the owl back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0kKTbCybxyE8jaP2T4sk4aX9XY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422800'),
  ('1112369151510669259', 'Mea Culpa', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Fred Cavayé, Danny Elsen', 'Fred Cavayé, Guillaume Lemans', 'Vincent Lindon, Gilles Lellouche, Nadine Labaki, Gilles Cohen, Medi Sadoun, Velibor Topic, Cyril Lecomte, Sofia Essaïdi', null, 'Franck and Simon are both good cops. They work as partners. But their lives take a tailspin when Simon, driving drunk, causes a tragic car wreck. A few years later, out of the police, he is forced to take matters into his own hands when his family is in danger.', 'Franck and Simon are both good cops. They work as partners. But their lives take a tailspin when Simon, driving drunk, causes a tragic car wreck. A few years later, out of the police, he is forced to take matters into his own hands when his family is in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQMDe2GyxJsY8rePgySmVcawzc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248611'),
  ('1140390949353426167', 'Mea Culpa', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Cory Burmester, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Kelly Rowland, Trevante Rhodes, Sean Sagar, Nick Sagar, RonReaco Lee, Shannon Thornton, Angela Robinson, Kerry O''Malley', 'R', 'A criminal defense attorney must choose between family, duty and her own dangerous desires when she takes on the case of an artist accused of murder.', 'A criminal defense attorney must choose between family, duty and her own dangerous desires when she takes on the case of an artist accused of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roxD9VCTTXYfPjVj9HiSC5IMtc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090874'),
  ('479741255308194490', 'Mea Maxima Culpa: Silence in the House of God', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Lisa Rinzler', 'Alex Gibney', 'Jamey Sheridan, Chris Cooper, Ethan Hawke, John Slattery, Brady Bryson, Pius XI., Benito Mussolini, Rembert Weakland', null, 'Alex Gibney explores the charged issue of pedophilia in the Catholic Church, following a trail from the first known protest against clerical sexual abuse in the United States and all way to the Vatican.', 'Alex Gibney explores the charged issue of pedophilia in the Catholic Church, following a trail from the first known protest against clerical sexual abuse in the United States and all way to the Vatican.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hg10wOuq3rtam7tmJChyuIXFeS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124074'),
  ('165292189188444125', 'Meadowland', 2015, 'Drama', 'Reed Morano, Reed Morano, Kacper Kowalski', 'Chris Rossi', 'Olivia Wilde, Luke Wilson, Elisabeth Moss, Kevin Corrigan, Juno Temple, John Leguizamo, Merritt Wever, Giovanni Ribisi', 'R', 'In the hazy aftermath of an unimaginable loss, Sarah and Phil come unhinged, recklessly ignoring the repercussions. Phil starts to lose sight of his morals as Sarah puts herself in increasingly dangerous situations, falling deeper into her own fever dream.', 'In the hazy aftermath of an unimaginable loss, Sarah and Phil come unhinged, recklessly ignoring the repercussions. Phil starts to lose sight of his morals as Sarah puts herself in increasingly dangerous situations, falling deeper into her own fever dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrvg3703wPftQLNI4xbBP2cuNy9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328869'),
  ('368536226607771681', 'Mean Creek', 2004, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jacob Aaron Estes, Sharone Meir', 'Jacob Aaron Estes', 'Rory Culkin, Scott Mechlowicz, Trevor Morgan, Josh Peck, Ryan Kelley, Carly Schroeder, Branden Williams, Heath Lourwood', 'R', 'Teenagers living in small-town Oregon take a boat trip for a birthday celebration. When they get an idea to play a mean trick on the town bully, it suddenly goes too far. Soon they''re forced to deal with the unexpected consequences of their actions.', 'Teenagers living in small-town Oregon take a boat trip for a birthday celebration. When they get an idea to play a mean trick on the town bully, it suddenly goes too far. Soon they''re forced to deal with the unexpected consequences of their actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47icHsfwq7qpfPTuGwZxAtQ0olJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12281'),
  ('1041926237557384324', 'Mean Dreams', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nathan Morlando, Steve Cosens', 'Ryan Grassby, Kevin Coughlin', 'Sophie Nélisse, Josh Wiggins, Colm Feore, Bill Paxton, Joe Cobden, Vickie Papavs, Ryan Blakely, George Buza', 'R', 'When two youngsters meet and fall for each other, they must go on the run from the girl''s corrupt father, who is also the sheriff of the town.', 'When two youngsters meet and fall for each other, they must go on the run from the girl''s corrupt father, who is also the sheriff of the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf1yPzqPNfmwh7RumTunOUir3f0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393732'),
  ('680629096561647769', 'Mean Girls', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daryn Okada, Mark Waters, Sarah Campbell', 'Tina Fey', 'Lindsay Lohan, Rachel McAdams, Lizzy Caplan, Lacey Chabert, Amanda Seyfried, Daniel Franzese, Jonathan Bennett, Rajiv Surendra', 'PG-13', 'Cady Heron is a hit with The Plastics, the A-list girl clique at her new school, until she makes the mistake of falling for Aaron Samuels, the ex-boyfriend of alpha Plastic Regina George.', 'Cady Heron is a hit with The Plastics, the A-list girl clique at her new school, until she makes the mistake of falling for Aaron Samuels, the ex-boyfriend of alpha Plastic Regina George.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXm3YKXAEjx7d2tIWDg9TfRZtsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10625'),
  ('488489659971919007', 'Mean Girls', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Colin MacLellan, Kyle Hanagami, Lisa Simon', 'Tina Fey', 'Angourie Rice, Reneé Rapp, Auliʻi Cravalho, Jaquel Spivey, Avantika, Bebe Wood, Christopher Briney, Jenna Fischer', 'PG-13', 'New student Cady Heron is welcomed into the top of the social food chain by the elite group of popular girls called ‘The Plastics,’ ruled by the conniving queen bee Regina George and her minions Gretchen and Karen. However, when Cady makes the major misstep of falling for Regina’s ex-boyfriend Aaron Samuels, she finds herself prey in Regina’s crosshairs. As Cady sets to take down the group’s apex predator with the help of her outcast friends Janis and Damian, she must learn how to stay true to herself while navigating the most cutthroat jungle of all: high school.', 'New student Cady Heron is welcomed into the top of the social food chain by the elite group of popular girls called ‘The Plastics,’ ruled by the conniving queen bee Regina George and her minions Gretchen and Karen. However, when Cady makes the major misstep of falling for Regina’s ex-boyfriend Aaron Samuels, she finds herself prey in Regina’s crosshairs. As Cady sets to take down the group’s apex predator with the help of her outcast friends Janis and Damian, she must learn how to stay true to herself while navigating the most cutthroat jungle of all: high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbbj3viSUDEGT1fFFMNpHP1iUjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673593'),
  ('802802998005682958', 'Mean Girls 2', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Melanie Mayron, Linda Brachman, Alison C. Rosa', 'Cliff Ruby, Elana Lesser, Allison Schroeder', 'Meaghan Jette Martin, Jennifer Stone, Maiara Walsh, Nicole Gale Anderson, Claire Holt, Diego Boneta, Bethany Anne Lind, Patrick Johnson', 'PG-13', 'Confident senior Jo begins the new school year by breaking her own cardinal rule: don''t get involved in girl drama. but when she sees timid Abby preyed upon by Queen Bee Mandi and her minions, she takes sides in a viciously funny girl-world-war that turns North Shore High School upside down.', 'Confident senior Jo begins the new school year by breaking her own cardinal rule: don''t get involved in girl drama. but when she sees timid Abby preyed upon by Queen Bee Mandi and her minions, she takes sides in a viciously funny girl-world-war that turns North Shore High School upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34zKHT98ZgSCz6ag1ZNBul7f1Wu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51481'),
  ('373620643201768960', 'Mean Guns', 1997, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Sazzy Lee Calhoun', 'Andrew Whitham', 'Christopher Lambert, Ice-T, Michael Halsey, Deborah Van Valkenburgh, Tina Cote, Yuji Okumoto, Thom Mathews, Kimberly Warren', 'R', 'One hundred mid- and low-level gangsters who are on their boss'' bad side are locked inside a newly-built high-security prison, and given plenty of guns, ammo, and baseball bats, then told that the last survivor will get a suitcase with 10 million dollars.', 'One hundred mid- and low-level gangsters who are on their boss'' bad side are locked inside a newly-built high-security prison, and given plenty of guns, ammo, and baseball bats, then told that the last survivor will get a suitcase with 10 million dollars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piNtPb6DF3n8veFi8AOF73IhI6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26103'),
  ('246914812071796774', 'Mean Johnny Barrows', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Fred Williamson, Bobby Angelle, Robert Caramico', 'Jolivett Cato, Charles Walker', 'Fred Williamson, Roddy McDowall, Stuart Whitman, Anthony Caruso, Luther Adler, R.G. Armstrong, Elliott Gould, Jenny Sherman', 'R', 'A Vietnam veteran gets caught in a mob war with a couple of double-crossers.', 'A Vietnam veteran gets caught in a mob war with a couple of double-crossers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFg0bm8UOhgkk7LZJKeH73KXmVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91475'),
  ('1018147910203769024', 'Mean Machine', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alex Barber, Barry Skolnick', 'Charlie Fletcher, Chris Baker, Tracy Keenan Wynn', 'Vinnie Jones, David Kelly, David Hemmings, Ralph Brown, Vas Blackwood, Robbie Gee, Geoff Bell, John Forgeham', 'R', 'Disgraced ex-England football captain, Danny ''Mean Machine'' Meehan, is thrown in jail for assaulting two police officers. He keeps his head down and has the opportunity to forget everything and change the lives of the prisoners. When these prisoners have the chance to put one over the evil guards during a prison football match, Danny takes the lead.', 'Disgraced ex-England football captain, Danny ''Mean Machine'' Meehan, is thrown in jail for assaulting two police officers. He keeps his head down and has the opportunity to forget everything and change the lives of the prisoners. When these prisoners have the chance to put one over the evil guards during a prison football match, Danny takes the lead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ripTQsmWQJyccK6zB1dajSY3olv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9991'),
  ('996537959023491999', 'Mean Spirit', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Alessandrin, Javier Aguirresarobe, Pascal Guerin', 'Laurent Chouchan, Laurent Chouchan, Patrick Alessandrin', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Ophélie Winter, Clémentine Célarié, Maria Pacôme, Michel Muller, Leonor Watling, François Levantal, Thaïs Alessandrin', null, 'Vincent Poirel, a multinational executive, has won the contract to build an Olympic stadium. The original design, however, was by young architect Simon Variot. When he discovers it, he goes to the construction site and is run over by Poirel. Simon dies, but is resurrected in the body of Poirel''s son, who doesn''t understand why the little boy hates him so much.', 'Vincent Poirel, a multinational executive, has won the contract to build an Olympic stadium. The original design, however, was by young architect Simon Variot. When he discovers it, he goes to the construction site and is run over by Poirel. Simon dies, but is resurrected in the body of Poirel''s son, who doesn''t understand why the little boy hates him so much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PhpxaKTx9us7MxCnTVV5x4Vg5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38209'),
  ('946019636273103767', 'Mean Streets', 1973, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kent L. Wakeford, Martin Scorsese, Russell Vreeland', 'Mardik Martin, Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Harvey Keitel, David Proval, Amy Robinson, Richard Romanus, Cesare Danova, Victor Argo, George Memmoli', 'R', 'A small-time hood must choose from among love, friendship and the chance to rise within the mob.', 'A small-time hood must choose from among love, friendship and the chance to rise within the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9msfwOeGc9uL1iRRTBdEf15XonC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203'),
  ('3416742123962243', 'Meander', 2021, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Thierry Lecomte, Alain Duplantier, Mathieu Turi', 'Mathieu Turi', 'Gaia Weiss, Peter Franzén, Romane Libert, Frédéric Franchitti, Corneliu Dragomirescu, Eva Niewdanski, Carl Laforêt, Fabien Houssaye', 'R', 'After getting a car ride from an unknown man, Lisa wakes up in a tube. On her arm is strapped a bracelet with a countdown. She quickly understands that every 8 minutes, fire burns an occupied section. She has no choice but to crawl into safe sections to survive. To know why she’s there and how to get out, Lisa will have to face the memories of her dead daughter…', 'After getting a car ride from an unknown man, Lisa wakes up in a tube. On her arm is strapped a bracelet with a countdown. She quickly understands that every 8 minutes, fire burns an occupied section. She has no choice but to crawl into safe sections to survive. To know why she’s there and how to get out, Lisa will have to face the memories of her dead daughter…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDNHgbbDgLcl67Q0Ges9R3qvwUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523936'),
  ('427660567388970086', 'Meaningless love', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Gastón Margolin', 'Tomas Posse, Gastón Margolin', 'Matías Mayer, Violeta Urtizberea, Paula Silva, Andrea Frigerio, David Roizner Selanikio, Camila Vives, Luis Pazos, Roberto Suárez', null, 'A sedentary and superficial aspiring film editor will test his senses and emotions when he falls in love with a talented and brilliant blind cook who, paradoxically, will make him see life differently.', 'A sedentary and superficial aspiring film editor will test his senses and emotions when he falls in love with a talented and brilliant blind cook who, paradoxically, will make him see life differently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2lhOk4Na7vywNz2duhkEEMlE66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1166740'),
  ('688016646164387528', 'Meantime', 1983, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mike Leigh, Roger Pratt, Steve Finn', 'Mike Leigh', 'Phil Daniels, Tim Roth, Jeffrey Robert, Pam Ferris, Gary Oldman, Marion Bailey, Alfred Molina, Tilly Vosburgh', null, 'A working-class family in London''s East End is struggling to stay afloat during the recession under Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher''s premiership. Only the mother Mavis is working; father Frank and the couple''s two sons Colin, a timid, chronically shy individual and Mark, an outspoken, headstrong young man, are on the dole. This situation is contrasted by the presence of Mavis''s sister Barbara, and her husband John, whose financial and social loftiness appears to be a comfortable facade over the unspoken soreness of a lackluster marriage.', 'A working-class family in London''s East End is struggling to stay afloat during the recession under Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher''s premiership. Only the mother Mavis is working; father Frank and the couple''s two sons Colin, a timid, chronically shy individual and Mark, an outspoken, headstrong young man, are on the dole. This situation is contrasted by the presence of Mavis''s sister Barbara, and her husband John, whose financial and social loftiness appears to be a comfortable facade over the unspoken soreness of a lackluster marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYeCvrkgUCylSQwmMFcqXV27WvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57978'),
  ('291730581832052039', 'Meanwhile', 1999, 'Drama', 'Miguel Gomes, Bruno Lourenço, Rui Poças', 'Miguel Gomes', 'Mariana Ricardo, André Delphim, Nuno Oliveira, Joana de Sá, Gonçalo Félix', null, 'A love triangle between two boys and a girl who drift through life from a rugby game, to a pool party, to the beach.', 'A love triangle between two boys and a girl who drift through life from a rugby game, to a pool party, to the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbyNf4YguER6udGcC6rvIH9ce1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130188'),
  ('1114428746260438798', 'Meanwhile on Earth', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Jérémy Clapin, Tom Pope, Robin Le Prêtre', 'Jérémy Clapin', 'Megan Northam, Dimitri Doré, Sébastien Pouderoux, Catherine Salée, Sam Louwyck, Roman Williams, Sofia Lesaffre, Nicolas Avinée', 'R', 'Siblings Elsa and Franck used to be close, but everything changed when Franck’s space mission went awry. Three years have passed since his mysterious disappearance, and 23-year-old Elsa is having trouble moving on with her life. One day, an unidentified life form makes contact, offering to bring her big brother back to Earth. But there''s a price to pay...', 'Siblings Elsa and Franck used to be close, but everything changed when Franck’s space mission went awry. Three years have passed since his mysterious disappearance, and 23-year-old Elsa is having trouble moving on with her life. One day, an unidentified life form makes contact, offering to bring her big brother back to Earth. But there''s a price to pay...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SxwmxZnGNkTe8VBlXuVJnKH7JY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001083'),
  ('68429262828182715', 'Measure of a Man', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Loach, Denson Baker, Lynn K. D''Angona', 'David Scearce', 'Blake Cooper, Donald Sutherland, Luke Wilson, Liana Liberato, Danielle Rose Russell, Luke Benward, Sam Keeley, Beau Knapp', 'PG-13', 'A bullied teen experiences a turning point summer in which he learns to stand up for himself.', 'A bullied teen experiences a turning point summer in which he learns to stand up for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSK7N9T9uqp7WqaFffKPhPxx0mB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411996'),
  ('96414582611118195', 'Measure of Revenge', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Peyfa', null, 'Melissa Leo, Bella Thorne, Jake Weary, Kevin Corrigan, Benedict Samuel, Adrian Martinez, Ivan Martin, Roma Maffia', null, 'Theater actress Lillian Cooper''s son dies mysteriously. When the investigating officer rules the cause of death an accidental overdose, Lillian conducts her own investigation which leads her to an unlikely alliance with her son''s former drug dealer. On her quest for answers, Lillian hallucinates some of the iconic characters she''s played on stage which serve as her inner voice, urging her to avenge her son''s death.', 'Theater actress Lillian Cooper''s son dies mysteriously. When the investigating officer rules the cause of death an accidental overdose, Lillian conducts her own investigation which leads her to an unlikely alliance with her son''s former drug dealer. On her quest for answers, Lillian hallucinates some of the iconic characters she''s played on stage which serve as her inner voice, urging her to avenge her son''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bO0gQaEGBJYMIuuke58zhiQD6ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890466'),
  ('111265786260397890', 'Measures of Men', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lars Kraume, Jens Harant', 'Lars Kraume', 'Leonard Scheicher, Girley Jazama, Peter Simonischek, Corinna Kirchhoff, Anton Paulus, Leo Meier, Sven Schelker, Max Koch', null, 'Berlin at the end of the 19th Century. Alexander Hoffmann is an ambitious PhD student of Ethnology. When a delegation of the Herero and Nama tribes travels to Berlin during a ‘Colonial Exhibition’, he takes a special interest in their young female translator Kezia Kambazembi as subject for his studies.', 'Berlin at the end of the 19th Century. Alexander Hoffmann is an ambitious PhD student of Ethnology. When a delegation of the Herero and Nama tribes travels to Berlin during a ‘Colonial Exhibition’, he takes a special interest in their young female translator Kezia Kambazembi as subject for his studies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3flJBdqzKRFjSSdxFlT2KGz0Pig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012173'),
  ('703365489507250253', 'Measuring the World', 2012, 'Drama', 'Detlev Buck, Sławomir Idziak', 'Daniel Kehlmann, Detlev Buck, Daniel Nocke', 'Florian David Fitz, Albrecht Schuch, Vicky Krieps, Jérémy Kapone, Katharina Thalbach, David Kross, Max Giermann, Georg Friedrich', null, 'Germany in the early 19th century. "Die Vermessung der Welt" follows the two brilliant and eccentric scientists Alexander von Humboldt and Carl Friedrich Gauss on their life paths.', 'Germany in the early 19th century. "Die Vermessung der Welt" follows the two brilliant and eccentric scientists Alexander von Humboldt and Carl Friedrich Gauss on their life paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEzYumB3zmDN5VobhKHVV3jK60y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115023'),
  ('326937523336137111', 'Meat Grinder', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tiwa Moeithaisong, Tiwa Moeithaisong', 'Tiwa Moeithaisong', 'Siriwimol Charoenpura, Arucha Tosawat, Wiradit Srimalai, Atitaya Shindejanichakul, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Somlek Sakdikul, Chaiyot Tushsanasuwan, Shiny Khunthong', null, 'A poverty stricken woman starts a restaurant where she slaughters people and serves up human flesh, cut from her victims.', 'A poverty stricken woman starts a restaurant where she slaughters people and serves up human flesh, cut from her victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpmVJeTEJdBkWoSvX7wvk8ch5MH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38762'),
  ('652254460977709144', 'Meat in Prison', 1952, 'Crime', 'Emilio Gómez Muriel', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'Pedro Armendáriz, Martha Roth, Carlos López Moctezuma, Luis Beristáin, José María Linares Rivas, Arturo Martínez, Polo Villa, Acela Vidaurri', null, 'Pedro is found guilty of murder after accidentally killing a friend''s husband. His own family will face difficult times, as will he when he entrusts his freedom to the one he shouldn''t.', 'Pedro is found guilty of murder after accidentally killing a friend''s husband. His own family will face difficult times, as will he when he entrusts his freedom to the one he shouldn''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBO4npJ9lfZeXRyQBErtm9hrjuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346807'),
  ('831294992729624476', 'Meat Love', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'Two pieces of meat fall in love.', 'Two pieces of meat fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ueGQlNSB1cj3niaqOIt9Ra2xCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18888'),
  ('953509934503390041', 'Meatball Machine', 1999, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jun''ichi Yamamoto', 'Jun''ichi Yamamoto', 'Toshihisa Watanabe, Akiko Sasaki, Rino Sôma, Tamotsu Uchiyashiki, Hirooki Kurosawa', null, 'Alien creatures invade human bodies and turn them into cybernetic fighting machines.', 'Alien creatures invade human bodies and turn them into cybernetic fighting machines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8Sdc02GPIsqm3cJquydkvyj9nn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419196'),
  ('894184999779531152', 'Meatball Machine', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Shinji Kugimiya, Tak Sakaguchi, Isao Karasawa', 'Junya Kato', 'Issey Takahashi, Aoba Kawai, Kenichi Kawasaki, Tarō Suwa, Shoichiro Masumoto, Ayano Yamamoto, Toru Tezuka, Takashi Naha', 'NR', 'Capable of making bio-mechanical weapons out of human flesh, alien parasites grotesquely invade the Earth, turning their hosts into maniacal killers who seek and destroy each other to the bloody death! And yes, it s also a human love story, even though the budding romantics are infested with slimy, tumor-like globules.', 'Capable of making bio-mechanical weapons out of human flesh, alien parasites grotesquely invade the Earth, turning their hosts into maniacal killers who seek and destroy each other to the bloody death! And yes, it s also a human love story, even though the budding romantics are infested with slimy, tumor-like globules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szggz8oSi9ZIszL14rHTiahOLMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27351'),
  ('1046724946044710358', 'Meatball Machine Kodoku', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura, Makoto Sakaguchi, Shozo Katashima', 'Sakichi Sato, Yoshihiro Nishimura', 'Yoji Tanaka, Yurisa, Miyuki Torii, Yohta Kawase, Seminosuke Murasugi, Masanori Mimoto, Takashi Nishina, Tomori Abe', null, 'Nobody knows where they came from. They parasitize in human beings, take control of them and change their bodies into hideous monsters (Necro-borg). The Necro-borg fight each other until the other dies. Where did they come from? To what end? Yuji and Kaoru, whom both have dark secrets within themselves, get caught up in the horrific battles of Necro-borg. What will their fate be?', 'Nobody knows where they came from. They parasitize in human beings, take control of them and change their bodies into hideous monsters (Necro-borg). The Necro-borg fight each other until the other dies. Where did they come from? To what end? Yuji and Kaoru, whom both have dark secrets within themselves, get caught up in the horrific battles of Necro-borg. What will their fate be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UO2ISt7v1RaZ7lBjki0c6IVjkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429829'),
  ('435841453248846895', 'Meatballs', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Ivan Reitman, David Shepherd, Gordon Robinson', 'Daniel Goldberg, Len Blum, Harold Ramis', 'Bill Murray, Harvey Atkin, Russ Banham, Kristine DeBell, Matt Craven, Kate Lynch, Sarah Torgov, Keith Knight', 'PG', 'Tripper is the head counselor at a budget summer camp called Camp Northstar. In truth, he''s young at heart and only marginally more mature than the campers themselves. Tripper befriends Rudy, a loner camper who has trouble fitting in. As Tripper inspires his young charges to defeat rival Camp Mohawk in the annual Olympiad competition, Rudy plays matchmaker between Tripper and Roxanne, a female counselor at Northstar.', 'Tripper is the head counselor at a budget summer camp called Camp Northstar. In truth, he''s young at heart and only marginally more mature than the campers themselves. Tripper befriends Rudy, a loner camper who has trouble fitting in. As Tripper inspires his young charges to defeat rival Camp Mohawk in the annual Olympiad competition, Rudy plays matchmaker between Tripper and Roxanne, a female counselor at Northstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YA2erSNcca9NWd0xePC9ArFWnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14035'),
  ('239117024143990370', 'Meatballs 4: To the Rescue', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Kris Krengel, Richard S. Lederer, Daniel M. McCormack', 'Bob Logan', 'Corey Feldman, Jack Nance, BoJesse Christopher, Brad Grunberg, J. Trevor Edmond, Paige French, John Mendoza, Bentley Mitchum', 'R', 'Ricky is the hottest water-ski instructor around and has just been rehired by his former employer/camp to whip up attendance. Unfortunately, the camp is in serious financial trouble. The owner of a rival, more popular camp wants to buy them out. Therefore they will have to engage in a mean, winner-takes-all competition that will settle the score once and for all.', 'Ricky is the hottest water-ski instructor around and has just been rehired by his former employer/camp to whip up attendance. Unfortunately, the camp is in serious financial trouble. The owner of a rival, more popular camp wants to buy them out. Therefore they will have to engage in a mean, winner-takes-all competition that will settle the score once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dcYDKcf8PJLqjzKBEthrzFYk8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40773'),
  ('64905124270480900', 'Meatballs III: Summer Job', 1986, 'Comedy', 'George Mendeluk, Peter Benison', 'Bradley Kesden, Michael Paseornek, George Mendeluk', 'Sally Kellerman, Patrick Dempsey, Al Waxman, Isabelle Mejias, Shannon Tweed, Peter Snider, Jan Taylor Hendricks, Hudson Bishop', 'R', 'The ghost of a dead porn star comes to Earth to help a nerd with his sex life.', 'The ghost of a dead porn star comes to Earth to help a nerd with his sex life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2N9rjuNg5vgQhKGrQJQLEDX7s70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40772'),
  ('902696663862220893', 'Meatballs: Part II', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Donald M. Morgan, Ken Wiederhorn, Robert P. Cohen', 'Bruce Franklin Singer', 'Richard Mulligan, Hamilton Camp, John Mengatti, Kim Richards, Archie Hahn, Misty Rowe, Ralph Seymour, Tammy Taylor', 'PG', 'Camp Sasquatch will be bought out and closed unless owner Coach Giddy wins the boxing competition scheduled for the end of the summer. Tough city punk Flash, who''s performing his community service time at the camp, is the coach''s best hope. Flash reluctantly offers to help and so must use his raw sparring talents to get a motley group of adolescent misfits into fighting shape, while also trying to win the heart of pretty Cheryl.', 'Camp Sasquatch will be bought out and closed unless owner Coach Giddy wins the boxing competition scheduled for the end of the summer. Tough city punk Flash, who''s performing his community service time at the camp, is the coach''s best hope. Flash reluctantly offers to help and so must use his raw sparring talents to get a motley group of adolescent misfits into fighting shape, while also trying to win the heart of pretty Cheryl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMhPQ6Nzt6TwqMvaBwRJz2b4t1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40771'),
  ('1006751663471946909', 'Meatcleaver Massacre', 1977, 'Horror', 'Guerdon Trueblood, Keith Burns, Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Keith Burns, Ray Atherton', 'Christopher Lee, Larry Justin, J. Arthur Craig, James Habif, Robert Clark, Doug Senior, Bob Mead, Alisa Beaton', 'R', 'Four crazed killers butchered his wife, son and daughter. From his hospital deathbed he called upon the power of the occult for revenge... And he got it, he really got it!', 'Four crazed killers butchered his wife, son and daughter. From his hospital deathbed he called upon the power of the occult for revenge... And he got it, he really got it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JrUQjCykhdfClnTnPKh7OctEhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119170'),
  ('1086811186389933995', 'Mechanic: Resurrection', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Dennis Gansel, Aaron Haye, Daniel Gottschalk', 'Philip Shelby, Rachel Long, Tony Mosher', 'Jason Statham, Jessica Alba, Tommy Lee Jones, Michelle Yeoh, Sam Hazeldine, John Cenatiempo, Toby Eddington, Femi Elufowoju Jr.', 'R', 'Arthur Bishop thought he had put his murderous past behind him when his most formidable foe kidnaps the love of his life. Now he is forced to travel the globe to complete three impossible assassinations, and do what he does best, make them look like accidents.', 'Arthur Bishop thought he had put his murderous past behind him when his most formidable foe kidnaps the love of his life. Now he is forced to travel the globe to complete three impossible assassinations, and do what he does best, make them look like accidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG3Q6EFcngpPn7uPuQTzTuq9DgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278924'),
  ('405653593797916668', 'Mechanical Principles', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Ralph Steiner', null, null, null, 'Close up we see pistons move up and down or side to side. Pendulums sway, the small parts of machinery move. Gears drive larger wheels. Gears within gears spin. Shafts turn some mechanism that is out of sight. Screws revolve and move other gears; a bit rotates. More subtle mechanisms move other mechanical parts for unknown purposes. Weights rise and fall. The movements, underscored by sound, are rhythmic. Circles, squares, rods, and teeth are in constant and sometimes asymmetrical motion. These human-made mechanical bits seem benign and reassuring.', 'Close up we see pistons move up and down or side to side. Pendulums sway, the small parts of machinery move. Gears drive larger wheels. Gears within gears spin. Shafts turn some mechanism that is out of sight. Screws revolve and move other gears; a bit rotates. More subtle mechanisms move other mechanical parts for unknown purposes. Weights rise and fall. The movements, underscored by sound, are rhythmic. Circles, squares, rods, and teeth are in constant and sometimes asymmetrical motion. These human-made mechanical bits seem benign and reassuring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85ppMKtbx0rNUVm2zyETqJ0CFoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165985'),
  ('163749499668841551', 'Mechanical Violator Hakaider', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Keita Amemiya, Tamotsu Shinohara, Osamu Kaneda', 'Yoshinori Kitase', 'Yuji Kishimoto, Mai Hosho, Hiroshi Matsumoto, Yasuaki Honda, Toshiyuki Kikuchi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Satoshi Kurihara, Ami Kawai', null, 'In a desolate future ruled by a totalitarian city-state known as Jesus Town, a leather-clad motorcyclist cyborg awakens from imprisonment to wage war against a regime that preaches peace through control.', 'In a desolate future ruled by a totalitarian city-state known as Jesus Town, a leather-clad motorcyclist cyborg awakens from imprisonment to wage war against a regime that preaches peace through control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3I8OJh7QDamOkDjuXzOgmsdGa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63450'),
  ('167891014096803967', 'Mechanics of the Brain', 1926, 'Documentary', 'Vsevolod Pudovkin', null, null, null, '"Though not given a New York showing until 1935, V. I. Pudovkin''s Mechanics of the Brain (Mekhanika Golovnovo Mozga) was written and directed by Pudovkin in 1926. A full year in the making, this scientific documentary concentrates on the behavioral studies conducted by Prof. Ivan Pavlov. The laboratory dogs used in Pavlov''s research don''t seem too happy about it, and as a result this film might be hard to take for the more sensitive viewers (the vivisection sequence is particularly rough). The progress of the research is detailed with charts and graphs, hardly the "cinematic" touches one might expect from Pudovkin. Interestingly, Mechanics of the Brains was released two years before the results of Pavlov''s studies were printed in book form."', '"Though not given a New York showing until 1935, V. I. Pudovkin''s Mechanics of the Brain (Mekhanika Golovnovo Mozga) was written and directed by Pudovkin in 1926. A full year in the making, this scientific documentary concentrates on the behavioral studies conducted by Prof. Ivan Pavlov. The laboratory dogs used in Pavlov''s research don''t seem too happy about it, and as a result this film might be hard to take for the more sensitive viewers (the vivisection sequence is particularly rough). The progress of the research is detailed with charts and graphs, hardly the "cinematic" touches one might expect from Pudovkin. Interestingly, Mechanics of the Brains was released two years before the results of Pavlov''s studies were printed in book form."', null, 'tmdb:movie:189420'),
  ('1103801742408647715', 'Medea', 1969, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Carlo Carunchio, Sergio Citti', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Maria Callas, Massimo Girotti, Laurent Terzieff, Giuseppe Gentile, Margareth Clémenti, Paul Jabara, Gerard Weiss, Sergio Tramonti', null, 'Based on the plot of Euripides'' Medea. Medea centers on the barbarian protagonist as she finds her position in the Greek world threatened, and the revenge she takes against her husband Jason who has betrayed her for another woman.', 'Based on the plot of Euripides'' Medea. Medea centers on the barbarian protagonist as she finds her position in the Greek world threatened, and the revenge she takes against her husband Jason who has betrayed her for another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYvY9aU8dnsnWBQuPXggGWzHO2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26356'),
  ('808624687833333517', 'Medea', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Lars von Trier, Sejr Brockmann', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Udo Kier, Kirsten Olesen, Henning Jensen, Solbjørg Højfeldt, Preben Lerdorff Rye, Baard Owe, Ludmilla Glinska, Vera Gebuhr', null, 'Medea after having helped the man she loves, Jason, and given him to birth two children, is driven into fury and vengeful madness after he decides to abandon her to become successor to the throne by marring Glauce, the daughter of Creon, king of Corinth.', 'Medea after having helped the man she loves, Jason, and given him to birth two children, is driven into fury and vengeful madness after he decides to abandon her to become successor to the throne by marring Glauce, the daughter of Creon, king of Corinth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvTeUfwf2za9Yx2xn7W1unrW3ot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34870'),
  ('395740644239268751', 'Medea', 2017, 'Drama', 'Alexandra Latishev', 'Alexandra Latishev', 'Javier Montenegro, Eric Calderón, Marianella Protti, Arnoldo Ramos, Milena Picado, Daniel Ross Mix, Olger Ignacio Gonzalez Espinosa, Federico Montero', null, 'María José is 25. Her life moves back and forth between the monotony of class at the university, her eternally distant parents, and a couple of alternative spaces where she can explore her own and others’ limits. One day, she meets Javier, a boy she really likes and tries to have a relationship with, but her behaviour starts changing radically. In fact, she’s a few months into her pregnancy and no one knows.', 'María José is 25. Her life moves back and forth between the monotony of class at the university, her eternally distant parents, and a couple of alternative spaces where she can explore her own and others’ limits. One day, she meets Javier, a boy she really likes and tries to have a relationship with, but her behaviour starts changing radically. In fact, she’s a few months into her pregnancy and no one knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3J1IKcCWGAuvRqxG9vfJP1t4w2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417436'),
  ('767352592355613136', 'Medellin', 2023, 'Action, Comedy', 'Franck Gastambide, Antoine Marteau, Camille Patrice', 'Charles Van Tieghem, Franck Gastambide', 'Franck Gastambide, Ramzy Bedia, Mike Tyson, Anouar Toubali, Rachid Guellaz, Saïdou Camara, Brahim Bouhlel, Ragnar Le Breton', null, 'To save his little brother from the hands of dangerous narcos of the Medellín cartel, Reda has a plan that is as simple as it is totally insane: put together a team and raid Colombia. But this adventure is going to get completely out of control when he decides to kidnap the son of the cartel leader to exchange him for his brother''s life.', 'To save his little brother from the hands of dangerous narcos of the Medellín cartel, Reda has a plan that is as simple as it is totally insane: put together a team and raid Colombia. But this adventure is going to get completely out of control when he decides to kidnap the son of the cartel leader to exchange him for his brother''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKFOQ5LNQuIWGLdB2WhVlSUcS6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961718'),
  ('394484868251013954', 'Media Crash', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Valentine Oberti, Luc Hermann', null, 'Cyril Hanouna', null, 'There is what you see, what some people want you to see, and what you don''t see. Never has France known such a concentration of private media. A few billionaire industrialists, owners of televisions, radios, newspapers use their media to defend their private interests. To the detriment of information of public interest. By hiding what is essential, by magnifying what is accessory, these media shape, orientate, hysterize for some the debate. With the complicity of certain political leaders, who willingly accept it. Mediapart and Premières Lignes tell you what goes on behind the scenes in the media.', 'There is what you see, what some people want you to see, and what you don''t see. Never has France known such a concentration of private media. A few billionaire industrialists, owners of televisions, radios, newspapers use their media to defend their private interests. To the detriment of information of public interest. By hiding what is essential, by magnifying what is accessory, these media shape, orientate, hysterize for some the debate. With the complicity of certain political leaders, who willingly accept it. Mediapart and Premières Lignes tell you what goes on behind the scenes in the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQFJ0PX746r2RAsumUmnoNgMctv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934368'),
  ('628208643373251570', 'Medicine for Melancholy', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Barry Jenkins, James Laxton', 'Barry Jenkins', 'Wyatt Cenac, Tracey Heggins, Elizabeth Acker, Melissa Bisagni, DeMorge Brown, Powell DeGrange, Chida Emeka, John Friedberg', 'NR', 'Waking from a one-night stand that neither remembers, Micah and Joanne find themselves wandering the streets of San Francisco, sharing coffee and conversation and searching for a deeper connection.', 'Waking from a one-night stand that neither remembers, Micah and Joanne find themselves wandering the streets of San Francisco, sharing coffee and conversation and searching for a deeper connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyO8w5lpK3kwBojTulRpYcA4MAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24885'),
  ('464867917500595785', 'Medicine Italian Style', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maurizio Mein, Luciano Salce, Sante Achilli', 'Alberto Sordi, Sergio Amidei', 'Alberto Sordi, Ida Galli, Pupella Maggio, Claudio Gora, Giovanni Nuvoletti, Alessandro Cutolo, Nanda Primavera, Gino Lavagetto', null, 'Story of an ambitious young doctor through unethical means intend to make a quick career. Now is primary in a luxury clinic where administers the sick with the same cynicism of his young years.', 'Story of an ambitious young doctor through unethical means intend to make a quick career. Now is primary in a luxury clinic where administers the sick with the same cynicism of his young years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6h0r8BdpmAulxGcMYm3YjgIeuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82372'),
  ('184149320135078959', 'Medicine Man', 1992, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Donald McAlpine, John McTiernan', 'Sally Robinson, Tom Schulman', 'Sean Connery, Lorraine Bracco, José Wilker, Rodolfo De Alexandre, Francisco Tsiren Tsere Rereme, Elias Monteiro Da Silva, Edinei Maria Serrio Dos Santos, Bec-Kana-Re Dos Santos Kaiapo', 'PG-13', 'An eccentric scientist in the Amazon jungle rejects his research assistant for being a woman, but as bulldozers threaten their work on a potential cancer cure, they learn to collaborate and begin to fall in love.', 'An eccentric scientist in the Amazon jungle rejects his research assistant for being a woman, but as bulldozers threaten their work on a potential cancer cure, they learn to collaborate and begin to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkHqtViTG4Zzh7i9rrtHJGTnEUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9096'),
  ('937592724555375885', 'Medieval', 2022, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Marketa Magerova, Martin Sebik, Jesper Tøffner', 'Petr Jákl', 'Ben Foster, Sophie Lowe, Michael Caine, Roland Møller, Magnus Samuelsson, Til Schweiger, Matthew Goode, William Moseley', 'R', 'The story of fifteenth century Czech icon and warlord, Jan Zizka, who defeated armies of the Teutonic Order and the Holy Roman Empire.', 'The story of fifteenth century Czech icon and warlord, Jan Zizka, who defeated armies of the Teutonic Order and the Holy Roman Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeUNWsdoiOijOZAMaWFDA5Pb1n8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551271'),
  ('359053372091708949', 'Meditation', 1971, 'Animation', 'Jordan Belson', null, null, null, 'An abstract experimental short film from Jordan Belson.', 'An abstract experimental short film from Jordan Belson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HobFBhEL4L6NMkzdujaoD9blE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253242'),
  ('457488202387636448', 'Meditation on Violence', 1949, 'Documentary', 'Maya Deren', 'Chao-Li Chi, Maya Deren', 'Chao-Li Chi', null, 'Chao-Li Chi shadow boxes indoors and practices with a sword outdoors. Theoretically, the film describes in a single continuous movement three degrees of traditional Chinese boxing, Wu-tang, Shao-lin, and Shao-lin with a sword. A long sequence of the ballet-like, sinuous Wu-tang becomes the more erratic Shao-lin; in the middle, there is an abrupt change to leaping sword movements, in the center of which, at the apogee of the leap, there is a long held freeze-frame.', 'Chao-Li Chi shadow boxes indoors and practices with a sword outdoors. Theoretically, the film describes in a single continuous movement three degrees of traditional Chinese boxing, Wu-tang, Shao-lin, and Shao-lin with a sword. A long sequence of the ballet-like, sinuous Wu-tang becomes the more erratic Shao-lin; in the middle, there is an abrupt change to leaping sword movements, in the center of which, at the apogee of the leap, there is a long held freeze-frame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4QIdlP97TDnEc42sTOcgeVRejO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104849'),
  ('767706267788981724', 'Mediterranea', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jonas Carpignano, Gwyn Sannia, Wyatt Garfield', 'Jonas Carpignano', 'Koudous Seihon, Alassane Sy, Francesco Papasergio, Pio Amato, Vincenzina Siciliano', null, 'Ayiva recently left his home in Burkina Faso in search of a way to provide for his sister and his daughter. He takes advantage of his position in an illegal smuggling operation to get himself and his best friend Abas off of the continent. Ayiva adapts to life in Italy, but when tensions with the local community rise, things become increasingly dangerous. Determined to make his new situation work he attempts to weather the storm, but it has its costs.', 'Ayiva recently left his home in Burkina Faso in search of a way to provide for his sister and his daughter. He takes advantage of his position in an illegal smuggling operation to get himself and his best friend Abas off of the continent. Ayiva adapts to life in Italy, but when tensions with the local community rise, things become increasingly dangerous. Determined to make his new situation work he attempts to weather the storm, but it has its costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84L8Qak3UAQ4qgY3xeXU4Siejem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336660'),
  ('432001662358910068', 'Mediterranean Food', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Joaquín Oristrell, Albert Pascual', 'Joaquín Oristrell, Yolanda García Serrano', 'Paco León, Olivia Molina, Alfonso Bassave, Carmen Balagué, Roberto Álvarez, Jesús Castejón, Jordi Martínez, Stefano Scandaletti', null, 'Sofia''s story, the best chef in the world, and the two men who helped her to become a legend.', 'Sofia''s story, the best chef in the world, and the two men who helped her to become a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJ7O4pQqQ1zN3GhvcTjdwBNSBrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26971'),
  ('1101581269884251773', 'Méditerranée', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Daniel Pollet, Volker Schlöndorff', 'Philippe Sollers', null, null, '[Here] Pollet made a work that is the very definition of what French critics like to call an ovni or ufo (as in ‘unidentified filmic object’). [It] has been described as being ‘like a comet in the sky of French cinema,’ an ‘unknown masterpiece,’ and an ‘unprecedented’ work that refuses interpretation even as it has provoked reams of critical writing. Its rhythmic collage of images – a girl on a gurney, a fisherman, Greek ruins, a Sicilian garden, a Spanish corrida – is accompanied by an abstract commentary written by Sollers, and only the somber lyricism of Antoine Duhamel’s score holds the film’s elements together. At first viewing, you fear that [it] might fly apart into incoherent fragments. Instead, over the course of its 45 minutes it invents its own rules, and you realize you’re watching something like the filmic channeling of an ancient ritual.', '[Here] Pollet made a work that is the very definition of what French critics like to call an ovni or ufo (as in ‘unidentified filmic object’). [It] has been described as being ‘like a comet in the sky of French cinema,’ an ‘unknown masterpiece,’ and an ‘unprecedented’ work that refuses interpretation even as it has provoked reams of critical writing. Its rhythmic collage of images – a girl on a gurney, a fisherman, Greek ruins, a Sicilian garden, a Spanish corrida – is accompanied by an abstract commentary written by Sollers, and only the somber lyricism of Antoine Duhamel’s score holds the film’s elements together. At first viewing, you fear that [it] might fly apart into incoherent fragments. Instead, over the course of its 45 minutes it invents its own rules, and you realize you’re watching something like the filmic channeling of an ancient ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niilxJfs02VMQXosSAphcZgwJkx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85834'),
  ('185282883773052504', 'Mediterraneo: The Law of the Sea', 2021, 'Drama', 'Marcel Barrena, Mariza Liakopoulou, Kiko de la Rica', 'Danielle Schleif, Marcel Barrena, Òscar Camps', 'Eduard Fernández, Dani Rovira, Anna Castillo, Sergi López, Melika Foroutan, Àlex Monner, Patricia López Arnaiz, Constantin Symsiris', null, 'Autumn 2015. Profoundly affected by the picture of a little boy who drowned in the Mediterranean Sea, lifeguards Oscar and Gerard travel to Lesbos (Greece). Once there, the reality is horrific: thousands of people risk their lives every day, crossing the sea in precarious boats and fleeing from armed conflicts. But nobody bothers to rescue them. With Esther, Nico and other members of the team, they will fight to do what they came to do, helping those who need it. For all of them, this initiation voyage will become a life-changing odyssey. Mediterráneo is the struggle to survive in the sea, an often hostile medium where every life counts.', 'Autumn 2015. Profoundly affected by the picture of a little boy who drowned in the Mediterranean Sea, lifeguards Oscar and Gerard travel to Lesbos (Greece). Once there, the reality is horrific: thousands of people risk their lives every day, crossing the sea in precarious boats and fleeing from armed conflicts. But nobody bothers to rescue them. With Esther, Nico and other members of the team, they will fight to do what they came to do, helping those who need it. For all of them, this initiation voyage will become a life-changing odyssey. Mediterráneo is the struggle to survive in the sea, an often hostile medium where every life counts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcSllnawrz4VfnkSx5yanr7kSn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824349'),
  ('609963206810242373', 'Medium', 1985, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jacek Koprowicz, Jerzy Zieliński, Wit Dąbal', 'Jacek Koprowicz', 'Władysław Kowalski, Michał Bajor, Jerzy Zelnik, Jerzy Stuhr, Grażyna Szapołowska, Jerzy Nowak, Ewa Dałkowska, Piotr Machalica', null, 'Story of four people in Sopot in 1933, mysteriously brought together to an old villa to reenact a murder ritual that took place 36 years earlier.', 'Story of four people in Sopot in 1933, mysteriously brought together to an old villa to reenact a murder ritual that took place 36 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMWMYVgeOT02XyTyH402pE8cUsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240860'),
  ('530650872995909557', 'Medium Cool', 1969, 'Drama', 'Haskell Wexler, Wendell Franklin, Erich von Stroheim Jr.', 'Haskell Wexler', 'Robert Forster, Verna Bloom, Peter Bonerz, Marianna Hill, Harold Blankenship, Charles Geary, Sid McCoy, Christine Bergstrom', 'R', 'John Cassellis is the toughest TV news reporter around. After extensively reporting about violence and racial tensions in poor communities, he discovers that his network is helping the FBI by granting them access to his footage to find suspects.', 'John Cassellis is the toughest TV news reporter around. After extensively reporting about violence and racial tensions in poor communities, he discovers that his network is helping the FBI by granting them access to his footage to find suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiRU2wJQh5x7q0HU3oBN0VbRMnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42612'),
  ('704096835763750851', 'Medusa', 2020, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Dominic Ellis, Matthew B.C.', 'Scott Chambers, Matthew B.C.', 'Megan Purvis, Sarah T. Cohen, Nicola Wright, Ricardo Freitas, Jamila Wingett, Nicole Nabi, Thomas Beatty, Joshua Samuels', null, 'After being bitten by a lethal snake, a young woman experiences changes in her senses and appearance, as she sheds her old self and slowly turns into a deadly weapon.', 'After being bitten by a lethal snake, a young woman experiences changes in her senses and appearance, as she sheds her old self and slowly turns into a deadly weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fs8RXnnJkYKo53R8A6eakzcTTHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761563'),
  ('416617380087670065', 'Medusa', 2021, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Anita Rocha da Silveira, João Atala', 'Anita Rocha da Silveira', 'Mari Oliveira, Lara Tremouroux, Joana Medeiros, Felipe Frazão, Thiago Fragoso, Bruna Linzmeyer, Bruna G, Carol Romano', 'NR', 'By day, Mari and her friends broadcast their spiritual devotion through pastel pinks and catchy evangelical songs about purity and perfection, and by night they form a vigilante girl gang, prowling the streets in search of sinners who have deviated from the rightful path. After an attack goes wrong, leaving Mari scarred and unemployed, her views of community, religion, and her peers begin to shift.', 'By day, Mari and her friends broadcast their spiritual devotion through pastel pinks and catchy evangelical songs about purity and perfection, and by night they form a vigilante girl gang, prowling the streets in search of sinners who have deviated from the rightful path. After an attack goes wrong, leaving Mari scarred and unemployed, her views of community, religion, and her peers begin to shift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL3auYQVO2748LPLzzofYXO7xCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820710'),
  ('534393999496232571', 'Medusa', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nicolas Desaintquentin, Alice Le Coent, Barbara Joseph Rocher', 'Sophie Lévy', 'Roxane Mesquida, Anamaria Vartolomei, Arnaud Valois, Pierre Nisse, Léo Dussollier, Maxime Gleizes, Amanda Rubinstein, Mehdi Rahim-Silvioli', null, 'After their mother dies in a car crash that leaves her sister Clémence disabled, Romane becomes her caretaker. But when Romane’s charismatic Corsican boyfriend steps in to help, his growing bond with Clémence challenges their sisterhood and explores the power of female fascination.', 'After their mother dies in a car crash that leaves her sister Clémence disabled, Romane becomes her caretaker. But when Romane’s charismatic Corsican boyfriend steps in to help, his growing bond with Clémence challenges their sisterhood and explores the power of female fascination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAfL6U7CDbxeosHfLPjOsXfHGUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933100'),
  ('562669665057959146', 'Medusa Deluxe', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Gary Davy, Thomas Hardiman, Robbie Ryan', 'Thomas Hardiman', 'Anita-Joy Uwajeh, Clare Perkins, Darrell D''Silva, Debris Stevenson, Harriet Webb, Heider Ali, Kae Alexander, Kayla Meikle', 'R', 'Talented and cutthroat hairstylists at a competition find one of their own murdered before judging can begin. Winding through neon-lit halls, competitors unspool long-simmering resentments and lies as they search for the killer among them.', 'Talented and cutthroat hairstylists at a competition find one of their own murdered before judging can begin. Winding through neon-lit halls, competitors unspool long-simmering resentments and lies as they search for the killer among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CTGPP33fSG7WkAgnX5XJXfdTp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:935903'),
