  ('855554259740028286', 'Mee Pok Man', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eric Khoo, Yoke Weng Ho', 'Yu Lei Foong', 'Joe Ng, Michelle Goh, Lim Kay Tong, David Brazil, George Chua', null, 'A painfully shy noodle-shop owner and a prostitute have a chance encounter when destiny arrives in the form of a car accident.', 'A painfully shy noodle-shop owner and a prostitute have a chance encounter when destiny arrives in the form of a car accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPfFVK1ImZQCywmbKkoPHfbjIul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135283'),
  ('68291748020862168', 'Mee-Shee: The Water Giant', 2005, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'John Henderson', 'Barry Authors', 'Bruce Greenwood, Joel Tobeck, Rena Owen, Phyllida Law, Shane Rimmer, Robert Bruce, Barry Authors, Daniel Magder', null, 'A New York City oil company troubleshooter is brought to a remote B.C. lake to look for some lost machinery. Cancelling a trip to Disney World with his son, he decides to bring the boy along. They both end up experiencing more excitement than Mickey could ever conjure in Orlando, when they meet up with bad guys and a legendary creature', 'A New York City oil company troubleshooter is brought to a remote B.C. lake to look for some lost machinery. Cancelling a trip to Disney World with his son, he decides to bring the boy along. They both end up experiencing more excitement than Mickey could ever conjure in Orlando, when they meet up with bad guys and a legendary creature', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO8XsAzBpthdq22wcl5Kmt8YgiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60596'),
