  ('220620977489725525', 'Meet Boston Blackie', 1941, 'Crime', 'Robert Florey, Franz Planer', 'Jay Dratler', 'Chester Morris, Rochelle Hudson, Richard Lane, Constance Worth, Jack O''Malley, George Magrill, James Seay, Charles Wagenheim', 'NR', 'When a murder occurs on an ocean liner docked in New York, the trail leads to Coney Island and a spy ring.', 'When a murder occurs on an ocean liner docked in New York, the trail leads to Coney Island and a spy ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkLkd5gUBYr7JvaJxgrtCerrPWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69699'),
  ('594800183230990230', 'Meet Cute', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Alexandre Lehmann, John Matysiak, Amey René', 'Noga Pnueli', 'Kaley Cuoco, Pete Davidson, Deborah S. Craig, Sierra Fisk, Wesley Holloway, Rock Kohli, Hari Nef, Kevin Corrigan', 'R', 'A wildly inventive deconstruction of the romantic comedy built around the question: What would you do if you could travel to your loved ones’ past, heal their traumas, fix their problems, and change them into the perfect partner?', 'A wildly inventive deconstruction of the romantic comedy built around the question: What would you do if you could travel to your loved ones’ past, heal their traumas, fix their problems, and change them into the perfect partner?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rp4nj7L3V5tPm2pWks4sX8NVKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843543'),
  ('717781337829136069', 'Meet Dave', 2008, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure, Family', 'Brian Robbins, Clark Mathis, Andy Gill', 'Rob Greenberg, Rob Greenberg', 'Eddie Murphy, Elizabeth Banks, Gabrielle Union, Scott Caan, Ed Helms, Kevin Hart, Mike O''Malley, Pat Kilbane', 'PG', 'A crew of miniature aliens operate a spaceship that has a human form. While trying to save their planet, the aliens encounter a new problem, as their ship becomes smitten with an Earth woman.', 'A crew of miniature aliens operate a spaceship that has a human form. While trying to save their planet, the aliens encounter a new problem, as their ship becomes smitten with an Earth woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Qfav5aVRcZmq854olMjJ795JJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11260'),
  ('682118593464602120', 'Meet Joe Black', 1998, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Martin Brest, Emmanuel Lubezki, Christopher Surgent', 'Maxwell Anderson, Gladys Lehman', 'Brad Pitt, Anthony Hopkins, Claire Forlani, Jake Weber, Marcia Gay Harden, Jeffrey Tambor, David S. Howard, Lois Kelly-Miller', 'PG-13', 'Bill Parrish has it all - success, wealth and power. Days before his 65th birthday, he receives a visit from a mysterious stranger, Joe Black, who soon reveals himself as Death. In exchange for extra time, Bill agrees to serve as Joe''s earthly guide. But will he regret his choice when Joe unexpectedly falls in love with Bill''s beautiful daughter Susan?', 'Bill Parrish has it all - success, wealth and power. Days before his 65th birthday, he receives a visit from a mysterious stranger, Joe Black, who soon reveals himself as Death. In exchange for extra time, Bill agrees to serve as Joe''s earthly guide. But will he regret his choice when Joe unexpectedly falls in love with Bill''s beautiful daughter Susan?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDPAjvfPMomkKF7cMRmL5Anak61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297'),
  ('113539250434999866', 'Meet John Doe', 1941, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Capra, George Barnes, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Robert Riskin', 'Gary Cooper, Barbara Stanwyck, Edward Arnold, Walter Brennan, Spring Byington, James Gleason, Gene Lockhart, Rod La Rocque', 'NR', 'As a parting shot, fired reporter Ann Mitchell prints a fake letter from unemployed "John Doe," who threatens suicide in protest of social ills. The paper is forced to rehire Ann and hires John Willoughby to impersonate "Doe." Ann and her bosses cynically milk the story for all it''s worth, until the made-up "John Doe" philosophy starts a whole political movement.', 'As a parting shot, fired reporter Ann Mitchell prints a fake letter from unemployed "John Doe," who threatens suicide in protest of social ills. The paper is forced to rehire Ann and hires John Willoughby to impersonate "Doe." Ann and her bosses cynically milk the story for all it''s worth, until the made-up "John Doe" philosophy starts a whole political movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnBZbFE2OGlTGNGBVTn6t83tJtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32574'),
  ('775837119170675636', 'Meet John Doughboy', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher, Robert C. Bruce, Robert Clampett, Jack Lescoulie', null, 'Porky introduces a newsreel of wartime spot gags, including a spoof of the RKO Pictures logo, and caricatures of Jack Benny and Rochester.', 'Porky introduces a newsreel of wartime spot gags, including a spoof of the RKO Pictures logo, and caricatures of Jack Benny and Rochester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgzFp2qUnQ6MTpYSM8c8ip35F43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236504'),
