  ('373610496804814871', 'Meet Me Next Christmas', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Rusty Cundieff, Andrew Strahorn', 'Camilla Rubis, Molly Haldeman', 'Christina Milian, Devale Ellis, Kofi Siriboe, Kalen Allen, Mitch Grassi, Scott Hoying, Kirstin Maldonado, Kevin Olusola', 'PG', 'On a quest to reconnect with the man of her dreams, Layla races across New York City to find a ticket to a sold-out Pentatonix Christmas Eve concert.', 'On a quest to reconnect with the man of her dreams, Layla races across New York City to find a ticket to a sold-out Pentatonix Christmas Eve concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPRH0Rm00esNefnI1ZxQqTTIpzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104171'),
  ('863848194962383520', 'Meet Monica Velour', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Keith Bearden, Masanobu Takayanagi', 'Keith Bearden', 'Kim Cattrall, Dustin Ingram, Brian Dennehy, Jee Young Han, Daniel Yelsky, Keith David, Sam McMurray, Elizabeth Shapiro', 'R', 'For Tobe, a nerdy, horny, frizzy-haired cineaste who doesn''t quite fit in with the average contemporary teen, the pinnacle of womanhood is Monica Velour, a soft-core actress who reached the zenith of her career in the 1980s. When Tobe learns that his love idol is headlining hundreds of miles away at the Gentlemen''s Petting Zoo in Indiana, he drives off with carefree glory, filled with the hope of meeting her.', 'For Tobe, a nerdy, horny, frizzy-haired cineaste who doesn''t quite fit in with the average contemporary teen, the pinnacle of womanhood is Monica Velour, a soft-core actress who reached the zenith of her career in the 1980s. When Tobe learns that his love idol is headlining hundreds of miles away at the Gentlemen''s Petting Zoo in Indiana, he drives off with carefree glory, filled with the hope of meeting her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfvv8XuQfdoFp5OxRa6pSoN4Qox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56928'),
  ('692185234829425718', 'Meet Mr. Lucifer', 1953, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Anthony Pelissier', 'Monja Danischewsky, Arnold Ridley', 'Stanley Holloway, Peggy Cummins, Jack Watling, Kay Kendall, Ian Carmichael, Joan Sims, Gordon Jackson, Dandy Nichols', null, 'A TV set given as a retirement present is sold on to different households causing misery each time.', 'A TV set given as a retirement present is sold on to different households causing misery each time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrah5y8Hyp17KWYxvJ6yeuu5bJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171297'),
  ('525528558882543800', 'Meet My Friend', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina', 'Enrico Vanzina, Francesco Massaro', 'Raoul Bova, Barbora Bobuľová, Martina Stella, Kelly Reilly, Stefano Dionisi, Sarah Felberbaum, Carlo Giuseppe Gabardini, Paolo Calabresi', null, 'Marco Ferretti is an Italian manager who is young and beautiful, but he cannot stand the presence of women after a difficult affair. When Marco goes to London for an appointment, he meets four beautiful girls who disrupt his life with love.', 'Marco Ferretti is an Italian manager who is young and beautiful, but he cannot stand the presence of women after a difficult affair. When Marco goes to London for an appointment, he meets four beautiful girls who disrupt his life with love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUpl3UesxzX38T3y3Kg1wavq18B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58401'),
  ('650034184239538525', 'Meet Prince Charming', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Brett Parker', 'Nina Colman', 'Tia Carrere, David Charvet, Nia Vardalos, Boyd Banks, Ian Gomez, Drea De Matteo, Vincent Angell', 'NR', 'Jonathan ''Jack'' Harris is a waiter, who hopes to start a newspaper called The Tribeca Times, after the part of Manhattan where he lives, and while struggling to find advertisers and stories decides to do one on Internet dating services, so he joins one and seems to have found a great match, maybe even a soul-mate. He doesn''t know it''s actually his apartment block neighbor, 29-year old magazine editor Samantha Feld -who only rolled into the thing because her friend and co-worker Jen thinks she needs a man and threw a party at Samantha''s place- with whom he clashed from the start in daily life as they consider each-other noisy and inconsiderate. Yet, when they meet after e-mail bliss together and nothing but failed dates with others...', 'Jonathan ''Jack'' Harris is a waiter, who hopes to start a newspaper called The Tribeca Times, after the part of Manhattan where he lives, and while struggling to find advertisers and stories decides to do one on Internet dating services, so he joins one and seems to have found a great match, maybe even a soul-mate. He doesn''t know it''s actually his apartment block neighbor, 29-year old magazine editor Samantha Feld -who only rolled into the thing because her friend and co-worker Jen thinks she needs a man and threw a party at Samantha''s place- with whom he clashed from the start in daily life as they consider each-other noisy and inconsiderate. Yet, when they meet after e-mail bliss together and nothing but failed dates with others...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEAfh5eATAM9fAgqrOBT3VGqKum.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61656'),
  ('1149911723628450625', 'Meet the Applegates', 1990, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Michael Lehmann, Mitch Dubin', 'Michael Lehmann, Redbeard Simmons', 'Ed Begley Jr., Stockard Channing, Dabney Coleman, Robert Jayne, Camille Cooper, Glenn Shadix, Susan Barnes, Adam Biesk', 'R', 'Modelling themselves after an idyllic cookie-cutter suburban 1950s family, a colony of insects move from South America into the United States with the intent of getting access to the nation''s nuclear resources.', 'Modelling themselves after an idyllic cookie-cutter suburban 1950s family, a colony of insects move from South America into the United States with the intent of getting access to the nation''s nuclear resources.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j79gY4zUgtpcDNpYh8esIer2aWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76516'),
  ('1045632337043377941', 'Meet the Barbarians', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aurélie Guichard, Georges Lechaptois, Julie Richard', 'Julie Delpy, Matthieu Rumani, Nicolas Slomka', 'Julie Delpy, Sandrine Kiberlain, Laurent Lafitte, India Hair, Mathieu Demy, Ziad Bakri, Albert Delpy, Jean-Charles Clichet', null, 'The municipality of a small Breton village has decided to welcome a family of Ukrainian refugees. To their surprise, they receive Fayad family – coming from Syria. They thwart all the clichés that the French expected: they are friendly, refined, educated… So much so that, in this small, humming village, it is no longer clear which side the barbarians are on…', 'The municipality of a small Breton village has decided to welcome a family of Ukrainian refugees. To their surprise, they receive Fayad family – coming from Syria. They thwart all the clichés that the French expected: they are friendly, refined, educated… So much so that, in this small, humming village, it is no longer clear which side the barbarians are on…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGacUz5IkYrRtp6MEiiy3hKOte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001736'),
  ('316783584450372134', 'Meet the Blacks', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Deon Taylor, John T. Connor', 'Deon Taylor, Nicole DeMasi', 'Mike Epps, Zulay Henao, George López, Mike Tyson, Charlie Murphy, Andrew Bachelor, DeRay Davis, Lavell Crawford', 'R', 'As Carl Black gets the opportunity to move his family out of Chicago in hope of a better life, their arrival in Beverly Hills is timed with that city''s annual purge, where all crime is legal for twelve hours.', 'As Carl Black gets the opportunity to move his family out of Chicago in hope of a better life, their arrival in Beverly Hills is timed with that city''s annual purge, where all crime is legal for twelve hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pemUf5lKEzgxGebxxMVKL5NHSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377587'),
  ('725827561623054490', 'Meet the Browns', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tyler Perry, Sandi Sissel, Michelle Gonsiorek', 'Tyler Perry', 'Angela Bassett, Rick Fox, Lance Gross, Chloe Bailey, Mariana Tolbert, Sofía Vergara, Tamela Mann, David Mann', 'PG-13', 'A single mother living in inner city Chicago, Brenda has been struggling for years to make ends meet and keep her three kids off the street. When she''s laid off with no warning, she starts losing hope for the first time - until a letter arrives announcing the death of a father she''s never met. Desperate for any kind of help, Brenda takes her family to Georgia for the funeral, but nothing could have prepared her for the Browns, her father''s fun-loving, crass Southern clan. In a small-town world full of long afternoons and country fairs, Brenda struggles to get to know the family she never knew existed... and finds a brand new romance that just might change her life.', 'A single mother living in inner city Chicago, Brenda has been struggling for years to make ends meet and keep her three kids off the street. When she''s laid off with no warning, she starts losing hope for the first time - until a letter arrives announcing the death of a father she''s never met. Desperate for any kind of help, Brenda takes her family to Georgia for the funeral, but nothing could have prepared her for the Browns, her father''s fun-loving, crass Southern clan. In a small-town world full of long afternoons and country fairs, Brenda struggles to get to know the family she never knew existed... and finds a brand new romance that just might change her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61qE0TunNdJiPELBdywMlpvZXDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16710'),
  ('794001578955592466', 'Meet the Deedles', 1998, 'Comedy, Family', 'Steve Boyum, Rick R. Johnson, David Hennings', 'Jim Herzfeld', 'Paul Walker, John Ashton, Dennis Hopper, Eric Braeden, Richard Lineback, Robert Englund, M.C. Gainey, Steve Van Wormer', 'PG', 'Two surfers end up as Yellowstone park rangers and have to stop a former ranger who is out for revenge.', 'Two surfers end up as Yellowstone park rangers and have to stop a former ranger who is out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hSCyqtYZ2ICMiV2rI5ZtZQTUnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40688'),
  ('104486445273066216', 'Meet the Feebles', 1989, 'Comedy, Music, Fantasy', 'Peter Jackson, Murray Milne', 'Peter Jackson, Stephen Sinclair, Fran Walsh', 'Donna Akersten, Stuart Devenie, Mark Hadlow, Brian Sergent, Ross Jolly, Peter Vere-Jones, Mark Wright, Danny Mulheron', 'R', 'Heidi, star of the "Meet The Feebles Variety Hour" discovers her lover Bletch the Walrus is cheating on her. And with all the world waiting for the show, the assorted co-stars must contend with drug addiction, extortion, robbery, disease, drug dealing, and murder.', 'Heidi, star of the "Meet The Feebles Variety Hour" discovers her lover Bletch the Walrus is cheating on her. And with all the world waiting for the show, the assorted co-stars must contend with drug addiction, extortion, robbery, disease, drug dealing, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31DqGazwdE9N4Y9FHC6Q4NvstuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8216'),
  ('499258241087365538', 'Meet the Fockers', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jay Roach, John Schwartzman, Jonah Markowitz', 'Jim Herzfeld, John Hamburg', 'Ben Stiller, Robert De Niro, Dustin Hoffman, Barbra Streisand, Blythe Danner, Teri Polo, Owen Wilson, Spencer Pickren', 'PG-13', 'Hard-to-crack ex-CIA man Jack Byrnes and his wife Dina head for the warmer climes of Florida to meet the parents of their son-in-law-to-be, Greg Focker. Unlike their happily matched offspring, the future in-laws find themselves in a situation of opposites that definitely do not attract.', 'Hard-to-crack ex-CIA man Jack Byrnes and his wife Dina head for the warmer climes of Florida to meet the parents of their son-in-law-to-be, Greg Focker. Unlike their happily matched offspring, the future in-laws find themselves in a situation of opposites that definitely do not attract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59fXm6N2x7QSbvt6BaBxTNBXGL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693'),
  ('586959925446989280', 'Meet the Guilbys', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Quentin Reynaud, Arthur Delaire, Yannick Ressigeac', 'Arthur Delaire, Quentin Reynaud', 'Isabelle Carré, Stéphane De Groodt, Alex Lutz, Joséphine Japy, Solal Forte, Aminthe Audiard, Jennifer Decker', null, 'Claire and Maurice have to take the whole family to Claire''s father''s funeral. This tightly knit family is not only composed of Claire''s vegetarian son, Alex, who''s secretly fond of Maurice''s daughter, Lucie, the teenage rebel, but also Claire''s brother, a poet living under his sister''s roof; without forgetting young Prune, Claire and Maurice''s daughter, who will develop a passion for the country''s emblematic cows. They must all strive to get along during the road trip to Willouby.', 'Claire and Maurice have to take the whole family to Claire''s father''s funeral. This tightly knit family is not only composed of Claire''s vegetarian son, Alex, who''s secretly fond of Maurice''s daughter, Lucie, the teenage rebel, but also Claire''s brother, a poet living under his sister''s roof; without forgetting young Prune, Claire and Maurice''s daughter, who will develop a passion for the country''s emblematic cows. They must all strive to get along during the road trip to Willouby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hYp09l6CmNyiW0Czwg6St2j9bd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375898'),
  ('60780552330616803', 'Meet the Hollowheads', 1989, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Thomas R. Burman, Marvin V. Rush', 'Thomas R. Burman, Lisa Morton', 'John Glover, Nancy Mette, Richard Portnow, Juliette Lewis, Joshua John Miller, Matt Shakman, Shnutz Burman, Lightfield Lewis', 'PG-13', 'The Hollowheads are a strange, futuristic family that live in a Jetsons type world complete with many cool gadgets. Henry is hoping for a promotion at the slime factory in which he works and decides to bring his boss home for dinner and to meet the family. Henry''s perverted boss doesn''t know what he''s up against when he tries to make advances with Mrs. Hollowhead', 'The Hollowheads are a strange, futuristic family that live in a Jetsons type world complete with many cool gadgets. Henry is hoping for a promotion at the slime factory in which he works and decides to bring his boss home for dinner and to meet the family. Henry''s perverted boss doesn''t know what he''s up against when he tries to make advances with Mrs. Hollowhead', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggkr71YdWaKjGxwuN7Yq1acQW2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39997'),
  ('1136618910325496350', 'Meet the In-Laws', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Han Ki-eop, Kim Jin-young', 'Ha Myung-mi', 'Song Sae-byuk, Lee Si-young, Baek Yoon-sik, Kim Soo-mi, Kim Eung-soo, Park Cheol-min, Park Hyo-ju, Kim Jung-nan', null, 'When cartoonist Hyun-joon falls in love with Da-hong, one of his fans, it sets up the archetypal battle between their two families, who are from rival regions. Hyun-joon comes from the politically liberal Honam region while Da-hong comes from the conservative Yeongnam region. When the two declare their intention to marry, they are confronted with a seemingly endless number of barriers that threaten their happiness.', 'When cartoonist Hyun-joon falls in love with Da-hong, one of his fans, it sets up the archetypal battle between their two families, who are from rival regions. Hyun-joon comes from the politically liberal Honam region while Da-hong comes from the conservative Yeongnam region. When the two declare their intention to marry, they are confronted with a seemingly endless number of barriers that threaten their happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwymkgzhbA7ILK4WOOvQKuQxegS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76435'),
  ('67198366565013578', 'Meet the Leroys', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Florent Bernard, Franck Heslon, Audrey Luciani', 'Florent Bernard', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, José Garcia, Lili Aubry, Hadrien Heaulmé, Lyes Salem, Luis Rego, Sébastien Chassagne, Jérôme Niel', null, 'A man takes his wife and their teenage children on a road trip down memory lane while facing divorce.', 'A man takes his wife and their teenage children on a road trip down memory lane while facing divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s3Wkt7V96yLOqLMbYUsxG5H49w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964877'),
  ('1106699217303882098', 'Meet the Malawas', 2019, 'Comedy', 'James Huth, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Michaël Youn, James Huth, Sonja Shillito', 'Michaël Youn, Christian Clavier, Ramzy Bedia, Sylvie Testud, Pascal Elbé, François Levantal, Bass Dhem', null, 'A news anchor, a comedian, an actress, and a soccer player with big egos have to travel across the globe to meet the Malawa tribe for a TV show.', 'A news anchor, a comedian, an actress, and a soccer player with big egos have to travel across the globe to meet the Malawa tribe for a TV show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxJqMW8nU0Hex259NkaoyyOru7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643236'),
  ('877954668266198982', 'Meet the Parents', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter James, Jay Roach, Hyun-joo Kim', 'Jim Herzfeld, John Hamburg', 'Ben Stiller, Robert De Niro, Teri Polo, Blythe Danner, Nicole DeHuff, Jon Abrahams, Owen Wilson, James Rebhorn', 'PG-13', 'Greg Focker is ready to marry his girlfriend, Pam, but before he pops the question, he must win over her formidable father, humorless former CIA agent Jack Byrnes, at the wedding of Pam''s sister. As Greg bends over backward to make a good impression, his visit to the Byrnes home turns into a hilarious series of disasters, and everything that can go wrong does, all under Jack''s critical, hawklike gaze.', 'Greg Focker is ready to marry his girlfriend, Pam, but before he pops the question, he must win over her formidable father, humorless former CIA agent Jack Byrnes, at the wedding of Pam''s sister. As Greg bends over backward to make a good impression, his visit to the Byrnes home turns into a hilarious series of disasters, and everything that can go wrong does, all under Jack''s critical, hawklike gaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tXJ9ctuyEOMUFLaeqRisbXowWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1597'),
  ('261904678248058419', 'Meet the Patels', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Documentary', 'Ravi Patel, Geeta Patel, Geeta Patel', 'Ravi Patel, Matthew Hamachek, Billy McMillin', 'Ravi Patel, Geeta Patel, Champa V. Patel, Vasant K. Patel, Audrey Wauchope', null, 'Finding love is never easy. For Ravi Patel, a first generation Indian-American, the odds are slim. His ideal bride is beautiful, smart, funny, family-oriented, kind and—in keeping with tradition—Indian (though hopefully raised in the US). Oh, and her last name should be Patel because in India, Patels usually marry other Patels. And so at 30, Ravi decides to break up with his American girlfriend (the one who by all accounts is perfect for him except for her red hair and American name) and embark on a worldwide search for another Patel longing to be loved. He enlists the help of his matchmaker mother, attends a convention of Patels living in the US and travels to wedding season in India. Witty, honest and heartfelt, this comedy explores the questions with which we all struggle: What is love? What is happiness? And how in the world do we go about finding them?', 'Finding love is never easy. For Ravi Patel, a first generation Indian-American, the odds are slim. His ideal bride is beautiful, smart, funny, family-oriented, kind and—in keeping with tradition—Indian (though hopefully raised in the US). Oh, and her last name should be Patel because in India, Patels usually marry other Patels. And so at 30, Ravi decides to break up with his American girlfriend (the one who by all accounts is perfect for him except for her red hair and American name) and embark on a worldwide search for another Patel longing to be loved. He enlists the help of his matchmaker mother, attends a convention of Patels living in the US and travels to wedding season in India. Witty, honest and heartfelt, this comedy explores the questions with which we all struggle: What is love? What is happiness? And how in the world do we go about finding them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPefACwGVov9QlJZI3GfxPzhaiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266764'),
  ('692128603755863403', 'Meet the Robinsons', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Stephen J. Anderson', 'Jon Bernstein, Michelle Bochner Spitz, Don Hall', 'Daniel Hansen, Jordan Fry, Wesley Singerman, Matthew Josten, Stephen J. Anderson, Tom Selleck, Tom Kenny, Laurie Metcalf', 'G', 'Lewis, a brilliant young inventor, is keen on creating a time machine to find his mother, who abandoned him in an orphanage. Things take a turn when he meets Wilbur Robinson and his family.', 'Lewis, a brilliant young inventor, is keen on creating a time machine to find his mother, who abandoned him in an orphanage. Things take a turn when he meets Wilbur Robinson and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naya0zF4kT401Sx15AtwB9vpcJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1267'),
  ('1084608564408344290', 'Meet The Santas', 2005, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Harvey Frost', 'Pamela Wallace', 'Steve Guttenberg, Crystal Bernard, Dominic Scott Kay, Armin Shimerman, Mariette Hartley, Parker McKenna Posey, John Wheeler, Marcia Ann Burrs', null, 'Because she is marrying the man who assumed the mantle of Santa Claus last December 26, Beth''s postponed wedding has to be rescheduled for Xmas eve. Overwhelmed by selling the house she and her son share and the prospect of the duties of Mrs. Claus, she has to call on her estranged socialite Grinch of a mother to arrange the wedding. Of course her mom has never met the fiancé nor his family and has no inkling of his secret. This is a sequel to 2004''s Single Santa Seeks Mrs. Claus.', 'Because she is marrying the man who assumed the mantle of Santa Claus last December 26, Beth''s postponed wedding has to be rescheduled for Xmas eve. Overwhelmed by selling the house she and her son share and the prospect of the duties of Mrs. Claus, she has to call on her estranged socialite Grinch of a mother to arrange the wedding. Of course her mom has never met the fiancé nor his family and has no inkling of his secret. This is a sequel to 2004''s Single Santa Seeks Mrs. Claus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0Om0HyoWOk3i2RutDp8bFjVp6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393196'),
  ('1149773849911586032', 'Meet the Spartans', 2008, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Shawn Maurer, Hal Olofsson, Greg Guzik', 'Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer', 'Travis Van Winkle, Sean Maguire, Carmen Electra, Ken Davitian, Kevin Sorbo, Diedrich Bader, Method Man, Ike Barinholtz', 'PG-13', 'The heroic Leonidas, armed with nothing but leather underwear and a cape, leads a ragtag group of thirteen Spartans to defend their homeland against the invading Persians (whose ranks include Ghost Rider, Rocky Balboa, the Transformers, and a hunchbacked Paris Hilton). No one is safe when the Spartans take on the biggest icons in pop culture!', 'The heroic Leonidas, armed with nothing but leather underwear and a cape, leads a ragtag group of thirteen Spartans to defend their homeland against the invading Persians (whose ranks include Ghost Rider, Rocky Balboa, the Transformers, and a hunchbacked Paris Hilton). No one is safe when the Spartans take on the biggest icons in pop culture!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DWQOjAPvM8Kk1Qp3Xq0zae0Z6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7278'),
  ('873568517058666314', 'Meet Wally Sparks', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Peter Baldwin, Charlie Picerni, Richard H. Kline', 'Rodney Dangerfield, Harry Basil', 'Rodney Dangerfield, Debi Mazar, Burt Reynolds, David Ogden Stiers, Rita McKenzie, Lisa Thornhill, Mark L. Taylor, Cindy Williams', 'R', 'Wally Sparks is a tabloid TV show reporter who''s trying to boost ratings on his show. He goes to the governor''s mansion to uncover a sex scandal.', 'Wally Sparks is a tabloid TV show reporter who''s trying to boost ratings on his show. He goes to the governor''s mansion to uncover a sex scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD30gucf7NkKNFyqEMEag7l63VO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40506'),
  ('233006902550770233', 'Meetin'' WA', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Pierre Binggeli', null, 'Woody Allen, Jean-Luc Godard, Annette Insdorf', null, 'Revolutionary French New Wave director Jean-Luc Godard conducts a twenty-five minute interview with influential and acclaimed American director Woody Allen on the cultural radiation, the ubiquity and significance of Television, and how Television compares with cinema as a medium and form of expression.', 'Revolutionary French New Wave director Jean-Luc Godard conducts a twenty-five minute interview with influential and acclaimed American director Woody Allen on the cultural radiation, the ubiquity and significance of Television, and how Television compares with cinema as a medium and form of expression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQoWYYkudzf0OAe9a5uAalpQ8pl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61415'),
  ('186086951529510315', 'Meeting Dr. Sun', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yee Chih-yen, Tu Duu-chih', 'Yee Chih-yen', 'Zhan Huai-yun, Wei Han-ting, Joseph Chang, Gina Li, Honduras, River Huang, Bryan Shu-Hao Chang, Wei-Jie Hu', null, 'Two factions of Taipei''s poorest high school students both plot to steal their school''s iconic statue of the famed philosopher Dr. Sun to make some much-needed money-but when their plans clash and they find themselves at war, they have to question: what are they really fighting for?', 'Two factions of Taipei''s poorest high school students both plot to steal their school''s iconic statue of the famed philosopher Dr. Sun to make some much-needed money-but when their plans clash and they find themselves at war, they have to question: what are they really fighting for?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9RLTf25ZRURWCyXYBU0rsSYnFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281139'),
  ('1073077370919633438', 'Meeting Evil', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chris Fisher, Marvin V. Rush, Stanton Barrett', 'Chris Fisher', 'Luke Wilson, Samuel L. Jackson, Leslie Bibb, Peyton List, Muse Watson, Tracie Thoms, Bret Roberts, Jason Alan Smith', 'R', 'Follows disillusioned young family man John as a mysterious stranger, Richie takes him on a murder-fueled ride that transforms the weak-willed John into a desperate hero willing to go to any length to protect his family.', 'Follows disillusioned young family man John as a mysterious stranger, Richie takes him on a murder-fueled ride that transforms the weak-willed John into a desperate hero willing to go to any length to protect his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGbgCFTN7zUFF6NddoQC8L883HP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94204'),
  ('1086781997135744592', 'Meeting Gorbachev', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, André Singer', 'Werner Herzog, André Singer', 'Mikhail Gorbachev, Werner Herzog, Miklós Németh, Lech Wałęsa, George Shultz, George H. W. Bush, Margaret Thatcher, James Baker III', null, 'Mikhail Gorbachev, former president of the Soviet Union, sits down with filmmaker Werner Herzog to discuss his many achievements. Topics include the talks to reduce nuclear weapons, the reunification of Germany and the dissolution of his country.', 'Mikhail Gorbachev, former president of the Soviet Union, sits down with filmmaker Werner Herzog to discuss his many achievements. Topics include the talks to reduce nuclear weapons, the reunification of Germany and the dissolution of his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Xdr25dhbCVSeoht6SdZO2AKgMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541576'),
  ('331252491284135824', 'Meeting in Secret', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hideo Jojo', 'Hideo Jojo', 'Iori Kogawa, Ayumi Kuroki, Mutsuo Yoshioka, Tei Tomari', null, 'Tamio Shibata, the wife of a career woman, and Yumi, a writer who cannot sell. The relationship between the two couples was cold. One day, Mr. and Mrs. "Shibata" with different kanji move into the room next to the apartment where Mr. and Mrs. Shibata live. Tamio Shibata, who stayed at home all day, and Asako Shibata, a housewife who became a neighbor, naturally narrowed their distance. One day, a courier arrives at Tamio. However, the package was from the Shibata family next door that the delivery staff mistakenly delivered. Tamio will deliver a courier next to him...', 'Tamio Shibata, the wife of a career woman, and Yumi, a writer who cannot sell. The relationship between the two couples was cold. One day, Mr. and Mrs. "Shibata" with different kanji move into the room next to the apartment where Mr. and Mrs. Shibata live. Tamio Shibata, who stayed at home all day, and Asako Shibata, a housewife who became a neighbor, naturally narrowed their distance. One day, a courier arrives at Tamio. However, the package was from the Shibata family next door that the delivery staff mistakenly delivered. Tamio will deliver a courier next to him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEmLO3e7OcmdaIzwoheWn9cSds0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427458'),
  ('1015794173695747656', 'Meeting People Is Easy', 1998, 'Music, Documentary', 'Grant Gee, Grant Gee', null, 'Thom Yorke, Colin Greenwood, Jonny Greenwood, Ed O''Brien, Philip Selway', null, 'Meeting People Is Easy takes place during the promotion of Radiohead''s 1997 release OK Computer, containing a collage of video clips, sound bites, and dialogue going behind the scenes with the band on their world tour, showing the eventual burn-out of the group as the world tour progresses. The inaugural show of the OK Computer tour began on 22 May 1997 in Barcelona, Spain.', 'Meeting People Is Easy takes place during the promotion of Radiohead''s 1997 release OK Computer, containing a collage of video clips, sound bites, and dialogue going behind the scenes with the band on their world tour, showing the eventual burn-out of the group as the world tour progresses. The inaugural show of the OK Computer tour began on 22 May 1997 in Barcelona, Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WtnnmgQNAZ2il10aW86haQI8g1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19362'),
  ('690539600640331723', 'Meeting Place', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Goran Marković', 'Goran Marković, Dušan Kovačević', 'Rade Marković, Bogdan Diklić, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Olivera Marković, Anica Dobra, Aleksandar Berček, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković, Mirjana Karanović', null, 'During the excavation of ancient Roman ruins, an old archaeology professor accidentally opens the gate between our world and the world of the dead.', 'During the excavation of ancient Roman ruins, an old archaeology professor accidentally opens the gate between our world and the world of the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pmdW99kRRzyolp7MqFwPIBA8EF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196892'),
  ('431116419179030861', 'Meeting Point', 2021, 'Drama', 'Umut Evirgen, Veli Kuzlu', 'Umut Evirgen', 'Melisa Şenolsun, Levent Üzümcü, Belçim Bilgin, Bora Akkaş, İrem Sak, Necip Memili, Alican Yücesoy, Müge Bayramoğlu', null, 'A man in his fifties, a woman in her twenties, as different as you can possibly imagine. They meet by chance. They will spend a few extremely important hours together…', 'A man in his fifties, a woman in her twenties, as different as you can possibly imagine. They meet by chance. They will spend a few extremely important hours together…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fWK27wNdJPEOTc3JYEL0st8wbv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877787'),
  ('1010757941987244914', 'Meeting the Man: James Baldwin in Paris', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Terence Dixon, Jack Hazan', null, 'James Baldwin, Terence Dixon', null, 'In 1970, a British film crew set out to make a straightforward literary portrait of James Baldwin set in Paris, insisting on setting aside his political activism. Baldwin bristled at their questions, and the result is a fascinating, confrontational, often uncomfortable butting of heads between the filmmakers and their subject, in which the author visits the Bastille and other Parisian landmarks and reflects on revolution, colonialism, and what it means to be a Black expatriate in Europe.', 'In 1970, a British film crew set out to make a straightforward literary portrait of James Baldwin set in Paris, insisting on setting aside his political activism. Baldwin bristled at their questions, and the result is a fascinating, confrontational, often uncomfortable butting of heads between the filmmakers and their subject, in which the author visits the Bastille and other Parisian landmarks and reflects on revolution, colonialism, and what it means to be a Black expatriate in Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zExOZp91MXEFe2W7NkhJe38Bkkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665002'),
  ('873318079845019594', 'Meeting Venus', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'István Szabó, Lajos Koltai', 'Michael Hirst, István Szabó', 'Glenn Close, Niels Arestrup, Erland Josephson, Macha Méril, Johanna ter Steege, Marián Labuda, Maïté Nahyr, Victor Poletti', 'PG-13', 'Celebrated Swedish opera star Karin Anderson is slated to appear in an internationally-telecast production of Tannhauser. Ms. Anderson balks at the notion of working with obscure Hungarian conductor Zoltan Szanto. The much-anticipated production may never get off the ground, thanks to labor-management difficulties, intramural jealousies, and clashing egos. Amidst all this chaos, the mismatched Anderson and Szanto fall in love.', 'Celebrated Swedish opera star Karin Anderson is slated to appear in an internationally-telecast production of Tannhauser. Ms. Anderson balks at the notion of working with obscure Hungarian conductor Zoltan Szanto. The much-anticipated production may never get off the ground, thanks to labor-management difficulties, intramural jealousies, and clashing egos. Amidst all this chaos, the mismatched Anderson and Szanto fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCId7g6MCWBM3bcwQV4ZkSNvWvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117825'),
  ('186798760860459654', 'Meeting with Pol Pot', 2024, 'History, Drama', 'Rithy Panh, Aymerick Pilarski, Rithea Phichith', 'Pierre Erwan Guillaume, Rithy Panh', 'Irène Jacob, Grégoire Colin, Cyril Gueï, Bun-Hok Lim, Somaline Mao, Leng Thirith, Sovann Nhoeb, Paov Pitu', null, 'Democratic Kampuchea (Cambodia) - 1978. Three French journalists are invited by the Khmer Rouge to conduct an exclusive interview of the regime''s leader, Pol Pot. The country seems ideal. But behind the Potemkin village, the Khmer Rouge regime is declining and the war with Vietnam threatens to invade the country. The regime is looking for culprits, secretly carrying out a large scale genocide. Under the eyes of the journalists, the beautiful picture cracks, revealing the horror. Their journey progressively turns into a nightmare.', 'Democratic Kampuchea (Cambodia) - 1978. Three French journalists are invited by the Khmer Rouge to conduct an exclusive interview of the regime''s leader, Pol Pot. The country seems ideal. But behind the Potemkin village, the Khmer Rouge regime is declining and the war with Vietnam threatens to invade the country. The regime is looking for culprits, secretly carrying out a large scale genocide. Under the eyes of the journalists, the beautiful picture cracks, revealing the horror. Their journey progressively turns into a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWvhHqonE8IwILeYENPl5GdJfyy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1257400'),
  ('913886743055112316', 'Meetings with Remarkable Men', 1979, 'Drama', 'Peter Brook, Gilbert Taylor', 'Peter Brook, Jeanne Salzmann', 'Dragan Maksimović, Athol Fugard, Warren Mitchell, Natasha Parry, Colin Blakely, Terence Stamp, Fahro Konjhodžić, David Markham', null, 'The story of G.I. Gurdjieff an Asian mystic who after a lifetimes study developed a form of meditation incorporating modern dance.', 'The story of G.I. Gurdjieff an Asian mystic who after a lifetimes study developed a form of meditation incorporating modern dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZNXsHB65qJptFKKiJDQzPV7IKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108758'),
  ('573462263779683595', 'Meg 2: The Trench', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Cliff Lanning, Mac Montero, Teresa Orlando', 'Dean Georgaris, Erich Hoeber, Jon Hoeber', 'Jason Statham, Wu Jing, Shuya Sophia Cai, Page Kennedy, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Sienna Guillory, Cliff Curtis, Skyler Samuels', 'PG-13', 'An exploratory dive into the deepest depths of the ocean of a daring research team spirals into chaos when a malevolent mining operation threatens their mission and forces them into a high-stakes battle for survival.', 'An exploratory dive into the deepest depths of the ocean of a daring research team spirals into chaos when a malevolent mining operation threatens their mission and forces them into a high-stakes battle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4m1Au3YkjqsxF8iwQy0fPYSxE0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615656'),
  ('521140733126905236', 'Mega Cyclone', 2011, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Action', 'Sheldon Wilson, Neil Cervin, Willan Leung', 'David Ray, Sheldon Wilson', 'David Sutcliffe, Mitch Pileggi, Brett Dier, Leah Cairns, Luisa d''Oliveira, Erica Cerra, Jon Mack, Cindy Busby', null, 'Jupiter’s famous blemish, the Great Red Spot, has vanished. When massive storms are reported in North America, it quickly becomes apparent that the huge, high storm that has been swirling around Jupiter for hundreds of years has landed on Earth. Swallowing up everything in its path, the Great Red Spot threatens to transform Earth into another Jupiter-like gas giant in just a matter of days! aka Mega Cyclone', 'Jupiter’s famous blemish, the Great Red Spot, has vanished. When massive storms are reported in North America, it quickly becomes apparent that the huge, high storm that has been swirling around Jupiter for hundreds of years has landed on Earth. Swallowing up everything in its path, the Great Red Spot threatens to transform Earth into another Jupiter-like gas giant in just a matter of days! aka Mega Cyclone', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYT1ayJHcS8x0otYHJYZlr27Js.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105485'),
  ('428755020260858730', 'Mega Monster Battle: Ultra Galaxy Legends The Movie', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Takumi Furuya', 'Junya Okabe, Tatsurô Kashihara, Yuji Kobayashi', 'Shota Minami, Susumu Kurobe, Kohji Moritsugu, Takeshi Tsuruno, Shunji Igarashi, Mamoru Miyano, Hiroyuki Miyasako, Hiroyuki Konishi', null, 'Ultraman and his comrades from M-78 (including a new Ultraman, Zero, the son of Ultra Seven) join forces with other allies to fight a massive army of giant monsters led by the evil Ultraman Belial.', 'Ultraman and his comrades from M-78 (including a new Ultraman, Zero, the son of Ultra Seven) join forces with other allies to fight a massive army of giant monsters led by the evil Ultraman Belial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gylqnQIeXF6pN08UBqY7B82Myxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51948'),
  ('689621924282207024', 'Mega Piranha', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Eric Forsberg, Stuart Gillard, Donald McAlpine', 'Eric Forsberg, Stuart Gillard', 'Paul Logan, Tiffany, Barry Williams, David Labiosa, Jude Gerard Prest, Jesse Daly, Cooper Harris, William Morse', 'R', 'When a science experiment goes horribly wrong, gigantic fish gain appetites for human flesh.', 'When a science experiment goes horribly wrong, gigantic fish gain appetites for human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZB82Iqg28c5UxY3maGg1gGr3yF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39522'),
  ('866899601483893118', 'Mega Python vs. Gatoroid', 2011, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Mary Lambert, Troy Smith, Carlos Reza', 'Naomi L. Selfman', 'Tiffany, Debbie Gibson, A Martinez, Kathryn Joosten, Kevin M. Horton, Micky Dolenz, Robert R. Shafer, Carey van Dyke', null, 'A fanatical animal rights activist releases giant pythons into the Everglades, believing the wild animals should be set free. When they start decimating the native animal population, an over-zealous park ranger feeds experimental steroids to wild alligators so they can fight back. The giant pythons and gargantuan alligators go on a killing spree, and it is now left up to the two feuding women to put aside their differences to put a stop to the creatures and the destruction.', 'A fanatical animal rights activist releases giant pythons into the Everglades, believing the wild animals should be set free. When they start decimating the native animal population, an over-zealous park ranger feeds experimental steroids to wild alligators so they can fight back. The giant pythons and gargantuan alligators go on a killing spree, and it is now left up to the two feuding women to put aside their differences to put a stop to the creatures and the destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LNC320qZn3lipN227RP3USuCup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56171'),
  ('1022788689706494294', 'Mega Shark vs. Crocosaurus', 2010, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Christopher Ray, Michael Meilander, Jack Jenkins', 'Micho Rutare', 'Jaleel White, Sarah Lieving, Gary Stretch, Robert Picardo, Gerald Webb, Dylan Vox, Hannah Cowley, Nicola Lambo', null, 'When the prehistoric warm-water beast the Crocosaurus crosses paths with that cold-water monster the Mega Shark, all hell breaks loose in the oceans as the world''s top scientists explore every option to halt the aquatic frenzy. Swallowing everything in their paths -- including a submarine or two -- Croc and Mega lead an explorer and an oceanographer on a wild chase. Eventually, the desperate men turn to a volcano for aid.', 'When the prehistoric warm-water beast the Crocosaurus crosses paths with that cold-water monster the Mega Shark, all hell breaks loose in the oceans as the world''s top scientists explore every option to halt the aquatic frenzy. Swallowing everything in their paths -- including a submarine or two -- Croc and Mega lead an explorer and an oceanographer on a wild chase. Eventually, the desperate men turn to a volcano for aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y2nVRQWMjmtdqZ6zzo3CuvVDFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52454'),
  ('305758029506761647', 'Mega Shark vs. Giant Octopus', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Perez, David Meador, Alexander X. Hutchinson', 'Jack Perez', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Debbie Gibson, Sean Lawlor, Vic Chao, Jonathan Nation, Mark Hengst, Michael Teh, Chris Haley', null, 'The California coast is terrorized by two enormous prehistoric sea creatures as they battle each other for supremacy of the sea.', 'The California coast is terrorized by two enormous prehistoric sea creatures as they battle each other for supremacy of the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQsfCkWxK8j9MLrA4ydSMWB2Cpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17911'),
  ('151728914746610446', 'Mega Shark vs. Kolossus', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Britt Meehan, Christopher Ray, Laura Beth Love', 'Edward DeRuiter', 'Illeana Douglas, Amy Rider, Brody Hutzler, Adam Dunnells, Tara Price, Ernest Lee Thomas, Edward DeRuiter, Christine Kent', null, 'In search of a new energy source, Russia accidentally reawakens the Kolossus - a giant robot doomsday device from the Cold War. At the same time, a new Mega Shark appears, threatening global security.', 'In search of a new energy source, Russia accidentally reawakens the Kolossus - a giant robot doomsday device from the Cold War. At the same time, a new Mega Shark appears, threatening global security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXggKwPOgu01UlDQ3qB1u4t9QK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343097'),
  ('426281351423828541', 'Mega Shark vs. Mecha Shark', 2014, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Julie Johnsen, Tony Bardales, Ben Demaree', 'H. Perry Horton, Jose Prendes', 'Christopher Judge, Elisabeth Röhm, Debbie Gibson, Matt Lagan, Hannah Levien, Emma Rose Maloney, Steve Hanks, Simon Barbaro', 'NR', 'When another Mega Shark returns from the depths of the sea, world militaries go on high alert. Ocean traffic grinds to a standstill as everyone lives in fear of the insatiable beast. Out of options, the US government unleashes the top secret Mecha Shark project -- a mechanical shark built to have the same exact characteristics as Mega. A pair of scientists pilot the mechanical creature as they fight Mega in a pitched battle to save the planet. But when faulty mechanics cause the Mecha to go after humans, the scientists must somehow guide Mega to Mecha in hopes that the two titans will kill each other - or risk untold worldwide destruction.', 'When another Mega Shark returns from the depths of the sea, world militaries go on high alert. Ocean traffic grinds to a standstill as everyone lives in fear of the insatiable beast. Out of options, the US government unleashes the top secret Mecha Shark project -- a mechanical shark built to have the same exact characteristics as Mega. A pair of scientists pilot the mechanical creature as they fight Mega in a pitched battle to save the planet. But when faulty mechanics cause the Mecha to go after humans, the scientists must somehow guide Mega to Mecha in hopes that the two titans will kill each other - or risk untold worldwide destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUCNz12ZezKkT3jzvMhz9eiVXnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246594'),
  ('782091073859354826', 'Mega Time Squad', 2018, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action, Crime, Adventure', 'Tim van Dammen', 'Tim van Dammen', 'Jonny Brugh, Anton Tennet, Milo Cawthorne, Josh McKenzie, Ashley Jones, Jaya Beach-Robertson, Arlo Gibson, Simon Ward', null, 'A small-town criminal finds an ancient Chinese time-travel device that can help him pull off a heist and start a new life-but he may not survive the consequences of tampering with time. The Castle meets Looper, Mega Time Squad is a study in high-meets-low, combining elements of the sci-fi, the crime thriller and the comedy to make a comedy heist film with a time-traveling twist.', 'A small-town criminal finds an ancient Chinese time-travel device that can help him pull off a heist and start a new life-but he may not survive the consequences of tampering with time. The Castle meets Looper, Mega Time Squad is a study in high-meets-low, combining elements of the sci-fi, the crime thriller and the comedy to make a comedy heist film with a time-traveling twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thHCbZVdA4DL0R8f84aUz83FSgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521936'),
  ('194494794771585923', 'Megaboa', 2021, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Mario N. Bonassin, Jake Jalbert', 'Alex Heerman', 'Eric Roberts, Michelle Elizabeth O''Shea, Emilia Torello, Joe Herrera, Garrett Schulte, Vimala Veera, Jadon Cal, Ray Acevedo', null, 'On a trip to Colombia, a group of college students encounter a fifty-foot boa constrictor, hungry for blood.', 'On a trip to Colombia, a group of college students encounter a fifty-foot boa constrictor, hungry for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAnAMv3eyQiGI1z2k8NsvH0Y6r5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920081'),
