  ('357044601805649197', 'Megadeth: Behind the Mask', 2026, 'Music, Documentary', 'Casey Tebo', null, 'Dave Mustaine', 'R', 'Dave Mustaine reveals 40 years of Megadeth history and premieres their final album in a special event featuring career-spanning interviews and track-by-track commentary on this landmark release.', 'Dave Mustaine reveals 40 years of Megadeth history and premieres their final album in a special event featuring career-spanning interviews and track-by-track commentary on this landmark release.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2zoPaXmzrqYHgFk3illCTHjEzqA.jpg', 'plex:movie:megadeth-behind-the-mask'),
  ('866256594058744148', 'MegaFault', 2009, 'TV Movie, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'David Michael Latt, Adam Silver', 'Paul Bales', 'Brittany Murphy, Eriq La Salle, Paul Logan, Bruce Davison, Justin Hartley, Jack Goldenberg, Paul M. Walker III, Anya Benton', 'PG-13', 'When miner Charley ''Boomer'' Baxter sets off a series of massive mining detonations in West Virginia, a gigantic earthquake is soon rocking the North Atlantic, exposing a deep seismic fault that runs the length of the North American continent. Joining forces with government seismology expert Dr Amy Lane, Boomer must now race against time to stop the chasm that is threatening to tear America - and the entire world - in half.', 'When miner Charley ''Boomer'' Baxter sets off a series of massive mining detonations in West Virginia, a gigantic earthquake is soon rocking the North Atlantic, exposing a deep seismic fault that runs the length of the North American continent. Joining forces with government seismology expert Dr Amy Lane, Boomer must now race against time to stop the chasm that is threatening to tear America - and the entire world - in half.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wa3v5osMnFaEUImfMiWOTIjv2lQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30289'),
  ('770979943137801473', 'MegaForce', 1982, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Hal Needham, Michael C. Butler, Bill Coker', 'James Whittaker, Albert S. Ruddy, Hal Needham', 'Barry Bostwick, Michael Beck, Persis Khambatta, Edward Mulhare, Henry Silva, George Furth, Mike Kulcsar, Ralph Wilcox', 'PG', 'MegaForce is an elite multi-national military unit that does the jobs that individual governments won''t. When the peaceful Republic of Sardun in under threat from their more aggressive neighbor, the beautiful Major Zara and General Byrne-White see the help of Ace Hunter and MegaForce.', 'MegaForce is an elite multi-national military unit that does the jobs that individual governments won''t. When the peaceful Republic of Sardun in under threat from their more aggressive neighbor, the beautiful Major Zara and General Byrne-White see the help of Ace Hunter and MegaForce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hX5p2thHjpARwAs6MvBlrrvwutL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27380'),
  ('1128318772370622014', 'Megalodon', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Pat Corbitt', 'Stanley Isaacs , Gary J. Tunnicliffe', 'Leighanne Littrell, Robin Sachs, Al Sapienza, Mark Sheppard, Jennifer Sommerfeld, Evan Mirand, Steve Scionti, Fred Belford', null, 'A skeptical news reporter is invited by the CEO of Nexecon Petroleum to document the safety of Colossus, the largest drilling and refining platform ever constructed. As the powerful drill tears through the seabed, a fissure forms, revealing a hidden mirror ocean teeming with prehistoric life. When a team is sent to access the damage, it comes face to face with the most powerful oceanic predator that ever lived: Carcharodon Megalodon.', 'A skeptical news reporter is invited by the CEO of Nexecon Petroleum to document the safety of Colossus, the largest drilling and refining platform ever constructed. As the powerful drill tears through the seabed, a fissure forms, revealing a hidden mirror ocean teeming with prehistoric life. When a team is sent to access the damage, it comes face to face with the most powerful oceanic predator that ever lived: Carcharodon Megalodon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLzlNq3fjNQ64TRRLKlNkrDpYLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33645'),
  ('41714674373177827', 'Megalodon', 2018, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror, TV Movie', 'Dante Yore, James Thomas', 'Canyon Prince, James Thomas', 'Michael Madsen, Scott C. Roe, Ego Mikitas, Paulina Nguyen, Dominic Pace, Aimee Stolte, Daniel Joo, Caroline Harris', 'PG-13', 'A military vessel on the search for an unidentified submersible finds themselves face to face with a giant shark, forced to use only what they have on board to defend themselves from the monstrous beast.', 'A military vessel on the search for an unidentified submersible finds themselves face to face with a giant shark, forced to use only what they have on board to defend themselves from the monstrous beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hES2eVAbVt08JJTqgu3jmI34Yxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523931'),
  ('980001060413258658', 'Megalodon Rising', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Carolan, Brian Nowak', 'Koichi Petetsky', 'Tom Sizemore, O''Shay Neal, Wynter Eddins, Freda Yifan Jing, Zhan Wang, Adam He, Lisa Ellee, Elisa Menniti', 'NR', 'When history’s greatest aquatic predator returns, the armada of modern warships sent to destroy it has no chance at all.', 'When history’s greatest aquatic predator returns, the armada of modern warships sent to destroy it has no chance at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWeWU43mNVzpAnjgzxnvi9xgo9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866462'),
  ('860295837501558704', 'Megalodon: The Frenzy', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brendan Petrizzo, Marcus Friedlander, James Mahoney', 'Ryan Ebert, Bill Hanstock', 'Eric Roberts, Caroline Williams, Jessica Chancellor, Alex Trumble, Sharon Desiree, Victoria Grant, Jordan Hubbard, Jordy Tulleners', null, 'When a frenzy of five Megalodons torment the open ocean, the stakes have never been higher.', 'When a frenzy of five Megalodons torment the open ocean, the stakes have never been higher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1o0jJYxgF7IJKdYNlDWgxomt2ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1165918'),
  ('746827275706048636', 'Megalomaniac', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Karim Ouelhaj, François Schmitt', 'Karim Ouelhaj', 'Eline Schumacher, Benjamin Ramon, Wim Willaert, Raphaëlle Lubansu, Pierre Nisse, Quentin Lasbazeilles, Olivier Picard, Catherine Jandrain', 'NR', 'Felix and Martha, the two offspring of legendary serial murderer The Skinner of Mons, grapple with the grotesque legacy bequeathed to them. While Martha works a menial janitorial job, Felix continues his father''s reign of terror. But following a brutal attack at work, Martha quickly descends into madness, finding she must come to terms with the infamous blood that flows through her veins.', 'Felix and Martha, the two offspring of legendary serial murderer The Skinner of Mons, grapple with the grotesque legacy bequeathed to them. While Martha works a menial janitorial job, Felix continues his father''s reign of terror. But following a brutal attack at work, Martha quickly descends into madness, finding she must come to terms with the infamous blood that flows through her veins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HKjrjwTjvDscC9uZNk6dCRHcfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841742'),
  ('59052866334225747', 'Megalopolis', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Roman Coppola, Mihai Malaimare Jr., Philip Banks', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Adam Driver, Giancarlo Esposito, Nathalie Emmanuel, Aubrey Plaza, Shia LaBeouf, Jon Voight, Laurence Fishburne, Talia Shire', 'R', 'In a futuristic New York known as New Rome, visionary architect Cesar Catilina dreams of building "Megalopolis," a utopian city that redefines society’s limits. Opposing him is the corrupt Mayor Franklyn Cicero, who clings to power and profit. Between them stands Julia, the mayor’s daughter, whose love for Cesar forces her to choose between loyalty, ambition, and the fate of humanity.', 'In a futuristic New York known as New Rome, visionary architect Cesar Catilina dreams of building "Megalopolis," a utopian city that redefines society’s limits. Opposing him is the corrupt Mayor Franklyn Cicero, who clings to power and profit. Between them stands Julia, the mayor’s daughter, whose love for Cesar forces her to choose between loyalty, ambition, and the fate of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Sok3HNA3r1GHnK2lCytHyBz1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592831'),
  ('594795721645302627', 'Megamind', 2010, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Tom McGrath, Corban Gossett, Peter Farson', 'Alan Schoolcraft, Brent Simons', 'Will Ferrell, Brad Pitt, Tina Fey, Jonah Hill, David Cross, Ben Stiller, Justin Theroux, Jessica Schulte', 'PG', 'After Megamind, a highly intelligent alien supervillain, defeats his long-time nemesis Metro Man, Megamind creates a new hero to fight, but must act to save the city when his "creation" becomes an even worse villain than he was.', 'After Megamind, a highly intelligent alien supervillain, defeats his long-time nemesis Metro Man, Megamind creates a new hero to fight, but must act to save the city when his "creation" becomes an even worse villain than he was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZ9ytt3sPTx62XTfN56ILSuYWRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38055'),
  ('950521306431466433', 'Megamind vs. the Doom Syndicate', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Eric Fogel', 'Brent Simons, Alan Schoolcraft', 'Keith Ferguson, Laura Post, Josh Brener, Maya Tuttle, Emily Tuñon, Talon Warburton, Scott Adsit, Chris Sullivan', 'G', 'Megamind''s former villain team, The Doom Syndicate, has returned. Our newly crowned blue hero must now keep up evil appearances until he can assemble his friends (Roxanne, Ol'' Chum and Keiko) to stop his former evil teammates from launching Metro City to the Moon.', 'Megamind''s former villain team, The Doom Syndicate, has returned. Our newly crowned blue hero must now keep up evil appearances until he can assemble his friends (Roxanne, Ol'' Chum and Keiko) to stop his former evil teammates from launching Metro City to the Moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1N7terrMeZPwK5qq31MUD0HQ3IG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1239251'),
  ('350107786304137496', 'Megamind: The Button of Doom', 2011, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Simon J. Smith', 'Brent Simons, Alan Schoolcraft', 'Will Ferrell, David Cross, Michelle Belforte, Jordan Alexander Hauser, Kevin Bailey, Dante James Hauser, Declan Swift, Fintan Thomas Swift', 'PG', 'For their first day on the job as the new protectors of Metro City, Megamind and Minion are selling off the gadgets from their evil lair. But when one seemingly harmless "button" unleashes the gigantic robot MEGA-MEGAmind, the duo will have to resort to their old tricks to restore order.', 'For their first day on the job as the new protectors of Metro City, Megamind and Minion are selling off the gadgets from their evil lair. But when one seemingly harmless "button" unleashes the gigantic robot MEGA-MEGAmind, the duo will have to resort to their old tricks to restore order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHWPPDPvtUtLtzEPAKAut7QACxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57718'),
  ('6499348090483543', 'Megan', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Silvio Nacucchi', 'Silvio Nacucchi', 'Sadie Katz, Randy Wayne, Greg Travis, Lily Anthonissen, Olga Dumnova', null, 'A hiker finds shelter in a mountain lodge inhabited by two strange women.', 'A hiker finds shelter in a mountain lodge inhabited by two strange women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFsqpz9wn7yREHWGQvviiJE9RVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883987'),
  ('1078256078933313784', 'Megan Is Missing', 2011, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Goi, Keith Eisberg, Maritza Murillo', 'Michael Goi', 'Amber Perkins, Rachel Quinn, Dean Waite, Jael Elizabeth Steinmeyer, Kara Wang, Brittany Hingle, Carolina Sabate, Trigve Hagen', 'NR', 'Fourteen-year–old Megan and her best friend Amy spend a lot of time on the internet, posting videos of themselves and chatting with guys online. One night Megan chats with a guy named Josh who convinces her to meet him for a date. The next day, Megan is missing—forever. Based on actual cases of child abduction.', 'Fourteen-year–old Megan and her best friend Amy spend a lot of time on the internet, posting videos of themselves and chatting with guys online. One night Megan chats with a guy named Josh who convinces her to meet him for a date. The next day, Megan is missing—forever. Based on actual cases of child abduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqFIC6miVQWBUrkQYk3Fe0jqXrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63197'),
  ('991973302911515958', 'Megan Leavey', 2017, 'Drama, War', 'Gabriela Cowperthwaite, Lorenzo Senatore, Martin Krauka', 'Pamela Gray, Annie Mumolo, Tim Lovestedt', 'Kate Mara, Ramón Rodríguez, Tom Felton, Bradley Whitford, Will Patton, Sam Keeley, Common, Edie Falco', 'PG-13', 'The true story of Marine Corporal Megan Leavey, who forms a powerful bond with an aggressive combat dog, Rex. While deployed in Iraq, the two complete more than 100 missions and save countless lives, until an IED explosion puts their faithfulness to the test.', 'The true story of Marine Corporal Megan Leavey, who forms a powerful bond with an aggressive combat dog, Rex. While deployed in Iraq, the two complete more than 100 missions and save countless lives, until an IED explosion puts their faithfulness to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yq66hYkXFaj2DDqCkF6T2wT7VxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424488'),
  ('965763452521328596', 'Megazone 23', 1985, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Romance, Music', 'Noboru Ishiguro, Ichiro Itano, Yasuo Hasegawa', 'Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', 'Maria Kawamura, Masato Kubota, Kaneto Shiozawa, Katsumi Toriumi, Mina Tominaga, Kumi Miyasato, Mayumi Shou, Daisuke Gori', null, 'A young biker stumbles onto a prototype motorcycle with a hidden function that has a link to the true nature of his world.', 'A young biker stumbles onto a prototype motorcycle with a hidden function that has a link to the true nature of his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOLGwByK0rAFIrTeLMh967yOEgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155017'),
  ('168839041484987325', 'Megazone 23 II', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action', 'Ichiro Itano, Katsuhisa Yamada, Yasuo Hasegawa', 'Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', 'Kazuki Yao, Maria Kawamura, Shigeru Chiba, Koichi Hashimoto, Kumi Miyasato, Banjo Ginga, Issei Futamata, Show Hayami', null, 'The Dezalg have returned with a new, horrible weapon and unleashed it on Megazone 23''s defenses. Believing their salvation is also in new weapons, B.D. is again bent on breaking the EVE''s final protection level.Full control of Megazone 23 would mean unfettered weapons development. Shogo, meanwhile, has tried to return to a ''normal'' life; Hanging out with his biker gang, "Trash" and his girlfriend, Yui. But, his convictions about the Megazone''s shadow government policies haven''t changed and when EVE calls for his help, he discovers where the Garland bike has been hidden. It''s showdown time for Shogo and B.D., Trash and the military, as well as the Dezalg and Megazone. However, EVE''s final secret, A.D.A.M., may mean no one will survive.', 'The Dezalg have returned with a new, horrible weapon and unleashed it on Megazone 23''s defenses. Believing their salvation is also in new weapons, B.D. is again bent on breaking the EVE''s final protection level.Full control of Megazone 23 would mean unfettered weapons development. Shogo, meanwhile, has tried to return to a ''normal'' life; Hanging out with his biker gang, "Trash" and his girlfriend, Yui. But, his convictions about the Megazone''s shadow government policies haven''t changed and when EVE calls for his help, he discovers where the Garland bike has been hidden. It''s showdown time for Shogo and B.D., Trash and the military, as well as the Dezalg and Megazone. However, EVE''s final secret, A.D.A.M., may mean no one will survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDKjaBviFNTYjAk3p0AWiy5rpOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160393'),
  ('757972621930524554', 'Megazone 23 III - Part 1 - The Awakening of Eve', 1989, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Aramaki, Kenichi Yatagai', 'Emu Arii', 'Hiroko Kasahara, Saki Takaoka, Takeshi Kusao, Maria Kawamura, Masato Kubota, Mitsuo Iwata, Nozomu Sasaki, Yuriko Fuchizaki', null, 'Years after the events of Megazone 23 II, the only city on Earth is the supposedly idyllic Eden. There lives Eiji Takanaka, a B Level hacker who has just been accepted into EX, the organization that controls Eden. However, before his first day on the job, he becomes embroiled in a network war, a legendary figure named EVE, and a plot to re-inhabit the Earth.', 'Years after the events of Megazone 23 II, the only city on Earth is the supposedly idyllic Eden. There lives Eiji Takanaka, a B Level hacker who has just been accepted into EX, the organization that controls Eden. However, before his first day on the job, he becomes embroiled in a network war, a legendary figure named EVE, and a plot to re-inhabit the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDuIApsp946VbJZBM4jtlNfAaLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160399'),
  ('879955024266886980', 'Megham', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Priyadarshan, Sanjeev Shankar', 'T Damodaran', 'Mammootty, Dileep, Priya Gill, Pooja Batra, Nedumudi Venu, Sreenivasan, Cochin Haneefa, Mamukkoya', null, 'Col. Ravivarma Thampuran visits the home village of his subordinate Mani where he finds and eventually falls in love with a girl named Meenakshi.', 'Col. Ravivarma Thampuran visits the home village of his subordinate Mani where he finds and eventually falls in love with a girl named Meenakshi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teU4hsqiSmrKgD3IE9NdLgLVmn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278059'),
  ('882437459928269667', 'Megiddo: The Omega Code 2', 2001, 'Action, Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Albert J. Dunk, Jerram A. Swartz', 'John Fasano, Stephan Blinn', 'Michael York, Michael Biehn, Diane Venora, Udo Kier, R. Lee Ermey, Franco Nero, Jim Metzler, Noah Huntley', 'PG-13', 'Stone (the Antichrist) becomes President of the European Union and uses his seat of power to dissolve the United Nations and create a one world government called the World Union. Megiddo is a supernatural ride into a world teetering on the edge of the Apocalypse. It follows the rise of a Machiavellian leader bent on amassing the armies of the world for the battle of Armageddon while calamities of Biblical proportions pummel the Earth.', 'Stone (the Antichrist) becomes President of the European Union and uses his seat of power to dissolve the United Nations and create a one world government called the World Union. Megiddo is a supernatural ride into a world teetering on the edge of the Apocalypse. It follows the rise of a Machiavellian leader bent on amassing the armies of the world for the battle of Armageddon while calamities of Biblical proportions pummel the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBFh6xxEManI9YJ5acKBfhqT9Nu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30379'),
  ('1008811266253175151', 'Mehua', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Camille Aigloz, Michiru Hirooka Baudet, Simon Anding Malandin', 'Camille Aigloz, Diane Tran Duc, Lucy Holmes', 'Lucille Boudonnat, Thierry Mercier, Alexandra Naoum', null, 'Two young women are about to receive the great honor of being sacrificed to their Mexica gods; but the cruel and bloody ritual does not go as expected.', 'Two young women are about to receive the great honor of being sacrificed to their Mexica gods; but the cruel and bloody ritual does not go as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yObwVrghSQVUmZRM6aS5Ti5Q2GY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474763'),
  ('781131431883172169', 'Mei and the Kittenbus', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Atsushi Okui, Masayuki Miyaji', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Chika Sakamoto, Hayao Miyazaki', null, 'Mei is eating a caramel on one very windy day, when suddenly a whirlwind appears and starts chasing her. The whirlwind turns out to be a baby cat bus. Mei offers the kitten a caramel and the two become friends. That night, the baby cat bus visits Mei. Letting Mei ride inside him, he leaps out into the sky. They head for the midnight forest full of ghosts. Other cat buses large and small have also gathered together.', 'Mei is eating a caramel on one very windy day, when suddenly a whirlwind appears and starts chasing her. The whirlwind turns out to be a baby cat bus. Mei offers the kitten a caramel and the two become friends. That night, the baby cat bus visits Mei. Letting Mei ride inside him, he leaps out into the sky. They head for the midnight forest full of ghosts. Other cat buses large and small have also gathered together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3dXeBTOuZMZKC4B3MXa553E2Xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158483'),
  ('175642867681209319', 'Mein erster Freund, Mutter und ich', 2003, 'TV Movie', 'Annette Ernst', null, 'Andrea Sawatzki, Herbert Knaup, Jasmin Schwiers, Florian Jahr, Karoline Schuch, Doris Kunstmann, Philipp Sonntag, Joseph M''Barek', null, '"Men cheat on women, it''s a law of nature." Sonja has had some bad experiences and now wants to save her sixteen-year-old daughter Nicole from the worst. The shy teenager has just won the heart of classmate Daniel. Nicole''s eternally pubescent father Sven is just as embarrassing as her mother. He messes up his ex-wife''s man-hating ways with superfluous macho tips.', '"Men cheat on women, it''s a law of nature." Sonja has had some bad experiences and now wants to save her sixteen-year-old daughter Nicole from the worst. The shy teenager has just won the heart of classmate Daniel. Nicole''s eternally pubescent father Sven is just as embarrassing as her mother. He messes up his ex-wife''s man-hating ways with superfluous macho tips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pDwVCkqQo1bUWMCK9jlPdaA2Xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138715'),
  ('1036935640676708273', 'Mein Kampf', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Urs Odermatt', 'George Tabori, Martin Lehwald', 'Götz George, Tom Schilling, Anna Unterberger, Wolf Bachofner, Simon Schwarz, Henning Peker, Elisabeth Orth, Paul Matic', null, 'The young, despotic and untalented artist Adolf Hitler comes to Vienna to study art. He befriends the Jew Schlomo Herzl working on a novel with the title "Mein Kampf". Hitler is rejected by the Vienna Academy of Fine Arts. Herzl''s concern for the sad young man continues, and leads him to a new career with disastrous consequences for world history.', 'The young, despotic and untalented artist Adolf Hitler comes to Vienna to study art. He befriends the Jew Schlomo Herzl working on a novel with the title "Mein Kampf". Hitler is rejected by the Vienna Academy of Fine Arts. Herzl''s concern for the sad young man continues, and leads him to a new career with disastrous consequences for world history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGhqkSjDgZSid0K1v5odwMQNSMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48742'),
  ('940608718927522614', 'Mein Name ist Otto', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Christine Uschy Wernke', null, 'Otto Waalkes, Michael Herbig, Udo Lindenberg, Hape Kerkeling, Jan Delay, Linh Hu, Ski Aggu, Joost Klein', null, 'The film tells the fairytale story of a scrawny East Frisian who, despite minimal starting opportunities, has had a unique career. Otto has always trusted his gut feeling, even when he often faced challenges that threatened to jeopardize his career. My Name is Otto shows comical moments and emotional high points, but also addresses the fears of a man who to this day firmly believes that his lucky streak could one day end.', 'The film tells the fairytale story of a scrawny East Frisian who, despite minimal starting opportunities, has had a unique career. Otto has always trusted his gut feeling, even when he often faced challenges that threatened to jeopardize his career. My Name is Otto shows comical moments and emotional high points, but also addresses the fears of a man who to this day firmly believes that his lucky streak could one day end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djbOtyH1MF5ESmzDCdE3RRxLWtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1408240'),
  ('344390661391350504', 'Meine Mutter ist unmöglich', 2018, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Jurij Neumann, Oliver-Maximilian Kraus', 'Christian Pfannenschmidt', 'Diana Amft, Stephan Luca, Margarita Broich, Arijana Antunovic, Filip Peeters, Vittorio Alfieri, Jessica Walther-Gabory, Hanno Friedrich', null, 'Even a God-like gourmet instance can sometimes be wrong: out of the blue, Eifel landlady Toni gets a star for her cooking skills. There is in their "copper can" only a lunch table with bourgeois home cooking. Of course, it is a mistake of the renowned restaurant guide, the star chef Rufus expensive: without the prestigious star threatens his eponymous gourmet temple off! When his snobbish regulars turn to Toni''s "copper can", the landlady gets cold feet: In contrast to her mother Heidi, she wants to eliminate the error as quickly as possible from the world.', 'Even a God-like gourmet instance can sometimes be wrong: out of the blue, Eifel landlady Toni gets a star for her cooking skills. There is in their "copper can" only a lunch table with bourgeois home cooking. Of course, it is a mistake of the renowned restaurant guide, the star chef Rufus expensive: without the prestigious star threatens his eponymous gourmet temple off! When his snobbish regulars turn to Toni''s "copper can", the landlady gets cold feet: In contrast to her mother Heidi, she wants to eliminate the error as quickly as possible from the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1I6JPeKjC54TAIMZMOyP2vtCKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525121'),
  ('397538955406424078', 'Meine Tochter Anne Frank', 2015, 'Drama', 'Raymond Ley', 'Raymond Ley, Hannah Ley', 'Mala Emde, Götz Schubert, Axel Milberg, André Hennicke, Lion Wasczyk, Hannah Ley, Stefan Mehren, Harald Schrott', null, 'The name Anne Frank stands for courage and confidence in hopeless times. But also for the cheeky and unsparing view of an adolescent on her family and her environment. Millions of people around the world know her diary, she wrote it while hiding from the Nazis. With this docu-drama, the first major German film adaptation of the life story of the Frankfurt girl is now available. The film follows Anne''s fate from a happy childhood to hiding in the Secret Annex in Amsterdam to her death in the Bergen-Belsen concentration camp. It focuses on the relationship between father and daughter. Otto Frank was the only one who survived the betrayal of the Secret Annex residents. The most secret thoughts and longings', 'The name Anne Frank stands for courage and confidence in hopeless times. But also for the cheeky and unsparing view of an adolescent on her family and her environment. Millions of people around the world know her diary, she wrote it while hiding from the Nazis. With this docu-drama, the first major German film adaptation of the life story of the Frankfurt girl is now available. The film follows Anne''s fate from a happy childhood to hiding in the Secret Annex in Amsterdam to her death in the Bergen-Belsen concentration camp. It focuses on the relationship between father and daughter. Otto Frank was the only one who survived the betrayal of the Secret Annex residents. The most secret thoughts and longings', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcdgg5znjeQUgQDClktMNzllN1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326178'),
  ('831583263659554671', 'Meister des Todes', 2015, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'Daniel Harrich, Gernot Roll', 'Daniel Harrich, Gert Heidenreich', 'Heiner Lauterbach, Veronica Ferres, Axel Milberg, Udo Wachtveitl, Alina Levshin, August Zirner, Hanno Koffler, Herbert Knaup', null, 'Based on explosive investigations, the thriller "Meister des Todes" ("Master of Death") tells of a German arms manufacturer and their questionable weapon exports to Mexiko.', 'Based on explosive investigations, the thriller "Meister des Todes" ("Master of Death") tells of a German arms manufacturer and their questionable weapon exports to Mexiko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOLjCUTiL1aNFEvlCAz5XqVVMAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350203'),
  ('1029022115480397185', 'Meiyazhagan', 2024, 'Family, Drama', 'C. Prem Kumar, Mahendiran Jayaraju', 'C. Prem Kumar', 'Arvind Swamy, Karthi, Rajkiran, Jayaprakash, Sri Divya, Devadarshini, Swathi Konde, Rajkumar', null, 'Twenty-two years after losing his home, Arulmozhi Varman returns to his native Thanjavur to attend his cousin''s wedding. Amidst the celebrations, Arul is reintroduced to an upbeat man whom he cannot recall. With the help of the unknown man, Arul reconnects with his past.', 'Twenty-two years after losing his home, Arulmozhi Varman returns to his native Thanjavur to attend his cousin''s wedding. Amidst the celebrations, Arul is reintroduced to an upbeat man whom he cannot recall. With the help of the unknown man, Arul reconnects with his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngDEH7YqVaMCAD4LpNxRl6ScJnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136423'),
  ('623987911041318328', 'Mekong Hotel', 2012, 'Drama', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul, Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Jenjira Pongpas, Maiyatan Techaparn, Sakda Kaewbuadee, Chai Bhatana, Chatchai Suban, Apichatpong Weerasethakul', null, 'Shifting between fact and fiction in a hotel situated along the Mekong River, a filmmaker rehearses a movie expressing the bonds between a vampire-like mother and daughter.', 'Shifting between fact and fiction in a hotel situated along the Mekong River, a filmmaker rehearses a movie expressing the bonds between a vampire-like mother and daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkBDbAue7BkX0F7k59wsnKxbYUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110377'),
  ('934965399110315920', 'Mektoub, My Love : Canto Due', 2025, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Marco Graziaplena, Nasredine Ben Maati', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Ghalya Lacroix', 'Shaïn Boumedine, Jodi Taylor, Salim Kéchiouche, André Jacobs, Ophélie Bau, Dany Martial, Delinda Kechiche, Alexia Chardard', null, 'Amin returns to Sète after studying in Paris, still dreaming of cinema. By chance, an American producer on vacation takes an interest in his project and wants his wife, Jess, to play the lead role. But fate, whimsical as ever, has its own rules.', 'Amin returns to Sète after studying in Paris, still dreaming of cinema. By chance, an American producer on vacation takes an interest in his project and wants his wife, Jess, to play the lead role. But fate, whimsical as ever, has its own rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQXfFFcMFTSu84TslhfQjUiNw7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661568'),
  ('106371181507880043', 'Mektoub, My Love: Canto Uno', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marco Graziaplena, Abdellatif Kechiche', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Ghalya Lacroix', 'Shaïn Boumedine, Ophélie Bau, Salim Kéchiouche, Lou Luttiau, Alexia Chardard, Hafsia Herzi, Delinda Kechiche, Kamel Saadi', null, 'Amin, an aspiring screenwriter living in Paris, returns home for the summer, in Sète, South of France. It is a time of reconnecting with his family and his childhood friends. Together with his cousin Tony and his best friend Ophélie, he spends his time between the Tunisian restaurant run by his parents, the local bars and the beaches frequented by girls on holiday.', 'Amin, an aspiring screenwriter living in Paris, returns home for the summer, in Sète, South of France. It is a time of reconnecting with his family and his childhood friends. Together with his cousin Tony and his best friend Ophélie, he spends his time between the Tunisian restaurant run by his parents, the local bars and the beaches frequented by girls on holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJLL0E243c8CBTlryvYh69rQQV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337676'),
  ('88820779947248876', 'Mektoub, My Love: Intermezzo', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Marco Graziaplena', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Ghalya Lacroix', 'Lou Luttiau, Alexia Chardard, Shaïn Boumedine, Ophélie Bau, Salim Kéchiouche, Hafsia Herzi, Marie Bernard, Roméo de Lacour', null, 'Summer is coming to an end, Amin and his friends meet Marie, a young parisian student.', 'Summer is coming to an end, Amin and his friends meet Marie, a young parisian student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3F4HpGnAlm34bsukL1TAlrBon6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504588'),
  ('1010835232752328371', 'Mela', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dharmesh Darshan', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Aamir Khan, Twinkle Khanna, Faisal Hussain Khan, Tinnu Verma, Johny Lever, Ayub Khan, Navneet Nishan, Asrani', null, 'Best mates Kishen and Shankar decide to help village belle Roopa avenge her family''s death, but their friendship is tested in the process.', 'Best mates Kishen and Shankar decide to help village belle Roopa avenge her family''s death, but their friendship is tested in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPF46QLaBni9PXvbjmA8zSeaiJ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159666'),
  ('762340805891168838', 'Melancholia', 2008, 'Drama', 'Lav Diaz', 'Lav Diaz', 'Angeli Bayani, Perry Dizon, Roeder Camañag, Malaya, Emmanuel Dela Cruz, Dante Perez, Raul Arellano, Irma Adlawan', null, 'Three people start a strange therapy to escape their agonies. Each attempts to process those they lost during the Marcos dictatorship while examining their own grief.', 'Three people start a strange therapy to escape their agonies. Each attempts to process those they lost during the Marcos dictatorship while examining their own grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3mzimDOgLArXv0xOviNje84VGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200785'),
  ('1126610228594392105', 'Melancholia', 2011, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lars von Trier, Manuel Alberto Claro, Anders Refn', 'Lars von Trier', 'Kirsten Dunst, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Kiefer Sutherland, Alexander Skarsgård, Cameron Spurr, Stellan Skarsgård, John Hurt, Brady Corbet', 'R', 'Two sisters find their already strained relationship challenged as a mysterious new planet threatens to collide with Earth.', 'Two sisters find their already strained relationship challenged as a mysterious new planet threatens to collide with Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMneszMiQuTKY8JUXrGGB5vwqJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62215'),
  ('711067210210193390', 'Melancholic', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Seiji Tanaka', 'Seiji Tanaka', 'Yoji Minagawa, Yoshitomo Isozaki, Mebuki Yoshida, Makoto Hada, Masanobu Yada, Yasuyuki Hamaya, Stefanie Arianne, Keiji Yamashita', null, 'Kazuhiko, a graduate of a prestigious university, wasn''t enjoying his life, until he takes a job at a bathhouse. Then he discovers that the baths are used as a space for killing people after closing hours.', 'Kazuhiko, a graduate of a prestigious university, wasn''t enjoying his life, until he takes a job at a bathhouse. Then he discovers that the baths are used as a space for killing people after closing hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuf1LoZQ7Ok9th6QWSbbVCvp5iL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566945'),
  ('900894532886668291', 'Mélancolie ouvrière', 2018, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Gérard Mordillat, François Catonné', 'Gérard Mordillat, Philippe Sainteny', 'Virginie Ledoyen, François Cluzet, Philippe Torreton, François Morel, Marc Barbé, Patrice Valota, Jacques Pater', null, 'Long live the strike! Lucie Baud, one of the pioneers of the women''s movement, went with creativity, fighting spirit and the power of singing against the weapons of male-dominated capitalist society in nineteenth-century France. The film, based on true events, describes the ambitious fight of a silk moth. She stood up for the rights of the female working class to end maltreatment and oppression once and for all. For the revolution in women''s rights, she even put her family back and fought to the end for their beliefs.', 'Long live the strike! Lucie Baud, one of the pioneers of the women''s movement, went with creativity, fighting spirit and the power of singing against the weapons of male-dominated capitalist society in nineteenth-century France. The film, based on true events, describes the ambitious fight of a silk moth. She stood up for the rights of the female working class to end maltreatment and oppression once and for all. For the revolution in women''s rights, she even put her family back and fought to the end for their beliefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXdvOZ9Jmd0qcADj4BWoo1SrPvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497767'),
  ('411685540107270488', 'Melania', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Brett Ratner, Michael Alan Kahn, Joseph Michael Polisano', null, 'Melania Trump, Donald Trump, Barron Trump, Hervé Pierre, Queen Rania of Jordan, Brigitte Macron, Peter Sohn, Adam Lippes', 'PG', 'Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself — step inside Melania Trump''s world as she orchestrates inauguration plans, navigates the complexities of the White House transition, and reenters public life with her family. With exclusive footage capturing critical meetings, private conversations, and never-before-seen environments, Mrs. Trump returns to one of the world''s most powerful roles.', 'Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself — step inside Melania Trump''s world as she orchestrates inauguration plans, navigates the complexities of the White House transition, and reenters public life with her family. With exclusive footage capturing critical meetings, private conversations, and never-before-seen environments, Mrs. Trump returns to one of the world''s most powerful roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ba6Silct0Y4pyvrSv0Tj0Urmx9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1413097'),
