  ('358280014781578092', 'MelanKos Vol. 2', 2023, null, null, null, 'Kenia Os', null, 'Is the perfect hybrid that unites all the creative aspects of entertainment, music, fashion, design, dance and cinematography.', 'Is the perfect hybrid that unites all the creative aspects of entertainment, music, fashion, design, dance and cinematography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Z0X1bOVlN1rpA0cyB11qV1jIT1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1131526'),
  ('847642961883149703', 'Meleparambil Aanveedu', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Anandakuttan, Rajasenan', 'Raghunath Paleri', 'Jayaram, Shobana, Narendra Prasad, Meena, Jagathy Sreekumar, Vijayaraghavan, Janardhanan, Paravoor Bharathan', null, 'A young man marries a Tamil girl, and fearing his family, he brings her to the house as a servant. Problem starts when his elder brothers falls for her too.', 'A young man marries a Tamil girl, and fearing his family, he brings her to the house as a servant. Problem starts when his elder brothers falls for her too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1c5LkGHVji8vSCjjRYV2esXJABo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351679'),
  ('891877619361565418', 'Melinda and Melinda', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Woody Allen, Vilmos Zsigmond, Richard Patrick', 'Woody Allen', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Will Ferrell, Jonny Lee Miller, Radha Mitchell, Amanda Peet, Chloë Sevigny, Wallace Shawn, David Aaron Baker', 'PG-13', 'While dining out with friends, Sy suggests the difficulty of separating comedy from tragedy. To illustrate his point, he tells his guests two parallel stories about Melinda ; both versions have the same basic elements, but one take on her state of affairs leans toward levity, while the other is full of anguish. Each story involves Melinda coping with a recent divorce through substance abuse while beginning a romantic relationship with a close friend''s husband.', 'While dining out with friends, Sy suggests the difficulty of separating comedy from tragedy. To illustrate his point, he tells his guests two parallel stories about Melinda ; both versions have the same basic elements, but one take on her state of affairs leans toward levity, while the other is full of anguish. Each story involves Melinda coping with a recent divorce through substance abuse while beginning a romantic relationship with a close friend''s husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cLNqq5dpblYG0QkPgwn763DvJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9688'),
  ('170582055087733073', 'Melissa P.', 2005, 'Drama', 'Luca Guadagnino, Paolo Giacomo Marino, Valentina Marianini', 'Luca Guadagnino, Cristiana Farina', 'María Valverde, Letizia Ciampa, Primo Reggiani, Fabrizia Sacchi, Geraldine Chaplin, Claudio Santamaria, Elio Germano, Alba Rohrwacher', null, 'An adolescent girl, living with her mother and her grandmother, will have her first sexual experiences in a heavy and excessive way.', 'An adolescent girl, living with her mother and her grandmother, will have her first sexual experiences in a heavy and excessive way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fjMLEVozmApiiDF75dnpSIaYZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13461'),
  ('464992352016475569', 'Mellisai', 2026, 'Drama, Family', 'Dhirav, Devaraj Pugazhendi, Stunner Sam', 'Dhirav', 'Kishore DS, Subathra Robert, Harish Uthaman, George Mariyan, Dhananya', null, 'A beautiful family drama woven around a central theme of father daughter bond which emphasizes human emotions at its depths.A daughters wish to make her dad participate in a reality show singing competition forms the crux of this emotional family dramaThe story takes place in two different time lines which reflects all these emotions in a poetic harmony of love, ambition, failure, success and the wheel of life.', 'A beautiful family drama woven around a central theme of father daughter bond which emphasizes human emotions at its depths.A daughters wish to make her dad participate in a reality show singing competition forms the crux of this emotional family dramaThe story takes place in two different time lines which reflects all these emotions in a poetic harmony of love, ambition, failure, success and the wheel of life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FtkXbSUHh9XhEwUQkSiCZxUfbtYm.jpg', 'plex:movie:mellisai'),
  ('38425113343340498', 'Mellow', 2020, 'Romance', 'Rikiya Imaizumi', 'Rikiya Imaizumi', 'Kei Tanaka, Sae Okazaki, Sara Shida, Elena Matsuki, Tamaki Shiratori, Sumire, Kenjirô Yamashita, Rie Tomosaka', null, 'Seiichi is the owner of a flower shop. He enjoys his peaceful single life. Kiho runs the ramen restaurant left to her by her father, but she''s thinking of closing it.', 'Seiichi is the owner of a flower shop. He enjoys his peaceful single life. Kiho runs the ramen restaurant left to her by her father, but she''s thinking of closing it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8vQ5VKumPXVUusE8F4tBzCXnwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678983'),
  ('1005148740457985381', 'Mélo', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alain Resnais, Charles Van Damme, Florence Malraux', 'Alain Resnais', 'Sabine Azéma, Fanny Ardant, Pierre Arditi, André Dussollier, Jacques Dacqmine, Hubert Gignoux, Catherine Arditi', null, 'Pierre Belcroix and Marcel Blanc are violinists and lifelong friends living in Paris in the 1920s. While Marcel has become famous and Pierre has not, both are happy with their lives. Pierre is happily married to Romaine, a stylish young flapper. However, Marcel meets and falls in love with her, which Marcel little suspects.', 'Pierre Belcroix and Marcel Blanc are violinists and lifelong friends living in Paris in the 1920s. While Marcel has become famous and Pierre has not, both are happy with their lives. Pierre is happily married to Romaine, a stylish young flapper. However, Marcel meets and falls in love with her, which Marcel little suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2D1lwqQLAmx507ne0B538QDpFID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59847'),
  ('311546132521865834', 'Melodies of the Vera Quarter', 1973, 'Music, Comedy', 'Aleqsandre Mgebrishvili, Giorgi Shengelaia', 'Giorgi Shengelaia, Anzor Salukvadze', 'Sofiko Chiaureli, Vakhtang Kikabidze, Iya Ninidze, Maia Kankava, David Abashidze, Erosi Mandjgaladze, Alisa Freyndlikh, Kakhi Kavsadze', null, 'This musical is based on old Georgian vaudevilles and plays. The early 20th century. Old Tiflis is in confusion and turmoil. A mysterious fairy is helping the poor Pavle’s family: real wood is burning in his old, neglected fireplace, wherein a pot with meat would suddenly appear. The good fairy is impersonated by laundress Vardo who helps not only the poor Pavle, but other families in this quarter as well. Vardo is known to many people in the town, but no one ever suspected that she was capable of performing miracles. The film’s colorful folk melodies, merry songs and fiery dances leave no viewer indifferent. Starring in the leading role is the great Georgian actress Sofiko Chiaureli.', 'This musical is based on old Georgian vaudevilles and plays. The early 20th century. Old Tiflis is in confusion and turmoil. A mysterious fairy is helping the poor Pavle’s family: real wood is burning in his old, neglected fireplace, wherein a pot with meat would suddenly appear. The good fairy is impersonated by laundress Vardo who helps not only the poor Pavle, but other families in this quarter as well. Vardo is known to many people in the town, but no one ever suspected that she was capable of performing miracles. The film’s colorful folk melodies, merry songs and fiery dances leave no viewer indifferent. Starring in the leading role is the great Georgian actress Sofiko Chiaureli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58chAkTWXYQCbSdYtU4o8EWZCrP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149109'),
  ('939895824247813637', 'Melodrama Sacramental', 1965, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Jean-Michel Humeau', null, 'Alejandro Jodorowsky', null, 'The Panic Movement performed theatrical events designed to be shocking, as a response to surrealism becoming petite bourgeoisie and to release destructive energies in search of peace and beauty. One four-hour performance known as Melodrama Sacramentral was staged in May 1965 at the Paris Festival of Free Expression. The "happening" starred Jodorowsky dressed in motorcyclist leather and featured him slitting the throats of two geese, taping two snakes to his chest and having himself stripped and whipped. Other scenes included a staged murder of a rabbi, a crucified chicken, a giant vagina giving birth to Jodorowsky, naked women covered in honey and the throwing of live turtles into the audience.', 'The Panic Movement performed theatrical events designed to be shocking, as a response to surrealism becoming petite bourgeoisie and to release destructive energies in search of peace and beauty. One four-hour performance known as Melodrama Sacramentral was staged in May 1965 at the Paris Festival of Free Expression. The "happening" starred Jodorowsky dressed in motorcyclist leather and featured him slitting the throats of two geese, taping two snakes to his chest and having himself stripped and whipped. Other scenes included a staged murder of a rabbi, a crucified chicken, a giant vagina giving birth to Jodorowsky, naked women covered in honey and the throwing of live turtles into the audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RuOnyzXxmGzGxO6kHI4Cm5M5tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195099'),
  ('234432713653630082', 'Melody', 1953, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols, Ward Kimball', null, 'Bill Thompson, Harry Stanton', 'NR', 'An owl teaches his class full of birds about melody. It''s all around in nature. Only birds and man can sing; man "sings" even when he speaks. We see a quick survey of the stages of life, as captured by songs: the alphabet song for primary school, Here Comes the Bride, The Old Gray Mare, etc. Some inspirations for song are outlined in song: love, sailing, trains, the West, motherhood, etc., but "we never sing about brains." Finally, an example of how a simple melody can be expanded into a symphony: an elaborate version of the simple tune that opened the lesson', 'An owl teaches his class full of birds about melody. It''s all around in nature. Only birds and man can sing; man "sings" even when he speaks. We see a quick survey of the stages of life, as captured by songs: the alphabet song for primary school, Here Comes the Bride, The Old Gray Mare, etc. Some inspirations for song are outlined in song: love, sailing, trains, the West, motherhood, etc., but "we never sing about brains." Finally, an example of how a simple melody can be expanded into a symphony: an elaborate version of the simple tune that opened the lesson', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOqHx8ScjyPabGVefIF2lCW5RDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73602'),
  ('101640175101698567', 'Melody', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Waris Hussein, Peter Suschitzky', 'Alan Parker', 'Mark Lester, Tracy Hyde, Jack Wild, Colin Barrie, Billy Franks, Ashley Knight, Craig Marriott, William Vanderpuye', 'G', 'Two youngsters declare to their parents that they want to get married. Not sometime in the future but as soon as possible.', 'Two youngsters declare to their parents that they want to get married. Not sometime in the future but as soon as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmLfhgwwFmEZzTUBN0S4JM3YlVw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48207'),
  ('864783362012890861', 'Melody', 2014, 'Drama', 'Bernard Bellefroid, David Williamson', 'Anne-Louise Trividic, Bernard Bellefroid, Carine Zimmerlin', 'Rachael Blake, Lucie Debay, Don Gallagher, Laure Roldan, Clive Hayward, Lana Macanovic, Julie Maes, Catherine Salée', null, 'Melody, 28 years old, a confused child born under the name X, decides to rent out her body in order to get the money she needs to realize her dream: opening a hair-dressing salon. To do so, she accepts to carry the child of Emily, a rich English woman 48 years old who can no longer have children. To make sure everything goes well and keep an eye on her future child, Emily decides to welcome Melody into her home and stay by her side throughout the pregnancy. Although they first appear to come from completely different worlds, the two women end up adopting each other: Melody finds in Emily the mother she never had, and Emily sees in Melody the daughter she always wanted to have. Evidently, the bonds that emerge during this double maternity create all sorts of doubts and questions.', 'Melody, 28 years old, a confused child born under the name X, decides to rent out her body in order to get the money she needs to realize her dream: opening a hair-dressing salon. To do so, she accepts to carry the child of Emily, a rich English woman 48 years old who can no longer have children. To make sure everything goes well and keep an eye on her future child, Emily decides to welcome Melody into her home and stay by her side throughout the pregnancy. Although they first appear to come from completely different worlds, the two women end up adopting each other: Melody finds in Emily the mother she never had, and Emily sees in Melody the daughter she always wanted to have. Evidently, the bonds that emerge during this double maternity create all sorts of doubts and questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6esZiKLWaoLp3HOPRG54HRVkTW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314555'),
  ('212071497637786241', 'Melody for a Hustler', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Philippe Le Sourd, Vincent Ravalec', 'Vincent Ravalec', 'Yvan Attal, Virginie Lanoué, Yann Collette, Benaïssa Ahaouari, Samy Naceri, Marc Lavoine, Claire Nebout, Jean-Louis Richard', null, 'French novelist Vincent Ravalec made his directorial debut with this French drama about small-time crook Gaston (Yvan Attal) who poses as a millionaire after he picks up hitchhiking 16-year-old Marie-Pierre (Virginie Lanoue). Actually living in a seedy apartment, Gaston deals in stolen goods, but he soon climbs to bigger heists, including car thefts. Concealing his illegal activities, Gaston operates his company, Extramill, out of upscale, posh offices, while he and Marie-Pierre move into a sedate upper-middle-class neighborhood. Life is sweet, but the onset of paranoia, kinky sex activities, and police probes eventually culminate in violence.', 'French novelist Vincent Ravalec made his directorial debut with this French drama about small-time crook Gaston (Yvan Attal) who poses as a millionaire after he picks up hitchhiking 16-year-old Marie-Pierre (Virginie Lanoue). Actually living in a seedy apartment, Gaston deals in stolen goods, but he soon climbs to bigger heists, including car thefts. Concealing his illegal activities, Gaston operates his company, Extramill, out of upscale, posh offices, while he and Marie-Pierre move into a sedate upper-middle-class neighborhood. Life is sweet, but the onset of paranoia, kinky sex activities, and police probes eventually culminate in violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dw33ZAnIKj3fFfcMQy8uFKTzZXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161754'),
  ('498416955073860807', 'Melody Makers', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', 'Leslie Ann Coles', null, 'Barrie Wentzell, Ian Anderson, Steve Howe, Eric Burdon, Chris Squire', 'NR', 'Melody Maker Magazine''s Chief Contributing Photographer(1965-1975), Barrie Wentzell tells the story of the rise and fall of the magazine, which marked the end to a style of rock n'' roll journalism that no longer exit''s today.', 'Melody Maker Magazine''s Chief Contributing Photographer(1965-1975), Barrie Wentzell tells the story of the rise and fall of the magazine, which marked the end to a style of rock n'' roll journalism that no longer exit''s today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z521Q2X94hgLUtqP1HAbZqxhUu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479197'),
  ('185782012462246315', 'Melody of a Murder', 1944, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Bodil Ipsen, Valdemar Christensen', 'Fleming Lynge', 'Gull-Maj Norin, Poul Reichhardt, Angelo Bruun, Else Petersen, Ib Schønberg, Peter Nielsen, Karen Poulsen, Petrine Sonne', null, 'A woman is found strangled in her shop. Shortly after, another murder is committed. Perhaps the most terrifying is that the both girls'' name is Sonja. The police is convinced it''s the same killer and at each scene is heard a woman singing the same song. A song which is soon dubbed the ''murder melody.''', 'A woman is found strangled in her shop. Shortly after, another murder is committed. Perhaps the most terrifying is that the both girls'' name is Sonja. The police is convinced it''s the same killer and at each scene is heard a woman singing the same song. A song which is soon dubbed the ''murder melody.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9IDKdPfGFBQK2cASz0dk0znYji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73271'),
  ('269081116618072008', 'Melody of the World', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Walter Ruttmann, Paul Holzki, Adolf Jansen', 'Wolfgang Ruttmann', 'Ivan Koval-Samborskyi, Renée Stobrawa, Grace Chiang, O. Idris, Heinrich Mutzenbecher, Ivor Montagu, George Bernard Shaw', null, 'An impression of the state of the world in 1929, contrasting similarities and differences in religion, customs, art and entertainment from all over the world. The film is constructed like a symphony.', 'An impression of the state of the world in 1929, contrasting similarities and differences in religion, customs, art and entertainment from all over the world. The film is constructed like a symphony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulyvofEU8RA7hZmioAAGj3M6Dp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129808'),
  ('858394183620189561', 'Melody Time', 1948, 'Animation, Music, Family', 'Clyde Geronimi, Jack Kinney, Wilfred Jackson', 'Erdman Penner, Joe Rinaldi, Clyde Geronimi', 'Roy Rogers, Dennis Day, Freddy Martin, Frances Langford, Ethel Smith, Trigger, Bobby Driscoll, Luana Patten', 'NR', 'In the grand tradition of Disney''s great musical classics, Melody Time features seven timeless stories, each enhanced with high-spirited music and unforgettable characters. You''ll be sure to tap your toes and clap your hands in this witty feast for the eyes and ears.', 'In the grand tradition of Disney''s great musical classics, Melody Time features seven timeless stories, each enhanced with high-spirited music and unforgettable characters. You''ll be sure to tap your toes and clap your hands in this witty feast for the eyes and ears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IlnhKFdNBxYIjEPkJ8N7YHrL0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13757'),
  ('647148731031004352', 'Meltdown: Days of Destruction', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'J.P. Howell, Adam Sliwinski', 'Rick Drew', 'Casper Van Dien, Vincent Gale, Stefanie von Pfetten, David Quinlan, Amanda Crew, Ryan McDonell, Venus Terzo, Greg Anderson', null, 'Despite scientist Nathan''s warnings, his boss continues an experiment meant as publicity for his satellite firm: exploding an asteroid. Instead it splits, and the major piece, the size of Iceland, changes course to earth. It is deflected but so close that it shift our course closer to the sun, causing rapid extreme heating, hopefully only mid-term. Nathan warns his sister, TV journalist Carly, and she her lover, police detective Tom. He brings his unruly daughter Kim, her ex-con lover C.J. and her mother, nurse Bonnie, when Nathan offers a flight to a friend''s Arctic weather station. Tom takes charge of a dangerous trip to the airport, as everywhere on earth things catch fire and people fight for water, transport and sheer looting.', 'Despite scientist Nathan''s warnings, his boss continues an experiment meant as publicity for his satellite firm: exploding an asteroid. Instead it splits, and the major piece, the size of Iceland, changes course to earth. It is deflected but so close that it shift our course closer to the sun, causing rapid extreme heating, hopefully only mid-term. Nathan warns his sister, TV journalist Carly, and she her lover, police detective Tom. He brings his unruly daughter Kim, her ex-con lover C.J. and her mother, nurse Bonnie, when Nathan offers a flight to a friend''s Arctic weather station. Tom takes charge of a dangerous trip to the airport, as everywhere on earth things catch fire and people fight for water, transport and sheer looting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsCYTME9KGpzPuH9uzGCzun9jta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52615'),
  ('1100916094015225454', 'Meltem', 2019, 'Drama', 'Basile Doganis', 'Basile Doganis, Fadette Drouard', 'Daphné Patakia, Rabah Nait Oufella, Lamine Cissokho, Karam al-Kafri, Akis Sakellariou, Féodor Atkine, Koukoulis Konstantinos, Maria Kallimani', null, 'One year after the death of her mother, Elena, a young French woman of Greek origin, returns to her holiday home on the island of Lesbos. She is accompanied by her friends Nassim and Sekou, two young suburbanites more used to the benches of the city than the paradisiac beaches.', 'One year after the death of her mother, Elena, a young French woman of Greek origin, returns to her holiday home on the island of Lesbos. She is accompanied by her friends Nassim and Sekou, two young suburbanites more used to the benches of the city than the paradisiac beaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRXiPktynTKblt3zpQWkK7F3f6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563673'),
  ('222530983371708309', 'Melvin and Howard', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jonathan Demme, Evelyn Purcell, Tak Fujimoto', 'Bo Goldman', 'Paul Le Mat, Mary Steenburgen, Jason Robards, Elizabeth Cheshire, Chip Taylor, Melvin E. Dummar, Michael J. Pollard, Denise Galik', 'R', 'The story of hard-luck Melvin Dummar, who claimed to have received a will naming him an heir to the fortune of Howard Hughes. Inspired by real events.', 'The story of hard-luck Melvin Dummar, who claimed to have received a will naming him an heir to the fortune of Howard Hughes. Inspired by real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oN3ZQPyJcSqoj0An39FSD8VFmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38772'),
  ('273419169492947470', 'Melvin Goes to Dinner', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bob Odenkirk, Alex Vendler', 'Michael Blieden', 'Michael Blieden, Stephanie Courtney, Matt Price, Annabelle Gurwitch, Kathleen Roll, Maura Tierney, Jenna Fischer, Jacqueline Heinze', null, 'Four thirtysomethings convene for a wine-fueled dinner party that turns increasingly intimate as they discuss everything from religion and ghosts to relationships and sexual fetishes.', 'Four thirtysomethings convene for a wine-fueled dinner party that turns increasingly intimate as they discuss everything from religion and ghosts to relationships and sexual fetishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH2RvmUq4c2R4GN4GRzlVV3dHMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34681'),
  ('530840635429050656', 'Memento', 2000, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Wally Pfister, Christopher Nolan, Chris Edmonds', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Guy Pearce, Carrie-Anne Moss, Joe Pantoliano, Mark Boone Junior, Russ Fega, Jorja Fox, Stephen Tobolowsky, Harriet Sansom Harris', 'R', 'Leonard Shelby is tracking down the man who raped and murdered his wife. The difficulty of locating his wife''s killer, however, is compounded by the fact that he suffers from a rare, untreatable form of short-term memory loss. Although he can recall details of life before his accident, Leonard cannot remember what happened fifteen minutes ago, where he''s going, or why.', 'Leonard Shelby is tracking down the man who raped and murdered his wife. The difficulty of locating his wife''s killer, however, is compounded by the fact that he suffers from a rare, untreatable form of short-term memory loss. Although he can recall details of life before his accident, Leonard cannot remember what happened fifteen minutes ago, where he''s going, or why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKTPH2WvH8nHTXeBYBVhawtRqtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77'),
  ('265392250938017262', 'Memento Mori', 1999, 'Horror, Romance, Drama', 'Min Kyu-dong, Kim Tae-yong, Kang Yi-kwan', 'Kim Tae-yong, Min Kyu-dong', 'Kim Gyu-ri, Park Ye-jin, Rie Young-zin, Gong Hyo-jin, Kim Jae-in, Baek Jong-hak, Maeng Bong-hak, Lee Hyun-soon', null, 'The ghost of a lesbian high-school girl takes revenge on the people who used to bully her. And another young girl finds her old diary detailing her love and rejection when she was alive.', 'The ghost of a lesbian high-school girl takes revenge on the people who used to bully her. And another young girl finds her old diary detailing her love and rejection when she was alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HDeHTbMQCWNmPD9Uqybtigt5sf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54111'),
  ('507313359587501723', 'Memoir of a Murderer', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kim Min-soo, Kim Ho-sung, Won Shin-yun', 'Hwang Jo-yoon, Won Shin-yun', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Kim Nam-gil, Kim Seol-hyun, Oh Dal-su, Hwang Seok-jeong, Kil Hae-yeon, Lee Byung-joon, Kim Min-jae', 'R', 'A former serial killer with Alzheimer''s fights to protect his daughter from her mysterious boyfriend who may be a serial killer too.', 'A former serial killer with Alzheimer''s fights to protect his daughter from her mysterious boyfriend who may be a serial killer too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTdvO9AwJrxq02iYf4Lu5qA0fNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432836'),
  ('642807672133498074', 'Memoir of a Snail', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Gerald Thompson, Adam Elliot', 'Adam Elliot', 'Sarah Snook, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Jacki Weaver, Magda Szubanski, Dominique Pinon, Tony Armstrong, Paul Capsis, Eric Bana', 'R', 'Forcibly separated from her twin brother when they are orphaned, a melancholic misfit learns how to find confidence within herself amid the clutter of misfortunes and everyday life.', 'Forcibly separated from her twin brother when they are orphaned, a melancholic misfit learns how to find confidence within herself amid the clutter of misfortunes and everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woaN8CbloH0akyX0E72ayxlJAB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064486'),
  ('720412592249131083', 'Memoir of War', 2017, 'Drama', 'Emmanuel Finkiel, Alexis Kavyrchine', 'Emmanuel Finkiel', 'Mélanie Thierry, Benoît Magimel, Benjamin Biolay, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Emmanuel Bourdieu, Anne-Lise Heimburger, Patrick Lizana, Shulamit Adar', 'PG-13', 'In the last days of the Nazi-occupied France, writer Marguerite Duras awaits the return of her husband, Robert Antelme, arrested for being a Resistance fighter and then deported, while she maintains a tense relationship with her ambiguous lover and a dangerous game with a French collaborationist. Even when the Liberation arrives, she must still endure the unbearable pain of waiting.', 'In the last days of the Nazi-occupied France, writer Marguerite Duras awaits the return of her husband, Robert Antelme, arrested for being a Resistance fighter and then deported, while she maintains a tense relationship with her ambiguous lover and a dangerous game with a French collaborationist. Even when the Liberation arrives, she must still endure the unbearable pain of waiting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcrKJJE5SOaTw6PPmO3FNrQenp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467675'),
  ('723470073078528320', 'Mémoire de sang', 2018, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Pascal Lagriffoul, Olivier Guignard', 'Catherine Touzet, Marie Deshaires', 'Louise Monot, Isabelle Gélinas, Blandine Bellavoir, Samir Boitard, Pierre Cassignard, Martin Pautard, Lou Lambrecht, Tomy Leconte', null, 'Louise, a doctor and mother, is suddenly caught up by her past after the discovery of her step-father''s body, 18 years after he went missing.', 'Louise, a doctor and mother, is suddenly caught up by her past after the discovery of her step-father''s body, 18 years after he went missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzYMLzzK7wRPQsytmQS2APAhXXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548213'),
  ('546114694535056341', 'Mémoire trouble', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Denis Malleval, Alain L''Eveille, Claude Codogno', 'Marie Guilmineau', 'Pierre Arditi, Nicolas Grandhomme, Florence Muller, Félix Kysyl, Clémence Boisnard', null, 'Garlat, a former cop, agrees with Voltaire''s maxim, but when confronted with evidence manipulation in one of his former investigations, he is forced to ask himself other questions. Is memory selective? Did he really fabricate evidence? So who is he? And is this man in prison guilty? With his son, Nicolas, a cop like him, Garlat returns to Paris and takes up the investigation again.', 'Garlat, a former cop, agrees with Voltaire''s maxim, but when confronted with evidence manipulation in one of his former investigations, he is forced to ask himself other questions. Is memory selective? Did he really fabricate evidence? So who is he? And is this man in prison guilty? With his son, Nicolas, a cop like him, Garlat returns to Paris and takes up the investigation again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKFUkTdwCZTA6Y7kQj56M7ng1Yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932486'),
  ('770042183731840927', 'Memoirs of a French Whore', 1979, 'Drama', 'Daniel Duval, Jean-Pierre Vergne, Anne-Marie Padovan', 'Christopher Frank, Daniel Duval, Jeanne Cordelier', 'Miou-Miou, Maria Schneider, Daniel Duval, Niels Arestrup, Brigitte Ariel, Jean Benguigui, Martine Ferrière, Marie Pillet', null, 'Marie is nineteen and bored in her little suburban life with no future. In a café, she meets the charismatic and beautiful Gerard. Blinded by adoration, Mary decides to leave her parents and her clerk job to live with the man she considers as the love of her life. But Gerard is a pimp, who soon forces her into prostitution. From within homes to out on the streets, the young woman gradually discovers a world of decay and violence.', 'Marie is nineteen and bored in her little suburban life with no future. In a café, she meets the charismatic and beautiful Gerard. Blinded by adoration, Mary decides to leave her parents and her clerk job to live with the man she considers as the love of her life. But Gerard is a pimp, who soon forces her into prostitution. From within homes to out on the streets, the young woman gradually discovers a world of decay and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VP87ViCiYg0KAAfAreir3FsCyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85363'),
  ('1050003820568331600', 'Memoirs of a Man in Pajamas', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Carlos Fernández de Vigo, Angie Paul Risque, Marcos García', 'Diana López Varela, Paco Roca, Angel de la Cruz', 'Raúl Arévalo, María Castro, Santi Balmes, Jordi Brunet, Julián Saldarriaga, Manuel Manquiña, Elena S. Sánchez, Tacho González', null, 'Paco, a 40-year-old bachelor, realizes a childhood dream: working at home in his pajamas.', 'Paco, a 40-year-old bachelor, realizes a childhood dream: working at home in his pajamas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvY3W1lwmDxoJh9aj4CN2aSQYoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516355'),
  ('472936058105284676', 'Memoirs of a Murderer', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Yū Irie, Go KINOMOTO', 'Kenya Hirata, Yū Irie', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Hideaki Ito, Kaho, Shuhei Nomura, Anna Ishibashi, Ryo Ryusei, Taichi Saotome, Mitsuru Hirata', null, 'The movie begins in the year 1995 where there were 5 peculiar murder cases. The murderer would always get someone close to the victim to witness how he would strangle the victim from behind with a rope but he would let the witnesses go and speak to the media on how the murders happened. Ito plays the role of Makimura, the police detective who was in charge of investigating the serial murders but failed to catch the cunning murderer and his respected superior ended up being killed as well. 22 years later in 2017 when the case is nearing its statute of limitations, a man named Sonezaki claims to be the culprit for the 1995 murders and even publishes a book titled "Watashi ga satsujinhan desu" to talk about the cases. Despite the disgust towards Sonezaki''s actions, the intensive attention showered on him via the media and SNS makes him become the talk of town.', 'The movie begins in the year 1995 where there were 5 peculiar murder cases. The murderer would always get someone close to the victim to witness how he would strangle the victim from behind with a rope but he would let the witnesses go and speak to the media on how the murders happened. Ito plays the role of Makimura, the police detective who was in charge of investigating the serial murders but failed to catch the cunning murderer and his respected superior ended up being killed as well. 22 years later in 2017 when the case is nearing its statute of limitations, a man named Sonezaki claims to be the culprit for the 1995 murders and even publishes a book titled "Watashi ga satsujinhan desu" to talk about the cases. Despite the disgust towards Sonezaki''s actions, the intensive attention showered on him via the media and SNS makes him become the talk of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1DxZDxQSiE86Vo23NhZplsFNzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450274'),
  ('1125116520181801102', 'Memoirs of a Sinner', 1986, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Janusz Weychert, Alicja Kluba, Hanna Ostrach', 'Michał Komar', 'Piotr Bajor, Maciej Kozłowski, Janusz Michałowski, Hanna Stankówna, Ewa Wiśniewska, Franciszek Pieczka, Anna Dymna, Katarzyna Figura', null, 'A recently resurrected corpse recounts his life story, focusing on his strange relationship with a murderous alter-ego.', 'A recently resurrected corpse recounts his life story, focusing on his strange relationship with a murderous alter-ego.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sr8rBOJtk0muu6EmxM8MJfebrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149430'),
  ('736042772708175516', 'Memoirs of a Survivor', 1981, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'David Gladwell, Walter Lassally', 'Kerry Crabbe, David Gladwell', 'Julie Christie, Christopher Guard, Leonie Mellinger, Debbie Hutchings, Nigel Hawthorne, Pat Keen, Georgina Griffiths, Christopher Tsangarides', 'R', 'Based on the acclaimed novel by Doris Lessing, this dystopian science fiction tale concerns a woman struggling to make her way in a post-apocalyptic society. D (Julie Christie) is living in a city that''s at the point of collapse following a catastrophic nuclear war; lawlessness and violence rule the day, and gangs of brutal youth roam the streets. With the help of her teenage companion Emily (Leonie Mellinger), D tries to make her way, and in order to cope, she often escapes into a fantasy world in which she lives in genteel Victorian surroundings in the 19th century.', 'Based on the acclaimed novel by Doris Lessing, this dystopian science fiction tale concerns a woman struggling to make her way in a post-apocalyptic society. D (Julie Christie) is living in a city that''s at the point of collapse following a catastrophic nuclear war; lawlessness and violence rule the day, and gangs of brutal youth roam the streets. With the help of her teenage companion Emily (Leonie Mellinger), D tries to make her way, and in order to cope, she often escapes into a fantasy world in which she lives in genteel Victorian surroundings in the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4pAUGs2bAFZOpNSFivr6XszPeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111432'),
  ('617395724279227051', 'Memoirs of a Teenage Amnesiac', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jaron Presant, Hans Canosa', 'Gabrielle Zevin', 'Maki Horikita, Kenichi Matsuyama, Yuya Tegoshi, Anton Yelchin, Emma Roberts, Misa Shimizu, Atsuro Watabe, Reika Kirishima', null, 'Diving to save a camera from a fall down a flight of stairs, high school junior Naomi Sukuse wakes with no memory of the last four years. Naomi must remember who she was and figure out who she wants to be in this story of love and second chances.', 'Diving to save a camera from a fall down a flight of stairs, high school junior Naomi Sukuse wakes with no memory of the last four years. Naomi must remember who she was and figure out who she wants to be in this story of love and second chances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmO4CfnjRHOLTr2OzXsQeluZYBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58550'),
  ('876928273232809884', 'Memoirs of an Invisible Man', 1992, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'John Carpenter, William M. Elvin, Alan Edmisten', 'Robert Collector, Dana Olsen, William Goldman', 'Chevy Chase, Daryl Hannah, Sam Neill, Michael McKean, Stephen Tobolowsky, Jim Norton, Pat Skipper, Paul Perri', 'PG-13', 'After a freak accident, an invisible yuppie runs for his life from a treacherous CIA official while trying to cope with his new life.', 'After a freak accident, an invisible yuppie runs for his life from a treacherous CIA official while trying to cope with his new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbplzn4WrBkKDmmWlQkWdsacmNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2687'),
  ('610257485989957416', 'Memorable', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', 'Bruno Collet, Fabien Drouet', 'Bruno Collet', 'André Wilms, Dominique Reymond', null, 'Aging painter Louis and his wife Michelle struggle to cope with Louis'' advancing dementia.', 'Aging painter Louis and his wife Michelle struggle to cope with Louis'' advancing dementia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLW86bTGdsSADHgLBZZSpiO95s5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608542'),
  ('1023207691417245884', 'Memoria', 2021, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Sompot Chidgasornpongse, Raúl Locatelli', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Tilda Swinton, Agnes Brekke, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Jerónimo Barón, Juan Pablo Urrego, Jeanne Balibar, Aída Morales, Constanza Guitérrez', 'PG', 'After hearing a loud ‘bang’ at daybreak, a Scottish woman begins experiencing a mysterious sensory syndrome while traversing the jungles of Colombia.', 'After hearing a loud ‘bang’ at daybreak, a Scottish woman begins experiencing a mysterious sensory syndrome while traversing the jungles of Colombia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZ4GABzjCIiQNlYSgjXoaf6rpK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511819'),
  ('317854485677646647', 'Memorial Day', 2011, 'Action, Drama, War, History', 'Bo Hakala, Rink Hankes, Alyana Ruggiero', 'Marc Conklin', 'Jonathan Bennett, James Cromwell, Jackson Bond, Emily Fradenburgh, Punnavith Koy, Steven Luke, Charles Hubbell, Mary Kay Fortier-Spalding', 'R', 'Memorial Day, 1993. When 13-year-old Kyle Vogel discovers the World War II footlocker belonging to his grandfather, Bud, everyone tells Kyle to put it back. Luckily, he ignores them. Although Bud has never talked about the war, he finds himself striking a deal with his grandson: Kyle can pick any three souvenirs, and Bud will tell him the stories behind each one. Memorial Day not only takes us on a journey into Bud''s complicated wartime past, but also into Kyle''s wartime future. As the two men share parallel experiences in combat, they come to realize how that magical day on the porch shaped both of their lives.', 'Memorial Day, 1993. When 13-year-old Kyle Vogel discovers the World War II footlocker belonging to his grandfather, Bud, everyone tells Kyle to put it back. Luckily, he ignores them. Although Bud has never talked about the war, he finds himself striking a deal with his grandson: Kyle can pick any three souvenirs, and Bud will tell him the stories behind each one. Memorial Day not only takes us on a journey into Bud''s complicated wartime past, but also into Kyle''s wartime future. As the two men share parallel experiences in combat, they come to realize how that magical day on the porch shaped both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBp63rPK3pNhWRrsUXrqSPCOXo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105945'),
  ('878115950937484131', 'Memorial Valley Massacre', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Oak O''Connor, Jeff Harris, George Eskander', 'Robert C. Hughes, George Frances Skrow', 'John Kerry, Mark Mears, John Caso, Lesa Lee, Jimmy Justice, William Smith, Cameron Mitchell, Karen Russell', 'R', 'Campers on a holiday are terrorized by an axe-wielding maniac.', 'Campers on a holiday are terrorized by an axe-wielding maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYPUNAXPKScLdlrhd0snN7AnBam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85170'),
  ('618254356857486914', 'Memories', 1995, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Katsuhiro Otomo, Koji Morimoto, Tensai Okamura', 'Satoshi Kon, Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Tsutomu Isobe, Koichi Yamadera, Shozo Iizuka, Shigeru Chiba, Gara Takashima, Ami Hasegawa, Hideyuki Hori, Kenichi Ogata', 'PG-13', 'Three back-to-back anime films by three different directors make up this sci-fi trilogy three years in the making.', 'Three back-to-back anime films by three different directors make up this sci-fi trilogy three years in the making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0HIBRiKS5dWmXkxWvEh6JQZcc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42994'),
  ('502548150745402365', 'Memories of a Boobs Flasher', 2014, 'Mystery', 'Bertrand Mandico, Bertrand Mandico', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Elina Löwensohn', null, 'A boobs flasher tells us, a boobs flasher lets us see.', 'A boobs flasher tells us, a boobs flasher lets us see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6AJj6boTLNfpIzmoJptkMFJYUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470148'),
  ('637690133148192372', 'Memories of a Marriage', 1989, 'Drama', 'Kaspar Rostrup, Claus Loof, Tom Hedegaard', 'Karen Bentzon, Kaspar Rostrup', 'Frits Helmuth, Mikael Helmuth, Ghita Nørby, Rikke Bendsen, Henning Moritzen, Michael Moritzen, Anne Werner Thomsen, Dorthe Simone Lang', null, 'Karl Åge and Regitze host a summer garden party for close friends, their son, and his family. Karl Åge is quiet, detached; Regitze is spirited, lively. He thinks back: love at first sight during the war, living together unmarried, her mother''s hunger strike when they won''t baptize their son. Regitze is passionate and forthright; she speaks her mind. He remembers her inviting a derelict for Christmas dinner, and the man shows up with five bashful friends. He recalls her taking on their son''s teacher when the man slaps the lad. He remembers her love of dancing and his fear that his social clumsiness might end their relationship. Now, in twilight, he has other things to face.', 'Karl Åge and Regitze host a summer garden party for close friends, their son, and his family. Karl Åge is quiet, detached; Regitze is spirited, lively. He thinks back: love at first sight during the war, living together unmarried, her mother''s hunger strike when they won''t baptize their son. Regitze is passionate and forthright; she speaks her mind. He remembers her inviting a derelict for Christmas dinner, and the man shows up with five bashful friends. He recalls her taking on their son''s teacher when the man slaps the lad. He remembers her love of dancing and his fear that his social clumsiness might end their relationship. Now, in twilight, he has other things to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUdippgqxkC7uXlbkBmAYTxcbKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41929'),
  ('354858934891038696', 'Memories of a Mexican', 1950, 'Documentary, History', 'Salvador Toscano, Salvador Toscano', 'Salvador Toscano', 'Carmen Toscano, Manuel Bernal, Porfirio Díaz, Francisco I. Madero, Emiliano Zapata, Venustiano Carranza, Pancho Villa, Victoriano Huerta', null, 'A history of the Mexican Revolution (1910-17), narrated through the striking images of the enormous film archive of Salvador Toscano (1872-1947), pioneer of Mexican cinema, compiled by his daughter, Carmen Toscano.', 'A history of the Mexican Revolution (1910-17), narrated through the striking images of the enormous film archive of Salvador Toscano (1872-1947), pioneer of Mexican cinema, compiled by his daughter, Carmen Toscano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IDNnoiLbTZCharfOWhJ32SbvFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199448'),
  ('148996822978214067', 'Memories of a Murderer: The Nilsen Tapes', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Michael Harte', null, 'Dennis Nilsen', 'R', 'Serial killer Dennis Nilsen narrates his life and horrific crimes via a series of chilling audiotapes recorded from his jail cell.', 'Serial killer Dennis Nilsen narrates his life and horrific crimes via a series of chilling audiotapes recorded from his jail cell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sfmqtBvCvI9s3uMRLTLMo6QtVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852851'),
  ('762098051336631809', 'Memories of a Teenager', 2019, 'Drama', 'Lucas Santa Ana, Pablo Galarza, Celeste Palma', 'Lucas Santa Ana', 'Renato Quattordio, Thomás Lepera, Malena Narvay, Jerónimo Bosia, Walter Pez, Tomás Wicz, Tomás Raimondi, Majo Chicar', null, 'After the suicide of his best friend and the fire of a local dance called Cromañón, including recitals, illegal parties in an abandoned warehouse and high school, a year passes by in the life of Zabo who writes everything he feels and lives in his blog, "Memories of a teenager".', 'After the suicide of his best friend and the fire of a local dance called Cromañón, including recitals, illegal parties in an abandoned warehouse and high school, a year passes by in the life of Zabo who writes everything he feels and lives in his blog, "Memories of a teenager".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBuYNodLru48rGFbBUM8TGBIxb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649058'),
  ('893917106932420201', 'Memories of Anne Frank', 2010, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Alberto Negrin', 'Monica Zapelli, Alberto Negrin', 'Emilio Solfrizzi, Rosabell Laurenti Sellers, Moni Ovadia, Mari Nagy, Kapriellan Alexa, Panna Szurdi, Gábor Jászberényi, Gáspár Mesés', null, 'The story of Anne Frank and her friend, Hanneli Goslar, their first meeting in Amsterdam, their daily lives, the German occupation, and their sudden separation when the Frank family went into hiding.', 'The story of Anne Frank and her friend, Hanneli Goslar, their first meeting in Amsterdam, their daily lives, the German occupation, and their sudden separation when the Frank family went into hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzqFqi7OlsaavL9S3F9nIOTXLyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92243'),
  ('467187658599667451', 'Memories of Matsuko', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Shôichi Atô', 'Tetsuya Nakashima', 'Miki Nakatani, Eita Nagayama, Yūsuke Iseya, Teruyuki Kagawa, Mikako Ichikawa, Asuka Kurosawa, Akira Emoto, Gori', null, 'While combing through the belongings of his recently deceased aunt, Matsuko, nephew Sho pieces together the crucial events that sank Matsuko''s life into a despairing tragedy.', 'While combing through the belongings of his recently deceased aunt, Matsuko, nephew Sho pieces together the crucial events that sank Matsuko''s life into a despairing tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epizm54ChIajXYHz5RBQYzdtjoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31512'),
  ('172006328260391917', 'Memories of Me', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Henry Winkler', 'Eric Roth, Billy Crystal', 'Billy Crystal, Alan King, JoBeth Williams, Janet Carroll, David Ackroyd, Phil Fondacaro, Robert Pastorelli, Mark L. Taylor', 'PG-13', 'After a heart attack, Abbie Polin (Crystal), a New York doctor, goes to Los Angeles to see his father, Abe (King), who works in Hollywood as the "king of the extras." Their relationship has been strained for several years. Lisa, the romantic interest in Abbie''s life, bonds with Abe, who gets along famously with everyone but his son. Abe begins having memory loss and eventually is diagnosed with a brain aneurysm. He and his son grow closer in time and, before it''s too late, Abbie tries to get Abe a speaking role in a film.', 'After a heart attack, Abbie Polin (Crystal), a New York doctor, goes to Los Angeles to see his father, Abe (King), who works in Hollywood as the "king of the extras." Their relationship has been strained for several years. Lisa, the romantic interest in Abbie''s life, bonds with Abe, who gets along famously with everyone but his son. Abe begins having memory loss and eventually is diagnosed with a brain aneurysm. He and his son grow closer in time and, before it''s too late, Abbie tries to get Abe a speaking role in a film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NmEbPfhpb1SW32D9rvJMwy2l3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107569'),
  ('428240874070890276', 'Memories of Murder', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Bong Joon Ho, Kim Hyung-koo, Lee Kang-san', 'Bong Joon Ho, Shim Sung-bo', 'Song Kang-ho, Kim Sang-kyung, Kim Roi-ha, Song Jae-ho, Byun Hee-bong, Go Seo-hee, Ryu Tae-ho, Park No-shik', null, 'A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.', 'A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsEoTJKM1s5OVDkS2P2JdoTxo4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11423'),
  ('233583308806856330', 'Memories of My Childhood', 1964, 'Family, Drama, Comedy, Adventure', 'Elisabeta Bostan', 'Elisabeta Bostan', 'Ștefan Ciubotărașu, Ion Bocancea, Corina Constantinescu, Emanoil Petruţ, Nicolae Veniaș, Eliza Petrăchescu, Zoe Anghel Stanca, Mircea Constantinescu', null, 'Based on Ion Creanga''s book, the story of a child from his childhood to his manhood.', 'Based on Ion Creanga''s book, the story of a child from his childhood to his manhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw9b96QJulN0mS31pnk9v7A5QIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315860'),
  ('400900136897681346', 'Memories of My Father', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Fernando Trueba, Sergio Iván Castaño', 'David Trueba', 'Javier Cámara, Daniela Abad Lombana, Aída Morales, Patricia Tamayo, Juan Pablo Urrego, Kami Zea, Luciana Echeverry, Camila Zarate', null, 'In the polarized and violent Medellín (Colombia''s ''City of Eternal Spring'') of the 1970s, doctor Héctor Abad Gómez is concerned about both his children and children from less favored classes. After a devastating loss in the family, Héctor gives himself to the greater cause of public health programs for the poor in Medellín to the consternation of the city''s authorities.', 'In the polarized and violent Medellín (Colombia''s ''City of Eternal Spring'') of the 1970s, doctor Héctor Abad Gómez is concerned about both his children and children from less favored classes. After a devastating loss in the family, Héctor gives himself to the greater cause of public health programs for the poor in Medellín to the consternation of the city''s authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgSnMFJuRsNvwXPD5SadM5shuVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660943'),
  ('829554218990222938', 'Memories of My Melancholy Whores', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henning Carlsen, Alejandro Martínez', 'Henning Carlsen, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Emilio Echevarría, Geraldine Chaplin, Ángela Molina, Olivia Molina, Dominika Paleta, Tara Parra, Evangelina Sosa, Evangelina Martínez', null, 'To celebrate his 90th birthday, an old single journalist, Sabio, wants something special from Rosa Cabarcas’s brothel: an intense night of love with a virgin teenager. The madam finds him the ideal young woman, Delgadina, a factory worker, who is selling her virginity to support her family. When he sees Delgadina sleeping angelically, he loses interest in pure pleasure and falls in love with her. That love was not meant to be true, but fate changes, and that hope is born of an opportunity for unbridled love.', 'To celebrate his 90th birthday, an old single journalist, Sabio, wants something special from Rosa Cabarcas’s brothel: an intense night of love with a virgin teenager. The madam finds him the ideal young woman, Delgadina, a factory worker, who is selling her virginity to support her family. When he sees Delgadina sleeping angelically, he loses interest in pure pleasure and falls in love with her. That love was not meant to be true, but fate changes, and that hope is born of an opportunity for unbridled love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNVNPoP0vgL3RbnMStOBDQORtNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114286'),
  ('919657190910971441', 'Memories of Prison', 1984, 'Drama, History', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Carlos Vereza, Glória Pires, Nildo Parente, José Dumont, Wilson Grey, Jofre Soares, Fábio Barreto, Tonico Pereira', null, 'In the 1930s, novelist and politician Graciliano Ramos is accused of being a communist sympathizer. He is then arrested and sent to the Ilha Grande prison, where he experiences the disturbing treatment reserved for common prisoners.', 'In the 1930s, novelist and politician Graciliano Ramos is accused of being a communist sympathizer. He is then arrested and sent to the Ilha Grande prison, where he experiences the disturbing treatment reserved for common prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VXhIqTk4rBLqAq3BmopxKkz1ef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135624'),
  ('744257577494375259', 'Memories of the Sword', 2015, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Park Heung-sik, Kim Byung-seo, Shin Kyung-man', 'Park Heung-sik, Choi Ah-reum', 'Lee Byung-hun, Jeon Do-yeon, Kim Go-eun, Bae Soo-bin, Sung Yoo-bin, Lee Jun-ho, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Tae-woo', null, 'While in medieval Korea, a young girl sets out to revenge the betrayal and the death of her mother. But therefore she must face one of the most powerful men and warriors of the Goryeo Dynasty.', 'While in medieval Korea, a young girl sets out to revenge the betrayal and the death of her mother. But therefore she must face one of the most powerful men and warriors of the Goryeo Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqf7fnJXoPvKdVD33w4KYl3qB55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348689'),
  ('864442342879689658', 'Memories of the Wind', 2015, 'Drama', 'Özcan Alper, Andreas Sinanos', 'Ahmet Büke, Özcan Alper', 'Onur Saylak, Sofiia Khandamirova, Mustafa Uğurlu, Tuba Büyüküstün, Menderes Samancılar, Ebru Özkan, Murat Daltaban, Nihat İleri', null, 'At the times of World War II, accomplished painter and translator Aram flees Istanbul due to political offenses. When he is trapped at the USSR-Georgia borders, his flight turns into a remembrance of things past...', 'At the times of World War II, accomplished painter and translator Aram flees Istanbul due to political offenses. When he is trapped at the USSR-Georgia borders, his flight turns into a remembrance of things past...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GNjLkEKy1Rf7AMYUzqHuZZLpDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372232'),
  ('1071533611547575060', 'Memories of Tomorrow', 2006, 'Drama', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Satoru Karasawa, 丸毛典子', 'Hakaru Sunamoto, Uiko Miura', 'Ken Watanabe, Kanako Higuchi, Kenji Sakaguchi, Kazue Fukiishi, Asami Mizukawa, Noritake Kinashi, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Eri Watanabe', null, 'After being stricken with Alzheimer''s disease in the prime of his life, a successful young businessman slips slowly away from his loving family.', 'After being stricken with Alzheimer''s disease in the prime of his life, a successful young businessman slips slowly away from his loving family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIKM3ajrbEneIhXjd568ApaNbs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163123'),
  ('321135014096962455', 'Memories of Underdevelopment', 1968, 'Drama', 'Tomás Gutiérrez Alea, Ramón F. Suárez', 'Tomás Gutiérrez Alea', 'Sergio Corrieri, Daisy Granados, Eslinda Núñez, Omar Valdés, René de la Cruz, Yolanda Farr, Ofelia González, Jose Gil Abad', null, 'In the aftermath of the Bay of Pigs incident, Sergio chooses to stay behind in Cuba while his wife and family escape to neighboring Miami. Alone in a brave new world, Sergio observes the constant threat of foreign invasion while chasing young women all over Havana. He finally meets Elena, a young girl he seeks to mould into the image of his ex-wife, but at what cost to himself?', 'In the aftermath of the Bay of Pigs incident, Sergio chooses to stay behind in Cuba while his wife and family escape to neighboring Miami. Alone in a brave new world, Sergio observes the constant threat of foreign invasion while chasing young women all over Havana. He finally meets Elena, a young girl he seeks to mould into the image of his ex-wife, but at what cost to himself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/av7zEHpOyzmm86VPRa68zOLaBqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47576'),
  ('916500501511713799', 'Memories They Told Me', 2013, 'Drama', 'Lúcia Murat, Guillermo Nieto', 'Lúcia Murat, Tatiana Salem Levy, Marília Nogueira', 'Simone Spoladore, Irene Ravache, Franco Nero, Miguel Thiré, Clarisse Abujamra, Otávio Augusto, Zécarlos Machado, Hamilton Vaz Pereira', null, 'A group of friends, who resisted the military dictatorship, and their children will face the conflict between the daily life of today and the past when one of them is dying.', 'A group of friends, who resisted the military dictatorship, and their children will face the conflict between the daily life of today and the past when one of them is dying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Tgo0L3vjopf8kgM6lD8Vio5k7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199288'),
  ('966792797416555914', 'Memories Unlocked', 1999, 'Drama', 'Jean Beaudin, Pierre Gill', 'Jean Beaudin', 'James Hyndman, Pascale Bussières, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Yves Jacques, Louise Portal, Jacynthe René, Michel Charette, Marcel Sabourin', null, 'In this French Canadian drama, the life of a paraplegic painter implodes when an old girlfriend comes back into his life and accuses him of raping her 15 years earlier.', 'In this French Canadian drama, the life of a paraplegic painter implodes when an old girlfriend comes back into his life and accuses him of raping her 15 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xibXpW92p0DkzezCF5eFDjTA7Ri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261252'),
  ('216844646053487157', 'Memory', 1964, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Osamu Tezuka, Tatsumasa Shimizu', null, null, null, 'This is a short, privately produced animated film. While elucidating the mystery and fuzziness as well as merits and demerits of memory in idealizing reality, the story develops into a tale of destruction of human beings, turning the existence of the earth into a memory of the universe. The production, only 5 minutes long, greatly helps expand the viewer''s imagination, embodying the enchantment of animation.', 'This is a short, privately produced animated film. While elucidating the mystery and fuzziness as well as merits and demerits of memory in idealizing reality, the story develops into a tale of destruction of human beings, turning the existence of the earth into a memory of the universe. The production, only 5 minutes long, greatly helps expand the viewer''s imagination, embodying the enchantment of animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KISUMvqRB545wmhfi0nisQsPtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85796'),
  ('951683903855455141', 'Memory', 2006, 'Horror', 'Bennett Davlin, Peter Benison', 'Anthony Badalucco, Bennett Davlin', 'Billy Zane, Tricia Helfer, Dennis Hopper, Terry Chen, Deirdre Blades, Ann-Margret, Emily Hirst, Emily Anne Graham', 'R', 'Dr. Taylor Biggs is haunted by a past that''s not his own. A hallucinatory drug gives him the power to see visions of vicious crimes, visions made all that more disturbing when he discovers that the murderous memories may belong to the father he never knew . Biggs''s mother, whose own failing memory makes her powerless to help him unravel his family history.', 'Dr. Taylor Biggs is haunted by a past that''s not his own. A hallucinatory drug gives him the power to see visions of vicious crimes, visions made all that more disturbing when he discovers that the murderous memories may belong to the father he never knew . Biggs''s mother, whose own failing memory makes her powerless to help him unravel his family history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWl7jAxhZrLojDakkaLcwmifQ63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36960'),
  ('578584153333358926', 'Memory', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Martin Campbell, David Tattersall', 'Dario Scardapane', 'Liam Neeson, Guy Pearce, Taj Atwal, Harold Torres, Ray Fearon, Monica Bellucci, Ray Stevenson, Mia Sanchez', 'R', 'Alex, an assassin-for-hire, finds that he''s become a target after he refuses to complete a job for a dangerous criminal organization. With the crime syndicate and FBI in hot pursuit, Alex has the skills to stay ahead, except for one thing: he is struggling with severe memory loss, affecting his every move. Alex must question his every action and whom he can ultimately trust.', 'Alex, an assassin-for-hire, finds that he''s become a target after he refuses to complete a job for a dangerous criminal organization. With the crime syndicate and FBI in hot pursuit, Alex has the skills to stay ahead, except for one thing: he is struggling with severe memory loss, affecting his every move. Alex must question his every action and whom he can ultimately trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Q1n3TwieoULnuaztu9aFjqHDTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818397'),
  ('802141825150541844', 'Memory', 2023, 'Drama', 'Michel Franco, Yves Cape, Matthew Lipke', 'Michel Franco', 'Jessica Chastain, Peter Sarsgaard, Merritt Wever, Josh Charles, Elsie Fisher, Jessica Harper, Blake Baumgartner, Davis Duffield', 'R', 'Sylvia is a social worker who leads a simple and structured life: her daughter, her job, her AA meetings. This is blown open when Saul follows her home from their high school reunion. Their surprise encounter will profoundly impact both of them as they open the door to the past.', 'Sylvia is a social worker who leads a simple and structured life: her daughter, her job, her AA meetings. This is blown open when Saul follows her home from their high school reunion. Their surprise encounter will profoundly impact both of them as they open the door to the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZgTA5ZOKOIRGyYClJMu02VUNcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979097'),
  ('124151763861689553', 'Memory', 2026, 'Drama, Documentary, War', 'Vladlena Sandu, Lisa Popova, Elizaveta Popova', 'Vladlena Sandu', 'Philippe Grivel, Amina Taisumova, Selima Agamirzaeva, Vladlena Sandu', null, 'After her parents’ divorce, six-year-old Vladlena moves from Crimea to Grozny, not yet aware of the changes that lie ahead. When war breaks out in Chechnya, it deeply affects her city and family. Years later, filmmaker Sandu reflects on her childhood in this poetic, autobiographical hybrid film, exploring how cycles of violence shape children—and how healing and change are possible.', 'After her parents’ divorce, six-year-old Vladlena moves from Crimea to Grozny, not yet aware of the changes that lie ahead. When war breaks out in Chechnya, it deeply affects her city and family. Years later, filmmaker Sandu reflects on her childhood in this poetic, autobiographical hybrid film, exploring how cycles of violence shape children—and how healing and change are possible.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsARePnp6xR4hhqx6u4mPj1Z9lHG.jpg', 'plex:movie:memory-2026'),
  ('101369273751079715', 'Memory Box', 2021, 'Drama', 'Wael Dib, Sahar Moussallem, Rania Salame', 'Marc Robitaille, Normand Bergeron, Benoît Pilon', 'Manal Issa, Rim Turki, Paloma Vauthier, Clémence Sabbagh, Hasan Akil, Halim Abiad, Michelle Bado, Rita Bado', null, 'Maia, a single mother, lives in Montreal with her teenage daughter, Alex. On Christmas Eve, they receive an unexpected delivery: notebooks, tapes, and photos Maia, from 13 to 18 years old, sent from Beirut to her best friend who left for Paris to escape the civil war. Maia refuses to open the box or confront its memories, but Alex secretly begins diving into it. Between fantasy and reality, Alex enters the world of her mother’s tumultuous, passionate adolescence during the Lebanese civil war, unlocking mysteries of a hidden past.', 'Maia, a single mother, lives in Montreal with her teenage daughter, Alex. On Christmas Eve, they receive an unexpected delivery: notebooks, tapes, and photos Maia, from 13 to 18 years old, sent from Beirut to her best friend who left for Paris to escape the civil war. Maia refuses to open the box or confront its memories, but Alex secretly begins diving into it. Between fantasy and reality, Alex enters the world of her mother’s tumultuous, passionate adolescence during the Lebanese civil war, unlocking mysteries of a hidden past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0OjUpv5bGbzUVt9eyEb0sHAQpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633949'),
  ('825282953806821944', 'Memory of the Dead', 2013, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Valentín Javier Diment', 'Martín Blousson, Germán Val, Valentín Javier Diment', 'Jimena Anganuzzi, Lola Berthet, Ana Celentano, Rafael Ferro, Gabriel Goity, Flora Gró, Matías Marmorato, Pamela Rementería', null, 'Forty-nine days after George’s death his wife, Alicia, calls friends who wanted to read over the letter that he left before he died. It is a very affectionate and moving letter, which addresses each of those present, knowing that his death is near. Little do they know that they are part of a ritual prepared by Alicia, with the connivance of Santiago, the closest friend of George, to bring him back to life – and that ritual, full of ghostly apparitions, traumatic and terrifying, will be gaining further life from each of the guests. The surprising twists in the plot will lead up to the most unexpected of endings.', 'Forty-nine days after George’s death his wife, Alicia, calls friends who wanted to read over the letter that he left before he died. It is a very affectionate and moving letter, which addresses each of those present, knowing that his death is near. Little do they know that they are part of a ritual prepared by Alicia, with the connivance of Santiago, the closest friend of George, to bring him back to life – and that ritual, full of ghostly apparitions, traumatic and terrifying, will be gaining further life from each of the guests. The surprising twists in the plot will lead up to the most unexpected of endings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xNV5CkB3hGFs8KlNNhI45GTaex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101725'),
  ('326948049507888889', 'Memory: The Origins of Alien', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre O. Philippe, Robert Muratore', 'Alexandre O. Philippe', 'Ronald Shusett, Roger Christian, Ivor Powell, Terry Rawlings, Tom Skerritt, Veronica Cartwright, Roger Corman, Gary Sherman', null, 'The untold origin story behind Ridley Scott''s Alien - rooted in Greek and Egyptian mythologies, underground comics, the art of Francis Bacon, and the dark visions of Dan O''Bannon and H.R. Giger. A contemplation on the symbiotic collaborative process of movie-making, the power of myth, and our collective unconscious.', 'The untold origin story behind Ridley Scott''s Alien - rooted in Greek and Egyptian mythologies, underground comics, the art of Francis Bacon, and the dark visions of Dan O''Bannon and H.R. Giger. A contemplation on the symbiotic collaborative process of movie-making, the power of myth, and our collective unconscious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsLijGBQgJCLh5TpWNTubNzkYGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565591'),
  ('1001913599971780624', 'Memphis Belle', 1990, 'Drama, War, Action', 'David Watkin, Michael Caton-Jones, Norman Dorme', 'Monte Merrick', 'Matthew Modine, Eric Stoltz, Tate Donovan, D. B. Sweeney, Billy Zane, Sean Astin, Harry Connick Jr., Bradley Lavelle', 'PG-13', 'The "Memphis Belle" is a World War II bomber, piloted by a young crew on dangerous bombing raids into Europe. The crew only have to make one more bombing raid before they have finished their duty and can go home. In the briefing before their last flight, the crew discover that the target for the day is Bremen.', 'The "Memphis Belle" is a World War II bomber, piloted by a young crew on dangerous bombing raids into Europe. The crew only have to make one more bombing raid before they have finished their duty and can go home. In the briefing before their last flight, the crew discover that the target for the day is Bremen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epsraI4swsSu9Fyefj7vPPhsOHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12651'),
  ('215116337389726924', 'Men', 1997, 'Drama', 'Zoe Clarke-Williams, Susan Helen Emerson', 'Zoe Clarke-Williams, Karen Black, James Andronica', 'Sean Young, Dylan Walsh, Robert Lujan, Paul Williams, Jordan Gurner, Keith Odett, Gary Wolf, Kathy Torrance', 'R', 'A single young woman moves to Los Angeles, gets a job as a chef and has casual affairs.', 'A single young woman moves to Los Angeles, gets a job as a chef and has casual affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIDcl3QhYa8Hbby2Q65KKc26IIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107488'),
  ('902115032136324275', 'Men', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Danni Lizaitis, Barney Shakespeare, Rob Hardy', 'Alex Garland', 'Jessie Buckley, Rory Kinnear, Paapa Essiedu, Gayle Rankin, Sarah Twomey, Zak Rothera-Oxley, Sonoya Mizuno', 'R', 'In the aftermath of a personal tragedy, Harper retreats alone to the beautiful English countryside, hoping to find a place to heal. But someone — or something — from the surrounding woods appears to be stalking her, and what begins as simmering dread becomes a fully-formed nightmare, inhabited by her darkest memories and fears.', 'In the aftermath of a personal tragedy, Harper retreats alone to the beautiful English countryside, hoping to find a place to heal. But someone — or something — from the surrounding woods appears to be stalking her, and what begins as simmering dread becomes a fully-formed nightmare, inhabited by her darkest memories and fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jo1Kv3P3UgDVk7JnUFr2Cl8WWUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780609'),
  ('953826851707636067', 'Men & Chicken', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Sebastian Blenkov, Peter Bækkel', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Mads Mikkelsen, David Dencik, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Søren Malling, Nicolas Bro, Ole Thestrup, Bodil Jørgensen, Kirsten Lehfeldt', null, 'Men & Chicken is a black comedy about two outcast brothers who, by getting to know their unknown family, discover a horrible truth about themselves and their relatives.', 'Men & Chicken is a black comedy about two outcast brothers who, by getting to know their unknown family, discover a horrible truth about themselves and their relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lZ1EjOoWJiZaGJe38052Hmt73l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296313'),
  ('39339641106478413', 'Men About Town', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Zdeněk Podskalský, Jan Mimra, František Valert', 'Vratislav Blažek', 'Jiří Sovák, Vlastimil Brodský, Jan Libíček, Jiřina Bohdalová, Jiřina Jirásková, Iva Janžurová, Jiřina Šejbalová, Oldřich Nový', null, 'Three blue collar workers have a night out in big city Prague.', 'Three blue collar workers have a night out in big city Prague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAg2Ea4klZ3I6wVfJLcNpNFFtqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50788'),
  ('711120194544504792', 'Men and Beasts', 1962, 'Drama', 'Sergei Gerasimov, Vladimir Rapoport, Vadim Kornilyev', 'Sergei Gerasimov', 'Nikolay Eryomenko, Tamara Makarova, Zhanna Bolotova, Vitali Doronin, Natalya Medvedeva, Sergey Nikonenko, Olesya Ivanova, Anastasiya Filippova', null, 'The plot is based on the dramatic fate of the Red Army commander Aleksei Ivanovich Pavlov. Having been captured in January 1942 and being among the displaced persons, he didn''t immediately decide to return to the USSR. Having rolled around the foreign country for 17 years, Aleksei nevertheless returned to his homeland. He goes to his brother in the south of the country to Sevastopol. Aleksei accidentally meets the doctor Anna Andreyevna, who was saved from death in besieged Leningrad. She travels by car from Moscow and also to the south, with her daughter Tanya; she suggests he join them. Aleksei tells about his life on the road.', 'The plot is based on the dramatic fate of the Red Army commander Aleksei Ivanovich Pavlov. Having been captured in January 1942 and being among the displaced persons, he didn''t immediately decide to return to the USSR. Having rolled around the foreign country for 17 years, Aleksei nevertheless returned to his homeland. He goes to his brother in the south of the country to Sevastopol. Aleksei accidentally meets the doctor Anna Andreyevna, who was saved from death in besieged Leningrad. She travels by car from Moscow and also to the south, with her daughter Tanya; she suggests he join them. Aleksei tells about his life on the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2Rb8odbrHQB0ES1YFhZb61G1Y0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138446'),
  ('796695585973842126', 'Men and Women', 1964, 'Drama', 'Walter Hugo Khouri, Rudolf Icsey, Alfredo Sternheim', 'Walter Hugo Khouri', 'Norma Bengell, Odete Lara, Mário Benvenutti, Gabriele Tinti, Lisa Negri, Marisa Woodward, Anita Kennedy, Célia Watanabe', null, 'Two friends take two prostitutes for a night of pleasure. But the night turns out to be frustrating for all involved, as much bitterness is revealed in their conversation and attitudes, uncovering their anguish and deeper feelings, and the emptiness of their lives.', 'Two friends take two prostitutes for a night of pleasure. But the night turns out to be frustrating for all involved, as much bitterness is revealed in their conversation and attitudes, uncovering their anguish and deeper feelings, and the emptiness of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d27Zz6k3PZjQly3SjIANXyeRjJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195450'),
  ('884332537330261339', 'Men Are from Mars... And That''s Where I''m Going!', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Marcus Baldini, Pedro Farkas, Renata Rezende', 'Mônica Martelli, Patricia Corso, Susana Garcia', 'Mônica Martelli, Paulo Gustavo, Dani Valente, Marcos Palmeira, Eduardo Moscovis, Humberto Martins, Peter Ketnath, Herson Capri', null, 'Successful at work, Fernanda is an example of women of the third millennium, free to make their choices and independent. Yet in her personal life she finds herself struggling to find a husband. Like other women of her generation, Fernanda put her personal life on hold to devote herself to her career and now suddenly feels her love life situation has become an emergency. Being single at 39 is quite different from being single at 29, after all "the fertile egg has an expiration date"!', 'Successful at work, Fernanda is an example of women of the third millennium, free to make their choices and independent. Yet in her personal life she finds herself struggling to find a husband. Like other women of her generation, Fernanda put her personal life on hold to devote herself to her career and now suddenly feels her love life situation has become an emergency. Being single at 39 is quite different from being single at 29, after all "the fertile egg has an expiration date"!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa0RQfTuGNgvOzNzhIT6G0KnB0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227970'),
  ('521387497002601290', 'Men Are Not Gods', 1936, 'Drama', 'Walter Reisch, Charles Rosher, Muir Mathieson', 'Walter Reisch, G.B. Stern, Iris Wright', 'Miriam Hopkins, Gertrude Lawrence, Sebastian Shaw, Rex Harrison, A.E. Matthews, Val Gielgud, Laura Smithson, Lawrence Grossmith', 'NR', 'Actor Edmund Davey becomes a star overnight when his wife and co-star teams up with the secretary of a noted stage critic to produce a glowing review of his ''Othello''.', 'Actor Edmund Davey becomes a star overnight when his wife and co-star teams up with the secretary of a noted stage critic to produce a glowing review of his ''Othello''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2lqS7DqjCyVxIcaz0suOCTiAt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142843'),
  ('881093434352268821', 'Men at Work', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Emilio Estevez, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Emilio Estevez', 'Charlie Sheen, Emilio Estevez, Leslie Hope, Keith David, Dean Cameron, John Getz, Hawk Wolinski, John Lavachielli', 'PG-13', 'Two garbage men find the body of a city councilman in a trash can on their route. With help from a supervisor, the duo must solve the case and find the man''s killer while hiding the body from the cops.', 'Two garbage men find the body of a city councilman in a trash can on their route. With help from a supervisor, the duo must solve the case and find the man''s killer while hiding the body from the cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bd0rOeZtTmVJObOAXHXBMurvyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10169'),
  ('822277498404622485', 'Men Behind the Sun', 1988, 'War, History, Horror', 'Mou Tun-Fei', 'Wen Yuan Mou, Liu Mei, Dun Jing Teng', 'Gang Wang, Wang Runshen, Hsu Gou, Tie Long Jin, Mei Zhaohua, Zhe Quan, Zhang Guowen, Wong Ying-Kit', null, 'Japanese troops round up Chinese and Russian prisoners of war and take them to unit 731, where they''re horribly tortured and experimented on to test new biological weapons.', 'Japanese troops round up Chinese and Russian prisoners of war and take them to unit 731, where they''re horribly tortured and experimented on to test new biological weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTbOXA1gBIhuumN5CnRhxfDp9xY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25998'),
  ('145174640190533494', 'Men Behind the Sun 2: Laboratory of the Devil', 1992, 'War, Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Godfrey Ho, Kang Chu', 'Simon Fong', 'Chu Kong, Yuen-Ching Leung, Wan Ying Ying, Gang Wang, Wang Runshen, Andrew Yu, Zhu Decheng, Zhang Guowen', null, 'In 1935, Japan''s Unit 731 conducts inhumane experiments. A doctor tries to free prisoners, including his fiancée, from the camp while witnessing atrocities.', 'In 1935, Japan''s Unit 731 conducts inhumane experiments. A doctor tries to free prisoners, including his fiancée, from the camp while witnessing atrocities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YhzSf0aGTipq2qOyMoQhzTXASc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36238'),
  ('851197979292790973', 'Men Behind the Sun 3: A Narrow Escape', 1994, 'Drama', 'Godfrey Ho', null, 'Jimmy Au Shui-Wai, Robert Mak Tak-Law, Debbie Cheung Jing, Chu Kong, Han Yueqiao, Gang Wang, Zhang Guowen, Andrew Yu', null, 'During the shut down and destruction of the Japanese test camp Squadron 731 in Manchuria, a soldier becomes infected with a virus developed during the camp''s testing and risks spreading it into Japan on the train ride home.', 'During the shut down and destruction of the Japanese test camp Squadron 731 in Manchuria, a soldier becomes infected with a virus developed during the camp''s testing and risks spreading it into Japan on the train ride home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7PdQJITTEvdGYZc492sgMmYJtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117498'),
  ('1064388498836839511', 'Men Can''t Be Raped', 1978, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jörn Donner, Bille August', 'Jörn Donner', 'Anna Godenius, Gösta Bredefeldt, Toni Regnér, Nils Brandt, Algot Böstman, Carl-Axel Heiknert, Christina Indrenius-Zalewski, Märta Laurent', null, 'A woman who has been raped by a man at a party plots and executes an elaborate and humiliating revenge.', 'A woman who has been raped by a man at a party plots and executes an elaborate and humiliating revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzFSjyYZA5U2igP4JKZsXXpNIzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229670'),
  ('259525167376326350', 'Men Do what Men Can', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martin Langer, Marc Rothemund', 'Marc Rothemund, Hans G. Raeth', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Jasmin Gerat, Jan Josef Liefers, Fahri Yardım, Oliver Korittke, Friederike Kempter, Karoline Schuch, Hedi Kriegeskotte', null, 'Confirmed bachelor Paul falls for Iris, who’s unfortunately as good as married. Although his friends have women problems of their own, and all end up moving into Paul’s apartment, they concoct a daring plan to help Paul save Iris from marrying the wrong man.', 'Confirmed bachelor Paul falls for Iris, who’s unfortunately as good as married. Although his friends have women problems of their own, and all end up moving into Paul’s apartment, they concoct a daring plan to help Paul save Iris from marrying the wrong man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moSJJT2eXBaTK8JIJw53ACnje2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149763'),
  ('1060940902623765863', 'Men Don''t Cry', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Sulev Nõmmik, Kalju Jõekalda, Heiki Roots', 'Enn Vetemaa, Sulev Nõmmik', 'Ants Lauter, Endel Pärn, Leo Normet, Voldemar Kuslap, Kalju Karask, Marika Merilo, Priit Peramets, Richard Peramets', null, 'A group of sleepless men should be taken into sanitarium for insomnia therapy. They are taken to a lonely island but no sanitarium is in sight. It turns out that the nurses have kidnapped the men and are about to give them the only useful medicine they need - fresh air and work. But the patients decide to disobey. There''s only one solution - to escape.', 'A group of sleepless men should be taken into sanitarium for insomnia therapy. They are taken to a lonely island but no sanitarium is in sight. It turns out that the nurses have kidnapped the men and are about to give them the only useful medicine they need - fresh air and work. But the patients decide to disobey. There''s only one solution - to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9lPgroRns5tZMHRg0T1kVIYdCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46923'),
  ('265433832711731785', 'Men Don''t Leave', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bruce Surtees, Paul Brickman, David Rubin', 'Barbara Benedek, Paul Brickman', 'Jessica Lange, Arliss Howard, Joan Cusack, Chris O''Donnell, Kathy Bates, Charlie Korsmo, Belita Moreno, Jim Haynie', 'PG-13', 'A widowed mother and her two sons move to Baltimore and struggle to adjust to urban life, encountering numerous eccentric characters along the way.', 'A widowed mother and her two sons move to Baltimore and struggle to adjust to urban life, encountering numerous eccentric characters along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sgKZiKaOh8QJxSbrW2Ds2wvWr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91217'),
  ('765300852438959254', 'Men for Sale', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Rodrigue Jean, Mathieu Laverdière', 'Rodrigue Jean', null, null, 'An intimate and unflinching look over 12 months at the hardscrabble lives of hustlers in downtown Montreal.', 'An intimate and unflinching look over 12 months at the hardscrabble lives of hustlers in downtown Montreal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOXzzw7FIm0kO0vfjfz1zrKSpDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162210'),
  ('558435874046210290', 'Men from the Gutter', 1983, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Lam Nai-Choi, Lam Nai-Choi', 'Tony Leung Hung-Wah, Keith Lee Pak-Ling', 'Jason Pai Piao, Wang Yong, Lo Meng, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Chan Pui-Sai, Parkman Wong Pak-Man, Lung Tin-Sang, Lee Hoi-Sang', null, 'A hot-head cop, a by-the-books cop, and a hitman all vie to take down a drug boss. Meanwhile, a gang of criminals plan to rob an armored truck.', 'A hot-head cop, a by-the-books cop, and a hitman all vie to take down a drug boss. Meanwhile, a gang of criminals plan to rob an armored truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SRAqJMVhlpT5G7aP5SB7wxSunA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160967'),
  ('761979942558238053', 'Men Have to Go through This', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Marc Rothemund, Martin Langer', 'Hans G. Raeth, Marc Rothemund', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Julia Jentsch, Jan Josef Liefers, Oliver Korittke, Fahri Yardım, Sarah Rebellato, Stephan Luca, Edita Malovčić', null, 'Paul is done with love - until he meets Lena. Now he has to convince her family on Mallorca of himself being the right one for their daughter. Lena''s mother though would prefer Patrick by her side, a hedge funds manager and Lena''s ex-boyfriend. Paul is challenged by Patrick to a duel among men and is glad that his three best friends are there to support him...', 'Paul is done with love - until he meets Lena. Now he has to convince her family on Mallorca of himself being the right one for their daughter. Lena''s mother though would prefer Patrick by her side, a hedge funds manager and Lena''s ex-boyfriend. Paul is challenged by Patrick to a duel among men and is glad that his three best friends are there to support him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud5Reud5iOg0pfIt6Ct7rQDnVnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321249'),
  ('628479075480856976', 'Men in Black', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Ray McCarey, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Felix Adler', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Dell Henderson, Phyllis Crane, ''Little Billy'' Rhodes, Kay Hughes, Irene Coleman', 'NR', 'The stooges are three doctors who graduated medical school by being in it for too many years. They come across such problems as an overly chirpy nurse, a mental patient, and a combination to a safe swallowed by the hospital superintendent in the course of their attempt to get through the day.', 'The stooges are three doctors who graduated medical school by being in it for too many years. They come across such problems as an overly chirpy nurse, a mental patient, and a combination to a safe swallowed by the hospital superintendent in the course of their attempt to get through the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kBOhxpwc7ZHO6Y3CzKTrhtkTO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115029'),
  ('479199923926628421', 'Men in Black', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Donald Peterman, Scott P. Murphy', 'Ed Solomon', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Will Smith, Linda Fiorentino, Vincent D''Onofrio, Rip Torn, Tony Shalhoub, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Mike Nussbaum', 'PG-13', 'After a police chase with an otherworldly being, a New York City cop is recruited as an agent in a top-secret organization established to monitor and police alien activity on Earth: the Men in Black. Agent K and new recruit Agent J find themselves in the middle of a deadly plot by an intergalactic terrorist who has arrived on Earth to assassinate two ambassadors from opposing galaxies.', 'After a police chase with an otherworldly being, a New York City cop is recruited as an agent in a top-secret organization established to monitor and police alien activity on Earth: the Men in Black. Agent K and new recruit Agent J find themselves in the middle of a deadly plot by an intergalactic terrorist who has arrived on Earth to assassinate two ambassadors from opposing galaxies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLOmOF5IzWoyrgIF5MfUnh5pa1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607'),
  ('733349671415432118', 'Men in Black 3', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Bill Pope, Barry Sonnenfeld, Stephen Lawes', 'Etan Cohen', 'Will Smith, Tommy Lee Jones, Josh Brolin, Jemaine Clement, Emma Thompson, Michael Stuhlbarg, Mike Colter, Nicole Scherzinger', 'PG-13', 'Agents J and K are back...in time. J has seen some inexplicable things in his 15 years with the Men in Black, but nothing, not even aliens, perplexes him as much as his wry, reticent partner. But when K''s life and the fate of the planet are put at stake, Agent J will have to travel back in time to put things right. J discovers that there are secrets to the universe that K never told him - secrets that will reveal themselves as he teams up with the young Agent K to save his partner, the agency, and the future of humankind.', 'Agents J and K are back...in time. J has seen some inexplicable things in his 15 years with the Men in Black, but nothing, not even aliens, perplexes him as much as his wry, reticent partner. But when K''s life and the fate of the planet are put at stake, Agent J will have to travel back in time to put things right. J discovers that there are secrets to the universe that K never told him - secrets that will reveal themselves as he teams up with the young Agent K to save his partner, the agency, and the future of humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90DdoEStzeObs96fsYf4GG544iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41154'),
  ('858508557230219554', 'Men in Black II', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Greg Gardiner, François Audouy', 'Barry Fanaro, Robert Gordon', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Will Smith, Rip Torn, Lara Flynn Boyle, Johnny Knoxville, Rosario Dawson, Tony Shalhoub, Patrick Warburton', 'PG-13', 'Kay and Jay reunite to provide our best, last and only line of defense against a sinister seductress who levels the toughest challenge yet to the MIB''s untarnished mission statement – protecting Earth from the scum of the universe. It''s been four years since the alien-seeking agents averted an intergalactic disaster of epic proportions. Now it''s a race against the clock as Jay must convince Kay – who not only has absolutely no memory of his time spent with the MIB, but is also the only living person left with the expertise to save the galaxy – to reunite with the MIB before the earth submits to ultimate destruction.', 'Kay and Jay reunite to provide our best, last and only line of defense against a sinister seductress who levels the toughest challenge yet to the MIB''s untarnished mission statement – protecting Earth from the scum of the universe. It''s been four years since the alien-seeking agents averted an intergalactic disaster of epic proportions. Now it''s a race against the clock as Jay must convince Kay – who not only has absolutely no memory of his time spent with the MIB, but is also the only living person left with the expertise to save the galaxy – to reunite with the MIB before the earth submits to ultimate destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enA22EPyzc2WQ1VVyY7zxresQQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608'),
  ('503997016917806587', 'Men in Black: International', 2019, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Sarah Bicknell, Alex Bowens, James M. Spencer', 'Art Marcum, Matt Holloway', 'Chris Hemsworth, Tessa Thompson, Kumail Nanjiani, Rebecca Ferguson, Rafe Spall, Emma Thompson, Liam Neeson, Laurent Bourgeois', 'PG-13', 'The Men in Black have always protected the Earth from the scum of the universe. In this new adventure, they tackle their biggest, most global threat to date: a mole in the Men in Black organization.', 'The Men in Black have always protected the Earth from the scum of the universe. In this new adventure, they tackle their biggest, most global threat to date: a mole in the Men in Black organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPrUPFcgLfNbmDL8V69vcrTyEfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479455'),
  ('760533228416459661', 'Men in Hope', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jiří Vejdělek, Martin Šácha', 'Jiří Vejdělek', 'Bolek Polívka, Jiří Macháček, Petra Hřebíčková, Simona Stašová, Vica Kerekes, Lukáš Langmajer, Hynek Čermák, Filip Antonio', null, 'Charming bon vivant Rudolf is convinced that infidelity is the basis for a happy marriage, since, after all, a woman does not want to be bored with her partner.', 'Charming bon vivant Rudolf is convinced that infidelity is the basis for a happy marriage, since, after all, a woman does not want to be bored with her partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22rnwek6CG5FOwlR2ZJCgwojiAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85621'),
  ('971788935198167437', 'Men in the City', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Simon Verhoeven, Jo Heim', 'Simon Verhoeven', 'Christian Ulmen, Nadja Uhl, Til Schweiger, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Florian David Fitz, Maxim Mehmet, Jana Pallaske, Justus von Dohnányi', null, 'Follows six very different men and their struggles with women, family and work. Yet, they are somehow connected to each other.', 'Follows six very different men and their struggles with women, family and work. Yet, they are somehow connected to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiN2PHryLSHz3qMrYT4wUsnjilf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28938'),
  ('489070775187362066', 'Men in the City 2', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Simon Verhoeven', 'Simon Verhoeven', 'Til Schweiger, Mina Tander, Fritz Karl, Pasquale Aleardi, Justus von Dohnányi, Jana Pallaske, Christian Ulmen, Florian David Fitz', null, 'The sequel of the "Men in the city" movie which reunites all the characters.', 'The sequel of the "Men in the city" movie which reunites all the characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRGUQi4Qit1fD7G9VfONnLsJe3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75969'),
  ('61584484773685923', 'Men in War', 1957, 'War, Drama', 'Anthony Mann, Ernest Haller, Leon Chooluck', 'Philip Yordan, Ben Maddow', 'Robert Ryan, Aldo Ray, Robert Keith, Phillip Pine, Nehemiah Persoff, Vic Morrow, James Edwards, L.Q. Jones', null, 'In Korea, on 6 September 1950, Lieutenant Benson''s platoon finds itself isolated in enemy-held territory after a retreat. Soon they are joined by Sergeant Montana, whose overriding concern is caring for his catatonic colonel. Benson and Montana can''t stand each other, but together they must get the survivors to Hill 465, where they hope the division is waiting. It''s a long, harrowing march, fraught with all the dangers the elusive enemy can summon.', 'In Korea, on 6 September 1950, Lieutenant Benson''s platoon finds itself isolated in enemy-held territory after a retreat. Soon they are joined by Sergeant Montana, whose overriding concern is caring for his catatonic colonel. Benson and Montana can''t stand each other, but together they must get the survivors to Hill 465, where they hope the division is waiting. It''s a long, harrowing march, fraught with all the dangers the elusive enemy can summon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfhF7arZn3VAJhrbjpDLLI9MDOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61370'),
  ('1102006274416870067', 'Men in White', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Boleslawski, Douglas Shearer, George J. Folsey', 'Waldemar Young', 'Clark Gable, Myrna Loy, Jean Hersholt, Elizabeth Allan, Otto Kruger, C. Henry Gordon, Russell Hardie, Wallace Ford', 'NR', 'A dedicated young doctor places his patients above everyone else in his life. Unfortunately, his social register fianceé can''t accept the fact that he considers an appointment in the operating room more important than attending a cocktail party. He soon drifts into an affair with a pretty nurse who shares his passion for healing.', 'A dedicated young doctor places his patients above everyone else in his life. Unfortunately, his social register fianceé can''t accept the fact that he considers an appointment in the operating room more important than attending a cocktail party. He soon drifts into an affair with a pretty nurse who shares his passion for healing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnD3XousuE2zkt4Y1dQP9lfOa4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104661'),
  ('1023432785563356442', 'Men in White', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Brad Rushing, Scott P. Levy', 'Rob Kerchner, Scott Sandin', 'Thomas F. Wilson, Karim Prince, M. Emmet Walsh, Brion James, Wigald Boning, Ben Stein, George Kennedy, Donna D''Errico', 'NR', 'National Lampoon''s Men in White is a straight-to-television satirical parody of contemporary science fiction movies, mainly spoofing Men in Black and Independence Day. It debuted in 1998 on the Fox Family Channel.', 'National Lampoon''s Men in White is a straight-to-television satirical parody of contemporary science fiction movies, mainly spoofing Men in Black and Independence Day. It debuted in 1998 on the Fox Family Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PNDDiex1rnV8QU50wVlUtOvVww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154140'),
  ('6920703871250465', 'Men Men Men', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Christian De Sica', 'Christian De Sica, Enrico Vanzina, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Ghini, Leo Gullotta, Alessandro Haber, Monica Scattini, Paolo Conticini, Carlo Croccolo, Paolo Gasparini', null, 'Four homosexual men in their 40s have issues and no small degree of self hatred. Yet, can laugh at themselves and their comrades and often do.', 'Four homosexual men in their 40s have issues and no small degree of self hatred. Yet, can laugh at themselves and their comrades and often do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twkK0AYRHDKa6pMX1FNoD1X9wDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190484'),
  ('930983630649949686', 'Men O'' War', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Lewis R. Foster, Jack Roach, George Stevens', 'H.M. Walker, Leo McCarey', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Anne Cornwall, Gloria Greer, Charlie Hall, Harry Bernard, Baldwin Cooke', 'NR', 'Sailors Stan and Ollie offer to buy sodas for two women they meet in a park, even though they are short on cash. Luckily Stan wins the jackpot on a slot machine and the boys have enough money to rent a boat to cruise on a lake. They soon tangle with other boaters and everyone ends up in the water.', 'Sailors Stan and Ollie offer to buy sodas for two women they meet in a park, even though they are short on cash. Luckily Stan wins the jackpot on a slot machine and the boys have enough money to rent a boat to cruise on a lake. They soon tangle with other boaters and everyone ends up in the water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dquLdY3oX4oKQg11ASaCjzHC2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48888'),
  ('395045961267911144', 'Men of Boys Town', 1941, 'Drama', 'Norman Taurog', 'James Kevin McGuinness', 'Spencer Tracy, Mickey Rooney, Bobs Watson, Larry Nunn, Darryl Hickman, Henry O''Neill, Mary Nash, Lee J. Cobb', null, 'Father Flanagan raises funds, helps a disabled boy, and saves an older boy from reform school.', 'Father Flanagan raises funds, helps a disabled boy, and saves an older boy from reform school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFJEkWQY9D5WBsaA3PfhwOYqwHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105038'),
  ('489817174106082139', 'Men of Crisis: The Harvey Wallinger Story', 1971, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Woody Allen, Fred T. Gallo', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Reed Hadley, Diane Keaton, Louise Lasser, David Ackroyd, Conrad Bain, Jean De Baer, Court Benson', null, 'Dr. Harvey Wallinger is one of Nixon''s aides who rises through the ranks to become the "real" power behind the president. This short was produced as a television special for PBS in 1971 and was scheduled to air in February 1972, but it was pulled from the schedule shortly before its airdate as PBS officials reportedly feared it might adversely affect their government funding. The special never aired, but it can now be viewed in The Paley Center for Media and has been widely bootlegged online.', 'Dr. Harvey Wallinger is one of Nixon''s aides who rises through the ranks to become the "real" power behind the president. This short was produced as a television special for PBS in 1971 and was scheduled to air in February 1972, but it was pulled from the schedule shortly before its airdate as PBS officials reportedly feared it might adversely affect their government funding. The special never aired, but it can now be viewed in The Paley Center for Media and has been widely bootlegged online.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqQlRkRyi5QjUbF9K9uWbu26avR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32072'),
  ('869765756787905377', 'Men of Hard Skin', 2019, 'Drama', 'José Celestino Campusano, Eric Elizondo', 'José Celestino Campusano', 'Wall Javier, Germán Tarantino, Claudio Medina, Juan Salmeri, Camila Diez', null, 'Ariel is a good-looking farm boy who lives with his father and sister in a rural part of Buenos Aires province. He has become familiar with sex thanks to Omar, a priest with whom he has a secret affair.', 'Ariel is a good-looking farm boy who lives with his father and sister in a rural part of Buenos Aires province. He has become familiar with sex thanks to Omar, a priest with whom he has a secret affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEFz8zjE7tA43VkocVpDshC2F8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575824'),
  ('161193761498298833', 'Men of Honor', 2000, 'Drama', 'George Tillman Jr., Anthony B. Richmond, Douglas A. Raine', 'Scott Marshall Smith', 'Robert De Niro, Cuba Gooding Jr., Charlize Theron, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Hal Holbrook, Michael Rapaport, Powers Boothe, David Keith', 'R', 'Against formidable odds -- and an old-school diving instructor embittered by the U.S. Navy''s new, less prejudicial policies -- Carl Brashear sets his sights on becoming the Navy''s first African-American master diver in this uplifting true story. Their relationship starts out on the rocks, but fate ultimately conspires to bring the men together into a setting of mutual respect, triumph and honor.', 'Against formidable odds -- and an old-school diving instructor embittered by the U.S. Navy''s new, less prejudicial policies -- Carl Brashear sets his sights on becoming the Navy''s first African-American master diver in this uplifting true story. Their relationship starts out on the rocks, but fate ultimately conspires to bring the men together into a setting of mutual respect, triumph and honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNUAnXV1mzOOfvnVBIYsalkk078.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11978'),
  ('261714552406795811', 'Men of Plastic', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Lee Seong-je, Lee Byeong-hoon, Im Jin-soon', 'Im Jin-soon, Shin Yeon-shick', 'Don Lee, Jung Kyung-ho, Oh Na-ra, Choi Byung-mo, Lim Hyung-jun, Na Kwang-hoon, Kil Hae-yeon, Cha Woo-jin', null, 'Dae-guk, a nosy man from Apgujeong, and Ji-woo, a cold but skillful plastic surgeon, open a plastic surgery business in Gangnam. Dae-guk is an unemployed man who likes to pry into other people’s businesses.', 'Dae-guk, a nosy man from Apgujeong, and Ji-woo, a cold but skillful plastic surgeon, open a plastic surgery business in Gangnam. Dae-guk is an unemployed man who likes to pry into other people’s businesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9fHfSZcd8cxJwOuhpU5Kx1QlFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717090'),
  ('331510492098438019', 'Men Of Respect', 1990, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'William Reilly, Bobby Bukowski, Gary Sales', 'William Reilly', 'John Turturro, Katherine Borowitz, Dennis Farina, Peter Boyle, Stanley Tucci, Julie Garfield, Lilia Skala, Steven Wright', 'R', 'In this modern day version of Shakespeare''s Macbeth, a hitman heeds a spiritualist''s prophesies that he will rise to the head of his family. He starts his ascension by clandestinely executing the heads of the family and casting the blame on others. However, with power comes consequences that are also predicted by the seer.', 'In this modern day version of Shakespeare''s Macbeth, a hitman heeds a spiritualist''s prophesies that he will rise to the head of his family. He starts his ascension by clandestinely executing the heads of the family and casting the blame on others. However, with power comes consequences that are also predicted by the seer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJpvx7g7PCEmrswZzh2xFyPePK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96171'),
  ('668139851763593569', 'Men of the Fighting Lady', 1954, 'Drama, War', 'Andrew Marton, Al Jennings, Joel Freeman', 'Art Cohn', 'Van Johnson, Walter Pidgeon, Louis Calhern, Dewey Martin, Keenan Wynn, Frank Lovejoy, Robert Horton, Bert Freed', 'NR', 'A writer visits an aircraft carrier during the Korean war to learn more about it and the way it''s run. He also gets to find out more about the Navy and Marine aviators themselves, their internal and external conflicts and dangers of their job.', 'A writer visits an aircraft carrier during the Korean war to learn more about it and the way it''s run. He also gets to find out more about the Navy and Marine aviators themselves, their internal and external conflicts and dangers of their job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vZRv37F4JINkGGoNskVm3uvHQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91477'),
  ('777167524528879821', 'Men of War', 1994, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, War', 'Perry Lang, Rohn Schmidt', 'John Sayles, Ethan Reiff, Cyrus Voris', 'Dolph Lundgren, Charlotte Lewis, BD Wong, Tim Guinee, Catherine Bell, Trevor Goddard, Tommy Lister Jr., Thomas Gibson', 'R', 'Nick Gunar is a burnt-out, jaded and hard-up former mercenary who is having a difficult time adjusting to civilian life. At the end of his rope, he is hired by the Nitro Mine Corporation to strong-arm the natives of a South China Sea island into giving up their rights to its valuable mineral resources. Nick loathes the thought of another mission, but this seemingly easy job will earn him enough money to get back with his estranged family. He recruits some of his former mercenary buddies to help him with the job. The island people refuse to give up their land and Nick decides to help them fight the greedy corporation that hired him. As greed and treachery begin to unravel, Nick''s band of mercenaries choose sides.', 'Nick Gunar is a burnt-out, jaded and hard-up former mercenary who is having a difficult time adjusting to civilian life. At the end of his rope, he is hired by the Nitro Mine Corporation to strong-arm the natives of a South China Sea island into giving up their rights to its valuable mineral resources. Nick loathes the thought of another mission, but this seemingly easy job will earn him enough money to get back with his estranged family. He recruits some of his former mercenary buddies to help him with the job. The island people refuse to give up their land and Nick decides to help them fight the greedy corporation that hired him. As greed and treachery begin to unravel, Nick''s band of mercenaries choose sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrwG9foUMulWBI2Nk7s6Bcgwfim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38940'),
  ('987138091387553657', 'Men On The Bridge', 2009, 'Drama', 'Aslı Özge', null, 'Cemile Ilker, Umut Ilker, Fikret Portakal, Belma Topçakar', null, 'The stories of three men working at the Bosphorus Bridge in Istanbul are told by the original characters, in this mosaic depicting real persons exposing their lives and aspirations.', 'The stories of three men working at the Bosphorus Bridge in Istanbul are told by the original characters, in this mosaic depicting real persons exposing their lives and aspirations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwstzgPUugZE40bg4RkGBr3nJnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115020'),
  ('911682214188046686', 'Men on the Verge of a Nervous Breakdown', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Aïm, Audrey Dana', 'Claire Barré, Audrey Dana', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Ramzy Bedia, François-Xavier Demaison, Laurent Stocker, Pascal Demolon, Marina Hands, Michaël Grégorio, Max Baissette de Malglaive', null, 'Seven men, all city-dwellers aged between 17 and 70, with nothing in common apart from the fact that they are all on the verge of a nervous breakdown, meet up at a lonely sta- tion for an unusual course in the wild that is supposed to get them back on their feet. Each step in this boot camp, designed by an eccentric and feisty female coach, aims to reveal them to themselves. The task seems to be a tough one, especially as nothing goes as planned between these men.', 'Seven men, all city-dwellers aged between 17 and 70, with nothing in common apart from the fact that they are all on the verge of a nervous breakdown, meet up at a lonely sta- tion for an unusual course in the wild that is supposed to get them back on their feet. Each step in this boot camp, designed by an eccentric and feisty female coach, aims to reveal them to themselves. The task seems to be a tough one, especially as nothing goes as planned between these men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IiTNWohanK62otUDGoCvgx2mI7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783556'),
  ('914589703034941526', 'Men Prefer Fat Girls', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Josiane Balasko, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Josiane Balasko, Luis Rego, Dominique Lavanant, Daniel Auteuil, Thierry Lhermitte, Ariane Lartéguy, Martin Lamotte, Valérie Kaprisky', null, 'Lydie, a physically unattractive young woman, is brutally dumped by her fiancé when she had just acquired the lease of an apartment to live with him.', 'Lydie, a physically unattractive young woman, is brutally dumped by her fiancé when she had just acquired the lease of an apartment to live with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zhgxYXKQVCdPJFnsUsqWCXwsJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81024'),
  ('461292329698852446', 'Men Seeking Women', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jim Milio, Joe C. Maxwell, Nunzio Fazio', 'Jim Milio', 'Grant Shaud, Will Ferrell, Anthony Palermo, Starr Andreeff, Pamela Gien, Rebeca Arthur, Nia Vardalos, Maureen Teefy', 'NR', 'Three best friends mess up their already flagging love lives with an ill-fated bet. They each put two thousand dollars in a bank account, with the winner being the one who can not only get a girlfriend, but also live with her for three months. Nick decides to hoodwink his two friends by faking a relationship with an old girlfriend from college, while Al proceeds to embark on a series of the worst dates imaginable, and Les finds himself getting deeply involved with an alluring but mysterious woman who may or may not be married to a mobster. Hilarious antics lead to an unexpected outcome guaranteed to surprise.', 'Three best friends mess up their already flagging love lives with an ill-fated bet. They each put two thousand dollars in a bank account, with the winner being the one who can not only get a girlfriend, but also live with her for three months. Nick decides to hoodwink his two friends by faking a relationship with an old girlfriend from college, while Al proceeds to embark on a series of the worst dates imaginable, and Les finds himself getting deeply involved with an alluring but mysterious woman who may or may not be married to a mobster. Hilarious antics lead to an unexpected outcome guaranteed to surprise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujX9exT1pVliuliPC9NwrIojCwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60125'),
  ('1126008077282110345', 'Men Suddenly in Black', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Edmond Pang', 'Edmond Pang, Patrick Kong Pak-Leung, Erica Li', 'Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Marsha Yuen Chi-Wai, Chapman To Man-Chat, Candy Lo Hau-Yam, Jia Zongchao, Tiffany Lee Lung-Yee', null, 'Four men attempt to fool around as much as they can before their wives return from a 14-hour Buddhism trip to Thailand.', 'Four men attempt to fool around as much as they can before their wives return from a 14-hour Buddhism trip to Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l66GCI5G3mXFSQw5JY6daglQdPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41161'),
  ('190980058398166120', 'Men to Kiss', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Robert Hasfogel, Till Caspar Juon', 'André Schneider, Frank Christian Marx, Juergen Hirsch', 'Frank Christian Marx, Udo Lutz, Alexandra Starnitzky, Sascia Haj, Luise Schnittert, Marcel Schlutt, André Schneider, Marcus Lachmann', null, 'The gay couple Tobi and Ernie are being visited by Ernie''s old friend Uta. What at first looks like an innocent house-call, turns into an insidious attack on the couple''s relationship.', 'The gay couple Tobi and Ernie are being visited by Ernie''s old friend Uta. What at first looks like an innocent house-call, turns into an insidious attack on the couple''s relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wln4jvBMXioRPybHVFpyam3m36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161243'),
  ('287401265442092911', 'Men Vs Women', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fausto Brizzi, Alessandro Pascuzzo, Angelo Licata', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Marco Martani, Fausto Brizzi', 'Paola Cortellesi, Fabio De Luigi, Sarah Felberbaum, Chiara Francini, Lucia Ocone, Francesco Pannofino, Alessandro Preziosi, Paolo Ruffini', null, 'From married couples to platonic roommates to testy rivals with romantic chemistry, the never-ending battle of the sexes gets personal.', 'From married couples to platonic roommates to testy rivals with romantic chemistry, the never-ending battle of the sexes gets personal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hC3ambPbZYugMMLKYeE1Vo81xo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56014'),
  ('1142488780333134268', 'Men with Brooms', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Gross, Thom Best', 'Paul Gross, John Krizanc', 'Paul Gross, Molly Parker, Leslie Nielsen, Barbara Gordon, Michelle Nolden, Connor Price, James B. Douglas, Stan Coles', 'R', 'A decade ago, curler Chris Cutter disappeared suddenly on the verge of stardom, dropping his curling stones to the bottom of a lake and leaving his fiancée, Julie Foley, at the altar. But when his former coach dies, Cutter returns home for the funeral and attempts to fulfill the man''s last wishes. The team is reunited under Cutter''s estranged dad, Gordon — himself a former curling star — for a final attempt at glory.', 'A decade ago, curler Chris Cutter disappeared suddenly on the verge of stardom, dropping his curling stones to the bottom of a lake and leaving his fiancée, Julie Foley, at the altar. But when his former coach dies, Cutter returns home for the funeral and attempts to fulfill the man''s last wishes. The team is reunited under Cutter''s estranged dad, Gordon — himself a former curling star — for a final attempt at glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWWvljKlmYwf1XtlJ0vu0u66xpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34341'),
  ('861611229619677633', 'Men with Guns', 1998, 'Drama, Adventure', 'John Sayles, Manuel Hinojosa, Adrian Grünberg', 'John Sayles', 'Federico Luppi, Damián Delgado, Dan Rivera González, Tania Cruz, Damián Alcázar, Mandy Patinkin, Kathryn Grody, Iguandili López', 'R', 'Dr. Fuentes is a medical professor approaching his retirement and journeys to find old students, with sometimes disturbing results.', 'Dr. Fuentes is a medical professor approaching his retirement and journeys to find old students, with sometimes disturbing results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdjOvVfG6lhRi1U1qBLW1s6CdFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44641'),
  ('376968535159511197', 'Men Without Wings', 1946, 'War, Drama', 'František Čáp, Jan Stallich', 'Bohumil Štěpánek', 'Gustav Nezval, L. H. Struna, Jaroslav Zrotal, Vladimír Hlavatý, Jan W. Speerger, Jaroslav Seník, Ladislav Hájek, Karel Peyr', null, 'After an attack against the guard of the Third Reich, Nazi repression intensifies, and the Czechoslovakian resistance''s organized sabotage in an aircraft factory leads to Gestapo shootings.', 'After an attack against the guard of the Third Reich, Nazi repression intensifies, and the Czechoslovakian resistance''s organized sabotage in an aircraft factory leads to Gestapo shootings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iS4yFIxFwnZAh8iW4VEBzsoWEEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154623'),
  ('925039802531820636', 'Men, Women & Children', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jason Reitman, Eric Steelberg, Jason Blumenfeld', 'Jason Reitman, Erin Cressida Wilson', 'Adam Sandler, Jennifer Garner, Rosemarie DeWitt, Judy Greer, Dean Norris, Emma Thompson, Timothée Chalamet, Olivia Crocicchia', 'R', 'Follows the story of a group of high school teenagers and their parents as they attempt to navigate the many ways the internet has changed their relationships, their communication, their self-image, and their love lives.', 'Follows the story of a group of high school teenagers and their parents as they attempt to navigate the many ways the internet has changed their relationships, their communication, their self-image, and their love lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzFHIxCcvq2CZVFCsgz7n1z5oIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243684'),
  ('38530564485534527', 'Men, Women: A User''s Manual', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Lelouch, Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty', 'Claude Lelouch, René Bonnell', 'Fabrice Luchini, Bernard Tapie, Alessandra Martines, Pierre Arditi, Caroline Cellier, Ticky Holgado, Ophélie Winter, Patrick Husson', null, 'Benoit Blanc loves living, he loves women, he loves daring. He is a famous businessman who suffers from stomach-ache. Fabiolini, a would-be actor, is a policeman and he too suffers from the same sickness. The two man face suffering in opposite ways: Benoit Blanc is optimistic while Fabiolini, always unsure of himself, is persuaded he is seriously ill. The two men meet by chance while doing a gastroscopy and become friends. After having known their real different conditions, they will change and will understand better their lives. Around them, other people, women and men, will see their lives changed, by chance, by love or solely by the life stream.', 'Benoit Blanc loves living, he loves women, he loves daring. He is a famous businessman who suffers from stomach-ache. Fabiolini, a would-be actor, is a policeman and he too suffers from the same sickness. The two man face suffering in opposite ways: Benoit Blanc is optimistic while Fabiolini, always unsure of himself, is persuaded he is seriously ill. The two men meet by chance while doing a gastroscopy and become friends. After having known their real different conditions, they will change and will understand better their lives. Around them, other people, women and men, will see their lives changed, by chance, by love or solely by the life stream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cbsWJB790lWB99w33MiAGCSMYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76390'),
  ('338189027455812052', 'Men...', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Doris Dörrie, Helge Weindler', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Heiner Lauterbach, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Ulrike Kriener, Dietmar Bär, Edith Volkmann, Janna Marangosoff, Marie-Charlott Schüler, Monika Schwarz', null, 'A successful, womanizing middle-aged man decides to move out of the house he shares with his wife after she confesses to having an affair. He looks for a new place to live and ends up moving into his wife''s lover''s apartment as a roommate. The husband begins to take an interest in the artistic work of the lover and coaches him for a big job interview. Little does he know that the job he''s helping the lover to get is within his own company... A story about strange circumstances and the limits of friendship.', 'A successful, womanizing middle-aged man decides to move out of the house he shares with his wife after she confesses to having an affair. He looks for a new place to live and ends up moving into his wife''s lover''s apartment as a roommate. The husband begins to take an interest in the artistic work of the lover and coaches him for a big job interview. Little does he know that the job he''s helping the lover to get is within his own company... A story about strange circumstances and the limits of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjNTqLlB1QBQTOXRoKgzYtaVcTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10146'),
