  ('449218379749166796', 'Mension House Mallesh', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bala Satish, Ammamuthu', 'Bala Satish', 'Maganti Srinath, V. Sivasankar, Aravind Menon, Sai Revanth, Gayathri Ramana', null, 'In a quiet village where gossip spreads faster than the wind, a swaggering young man becomes the talk of the town after his wedding night sparks unexpected rumours. What follows is a hilarious chain of misunderstandings, ego clashes, and small-town chaos. Mension House Mallesh is a lively rural entertainer packed with satire and nonstop laughter.', 'In a quiet village where gossip spreads faster than the wind, a swaggering young man becomes the talk of the town after his wedding night sparks unexpected rumours. What follows is a hilarious chain of misunderstandings, ego clashes, and small-town chaos. Mension House Mallesh is a lively rural entertainer packed with satire and nonstop laughter.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1jexjNlyvZihnYo6p6mK2oJyF9v.jpg', 'plex:movie:mension-house-mallesh'),
